{"id": "21897", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21897", "title": "Ikipe ya bobsled ya Nijeriya", "text": "Ikipe ya Nigeria yitwa bobsled cyangwa ikipe ya Nigeria yitwa bobsleigh, ihagarariye Nigeria mumukino wa bobsled. Ikipeyambere yashinzwe mu 2016 na Seun Adigun, nk'ikipe y'abagore mu irushanwa ry'abagore 2. Mu 2017, bujuje ibisabwa kugira ngobabe Abanya-Nigeria bambere mu mikino Olempike y'itumba, ndetse n'Abanyafurika bambere mumukino wa bobsled mumikino Olempike y'itumba. \nAmateka.\nIkipeyambere y'igihugu yashinzwe mu 2016 na Seun Adigun, mu irushanwa rya bobsleigh y'abagore babiri. Iyi kipe yiyishyuriraga amafaranga gusa, ntankunga y'amafaranga iturutse ku bayobozi ba Nijeriya. Gukusanya amafaranga yo kuyobora iyi kipe byagaragarije guverinoma ya Nijeriya ko ikeneye gushyiraho ishyirahamwe riyobora bobsled, kandi barabikoze, Bobsled &amp; Skeleton Federation of Nigeria (BSFN). Igerageza rya mbere ry'iyi kipe ryo kwemererwa kwitabira imikino Olempike y'itumba, ryari mu 2017, mu mikino Olempike y'itumba ya 2018 muri bobsledding, irushanwa ry'abagore babiri. Ikipe Olempike ya 2018 yari igizwe n'umushoferi Seun Adigun, n'abakoresha feri Ngozi Onwumere na Akuoma Omeoga. Mu Gushyingo 2017, iyi kipe yujuje ibisabwa kugira ngo yifatanye mumikino Olempike. Iyokipe yujuje ibisabwa, ibibizaba arubwa mbere Nijeriya igaragaye mu mikino Olempike y'itumba; n'ikipe ya mbere y'Abanyafurika muri bobsled. Iyikipe yujuje ibisabwa kugira ngo yifatanye mu mikino Olempike, ikaba ari yo ihagarariye iyi kipe mu mikino Olempike y'itumba. Nijeriya yabaye kimwe mu bihugu umunani bya Afurika bizahagararirwa mu mikino Olempike y'itumba ya 2018. Onwumere yari yitwaje ibendera rya Nijeriya mu muhango wo gufungura imikino Olempike y'itumba ya 2018 Parade of Nations, maze agendana na bagenzi be babiri, hamwe na mugenzi we Simidele Adeagbo wo muri Nijeriya, waje mu cyiciro cy'abagore. Ikipe yarangije kumwanya wanyuma mumakipe 20 yahatanye. Nyuma y'imikino, amakipe atatu yari mu ikipe yasezeye muri bobsled, ariko yiyemeje guteza imbere siporo muri Nijeriya, guteza imbere ishyirahamwe ry'imikino muri Nijeriya, no guteza imbere imikino y'itumba n'imikino Olempike y'itumba mur'Afurika. \nIkipe yageze muri Nijeriya kwizihiza uburambe bwayo mumikino Olempike muri Werurwe 2018, yateguwe n'itsinda rya BSFN rishinzwe kwamamaza, Temple Management Company (TMC), itangiriye kukibuga cy'indege mpuzamahanga cya Murtala Mohammed (MMIA) Ikeja Lagos. "}
