{"id": "21899", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21899", "title": "Shampiyona y'Isi ya IIHF ya 2018 Icyiciro cya gatatu", "text": "Shampiyona y'Isi ya IIHF yo mu cyiciro cya gatatu yarirushanwa mpuzamahanga rya hockey kurubura ryayobowe n'ishyirahamwe mpuzamahanga rya hockey kurubura. Ryabereye i Cape Town, muri Afurika y'Epfo n'irushanwa ryogushaka itike ryabereye i Sarajevo, Bosiniya na Herzegovina nyuma y'uko Abu Dhabi, Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Abarabu, bakuyeho ubusabe bwabo. \nGeorgia yatsinze irushanwa maze izamurwa mucyiciro cyakabiri. \nKuwait na Turukimenisitani byatangiye gukina Shampiyona y'Isi, byombi bikinnye irushanwa ryo gushakitike. Turukimenisitani yatsinze umukino wayo wambere mumikino ya Shampiyona y'Isi, itsinda Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Abarabu, nyuma itsindira itike yogukina ndetse izamurwa mu cyiciro cya gatatu cy'umwaka utaha. \nIcyiciro cya gatatu.\nAbayobozi b'umukino.\nAbasifuzi 4 n'abasifuzi 7 batoranyijwe muri iryo rushanwa. \nIbisubizo.\n\"Ibihe byose ni ibyo mu gace utuyemo (UTC+2).\"\nIbihembo n'imibare.\nAbayobozi b'abazamu.\nAbakinnyi batanu bambere bashinzwe kurindizamu, hashingiwe ku ijanisha ryokurokora abakinnyi, bakinnye nibura 40% by'iminota y'ikipe yabo, ni bo bonyine bashyizwe kuri uru rutonde.\nIrushanwa ryo gushaka itike yo mu cyiciro cya gatatu.\nAbayobozi b'umukino.\nAbasifuzi 3 n'abasifuzi 4 batoranyijwe muri iryo rushanwa. \nIbisubizo.\n\"Ibihe byose ni ibyo mu gace utuyemo (UTC+1).\"\nAbayobozi b'abazamu.\nAbakinnyi batanu ba mbere bashinzwe kurinda izamu, hashingiwe kwijanisha ryo kurokora abakinnyi, bakinnye nibura 40% by'iminota y'ikipe yabo, nibobonyine bashyizwe kurururutonde."}
{"id": "21900", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21900", "title": "Shampiyona y'Isi ya IIHF ya 2023 Icyiciro cya gatatu", "text": "Shampiyona y'Isi ya IIHF yomu 2023 mucyiciro cyagatatu yaramarushanwa abiri mpuzamahanga ya hockey yomurubura yayobowe n'Ishyirahamwe Mpuzamahanga rya Hockey yo muRubura. \nIrushanwa ryomwitsinda A ryabereye i Cape Town, mur'Afurika y'Epfo kuva kuya 17 kugeza kuya 23 Mata, naho irushanwa ryo mwitsinda B ribera i Sarajevo, Bosiniya na Herzegovina kuva kuya 27 Gashyantare kugeza ku ya 5 Werurwe 2023.\nTaipei yomu Bushinwa yazamutse nyumayogutsinda itsinda A, naho Koreya ya Ruguru yasezerewe nyumayo kwikuramo mbere y'irushanwa. Kyrgyzstan yatsinze irushanwa ryou itsinda B irazamurwa, naho Maleziya irazamurwa. \nIrushanwa ryo mu itsinda A.\nAbayobozi b'umukino.\nAbasifuzi bane n'abasifuzi barindwi batoranyijwe muri iryo rushanwa. \nImibare.\nAbayoboye mu gutanga amanota.\nUrutonde rwerekana abakinnyi bakomeye bashyizwe kurutonde hakurikijwe amanota, hanyuma hagakurikiraho ibitego.\nAbayobozi b'abazamu.\nAbakinnyi batanu ba mbere bashinzwe kurinda izamu, hashingiwe ku ijanisha ryo kurokora abakinnyi, bakinnye nibura 40% by'iminota y'ikipe yabo, ni bo bonyine bashyizwe kuri uru rutonde.\nIrushanwa ryo mu itsinda rya kabiri.\nAbayobozi b'umukino.\nAbasifuzi bane n'abasifuzi barindwi batoranyijwe muri iryo rushanwa. \nIbisubizo.\n\"Ibihe byose ni ibyo mu gace utuyemo (UTC+1)\"\nImibare.\nAbayoboye mu gutanga amanota.\nUrutonde rwerekana abakinnyi bakomeye bashyizwe ku rutonde hakurikijwe amanota, hanyuma hagakurikiraho ibitego.\nAbayobozi b'abazamu.\nAbakinnyi batanu ba mbere bashinzwe kurinda izamu, hashingiwe ku ijanisha ryo kurokora abakinnyi, bakinnye nibura 40% by'iminota y'ikipe yabo, ni bo bonyine bashyizwe kuri uru rutonde."}
{"id": "21901", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21901", "title": "Shampiyona y'Isi ya IIHF ya 2022 Icyiciro cya gatatu", "text": "Shampiyona y'Isi ya IIHF yomu 2022 Icyicirocya III cyarirushanwa mpuzamahanga rya hockey kurubura ryayobowe n'Ishyirahamwe Mpuzamahanga rya Hockey kuRubura.\nIrushanwa ryomwitsinda A ryabereye i Kockelscheuer, Luxembourg kuva kuya 3 kugeza kuya 8 Mata, naho irushanwa ryomwitsinda B ribera i Cape Town, mur'Afurika y'Epfo kuva kuya 13 kugeza kuya 18 Werurwe 2022. \nNyuma y'uko irushanwa rihagaritswe mumyaka ibirishize kubericyorezo cya COVID-19, amakipe yoseyagumye mubyiciro byayo. \nIbihugu by\u2019Abarabu byabonye umwanya wambere mwitsinda rya A ndetse binazamuka mucyiciro cya kabiri, nahw'Afurika y\u2019Epfo yegukana irushanwa mwitsinda rya B ndetse binazamuka mu itsinda rya A. \nUburusiya na Belarusi byahagaritswe mwirushanwa ry\u2019isi ryomu 2022 na 2023. Kugira ngo buri tsinda ry\u2019isi rigarure ku mubare w\u2019amakipe yari asanzwe afite, IIHF yafashe icyemezonyuma y\u2019irushanwa cyo kutamanuka Luxembourg cyangwa Bosnia na Herzegovina, zarangije ariza nyuma mumatsinda A na B, ahubwokozazamuye Turukiya na Tayilande, arizozabaye izakabiri muri buri tsinda. \nIrushanwa ryo mu itsinda A.\nAbayobozi b'umukino.\nAbasifuzi batatu n'abasifuzi batanu batoranyijwe muri iryo rushanwa. \nIbisubizo.\n\"Ibihe byose ni ibyo mu gace utuyemo (UTC+2)\"\nImibare.\nAbayoboye mu gutanga amanota.\nUrutonde rwerekana abakinnyi bakomeye bashyizwe ku rutonde hakurikijwe amanota, hanyuma hagakurikiraho ibitego.\nAbayobozi b'abazamu.\nAbakinnyi batanu ba mbere bashinzwe kurinda izamu, hashingiwe ku ijanisha ryo kurokora abakinnyi, bakinnye nibura 40% by'iminota y'ikipe yabo, ni bo bonyine bashyizwe kuri uru rutonde.\nIrushanwa ryo mu itsinda rya kabiri.\nAbayobozi b'umukino.\nAbasifuzi babiri n'abasifuzi batatu batoranyijwe muri iryo rushanwa. \nIbisubizo.\n\"Ibihe byose ni ibyo mu gace utuyemo (UTC+2)\"\nImibare.\nAbayoboye mu gutanga amanota.\nUrutonde rwerekana abakinnyi bakomeye bashyizwe ku rutonde hakurikijwe amanota, hanyuma hagakurikiraho ibitego.\nAbayobozi b'abazamu.\nAbakinnyi batanu ba mbere bashinzwe kurinda izamu, hashingiwe ku ijanisha ryo kurokora abakinnyi, bakinnye nibura 40% by'iminota y'ikipe yabo, ni bo bonyine bashyizwe kuri uru rutonde."}
{"id": "21902", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21902", "title": "Shampiyona y'Isi ya IIHF ya 2021 Icyiciro cya gatatu", "text": "Shampiyona y'Isi ya IIHF yomu 2021 Icyiciro cya III cyarigiteganyijwe kubairushanwa mpuzamahanga rya hockey kurubura riyobowe n'Ishyirahamwe Mpuzamahanga rya Hockey ku Rubura.\nIrushanwa ryomwitsinda A ryagombaga kubera i Kockelscheuer, Luxembourg kuva kuya 18 kugeza kuya 24 Mata, naho irushanwa ryo mu itsinda B rikabera i Cape Town, mur'Afurika y'Epfo kuva kuya 19 kugeza kuya 25 Mata 2021. \nKwitariki ya 18 Ugushyingo 2020, amarushanwa yombi yarahagaritswe kubericyorezo cya COVID-19. "}
{"id": "21903", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21903", "title": "Shampiyona y'Isi ya IIHF ya 2020 Icyiciro cya gatatu", "text": "Shampiyona y'Isi ya IIHF yomu 2020 Icyiciro cya III cyarirushanwa mpuzamahanga rya hockey kurubura ryayobowe n'Ishyirahamwe Mpuzamahanga rya Hockey ku Rubura.\nIrushanwa ryomwitsinda A ryagombaga kubera i Kockelscheuer, Luxembourg kuva ku ya 19 kugeza kuya 25 Mata, nahirushanwa ryomwitsinda B rikabera i Cape Town, mur'Afurika y'Epfo kuva kuya 20 kugeza ku ya 23 Mata 2020. \nAmarushanwayombi yahagaritswe kuya 13 Werurwe 2020 kubera icyorezo cya COVID-19. \nIrushanwa ryo mu itsinda A.\nAbayobozi b'umukino.\nAbasifuzi bane n'abasifuzi barindwi batoranyijwe muri iryo rushanwa. \nIrushanwa ryo mu itsinda rya kabiri.\nAbayobozi b'umukino.\nThree referees and four linesmen are selected for the tournament.\nIbisubizo.\n\"Ibihe byose ni ibyo mu gace utuyemo (UTC+2).\""}
{"id": "21904", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21904", "title": "Shampiyona y'Isi y'Abatarengeje imyaka 18 ya IIHF mu 2019 Icyiciro cya gatatu", "text": "Shampiyona y'Isi ya IIHF U18 yomucyiciro cyagatatu cya 2019 yaramarushanwa abiri mpuzamahanga ya hockey kurubura y\u2019abari munsi y\u2019imyaka 18 yateguwe n'Ishyirahamwe Mpuzamahanga rya Hockey ku Rubura. Amarushanwa yomucyiciro cyagatatu cya A n'icya gatatu cya B ahagarariye icyiciro cya gatandatu n'icya karindwi cya Shampiyona y'Isi ya IIHF U18.\nIcyiciro cya gatatu A.\nIrushanwa rya Division III A ryabereye i Sofia muri Bulugariya, kuva kuya 25 kugeza ku ya 31 Werurwe 2019. Mugihe cy'irushanwa, Iceland yahawe umwanya wakabiri; icyakora, barangije basangira umudari na Turukiya. \nAbayobozi b'umukino.\nAbasifuzi 4 n'abashinzwe imikino 7 batoranijwe mu irushanwa. \nIbisubizo.\n\"Ibihe byose ni ibyo mu gace utuyemo (UTC+2).\"\nIbihembo.\nIrushanwa rya Division III B ryabereye i Cape Town, muri Afurika y'Epfo, kuva ku ya 9 kugeza ku ya 12 Mata 2019. "}
{"id": "21905", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21905", "title": "Heroes' Cup (Rwanda)", "text": "Igikombe cy'Intwari cyangwa se Irushanwa ry'Umunsi w'Intwari, ni irushanwa ngaruka mwaka mu marushanwa rya basketball ku makipe akina shampiyona yu Rwanda. Amarushanwa y'Igikombe cy'Intwari gitegurwa n'ishyirahamwe rya basketbal mu Rwanda, yabo ku bufatanye n'abashizwe gutegura umunsi w'intwari, Imidari y'Igihugu n'Imidari y'Icyubahiro (CHENO). Umukino wa nyuma w'igikombe ukinwa buri mwaka ku Munsi w'Intwari z'Igihugu ku ya 1 Gashyantare.\nKuva mu 2024, amakipe y'abagabo yo mu Rwanda afite irindi rushanwa ritegurwa na FERWABA mu gikombe cya Basketball cy'u Rwanda."}
{"id": "21906", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21906", "title": "MESSI MURI PSG", "text": "Messi muri PSG.\nNyuma y\u2019imyaka 21 mu ikipe ya FC Barcelone, umukinnyi Lionel Messi ubu yamaze kuba umukinnyi wa Paris Saint-Germain aho yayisinyiye amasezerano y\u2019imyaka ibiri ndetse n\u2019undi umwe ushobora kwiyongeraho.\nNyuma y\u2019iminsi ibiri ategerejwe i Paris, ku gicamunsi cyo ku wa Kabiri tariki 10 Kanama 2021 ahagana saa cyenda ni bwo rutahizamu ukomoka muri Argentine yari amaze gusesekara i Paris aho yakiriwe n\u2019amagana y\u2019abafana, abanza gufata umwanya wo kubasuhuza.\nNyuma yaho Lionel Messi yaje guhita ajya gukora ikizamini cy\u2019ubuzima mu bitaro by\u2019Abanyamerika byitwa Neuilly-sur-Seine, nyuma ikipe ya Paris Saint-Germain iza guhita itangaza ko ari umukinnyi wayo mushya uzajya yambara nimero 30"}
{"id": "21910", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21910", "title": "IRAHIRA RYA PEREZIDA WA AMERICA", "text": "Perezida wa 47 wa Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika,witwa Donald Trump yarahiriye mu nzu y\u2019inteko Ishinga Amategeko kubera ubukonje bukomeye i Washington DC.Ubusanzwe,akenshi ibirori bijyanye n\u2019irahira rya Perezida wa Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika ribera mu mbuga y\u2019Inteko Ishinga Amategeko izwi nka Capitol, inzu ikomeye cyane mu mateka y\u2019ubutegetsi bwa Amerika.Ariko kubera ubukonje bwinshi yarahiriye mu nzu.Umukandida Trump asimbuye Joe Biden watangiye ahanganye na we, ariko nyuma yaho akaza gukuramo Kandidatire ye, agahereza Visi Perezida we Kamala Harris ariko Trump akamutsinda.Trump agarutse ku buyobozi bw\u2019iki gihugu cy'America cy\u2019igihangange ku isi nyuma yo gutsinda amatora ya 2016, aho yari ahanganye na Hillary Clinton.\nMuri 2020 yongeye kwiyamamaza ariko uwo bari bahanganye aramutsinda,yagiye atanyuzwe kuburyo atanamukoze mukiganza.uretse abari ku butegetsi bucyuye igihe mu irahira rya perezida wa 47 wa america,hari abanyacyubahiro benshi harimo n'abaperezida b'America ndetse n'umukire wa mbere witwa Elion Musk ubu ufite ijambo rikomeye muri iyi manda ya Trump."}
{"id": "21911", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21911", "title": "Ibyiza byo kunywa amazi ashyushye", "text": "Abashyakashatsi bavuga ko iyo unyoye amazi ashyushye mu gitondo bifasha urwungano ngogozi kubyuka rugakora neza mu kwakira ibyinjira mu mubiri. Bitandukanye no kunywa amazi akonje kuko iyo uyanyoye umaze kurya, atuma amavuta n\u2019ibinure bikomera ku buryo igogora rigorana, ari yo mpamvu ari byiza kunywa amazi ashyushye wasoje kurya.mu mubiri w\u2019umuntu mu gihe cy\u2019imbeho akenshi hahindamushyitsi, kunywa ibishyushye biwurinda guhinda umushyitsi.Ibyo bifasha cyane abantu batuye cyangwa bakorera ahantu hakonje. Koga amazi ashyushye kandi bifasha imitsi ijyana amaraso gufunguka ikaguka, ibyo byorohereza amaraso gutembera neza mu mubiri.Iyo amaraso atembera neza mumubiri bituma ubuzima buhorana itoto bityo bikarinda ubuzima bwa muntu.https://www.kigalitoday.com/amakuru/utuntu-n-utundi/article/menya-ibyiza-byo-kunywa-amazi-ashyushye-mu-gitondo"}
{"id": "21912", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21912", "title": "INDYO YUZUYE KU MUGORE UTWITE", "text": "Umugore utwite asabwa kurya no kunywa bihagije kuko aba agaburira n'umwana uri munda,hari ibyo atemerewe kurya mu gihe atwite kuko byagira ingaruka mbi kumwana atwite.\n= IBUNTU 2 UMUGORE UTWITE ATEMEREWE MU GIHE ATWITE =\n1.NTAGOMBA KUNYWA ITABI\nUmugore utwite abujijwe kunywa itabi,kuko bishyira umwana n'umubyeyi mu byago binyuranye,nko kuba inda yakwivumbagatanya ikaba yavamo, ikaba yavamo, umwana agapfira mu nda cyangwa akavuka atagejeje igihe. \n2 NTAGOMBA KUNYWA INZOGA\nUmugore utwite nagomba kunywa inzoga, kuko ishobora gutuma umwana agira ibibazo by'indwara z'umutima bikazamukurikirana ubuzima bwiza."}
{"id": "21913", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21913", "title": "Amwe mu mafunguru abantu batitaho kandi aringenzi mu buzima bwa burimuntsi", "text": "Mumbuto usangamo nka avoka,umwembe,ipapayi,nizindi hakabamo nimbonga.avoka ifite akamaro mubuzima bwumuntu gusa ariko ntago abantu bakunze kuyitaho kumafungururo yabo yaburimutsi kandi ningenzi.\nHarikiganiro IGIHE giherutse kugirana n'inzobere mubijyanye ni mbonzamirire Mukakarisa Anastasie,yasobanuyeko buri rubuto ryose rugira akamaro mumubiri kandi buri rubuto rwose rugira umwihariko warwo. Ati\"umuntu agize amahirwe yagenda arya kuri buri rubuto ryose kerek abaye afite indwara imubuza kurya urubuto runaka. Urugero nk'urubuto rwitwa inanansi nurubuto ruboneka kugiciro gito ariko nkabantu bafite uburwayi bw'igifu ntago bemerewa kurukoresha kuko rushobora kubatera \"allergie\"\nMukakarisa akomeza agira ati\"kumuntu utabasha kubona imbuto zitandukanye byibuze agomba kugira urubuto rumwe akoresha kumunsi.\nAbahanga mubijyanye n'ubuzima bavugako Avoka ikungahayemo,Potassium,Fiber na Vitamine B,C n'izindi zvitamine zitandukanye.\nUmwembe nurundi rubuto rufitiye akamaro umubiri kuku rukungahayemo Vitamine C ikenerwa mugukora Prote'ines z'ingenzi ku menyo.\nImboga rwatswi zigira akamaro kanini ku buzima bwa muntu. kurya imboga bituma umubiri ubona ibyitwa 'acido basique'bikenerwa cyane ku maraso. Imboga cyane cyane imboga rwatsi zifitemo ibintu byongera amaraso.\nAmazi nayo afite akamaro gakomeye kubuzima bw'amuntu kuko umuntu muzima bwe agomba kuba afite amazi nka 60%na65% kugirango umubiri ukore neza.\nkandi amazi yoza igifu akanaruhura umubiri warurushye,igihe umuntu atanyonye amzi ajye yumvako ahobwe kuku amazi nubuzima kandi wibukeko amazi atuma utarwara byahato nahato."}
{"id": "21914", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21914", "title": "PEREZIDA WA BURUKINAFASO", "text": "Cap Ibrahim Traor\u00e9 yabaye Perezida w\u2019inzibacyuho wa Burkina Faso ku mugaragaro, nyuma yo guhirika ubutegetsi bwariho, muri \u2018Coups d\u2019Etat\u2019 iheruka muri icyo gihugu, akaba yaremejwe ku wa Gatatu tariki 5 Ukwakira 2022.Cap Traor\u00e9 yigeze kuganira na Radio mpuzamahanga y\u2019Abafaransa, RFI, ku wa Mbere tariki 3 Ukwakira 2022, yavuze ko bitazafata igihe kirekire kugira ngo ubutegetsi buve mu maboko y\u2019igisirikare cye busubizwe mu y\u2019abasivili.\nNk\u2019uko byatangajwe kuri Televiziyo y\u2019igihugu n\u2019Umuvugizi w\u2019Ishyaka \u2018MPSR\u2019, Cap Kiswendsida Farouk Azaria Sorgho, yagize ati \u201cPerezida w\u2019ishyaka rya MPSR agomba kubahiriza inshingano z\u2019Umukuru w\u2019igihugu n\u2019iz\u2019Umugaba mukuru w\u2019ikirenga w\u2019Ingabo z\u2019igihugu, nk\u2019uko biteganywa n\u2019itegeko, Itegeko Nshinga rya Burkina mu gihe hategerejwe itorwa ry\u2019itegeko rigenga ibijyanye n\u2019inzibacyuho\u201d.\nItegeko \u2018Acte\u2019 ryatowe ku wa Gatatu tariki 5 Ukwakira 2022, rivuga ko mu gihe hategerejwe \u201cIshyirwaho ry\u2019inzego z\u2019inzibacyuho, ishyaka rya MPSR, rizakomeza kurinda ubwigenge bw\u2019igihugu, kurinda imbibi z\u2019igihugu, kubahiriza amasezerano mpuzamahanga Burkina Faso yasinye...\u201d\nItegeko Nshinga ry\u2019icyo gihugu ryari ryabaye rihagaritswe nyuma ya Coup d\u2019Etat ariko ubu ryasubijweho, kandi rirubahizwa uretse ingingo zaryo zinyuranyije na Acte fundamental.\nNyuma yo guhirika ku butegetsi Lieutenant-colonel Paul-Henri Sandaogo Damiba, na we wari wafashe ubutegetsi akoze coup d\u2019Etat muri Mutarama 2022, Cap Ibrahim Traor\u00e9 w\u2019imyaka 34, abaye Perezida wa kabiri muto ku rwego rw'isi.\nMu gufata ubutegetsi ku ngufu, yashinjaga uwamubanjirije \u201ckuba ntacyo akora ku kibazo cy\u2019umutekano kirushijeho gukomeza kwiyongera,mu gace katakigenzurwa na Leta cyane cyane ku ruhande ruhana imbibi n\u2019igihugu cya Mali na Niger.\nKu wa kabiri tariki 4 Ukwakira 2022, Perezida Ibrahim Traor\u00e9 yakiriye itsinda ry\u2019abantu baturutse mu Muryango w\u2019Ibihugu by\u2019Afurika y\u2019Iburengerazuba (CEDEAO), baje kureba uko ibibazo bimeze nyuma y\u2019iminsi mikeya hakozwe Coup d\u2019Etat, ariko ngo batashye bafite icyizere ko ibintu bizagenda neza nk\u2019uko byatangajwe na Mahamadou Issoufou, wahoze ari Perzida wa Niger, akaba yari n\u2019umwe mu bagize iryo tsinda ryaje muri Burkina Faso.Ubu hari ikizere cyuko umutekano ugiye gusubirwamo"}
{"id": "21916", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21916", "title": "PEREZIDA WA CONGO", "text": "Kurahira kwa Tshisekedi: Abaperezida 18 baritezwe ko bari bwitabire\nIntumwa nkuru ya perezida wa DR Congo, Serge Tshibangu, yatangaje ko abakuru b\u2019ibihugu 18, ba visi perezida babiri, n\u2019abahoze ari abakuru b\u2019ibihugu bane, bitezwe i Kinshasa kuri uyu wa gatandatu mu muhango wo kurahira kwa Perezida watowe Felix Tshisekedi Kirombo.\nMu kiganiro n\u2019abanyamakuru kuri Stade des Martyrs mu ijoro ryo kuwa kane, Tshibangu, wari kumwe na Patrick Muyaya umuvugizi wa leta, yavuze ko abo bategetsi 18 biganjemo ab\u2019ibihugu bya Africa \u201cbamaze kwemeza ko bazitabira\u201d uwo muhango wo kurahira kwa perezida.\nTshibangu yavuze kandi ko Joseph Kabila yatumiwe ubugira kabiri nk\u2019uwahoze ari perezida ndetse nk\u2019umusenateri ubuzima bwose wa DR Congo.\nKabila niwe wahererekanyije ubutegetsi na Tshisekedi mu myaka itanu ishize, gusa nyuma aba bagabo ntibongeye kuvuga rumwe aho nk\u2019uwahoze ari perezida wa komisiyo y\u2019amatora yavuze ko Tshisekedi yirengangije ibyo yari yarumvikanye na Kabila amaze kumugeza ku ntsinzi.\nKabila \u2013 udakunze kuvuga mu itangazamakuru \u2013 ashobora kutitabira kurahira kwa mugenzi we Tshisekedi. Barbara Nzimbi, umujyanama we mu by'itumanaho yatangaje ku rubuga X ko Kabila \"ari i Johannesbourg muri Africa y'Epfo muri porogaramu y'amasomo ye\".\nKabila amaze igihe akorera impamya bumenyi y'ikirenga muri kaminuza y'i Johannesbourg.\nMu byitezwe cyane mu muhango wo kuri uyu wa gatandatu wo kurahira harimo indahiro ya perezida, ijambo rye nyuma yo kurahira, n'akarasisi ka gisirikare, nk'uko bivugwa na Patrick Muyaya.\nIbiro ntaramakuru bya Congo, byasohoye urutonde ruriho abakuru b\u2019ibihugu 22 batumiwe, barimo nka Evariste Ndahishimiye w\u2019u Burundi, Brice Oligui wa Gabon, Cyril Ramaphosa wa Africa y\u2019Epfo, Samia Suluhu wa Tanzania, Macky Sall wa S\u00e9n\u00e9gal cyangwa Bola Tinubu wa Nigeria, William Ruto wa Kenya n\u2019abandi ariko perezida w'u Rwanda POUL KAGAME ntawurimo."}
