{"id": "21921", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21921", "title": "Benediction Club", "text": "Benediction Club ni ikipe y\u2019amagare y'abigize umwuga ibarizwa mu karere ka Rubavu mu intara y'iburengerazuba i Gisenyi ikaba iabarizwa mu makipe yemewe n'ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Umukino w\u2019Amagare mu Rwanda, Afurika ndetse no ku isi. ikaba ikina nk\u2019akipe iri mu cyiciro cya gatatu ku mugabane wa afurika.\nAbakinnyi.\nBenediction Club yakinnyemo abakinnyi batandukanye harimo nka:\nMugihsa Moise\nMasengesho Vainqueur"}
{"id": "21922", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21922", "title": "Masengesho Vainqueur", "text": "Masengesho Vainqueur (wavutse ku ya 1 Mutarama 2002) ni umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga ukomoka mu Rwanda mu karere ka Musanze. \nAmarushanwa.\nMasengesho Vainqueur yitabiriye amarushanwa atandukanye hari tour du Rwanda muri 2026, aho yakinaga avuye mu ikipe ya Beneduction Club. MAsengesho yitabiriye andi marushanwa atandukanye nk'irushanwa ry'amagare ryo muri arigeriya ararirangiza, ndetse yitabiriye urishanwa ry'amagere ku isi muri 2023, kandi yaje kwitabira irushanwa ry'amagare ryo muri morice. mu Rwanda yakinnye ndetse atwara amarushanwa atandukanye nk'irushanwa ryakarere ka nyaruguru, irushanwa rya Sakumi Anselme ndetse niwe watwaye irushanwa ry'amagare mu Rwanda ry'abanyonga mu muhanda."}
{"id": "21923", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21923", "title": "Shemu Nsengiyumva", "text": "Shemu Nsengiyumva (yavutse ku wa 3 Gashyantare 1998) ni umukinnyi w'amagare w'umwuga w'Umunyarwanda. Ni inzobere mu gusiganwa n'igihe (\"contre-la-montre\"), akaba akinira ikipe yo ku rwego rw'umugabane ya Java-Inovotec Pro Team.\nYigaragaje muri shampiyona z'igihugu z'u Rwanda, yegukana umwanya wa mbere mu gusiganwa n'igihe mu 2025 nyuma yo kuba uwa kabiri mu 2023. Yanahagarariye u Rwanda muri shampiyona y'isi y'amagare yo mu 2025 yabereye i Kigali.\nUbuzima.\nShemu Nsengiyumva yavutse ku wa 3 Gashyantare 1998 mu Rwanda. Yatangiriye gusiganwa ku magare mu gihugu cye cy'amavuko, maze yigaragaza vuba mu masiganwa yo mu mihanda ya Afurika, cyane cyane mu gusiganwa n'igihe. Iterambere rye rihoraho ryatumye yinjira mu ikipe yo ku rwego rw'umugabane (\"\u00e9quipe continentale\") ya Java-Inovotec Pro Team, akaba yaritabiriye amasiganwa menshi mpuzamahanga.\nUmwuga.\nNsengiyumva ari mu bakinnyi b'imbere mu gusiganwa n'igihe mu Rwanda: yagiye agera ku myanya y'imbere muri shampiyona z'igihugu, anahagararira igihugu cye ku rwego mpuzamahanga. Mu 2025 yegukanye shampiyona y'u Rwanda yo gusiganwa n'igihe, anegukana umudari wa feza muri shampiyona ya Afurika yo gusiganwa n'igihe hagati y'amakipe avanze abagabo n'abagore.\nMuri Nzeri 2025, muri Shampiyona y'isi y'amagare 2025 yabereye i Kigali, yabaye uwa 25 mu bakinnyi 55 mu isiganwa ryo gusiganwa n'igihe ry'abakuru (\"elite\")."}
{"id": "21924", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21924", "title": "Java-Inovotec Pro", "text": "Java-Inovotec Pro ni ikipe y'amagareibarizwa i Ngarama mu karere ka Gatsibo, ikaba ikipe y'abigize umwuga ikaba ibarizwa mu Rwanda, ikaba ikina imikino ya Tour du Rwanda ndetse n'amarushanwa muzamahanga. Ni ikipe itoza kandi ikita ku iterambere ry'abakinnyi b'abanyarwanda, Ni ikipe ibarizwa mu cyiciro cya gatatu ku mugabane w'afurika, iyi kipe ikaba yaratwaye amarushanwa atandukanye mu Rwanda cyangwa muri afurika.\nAmarushanwa.\nJava-Inovotec Pro ni ikipe ifite ibikombe bitandukanye ndetse yakinnyemo abakinnyi batandukanye nka:"}
{"id": "21925", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21925", "title": "Ngendahayo J\u00e9r\u00e9mie", "text": "Ngendahayo J\u00e9r\u00e9mie (yavutse kuya 29 Mata 2001 i Kigali) ni umunyarwanda akaba ari umunyonzi w'igare w'abigize umwuga, akaba akinira ikipe ya May Stars, akaba yarakinnye amarushanwa atandukanye harimo Tour du Rwanda muri 2026.\nAmarushanwa.\nNgendahayo J\u00e9r\u00e9mie yakinnye amarushanwa atandukanye mu Rwanda ndetse no mu Rwanda harimo no ku isi, yegukanye yegukanaga Isiganwa ry'Amagare ryo Kwibuka ku nshuro ya 29 mu Rwanda, yegukanye kandi umwanya wa mbere mubakuru mu mwaka wa 2019 mu irushanwa ry'Intwali ry'abato, ndetse wakinnyeye kandi yegukanye umudari w'okunyonga ku giti cye mu isiganwa rya Race to Remember muri 2023 mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "21926", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21926", "title": "May Stars", "text": "May Stars ni ikipe y'abigize umwuga ibarizwa mu Rwanda y'abigize umwuga aho izwiho kugira abakinnyi mpuzamahanga atari abanyarwanda gusa, ni ikipe yatwaye kandi yegukanye agace cyangwa irushanwa rya Kirehe Race muri 2025, ifite abakinnyi ba bagabo batarengeje imyaka 23 gusa. Iyi kipe yagiye yitabira amarushanwa nka Tour du Rwanda ndetse yakinnye irushnawa rya estoniaya.\nAbakinnyi.\nMay Stars yagize abakinnyi batandukanye nka "}
{"id": "21927", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21927", "title": "Ruhumuriza Aim\u00e9", "text": "Ruhumuriza Aim\u00e9 (yavutse ku wa 9 Ukuboza 2006) ni umukinnyi w'amagare w'abigize umwuga akaba ari w'Umunyarwanda. Ruhumuriza akaba akina mu ikipe ya May Stars, ibarizwa mu Rwanda yagaragaye akina mu masiganwa arimo Tour du Rwanda.\nAmarushanwa.\nRuhumuriza ya twaye irushanwa ry'isiganwa rya Kirehe Race muri 2025 ari kumwe na May Stars. akaba ari umukinnyi muto mwiza mu isiganwa rya Tour du Rwanda muri 2025."}
{"id": "21928", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21928", "title": "Ufitimana Shadrack", "text": "Ufitimana Shadrack ni umukinnyi w'amagare w'abigize umwuga ukomoka mu Rwanda ukinira ikipe y'igihugu, ndetse akaba yaratoranijwe ndetse agaragara akina mu Team du Rwanda yo muri 2026.\nAmarushanwa.\nUfitimana shadrack yagaragaye akina amarushanwa mu atandukanye aho yatwaye irushanwa rya Rwanda Junior Tour mu mwaka wa 2024, akaba shadrack akinira ikipe ya Les Amis Sportifs yo Rwanda akaba yaratwaye irushanwa mu cyiciro cy\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 23 mu irushanwa rya amahoro Criterium."}
{"id": "21930", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21930", "title": "Ntirenganya Moise", "text": "Ntirenganya Moise ni umunyarwanda w'abigize umwuga mu mukino w'amagare, akaba yaragaragaye mu marushanwa atandukanye, ndetse akaba agaragara mu ikipe y'igihugu ndetse n'ikipe y'abago yi ngimbo. akaba akinira ikipe ya Les amis sportifs. \nAmarushanwa.\nNtirenganya Moise yegukanye isiganwa rya virunga XCO Mountain Bike muri 2025 ndetse yaje kwegukana umunsi wa Karindwi wa Youth Racing Cup muri 2024 mu Rwanda, Yitabiriye Shampiyona y'Isi y'Amagare yabereye i Zurich muri 2024, ndetse yaje ku mwanya wa 66 mu cyiciro cy'ingimbi muri Shampiyona y'isi yabereye i Kigali muri 2025, akaba ari umukinnyi w'amagare ubarizwa mu ikipe ya amani."}
{"id": "21931", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21931", "title": "Nkurikiyinka Jackson", "text": "Nkurikiyinka Jackson Nkurikiyinka Jackson ni umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga mu igare akaba ari umunyarwanda ukina mu ikipe ya bato batarengee imyaka 19, akaba yarafashe nk'umukinnyi uzamuri myaka y'imikino yo muri 2025 kugeza 202.\nAmarushanwa.\nNkurikiyinka Jackson akaba akinira ikipe ya Benediction Cycling Team ibarizwa i Rubavu, mu burengerazuba bw'u Rwanda, Yatwaye irushanwa ry'ingimbi, ryitwa Rwanda Youth Racing Cup 2026 muri Sitage ya 2, ndetse na Heroes Cycling Race 2026 nabwo mu ngimbi."}
