{"id": "21937", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21937", "title": "BAL", "text": "= Basketball Africa League (BAL) =\nBasketball Africa League (BAL) ni shampiyona y\u2019umwuga ya basketball ihuza amakipe akomeye yo muri Afurika. Yatangiye ku mugaragaro mu mwaka wa 2021 binyuze mu bufatanye bwa National Basketball Association (NBA) n\u2019Ishyirahamwe Mpuzamahanga rya Basketball (FIBA) (NBA, 2021). Ishyirwaho rya BAL ryabaye intambwe ikomeye mu mikino muri Afurika, kuko ari yo shampiyona ya mbere ishyigikiwe na NBA ikorera hanze ya Amerika ya Ruguru (FIBA, 2021). Intego yayo ni guteza imbere umukino wa basketball ku mugabane wa Afurika no guha abakinnyi, abatoza n\u2019amakipe amahirwe yo kwigaragaza ku rwego mpuzamahanga.\nIyi shampiyona igizwe n\u2019amakipe 12 aturuka mu bihugu bitandukanye bya Afurika (BAL, 2024). Amakipe ayijyamo atsindira shampiyona z\u2019ibihugu byayo cyangwa akabinyura mu mikino yo gushaka itike ya BAL. Irushanwa ritangirana n\u2019icyiciro cy\u2019amatsinda, rikurikirwa na kamarampaka (playoffs), hanyuma hakabaho umukino wa nyuma (Finals) ugaragaza ikipe itwara igikombe (NBA Africa, 2023). Imikino ibera mu mijyi itandukanye yo muri Afurika buri mwaka, bigafasha abafana kubona basketball yo ku rwego rwo hejuru hafi yabo.\nKuva yatangira, BAL imaze kugira amakipe atandukanye yegukana igikombe. Mu 2021, Zamalek SC yo mu Misiri ni yo yegukanye igikombe cya mbere (NBA, 2021). Mu 2022, US Monastir yo muri Tuniziya yatwaye igikombe (BAL, 2022). Mu 2023, Al Ahly yo mu Misiri yegukanye igikombe (NBA Africa, 2023). Mu 2024, Petro de Luanda yo muri Angola yatwaye igikombe cyayo cya mbere cya BAL (BAL, 2024). Mu 2025, Al Ahli Tripoli yo muri Libiya yegukanye igikombe, iba ikipe ya mbere yo muri Libiya ibigezeho (BAL, 2025). Ibi bigaragaza ko urwego rwa basketball mu bihugu bitandukanye bya Afurika rugenda ruzamuka kandi ko irushanwa ririmo guhatanira ku rwego rwo hejuru.\nBAL yanagaragayemo abakinnyi bakoze amateka kubera imikinire yabo idasanzwe. Walter Hodge yabaye umukinnyi mwiza w\u2019irushanwa (MVP) wa mbere mu 2021 (NBA, 2021). Nuni Omot yabonye igihembo cya MVP mu 2023 akinira Al Ahly (NBA Africa, 2023). Jean Jacques Boissy yabaye MVP mu 2025 kubera imikinire ye myiza muri uwo mwaka (BAL, 2025). Hari n\u2019abandi bakinnyi bagaragaje ubuhanga budasanzwe, nka Terrell Stoglin uzwiho gutsinda amanota menshi, na Aliou Diarra wamamaye mu gufata imipira no kurinda neza (FIBA, 2024). Aba bakinnyi bagize uruhare rukomeye mu kuzamura urwego n\u2019icyubahiro cya BAL.\nMuri rusange, Basketball Africa League ni intambwe ikomeye mu iterambere rya basketball muri Afurika. Kubera guhuza impano zo ku mugabane wa Afurika n\u2019ubufatanye mpuzamahanga, BAL ikomeje kwamamara no kurushaho gukomera buri mwaka (NBA Africa, 2024). Uko igenda yaguka, ni ko ikomeje kugira uruhare mu gushushanya ejo hazaza ha basketball muri Afurika no kuzamura izina ry\u2019umugabane ku rwego mpuzamahanga."}
{"id": "21938", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21938", "title": "Ishimwe Anicet", "text": "Ishimwe anicet ni Umunyarwanda akaba umukinnyi w'umupira wamaguru wabigize umwuga akaba akina kuruhande rw'ibumoso mwikipe y'igihugu amavubi,Anicet Ishimwe yavutse mumwaka wa 2003 mata 06.\nIshimwe anicet, yavuye muri olympique de Bea yo muri Tunisia yamutanze muri Assabah SC yo muri Libya mu gihe cy'amezi atandatu. Muri 2024 nibwo uyu mukinnyi yerekanywe muri Olympique de Bea yo mu cyiciro cta mbere muri Tunisia, gusa kubona umwanya ugahije wo gukina bikomeza kugorana.\nIbi byatumye ii ekipe imutanga muri Assabah SC yo mucyiciro cya mbere muri Libya kugirango ashake iminota ihagije yo gukina.\nIshimwe Anicet yakinnye muri APR FC nyuma yaho APR FC iza kumutiza Mukura FC."}
{"id": "21940", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21940", "title": "Dedan Juma", "text": "Dedan Juma (rimwe na rimwe azwi nka Dedan Juma Onyango) ni umukinnyi wa filime na televiziyo wo muri Kenya ndetse akaba n\u2019umuhanzi w\u2019amajwi (voice-over artist). Yamenyekanye cyane kubera uruhare rwe muri series ya Showmax yitwa \"Pepeta\" ndetse no mu ikinamico ikunzwe cyane yitwa \"Real Househelps of Kawangware.\"\nUbuzima bwa mbere.\nJuma yakuriye i Nairobi, aho yavuze ko yahuye n'ibikorwa by'ubugizi bwa nabi n'ubuzima bwo mu muhanda kuva akiri muto. Yakoze ibyaha bito mu gihe cy'ubugimbi ariko yaretse ubwo buzima nyuma yo kubona inshuti ye imwica. Avuga ko ingaruka za nyina n'ukwizera kwe byamufashije gukina. \nJuma yatangiye umwuga we wo gukina filime mu myaka ya 2010, agaragara muri televiziyo na filime zo mu gace k'iwabo. Yamenyekanye cyane mu gihugu kubera uruhare rwe nk'umupolisi mu ruhererekane rw'urwenya \"rwa Real Househelps of Kawangware\", nyuma aza gukina \"Zeze\" muri filime ya mbere ya Showmax \"yitwa Pepeta\". Yanagaragaye muri filime ngufi n'imishinga yo ku rubyiniro kandi agaragara mu bubiko mpuzamahanga bwa filime nka IMDb. \nNubwo azwiho gukina imikino y\u2019abagizi ba nabi, abagize itsinda ry\u2019abagizi ba nabi n\u2019abashinzwe iperereza, Juma yavuze ku mbogamizi zo kuba umukinnyi w\u2019inyuguti ndetse n\u2019uko hakenewe imyanya itandukanye mu nganda za filime zo muri Kenya. \nMu biganiro byinshi, Juma yavuze ingorane abakinnyi benshi bo muri Kenya bahura nazo mu kubona amafaranga ahoraho mu buhanzi. Yavuze ko hagati y'imirimo yo gukina yakundaga kwishingikiriza ku mirimo idasanzwe nko gucuruza kugira ngo yibesheho. Ibitangazamakuru byamugaragaje nk'urugero rw'impinduka mu buzima bwe no kwihangana mu rwego rw'imyidagaduro muri Kenya. \nUbuzima bwe mu bwana.\nDedan Juma (rimwe na rimwe azwi nka Dedan Juma Onyango) ni umukinnyi wa filime na televiziyo wo muri Kenya ndetse akaba n\u2019umuhanzi w\u2019amajwi (voice-over artist). Yamenyekanye cyane kubera uruhare rwe muri series ya Showmax yitwa \"Pepeta\" ndetse no mu ikinamico ikunzwe cyane yitwa \"Real Househelps of Kawangware.\"\nUbuzima bwa mbere.\nJuma yakuriye i Nairobi, aho yavuze ko kuva akiri muto yahuye n\u2019ibikorwa by\u2019ubugizi bwa nabi n\u2019ubuzima bwo ku muhanda. Mu gihe cy\u2019ubugimbi bwe yakoze ibyaha bito, ariko yaje kureka ubwo buzima nyuma yo kubona inshuti ye yicwa. Avuga ko ubufasha n\u2019ingaruka nziza bya nyina, hamwe n\u2019ukwizera kwe, ari byo byamufashije guhindura ubuzima bwe no kwinjira mu mwuga wo gukina.\nJuma yatangiye umwuga we wo gukina filime mu myaka ya 2010, agaragara muri televiziyo na filime zo mu gace k'iwabo. Yamenyekanye cyane mu gihugu kubera uruhare rwe nk'umupolisi mu ruhererekane rw'urwenya \"rwa Real Househelps of Kawangware\", nyuma aza gukina \"Zeze\" muri filime ya mbere ya Showmax \"yitwa Pepeta\". Yanagaragaye muri filime ngufi n'imishinga yo ku rubyiniro kandi agaragara mu bubiko mpuzamahanga bwa filime nka IMDb. \nNubwo azwiho gukina imikino y\u2019abagizi ba nabi, abagize itsinda ry\u2019abagizi ba nabi n\u2019abashinzwe iperereza, Juma yavuze ku mbogamizi zo kuba umukinnyi w\u2019inyuguti ndetse n\u2019uko hakenewe imyanya itandukanye mu nganda za filime zo muri Kenya. \nMu biganiro byinshi, Juma yavuze ingorane abakinnyi benshi bo muri Kenya bahura nazo mu kubona amafaranga ahoraho mu buhanzi. Yavuze ko hagati y'imirimo yo gukina yakundaga kwishingikiriza ku mirimo idasanzwe nko gucuruza kugira ngo yibesheho. Ibitangazamakuru byamugaragaje nk'urugero rw'impinduka mu buzima bwe no kwihangana mu rwego rw'imyidagaduro muri Kenya. "}
{"id": "21984", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21984", "title": "Urupapuro", "text": "Ubusobanuro.\nUrupapuro ni igikoresho gikozwe mu biti, cyifashishwa mu kwandika no kubika amakuru yanditse, kikifashishwa mu gushushsanya no gusomerwaho amakuru yanditseho. Urupapuro nirwo ruzwi mu rurimi rw'icyongereza nka \"paper\"."}
{"id": "21985", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21985", "title": "Imyizerere mu Rwanda", "text": "Ubukirisitu niryo dini rifite Abayoboke benshi mu Rwanda, aho ariyo madini yiganjemo abayoboke mesnhi. Abaturage bo mu Rwanda bagera kuri 3% bavuga ko nta dini basengeramo, mu gihe abandi 3% bayobotse andi madini harimo. Abaturage bagera kuri 2% ni Abayisilamu (cyane cyane). \nHariho kandi umubare muto w\u2019aba Baha'i, ndetse n\u2019abandi bagendera ku myemerere iciriritse ya Gakondo. Kuva Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 ibaye, habayeho kwiyongera kw\u2019amatsinda mato y\u2019amadini akenshi afitanye isano n\u2019abakristo. \nHari imiryango mito y\u2019Abahindu n\u2019Ababuda, igizwe ahanini n\u2019abayoboke b\u2019abanyamahanga, cyane cyane abacuruzi bakomoka mu Bushinwa no mu Buhinde ndetse n\u2019abarimu ba kaminuza n\u2019abanyeshuri. ntayandi madini akunze kuza mu Rwanda, nubwo hari Ingoro y\u2019Abahindu mu Rwanda aho abantu bajya basengera. "}
{"id": "21986", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21986", "title": "Gutanga inka", "text": "Muri muco nyarwanda, \"Gutanga inka\" ni umuhango ukomeye cyane ushushanya ubucuti, icyubahiro, n'ubumwe hagati y'abantu. Inka ntabwo yari itungo gusa, yari ikimenyetso cy'ubutunzi n'agaciro k'umuntu mu muryango.\nDore ubusobanuro bw\u2019ingenzi bw\u2019uyu muhango:\n1. Guca Ubuhake (Guhana Inka).\nMu Rwanda rwo hambere, gutanga inka byari uburyo bwo kurema umubano hagati y\u2019umutunzi (shebuja) n\u2019umugaragu. Iyo shebuja yahaga umuntu inka, yabaga amuhaye ubushobozi bwo kubaho neza, kandi uwo muntu akamugaragariza ubudahemuka.\n2. Inkwano (Gukwa).\nMu muhango wo gushyingirwa, umuryango w\u2019umuhungu utanga inka mu muryango w\u2019umukobwa. Ibi ntibivuze \"kugura\" umukobwa, ahubwo ni:\nAmashakiro.\nhttps://www.rwandaheritage.gov.rw/fileadmin/user_upload/RCHA/Publications/Published_Books/Ubukwe_bwa_kinyarwanda.pdf"}
{"id": "21987", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21987", "title": "Gucuragura", "text": "Gucuragura ni umwe mu migenzo gakondo yo mu Rwanda, aho byakorwaga hagamijwe kuroga no kwifuriza inabi abo muru urwo rugo, kandi byakorwaga ucuragura yambaye ubusa, akabyina kurugo rwuwo yifuriza inabi ana tongera. \nAmateka yo gucuragura mu Rwanda.\nuyu mugenzo wo gucuragura wadutse mu Rwanda ahayingo muri 1500 ku ngoma y' umwami ndahiro, aha byadukanywe n' umunyabungokazi witwaga Maduna hamwe n' umuhunguwe witwaga Nkoma ya Nkondogoro, (Sekirasanyi ikirozi cyo mu Marangara), waje mu Rwanda azanye n' umuhungu we baturutse i bunyabungo ya zayire. mubisanzwe gucuragura ntibyari umuco w' abanyarwanda ahubwo byazanywe na Maduna,wanaje kuba umurozi w' umwami Yuhi ndahiro. "}
{"id": "21988", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21988", "title": "Gutongera", "text": "Gutongera.\nGutongera ni umugenzo wo gusukiranya amagambo uyatura ku muntu cyangwa ku kintu ugamije ko ahinduka cyangwa gihinduka mu buryo Utongera ashaka ko kigendamo bitewe nuburyo yifuza. ni umugenzo ahanini ukoreshwa hagamijwe ikibi cyangwa ikiza kumuntu cyangwa kubintu runaka. \nMu nyandiko dukesha ikinyamakuru Igihe mu nkuru yanditswe muri 2013 bavuzeko Gutongera bikoreshwa n'Umupfumu atongera nk'inkoko aho ayitera umuti akayica akoresheje umushyo cyangwa akayirambika ku kirere akayibaga\" ibyo nka bimwe mi migenzo bakora batongera abazimu bateye ngo babagushe neza. "}
{"id": "21989", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21989", "title": "Umumari", "text": "Nikamwe mugakoresho kabazwaga mugiti akenshi kakinwaga \"(Umukino\") naba kiribato(Ababyiruka) Aho uwomumari wasongorwaga Hanyuma ugakubitishwa imigozi iboshwe mumigwegwe Maze kakizengurutsa kubutaka kujyeza igihe uwakubitaga uwo mumari yananirwaga cyangwa se agahusha kuwutsibura aho iyo uwabaga atsinzwe kuwutsibura yakirwaga nundi babaga barigukinana umo mukino."}
{"id": "21990", "revid": "14223", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21990", "title": "Umurozikazi", "text": "Umurozi ni umuntu w'igitsina gabo cyangwa gore wifashisha ibyatsi gakondo, ibice by'imibiri y'inyamaswa (uruhu, ubwoya, amababa, inzara, ubwonko..) akabiha umuntu ashaka ko amera uko ashaka cyangwa akamwica ku mpamvu z'uko atamukeneye mu buzima bwe."}
{"id": "21991", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21991", "title": "Kurumika no kurasaga", "text": "Kurumika no kurasaga ni imigenzo yacera Nyarwanda yakoreshwaga mubuvuzi gakondo nokurinda ibyago Abanyarwanda, bityo uwabikoraga akaba yarafite imyizere yuko iyobikozwe byanga byakunda birinda. Gusa kuri ubu abanyarwanda benshi ntibabyemera ndetse bavugako arimihango ya gipagani nubwo hari abaganga bavugako iyomigenzo yabaga aringirakamaro.\nAmateka yo kurumika no kurasaga.\nMu muco nyarwanda wa kera, hari imihango yakoreshwaga mu kuvura no kurinda indwara. Nubwo ubu abantu benshi bayifata nk\u2019imigenzo ya gipagani, hari abaganga bavuga ko hari aho byafashaga. Muri iyo migenzo harimo kurasaga, aho bacagaga ku ruhu rw\u2019umuntu bagashyiramo imiti yo kumuvura cyangwa kumurinda uburozi. Hari kandi kurumika, aho bacagaga bagakuramo amaraso bita mabi kugira ngo umuntu akire.\nAbanyarwanda bakoreshaga kandi imyotso, cyane cyane ku bana, aho babotsaga ku gahanga cyangwa ku misaya kugira ngo barinde cyangwa bavure indwara z\u2019amaso. Undi muco wari kugombora, wakoreshwaga mu kuvura umuntu warumwe n\u2019inzoka, bashyiraho imiti yihariye bakavugamo n\u2019imitongero.\nMuri rusange, ubuvuzi gakondo bw\u2019Abanyarwanda bwari bufite uburyo bwinshi n\u2019imitekerereze yihariye, kandi hari aho bugikoreshwa no muri iki gihe mu kuvura zimwe mu ndwara."}
{"id": "21992", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21992", "title": "Guca indasago", "text": "Guca indasago ni umugenzo wakorwaga n'Abanyarwanda ndetse n'Abarundi ba kera bagamije ubuvuzi gakondo harimo gutunganya umubiri cg gukingira indwara zitandukanye. Mu guca indasago bakebaga gato ndetse gahoro ku gice cy'umubiri runaka bitewe n'ahafite uburwayi hagashyirwamo imiti. Indasago zabaga ari nk'ibibyimba, imyotso, n' ibindi.\nInkomoko yo guca indasago.\nGuca indasago ni umutsiriko bakorerega ku muntu bagamije kumurinda kugirango batazamuroga, atazahura n' akaga, azagire urugo rwiza n' ibindi."}
{"id": "21993", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21993", "title": "Nijeriya mu mikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi yo mu 1980", "text": "Nijeriya yitabiriye imikino Olempike yomumpeshyi yabereye i Moscou muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu 1980. Igihugu cyasubiye mumikino Olempike nyumayokwanga imikino Olempike yo mumpeshyi yomu 1976.\nIbisubizo ku byabaye.\nSiporo.\nIntera y'abagabo ya metero 100\n* Ubushyuhe \u2014 10.39\n* Imikino ya kimwe cya kane \u2014 10.34\n* Igice cya kabiri \u2014 10.51 (\u2192 ntabwo yageze imbere)\n* Ubushyuhe \u2014 10.59\n* Imikino ya kimwe cya kane \u2014 10.73 (\u2192 ntiyakomeje)\n* Ubushyuhe \u2014 10.58\n* Imikino ya kimwe cya kane \u2014 10.67 (\u2192 ntiyakomeje)\nIntera y'abagabo ya metero 200\n* Ubushyuhe \u2014 21.79 (\u2192 ntabwo byateye imbere)\nIrelay y'abagabo ya metero 4\u00d7400\n* Ubushyuhe \u2014 3:14.1 (\u2192 ntiyateye imbere)\nGusimbuka ndende kw'abagabo\n* Impamyabushobozi \u2014 7.82 m\n* Umukino wa nyuma \u2014 metero 7.49 (\u2192 umwanya wa 11)\n* Impamyabushobozi \u2014 7.77 m (\u2192 ntiyakomeje)\n* Impamyabushobozi \u2014 7.43 m (\u2192 ntiyakomeje)\nmetero 100 z'abagore\n* Ubushyuhe \u2014 11.72\n* Imikino ya kimwe cya kane \u2014 11.55 (\u2192 ntiyakomeje)\n* Ubushyuhe \u2014 11.75\n* Imikino ya kimwe cya kane \u2014 11.60 (\u2192 ntiyakomeje)\nIteramakofe.\nAbagabo bapima ibiro bya Bantam (54)\u00a0kg)\nUbushobozi bw'abagabo bwo gupima amababa (57)\u00a0kg)\nIyoroheje y'abagabo (60)\u00a0kg)\nAbagabo bafite ibiro byoroheje (63,5)\u00a0kg)\nAbagabo baremereye cyane (+ 81)\u00a0kg)\n* Yatsinzwe na Koweti (1-3)\n* Drew na Cekosilovakiya (1-1)\n* Yatsinzwe na Kolombiya (0-1)\n* Ntabwo yateye imbere\nUmupira w'amaguru (umupira w'amaguru).\nIrushanwa ry'amakipe y'abagabo.\nUrutonde rw'amakipe\n* Ogedegbe nziza cyane\n* Moses Effiong\n* David Adiele\n* Sylvanus Okpala\n* Leotis Boateng\n* John Orlando\n* Tunde Bamidele\n* Isima Okey\n* Shefiu Mohamed\n* Alloysius Atuegbu\n* Henry Nwosu\n