{"id": "21994", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21994", "title": "Nijeriya mu mikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi yo mu 1972", "text": "Nigeria yitabiriyimikino Olempike yomumpeshyi yomu 1972 yabereye i Munich, mu Budage bw'Iburengerazuba.\nIbisubizo ku byabaye.\nSiporo.\nIntera y'abagabo ya metero 100\n* Ubushyuhe bwa mbere \u2014 10.70s (\u2192 ntabwo byateye imbere)\nMetero 800 z'abagabo\n* Ubushyuhe \u2014 1:52.0 (\u2192 ntabwo byateye imbere)\nIntera y'abagabo ya metero 1500\n* Ubushyuhe \u2014 3:48.8 (\u2192 ntabwo byateye imbere)\nRelay y'abagabo ya metero 4 \u00d7 100\n* Ubushyuhe \u2014 39.66s\n* Igice cya kabiri \u2014 39.73s (\u2192 ntabwo yageze imbere)\nRelay y'abagore ya metero 4 \u00d7 100\n* Ubushyuhe \u2014 45.15s (\u2192 ntiyazamutse, ku mwanya wa 12)\nGusimbuka muremure kw'abagore\n* Icyiciro cy'amajonjora \u2014 6.22m (\u2192 ntiyakomeje, ari uwa 19)\nPentathlon y'abagore\n* First Heat \u2014 amanota 4.279 (\u2192 umwanya wa 14)\nIteramakofe.\nAbagabo baremereye cyane (+ 81)\u00a0kg)\n* Icyiciro cya mbere \u2014 Yatsinzwe na Carroll Morgan (CAN), 2:3"}
{"id": "21995", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21995", "title": "Nijeriya mu mikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi yo mu 1968", "text": "Nigeria yitabiriyimikino Olempike yomumpeshyi yomu 1968 yabereye mumujyi wa Mexico, muri Mexique.\nIbisubizo ku byabaye.\nIteramakofe.\nUbwinshi bw'abagabo bworoheje (\u2013 48)\u00a0kg)\n* Icyiciro cya mbere \u2014 Muraho\n* Icyiciro cya Kabiri \u2014 Yatsinzwe na Stefan Alexandrov (BUL), 4:1\n* Igice cya kane \u2014 Yatsinzwe na Harlan Marbley (USA), 0:5\nIgare ryoroheje ry'abagabo (\u2013 81)\u00a0kg)\n* Icyiciro cya mbere \u2014 Muraho\n* Icyiciro cya Kabiri \u2014 Enrique Villarreal (MEX) yatsinzwe, umusifuzi ahagarika irushanwa\n* Igice cya kane \u2014 Yatsinzwe na Ion Monea (ROU), 2:3\nUmupira w'amaguru.\nItsinda B"}
