{"id": "21999", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=21999", "title": "Nijeriya mu mikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi yo mu 1952", "text": "Nijeriya yitabiriyimikino Olempike yomumpeshyi kunshuro yambere mumikino Olempike yomu mpeshyi yomu 1952 yabereye i Helsinki muri Finlande.\nIbisubizo ku byabaye.\nSiporo.\nImodoka ya M100 z'abagabo\n* Icyiciro cya mbere \u2014 iminota 11.25 DNQ\n* Icyiciro cya mbere \u2014 11.12 DNQ\nImodoka ya M200 z'abagabo\n* Icyiciro cya mbere \u2014 22.92s DNQ\n* Icyiciro cya mbere \u2014 22.71 DNQ\n* Icyiciro cya mbere \u2014 22.89 (Q)\n* Imikino ya kimwe cya kane \u2014 22.69 DNQ\nGusiganwa ku maguru kwa 4x100 kw'abagabo\n* Icyiciro cya mbere \u2014 (Muslim Arongudade, Titus Erinle, Karim Olowu, Rafiu Oluwa) 42.4s (Q)\n* Igice cya kabiri \u2014 41.9 DNQ ya 5\nGusimbuka Igihe Kirekire\n* Icyiciro cya mbere \u2014 6.96 DNQ\n* Icyiciro cya mbere \u2014 6.98 DNQ\nGusimbuka cyane\n* Icyiciro cya mbere \u2014 1.87m (Abafite amanota meza)\n* Umukino wa nyuma \u2014 1.90m 9th\n* Icyiciro cya mbere \u2014 1.87m (Abafite amanota meza)\n* Umukino wa nyuma \u2014 1.90m 18th\n* Icyiciro cya mbere \u2014 1.87m (Abafite amanota meza)\n* Umukino wa nyuma \u2014 1.80m 20th"}
{"id": "22000", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22000", "title": "Sitade ya MKO Abiola", "text": "Sitade ya MKO Abiola nisitade ikoreshwamuburyo bwinshi i Abeokuta, muri Nijeriya. Ubu ikoreshwa cyanecyane mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi nisitade y'iwabo ya Gateway FC na Abeokuta Stormers SC. Iyisitade ifitubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 10.000.\nIzina.\nIzina ry'iyi sitade risobanura Moshood Kashimawo Olawale Abiola, umucuruzi, umunyamakuru, umunyapolitiki n'umunyacyubahiro w'Abeokuta, muri Leta ya Ogun."}
{"id": "22001", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22001", "title": "Sitade ya Lekan Salami", "text": "Sitade ya Lekan Salami, izwikandi nka Sitade y'Adamasingba, ni sitade ifite intego nyinshi i Ibadan, muri Nijeriya. Iyisitade ikoreshwa cyanecyane mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru, ikoreshwa nk'ikibuga cya Shooting Stars n'andi makipe yomuri akogace. Ifitimyanya y'abareba 10.000."}
{"id": "22002", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22002", "title": "Ikipe ya Tennis yo mu gasozi ya Lagos", "text": "Ikipe ya Tennis ya Lagos Lawn (yashinzwemu 1895) niyokipe yakera cyane muri Nijeriya. Iyi kipifite ubusobwa metero kare zigera ku 14.000 iherereye kuri 12 Tafawa Balewa Square mu kirwa cya Lagos. \nIshyirahamwe rya Tennis rya Lagos Lawn Club ryakiramarushanwa menshi ya Tennis, aho shampiyona ya Tennis ya Governor's Cup Lagos (GCLT), irushanwa rya ITF Pro-Circuit ngarukamwaka ritangamafaranga y'amadolari 100.000, rikaba ariryorizwicyane. "}
{"id": "22003", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22003", "title": "Abanyagihugu bo mu Birwa bya Lagos", "text": "Ikipe ya Lagos Islanders nikipe ya Basketball yomuri Nijeriya ifiticyicaro i Lagos, yashinzwe mu 1984. Iyikipe yarifitwe n'umuhanzi w'umuziki wapfuye Sound Sultan kuvamu 2014. Bakinira imikino yabo yomurugo muri Rowe Park Sports Centre mugace ka Yaba.\nMu 2016, ikipe ya Islanders yakinnye mwirushanwa ryigenga rya Basketball muri Afurika (ABL). Kubera kwishyirahamwe ry\u2019umukino wa Basketball muri Nijeriya (NBBF) ritemeraga iyi shampiyona, bahagaritswe mu marushanwa yomugihugu. Iryo egeko ryakuweho mu 2019. \nIbyubahiro.\nShampiyona y'icyiciro cya mbere cya Nijeriya \nIgikombe cya FIBA Africa Club Champions Cup"}
{"id": "22004", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22004", "title": "Ikibuga cya Lagos", "text": "Lagos Arena nikibuga cy\u2019imbere kirikubakwa i Lekki, muri Leta ya Lagos, muri Nijeriya, kirimo kubakwa ubu. Iki kibuga kizaba gifite ubushobozi bwo kwakira abantu 12.000 kandikizaba aricyo kibuga kinini cyane cyimbere mugihugu. Byari byitezwe kwikibuga kizarangira mu Kuboza 2024. Iki kibuga kiri kubakwa mugace ka Victoria Island kandi kizatanga ahantuho gukoreribitaramo ndetse n\u2019imikino ikomeye.\nAmateka.\nUyumushinga wa miliyoni 100 z'amadolari wamenyekanye bwambere kwizina rya \"Project Arena\". Igishushanyo mbonera cyakozwe n'ikigo cy'ubwubatsi cyomuri Turukiya cya Yazan Design Architecture cyarangiye mu 2020. Akarere ka Lagos gaterwa inkunga n'ishyirahamwe ry'abikorera ku giti cyabo n'abashinzwe ubucuruzi bw'amazu, riyobowe na Tayo Amusan's Perspectives Corporation n'Ikigo cy'Ishoramari cya Nijeriya, bashoyemo 40.5%. Abandi bashoramari bo mu rwego rw'abikorera barimo Adino Capital Ltd., Ikigogishinzwe Ibikorwaremezo bya Siporo n'Iterambere ry'Imyidagaduro Ltd. na Persianas Group. Kubaka byatangiye kuya 24 Gashyantare 2024 kandi byatangajwe kobizarangira m'Ukuboza 2025. \nAriko, guhera m'Ukuboza 2025, imirimoyokubaka Lagos Arena yari ikiri ku rwego rw\u2019inyubako, cyane cyane mu gihe cyo gupima ubutaka nokubushyiraho, bityo bigatuma igihe cyiza cyo kurangiza nogufungura Arena cyari ukuboza 2027. "}
{"id": "22005", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22005", "title": "Sitade ya Lafia Township", "text": "Sitade ya Lafia Township nisitade ikoreshwa muburyo bwinshi i Lafia, muri Leta ya Nasarawa, muri Nijeriya yohagati. Ikoreshwa cyane cyane mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi nisitade ya Nasarawa United. Iyi sitade ifite ubushobozi bwo kwakira abantu 10.000. Irimu Mujyi wa Lafia rwagati kumuhanda wa Jos-Makurdi."}
{"id": "22006", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22006", "title": "Sitade ya Leta ya Kwara", "text": "Sitade ya Leta ya Kwara nisitade ikoreshwa muburyo bwinshi i Ilorin, Kwara, muri Nijeriya. Ubu ikoreshwa cyane cyane mu mikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi nisitade ya Kwara United FC na ABS FC. Sitade ifite ubushobozi bwokwakirabantu 18.000 nyuma y'imirimo yokuvugurura yatangiye mu 2010. Iherereye kumuhanda wa Sitade, hafi y'umuhanda wa Ibrahim Taiwo.\nAmateka.\nSitade yubatswe n'Umuyobozi wa Gisirikare muriyo leta, Brigadier George Innih, wari mukiruhuko cy'izabukuru, mu 1977. \nKuya 9 Ukuboza 2021, ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru rya Nijeriya (NPFL) ryahagaritse ikibuga cy\u2019imikino nyumay\u2019uko cyatsinzwe ikizamini cy\u2019ubunyangamugayo cyakoreshejwe mu byumba byo kwambariramo, ubwiherero, televiziyo, ahokamera zihagarara, n\u2019amanota y\u2019ikoranabuhanga. Iryo tegeko ryasubiwemo hanyuma rikurwaho kuya 14 Ukuboza 2021 nyuma yo kuvugururwa byihutirwa. Ariko, ikibuga nticyashoboraga gukinirwa muruwomwaka w\u2019imikino kuko leta yemeye impinduka z\u2019ikibuga murwego rwokuvugurura ikibuga. \nKwara United yitabiriyimikino ya shampiyona y\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru ya Nigeria kuvamu 2023 kugeza 2024, impuzandengo y\u2019abitabiriye imikino yakinwe murugo ni 5,368.\nMuri Kanama 2024, leta yatangiye gusananokuvugurura sitade kugira ngwikomeze kugendera ku bipimo bya NPFL. \nKoresha.\nIkoreshwa cyanecyane mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru\nAmareferensi.\n&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Coordinates/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;8\u00b028\u203230\u2033N 4\u00b032\u203234\u2033E\ufeff / \ufeff8.47500\u00b0N 4.54278\u00b0E\ufeff / 8.47500; 4.54278"}
{"id": "22007", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22007", "title": "Ishyirahamwe rya Karate muri Nijeriya", "text": "Ishyirahamwe rya Karate muri Nijeriya niryo shyirahamwerinini ryakarate muri Nijeriya, rikaba n'umunyamuryango ndetse n'uhagarariye uyumukino muri Komite Olempike ya Nijeriya. \nIrushanwa mpuzamahanga.\nIshyirahamwe rya Karate muri Nijeriya numunyamuryango w\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Afurika ry\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abakina Karate muri Afurika (UAKF) ndetse n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019isi ry\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abakina Karate ku isi (WKF).\nKuruhande rwa Komite Olempike ya Nijeriya, Ishyirahamwe rya Karate muri Nijeriya niryo ryonyine ryemewe kohereza abakinnyi mumikino Olempike. "}
{"id": "22008", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22008", "title": "Sitade ya Jay Jay Okocha", "text": "Sitade ya Jay Jay Okocha ni sitade irimuri Ogwashi-Uku, Aniocha y'Amajyepfo, muri Nijeriya yitiriwe uwahoze ari kapiteni wa Super Eagles Jay-Jay Okocha. Kurubikoreshwa cyane cyane mu mikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi sitade ya Delta Force FC yakiniwe murugo. Iyi sitade yahinduwe izina rya Okocha muri Kamena 2008, ifite ubushobozi bwo kwakira abantu 8.000 kandi yakiriye imikino ya Shampiyona ya WAFU y'abatarengeje imyaka 20 yatwaye na Ghana mu 2008. \nAmateka.\nMu 2015, yabaye imwemumbuga zakiniwemo igikombe cya Delta State Federation Cup cyo mu 2015.\nNyuma y'imyaka icyenda, mwirushanwa rya 2024 Zenith Bank/Delta Principals Cup, ryabereye mu cyiciro cyakabiri cyanyuma cyahuje Ishuri Rikuru rya Umutu n'Ishuri Rikuru rya Utagbe, aho Ishuri Rikuru rya Utagbe ryageze kumukino wa nyuma ritsinda igitego 1-0."}
{"id": "22009", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22009", "title": "Sitade y'Umujyi wa Jalingo", "text": "Sitade ya Jolly Nyame ni sitade ikoreshwa muburyo bwinshi i Jalingo, muri Nijeriya. Ubu ikoreshwa cyane cyane mu mikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandiniho Taraba FC iherereye. Sitade icumbikira abantu 12.000 kandiyubatswe mu 2002. Yitiriwe Guverineri w'iyo leta icyogihe, Hon. Jolly Nyame. "}
{"id": "22010", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22010", "title": "Sitade ya Ilaro", "text": "Sitade ya Ilaro ni sitade ikoreshwa muburyo bwinshi i Ilaro, muri Nijeriya. Yubatswe mu 2008, ubu ikoreshwa cyane cyane mu mikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi ni sitade yomurugo ya Gateway FC. Sitade ifite ubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 12.000. Sitade ubiherereye kumuhanda wa Idogo muri Ilaro."}
{"id": "22011", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22011", "title": "Sitade y'Urwibutso rwa Ikpeazu", "text": "Sitade y'urwibutso rwa Chuba Ikpeazu ni sitade ifitubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 5,000 iherereye Onitsha, muri Nijeriya, ikabayubatswe mu 2009. Ubuni sitade y'ikipe ya Anambra Pillars FC na Anambra United FC."}
{"id": "22012", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22012", "title": "Sitade ya Hadejia", "text": "Sitade ya Hadejia ni sitade ikoreshwa muburyo bwinshi i Hadejia, muri Leta ya Jigawa, muri Nijeriya. Ubu ikoreshwa cyane mu mikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi nisitade ya Jigawa Golden Stars FC. Sitade ifitubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 15.000. \nAmasano yo hanze.\n&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Coordinates/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;12\u00b028\u203225\u2033N 10\u00b01\u203253\u2033E\ufeff / \ufeff12.47361\u00b0N 10.03139\u00b0E\ufeff / 12.47361; 10.03139"}
{"id": "22013", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22013", "title": "Ishyirahamwe ry'imikino ngororamubiri muri Nijeriya", "text": "Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019imikino ngororamubiri muri Nijeriya niryoriyobora siporo y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri muri Nijeriya. Numunyamuryango w\u2019Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Imikinongororamubiri muri Afurika n\u2019Ishyirahamwe Mpuzamahanga ry\u2019Imikino ngororamubiri.\nYashinzwe nk'Inama Nkuru y'Ishyirahamwe ry'Imikino y'Abakinnyi b'Amaguru muri Nijeriya mu 1944. AFN itegura irushanwa ngarukamwaka rya AFN Golden League, rikaba ari irushanwa ry'imbere mu gihugu rifite imiterere isa n'iya IAAF Golden League ubwitakibaho. Mu 2017, Ibrahim Shehu Gusau yatorewekuba perezida w'iryo shyirahamwe. Kugezamuri Nyakanga 2024, Tonobok Okowa niwe perezida wa AFN. \nIcyicaro cya AFN kirikuri Sitade y'Igihugu ya Nijeriya i Garki, Abuja. "}
{"id": "22014", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22014", "title": "Sitade ya Gabros", "text": "Sitade ya Gabros ni sitade ifitubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 3,000 i Nnewi, muri Nijeriya, hafi ya Beverly Hills Hotel. Ni sitade ya Gabros International na Godosky FC, ikaba yarikicaro cy'agateganyo cya Anambra United FC.\nImpaka.\nIkipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Gabros na Sitade yayobyaje kugurishwa kuri Dr. Patrick Ifeanyi Ubah na Chief Gabriel Chukwuma. Sitade yakiriye imikino y'umupira w'amaguru ya NFPL Icyumweru cya 10. Ariko, Chief Gabriel Chukwuma yashimangiye kontagurishwa nk'iryo ryabayeho. Anavugako Dr. Patrick Ifeanyi Ubah yishyuye gusa ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru atari iyindi sitade nk'ikindi kigo. \nM'Ukuboza 2015, Urukiko Rukuru rw\u2019Intara y\u2019Umurwa Mukuru (FCT) rwabujije Chief Gabriel Chukwuma kwivanga mu burenganzira bwa Dr. Patrick Ifeanyi Ubah na FC Ifeanyi Ubah bwo gukora nk\u2019ikipe y\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru no kwitabira shampiyona y\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru ya Nigeria (NPFL), nyuma y\u2019uko uyumukinnyi wa mbere yavuzekoyigaruriye iyikipe kandi karimo kwitegura kwitabira shampiyona iri imbere. "}
{"id": "22015", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22015", "title": "Sitade Mpuzamahanga ya Enyimba", "text": "Sitade Mpuzamahanga ya Enyimba ni sitade ikoreshwa mu buryo bwinshi i Aba, muri Nijeriya. Ubikoreshwa cyane cyane mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi ikora nk'ikibuga cya Enyimba FC nyuma yo kuvugururwa mu 2018, iyi sitade yakirabantu 16.000. Enyimba imaze kwegukana igikombe cy'umupira w'amaguru cya Nijeriya inshuro nyinshi. Enyimba FC yitabiriye imikino yomu rugo ingana na 3.496 mwirushanwa rya NPFL ryo mu 2023-24."}
{"id": "22016", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22016", "title": "Sitade ya El-Kanemi", "text": "Sitade ya El-Kanemi nisitade ikoreshwan'abantu benshi i Maiduguri, muri Nijeriya. Ubu ikoreshwa cyanecyane mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandini sitade y'ikipe ya El-Kanemi Warriors. Sitade y'abantu 10.000 yitiriwumutegetsi wa Kanem-Borno Empire, Muhammad al-Amin al-Kanemi.\nAmareferensi.\n&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Coordinates/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;11\u00b050\u203246\u2033N 13\u00b008\u203245\u2033E\ufeff / \ufeff11.84611\u00b0N 13.14583\u00b0E\ufeff / 11.84611; 13.14583"}
{"id": "22017", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22017", "title": "Sitade ya Eket Township", "text": "Sitade ya Eket Township nisitade ifitintego nyinshiherereye muri Eket, agace k'ubuyobozi bw'ibanze muri Leta ya Akwa Ibom, muri Nijeriya. Iyi sitade yafunguwe mu 2022 kandi ikoreshwa cyane cyane mu mikino y'umupira w'amaguru. Iyi sitade nikibuga cya FC One Rocket na Vandrezzer FC. Iyi sitade ifitubushobozi bwokwicara abantu 17.000 kandifite amatara, icyumba cy'imikino cyo mu nzu, n'ahantu ho gukiniramo hakozwe ubukorikori. \nMu 2023, Akwa United yimuriye by'agateganyo imikinoyayo isanzwe yomumwaka w'imikino ibera murugo kuri Sitade ya Eket kubera gahundanyinshi za sitade ya Godswill Akpabio i Uyo, yakoreshwaga mumikino mpuzamahanga. "}
{"id": "22018", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22018", "title": "Ebun Comets", "text": "Ebun Comets ni ikipe ya basketball yo muri Nijeriya, ifite icyicaro i Lagos. Ni imwe mu makipe afite amateka akomeye muri shampiyona ya Nijeriya.\nYegukanye shampiyona y'igihugu mu myaka ya 2000, harimo iya 2007, ndetse n'irushanwa rya Crown Elite Basketball Championship mu 2021.\nAmateka.\nEbun Comets ni ikipe ifite amateka akomeye muri shampiyona ya Nijeriya, aho yasangiye ibikombe na Lagos Islanders mu gihe cy'imyaka igera kuri cumi n'itanu.\nMu ntangiriro z'umwaka w'imikino wa 2005\u20132006, Ebun Comets yari ifite igikombe cya shampiyona (Premier League), itozwa na Ayo Bakare. Mu 2007, yongeye kwegukana Premier League itsinze Union Bank amanota 74\u201364, ibona itike yo guhagararira Nijeriya mu marushanwa nyafurika.\nMu 2021, yageze ku mukino wa nyuma wa NBBF National Division One idatsinzwe, ihita izamurwa muri Premier League. Ku wa 14 Nyakanga 2021, yegukanye Crown Elite Basketball Championship itsinze Lagos Legends amanota 58\u201352."}
{"id": "22019", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22019", "title": "Ikipe ya Delta Queens FC", "text": "Delta Queens nikipe y'umupira w'amaguru y'abagore muri Leta ya Delta, muri Nijeriya. [\"Bikenewe\"] Imwemumakipe ya Nigeria yitwaye nezacyane, irushanwa muri Nigeria Women Premier League, ishami rinini ry\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru w\u2019abagore mugihugu. Bakinira imikino yaboyamu rugo kuri Sitade ya Stephen Keshi mumurwa mukuru wa Delta State Asaba. Umutozamukuru w\u2019iyi kipe ubuni Peter Dedevbo. \nAmateka.\nDelta Queens yashinzwe na guverinoma ya Guverineri James Ibori muri Mutarama 2000. Ubuyobozi bw'iyi kipe bwari buyobowe na Komiseri wa Siporo, Solomon Ogba.\nIkipe iriho ubu.\n\"Squad list for 2025 season.\"\nAbakinnyi ba kera bazwi cyane.\n\"Uru rutonde rw'abakinnyi bahoze ari abakinnyi rugizwe n'abakinnyi bahagarariye igihugu cyabo ku rwego mpuzamahanga.\""}
{"id": "22020", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22020", "title": "Sitade ya Dan Anyiam", "text": "Sitade ya Dan Anyiam ni sitade yomuri Nijeriya ifitintegonyinshi iherereye i Owerri, muri Leta ya Imo.\nAmateka.\nIyisitade iherereyehagati mumujyi wa Owerri, umurwamukuru wa Leta ya Imo, yitiriwe Daniel Anyiam, kapiteni wungirije w'ikipe ya mbere y'igihugu ya Nijeriya akaba n'uwahoze arumutoza w'ikipe y'igihugu ya Nijeriya. Daniel Anyiam niwemutoza wambere w'ikipe y'igihugu, icyogihe yitwaga Green Eagles.\nMu 2019, Guverineri wa Leta ya Imo, Emeka Ihedioha, mugihe cy'umushinga we \"Rebuild Imo Project\" yatanzamasoko yokuvugurura nogusana sitade ya Dan Anyiam hamwe n'indi mishinga. \nImikoreshereze.\nIkoreshwa cyane cyane mumikino y\u2019ishyirahamwe n\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru kandinisitade ya Heartland FC Heartland FC yitabiriye imikino yo mu rugo ya NPFL mumwaka wa 2019-20.\nUbushobozi.\nSitade ifitubushobozi bwokwakirabantu 10.000."}
{"id": "22021", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22021", "title": "Sitade y'ihuriro", "text": "Sitade ya Confluence ni sitade ifitabantubenshi i Lokoja, muri Leta ya Kogi ifitimyanya 25.000. Ni ikibuga cya Kogi United na Confluence Queens muri shampiyona y'igihugu ya Nigeria na shampiyona y'abagore ya Nigeria. Yakoreshejwe nk'ikibuga cy'agateganyo cyakinirwagamo imikino ya Niger Tornadoes mwirushanwa rya shampiyona y'umupira w'amaguru ya Nigeria yomu 2016. Ariko sitade ihorahoya Tornadoes iracyari sitade ya Bako Kontagora. \nAmateka.\nIyi sitade yubatswe mu 1998, ivugururwa kugira ngo irusheho kubanziza mu 2008.\nKoresha.\nSitade ya Confluence ikoreshwa cyane cyane mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru ndetse rimwe na rimwe no mu birori bya leta n'iby'igihugu, nkomubirori by'amadini, politiki n'imibereho myiza y'abaturage."}
{"id": "22022", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22022", "title": "Abarwanirira abaturage", "text": "Abakinnyi b'abasivili, bazwi kandinka Abakinnyi b'abadefensi Basketball, nikipe ya Basketball y'ababigize umwugayomuri Nijeriya ikomoka i Abuja. Iyikipe irushanwamuri Shampiyona y'Umukuru wa Nijeriya.\nAbakinnyi b'inyuma bitabiriye shampiyona ya FIBA Africa Basketball League mu 2018-19. \nMu marushanwa ya Afurika.\nFIBA Africa Basketball League (imikino 1)\n 2018\u201319 \u2013 Imikino ya kimwe cya kane"}
{"id": "22023", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22023", "title": "Sitade ya Bako Kontagora", "text": "Sitade ya Bako Kontagora, izwikandi nka Minna Township Stadium, ni sitade ifitubushobozi bwo kwakira abantu 5,000 i Minna, muri Nijeriya. Ubikoreshwa cyane cyane mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru. Niho Niger Tornadoes ituye. Mu 2017-18, Niger Tornadoes yitabiriye imikino yomu rugoyari 4,300 muri Sitade ya Bako Kontagora.\nLeta ya Niger irimu igenamigambi ryokwagura ubushobozi bwa sitade ya Bako Kontagora bugera ku 30.000, icyakora, kubera kositade iri hagati mumujyi hamwe n'amazu yubatswe impande zose za sitade, ntamwanya munini wokwagura."}
{"id": "22024", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22024", "title": "Ayo Bakare", "text": "Ayodele \"Ayo\" Bakare (wavutse kuya 20 Werurwe 1960) numutoza wa basketball wabigize umwuga wo muri Nijeriya. Ubuni wemutoza mukuru wa Ebun Comets kandi amazimyaka myinshi atoza Nigeria.\nUmwuga wo gutoza amakipe.\nBakare yabayeumutoza mukuru wa Ebun Comets muri shampiyona y'icyiciro cyambere muri Nigeria.\nUmwuga wo gutoza ikipe y'igihugu ya Nijeriya.\nBakare yahoze arumutozamukuru w'ikipe y'igihugu ya Basketball y'abagabo bakuru ya Nijeriya. Ikipeye ya Nijeriya yujujibisabwa kandi yitabiriye imikino Olempike yomumpeshyi ya 2012. Yeguye afite Umuyobozi wa Tekiniki w'amakipe mu 2014. "}
{"id": "22025", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22025", "title": "Sitade ya Ahmadu Bello", "text": "Sitade ya Ahmadu Bello, yitwa ABS, ni sitade ifitintego nyinshi irimu Mujyi wa Kaduna, muri Leta ya Kaduna, muri Nijeriya. Yakozwemu 1965 n'abubatsi b'Abongereza Jane Drew na Maxwell Fry. Kugeza mu 2016, ikoreshwa cyane cyane mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru. Sitade ifite ubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 16.000.\nSitade igizwe n'igice kinini cy'imikino yo gusiganwa kumaguru ndetsen'imikino y'umupira w'amaguru n'ibigo bibiri by'imikino yo mu nzu."}
{"id": "22026", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22026", "title": "Sitade ya Agege", "text": "Ikibuga cya Agege ni sitadeifitintego nyinshi i Lagos, muri Nijeriya. Ifitubushobozi bwokwicara abantu 4.000. Nikibuga cya MFM FC, ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore barimunsi y'imyaka 17 ya Nijeriya, kandi kuvamu 2018, ni icya DreamStar FC Ladies.\nGuverinoma ya Lagos ivuga kohari gukorwibishobokabyose kugirango bazarangize kuvugurura sitade muri Gashyantare, nk'ukobyatangajwe n'ibiro ntaramakuru byomuri Nijeriya. \nSitade ya Lagos niyicumbikiye ikipe ya DreamStar FC Ladies yomuri Nigeria, ikipe ya DreamStar FC Ladies, n'ikipe ya MFM yomuri Nigeria, bahagarariye igihugu muri CAF Champions League yo mu 2017, hamwe na Plateau United. \nIsosiyete Verified Creative House, ubucuruzi n'ikirango, yakoreyimurikagurisha ryayo muri sitade ya Agege, mugace ka Agege muntara ya Lagos, kuva kuya 1 kugeza kuya 7 Nyakanga. \nIbidukikije.\nSitade irahantu hasukuye kandi ibikorwa remezo byayo bihora bibungabungwa kugirango byuzuze amahame mpuzamahanga. Sitade izwiho kwakira amarushanwa atandukanye y\u2019imikino mpuzamahanga. "}
{"id": "22027", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22027", "title": "Sitade y'Urwibutso rwa Abubakar Umar", "text": "Sitade y'urwibutso rwa Abubakar Umar ni sitade ikoreshwa muburyo bwinshi i Gombe, muri Leta ya Gombe, muri Nijeriya, ifite ubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 10.000. Yakoreshwaga cyane cyane mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi yarikibuga cya Gombe United FC.\nGuverinoma y\u2019igihugu yari imazigihe kinini iteganya kuyisimbuza sitade nshya. Iyigahunda yashyizwe mubikorwa ubwo sitade ya Pantami yubatswega ikanatangira gukoreshwa i Gombe mu 2010. Iyi nyubako nshya kandi igezweho yasimbuye sitade y\u2019urwibutso rwa Abubakar Umar iba sitade nshya yemewe ya Gombe United FC. Nyamara, harimpungenge zimwe na zimwe ku kwirengagiza kubungabunga sitade ya Pantami. \nMuby\u2019ukuri, kutagira gahunda yokubungabunga sitade nshya ya Pantami byatumye bamwemu basaba leta gushaka gukoresha sitade \"yasizwe\" ya Abubakar Umar kugirangobagabanye igitutu kuri sitade ya Pantami. \n&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Coordinates/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;10\u00b018\u203253\u2033N 11\u00b08\u203216.5\u2033E\ufeff / \ufeff10.31472\u00b0N 11.137917\u00b0E\ufeff / 10.31472; 11.137917"}
{"id": "22028", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22028", "title": "Stade Abubakar Tafawa Balewa", "text": "Sitade ya Abubarkar Tafawa Balewa ni sitade ikoreshwa mu buryo bwinshi i Bauchi, muri Nijeriya. Ubikoreshwa cyane cyane mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi nisitade y'abakerarugendo ba Wikki. Iyisitade ifitubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 11.000 kandiyafunguwe mu 1985 yitiriwe Minisitiri w'Intebe wambere wa Nijeriya, Tafawa Balewa. \nSitade ya Abubarkar Tafawa Balewa yarimwemumbuga 8 zakoreshejwe mumikino y'igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cy'abatarengeje imyaka 17 cyabereye muri Nijeriya mu 2009, yakiriyimikino 3. Umukino wambere wabereye mwirushanwa ryahuje Nijeriya na Argentine mu matsinda wagaragaje kwabantu 11,467 bitabiriye. \nIbintubidasanzwe kurisitade birimo ikibaho cy\u2019amanota cyokurwego rw\u2019isi cya FIFA, ecran ya LED n\u2019amatara akoresha ingufu nke, televiziyo ifunze (CCTV) yokugenzura umutekano, hamwe n\u2019ikigo cy\u2019itangazamakuru kigezweho cyane. Ifite kandi pisine y\u2019ubwoko bwa Olempike ifite inzira 10. "}
{"id": "22029", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22029", "title": "Nijeriya mu mikino Paralempike yo mu mpeshyi ya 1996", "text": "Abakinnyi 8 b'abagabo baturutse muri Nijeriya bitabiriyirushanwa rya Paralympic ryo mu mpeshyi ryo mu 1996 ryabereye i Atlanta, muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika. \nInyuma.\nMubice byinshi by'Afurika, abantubafite ubumuga bw'umubiri n'ubwo mumutwe bahura n'igisuzuguro gikabije. Ingerozirimo imyizerere ivuga kobakuye ubumuga bwabokubera ko ababyeyi babobari abarozi cyangwa ko ari abapfumu; akenshi hari igitutu gikomeye cy'umuco ku bantu bafite ubumuga bw'umubiri cyokuguma bihishe kandi batabonwa n'abantu benshi. Ahantu henshi, bafatwa nk'inyamaswa zikeneye gukira. Iyi ni yo mpamvu abakinnyi ba Paralympian bo muri Nijeriya bashyira imbere sosiyete ndetse n'imikino imbere mu gihugu cyabo. \nImidari.\nItsinda rya Nijeriya mumikino Paralempike ryavuye mumikino ryatwaye imidari myinshi kurusha bagenzi babo mumikino Olempike. Nyuma Adeoye Ajibola yaje guhagararira Nijeriya mu marushanwa y\u2019abafite ubushobozi. \nSiporo.\nAdeoye Ajibola yegukanye imidari itatu mu mikino ngororamubiri.\nGuterura amashanyarazi.\nKu wambere Emoghavwe, Abraham Obaretin, Johnson Sulola na Patrick Akutaekwe begukanye umudari mu mukino wo guterura amashanyarazi."}
{"id": "22030", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22030", "title": "Nijeriya muri Kaminuza y'Impeshyi ya 2017", "text": "Nijeriya yitabiriyirushanwa rya 2017 Summer Universiade ryabereye i Taipei muri Tayiwani.\nNijeriya yohereje itsindarigizwe n'abantu 59 bahatanira irirushanwa bahatanira imikino 7. Nijeriya nta mudari yatsindiye muri iri rushanwa ryimikino myinshi."}
{"id": "22031", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22031", "title": "Nijeriya mu gikombe cya Afurika", "text": "Nijeriya yagaragaye mumikino yanyuma y'igikombe cya Afurika inshuromakumyabiri. Nijeriya yatwaye igikombe inshuro eshatu: kunshuro yambere harimu 1980 kandi yegukanye igikombe cyakabiri mu 1994, cyabereye muri Tuniziya.\nNijeriya yegukanye igikombe cyayocyagatatu cya Afurika mu 2013, cyabereye mur'Afurika y'Epfo."}
{"id": "22032", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22032", "title": "Ikipe ya Nijeriya ya Billie Jean King Cup", "text": "Ikipe ya Nigeria Billie Jean King Cup ihagarariye Nigeria mwirushanwa rya tenisi rya Billie Jean King Cup kandiyobowe n'ishyirahamwe ry'umukino wa tenisi rya Nigeria. Ubu irushanwa mu gace k'i Burayi/Afurika mwitsinda ryagatatu.\nAmateka.\nNijeriya yitabiriye imikino yambere ya Billie Jean King Cup mu 2021. Umusaruro mwizayatsinze ni ukurangiza ari uwa kabiri mu itsinda rya gatatu mu 2021."}
{"id": "22033", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22033", "title": "Ishyirahamwe ry'umukino wa Hockey muri Nijeriya", "text": "Ishyirahamwe ry'umukino wa Hockey muri Nijeriya (NHF) niryoshyirahamwe riyobora umukino wa Hockey womukibuga muri Nijeriya. Rifitanye isano n'ishyirahamwe mpuzamahanga rya Hockey rya IHF na AfHF African Hockey Federation. Icyicarogikuru cya NHF kiri i Abuja, muri Nijeriya.\nInjeniyeri Obadiah Simon Nkom ni Perezida wa NHF naho Chimezie Asiegbu n'Umunyamabanga Mukuru. \nFIH nurwego rushinzwe kwemeza ikibuga cya Hockey/Ikibuga. Kurubuntamakipeyemewe na FIH ahaba muri Nijeriya.\nIkipe y'igihugu ya Hockey y'abagabo ya Nigeria yanditsamateka muri Mutarama mugikombe cya Afurika cya 2022 cyabereye muri Ghana, irangiza iri kumwanya wagatatu muriryorushanwa nyuma yo gutsinda Kenya ibitego 4-2. Nibwobwambere barangije ku mwanya wa mbere mu gikombe cya Afurika."}
{"id": "22034", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22034", "title": "Ikipe y'igihugu y'abagabo ya Nijeriya mu mukino wa Handball", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu ya Nijeriya yitwa Handball nikipe y'igihugu ya Nijeriya. Yitabiramarushanwa mpuzamahanga ya Handball.\nIkipeyitabiriye shampiyona y'isi y'umukino w'intoki w'abagaboyomu 1999, ahoyaje kumwanya wa 23."}
{"id": "22035", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22035", "title": "Ikipe y'igihugu y'abagabo ya Basketball y'abatarengeje imyaka 17 ya Nijeriya", "text": "Ikipey'igihugu ya Basketball y'abagabo barimunsi y'imyaka 16 ya Nijeriya nikipe y'igihugu ya Basketball ya Nijeriya, iyoborwa n'Ishyirahamwe ry'Umukino wa Basketball rya Nijeriya. Ihagarariye igihugumumarushanwa mpuzamahanga y'abagabo barimunsi y'imyaka 16 ya Basketball."}
{"id": "22036", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22036", "title": "Ikipe y'igihugu y'abagabo ya Basketball y'abatarengeje imyaka 19 ya Nijeriya", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu ya Basketball y'abagabo barimunsi y'imyaka 18 na 19 ya Nijeriya nikipe y'igihugu ya Basketball ya Nijeriya, iyoborwa n'ishyirahamwe ry'umukino wa Basketball rya Nijeriya. Ihagarariye igihugu mumarushanwa mpuzamahanga ya Basketball y'abari munsiy'imyaka 18 na 19."}
{"id": "22037", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22037", "title": "Ikipe y'igihugu ya baseball ya Nijeriya", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu ya baseball ya Nijeriya nikipe y'igihugu ya baseball ya Nijeriya. Iyikipe ihagarariye Nijeriya mumarushanwa mpuzamahanga kandi irikumwanya wa 6 mur'Afurika (yasohotse ku rutonde rwa 2020), imanuka ivuye kumwanya wa 2 mur'Afurika. Kandi iriku mwanya wa 70 kwisi (yasohotse kurutonde rwa 2020) \nAgahigo k'irushanwa.\nImikino ya Afurika yose.\nMu 1999, Nijeriya yegukanye umudari wa feza itsinze andimakipe yose y'igihugu urets'Afurika y'Epfo, ahoyatsinzwe ku mukino wanyuma. Kugira ngo bigende neza, Nijeriya yatsinze Lesotho (14-3), Zimbabwe (12-11), Uganda (27-1) na Ghana (14-5) kugeza ubwo yatsinzwe na Afurika y'Epfo (1-19) mu mukino wa shampiyona. Nijeriya yongeye kuba igihugu gikomeye mu mikino yabereye i Abuja mu 2003, igera ku mukino wa nyuma aho yatsinzwe n'Afurika y'Epfo 0-15 yongera kubona umudari wa feza. Baseball yari iteganijwe kugaruka mu mikino ya Afurika yose yabereye muri Mozambike mu 2011, ariko ibintibyagenze ukobyari biteganijwe. [\"Icyitonderwa kirakenewe\"]"}
{"id": "22038", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22038", "title": "Ikipe y'igihugu ya Nijeriya ya futsal", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu ya Nijeriya yitwa Futsal ihagarariye Nijeriya mumarushanwampuzamahanga ya futsal kandigenzurwa na Komisiyo ya Futsal y'Ishyirahamwe ry'Umupira w'Amaguru rya Nijeriya. Nijeriya yakinnye igikombe cya Afurika cya Futsal nyumayokugikina bwambere mwirushanwa ryo mu 2008 ahoyasezerewe mucyicirocyambere. Nijeriya yanakinnye igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA Futsal ubwo yakinnye bwa mbere ku rwego mpuzamahanga mu 1992 ahoyasezerewe mu matsinda nyumayogutsindwa imikinitatuyose (na Argentine, Pologne na Hong Kong yakiriye).\nIbisubizo.\nNijeriya imazimyaka myinshi idakina kandi imaze gukina imikino 8 gusa mu gihe cya 1992-2026:"}
{"id": "22039", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22039", "title": "Ikipe y'igihugu ya rugby ya Nijeriya", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu ya rugby muri Nijeriya ihagarariye Nijeriya mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga ya rugby football. Yatangiye gukina shampiyona y'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba bwohagati mu 2019, itsinze Ghana kumanota 23-12. \nIkipe iriho ubu.\nIkipe y'abakinnyi bazakina shampiyona ya MEA Rugby League 2019 ; "}
{"id": "22040", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22040", "title": "Ikipe y'igihugu ya Nijeriya y'abatarengeje imyaka 19 ya Cricket", "text": "Ikipe ya Cricket ya Nijeriya y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 19 ihagarariye Nijeriya mumukino wa Cricket w\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 19 kurwego mpuzamahanga. Iyikipiyobowe n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umukino wa Cricket rya Nijeriya (NCF). Iyikipe yegukanye igikombe cyayo cyambere cy\u2019isi mu gikombe cy\u2019isi cya Cricket cy\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 19 cya 2020.\nAmateka.\nYitabiriye irushanwa rya ICC Africa Division One ryoguhatanira itike yokujya mugikombe cy\u2019isi cya Cricket cy\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 19 mu 2020, ryabereye muri Namibiya. Nijeriya yatsinze Namibia, ikipe ihabwa amahirwe yo kwitabira irushanwa ku manota 52, Uganda kumanota 30 na Kenya ku manota 58. Nijeriya yatsinze irushanwa inabona amahirwe yokwitabira igikombe cy\u2019isi cya Cricket cy\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 19 cyabereye mur'Afurika y\u2019Epfo ku nshuro yambere. Barangije ku mwanya wa 15 muririrushanwa, mumakipe 16, batsinda Ubuyapani mumukino wa nyuma. \nIkipe.\nIkipe ya Nijeriya izitabira igikombe cy'isi cy'abatarengeje imyaka 19 cya 2020 yatangajwe ku ya 7 Ukuboza 2019. \nInyandiko n'imibare.\nIncamake y'imikino mpuzamahanga\n\"Guhera ku ya 7 Kanama 2024\""}
{"id": "22041", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22041", "title": "Ishyirahamwe ry'Umupira w'Amaguru rya Rugby muri Nijeriya", "text": "Ishyirahamwe ry'Umupira w'Amaguru rya Rugby muri Nijeriya (NRFF) niryoshyirahamwe riyoborishyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru rya Rugby muri Nijeriya. Rifitanye isano na Komite Olempike ya Nijeriya, Rugby Africa na Rugby y'Isi.\nNRFF igizwe n'inama y'ubutegetsiyobowe na Perezida; Ademola Are na Visi Perezida; AIG Aliyu Abubakar (w'ucyuyigihe) batorewe kuyoborimikino ya rugby muri Nijeriya."}
{"id": "22042", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22042", "title": "Ishyirahamwe rya Squash rya Nijeriya", "text": "Ishyirahamwe rya Nigeria Squash ryashinzwe mu 1974 nk'urwego rushinzwekugenzura siporo ya squash muri Nijeriya. \nAmareferensi.\nHenry Usiayo https://en.africatopsports.com/2020/09/09/taiwo-hails-fg-for-return-of-sports-after-covid-19/"}
{"id": "22043", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22043", "title": "Ishyirahamwe rya Taekwondo muri Nijeriya", "text": "Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umukino wa Taekwondo muri Nijeriya numunyamuryango w\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abanyafurika ry\u2019umukino wa Taekwondo mur'Afurika (ATU) ndetse n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019isi ry\u2019umukino wa Taekwondo ku isi (WT). \nKuruhande rwa Komite Olempike ya Nijeriya, NOC niyoshyirahamwe ryonyine rya Taekwondo ryemerewe kohereza abakinnyi mumikino Olempike. [\"Ibisobanuro birakenewe\"]"}
{"id": "22044", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22044", "title": "Ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore ya Basketball y'abatarengeje imyaka 17 ya Nijeriya", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu ya Basketball y'abagore ya Nijeriya y'abari munsiy'imyaka 16 na 17 nikipe y'igihugu ya Basketball ya Nijeriya, iyoborwa n'Ishyirahamwe ry'Umukino wa Basketball rya Nijeriya. Ihagarariye igihugu mumarushanwa mpuzamahanga ya Basketball y'abagore bari munsi y'imyaka 16 na 17.\nAmateka.\nAfroBasket y'abagore ya FIBA U16.\nNijeriya yitabiriye shampiyona y\u2019abagore ya Basketball y\u2019abagore batarengejimyaka 16 ni shampiyona y\u2019abagore ya FIBA Africa y\u2019abatarengejimyaka 16 yomu 2015, aho yegukanye umudari wa feza.\nIgikombe cy'Isi cya Basketball cy'abagore bari munsi y'imyaka 17 cya FIBA.\nIkipe ya Nijeriya yegukanye uburenganzira bwogutangira imikino y\u2019isi y\u2019abagore ya FIBA mu mwaka wa 2016, arikontibashoboye kugenda, bityo, ibisubizo byabo muriryorushanwa byanditswe nk\u2019ibyatsinzwe."}
{"id": "22045", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22045", "title": "Ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore ya Basketball y'abatarengeje imyaka 19 muri Nijeriya", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu ya Basketball y'abagore ya Nijeriya y'abarimunsiy'imyaka 18 na 19 niikipe y'igihugu ya Basketball ya Nijeriya, iyoborwa n'Ishyirahamwe ry'Umukino wa Basketball rya Nijeriya. Ihagarariye igihugu mumarushanwampuzamahanga ya Basketball y'abagore bari munsi y'imyaka 18 na 19."}
{"id": "22046", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22046", "title": "Igikombe cya Super Cup cy'abagore cya Nijeriya", "text": "Igikombe cya Nigeria cy\u2019abagore cyitwa NWFL Champions Shield numukino ngarukamwaka, uhuzamakipe yatwaye igikombe cya Aiteo na shampiyona y\u2019abagore ya Nigeria mumwaka ushize. Icyiciro cya mbere cyakinwe kuya 4 Werurwe 2018 hagati ya Nasarawa Amazons na Rivers Angels kuri sitade ya Agege, i Lagos. Uyumukino kandugaragaza kumwaka mushya w\u2019umupira w\u2019amagurutangiye. "}
{"id": "22047", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22047", "title": "Ishyirahamwe ry'abazitira uruzitiro muri Nijeriya", "text": "Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abazitira uruzitiro muri Nijeriya niryoriyobora rikanagenzurimikino Olempike yokuzitiruruzitiro muri Nijeriya. Rifatanyije na Komite Olempike ya Nijeriya, urwegorufite inshingano zo gutegura amarushanwa yokuzitira uruzitiro mugace noguhitamo abazitiruruzitiro mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga. "}
{"id": "22048", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22048", "title": "Ishyirahamwe ry'Ubuhanzi bw'Intambara buvanze muri Nijeriya", "text": "Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Ubuhanzi bw\u2019Intambara zomu Mahanga muri Nijeriya (NMMAF) ryashinzwe ku ya 11 Werurwe 2014 nk\u2019urwego rw\u2019igihugu rushinzwe ubuhanzi bw\u2019intambara bwomumaguru (MMA) muri Nijeriya. NMMAF ni urwego rushinzwe shampiyona y\u2019ubuhanzi bw\u2019intambara bwo mu maguru n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019imikino muri iryo shyirahamwe. NMMAF kandi ishyigikiwe byuzuye n\u2019Ishyirahamwe Mpuzamahanga ry\u2019Ubuhanzi bw\u2019Intambara zomu Maguru (IMMAF) kandikaba ifitanye isano n\u2019Ishyirahamwe Mpuzamahanga ry\u2019Ubuhanzi bw\u2019Intambara zo mu Maguru (IMMAF). NMMAF ishishikajwe nokumenyekanisha impanozomugace ndetsenoguteza imbere ubuhanzi bw\u2019intambara bwo mu maguru muri Nijeriya. Uwatorewe kuyobora iri shyirahamwe numukinnyi wa karate kurwego rw\u2019igihugu nokurwego mpuzamahanga, AMB. Sensei Henry George. Umuyobozi wa tekiniki akaba na Perezida w\u2019umuryango wa tekiniki ni Shihan (Pharm) Victor Akhimien (Vicamen) wa 7th Dan, Perezida wa Karate w\u2019Umushito Ryu wo muri Nijeriya."}
{"id": "22049", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22049", "title": "Nigerian Table Tennis Federation", "text": "Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umukino wa Tennis yokumeza muri Nijeriya (NTTF) niryoshyirahamwe rishinzwe iterambere no guteza imberumukino wa Tennis yokumeza muri Nijeriya. Rigenzura imitunganyirize n\u2019imicungire y\u2019ikipe y\u2019igihugu ya Tennis yokumeza mumarushanwa yomugihugu no mu mahanga. NTTF yemewe n\u2019Ishyirahamwe Mpuzamahanga ry\u2019Umukino wa Tennis yo ku meza (ITTF). Perezida wa NTTF ubu ni Ishaku Tikon. \nAmateka.\nIshyirahamwe rya tenisi yokumeza rya Nijeriya ryashinzwe mu 1951 na Jack W. Farnsworth, icyicaro gikuru cyaryo kirimuri leta ya Lagos. "}
{"id": "22050", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22050", "title": "Sitade y'Umujyi wa Oghara", "text": "Sitade ya Oghara Township ni sitade ikoreshwa muburyo bwinshi i Oghara, muri Nijeriya. Ubu ikoreshwa cyane cyane mu mikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi yakiriye amwe mumarushanwa ya nyuma ya Shampiyona y'Umupira w'Amaguru w'Abagore yomu 2006. Sitade ifitubushobozi bwo kwakirabantu 8.000. Sitade yabereye nk'ahantu hagenewe by'agateganyo amakipe ya Bayelsa Ocean Boys FC na Bayelsa United FC. "}
{"id": "22051", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22051", "title": "Isiganwa ry'umuhanda wa Okpekpe", "text": "Isiganwa rya Okpekpe road ni irushanwa ngarukamwaka ribera muri Leta ya Edo, muri Nijeriya. Nisiganwa rya kilometero 10 kumisozi n'imihanda ya kaburimbo, ritangirira kuri Apana Road rirangirira mu mujyi wa Okpekpe. Iri siganwa ryomu 2018 ryahuje abitabiriye baturutse muri Kenya, Eritrea, Etiyopiya, Uganda, Maroc, Isiraheli, Bahrain, Maroc na Nijeriya. Umunyakenya Kibet Alex yegukanye icyiciro cy'abagabo mwisiganwa ryomu 2018, arangiza iminota 29 n'amasegonda 46. Simon Chepat yabaye uwakabiri, arangiziminota 30 n'amasegonda 29, naho Ronoh Timothy aba uwagatatu, arangiziminota 30 n'amasegonda 39. Yani Dera Dida yegukanye icyiciro cy'abagore. \nIshyirahamwe Mpuzamahanga ry\u2019Imikino y\u2019Amahirwe (IAAF) ryahawizina rya feza ry\u2019isiganwa mpuzamahanga rya Okpekpe rya kilometero 10. "}
{"id": "22052", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22052", "title": "Ikibuga cya Kera cya Parade", "text": "Ikibuga cya Old Parade ni sitade iri mu Karere ka Garki muri Abuja, muri Nijeriya. Yubatswe mu ntangiriro za 1980, ubikoreshwa cyane cyane mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi ni sitade y'amakipe atandukanye yo mu Murwa Mukuru wa Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika, harimo Abuja FC n'Urukiko rw'Ubujurire. Iyisitade ifite ubushobozi bwokwakira abantu bagera ku 5.000."}
{"id": "22053", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22053", "title": "Sitade ya Onikan", "text": "Ikibuga cya Mobolaji Johnson, cyahozekizwi nka Sitade ya Onikan, nisitade ifitintego nyinshi i Lagos, Nijeriya Ubikoreshwa mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi nisitade y'ikipe ya 1472 FC, First Bank FC, Ikorodu City FC, Inter Lagos, Julius Berger FC, Prince Kazeem Eleku FC, Smart City FC, Sporting Lagos, Stationery Stores FC na Valiant FC. \nIkibuga cya Mobolaji Johnson Arena gifitubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 10.000 kandi nicyocya kera cyane muri Nijeriya. Ikibuga cyambere cyubatswe mu 1930, giherereye mumajyepfo y'uburasirazuba bw'ikirwa cya Lagos hafi ya Tafewa Balewa Square, maze cyitiriwe Umwami George V nyuma y'imyaka itandatu. Hagati ya 1963 na 1973, cyajekumenyekana nka Sitade y'Umujyi wa Lagos. Sitade ya Onikan iriho ubuyaravuguruwe yongera gufungurwa kubera ibikorwa by'umupira w'amaguru n'umuco mumyaka ya 1980. Muri Werurwe 2008, sitade yabujijwe gukoreshwa mugihe cyose cy'umwaka usigaye na shampiyona y'umupira w'amaguru ya Nijeriya ubwo ishyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru rya Nijeriya ryateraga abakinnyi benshi ba Warri Wolves nyuma yo kunganya na First Bank nta gitego. \nMu 2019, yahinduriwizina na guverinoma ya leta ya Lagos, kuva kuri sitade ya Onikan kugera kuri Mobolaji Johnson Arena. \nKwitariki ya 1 Ukwakira 2025, kumunsi w\u2019ubwigenge bwa Nijeriya, Amir Khan Promotions yakoze irushanwa ry\u2019iteramakofe kuriyisitade. Ryari riyobowe na Marcus Browne na Brandon Glanton, kandi ryariririmo abandibakinnyi bazwicyane ba teramakofe. \nAmasano yo hanze.\n&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Coordinates/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;6\u00b026\u203233\u2033N 3\u00b024\u20328\u2033E\ufeff / \ufeff6.44250\u00b0N 3.40222\u00b0E\ufeff / 6.44250; 3.40222"}
{"id": "22054", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22054", "title": "Sitade ya Oshogbo", "text": "Sitade ya Osogbo Township nisitade ikoreshwa muburyobwinshi i Osogbo, muri Leta ya Osun, muri Nijeriya. Ubikoreshwa cyane cyane mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi nisitade ya Prime FC na Ila Orangun FC. Iyisitade ifitubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 20.000.\nAmateka.\nIshyirahamwe ry\u2019Umupira w\u2019Amaguru ry\u2019Abagore muri Nijeriya (NWFL) ryabujije Sitade ya Oshogbo kwakira imikino iyariyoyose ya shampiyona kuya 6 Ukuboza 2021. Sitade yemejwe na Guverinoma kwigomba kuvugururwa muri Mutarama 2022. \nMuri Gashyantare 2024, sitade yarafunzwe kugirango hakorwubusitani murwego rwokwitegura igice cya kabiri cya NNL. Yafunguwe muri Werurwe 2024. \nImikoreshereze.\nIkibuga gikoreshwa cyane cyane mumupira w'amaguru"}
{"id": "22055", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22055", "title": "Sitade mpuzamahanga ya Otunba Dipo Dina", "text": "Sitade Mpuzamahanga ya Otunba Dipo Dina, yahoze yitwa Sitade ya Gateway, ni sitade ikoreshwa muburyo bwinshi i Ijebu-Ode, muri Nijeriya. Ubikoreshwa cyane cyane mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi nikibuga cya Atlantic Business FC.\nMberey\u2019ukobimukira kuri sitade yabo i Sagamu, niho FC Ebedei yakiniraga. \nMugihembwe cya shampiyonay\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru ya Nigeria cya 2024-25, Sunshine Stars FC yimukiyeyo by\u2019agateganyo mugihe ikibuga cyabocya Ondo State cyarikiri kuvugururwa. \nIyi sitade ifitubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 20.000. Yavuguruwekubera imikino y'igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cy'abatarengeje imyaka 17 mu 2009.\nIyisitade yahinduriwe izina mu 2011 ikurikije izina rya Otunba Dipo Dina, umukandida wa politiki wishwe. \nAmasano yo hanze.\n&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Coordinates/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;6\u00b049\u203215\u2033N 3\u00b055\u203213\u2033E\ufeff / \ufeff6.82083\u00b0N 3.92028\u00b0E\ufeff / 6.82083; 3.92028"}
{"id": "22056", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22056", "title": "Sitade ya Pantami", "text": "Sitade ya Pantami ni sitade ifitubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 12,000, ikabirimu karere ka Pantami muri Gombe,\nLeta ya Gombe, muri Nijeriya. Ikoreshwa cyane cyane mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru ariko nanone mu birori bya leta n'iby'igihugu, nkomubirori by'idini, politiki n'imiberehomyiza y'abaturage. Ni sitade yemewe ya Gombe United FC na Doma United FC kandi yafashwe nk'imwe mumakipe y'imikino agezweho mugihugu. Yubatswe mu 2010.\nIyinyubako ifitibikoresho bitatu by'ingenzi byakira ikibuga cy'umupira w'amaguru cya sintetike, ikibuga cya tartan cy'imikino ngororamubiri n'ikigo cy'imyitozo ngororamubiri cyubatswe murwego rwogutezimbere nogutezimbere iterambere rya siporo muri iyo leta \nDoma United yitabiriyimikino ya shampiyona y\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru ya Nigeria kuva mu 2023 kugeza 2024, impuzandengo y\u2019abitabiriyimikino yakinwe murugo ni 2,852.\nGahunda ya Siporo.\nKuya 8 Nyakanga 2023, gahunda y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri hagati y\u2019amashuri abanza yabereye kuri sitade, yitabiriwe n\u2019abanyeshuri 1.000 bomumashuri abanza. \nAmasano yo hanze.\n&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Coordinates/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;10\u00b016\u203235.5\u2033N 11\u00b010\u20326.5\u2033E\ufeff / \ufeff10.276528\u00b0N 11.168472\u00b0E\ufeff / 10.276528; 11.168472"}
{"id": "22057", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22057", "title": "Sitade ya Pillars", "text": "Sitade ya Pillars yashinzwe mu 1949 ni sitade ifitintego nyinshi mugace ka Sabon Gari, Kano, muri Leta ya Kano, muri Nijeriya. Ahwiherereye nimumasangano ya Abuja Road na Airport Road. Ubu ikoreshwa cyane cyane mu mikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi ni imwemuri sitade ebyiri zikoreshwa na Kano Pillars FC, indi ikaba ari Sitade ya Sani Abacha. Iyi sitade ifitubushobozi bwo kwakira abantu 10.000. Mu 2014 yabaye ikiraro cy'agateganyo cya El-Kanemi Warriors nyuma y'aho iwabo wa Maiduguri hafatwaga nk'aho harumutekano muke kumikino."}
{"id": "22058", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22058", "title": "Sitade ya Potiskum", "text": "Sitade ya Potiskum ni sitade iri i Potiskum, muri Nijeriya, ikabikibuga cya Yobe Desert Stars FC yomuri shampiyona y'igihugu ya Nijeriya. Sitade ifitubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 2.000. "}
{"id": "22059", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22059", "title": "Sitade ya Ranchers Bees", "text": "Ikibuga cya Ranchers Bees (cyahoze ari Sitade ya Kaduna Township) nikibuga gifitintego nyinshi i Kaduna, muri Nijeriya. Ubugikoreshwa cyane cyane mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi ni sitade y'ikipe ya Ranchers Bees Football Club (cyahoze ari Aruwa Boys) na Kaduna United Football Club. Kada City FC ikoresha Sitade ya Ranchers Bees mumikino y'urugo muri NPFL. [\"Icyitonderwa kirakenewe\"]\nSitade ifitubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 10.000. \nAmareferensi.\n&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Coordinates/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;10\u00b031\u203214\u2033N 7\u00b026\u203220\u2033E\ufeff / \ufeff10.52056\u00b0N 7.43889\u00b0E\ufeff / 10.52056; 7.43889"}
{"id": "22060", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22060", "title": "Sitade ya Remo Stars", "text": "Sitade ya Remo Stars nisitade y'umupira w'amaguru i Ikenne, muri Nijeriya. Ubikoreshwa cyane cyane mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi nisitade ya Remo Stars yo muri shampiyona y'umupira w'amaguru ya Nigeria na Beyond Limits FA. Iyi sitade ifiteubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 5.000. \nSitade yafunguwe mu 2020 kandi yakiriyumukino wayo wambere wa shampiyona mu 2021. "}
{"id": "22061", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22061", "title": "Sitade ya Rwang Pam", "text": "Ikibuga cya Rwang Pam Township ni sitade ikoreshwamuburyo bwinshi i Jos, muri Nijeriya. Ikoreshwa cyane cyane mu mikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi nisitade y'amakipe ya Jos Plateau United, Pepsi FA na Mighty Jets FC. Ninayo sitade y'ikibuga cya JUTH FC yahozeho. Iyisitade ifitubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 15.000. \n&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Coordinates/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;9\u00b057\u20325\u2033N 8\u00b051\u203259\u2033E\ufeff / \ufeff9.95139\u00b0N 8.86639\u00b0E\ufeff / 9.95139; 8.86639\nAho biherereye.\nSitade ya Rwang Pam Township iherereye ku muhanda wa Ibrahim Dasuki, hafi ya Zaria Bypass, Jos, muri Nijeriya.\nUbwikorezi.\nUburyo bwo gutwara abantu buboneka kugira ngo umuntu agere kuri sitade burimo imodoka, bisi n'amagare.\nImikoreshereze.\nIkibuga ubu gikoreshwa cyane cyane mu mikino y'umupira w'amaguru. Mbere cyakoreshwaga no mu mikino yo ku kibuga."}
{"id": "22062", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22062", "title": "Sitade y'imikino ya Samson Siasia", "text": "Sitade ya Siporo ya Samson Siasia ni sitade ikoreshwa muburyobwinshi iherereye mumujyi wa Yenagoa muri Nijeriya. Ubikoreshwa cyane cyane mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi ni sitade y'iwabo ya Ocean Boys FC na Bayelsa United. [\"Bikenewe\"] Sitade ifite ubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 5.000. Mbere ya 2009, yari izwi nka Sitade ya Yenagoa Township. Yongeye kwegurirwa Imana mu 2009, yitiriwe Samson Siasia. Samson Siasia ni umukinnyi wahoze ari Umunya-Nigeria umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru watojamakipe menshi kandi yatsinze byinshi. ya Samson Siasia niyo sitade yambere y\u2019ubusitani bw\u2019ubusitani bw\u2019ubusitani bw\u2019ubusitani bw\u2019ubusitani bw\u2019ubusitani bw\u2019ubusitani bw\u2019ubusitani bw\u2019ubusitani bw\u2019ubusitani bw\u2019ubusitani bwubatswe na Monimichelle Sports Facility Construction and Development Ltd. "}
{"id": "22063", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22063", "title": "Sitade ya Sani Abacha", "text": "Sitade ya Sani Abacha ni sitade ifitintego nyinshi i Kano, muri Leta ya Kano, muri Nijeriya. Ikoreshwa cyane cyane mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru n'imikino ngororamubiri. Sitade niyikipe ya Kano Pillars FC, ikipe ya Nigeria Professional Football League (NPFL). Sitade ifitubushobozi bwo kwakira abantu 16.000 kandi yitiriwe Jenerali Sani Abacha, wahoze arumukuru w'ingabo witabye Imana.\nIyi sitade yakiriyamarushanwa mpuzamahanga mensharimo igikombe cy'Afurika cyomu 2000 n'igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cy'abatarengeje imyaka 17 cyo mu 2009.\nMumwaka wa shampiyona wa NPFL wa 2017, Kano Pillars yitabiriye imikino yomurugo igera ku 10.000, ikaba ariyomyinshi kurusha izindi zose zabayeho muri shampiyona ya Nijeriya."}
{"id": "22064", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22064", "title": "Sitade ya Sapele", "text": "Sitade ya Sapele Township ni sitade ikoreshwa muburyo bwinshi i Sapele, muri Nijeriya. Ikoreshwa cyane cyane mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru n'imikino ngororamubiri. Nisitade y'agateganyo ya Bayelsa United FC. Sitade ifitubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 10.000. Amaherezo yarangiye mu 2013 nyuma y'imyaka myinshi yo gutinda.\nAho biherereye.\nSitade ya Sapele iherereye kumuhanda wa Market, Sapele"}
{"id": "22065", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22065", "title": "Sitade y'Urwibutso rwa Sardauna", "text": "Sitade yokwibuka Sardauna ni sitade ikoreshwa muburyobwinshi i Gusau, muri Leta ya Zamfara, muri Nijeriya. Ubu ikoreshwa cyane cyane mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi nisitade y'ikipe ya Zamfara United FC yomuri shampiyona ya Nijeriya. Iyi sitade ifitubushobozi bwo kwakira abantu 5.000. \nUbwo Katsina United FC yongeraga gushingwa mu 2009, yakinnye igice cyambere cy'umwaka wayo wambere kuri sitade ya Sardauna mbereyokwimukira kuri sitade nshya ya Muhammadu Dikko i Katsina.\nAmareferensi.\n&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Coordinates/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;12\u00b009\u203251\u2033N 6\u00b040\u203206\u2033E\ufeff / \ufeff12.16417\u00b0N 6.66833\u00b0E\ufeff / 12.16417; 6.66833"}
{"id": "22066", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22066", "title": "Sitade ya Sharks", "text": "Sitade ya Sharks nisitade ikoreshwa muburyo bwinshi i Port Harcourt, muri Nijeriya. Igice cy'ikigo cy'imikino cya Alfred Diete-Spiff Rivers State, gikoreshwa cyane cyane mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru. Cyari sitade ya Sharks FC mbereyukwiyokipe ihuzwa na Dolphins FC mu 2016 igakora Rivers United FC. Sitade ifitubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 5.000."}
{"id": "22067", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22067", "title": "Sunshine Queens FC", "text": "Sunshine Queens FC nikipe y'umupira w'amaguru y'abagore muri Nijeriya. Bakina mucyiciro cya mbere cy'umupira w'amaguru w'abagore muri NWFL Premiership. Sitade yabo y'iwabo ni Akure Township Stadium. Iyikipe nimwe mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru ya Ondo State Football Agency. Umutoza mukurubu ni Rafiu Oseni. \nAmateka.\nIyi kipe yashinzwe mu 2005. Yitwa \"Owena Mermaid,\" bigaragara koyaturutse kuruzi ruzwi cyane muri iyo leta. "}
{"id": "22068", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22068", "title": "Ikipe y'igihugu ya Basketball y'abagabo ya Eritrea", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu ya Eritrea ya Basketball ihagarariye Eritrea mumarushanwampuzamahanga. \nIyoborwan'ishyirahamwe ry'umukino wa Basketball rya Eritrea. "}
