{"id": "22072", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22072", "title": "Urugendo rwa Asmara", "text": "Irushanwa rya Asmara Circuit (ryahoze ari Circuit of Asmara) nisiganwa ry'amagare ry'umunsi umweriba burimwaka i Asmara, muri Eritrea kuva mu 2013. Rifite amanota 1.2 kandi niigice cya UCI Africa Tour. "}
