{"id": "22076", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22076", "title": "Sitade ya Denden", "text": "Sitade ya Denden ni sitade ikoreshwa muburyo bwinshi i Asmara, muri Eritrea. Iyi sitade yubatswe mu 1958 n'akarere ka Asmara. Ubu ikoreshwa cyane cyane mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru. Mbere sitade yari ifite ubushobozi bwo kwakira abantu 5.000. Iherutsekuvugururwa ikagera ku myanya 10.000, ibibikaba aribimwe mubyateyimbere."}
{"id": "22077", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22077", "title": "Eritrea mu mikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi ya 2000", "text": "Eritrea yitabiriye imikino Olempike kunshuro yambere mumikino Olempike yomumpeshyi yabereye i Sydney muri Ositaraliya.\nAbarushanwa.\nUrutonde rw'abahatana muriyi mikinorukurikira. "}
{"id": "22078", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22078", "title": "Eritrea mu mikino Olempike", "text": "Eritrea yakinnye bwambere mumikino Olempike yomumpeshyi yabereye i Sydney mu 2000 aho yohereje abakinnyi batatu mu marushanwa yo gusiganwa kumaguru. Mumikino yabereye i Atene mu 2004, Zersenay Tadese yegukanye umudari wambere wa Eritrea ubwo yazaga ku mwanya wa gatatu mu kwiruka metero 10.000 mu bagabo.\nEritrea yakinnye umukino wayo wambere mugihe cy'itumba mumikino Olempike y'itumba yabereye i PyeongChang muri Koreya y'Epfo, aho Shannon-Ogbnai Abeda yahataniye Eritrea mumikino yo gusiganwa kurubura mumisozi miremire. \nKomite Olempike y'Igihugu ya Eritrea yashinzwe mu 1996, yemerwa na Komite Olempike Mpuzamahanga mu 1999."}
{"id": "22079", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22079", "title": "Ikipe ya Tesfa FC", "text": "Tesfa FC ni club yumupira wamaguru ya Eritereya ifiticyicaro i Asmara.\nIyikipe yashinzwe mu 1994 ubu ikinamuri Eritrea Premier League.\nSitade.\nUbikipe ikinira kuri sitade ya Cicero ifite ubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 10000. Umutoza wayo ubuni Mekonnen Zewede."}
{"id": "22080", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22080", "title": "Ikipe ya Red Sea FC", "text": "Ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Red Sea (Tigrinya: \u12ad\u1208\u1265 \u12a9\u12d5\u1236 \u12a5\u130d\u122a \u1240\u12ed\u1215 \u1263\u1215\u122a) ni ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru yabigizumwugaya Eritrea ifite icyicaro i Asmara. Irushanwa muri Eritrea Premier League, ishami rikomeye ry'umupira w'amaguru wa Eritrea. Ifitibikombe 13 bya shampiyona, ni yo kipe yatsinze cyane mugihugu. Red Sea FC ikundagukinimikino yomurugimbere y'abantu amagana.\nAmateka.\nRed Sea FC yashinzwe mu 1945. Nyuma y'igikombe cya Kagame Interclub Cup cyabereye muri Tanzaniya mu 2011, abakinnyi cumi na batatu b'ikipe ntibasubiyiwabo muri Eritrea ahubwo basaba ubuhungiro bwa politiki. \n 1995, 1998, 1999, 2000, 2002, 2005, 2009, 2010, 2011, 2012, 2013, 2014, 2019, 2023\nAmarushanwa mpuzamahanga.\n\"Urutonde rw'ibyavuye mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga ya Red Sea FC nirwo rukurikira. Amanota ya Red Sea FC ni yo yabanje kugaragara.\""}
