{"id": "22085", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22085", "title": "Irushanwa rya Fenkil ryo mu majyaruguru y'inyanja itukura", "text": "Irushanwarya Fenkel Northern Redsea Challenge nisiganwa ry'amagare ribaburimwaka mu Karere k'Inyanja Itukura y'Amajyaruguru, muri Eritrea kuvamu 2013. Ryahawe amanota 2.2 mu 2013 na 1.2 mu 2016. Irisiganwa nigice cya UCI Africa Tour."}
