{"id": "22087", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22087", "title": "FC Edaga Hamus", "text": "\u00a0Ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Edaga Hamus nikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Eritrea ifite icyicaro i Edaga Hamus mukarere ka Asmara. Ikinira muri Shampiyona y'Ubwongereza ya Eritrea. Bakinira muri Sitade ya Cicero, ifitubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 10.000."}
{"id": "22088", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22088", "title": "FC Al Tahrir", "text": "Ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Al Tahrir nikipe y'umupira w'amaguru yomuri Eritrea ifiticyicaro i Asmara.\n 1997, 2007 \n 2008\u00a0\u2013 Icyiciro cya mbere"}
{"id": "22089", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22089", "title": "Komite Olempike y'Igihugu ya Eritrea", "text": "Komite y'igihuguya Olempike ya Eritereya (Tigrinya Kode ya IOC: ERI) ni Komite Olempike y'Igihugu ihagarariye Eritrea. Yashinzwemu 1996 kandi yemewena Komite Olempike Mpuzamahanga mu 1999. \nEritrea yakinnye bwambere mumikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi yabereye i Sydney mu 2000 aho yohereje abakinnyi batatu mu marushanwa yogusiganwa kumaguru. Mumikino yomugihe cy'itumba ya 2018, umukinnyi Shannon-Ogbani Abeda yahagarariye igihugu mumikino yo gusiganwa kurubura. "}
{"id": "22090", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22090", "title": "Igikombe cya Eritrea", "text": "Igikombe cya Eritrea ni cyogikombe cy\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru cyambere cyatsinzwemuri Eritrea.\nAbatsinze.\n\"Icyitonderwa: Abatsinze bazwi gusa nibo bashyizwe ku rutonde.\""}
{"id": "22091", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22091", "title": "Ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore y'umupira w'amaguru ya Eritrea y'abari munsi y'imyaka 20", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore ya Eritrea y'abatarengeje imyaka 20 ihagarariye Eritrea mu marushanwampuzamahanga y'umupira w'amaguru w'abagorebakiribato.\nIkipeyarangije kumwanya wa 5 mu irushanwa rya mbere rya CECAFA ry'abagore batarengeje imyaka 20. "}
{"id": "22092", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22092", "title": "Ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore ya Eritrea", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore ya Eritrea (Tigrinya: \u12a4\u122d\u1275\u122b \u1203\u1308\u122b\u12ca\u1275 \u130b\u1295\u1273 \u12a9\u12d5\u1236 \u12a5\u130d\u122a \u12f0\u1242 \u12a3\u1295\u1235\u1275\u12ee) ni ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore ya Eritrea kandigenzurwa n'Ishyirahamwe ry'Umupira w'Amaguru rya Eritereya (ENFF), urwego ruyobora umupira w'amaguru muri Eritereya. Ntanarimwe ryigezerigera ku mukino wanyuma w'Igikombe cy'Isi cy'Abagore cya FIFA cyangwa Igikombe cy'Afurika cy'Abagore.\nIyobowe na Ghezai Tesfagabir kandikina imikino yayoyambere i Asmara. Kugezam'Ukuboza 2025, Eritrea ntabwo iri ku rutonde rw'abagore ku isi kubera ko imaze amezi arenga 18 idakora. \nIshusho y'ikipe.\nSitade yo mu rugo.\nIkipe y'igihugu y'abagore ya Eritrea irakinira imikino yayoyanyuma kukibuga cya Cicero.\nIbisubizo n'imikino.\nUrutonde rw'ibyavuye mu mikino mu mezi 12 ashize, hamwe n'imikino yose izaza yateganijwe.\nAbakinnyi.\nAbahamagawe vuba aha.\nAbakinnyi bakurikira bahamagawe mu ikipe ya Eritrea mu mezi 12 ashize."}
{"id": "22093", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22093", "title": "Ikipe y'igihugu ya Eritrea y'umupira w'amaguru y'abatarengeje imyaka 20", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu ya Eritrea y'umupiraw'amaguru y'abatarengeje imyaka 20 nikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru y'abatarengeje imyaka 20 yomuri Eritrea."}
{"id": "22094", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22094", "title": "Sitade y'umujyi wa Ughelli", "text": "Sitade ya Ughelli Township nisitade iri i Otovwodo, Ughelli North Local Government Area Delta State. Ubu ikoreshwa cyane cyane mu mikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi nisitade ya Ughelli Rovers Football Club. Iyisitade ifitubushobozi bwokwakirabantu 5.000 kandiyubatswe mu 2002. [\"Ibisobanuro bikenewe\"] Yakiriye imikino ya Shampiyona y'Umupira w'Amaguru w'Abagore yo mu 2006 n'iya Shampiyona ya WAFU y'Abatarengeje imyaka 20 yo mu 2008.\nAmareferensi.\n&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Coordinates/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;5\u00b028\u203252\u2033N 6\u00b01\u203222\u2033E\ufeff / \ufeff5.48111\u00b0N 6.02278\u00b0E\ufeff / 5.48111; 6.02278"}
{"id": "22095", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22095", "title": "Umulisa Joselyne", "text": "Umulisa Joselyne ni umunyarwandakazi w'icyamamare mu mukino wa Tennis, akaba ari n'umutoza w'uwo mukino, akaba ari nawe washinze umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta witwa Tennis Rwanda Children\u2019s Foundation (TRCF). Azwi cyane nk'umwe mu bakinnyi bamaze igihe kirekire mu bakina umukino wa tennis mu Rwanda, aho amaze imyaka irenga 15 ari uwa mbere mu gihugu mu kiciro cy\u2019abagore.\nAmateka.\nUmulisa Joselyne yakuriye mu bihe bigoye nyuma yo kurokoka Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Avuga ko yinjiye mu mukino wa Tennis mu mwaka wa 2002 agira ngo akire ibikomere by\u2019ihungabana rya Jenoside. Siporo yamubereye umuti w\u2019ubuzima bwo mu mutwe n\u2019ubw\u2019umubiri, imufasha gusinzira neza no kwiyakira.\nUretse siporo, Umulisa ni umubyeyi wubatse, akaba abifata nk'ikimenyetso cyo kuvuguruza imyumvire ishaje yavugaga ko abakobwa bakora siporo batabasha kubaka ingo cyangwa kubyara.\nUmwuga wa Tennis.\nUmulisa yigaragaje nk'umukinnyi ukomeye mu Rwanda mu gihe cy'imyaka 18 ishize."}
{"id": "22096", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22096", "title": "Kaminuza ya Lagos Cricket Oval", "text": "Kaminuza ya Lagos Cricket Oval nikibuga cya Cricket, i Akoka, muri Nijeriya. \nMumwaka wa 2020, Visi Chancellor wa Kaminuza Porofeseri Oluwatoyin Ogundipe yakoze umuhango wo guca ivu ryo kongera kubaka ikibuga cya Cricket maze asezeranya kucyubaka ku rwego mpuzamahanga. Ikibuga cyavuguruwe n'abanyeshuri barangije muriryoshuri murwegorwo guha icyubahiro umutoza wabo Porofeseri Adebols Kukoyi warufitimyaka 80 icyogihe. \nMu Ukwakira 2021, ikibuga cyabereyemumukino wahujikipe ya Nijeriya na Sierra Leone, arinawo mukino wa mbere wa T20Is wabereye muri Nijeriya, ndetse n'umukino wa mbere wa T20Is ku ikipe ya Cricket ya Sierra Leone. Uyumukino wahaye amakipe yombi imyiteguro yoguhatanira itike yo gukina igikombe cy'isi cya T20 muri Afurika mu Gushyingo 2021. Uyumukino wagarutse nomu marushanwa amaze igihe kinini hagati y'ibihugu bibiri by'Afurika y'Amajyaruguru y'Uburengerazuba. \nInyandiko.\nMu Ukwakira 2021, mumukino wa gatanu bakinnye na Sierra Leone, Peter Ahoyafashe wicket esheshatu kumanota atanu kugirango afate amanota mezacyane mumukino wa T20I, hamwe no gufata hat-trick, abumukinnyi wambere wa Nijeriya wafashe hat-trick. "}
{"id": "22097", "revid": "17687", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22097", "title": "\u0ca1\u0cbe. \u0cb6\u0ccd\u0cb0\u0cc0. \u0c9a\u0cbf\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0cb0\u0cad\u0cbe\u0ca8\u0cc1 \u0c95\u0cc6 \u0caa\u0cca\u0ca6\u0cc1\u0cb5\u0cbe\u0cb2\u0ccd", "text": "\u0ca1\u0cbe. \u0cb6\u0ccd\u0cb0\u0cc0. \u0c9a\u0cbf\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0cb0\u0cad\u0cbe\u0ca8\u0cc1 \u0c95\u0cc6 \u0caa\u0cca\u0ca6\u0cc1\u0cb5\u0cbe\u0cb2\u0ccd (Dr. Shri Chithrabhanu K Poduval) \u0c85\u0cb5\u0cb0\u0cc1 \u0cad\u0cbe\u0cb0\u0ca4\u0cc0\u0caf \u0c9c\u0ccd\u0caf\u0ccb\u0ca4\u0cbf\u0cb7\u0cbf, \u0c87\u0c82\u0c9f\u0ccd\u0caf\u0cc2\u0c9f\u0cbf\u0cb5\u0ccd \u0c95\u0ca8\u0ccd\u0cb8\u0cb2\u0ccd\u0c9f\u0c82\u0c9f\u0ccd \u0cb9\u0cbe\u0c97\u0cc2 \u0c86\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0cae\u0cc0\u0caf \u0cb8\u0cb2\u0cb9\u0cc6\u0c97\u0cbe\u0cb0\u0cb0\u0cbe\u0c97\u0cbf\u0ca6\u0ccd\u0ca6\u0cbe\u0cb0\u0cc6. \u0c87\u0cb5\u0cb0\u0cc1 \u0c95\u0cc7\u0cb0\u0cb3 \u0cb0\u0cbe\u0c9c\u0ccd\u0caf\u0ca6 \u0c95\u0ca3\u0ccd\u0ca3\u0cc2\u0cb0\u0cc1 \u0c9c\u0cbf\u0cb2\u0ccd\u0cb2\u0cc6\u0caf \u0caa\u0caf\u0ccd\u0caf\u0ca8\u0ccd\u0ca8\u0cc2\u0cb0\u0cc1 \u0ca8\u0c97\u0cb0\u0cb5\u0ca8\u0ccd\u0ca8\u0cc1 \u0c95\u0cc7\u0c82\u0ca6\u0ccd\u0cb0\u0cb5\u0cbe\u0c97\u0cbf\u0cb8\u0cbf\u0c95\u0cca\u0c82\u0ca1\u0cc1 \u0c95\u0cbe\u0cb0\u0ccd\u0caf\u0ca8\u0cbf\u0cb0\u0ccd\u0cb5\u0cb9\u0cbf\u0cb8\u0cc1\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0cbf\u0ca6\u0ccd\u0ca6\u0cbe\u0cb0\u0cc6. \u0cb5\u0cc7\u0ca6 \u0c9c\u0ccd\u0caf\u0ccb\u0ca4\u0cbf\u0cb7\u0ccd\u0caf, \u0c97\u0ccd\u0cb0\u0cb9\u0cb8\u0ccd\u0ca5\u0cbf\u0ca4\u0cbf\u0c97\u0cb3 \u0cb5\u0cbf\u0cb6\u0ccd\u0cb2\u0cc7\u0cb7\u0ca3\u0cc6 \u0cae\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0cc1 \u0c87\u0c82\u0c9f\u0ccd\u0caf\u0cc2\u0c9f\u0cbf\u0cb5\u0ccd (\u0c85\u0c82\u0ca4\u0cb0\u0ccd\u0ca6\u0cc3\u0cb7\u0ccd\u0c9f\u0cbf) \u0c86\u0ca7\u0cbe\u0cb0\u0cbf\u0ca4 \u0cb5\u0cbf\u0ca7\u0cbe\u0ca8\u0c97\u0cb3 \u0cb8\u0c82\u0caf\u0ccb\u0c9c\u0ca8\u0cc6\u0caf \u0cae\u0cc2\u0cb2\u0c95 \u0cad\u0cb5\u0cbf\u0cb7\u0ccd\u0caf\u0cb5\u0cbe\u0ca3\u0cbf \u0ca8\u0cc0\u0ca1\u0cc1\u0cb5 \u0cb6\u0cc8\u0cb2\u0cbf\u0c97\u0cc6 \u0caa\u0cb0\u0cbf\u0c9a\u0cbf\u0ca4\u0cb0\u0cbe\u0c97\u0cbf\u0ca6\u0ccd\u0ca6\u0cbe\u0cb0\u0cc6.\n\u0caa\u0ccd\u0cb0\u0cbe\u0cb0\u0c82\u0cad\u0cbf\u0c95 \u0c9c\u0cc0\u0cb5\u0ca8 \u0cae\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0cc1 \u0cb6\u0cbf\u0c95\u0ccd\u0cb7\u0ca3.\n\u0c9a\u0cbf\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0cb0\u0cad\u0cbe\u0ca8\u0cc1 \u0c85\u0cb5\u0cb0\u0cc1 \u0caa\u0caf\u0ccd\u0caf\u0ca8\u0ccd\u0ca8\u0cc2\u0cb0\u0cbf\u0ca8\u0cb2\u0ccd\u0cb2\u0cbf \u0c86\u0ca7\u0ccd\u0caf\u0cbe\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0cae\u0cbf\u0c95 \u0caa\u0cb0\u0c82\u0caa\u0cb0\u0cc6 \u0cb9\u0cca\u0c82\u0ca6\u0cbf\u0ca6 \u0c95\u0cc1\u0c9f\u0cc1\u0c82\u0cac\u0ca6\u0cb2\u0ccd\u0cb2\u0cbf \u0c9c\u0ca8\u0cbf\u0cb8\u0cbf\u0ca6\u0cb0\u0cc1. \u0cac\u0cbe\u0cb2\u0ccd\u0caf\u0ca6\u0cbf\u0c82\u0ca6\u0cb2\u0cc7 \u0c9c\u0ccd\u0caf\u0ccb\u0ca4\u0cbf\u0cb7\u0ccd\u0caf, \u0cae\u0c82\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0cb0-\u0ca4\u0c82\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0cb0 \u0cb6\u0cbe\u0cb8\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0cb0 \u0cae\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0cc1 \u0cb5\u0cc7\u0ca6\u0cbe\u0ca7\u0ccd\u0caf\u0caf\u0ca8\u0c97\u0cb3\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0ca4 \u0c86\u0cb8\u0c95\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0cbf \u0ca4\u0ccb\u0cb0\u0cbf\u0ca6\u0cb0\u0cc1. \u0c85\u0cb5\u0cb0 \u0c95\u0cc1\u0c9f\u0cc1\u0c82\u0cac\u0ca6 \u0ca7\u0cbe\u0cb0\u0ccd\u0cae\u0cbf\u0c95 \u0cae\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0cc1 \u0cb8\u0cbe\u0c82\u0cb8\u0ccd\u0c95\u0cc3\u0ca4\u0cbf\u0c95 \u0cb9\u0cbf\u0ca8\u0ccd\u0ca8\u0cc6\u0cb2\u0cc6 \u0c85\u0cb5\u0cb0 \u0c9c\u0cc0\u0cb5\u0ca8\u0ca6 \u0ca6\u0cbf\u0c95\u0ccd\u0c95\u0ca8\u0ccd\u0ca8\u0cc1 \u0ca8\u0cbf\u0cb0\u0ccd\u0ca7\u0cb0\u0cbf\u0cb8\u0cbf\u0ca4\u0cc1. \n\u0caa\u0caf\u0ccd\u0caf\u0ca8\u0ccd\u0ca8\u0cc2\u0cb0\u0cc1 \u0caa\u0ccd\u0cb0\u0ca6\u0cc7\u0cb6\u0cb5\u0cc1 \u0caa\u0ccd\u0cb0\u0cb8\u0cbf\u0ca6\u0ccd\u0ca7 \u0cb6\u0ccd\u0cb0\u0cc0 \u0cb8\u0cc1\u0cac\u0ccd\u0cb0\u0cb9\u0ccd\u0cae\u0ca3\u0ccd\u0caf \u0cb8\u0ccd\u0cb5\u0cbe\u0cae\u0cbf \u0ca6\u0cc7\u0cb5\u0cb8\u0ccd\u0ca5\u0cbe\u0ca8, \u0caa\u0caf\u0ccd\u0caf\u0ca8\u0ccd\u0ca8\u0cc2\u0cb0\u0cc1\u0c97\u0cbe\u0c97\u0cbf \u0cb9\u0cc6\u0cb8\u0cb0\u0cc1\u0cb5\u0cbe\u0cb8\u0cbf\u0caf\u0cbe\u0c97\u0cbf\u0ca6\u0cc6. \u0cb8\u0ccd\u0ca5\u0cb3\u0cc0\u0caf \u0ca7\u0cbe\u0cb0\u0ccd\u0cae\u0cbf\u0c95 \u0cb5\u0cbe\u0ca4\u0cbe\u0cb5\u0cb0\u0ca3 \u0cae\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0cc1 \u0cb8\u0c82\u0cb8\u0ccd\u0c95\u0cc3\u0ca4\u0cbf\u0caf \u0caa\u0ccd\u0cb0\u0cad\u0cbe\u0cb5\u0ca6\u0cbf\u0c82\u0ca6 \u0c85\u0cb5\u0cb0\u0cc1 \u0cb5\u0cc7\u0ca6 \u0c9c\u0ccd\u0caf\u0ccb\u0ca4\u0cbf\u0cb7\u0ccd\u0caf\u0ca6\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0ca4 \u0c86\u0c95\u0cb0\u0ccd\u0cb7\u0cbf\u0ca4\u0cb0\u0cbe\u0ca6\u0cb0\u0cc1. \u00a0\n\u0c85\u0cb5\u0cb0\u0cc1 \u0c9c\u0ccd\u0caf\u0ccb\u0ca4\u0cbf\u0cb7\u0ccd\u0caf \u0cae\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0cc1 \u0c86\u0ca7\u0ccd\u0caf\u0cbe\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0cae\u0cbf\u0c95 \u0c85\u0ca7\u0ccd\u0caf\u0caf\u0ca8\u0c97\u0cb3\u0cb2\u0ccd\u0cb2\u0cbf \u0caa\u0cb0\u0c82\u0caa\u0cb0\u0d3e\u0d17\u0d24 \u0cb9\u0cbe\u0c97\u0cc2 \u0cb8\u0ccd\u0cb5\u0caf\u0c82 \u0c85\u0ca7\u0ccd\u0caf\u0caf\u0ca8\u0ca6 \u0cae\u0cc2\u0cb2\u0c95 \u0caa\u0cb0\u0cbf\u0ca3\u0ca4\u0cbf \u0caa\u0ca1\u0cc6\u0ca6\u0cbf\u0ca6\u0ccd\u0ca6\u0cbe\u0cb0\u0cc6 \u0c8e\u0c82\u0ca6\u0cc1 \u0cb5\u0cb0\u0ca6\u0cbf\u0c97\u0cb3\u0cc1 \u0cb8\u0cc2\u0c9a\u0cbf\u0cb8\u0cc1\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0cb5\u0cc6.\n\u0cb5\u0cc3\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0cbf\u0c9c\u0cc0\u0cb5\u0ca8.\n\u0c9a\u0cbf\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0cb0\u0cad\u0cbe\u0ca8\u0cc1 \u0c85\u0cb5\u0cb0\u0cc1 \u0c87\u0c82\u0c9f\u0ccd\u0caf\u0cc2\u0c9f\u0cbf\u0cb5\u0ccd \u0c85\u0cb0\u0cbf\u0cb5\u0cc1 \u0cae\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0cc1 \u0c97\u0ccd\u0cb0\u0cb9\u0cb8\u0ccd\u0ca5\u0cbf\u0ca4\u0cbf\u0c97\u0cb3 \u0c97\u0ca3\u0cbf\u0ca4\u0cc0\u0caf \u0cb5\u0cbf\u0cb6\u0ccd\u0cb2\u0cc7\u0cb7\u0ca3\u0cc6\u0caf\u0ca8\u0ccd\u0ca8\u0cc1 \u0cb8\u0c82\u0caf\u0ccb\u0c9c\u0cbf\u0cb8\u0cbf \u0cb5\u0ccd\u0caf\u0c95\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0cbf\u0c97\u0cb3 \u0cb5\u0cc8\u0caf\u0c95\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0cbf\u0c95, \u0cb5\u0cc3\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0cbf\u0c9c\u0cc0\u0cb5\u0ca8 \u0cb9\u0cbe\u0c97\u0cc2 \u0cb8\u0cbe\u0cae\u0cbe\u0c9c\u0cbf\u0c95 \u0cb8\u0cae\u0cb8\u0ccd\u0caf\u0cc6\u0c97\u0cb3 \u0cac\u0c97\u0ccd\u0c97\u0cc6 \u0cb8\u0cb2\u0cb9\u0cc6 \u0ca8\u0cc0\u0ca1\u0cc1\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0cbe\u0cb0\u0cc6. \u00a0\n\u0c95\u0cc6\u0cb2\u0cb5\u0cc1 \u0cb5\u0cb0\u0ca6\u0cbf\u0c97\u0cb3 \u0caa\u0ccd\u0cb0\u0c95\u0cbe\u0cb0, \u0cb5\u0cc7\u0ca6 \u0c9c\u0ccd\u0caf\u0ccb\u0ca4\u0cbf\u0cb7\u0ccd\u0caf \u0cb5\u0cbf\u0ca7\u0cbe\u0ca8\u0c97\u0cb3 \u0cae\u0cc2\u0cb2\u0c95 \u0c97\u0ca3\u0ca8\u0cc0\u0caf \u0cae\u0ccc\u0cb2\u0ccd\u0caf\u0ca6 \u0cb5\u0cb8\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0cc1\u0c97\u0cb3 \u0caa\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0cc6\u0c97\u0cc6 \u0c85\u0cb5\u0cb0\u0cc1 \u0cb8\u0cb9\u0cbe\u0caf \u0cae\u0cbe\u0ca1\u0cbf\u0ca6\u0cb0\u0cc6\u0c82\u0ca6\u0cc1 \u0cb9\u0cc7\u0cb3\u0cb2\u0cbe\u0c97\u0cbf\u0ca6\u0cc6.\n\u0cb8\u0cbe\u0cb0\u0ccd\u0cb5\u0c9c\u0ca8\u0cbf\u0c95 \u0c97\u0cae\u0ca8\u0cbe\u0cb0\u0ccd\u0cb9\u0ca4\u0cc6.\n\u0c9a\u0cbf\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0cb0\u0cad\u0cbe\u0ca8\u0cc1 \u0c85\u0cb5\u0cb0\u0cc1 2014 \u0cae\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0cc1 2019\u0cb0 \u0cad\u0cbe\u0cb0\u0ca4\u0ca6 \u0cb2\u0ccb\u0c95\u0cb8\u0cad\u0cbe \u0c9a\u0cc1\u0ca8\u0cbe\u0cb5\u0ca3\u0cc6\u0caf\u0cb2\u0ccd\u0cb2\u0cbf \u0ca8\u0cb0\u0cc7\u0c82\u0ca6\u0ccd\u0cb0 \u0cae\u0ccb\u0ca6\u0cbf \u0c85\u0cb5\u0cb0 \u0c9c\u0caf\u0cb5\u0ca8\u0ccd\u0ca8\u0cc1 \u0cae\u0cc1\u0c82\u0c9a\u0cbf\u0ca4\u0cb5\u0cbe\u0c97\u0cbf \u0cad\u0cb5\u0cbf\u0cb7\u0ccd\u0caf\u0cb5\u0cbe\u0ca3\u0cbf \u0cae\u0cbe\u0ca1\u0cbf\u0cb0\u0cc1\u0cb5\u0cc1\u0ca6\u0cbe\u0c97\u0cbf \u0cb9\u0cc7\u0cb3\u0cb2\u0cbe\u0c97\u0cbf\u0ca6\u0cc6. \u0c88 \u0cb9\u0cbf\u0ca8\u0ccd\u0ca8\u0cc6\u0cb2\u0cc6\u0ca6\u0cb2\u0ccd\u0cb2\u0cbf \"\u0ca6\u0cbf \u0cb5\u0cc0\u0c95\u0ccd\" \u0cae\u0cbe\u0cb8\u0caa\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0cb0\u0cbf\u0c95\u0cc6\u0caf\u0cb2\u0ccd\u0cb2\u0cbf \u0c85\u0cb5\u0cb0 \u0cb8\u0c82\u0ca6\u0cb0\u0ccd\u0cb6\u0ca8 \u0caa\u0ccd\u0cb0\u0c95\u0c9f\u0c97\u0cca\u0c82\u0ca1\u0cbf\u0ca6\u0cc6.\n2019\u0cb0 \u0ca8\u0cb5\u0cc6\u0c82\u0cac\u0cb0\u0ccd 1\u0cb0\u0c82\u0ca6\u0cc1 \u0c85\u0caa\u0cb0\u0cc2\u0caa\u0ca6 \u0c97\u0ccd\u0cb0\u0cb9 \u0caa\u0cb0\u0cbf\u0cb5\u0cb0\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0ca8\u0cc6\u0caf\u0cc1 \u0c9c\u0cbe\u0c97\u0ca4\u0cbf\u0c95 \u0cae\u0c9f\u0ccd\u0c9f\u0ca6\u0cb2\u0ccd\u0cb2\u0cbf \u0c9c\u0cc8\u0cb5\u0cbf\u0c95, \u0cb8\u0cbe\u0cae\u0cbe\u0c9c\u0cbf\u0c95 \u0cae\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0cc1 \u0cb0\u0cbe\u0c9c\u0c95\u0cc0\u0caf \u0c95\u0ccd\u0cb7\u0cc7\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0cb0\u0c97\u0cb3\u0cb2\u0ccd\u0cb2\u0cbf \u0caa\u0cb0\u0cbf\u0ca3\u0cbe\u0cae \u0cac\u0cc0\u0cb0\u0cc1\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0ca6\u0cc6 \u0c8e\u0c82\u0ca6\u0cc1 \u0c85\u0cb5\u0cb0\u0cc1 \u0cb9\u0cc7\u0cb3\u0cbf\u0c95\u0cc6 \u0ca8\u0cc0\u0ca1\u0cbf\u0ca6\u0ccd\u0ca6\u0cb0\u0cc1. \u0ca8\u0c82\u0ca4\u0cb0 \u0c88 \u0cb9\u0cc7\u0cb3\u0cbf\u0c95\u0cc6\u0caf\u0ca8\u0ccd\u0ca8\u0cc1 \u0c95\u0ccb\u0cb5\u0cbf\u0ca1\u0ccd-19 \u0cae\u0cb9\u0cbe\u0cae\u0cbe\u0cb0\u0cbf\u0caf\u0cca\u0c82\u0ca6\u0cbf\u0c97\u0cc6 \u0cb8\u0c82\u0caa\u0cb0\u0ccd\u0c95\u0cbf\u0cb8\u0cb2\u0cbe\u0c97\u0cbf\u0ca6\u0cc6 \u0c8e\u0c82\u0ca6\u0cc1 \u0c95\u0cc6\u0cb2\u0cb5\u0cc1 \u0cb5\u0cb0\u0ca6\u0cbf\u0c97\u0cb3\u0cc1 \u0c89\u0cb2\u0ccd\u0cb2\u0cc7\u0c96\u0cbf\u0cb8\u0cc1\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0cb5\u0cc6. \u00a0\n\u0c85\u0cb5\u0cb0\u0cc1 Malaysia Airlines Flight 370 \u0cae\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0cc1 Indonesia AirAsia Flight 8501 \u0c98\u0c9f\u0ca8\u0cc6\u0c97\u0cb3 \u0c95\u0cc1\u0cb0\u0cbf\u0ca4\u0cc1 \u0cb8\u0cb9 \u0cb8\u0cbe\u0cb0\u0ccd\u0cb5\u0c9c\u0ca8\u0cbf\u0c95 \u0cb9\u0cc7\u0cb3\u0cbf\u0c95\u0cc6\u0c97\u0cb3\u0ca8\u0ccd\u0ca8\u0cc1 \u0ca8\u0cc0\u0ca1\u0cbf\u0ca6\u0ccd\u0ca6\u0cbe\u0cb0\u0cc6.\n\u0cb5\u0cc8\u0caf\u0c95\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0cbf\u0c95 \u0c9c\u0cc0\u0cb5\u0ca8.\n\u0c9a\u0cbf\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0cb0\u0cad\u0cbe\u0ca8\u0cc1 \u0c85\u0cb5\u0cb0\u0cc1 \u0cad\u0cbe\u0cb0\u0ca4 \u0cae\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0cc1 \u0cb5\u0cbf\u0ca6\u0cc7\u0cb6\u0c97\u0cb3\u0cb2\u0ccd\u0cb2\u0cbf \u0cb5\u0ccd\u0caf\u0cbe\u0caa\u0c95\u0cb5\u0cbe\u0c97\u0cbf \u0caa\u0ccd\u0cb0\u0cb5\u0cbe\u0cb8 \u0cae\u0cbe\u0ca1\u0cbf \u0cb9\u0ccb\u0cae, \u0cb9\u0cb5\u0ca8 \u0cb9\u0cbe\u0c97\u0cc2 \u0c86\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0cae\u0cc0\u0caf \u0cb5\u0cbf\u0ca7\u0cbf\u0c97\u0cb3\u0ca8\u0ccd\u0ca8\u0cc1 \u0ca8\u0cc6\u0cb0\u0cb5\u0cc7\u0cb0\u0cbf\u0cb8\u0cc1\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0cbe\u0cb0\u0cc6. \u0cae\u0ca7\u0ccd\u0caf\u0caa\u0ccd\u0cb0\u0cbe\u0c9a\u0ccd\u0caf, \u0caf\u0cc2\u0cb0\u0ccb\u0caa\u0ccd, \u0cb0\u0cb7\u0ccd\u0caf\u0cbe, \u0c9c\u0caa\u0cbe\u0ca8\u0ccd \u0cae\u0ca4\u0ccd\u0ca4\u0cc1 \u0c85\u0cae\u0cc7\u0cb0\u0cbf\u0c95\u0cbe \u0cb8\u0cc7\u0cb0\u0cbf\u0ca6\u0c82\u0ca4\u0cc6 \u0c85\u0ca8\u0cc7\u0c95 \u0ca6\u0cc7\u0cb6\u0c97\u0cb3\u0cb2\u0ccd\u0cb2\u0cbf \u0c85\u0cb5\u0cb0 \u0c95\u0ccd\u0cb2\u0cc8\u0c82\u0c9f\u0ccd\u200c\u0c97\u0cb3\u0cbf\u0ca6\u0ccd\u0ca6\u0cbe\u0cb0\u0cc6. \u00a0\n\u0c85\u0cb5\u0cb0\u0cc1 \u0caa\u0cb0\u0c82\u0caa\u0cb0\u09be\u0997\u09a4 \u0cb5\u0cc7\u0ca6 \u0cb5\u0cbf\u0ca7\u0cbe\u0ca8\u0c97\u0cb3\u0ca8\u0ccd\u0ca8\u0cc1 \u0c86\u0ca7\u0cc1\u0ca8\u0cbf\u0c95 \u0c9c\u0cc0\u0cb5\u0ca8\u0cb6\u0cc8\u0cb2\u0cbf\u0caf \u0cb8\u0cae\u0cb8\u0ccd\u0caf\u0cc6\u0c97\u0cb3\u0cca\u0c82\u0ca6\u0cbf\u0c97\u0cc6 \u0cb8\u0c82\u0caf\u0ccb\u0c9c\u0cbf\u0cb8\u0cbf \u0caa\u0cb0\u0cbf\u0cb9\u0cbe\u0cb0\u0c97\u0cb3\u0ca8\u0ccd\u0ca8\u0cc1 \u0ca8\u0cc0\u0ca1\u0cc1\u0cb5 \u0cb6\u0cc8\u0cb2\u0cbf\u0c97\u0cc6 \u0cb9\u0cc6\u0cb8\u0cb0\u0cc1\u0cb5\u0cbe\u0cb8\u0cbf\u0caf\u0cbe\u0c97\u0cbf\u0ca6\u0ccd\u0ca6\u0cbe\u0cb0\u0cc6."}
{"id": "22098", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22098", "title": "Sitade y'umujyi wa Uyo", "text": "Sitade ya Uyo Township ni sitade ikoreshwa muburyo bwinshiherereye i Uyo, umurwamukuru wa Leta ya Akwa Ibom, muri Nijeriya. Ikoreshwa cyane cyane mu mikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi ni sitade ya Akwa United FC yomuri Shampiyona y'Ubwongereza ya Nijeriya. Nin'ikigo cy'ibikorwa by'imiberehomyiza, umuco, politiki n'amadini. Igitaramo cya Noheli cya Akwa Ibom gikunzwe ngarukamwaka, gitegurwa na Guverinoma ya Leta ya Akwa Ibom, gihora giberakurisitade. Sitade iherereye hafi y'isoko rikomeye mu Mujyi wa Uyo, ryitwa Akpan Andem Market. Sitadifite ubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 5.000.\nImikino myinshi ya shampiyona yomugaceka Uyo n'inama za politiki biberahano. "}
{"id": "22099", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22099", "title": "Sitade ya Warri", "text": "Sitade ya Warri ni sitade ifitintego nyinshi i Warri, muri Nijeriya kumuhanda wa Cemetery. Ubu ikoreshwa cyane cyane mu mikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandinihohasanzwe hacumbitse uwahoze ari ikipe ya Warri Wolves FC. Sitade yakiriyirushanwa ryanyuma rya Shampiyona y'Umupira w'Amaguru w'Abagore yo mu 2006 kandifite ubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 20.000, bose barebwa. Yavuguruwe kugirangihabwe igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cy'abatarengeje imyaka 17 cyo mu 2009.\nIbikoreshompuzamahanga byo gusiganwa ku maguru n'ibibuga byashyizwe murwegorwo gutegura amarushanwa y'imikino y'urubyiruko muri Afurika yomu 2013. Sisitemu yogupima interaya Timetronics Electronic Distance ni yo ya mbere ikoreshwa mu gihugu. "}
{"id": "22100", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22100", "title": "Tennis Rwanda Children\u2019s Foundation (TRCF)", "text": "Tennis Rwanda Children\u2019s Foundation (TRCF) ni umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta ufite icyicaro i Kigali mu Rwanda, ukaba warashinzwe n\u2019umukinnyi wa Tennis w\u2019icyamamare mu Rwanda, Umulisa Joselyne. Intego y\u2019ingenzi y\u2019uyu muryango ni ugukoresha umukino wa Tennis nka gihamya yo guhindura imibereho y\u2019abana baturuka mu miryango itishoboye, haba mu buryo bw\u2019umubiri n\u2019ubw\u2019imyitwarire.\n= Intego n'indangagaciro =\nTRCF igendera ku nkingi enye z\u2019ingenzi: Ubucuti, Imyitwarire myiza mu mikino (Sportsmanship), Kubaha, n\u2019Ubutariganya (Integrity).\nIcyerekezo:.\nGuha amahirwe abana bakeneye ubufasha, cyane cyane abo mu bice bikennye cyane mu Rwanda n\u2019abo mu nkambi z\u2019impunzi, binyuze mu kubigisha Tennis mu nzu z\u2019imikino, ku bibuga by\u2019imikino, n\u2019ahandi hagenewe imyidagaduro.\nIntego:.\nKwigisha abana ubumenyi ngiro bw\u2019ubuzima bakura mu kibuga cya Tennis bakabwifashisha mu buzima bwabo bwa buri munsi.\n= Urutonde rw'inyandiko zifashishijwe ="}
{"id": "22101", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22101", "title": "Sitade ya Yakubu Gowon", "text": "Sitade ya Yakubu Gowon (yahozeari \"Sitade ya Liberation\") ni sitade ifitintego nyinshi irimugace ka Elekahia muri Port Harcourt, muri Nijeriya. Ubikoreshwa cyane cyane mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi ni sitade ya Rivers United FC, yahoze ari Dolphins FC. Sitade ifitubushobozibwo kwakira abantu 16.000. \nMu 2015, ryahinduriwe izina ry\u2019uwahoze arumukuru w\u2019igihugu wa gisirikare, Jenerali Yakubu Gowon. "}
{"id": "22102", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22102", "title": "Kwerera (gukura ikiriyo)", "text": "Umuhango wo Kwerera umuntu witabye imana cyangwa wapfuye(gukura ikiriyo) mu mateka yu Rwanda ntaho byanditse igihe uwo muco watangiriye gusa numwe mihango y'ingenzi mu mibereho yabakurambere bacu bagize kandi nubu ukaba ugikorwa.\nUyu muhango washyiraga iherezo kugihe cy'icyunamo n'ishavu byo guherekeza uwitabye Imana, kumwerera rero byagaruraga umuryango mu buzima busanzwe.\nAbakurambere bacu bizeragako iyo umuntu y'itabaga Imana byaturukaga ku mivumo cyangwa abazimu barakaye, gukura ikiriyo byari uburyo bwo guca uwo muvumo ngo utazakwira mu gihugu cyose cyangwa mu muryango.\nMu mateka umuhango wo Kwerera uwapfuye byakorwaga mu bwiru bukomeye, iyo umwami yabaga yaratanze ibyo bikatwereka ko uyu muco cyangwa uyu muhango umaze imyaka irenga magana inani (800) uriho, kuko abami bakuru bawukoraga.\nUyu muhango ku mugabo ukorwa byibura hashize igihe kitari munsi y'iminsi ine(4) naho umugore ntago byakorwa mbere y'iminsi itatu(3) nyuma yo ku mushyingura.\nKu bantu bazwi cyangwa abategetsi biratinda bategura uwo munsi wo Kwerera uwapfuye, Impamvu nyamukuru ituma habaho kwerera uwapfuye harimo: Kwiyeza kw'umuryango, gusubira mu mirimo n'ibindi."}
{"id": "22103", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22103", "title": "Ntarugera Emmanuel", "text": "Ntarugera Emmanuel, wamamaye cyane ku kabyiniriro ka Gisembe (yavutse mu mwaka wa 1961 \u2013 yicwa muri Kamena 1994), yari umukinnyi w'icyatwa w'umukino wa Basketball mu Rwanda. Azwi cyane nk'inkingi ya mwamba mu ikipe ya Espoir BBC no kuba yarabaye icyitegererezo mu kuzamura impano z'abakiri bato mu myaka ya 1980 na 1990.\n= Ubuzima n'akazi =\nNtarugera yakoraga muri Minisiteri y\u2019Imirimo Rusange (MINITRAP) ariko akabifatanya no gukina umukino wa Basketball. Yari afite indeshyo ya metero ebyiri (2m), ibyatumaga akina mu mwanya wo hagati 'Pivot' (center), aho azwiho kuba yari umukinnyi ugoye guhagarikwa mu kibuga.\nYakinaga mu ikipe ya Espoir BBC, imwe mu makipe akomeye mu mateka ya Basketball y'u Rwanda, aho yafashije iyi kipe kwegukana ibikombe binyuranye, birimo n'irushanwa ryari ryateguwe na Hyundai mu myaka yo hambere.\n= Umurage =\nGisembe ntiyari azwiho gusa ubuhanga mu kibuga, ahubwo n\u2019ubugiraneza no kwicisha bugufi. Amakuru aturuka kubo bakinanye, barimo Ma\u00eetre Munyangabe Pierre na Kabenga De Gaul, amuvuga nk'umuntu wahaga umwanya munini abato, akabigisha umukino wa basketbal kuri Club Rafiki i Nyamirambo nyuma y'akazi.\n= Urupfu rwe =\nMuri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, Gisembe yari mu bakinnyi ba Espoir BBC bagerageje guhungira muri Coll\u00e8ge Saint Andr\u00e9 i Nyamirambo. Nubwo yagerageje kwihisha bitewe n'uko yari azwi cyane, yaje kwicwa muri Kamena 1994 muri Rwezamenyo, ajugunywa mu cyobo. Yishwe afite imyaka 33 y'amavuko.\n= Kwibukwa =\nKugira ngo izina ryiwe n'umurage we bitazazima, nyuma ya Jenoside bagenzi be n'ishyirahamwe rya Basketball mu Rwanda batangije irushanwa ryo kumwibuka ryamenyekanye nka Gisembe Memorial Tournament. Iri rushanwa ryaje kwaguka riba iryo kwibuka abakinnyi, abatoza, n'abakunzi ba Basketball bose bazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\n= Urutonde rw'inyandiko zifashishijwe ="}
{"id": "22104", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22104", "title": "Bitumastic FC", "text": "Bitumastic Football Club, mumagambo make, nikipe y'umupira w'amaguru yomuri Uganda ikomoka i Kampala. Bakina mucyiciro cya kabiri cy'umupira w'amaguru muri Uganda, shampiyona nini ya Uganda.\nMu 1967 ikipeyatsinze irushanwa rya kabiri arinaryo ryanyuma ry\u2019irushanwa ritazwi rya Ugandan Super League. Irushanwa ryemewe ryatangiye mu 1968.\nSitade.\nUbikipe ikinakuri sitade ya Muteesa II ifite ubushobozi bwogukiniraho mu 2020.\n Uwatsinze (1): 1967\n 1967\u00a0\u2013 Icyiciro cy'ibanze"}
{"id": "22105", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22105", "title": "BUL Jinja FC", "text": "BIDCO Uganda Limited Jinja Football Club, na BUL Jinja FC, nikipe y'umupira w'amaguru yo muri Uganda ikomoka i Jinja, mu Karere k'Iburasirazuba bw'igihugu. Iyikipe ifitwe na BIDCO Uganda Limited ifite icyicaro i Jinja. Bakina mucyiciro cyambere cy'umupira w'amaguru muri Uganda, shampiyona y'icyiciro cyambere cya Uganda ndetse banakinira imikino yomurugo muri FUFA Technical Centre i Njeru. \nAmateka.\nIyikipe yashinzwe hagati ya 2006 na 2007 nk'amarushanwa y'ishami rya Bidco Co. agamije inshingano z'ibigo mubijyanye nokwamamaza nokwamamaza Ibicuruzwa bya Bidco, binyuze muri ibyobateje imbere igitekerezo cyokujya mumakipe afitanyisano na Fufa.\nIkipe yakinnye muri FUFA Super League kunshuro yambere mu 2011, irangiza irikumwanya wa cumi na gatatu muricumi n'itandatu muri shampiyona y'uwomwaka w'imikino. \nUbuyobozi.\nUbuyobozi bw'ikipe bwambere bwayobowe na Rupesh, umufana w'umupira w'amaguru, na Rao Kodey warumubitsi w'ikigo akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru. Ubuyobozi buriho ububugizwe n'abayobozi b'ikipe Sankha Chatterjee na Leo Deng Hao, perezida Ronald Barente, Visi Perezida Martin Ocitti, umuyobozi mukuru w'ikipe Joseph Mutaka n'umuyobozi w'ikipe Alex Isabirye.\nSitade.\nKurubu ikipe ikinira kuri sitade ya Kakindu Municipal ifitubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 1,000, aho basangiye n'indi kipe y'umupira w'amaguru, \"Jinja Municipal Council Football Club\". \nAbatoza.\nUmutoza mukuru muri shampiyona ya shampiyona ya Uganda ya 2020/2021 ni Arthur Kyesimira, wigeze kubumukinnyi wo ku ruhande rw'ibumoso mwikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda, \"Uganda Cranes\". Abandibatoza b'ikipe barimo Peter Onen (umutozawungirije), David Kiwanuka (umutoza), na Bright Dhaira (umutozaw'abazamu). "}
{"id": "22106", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22106", "title": "Sitade ya Bunamwaya", "text": "Sitade ya Bunamwaya ni sitade ifitintego nyinshi irimu Mujyi wa Wakiso, muri Uganda. Ubu ikoreshwa cyane cyane mu mikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi niyikibuga cya Bunamwaya SC yo muri Ugandan Super League. Iyi sitade ifitubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 5.000. "}
{"id": "22107", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22107", "title": "Entebbe Cricket Oval", "text": "Entebbe Cricket Oval nikibuga cya cricket, muri Entebbe, muri Uganda. \nMuri Kanama 2021, ikibuga cyabereyemimikino ya 2021-22 Uganda Tri-Nation Series yahuje ikipe ya Uganda hamwe na Kenya na Nijeriya. \nIkibuga cyakiriyimikino 10 ya T20I kugeza ubu, ahwikipe yatsinze imikino itandatu, nahiyakabiri itsinze imikino itatu. Impuzandengo y'amanota yambere namanota 138."}
{"id": "22108", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22108", "title": "FUFA Women Super League", "text": "FUFA Women Super League nimwe mumakipe akomeye y\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru y\u2019abagore mu gihugu cya Uganda, ikabayemejwe n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru rya Uganda.\nMu 2019, shampiyona y\u2019abagore yashyizwe mucyiciro cyakabiri cy\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru w\u2019abagore muri Uganda, FUFA Women Elite League yongeragushyirwa mucyiciro cyakabiri muri shampiyona y\u2019abagore. Igihembwe cyambere cya shampiyona y\u2019abagore yatangiranye n\u2019amakipe 8, cyarangiye muburyobutunguranye muri Gicurasi 2020 kubera icyorezo cya COVID-19. \nAmateka.\nIyi shampiyona niyoyasimbuye shampiyona y\u2019abagore ya Elite, yamaze imyaka itanu. Iyo shampiyona yakinwe mumatsinda y\u2019uturere yakinnye imikino yokwishyura nyumaya shampiyona. Imikino yanyuma ya shampiyona yariyi: \nAbakinnyi batsinze.\nurutonde rw'abatsinze "}
{"id": "22109", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22109", "title": "Jinja North United FC", "text": "Jinja North United FC nikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda ifite icyicaro i Wakitaka / Namulesa Jinja City. Iyi kipe irushanwa muri FUFA Big League, shampiyona y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda yomucyiciro cyakabiri. \nAmateka.\nIyikipe yashinzwe mu 2010 kugira ngihagararire abaturage bomumajyaruguru y'Umujyi wa Jinja n'uturere tuyikikije. Iyikipe yitabira amarushanwa ya FUFA, harimo FUFA Big League n'igikombe cya Uganda Cup. \nMugikombe cya Uganda cya 2021-22, Jinja North United yasezerewe na Maroons FC nyuma yo gutera penaliti nyumayokunganya 1-1 mu gihe cy\u2019amategeko. \nMugihe cy'umwaka wa shampiyona ya FUFA Big League 2023-2024, iyikipe yitabiriye imikino itandukanye harimo n'aho yanganyije na Booma FC igitego 1-1. \nSitade.\nJinja North United ikinirimikino yayo yanyuma kukibuga cya Kyabazinga, giherereye i Bugembe, mu Mujyi wa Jinja. Iyisitade iberamo imikino ya shampiyona n'igikombe, ikabihuriweho n'amakipe menshi y'umupira w'amaguru murakokarere. \nItsinda rya tekiniki (2023- 2024).\nJinja North United FC iyoborwa n'ikipe ya tekiniki n'ubuyobozi ishinzwibikorwa by'umupira w'amaguru noguteza imbere abakinnyi. \nAbakinnyi.\nIkipe y'iyi kipigizwe ahanini n'abakinnyi b'umupira w'amaguru bomuri Uganda, bahuza abakinnyi b'inararibonye n'impano zikiri ntoya bakomoka mumakipe yomu gace batuyemo. "}
{"id": "22110", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22110", "title": "Kitara FC", "text": "Kitara FC, izwikandi nka Kitara Football Club cyangwa The Royals, ni ikipe y\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru y\u2019ababigize umwuga yomuri Uganda ifiticyicaro i Hoima City. Ikina mucyiciro cya mbere cya shampiyona y\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru ya Uganda izwi nk'Uganda Premier League \nAmateka.\nKitara FC yashinzwe mu 2010 n\u2019abaturagebaho i Bunyoro babifashijwemo na Kabalega \nDeo Kasozi niwuyoboye ikipe. Yafashe uyumwanya muri Nyakanga 2022, asimbuye Godfrey Bamwenda, wabaye perezida w\u2019ikipe mugihe cy\u2019imyaka 4 kuvamu 2018. \nSitade.\nKitara FC ikina by'agateganyo imikino yayoya nyuma murugo kuri sitade ya Hoima city. \nAbashyigikiye.\nAbafana ba Kitara FC murirusange bakomoka mukarere ka Bunyoro hamwe n'abandi bafana muri Uganda. \nIkipe.\n\"Guhera mu Ukwakira 2023\"\nKitara FC irimo bamwe mubakinnyi bari muriyokipe. \nIbyubahiro.\nYambitswigikombe cya FUFA Big League 2022/23. \nYambitswigikombe cya Stanbic Uganda Cup 2023/24\nInyandiko.\nYatsinze Kiboga Young FC 1-0 ku ya 21-10-2020 muri FUFA Technical Centre, Njeru byatumye izamurwamuri shampiyona ya Uganda \nYitabiriye shampiyona ya FUFA Big league 2019/2020 \nIgihembwe cya 2020/21\nKitara FC yasezerewe mucyiciro cyambere cya shampiyona ya Uganda ya 2020/21 mbere y'igihe nyuma y'icyorezo cya COVID-19 mur'Uganda, ifitamanota 13 mumikino 27 yakinnye. \n2022/23\nYatsinze Kaaro Karungi FC 1- 0 kumukino wabereyahitwa Kigaaya Primary School Ground. \nIgihembwe cya 2023/24\nKitara FC yinjiye mumwaka mushya w'imikino, Umutoza Mukuru Brian Ssenyondo yegukanye igikombe cya Uganda Cup cya mbere muri Gicurasi 2024 ubwo yatsindaga NEC FC igitego 1-0 kuri Wankulukuku. Igitego cyatsinzwe n'umukinnyi wasimbuye Solomon Okwalinga mu gice cya kabiri kumunota wa 73. Umunyezamu wabo Jamil Kiyemba yatorewe kuba umukinnyi w'agaciro cyane ndetse n'umunyezamu mwiza w'irushanwa ryose ubwo Uganda Cup yizihizaga imyaka 50 imazishinzwe. Gutwara Uganda Cup byabemereye kobazitabira imikino y'ibanze ya CAF Confederation Cup, ahobatangiriye gukina kumugabane w'Afurika. \nBarangije kumwanya wa kane muri shampiyona n'amanota 54 mu mikino 29, bamaze gutsinda imikino 16, banganya imikino 6 ndetse batsindwa imikino 7, bitumabarangiza barimunsi y'ikipe ya SC Villa irikumwanya wambere n'amanota 3 gusa. "}
{"id": "22111", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22111", "title": "Mukunzi Christophe", "text": "Mukunzi Christophe (yavutse mu 1989) ni umukinnyi wa volleyball w\u2019umunyarwanda wabigize umwuga, wamenyekanye cyane nka kapiteni w\u2019ikipe y\u2019igihugu ya volleyball y\u2019u Rwanda ndetse n\u2019uburyo yakinaga asatira anyuze ibumoso. Mukunzi yatangaje ko ahagaritse gukina volleyball nk'uwabigize umwuga ku wa 29 Mutarama 2024, amaze imyaka 18 muri uyu mukino.\n= Amateka yerekeye siporo =\nMukunzi yatangiye kumenyekana muri volleyball mu makipe y\u2019imbere mu gihugu nka Kigali Volleyball Club (KVC) na Gisagara Volleyball Club. Mu mwaka wa 2011, nibwo yatangiye gukina nk\u2019uwabigize umwuga hanze y\u2019u Rwanda (pro), asinyira ikipe ya Tarsana Club yo muri Libya.\nAmakipe yakiniye hanze y'u Rwanda.\nMu rugendo rwe rwamaze imyaka igera ku 13 akina hanze y'u Rwanda, yakiniye amakipe akomeye arimo:\nAmakipe yakiniye mu Rwanda.\nNyuma yo gusoza amasezerano muri Buligariya mu 2017, Mukunzi yagarutse mu Rwanda asinyira ikipe ya Gisagara VC, ayifasha kwegukana igikombe cya shampiyona na \"Carre d\u2019As\". Mu 2019, yinjiye mu ikipe ya REG (Rwanda Energy Group), naho mu mpera z\u2019urugendo rwe yakiniraga ikipe ya Kepler, ari na yo yasezereyemo amaze kuyifasha kurangiza ku mwanya wa kane mu gikombe cy\u2019akarere ka gatanu (CAVB Zone V Club Championship).\n= Inyandiko zifashishijwe ="}
{"id": "22112", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22112", "title": "Kyambogo Cricket Oval", "text": "Ikibuga cya Kyambogo Cricket Oval nikibuga cya cricket kiri i Kampala, muri Uganda. Cyakiriye imikino mwirushanwa rya ICC World Cricket League ryomu 2017, ndetsenomu mikino yanyuma y\u2019akarere mwirushanwa rya 2018-19 ICC World Twenty20 Africa Qualifier muri Gicurasi 2019. \nAgahigo mpuzamahanga.\nTwenty20 International five-wicket houls.\nIkibuga cya T20I cyafashe amanota atanukuri iyi ntsinzi. "}
{"id": "22113", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22113", "title": "Kyetume FC", "text": "Kyetume Football Club nikipe y'umupira w'amaguru i Mukono, mur'Uganda ubikina muri shampiyona y'icyiciro cyambere cya Uganda.\nAmateka.\n2018\u201319.\nHasigaye amezatatu ngo shampiyona ya 2018-19 ya FUFA Big League irangire, Kyetume FC yahayumutoza Allen Kabonge amasezerano y'amezi atatu kugira ngazamurwe muntera. Kabonge azwicyane mugutwara amakipe ane atandukanye yomucyiciro cya kabiri cya Uganda mucyiciro cya mbere. \nKyetume yajekwemererwa kujyamumikino ya nyuma ya FUFA Big League. Robert Ssentongo yatsinze igitego kimwe cyagatatu kuri Kyetume mumikino yanyuma yanyuma ya shampiyona, ikipe yatsinze Kansai Plascon ibitego 4-1, bituma ijyamucyiciro cya mbere cya Uganda kunshuro ya mbere mu mateka yayo. \nKyetume yahayakazi George \"Best\" Nsinga kugira ngwabe umutoza wabo mumwaka w'imikino wa 2019-20. Jackson Mayanja ubuniwe utozamukuru wabo. \nUbutaka.\nKyetume ikinira ahitwa Nakisunga Saaza Ground, ifitubushobozi bugera ku 1.000. "}
{"id": "22114", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22114", "title": "Ikipe ya Lady Doves FC", "text": "Lady Doves FC nikipe y'umupira w'amaguru y'abagore yo muri Uganda yitabira shampiyona y'abagore ya FUFA. Iyikipe ifiteicyicaro mumujyi wa Masindi. \nAmateka.\nLady Doves FC yagiranye ubufatanye kumugaragaro n'ikipe ya Kitara FC yomuri Uganda. Ubu bufatanye bwashyizwe kumugaragaro nyumayogusinya amasezerano y'ubufatanye na perezida wa Kitara FC, Deo Kasozi na Nsingwire Godfrey, ba Lady Doves FC. \nLady Doves FC yegukanye $10000 nyuma yokumwanya wagatatu n'umudari wa bronze mu irushanwa rya mbere rya CAF Women's Champions League ryabereye mumurwa mukuru wa Kenya, Nairobi. \nMu 2022, Lady Doves FC yarangije umukinowayo idatsinzwe n'ikipe ya She Corporate kubitego 5 kubusa kurisitade ya Katusabe i Masindi. "}
{"id": "22115", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22115", "title": "Sitade ya Lugogo", "text": "Sitade ya Lugogo, izwikandi nka Lugogo Cricket Oval, nikibuga cya cricket kiri i Kampala, muri Uganda. Umukino wambere wafashwe amajwi wabereye kukibuga wabaye mu 1957 ubwo Abanya-Kenya Aziya bakinaga na Sunder Cricket Club. Yanamenyekanye cyane nk'ahantu habera ibitaramo byamuzika muri Uganda.\nMuruwo mwaka Uganda yabanje gukoresha ikibuga ubwikipe y'igihugu yakinaga na Sunder Cricket Club. Ikibuga cyakoze umukino wambere w'icyiciro cya mbere ubwikipe ya East African Invitation XI yakinaga na Marylebone Cricket Club mu 1963.\nUndimukino womucyiciro cyambere wakurikiyeho mu 1967 ubwo ikipe y' Afurika y'Iburasirazuba yakinaga n'Abahinde basuraga imikino. Imikino ikurikira yomu cyiciro cyambere yabereye ku kibuga ntiyageze mu 2005, ubw'Uganda yakinaga imikino ibirimuri Intercontinental Cup na Kenya na Namibia. Sitade ya Lugogo niyoyonyine muri Uganda yakoreyemo Cricket yo mu cyiciro cya mbere.\nIkibuga cya cricket gikikije ikibuga cya tennis n'ikibuga cy'umupira w'amaguru arinacyo kiberamo ikipe ya Kampala City Council FC.\nSitaditeganijwe kuvugururwa mu 2024. "}
{"id": "22116", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22116", "title": "Kaminuza ya Makerere WFC", "text": "Kaminuza ya Makerere WFC nikipe y'umupira w'amaguru y'abagore yomuri Uganda yitabira shampiyona y'abagore ya FUFA. Iyikipe ifite icyicaro mumujyi wa Kampala. \nAmateka.\nKaminuza ya Makerere WFC yegukanyigikombe cy'abagore cya FUFA mumwaka wa 2018 - 2019. Yatsinze Lady Doves FC ibitego 2-0 kumukino wanyuma wabereye kuri sitade ya StarTimes Lugogo kuya 8 Kamena 2019. "}
{"id": "22117", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22117", "title": "Masaka Local Council FC", "text": "Masaka Local Council FC, cyangwa Masaka ngufi, ni club yumupirawamaguru ya Uganda kuva Masaka.\nBakina mucyiciro cyambere cy'umupira w'amaguru muri Uganda, Ugandan Super League. \nSitade.\nUbwikipe ikinira kukibuga cy\u2019imyidagaduro cya Masaka gifitubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 1000."}
{"id": "22118", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22118", "title": "Abagore b'ibyamamare mu mateka yu Rwanda", "text": "Bimwe mubigwi n'amateka by'u Rwanda byagiye byubakwa hashingiye kubufatanye bwa bamwe mu bagabo ndetse n'abagore, Abagore bagiye bakora byinshi bitandukanye mubice bitandukanye by'igihugu cyu Rwanda no mu mateka gifite uyumunsi nko mu mitegekere, mu ntambara, no mugucunga umutekano, ubumwe n'ubusugire bw'igihugu. \nImiyoborere.\n1.NYIRATUNGA:uyu Nyiratunga yari umugabe kazi amateka nibigwi by'uyu mugore bitangirira kungoma ya MIBAMBWE III MUTABAZI II SENTABYO.Uyu SENTABYO yatanze ingoma akenyutse akiri muto, yazize icyorezo cy'ubushita bwateye buturutse muri Ndorwa.\nNyuma yitanga rye abiru harimo uwo bitaga RUSAKA wanamurinze baharaniye gukomeza ingoma bayimana kuri GATARABUHURA Wari se wabo wa sentabyo. bityo bimika GAHINDIRO akiri uruhinja buryakoko ingoma iraragwa ntiyibwa.\nGAHINDIRO uyu, mwene sentabyo wa ndabarasa wa Rujugira rwa Mazimpaka wa Gisanura Cya Nyamuheshura ya Semugeshi wa Ndori ya cyamatare cya Gahima ka Mutabazi wa Mukobya mwa Rugwe rwa Bwimba na NYIRATUNGA yazunguye se ingoma y'imikwa mu Ruhango Rwan Mutakara na Nyamagana Nangingare(Ruhango y'ubu).\n2.: Yari umugabekazi wa Yuhi V Musinga. Yagize uruhare rukomeye mu miyobobere mu mpera zikinyejana cya 19.\n3. UWILINGIYIMANA Agathe: Yabaye Ministri w'Intebe wa mbere w'umugore mu Rwanda. Yayoboye guvernoma kuva 1993 kugeza 1994. Yari azwiho guharanira amahoro no guteza imbere uburezi yishwe muri Genocide yakorewe abatutsi 1994. \n4. INYUMBA Aloisea: Ni umwe mu bagore bagize uruhare runini mu kwubaka u Rwanda nyuma ya 1994. Yabaye Minisitiri w'uburinganire n'iterambere ry'umuryango, yagize uruhare mu kwita ku mpunzi n'imfubyi nyuma ya Genocide. Yabaye kandi umuyobozi mu muryango wa RPF.\n5.Rose KABUYE: Ni umwe mu bagore bagize uruhare mu kurwana urugamba rwo kubohora igihugu, yabaye umusirikare muri RPF, yabaye kandi umuyobozi mu biro bya perezida w'u Rwanda.\n6. Jeannette KAGAME: Ni umwe mu bagore bafite uruhare rukomeye mu iterambere n'imibereho myiza y'abaturage bu Rwanda, cyane cyane mu guteza imbere uburezi, ubuzima n'imibereho myiza y'abagore n'urubyiruko.\n7. Louise MUSHIKIWABO\n8. MUKABARISA Donatille\n9. Judith UWIZEYE\n10.NSANZABAGANWA Monique\n11. Clare AKAMANZI\n12. Germaine KAMAYIRESE\n13. Valentine RUGWABIZA\n14. Paula INGABIRE\n15. Soraya Hakuziyaremye\n16.Diane Gashumba\n17. Marie Solange Kayisire\n18.UWAMARIYA Odette\n19.Jeanne d'Arc Mujawamariya\n20. NYIRASAFARI Esperance\n21. Speciose Ayinkamiye\n22. Patricie Uwase\n23.MUKARWEGO Beatha\n24. KANTENGWA Juliana\n25.UWIMANA Consolee\n26.KANTENGWA Angelique\n27. NKUSI Anne Marie\n28.UWERA Pelagie\n29.UWAMARIYA Chantal\n30. NYIRAMATAMA Zaina\n31. Ndangiza Nyirakobwa Fatuma\n32.NYIRAMIRIMO Odette\n33. GAKUBA Anne Marie\n34.NKURIKIYINKA Christine\n35. Belize Kariza\n36. Sandrine Isheja Butera\n37. Alice Umurerwa\n38. Denise Uwimana\n39. Ange Umutoni\n40. Sandra Teta\n41. Gloria Mukamabano\n42. Claudine Uwase\n43. Yvonne Iradukunda\n44. Diane Ntwari\n45. Sonia Rolland\n46. Aline Murekatete\n47. Diane Uwase\n48.Yvette Mutoni\n49.Grace Mbabazi\n50. Claudette Niyomugabo\n51. Chantal Uwineza\n52.Diane Karusisi\n53. Jeannette Uwimana\n54. Yolande Makolo\n55. Aline Gahongayire"}
{"id": "22119", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22119", "title": "Mbarara United FC", "text": "Ikipe ya Mbarara United Football Club yarikipe y'umupira w'amaguru yomuri Uganda iherereye i Mbarara, muKarere ka Mbarara mu Burengerazuba bwa Uganda. Iyikipe yakinnyemuri shampiyona nini ya Uganda mumwaka wa 2009-10 ariko ubunta nyandiko za FUFA zemeza kiyi kipigikora. \nAmateka.\nMbarara United FC yari imwemumakipe 8 yitabiriye shampiyona y\u2019ibanze ya shampiyona y\u2019igihugu ya mbere mu 1968-69, shampiyona ikaba ariyoyari ibanziriza shampiyona ya Ugandan Super League. Iyikipeyavuyemo nyumay\u2019umwaka umwe kurwegorwohejuru arikimaze igihe 6 ikina umupira w\u2019amagurumumyaka 9 mugihe cy\u2019imyaka 40. \nBaherukaga gukina muri Ugandan Super League mumwaka w'imikino wa 2008-09, kandintibari bameze nezakuko barangije kumwanya wa 14 n'amanota 35. Mumwaka wakurikiyeho wa 2009-10 binjiye muri Ugandan Big League, shampiyona nshya ya FUFA yomucyiciro cya kabiri, ariko ntacyo bahinduye muri Rwenzori Group. Umusaruro wabo wanyuma muri shampiyona ni intsinzi yaboyanyuma ya Masaka Municipal Council FC ku bitego 7-1. Iyikipe ntabwo yarikora mu myaka ishize. \nMbarara United FC yaterwaga inkunga n'abanyamuryango b'ikipe ndetse n'Inama Njyanama y'Umujyi wa Mbarara. Kubera ko Mbarara iherereye hafi y'umupaka w'amajyepfo y'uburengerazuba bw'igihugu, ntibitangaje kubonabakinnyi b'abanyekongo basanzwe aribo bakunze kwigarurira ikipeyabo yambere. "}
{"id": "22120", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22120", "title": "Sitade ya Mutesa II", "text": "Sitade ya Mutesa II ni sitade ifitintegonyinshi i Kampala, muri Uganda. Ubwikoreshwa cyane cyane mumikino y'umupira w'amaguru kandi niyikibuga cya Express FC yomuri Ugandan Super League. Iyi sitade ifitubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 20.200. Yitiriwe Mutesa II yo muri Buganda.\nAmareferensi.\n&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Coordinates/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;0\u00b017\u203202\u2033N 32\u00b032\u203254\u2033E\ufeff / \ufeff0.284\u00b0N 32.5483\u00b0E\ufeff / 0.284; 32.5483"}
{"id": "22121", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22121", "title": "Ikigo cy'Igihugu cy'Amasosiyete FC", "text": "National Enterprise Corporation FC yitwa kandi NEC FC, nikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda yashinzwe mu 2017 i Bugolobi, Kampala. Ikinamuri shampiyona y'icyiciro cya mbere cy'Uganda. \nAmateka.\nNEC FC yashinzwe mu 2017, izamurwamuntera ijyamuri FUFA mucyiciro cya 5 mu 2018 iyobowe n'ishyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru rya Nakawa. \nMu 2019, NEC FC yazamutse ijyamuri shampiyona y'akarere ya Kampala ivamucyiciro cya 4, nyumizamurwa ijyamuri FUFA Big League mu 2022 ahoyaje kumwanya wagatatu kurutonde rwa shampiyona bityizamuka muri shampiyona y'icyiciro cyambere cy'Uganda. \nNEC FC yazamutse mur'Uganda Premier League shampiyona ya 2023/24 kunshuro yayoya mbere nyumayo kurangiza kumwanya wagatatu kurutonde rw'amakipe yakinnye muri FUFA Big League n'amanota 57 mu mikino 30 yakinnye, Julius Walugembe yatsinze ibitego 2 hamwe na Marvin Kavuma na Tonny Kiberu batsinze igitego kimwe buriwese bituma batsinda ibitego 4 byose hamwe, byatumyebatsinda kandibakazamuka. \nUmwirondoro w'ikipe\n\"Guhera muri Gashyantare 2026.\" \nSitade.\nNEC FC yakoreshejikibuga cya Coffee i Bugolobi nk'ikibuga cyakirimikino muri shampiyona ya FUFA Big League 2022/23. Kandubwo yazamukaga muri Uganda Premier League, NEC FC ikoresha ikibuga cya MTN Omondi nk'ikibuga cyayo cyogukiniramo. \nIkipe.\n\"Bamwe mu bishyuye kugeza muri Gashyantare 2026\" \nInyandiko.\nAmarushanwa.\nNEC FC yageze mucyiciro cya 64 cya Stanbic Uganda Cup 2022-23 ahoyakinnye na Pajule Lions kukibuga cyayo i Pader mazitsindwa na 1-0 n'uwakiriye. "}
{"id": "22122", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22122", "title": "Nile Breweries FC", "text": "Nile Breweries FC, cyangwa Nile Breweries, nikipe y'umupira w'amaguru yomur'Uganda ikomoka i Jinja, muri Uganda.\nBakina mucyiciro cya kabiri cy'umupira w'amaguru mur'Uganda, shampiyona nini y'Uganda. Mu 1980 ikipeyegukanye igikombe cya Ugandan Super League. "}
{"id": "22123", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22123", "title": "Tooro United FC", "text": "Tooro United FC nikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ikomoka muri Uganda ya Fort Portal ubikinira mu cyiciro cyambere cya Star Times Uganda Premier League. \nAmateka.\nIyikipe yashinzwe mu 2007 yitwa Soana FC, yakinnye kukibuga cya Kavumba i Wakiso. Iyikipe yitiriwikigo cy\u2019ishoramari. \nSoana yazamutse mucyiciro cyakabiri cya Ugandan Super League mu 2013. Bahisebiyubaka ubwobatsindaga imikino ine yambere y'uyu mwaka w'imikino, amaherezo babonumwanya wa gatanu. \nMumwaka wa 2018, Perezida w'ikipe wakomokaga mukarere ka Tooro mur'Uganda, yafashe icyemezo mazeyimurira ikipemuri Fort Portal. \nKuva icyogihe, Smart Obed yagurishije iyikipe kuri Mdm Alice Namatovu, wayoboye iyikipe kuva muri Big League kugeza kuri Star Times Uganda Premier League. Kubuyobozi bushya, iyikipe irimo kuva ku kuba umunyeshuri utarabigize umwuga ijya kukigo cy\u2019imikino cyabigizumwuga. Perezida wa Mdm Alice Namatovu afitigitekerezo cyokuyihinduramo ikipe nyayo y\u2019imikino, imeze nk\u2019iyo kurwego mpuzamahanga. \nSitade.\nIkipe ubikinira kukibuga cy'imikino cya Buhinga gifite ubushobozi bwokwakira abantu 5000 i Fort Portal mukarere k'Iburengerazuba bwa Uganda. "}
{"id": "22124", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22124", "title": "Uganda mu mikino Paralempike yo mu mpeshyi ya 1976", "text": "Uganda yoherejitsinda ry\u2019abahagarariye abandi mumarushanwa ya Paralympic yomu mpeshyi yomu 1976 yabereye i Toronto, muri Ontario, muri Kanada. Igihugucyinjiyemo umukinnyi umwe gusa, wahatanye mumikino ngororamubiri. Ntamudariyatsindiye. \nUganda yitabiriyimikino ya Paralympic, arikontabwo yitabiriye imikino Olempike yomumpeshyi yo mu 1976, kukoyitabiriye imikino yomur'Afurika yokwiyamamaza muri uwomwaka.\nNibwo bwanyuma Uganda yagaragaye muriyi mikino ya Paralympic y'impeshyi mbereya 1996.\nSiporo.\nO. Obadiya niwewenyine wari uhagarariye Uganda, kandi yahatanye mu irushanwa ry\u2019abagabo ryoguterumuhunda (C). Yaje kumwanya wa 15 muri 23, afitemetero 32.18. "}
{"id": "22125", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22125", "title": "Uganda mu mikino Paralempike yo mu mpeshyi ya 1996", "text": "Uganda yoherejitsinda ry\u2019abahagarariye abandi mumarushanwa ya Paralympic yomumpeshyi yo mu 1996 yabereye i Atlanta, muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika. Bityo, icyo gihugu cyagarutse mu mikino ya Paralympic yo mu mpeshyi nyuma y\u2019imyaka makumyabiri kitagaragara. Cyakinjije umukinnyi umwegusa, wahatanye muguterura ibiremereye. Ntabwoyatsindiye umudari. \nGuterura amashanyarazi.\nRichard Bogere, uhagarariy'Uganda wenyine, yahatanye muri 67.5\u00a0ibirori bya kg. Yarangije aruwa 21 (uwanyuma mubarangije irushanwa), afituburemere bwametero 110\u00a0kg. "}
{"id": "22126", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22126", "title": "Ikipe ya Uganda Davis Cup", "text": "Ikipe ya Uganda Davis Cup ihagarariye Uganda mwirushanwa rya tenisi rya Davis Cup kandi iyobowen'ishyirahamwe rya tenisi rya Uganda. Ubu Uganda iri mu irushanwa rya Afurika mu itsinda rya kane. Yarangije neza cyane niya gatanu mwitsinda ryakane mu 1998.\nAmateka.\nUganda yitabiriyimikino yambere ya Davis Cup mu 1997, yitabiriyimikino y\u2019itsinda ryakane ry\u2019i Burayi/Afurika, inarangiza neza kumwanya wa gatanu mwitsinda ryakane mu 1998, ikomeza gukina mu cyiciro cyo hasi (Itsinda ryakane/Afurika) kugira ngo iteze imbere abakinnyi nka John Oduke (umukinnyi wanditse amateka) na Simon Ayella. Nyuma y\u2019imyaka 12 y\u2019ikiruhuko, yagarutse mu 2018, ikomeza kwitabira imikino y\u2019itsinda rya kane ry\u2019Afurika, igamije kuzamurwa muntera no kugirubunararibonye mubakinnyi, nubwoyahanganye n\u2019irushanwa rikomeye mukarere."}
{"id": "22127", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22127", "title": "Ikipe y'igihugu y'abagabo ya Basketball y'abatarengeje imyaka 18 ya Uganda", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu ya Basketball y'abagabo bari munsi y'imyaka 18 ya Uganda izwikandi nka Junior Silverbacks nikipe y'igihugu ya Basketball ya Uganda, iyoborwa n'Ishyirahamwe ry'Umukino wa Basketball ry'Uganda. Ihagarariye igihugu mumarushanwa mpuzamahanga ya Basketball y'abagabo barimunsi y'imyaka 18."}
{"id": "22128", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22128", "title": "Ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda y'umupira w'amaguru y'abatarengeje imyaka 20", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda y'umupira w'amaguru y'abatarengeje imyaka 20 nikipe y'ingimbi y'abatarengeje imyaka 20 mumupira w'amaguru w'igihugu mur'Uganda. Iyikipe igenzurwa n'ishyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru ry'Uganda.\nIyikipe itozwa n'umukinnyi wahoze arumunya Ghana witwa Laryea Kingston, akaba arinawe mutoza w'igihe cyose ushinzwe amakipe y'igihugu y'ingimbi mur'Uganda. \nAgahigo ko guhatana.\nAgahigo k'igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA ku batarengeje imyaka 20.\n1. Imikino ya tombola irimo imikino yo gukubitana yagenwe na penaliti.\nIkipe iriho ubu.\nAbakinnyi bakurikira nibo bahamagawe mu gikombe cya Afurika cy'ibihugu by'abatarengeje imyaka 20 cya 2023."}
{"id": "22129", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22129", "title": "Ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore ya hockey yo mu kibuga muri Uganda", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore ya Uganda ya Hockey ihagarariye Uganda mumarushanwa mpuzamahanga ya Hockey y'abagore kandigenzurwa n'Ishyirahamwe rya Hockey rya Uganda, urwego rushinzwe Hockey yomukibuga muri Uganda. Irikumwanya wa 77 kwisi n'ishyirahamwe mpuzamahanga rya Hockey.\nIterambere ry'imbere mu gihugu n'amashyirahamwe..\nUruhare rw'abagore mumukino wa Hockey mugihugu cya Uganda rwariyongereye mu myaka yashize. Ishyirahamwe ry'abagore rya UHA rihuriweho n'amakipe yohirya nohino mugihugu ahatanira kuri Sitade y'Igihugu ya Hockey i Lugogo, Kampala. Amakipe nka Wananchi, Kampala Hockey Club (KHC Swans) n'andi atwara shampiyona, ashyigikira iterambere ry'impano no gutanga amahirwe yo gutoranya abakinnyi mu gihugu. \nUbwitabire bw'abana bato n'urubyiruko.\nMubikorwa byokubaka inzira y\u2019ikipe y\u2019abagore bakuruharimo kwitabira amarushanwa y\u2019abakiri bato ku mugabane w\u2019Afurika; Urugero, ikipe y\u2019abagore ya Uganda y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 21 yashyizwe ku mugaragaro mu irushanwa ry\u2019igikombe cya Afurika cy\u2019abakiri bato cya 2025 i Windhoek, muri Namibiya ifiticyizere cyokwemererwa gukina igikombe cy\u2019isi cy\u2019abakiri bato cya 2025 i Santiago, muri Chili. \nImiterere y'ikipe.\nAmakipe yatangajwe kwazakina imikino mpuzamahanga arimabakinnyi baturutse mumakipe akomeye yo muri Uganda muri shampiyona y'imbere mu gihugu. Ikipe yo mu 2024 yakiniye Zambezi Hockey Series yari irimo abakinnyi baturutse mumakipe yomukarere nka Weatherhead Hockey Club, Wananchi na KHC Swans bagaragaza impano y'abagore muri hockey mugihugu. "}
{"id": "22130", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22130", "title": "Ikipe y'igihugu ya volleyball y'abagore ya Uganda", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu ya volleyball y'abagore y'Uganda ihagarariye Uganda mumarushanwa mpuzamahanga ya volleyball y'abagore n'imikino ya gicuti."}
{"id": "22131", "revid": "16492", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22131", "title": "Victors FC", "text": "Victors FC yarikipe y'umupira w'amaguru y'igihugu cya Uganda ifiticyicaro i Kampala, yakinnye muri Ugandan Super League kugeza imanuka mu kiciro cya kabiri mu 2012. \nVictors FC yatwayigikombe cy'Uganda kabiri ndetse inagaragara mu gikombe cya CAF Confederations Cup. Murwego rwo kwitwara neza mugikombe cya Confederations, iyi kipe yazigamye $1,500 isaba abasifuzi baturutse muri Tanzaniya ahogusaba Eritrea. \nIyikipe yamanukaga mumwaka wa 2013, inanirwa kwiyandikisha mucyiciro cyakabiri mumwaka wakurikiyeho. \n 2008, 2010."}
{"id": "22132", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22132", "title": "Canyon\u2013SRAM", "text": "Canyon\u2013SRAM zondacrypto ni ikipe y\u2019abagore ikina umukino mu gusiganwa ku magare aho yitabira amarushanwa y\u2019abagore mu gusiganwa ku magare bakorera mu muhanda, nki siganwa ry'isi mu magare mu bagore. Abaterankunga b\u2019iyi kipe ni amagare ya Canyon na SRAM. Imyambaro y\u2019iyi kipe itangwa na Rapha yo mu mujyi wi Londere mu bwongereza. Ronny Lauke ni we washinze ikipe nyuma y\u2019urupfu rw\u2019uwahoze akuriye ikipe ye Velocio SRAM, iyi kipe ikinamo kandi umunyarwandakazi witwa Ingabire Diane. \nAmateka.\nMuri Nzeri 2017, ikipe yatangaje ko yasinyishije amasezerano yakazi na Alice Barnes, hamwe n'umukinnyi w\u2019umudage Lisa Klein, akaba n\u2019umutoza wa Christa Riffel. "}
{"id": "22133", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22133", "title": "Nzayisenga Valantine", "text": "Valantine Nzayisenga (yavutse kuya 15 werurwe muri 2000), akaba ari umukinnyi w'igare akaba ari umunyarwanda, yatsindiye umudari wa zahabu mu irushanwa ry\u2019a banyonga basiganwa n'igihe mu ikipe y\u2019abakiri bato mu irushanwa rya Afurika ryo gusiganwa ku magare ryabereye i Kigali muri 2018. Naho mu irushanwa rya Afurika ryo gusiganwa ku magare ryabereye i Cayiro muri 2021, yatsindiye umudari wa feza mu kunyonga basiganwa n'igihe.\nKu rwego rw'igihugu, yambitswe umudari rya shampiyona y'u Rwanda mu mu gusiganwa ku magare muri 2019."}
{"id": "22134", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22134", "title": "Irakoze Neza Violette", "text": "Irakoze Neza Violette yavutse ku ya 1 mutarama 2001, ni umunyarwandakazi wavukiye mu Rwanda akaba ari umwe mu bagore bazwi mu mukino wa magare, kuko yatangiye gukora siporo siporo y'amagare mu Rwanda akiri ingimbi. \nIbihembo.\nIrakoze Neza Violette yatwaye ibihembo bitandukanye mu rwanda nohanze yarwo, aha twavuga nko muri 2018 yatwaye shampiyona yama gare mu Rwanda mu bagore."}
{"id": "22135", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22135", "title": "Ridley Racing Team", "text": "Ridley Racing Team ni ikipe y'amagare yabigize umwuga ibarizwa ku mugabana w'afurika, ni ikipe ikinamo umukinnyi w'umunyarwandakazi witwa Irakoze Neza Violette."}
{"id": "22136", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22136", "title": "Mwamikazi Jazilla", "text": "Mwamikazi Jazilla ni umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga mu igare akaba ari umunyarwanda ukina mu ikipe ya bato batarengeje imyaka 19, akaba yarafashe nk'umukinnyi uzamuka mu mukino w'igare, akaba azobereye mu gutwara igare ryo mu misozi. \nAmarushanwa.\nMwamikazi Jazilla muri 2023 yegukanye shampiyona ny'afurika mu magare mu batarengeje imyaka 23, mugusiganwa banyhonga igare mu misozi."}
{"id": "22137", "revid": "12672", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22137", "title": "Shampiyona y'icyiciro cya mbere Muri Ghana", "text": "Shampiyona yo ku rwego rwa mbere mu mupira w'amaguru muri Ghana ni Shampiyonaikomeye cyane mu gihugu itegura n'ishyirahamwe ry'umupira wa' ishingwa mu 1958 kugira ngo isimbure shampiyona yahozeho, Gold Coast Club Competition yatangiye kuva mu 1933 kugeza mu 1953\u201354. Kugeza mu gihembwe cya mbere cya 2024, shampiyona yaabaye iya 8 Muri shampiyona zose zikinirwa ku mugabanee W'Afurika na TeamForm.com. \nAsante Kotoko ni yo kipe imaze gutwara ibikombe byinshi bya shampiyona aho ifite ibikombe 25, ikurikirwa na imaze gutwara ibikombe 20. Amakipe atatu ya nyuma buri mwaka amanuka w'imikino, agashyirwa mu mukiciro cya mbere cya.\nMuri yahagaritswe ndetse irahagarikwa bitewe n\u2019icyorezo cya COVID-19 cyabaye muri Ghana, nk\u2019icyatumye imikino y\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru n\u2019amarushanwa hirya no hino ku isi isubikwa cyangwa ihagarikwa.\nItangazamakuru.\nMuri Nzeri 2013, yo muri Afurika y'Epfo yasinye amasezerano n'Ishyirahamwe ry'Umupira w'Amaguru rya Ghana yo kwerekana shampiyona kuri DStv na GOtv. Ku ya 23 Ugushyingo 2016, ikigo cy'itangazamakuru cyo mu Bushinwa gitanga serivisi zo gutangaza filime StarTimes cyabonye uburenganzira bwo gukora televiziyo no gutangaza filime ku mugaragaro, byarangiye mu mpera z'umwaka wa 2023-24, aho raporo nyinshi n'ibiganiro byavugaga ko StarTimes ifitiye GFA miliyoni 1 y'amadolari kandi ko iri mu biganiro byo gushaka andi masezerano mashya. Ariko, raporo zigaragaza ko GTV Sports+, umuyoboro wa siporo w'ikigo cy'itangazamakuru cya leta ya Ghana cyitwa Ghana Broadcasting Corporation, wari wabonye uburenganzira bwo gukwerekana shampiyona ya 2024-25. \nGuhera mu mwaka wa shampiyona ya Ghana Premier League wa 2025/2026, uburenganzira bwo Kwereka shampiyona bwahawe Adesa Production Limited. \nKubona itike yo Kwitabira irishanwa rya CAF.\nUrutonde rw'amakipe azakina shampiyona ya CAF Champions League ya 2025-26 ndetse n'igikombe cya Confederation Cup cya CAF cya 2025-26 Bishingira ku bisubizo biva mu marushanwa ya buri kipe ya CAF kuva mu mwaka wa 2020-21 kugeza mu mwaka wa 2024-25. [\"Icyitonderwa kirakenewe\"]"}
{"id": "22138", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22138", "title": "Ntakirutimana Martha", "text": "Ntakirutimana Martha (yavutse kuya 22 mata 2004) ni umunyarwandakazi akaba ari umukinnnyi w'abigize umwuga mu magare, wagiye ahatana mu bikombe bigiye bitandukanye mu Rwanda no hanze mu mahanga, akaba ari umukinnyi wa Ndabaga Cycling Team.\nAmarushanwa.\nNtakirutimana Marthe niwa wegukanye irushanwa ry'amagare aho basiganwa mu misozi mu bagore mu Rwanda, yabaye uwa mbere mu cyiciro cya kilometero 24, akoresha isaha imwe, iminota 19 n\u2019amasegonda 36."}
{"id": "22139", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22139", "title": "Nyirarukundo Claudette", "text": "Nyirarukundo Claudette (yavutse 1 mutarama 2003) akaba ari umukinyi wabigize umwuga mu magare, akaba ari umunyarwandakazi, yatsinze amarushanwa atandukanye, nkaho yabaye uwatwaye irushanwa rya Musanze Challenge 2025, akaba ariwe wegukanye amanota y\u2019ahatambika n\u2019ahazamuka.\nAmarushanwa.\nNyirarukundo Claudette Nyirarukundo Claudette ni umukinnyi w'igare wa Team Amani akaba abarizwa mu bagore mu bagore, akaba ariwe watwaye irushanwa rya Musanze challenge muri 2025."}
{"id": "22140", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22140", "title": "Iragena Charlotte", "text": "Iragena Charlotte (yavutse 1 mutarama 2003) ni umukinyi w'abigize umwuga mu magare, akaba ari umunyarwandakazi, yatsinze amarushanwa atandukanye, akaba yaakiniye ikipe ya Bugesera Cycling Team mbere yo kwerekeza mu ikipe ya Ndabaga Women Cycling Team.\nAmarushanwa.\nIragena Charlotte muri Kamena 2023, yabaye umukinnyi mwiza mu magare azakuba uwa gatatu muri Shampiyona y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Amagare mu bagore, batarengeje imyaka 18. kandi ku wa 18 Ukwakira 2023, yatwaye kandi Shampiyona y\u2019Abatarengeje imyaka 17 yakinwe imbere mu gihugu cyu Rwanda."}
{"id": "22141", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22141", "title": "Masengesho Yvonne", "text": "Masengesho Yvonne ni umukinnyi ukina umukino w'igareakaba ari umunyarwandakazi utanga icyizere mu batarengeje imyaka 19 mu kunyonga igare. Masengesho akaba akinira ikipe ya Ndabaga Women Cycling Team. \nIbigwi.\nMasengesho Yvonne yegukanye umwanya wa mbere mu ma rushanwa yo kwibuka n'igare ryo kwibuka kushuro ya 2025 mu cyiciro cy'abagore batarengeje imyaka 19. kandi yatwaye umudari wa zahabu mu isiganwa ryo gusiganwa n'igihe muri 2025 mu Rwanda. Muri 2025/2026 yegukanye isiganwa ry'intwari."}
{"id": "22142", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22142", "title": "Uwiringiyimana Liliane", "text": "Uwiringiyimana Liliane (yavutse 1 mutarama 2003) akaba ari umukinyi wabigize umwuga mukino wa magare, akaba ari umunyarwandakazi, yatsinze amarushanwa atandukanye, nkaho yabaye uwitabiriye irushanwa irushanwa rya Shampiyona y'Isi mu Rwanda.\nAmarushanwa yitabiriye.\nUwiringiyimana Liliane yitabiriye irushanwa rya Shampiyona y'Isi mu Rwanda muri 2026 mu cyiciro cy'abagore."}
{"id": "22148", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22148", "title": "Uwase muyango claudine", "text": "Uwase Muyango Claudine ni umunyarwandakazi uzwi kwizina rya Coco wavukiye mu majyepfo y'u Rwanda wavutse mu 19 Werurwe 1997.Muyango kandi afite umugabo n'umwana umwe,yabaye miss photogenic 2019 \nUbuzima bwite.\nMuyango Claudine yaje gukundana n'umukinnyi w'umunyezamu witwa Kimenyi Yves ariwe baje gusezerana mu mategeko taliki 6 Mutarama 2024.Ni umuhango wabereye mu busitani bwa Center Piece buri ku Gisozi,banasezeranywe kandi na Bishop Karemera Emmanuel wo mu itorero rya Living God Church nyuma bakibaruka umwana w'umuhungu witwa Miguel.\nIbyo akora.\nNyuma yirushanwa,Muyango yakomeje kwagura ibikorwa bye mu itangazamakuru no kumbuga nkoranyambaga.Yashyinze ikiganiro cyo kuri Youtube cyitwa Who is My Date?,kigamije kugirana ibiganiro bisanzwe nabandi byisanzuye n'ibyamamare byo m'uRwanda no mu karere."}
{"id": "22151", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22151", "title": "Ubupfumu mu Rwanda", "text": "Ubupfumu mu Rwanda, ni umuco w'abanyarwanda kuva mu Rwanda rwohambere aho wari umuco gakondo, habaga harimo ibintu bitandukanye aha twavuga kuraguza, ubumaji, guhamura, guterekera, byabaga ari uburyo bwabo bwo gusenga, kumenya ibyabaye, ibizaba, ndetse no gukemura ibibazo mu muco w'i Rwanda byafatwaga nko gusenga.\nUbupfumu.\nUbupfumu bwakorwaga n'abantu bitwa abapfumu, bakaba bari kuraguza, bikaba ari ibikorwa byakorwaga n\u2019abanyarwanda bohambere hafi ya bose kuva ku mwami kugeza kubaturage ba giseseka, kugirango icyo bakora cyose bamenye niba bazagira intsinzi cyangwa ihirwe. Kuraguza cyangwa kuragura kw\u2019abanyarwanda ba cyera ntabwo bwari ukuyoba, bitihise ibikorwa by\u2019ubujiji nk\u2019uko benshi babyumva. Cyari igikorwa kigaragaza ko Abanyarwanda bitanga kubikorwa by'imana yabo aho, bifuza kumenya uko bahagaze, kumenya icyerekezo ndetse n'ibindi byose bifuzaga kumenya."}
{"id": "22156", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22156", "title": "Guterekera Mu Rwanda", "text": "Guterekera Mu Rwanda ni umuhango wo mu Rwanda rwohambere aho abakurambere babikoreshaga mu gusaba imbaraga cyangwa inama ku myuka ya ba sekuruza babo babaga batakiriho, babagisha inama, babaza itsinzi,cyangwa ikindi kintu cyose cyerekeranye ibihe byarangiye.\nMu Rwanda.\nUmuhango wo guterekera ubundi ni bumwe mu bwoko bwo guterekera ubwoko bw'ubupfumu n'imyizerere byabakurambere bo mu Rwanda bukubiyemo rwabaga bukubiyemo ibintu byinshi bitandukanye, byenda gusa no kubandwa cyangwa guhamura."}
{"id": "22158", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22158", "title": "Kuraguza mu Rwanda", "text": "Kuraguza mu Rwanda ni bumwe m' uburyo bw'imizerere bwo hambere mu bakurambere bu Rwanda bwabaga ari kureba kure cyangwa se kubona imbaraga zidasanzwe binyuze munzira zizwi za gipfumu. Kuraguza nawo ni umwe mu mico yarangaga abakurambere mu kwambaza.\nUko Baragura.\nKera hariho abapfumu rero bakoresheje ibikoresho bigiye bitandukanye rwose ariko bigaterwa nahantu cyangwa abantu, aha twavuga, haba ari inyama zo mu nda z\u2019inyamaswa cyangwa se n\u2019iz\u2019abantu, cyangwa sebakitegereza neza ukuntu inkoko itora hasi. Hari n\u2019abakoreshaga ibibabi by\u2019icyayi cyangwa imbuto z\u2019ikawa. \nUbu.\nKuraguza ubu muri iki gihe bisa nibyajemo ibintu byinshi bisa naho ari ubutekamutwe cyangwa ubujura, aho muri iki gihe bakoresha wenda amakarita y\u2019ubupfumu, utubumbe tw\u2019ibirahuri byangiye bisigare mu bikoresho by'okubaka n\u2019ibindi kugira ngo bamenye ibizaba ku muntu cyangwa baamenye amakuru atari asazwe azwi."}
{"id": "22159", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22159", "title": "Ubuvuzi bwa gakondo", "text": "Ubuvuzi bwa gakondo cyangwa ubupfumu ni imwe mumihango yarangaga abanyarwanda ba kera, nka bimwe by'abafasha mu kuvura irwara bakaba bari baziko hari ibiti bivura, imizi y'ibiti, uruvange rw'ibyatsi n'ibindi... \nIbikoresho.\nUbuvuzi bwa gakondo bukoresha ibikoresho bigiye bitandukanye ndetse no muburyo butandukanye harimo Kuragura umenye inzitizi mbere yo gukora igikorwa runaka, mu bikoresho harimo inka ku bami, inkoko, inzuzi, amavuta, n\u2019urugimbu, ndetse Byifashishwaga mu gusaba umugeni, gukiza indwara, no kumenya ibizaba, rero ubupfumu cyangwa ubuvuzi bw'a gakondo bemeraga ko bafite impano ivuye ku ba kurambere ba ba sekuruza cyangwa ku Mana y'i Rwanda yabihereye."}
{"id": "22160", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22160", "title": "Abavuzi Gakondo", "text": "Abavuzi Gakondo batandukanye na abapfumu ndetse n'abahanuzi, aba ni abantu bafite ibyo bakora bituma babita ayo mazina bose ntibitwa abapfumu kuko abavuzi bagihanga bamwe bishingikiriza cyangwa bizerera ku miti y'ibyatsi, naho abapfumu bishingikiriza mu ku baragurira inzuzi ndetse n'imbaraga zidasanzwe, Abahanuzi bafite impano yo kubona ibitabonwa na bose.\nAga.\nAGA ni Ihuriro nyarwanda rigizwe n'abanyarwanda ndetse n'abanyarwandakazi ry\u2019abavuzi gakondo babarizwa mu Rwanda, ndetse abavuzi gakondo bakaba ari bamwe mu bemewe mu Rwanda mubufatanya n'abavuzi ba kizungu amagara."}
{"id": "22164", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22164", "title": "ADEPR Rwanda", "text": "ADEPR Rwanda ni rimwe mu ma torero agize Itorero rya ADEPR, nubwo ryatangiye mu Rwanda ariko rikorerA no mubindi bihugu, nka ADEPR Uganda, ADEPR Europe, ADEPR mu bubirigi. \nAmateka.\nItorero rya ADEPR rimaze imyaka 82 rigeze mu Rwanda, aho ryatangiriye muntara y'uburengerazuba, kuri ubu rifte abayoboke basaga miliyoni 3. ADEPR iyoboye na pasiteri umushyumba mu kuru ni Ndayizeye Isa\u00efe hamwe na Rutagarama Eugene umushyumba w'ungirije.\nAbayoboye ADEPR.\nkuri ubu adepr yimitse abapasiteri ba bagore "}
{"id": "22165", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22165", "title": "Ndayizeye Esaie", "text": "Ndayizeye Esaie ni umugabo akaba ari umunyarwanda ari kandi n'Umushumba Mukuru w'Itorero rya Pantekoti mu Rwanda rya ADEPR.\nUmuryango.\nNdayizeye Esaie afite umugore n'abana abahungu n'abakobwa,afite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu bijyanye n'Uburezi, yabaye kandi umuyobozi wa Hope International Rwanda ndetse mbere yaho yari yabaye umuyobozi w'agashami gashinzwe kuzigama no kugurizanya muri uwo muryango.\nUmushumba.\nNdayizeye Esaie akaba yaratorewe kuyobora ADEPR nk'u mushumba Mukuru ku wa 25 Nzeri 2021, muri manda y\u2019imyaka itandatu. Mbere yo gutorwa, yari yabanje kuyobora iri torero mu gihe cy'inzibacyuho kuva mu Ukwakira 2020."}
{"id": "22166", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22166", "title": "Rutagarama Eugene", "text": "Rutagarama Eugene ni Umushumba Mukuru Wungirije mu itorero rya ADEPR, akaba ari umwe mubafasha gushaka amavugurura muri iryo torero.\namashuri.\nRutagarama Eugene Pasiteri Rutagarama Eugene yize amashuri agiye atandukanye aha twavugako afite afite amashuri cyangwa afite icyiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza mu mu bijyanye n'imisoro (Taxation), ndeste icyiciro cya kabili cya kaminuza mu icungamutungo, kandi arimo kwiga amasomo y'ikirenga mu bijyanye n'iyobokamana.\nImirimo yakoze.\nPasiteri Rutagarama Eugene imirimo yakoze muri Leta hari mu kigo cy'igihugu gishinzwe imisoro n'amahoro mu myanya itandukanye irimo kuba umugenzuzi mukuru w'imari n'umuyobozi w'ishami rishinzwe imisoro.\nUmushyumba.\nPasiteri Rutagarama Eugene yabaye umuyobozi wa komite nyobozi ya ADEPR mu mujyi wa Kigali ndetse n'umuyobozi w'inama y'ubuyobozi ya Dove Hotel. ubu ni umuyobozi Wungirije guhera mu mwaka wa 2020 mu gihe cy'inzibacyuho, no mu mwaka wa 2021 atorwa burundu nk'umuyobozi w'ungirije wa ADEPR yungirije Pasiteri Ndayizeye Isaie."}
{"id": "22167", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22167", "title": "Kubandwa mu Rwanda", "text": "kubandwa Imana mu Rwanda ni umuhango wakorwaga n'abakurambere b'u Rwanda ubahuza n'imana yabo, ubundi kubandwa kwari ukugaragaza ikimenyetso cyuko wa buyobotse, aha rero hakabamo imigenzo ihuza abantu n\u2019imana, ndetse bityo ikanahurizamo abanyarwanda mu rukundo n\u2019ubutwererane yabo. Imandwa ni zo zari zishyigikiye idini gakondo ikore neza. \nNku muhango.\nKubandwa bimeze nko kubatizwa muri iki gihe, na byo byari ukugaragaza ubuyoboke mu idini wahisemo. Ni umuhango wakorwaga ugamije kwimakaza ubusabane hamwe n' ubumana n\u2019ubumuntu mu Banyarwanda bohambere, ni umuhango wadutse ku ngoma ya Ruganzu Ndoli, utangizwa ku ngoma y\u2019umuhungu we Mutara Nsoro Semugeshi. Imigenzo isobetse yakorwaga mu muhango wo kubandwa Imana, ni yo yatumaga urushaho gukomera no gushinga imizi mu mitima y\u2019Abanyarwanda."}
{"id": "22169", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22169", "title": "Kunywana mu Rwanda", "text": "Kunywana mu Rwanda ni igihango cyo kunywana, ari byo bakunze kwita guca ku nda, Ni umugenzo wakorwaga n\u2019abantu babiri cyangwa se batatu cyangwa se barenze, byo gushaka kugaragaza ko bazakundana mu bwubahane bakabana neza mu mubano uzira guhemukirana, akaba ari umuhango nshimangira bumwe mu bantu, akaba ari ubudahemuka n\u2019urukundo y\u2019abanyarwanda. \nUko bikorwa.\nKunywana ubundi byari igihango cyangwa se kunywana, buri muntu mu bifuza kunywana amaraso, aha bacagana indasago ku nda, undi agafata amaraso ahavuye akayanywa, n\u2019undi akabigenza atyo, rero mu kunywa ayo maraso hari n'amagambo y\u2019indahiro babwiranaga hagati ya bo, aho bagiraga bati ndahiye imbere y\u2019imana y\u2019i Rwanda ko ntazatatira igihango tugiranye, ningitatira kizansame., usibye no kunywana igihango kw\u2019abanyarwanda hagati ya bo, Umunyarwanda yashoboraga no kukinywera igihugu cye, akiyemeza kugipfira."}
{"id": "22171", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22171", "title": "Guhana Inka", "text": "guhana Inka ni igihango cyo mu muco nyarwanda aho bahana Inka, ni igihango cyaremwe cyera cyane na Gihanga ahasaga mu mwaka yi 1100, ubwo yashyiraga Inka mu bigomba kwifashishwa mu mushinga wo kubaka u Rwanda cyane mu gisata cyari cyerekeye ububanyi n\u2019amahanga. \nIgihango.\nGuhana Inka ni igihango cyo kugabirana Inka kiba hagati y\u2019Umunyarwanda n\u2019Inka, cyangwa se igihugu cye, umunyarwanda mugenzi we, umunyamahanga ukunda u Rwanda n\u2019igihugu cye, Hanyuma umutunzi w\u2019amashyo n\u2019amagana, akaba yayifatiraho agirana igihango n\u2019abandi, Igihango cyo guhana Inka, cyabanzirizwaga n\u2019uko buri Munyarwanda na we agomba guhana igihango n\u2019Inka kugira ngo zimukundire abashe kuzorora zororoke."}
{"id": "22172", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22172", "title": "Guhana abageni", "text": "Guhana abageni ni gihango kirakomeye mu muco no mukwemera kwa banyarwanda, kuko kiva mu miryango ubwayo kigakomereza kuyahanye abageni, kigafata no ku bashyingiranywe ubwabo. rero Kurongorana k\u2019umugore n\u2019umugabo, ni umugenzo uri mu kwemera kwakera cyane aho bidasaza kugeza ku myaka ibihumbi n\u2019ibihumbagiza, kuko gikomereza ku rubyaro rwabo. nimwe bigasabako babanza kuraguza cyangwa bagaterekera ngo bamenyeko indagu zibyemera.\nUmugeni.\numugeni baragurije inzuzi zikamwemera nabo mu muryanho bahita bamwemera, bakabashyigira urugo rugakomera, ndetse nabo bakabyemera batyo ko imana yabo babyemeye."}
{"id": "22173", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22173", "title": "Igihango mu Rwanda", "text": "Igihango nkuko ibitabo bibisobanura mu kinyamakuru Igihe, ni amahame ngengamitekerereze na ngengamigenzereze, ya abakurambere bashyizemo imitsindo yo kubanisha abanyarwanda mu mibereho izira icyasha, Ibyo bihango, abakurambere mpangarwanda bari barabikagiriyemo imbaraga nyinshi zihambaye ku buryo ubirenzeho, bimusama agapfa.\nUbwoko bw'ibihango.\nhari ibihango by\u2019Abanyarwanda, bari bazi neza bigera kuri bitanu, Uwaramukaga arenze ku masezerano yagiranye n\u2019undi, igihango cyaramusamaga agapfa. Ibyo byarushagaho gutuma Abanyarwanda baziririza umugenzo wo guhana igihango, kandi bakanawukunda kuko wabafashaga guhamya ubwizerane hagati yabo."}
{"id": "22174", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22174", "title": "PEREZIDA WA UGANDA", "text": "Museveni yatsindiye manda ya karindwi izageza mu 2031.\nKomisiyo y'amatora ya Uganda yemeje ko Yoweri Museveni yatsinze amatora ya perezida n'amajwi 71% mu gihe uwo bari bahatanye cyane Robert Ssentamu uzwi cyane nka Bobi Wine yagize amajwi 24% naho abandi bakandida batandatu uwaje hafi yagize 1%yonyine\nIbyavuye mu matora yabaye ku wa kane bitangajwe nyuma y'amasaha macye Bobi Wine atangaje amashusho avugamo ko \"ibigiye gutangazwa na Byabakama [perezida wa komisiyo y'amatora atari byo.\nIbyatangajwe bisobanuye ko Yoweri Museveni w'imyaka 81 atorewe manda ya karindwi yikurikiranya nka perezida wa Uganda izatuma aguma ku butegetsi kugeza muri bibiri namirongo itatu(2031).\nIbyavuye mu matora bitangajwe nyuma y'iminsi itanu internet ikuweho muri Uganda.\nInternet yasubijweho muri Uganda hashize amasaha bitangajwe ko Yoweri Museveni yatsinze amatora ya perezida.Internet yari yakuweho na leta ku wa kabiri w'iki cyumweru ivuga ko ari mu rwego rwo kwirinda ikwirakwira ry'amakuru yibihuha cyangwa se atari yo hamwe no kurinda umutekano w'igihugu.\nIshami rya ONU ry'uburenganzira bwa muntu ryamagaye iki gikorwa cyo kuvanaho interinet rivuga ko \"giteye inkeke zikomeye\".\nYari inshuro ya kabiri abategetsi ba Uganda bakuyeho internet mu gihugu mu matora ku mpamvu bavuga ko ari iz'umutekano. Ibi byakozwe bwa mbere mu 2021 bigira ingaruka ku barenga miliyoni 10 bayikoresha.\nBobi Wine n'abo mu ishyaka rye NUP bavuga ko gufunga internet \"bigamije gukora uburiganya mu matora, isi itareba ibirimo kuba\".\nKubera kubura internet mu gihugu byagoye BBC n'ibindi binyamakuru byigenga kugenzura ibyabaye mu matora no kugenzura ibyayavuyemo.\nKomisiyo y'amatora yavuze ko abatoye bose hamwe ari abantu miliyoni 11.3 bangana na 52% by'abari biyandikishije gutora. Iyi komisiyo ivuga ko amajwi agera ku bihumbi 275 yabaye impfabusa, ayo akangana na 2.4%."}
{"id": "22175", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22175", "title": "PEREZIDA WA VENEZUWERA", "text": "Perezida Maduro wa Venezuela yafatiwe mu gitero cy\u2019igisirikare cya Amerika.\nPerezida wa Leta zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, Donald Trump, yatangaje ko Perezida Nicolas Madulo wa Venezuela n\u2019umugore we bafashwe bakajyanwa hanze y\u2019igihugu cyabo aho akaba ari muri America, bikaba byabaye ubwo igisirikare cya Amerika cyagabaga ibitero bikomeye mu murwa mukuru wa Venezuela, Caracas mu ijoro ryakeye ry\u2019uyu wa Gatandatatu tariki 3 Mutarama 2026.\nIbi bitero by\u2019igisirikare cya Amerika byanibasiye ibikorwa bya gisirikare bitandukanye muri Caracas, ndetse no mu zindi Leta za Venezuela zirmo Miranda, La Guaira na Aragua, nk\u2019uko amakuru aturuka muri iki gihugu yabitangaje cya Venezuela.\nIbi bibaye nyuma y\u2019umwuka mubi umaze igihe hagati y\u2019ibihugu byombi, aho Perezida Trump ashinja Maduro kuba ari we uyoboye abari mu ruhererekane rw\u2019abacuruza ibiyobyabwenge, bituruka muri Venezuela byinjira muri Leta zunze Ubumwe za Amerika.\nIbi birego ariko Perezida Maduro arabihakana, ahubwo agashinja Trump gushaka kumuhirika ku butegetsi, kugira ngo yigarurire umutungo kamere uri mu butaka bwa Venezuela, wiganjemo peteroli.\nKu wa Gatatu w\u2019iki cyumweru, na bwo igisirikare cya Amerika cyatangaje ko cyarashe ubwato bwa Venezuela bwari buri mu mazi, aho cyavugaga ko bwari butwaye ibiyobyabwenge, icyo gitero kikaba cyaraguyemo abantu batanu.\nMuri rusange, Amerika imaze kugaba ibitero birenga 30 ku hantu hatandukanye ivuga ko hari ibiyobyabwenge, ibyo bikaba biri mu muganbi mugari wa Trump wiswe \u2018intambara ku biyobyabwenge\u2019, bikaba bimaze kugwamo abantu basaga 110, kuva igitero cya mbere cyagabwa ku bwato bwa Venezuela ku itariki 2 Nzeri 2025, nk\u2019uko BBC yabitangaje.\nIbi bitero kuri Venezuela, byatangiye hari hashize amezi make Leta zunze Ubumwe za Amerika zongereye ibikorwa bya gisirikare mu birwa bya Cara\u00efbes, zikavuga ko ziteguraga guhangana na Leta ya Perezida Maduro, zifata nk\u2019umuyobozi w\u2019igihugu utemewe, ariko kandi zivuga ko ari mu bacuruza ibiyobyabwenge.\nNicolas Maduro yayoboye Venezuela kuva ku itariki 19 Mata 2013, asimbuye Hugo Ch\u00e1vez na we utaracanaga uwaka na Amerika, wari umaze kwitaba Imana ndetse yari anabereye Visi Perezida. Maduro yongeye gutorerwa kuyobora iki gihugu mu 2018 ndetse no mu 2024, aho hose ariko amatora yaranzwe n\u2019umwuka mubi, wanatumye iki gihugu gisubira inyuma mu bukungu nubwo gikize kuri peteroli."}
{"id": "22176", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22176", "title": "Umuhango wo kuragura", "text": "Kuragura mu Rwanda ni umuhango ukorwa n'abapfumu, aho akabukira inzuzi akazitera impagarike, Iyo umupfumu ateye inzuzi zikikaraga ku mbehe, zigahindukiza imitwe zikarebana n'izindi nzovu zo haruguru ziba zeze bikaba ari ubuhoro.\nInzuzi.\nUmupfumu akabukira inzuzi akazitera impagarike maze zabarara zikagwa kure inyuma y'imbehe zikaba ziterereje umuzimu w'umugabo waguye kure. Iyo ziguye zubaraye, zimwe ziteretse hejuru y'izindi ziba zishaka ko uwo mugabo abagirwa inka. Iyo Kanantuku ibaraye ikava ku mbehe, ikagwa i bumoso, iba imuterereje umuzimu w'umukobwa waguye kure y'iwabo, yaba igiye mu rukinga ngo ni umukobwa wapfuye atarongowe yabishakaga. Naho rero iyo kanantuku ibaraye hasi i buryo ikaba imuterereje umuzimu w'umugabo waguye kure. "}
{"id": "22177", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22177", "title": "Imiziririzo mu Rwanda", "text": "Imiziririzo mu Rwanda yariho kuva kera mu bakurambere bu Rwanda aho usanga hari imigenzo bafite bakoraga birinda ibintu rukana ndetse hari imyizerere bishigiye uko bameze ndetse n'umuco gakondo wabo mu buzima bwa buri munsi bwa baturarwanda, aho birinda ibintu runaka ibyago, gusigasira umuco, imibanire, ugasanga wenda nko kurya, kurara, nindi mihango y'ubuzima ari imwe mu myitwarire yabaranganga abakurambere.\nImiziro.\nhari imizoro imiziririzo imwe n'imwe mu Rwanda rwo hambere bari bafite bubahaga kandi bakayigenderaho nko:"}
{"id": "22178", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22178", "title": "Phoebe Kanyange", "text": "Phoebe Kanyange ni umunyapolitiki wo mu Rwanda, ubu akaba ari umwe mu bagize Inteko Ishinga Amategeko y\u2019u Rwanda mu Mutwe w\u2019Abadepite. Muri Nzeri 2016 yasimbuye Christine Mukabunani ku mwanya w\u2019umuvugizi w\u2019Ihuriro ry\u2019Igihugu ry\u2019Imitwe ya Politiki (National Consultative Forum of Political Organisations). \nIbyo yavuze\nHari uduce tumwe na tumwe tudafite amazi n\u2019amashanyarazi. Ibi ni byo nzashyira imbere mu byo nzitaho cyane nintorwa.\nIbyo yakoze\nPhoebe Kanyange yabaye umwe mu bayobozi bakomeye mu Ishyaka PSP (Party for Solidarity and Progress) aho yigeze kuba Perezida waryo. Azwi nk\u2019umunyapolitiki ufite uburambe, wagize uruhare mu guteza imbere imiyoborere n\u2019imikoranire y\u2019imitwe ya politiki mu Rwanda. Yagize uruhare mu biganiro n\u2019ibikorwa by\u2019imitwe ya politiki hagamijwe kubaka demokarasi n\u2019ubwumvikane hagati y\u2019amashyaka. Mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko, yagize uruhare muri komite zitandukanye, zirimo izirebana n\u2019imiyoborere n\u2019uburinganire."}
{"id": "22179", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22179", "title": "Nancy Sibo", "text": "Nancy Sibo ni umunyarwandakazi w\u2019umuhanga mu ikoranabuhanga kandi akaba n\u2019umushoramari mu bikorwa bigamije guteza imbere imibereho myiza y\u2019abaturage, uzwiho guhuza ikoranabuhanga, kurengera ibidukikije no guteza imbere abagore.\nNancy Sibo ufite imyaka 73, yamenyekanye cyane mu mwaka wa 2014, ubwo yari afite imyaka 21. Muri icyo gihe yari umunyeshuri muri Kaminuza y\u2019u Rwanda, yiga ubwubatsi mu by\u2019ubuhinzi (Agriculture Engineering).\nIbyo yize\nNancy Sibo yize ubwubatsi mu by'ubuhinzi (Agriculture Engineering) muri Kaminuza y'u Rwanda.\nUbumenyi yakuye mu mashuri bwagize uruhare rukomeye mu bikorwa bye bijyanye na:\nMu gihe yari akiri mu masomo ye, yatangiye gushishikarira gukoresha ikoranabuhanga mu gukemura ibibazo byugarije abaturage, cyane cyane ibijyanye n\u2019ubuhinzi no gucunga neza ibidukikije\nIbyo yavuze\n\u201cMfite ubushake bukomeye bwo guteza imbere ubumenyi n\u2019ubushobozi bw\u2019abakobwa bagenzi banjye ndetse n\u2019umuryango mugari wacu, cyane cyane mu gushaka ibisubizo ku mbogamizi igihugu cyacu gihura nazo mu rugendo rwo kugera ku iterambere rirambye.\u201d\nUwegukanye irushanwa rya Miss Geek Rwanda (2014).\nNancy Sibo yamenyekanye cyane nyuma yo kwegukana irushanwa rya Miss Geek 2014, irushanwa ryo ku rwego rw'igihugu rishishikariza abakobwa guhanga udushya.\nYatsinze iri rushanwa abikesha agashya yise \"Mobile Cow App\"\nIntego y\u2019iyo porogaramu (app):"}
{"id": "22180", "revid": "17106", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22180", "title": "Ameza", "text": "Ameza ni igikoresho cyo mu rugo.mu muco nyarwanda bamwe baziko ameza ari ayo gufatiraho amafunguro abandi ari ayo gutegura muruganiriro.\nAmeza ni igikoresho cyo mu nzu gikoze ku buryo gifite ubuso busa n\u2019uburinganire hejuru n\u2019amaguru (kenshi ane) kigashyirwaho cyangwa kigakorerwaho ibintu bitandukanye.\nAmeza akoreshwa mu:\nAmashakiro.\nhttps://www.cnsuncha.com/rw/home-accessories-kitchen-tool"}
{"id": "22181", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22181", "title": "Chantal Butare", "text": "Chantal Butare ni umunyarwandakazi w\u2019umushoramari mu buhinzi n\u2019ubworozi uzwi cyane kubera ibikorwa bye byo guteza imbere aborozi n\u2019abagore bo mu cyaro. Yavukiye kandi akurira mu Rwanda, aho yakuriye abona ko ubuhinzi n\u2019ubworozi ari inkingi y\u2019imibereho y\u2019abaturage benshi.Yari afite imyaka 21 mu mwaka wa 2015 igihe yatoranywaga mu rubyiruko rw\u2019abashoramari bato muri Afurika..\nMu gihe yari umunyeshuri muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda, yatangiye gutekereza ku buryo yafasha abaturage bo mu cyaro cyane cyane abagore bahabwa inka muri gahunda ya Girinka ariko bakagira ikibazo cyo kubona amasoko y'amata yabo.\nGutangiza ibikorwa by\u2019iterambere.\nMu 2012, Chantal Butare yashinze Koperative yitwa Kinazi Dairy Cooperative (KIDACO). Iyi koperative yari igamije gufasha aborozi, cyane cyane abagore barokotse Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, kubona amasoko yo kugurishamo amata yabo. \nKoperative ye ikora ibikorwa birimo:\nIki gikorwa cyafashije ibihumbi by\u2019abahinzi n\u2019aborozi kubona amafaranga no guteza imbere imiryango yabo. \nIbihembo n\u2019icyubahiro yahawe.\nKubera ibikorwa bye byo gufasha abaturage, Chantal Butare yatoranyijwe mu rubyiruko rw\u2019abashoramari b\u2019indashyikirwa muri Afurika mu marushanwa ya Anzisha Prize 2015, ahabwa igihembo mu rwego rw\u2019ubuhinzi. Uyu mushinga we wafashije abarenga 3,000 borora kubona amasoko y\u2019amata yabo kandi unatanga akazi ku bantu bakora mu gukusanya amata.\nIbyo yavuze\n\u201cIcyerekezo cyanjye ni ugufasha kurwanya ubukene n\u2019inzara mu bantu batishoboye bo mu muryango mugari wanjye.\u201d"}
{"id": "22204", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22204", "title": "Amasunzu mu Rwanda", "text": "Amasunzu mu Rwanda yari imisatsi yabaga ku mitwe yabanyarwanda cyangwa abanyarwandakazi, ikaba ari ikimenyetso cy'umuco mu Rwanda, berekane ko bafite icyubahiro, ari intwari, ububasha cyangwa ko bakomeye. Gusa nanone abangavu cyangwa urubyiruka na bo bayiyogosheshaga bakurure abantu ko bagejeje igihe cyo gushyingirwa no kurongorwa.\nImitere.\nAmasunzu yari afite imiterere itangaje ndetse ubwayo nk'amasunzu ntiyari imisatsi isanzwe, akaba yari imisatsi yo goshwaga mu buryo bugezweho ku mpande z'umutwe muri icyo gihe cya cyera mu bakurambere, yabaga izinze muburyo budasanzwe habaga hari n'izamuye. Hariho uburyo busaga 30 bwari buzwi bwo gutera amasunzu.\nAho ikoreshwa.\nAmasunzu yari imisatsi barwaga cyane naba kera mu muco gakondo, ku bakuru b'imisozi, abagabo b'intwari, ndetse n'ingimbi n'abangavu."}
{"id": "22205", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22205", "title": "Imigara", "text": "Imigara mu Rwanda ni ibyambarwa bya cyera aho yari imyenda ikozwe mu mpu yambarwaga n'abagabo, cyangwa ibishishwa by'ibiti aho yabaga ifite umwanya wihariye mu muco wa kinyarwanda.\numugara.\nUbundi Umugara wabaga ukoze mu binusu birebire, bakabikata bakabisekura cyangwa se bakabikubita bakoresheje igiti cyangwa ibuye nyuma bakaza kubyoza mu mazi menshi ubundi bakabyanika, bakabona ku bikoresha."}
{"id": "22206", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22206", "title": "Amoko y\u2019Imyambaro ya Gakondo", "text": "Abanyarwanda ba kera dukomokaho bari bafite uburyo bakoraga imyambaro bambara mubikoresho bitandukanye haba mu mpu z\u2019inyamaswa, mu bishishwa by\u2019ibiti nk\u2019ibivumu n\u2019ibivovo by\u2019insina. Bifashishaga ubumenyi gakondo mu gukora imyambaro myiza, yerekana indangagaciro z\u2019umuco na kirazira hari imyambaro bari bafite twavuga."}
{"id": "22207", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22207", "title": "Inkanda mu muco", "text": "Inkanda mu muco nyarwanda ni imyenda yabaga ikoze mu ruhu rw'inka rutunganyije cyane, ni imyenda igaragaza umuco cynagwa umwambaro gakondo w'ambarwaga n'abakobwa ndetse na bagore bo mu Rwanda mu bakurambere bi gihugu, ikaba yari imyambaro y'icyubahoro n'umurimbo, yambarwaga n'abagore bashatse vuba.\nImyambarire.\nInkanda ni imyambarire y'abaga yambarwa na abagore aho bayikenyeraga mu mabere bayambaye, maze bagasokoza imisatsi yabo yu uruhanika cyangwa amasunzu, yarwambaraga mu birori bagirango bagaragaze umuco nyarwanda."}
{"id": "22208", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22208", "title": "Uruyonga mu muco", "text": "Uruyonga mu muco nyarwanda ni imwe mu myambaro yagiye igaragaza umuco nyarwanda, ni umwe mu myambaro gakondo yambarwaga n\u2019urubyiruko rwo mu Rwanda rwo hambere, nk\u2019ikimenyetso cy\u2019uburanga, icyubahiro, n\u2019isuku. \nUruyonga.\nUruyonga ubundi ni mwambaro ugaragaza uburyo ingimbi zo hambere zubahaga umuco wazo mu myambarire, itandukanye n\u2019imyambaro y\u2019uyu munsi nk'uko bigaragazwa n'ubushakashatsi bw'Inteko y'Umuco, uruyonga yambarwaga n'ingimbi mu birori, imbyino, n'imikino byabaga bitandukanye."}
{"id": "22209", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22209", "title": "Uruhu rw\u2019ingwe", "text": "Uruhu rw\u2019ingwe ni uruhu rwari umwambaro mu bakurambere bu Rwanda kuva kera, ni uruhu rwi nyamaswa yitwa ingwe, ikaba ari inyamaswa ifite uruhu rugira amabara meza, amabara y'umuhondo, umweru cyangwa umukara. uru ruhu rukaba rwambarwaga n'abafite ubushobozi byarerekaga icyubahiro."}
{"id": "22210", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22210", "title": "Gushikisha", "text": "Gushikisha mu Rwanda, ni igikorwa cyo gusura abapfumu cyangwa abashitsi ufite intego yo kuraguza, gusobabanuza ibyahishwe, cyangwa kumenya ibizaba ukoresheje imbaraga z'imyuka itandukanye. \nIgikorwa.\nGusjikisha ubundi bikunze gukorwa n'abashaka kuvugana n'abantu bapfuye cyangwa gushaka ubufasha mu bapfuye haba ibitekerezo, imbaraga cyangwa ibindi."}
{"id": "22212", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22212", "title": "Nyiramavugo Kankazi Radegonde", "text": "Nyiramavugo Kankazi Radegonde yavukiye mu Rwanda mu mpera z\u2019ikinyejana cya 19 (hafi mu myaka ya 1880). Yakuriye mu muryango w\u2019abanyacyubahiro mu bwami bw\u2019u Rwanda, aho yize indangagaciro z\u2019umuco nyarwanda zirimo ubutwari, ubwenge mu gutanga inama, n\u2019ubuyobozi.\nYaje gushyingirwa n\u2019Umwami Yuhi V Musinga, wari warabaye umwami w\u2019u Rwanda kuva mu 1896 kugeza mu 1931. Mu muryango wabo ni ho havutse umuhungu wabo Mutara III Rudahigwa mu 1911. \nUruhare rwe mu bwami bw\u2019u Rwanda\nNyiramavugo Kankazi yari azwiho kugira ubwenge n\u2019ubushishozi mu gutanga inama. Yafashaga cyane umuhungu we mu miyoborere y\u2019igihugu. Abanditsi b\u2019amateka bavuga ko yakundaga kuganira n\u2019umwami akamugira inama ku bibazo by\u2019igihugu no ku miyoborere myiza. \nYagize kandi uruhare mu bintu byinshi byabereye mu bwami, harimo:\nKubatizwa kwe.\nKu wa 17 Ukwakira 1943, Nyiramavugo Kankazi hamwe n\u2019umuhungu we Mutara III Rudahigwa babatijwe muri Kiliziya Gatolika i Kabgayi Cathedral.\nMuri icyo gihe ni bwo yahise ahabwa izina rya gikirisitu Radegonde. Icyo gikorwa cyabaye ikintu gikomeye mu mateka y\u2019u Rwanda kuko cyari igihe umwami n\u2019umugabekazi bemeraga ku mugaragaro ukwemera kwa gikirisitu.\nIgihe umuhungu we yari ku ngoma.\nMu 1931, abakoloni b'Ababiligi bakuye Yuhi V Musinga ku ngoma, maze umuhungu we Mutara III Rudahigwa aba umwami mushya w'u Rwanda. \nNyuma yaho, Nyiramavugo Kankazi yabaye umugabekazi(Queen mother). Yakomeje kuba hafi y'umuhungu we, amugira inama ku miyoborere n'iterambere ry'igihugu.\nMu 1959, igihe Umwami Rudahigwa yapfiraga i Bujumbura mu Burundi, Nyiramavugo Kankazi yagize uruhare mu gucyura umurambo we ukazanwa mu Rwanda kugira ngo ashyingurwe mu cyubahiro.\nImico n\u2019indangagaciro zamurangaga.\nNyiramavugo Kankazi yari azwiho:\nAbantu benshi bamwibuka nk\u2019umugore w\u2019ubwenge n\u2019icyubahiro mu bwami bw\u2019u Rwanda.\nImvugo cyangwa ijambo rimuvugwaho (Quote).\nMu mateka y\u2019u Rwanda, Nyiramavugo Kankazi akunze kuvugwaho amagambo agaragaza uruhare rwe mu kuyobora no kugira inama umwami.\nUrugero rw\u2019imvugo imusobanura:\"\u201cUmugabekazi Nyiramavugo Kankazi yari inkingi y\u2019ubwenge n\u2019inama mu bwami, aho yakundaga gufasha umwami gufata ibyemezo byiza ku gihugu.\u201d\"(Iyi mvugo ikoreshwa n\u2019abanditsi b\u2019amateka mu gusobanura uruhare rwe.)"}
{"id": "22213", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22213", "title": "Gusaba Umugeni", "text": "Gusaba umugeni ni umwe mu mihango ikomeye cyane mu muco nyarwanda uba mbere y\u2019ubukwe bwo mw'idini cyangwa itorero. Ni umuhango aho umuryango w\u2019umusore ujya gusaba umukobwa mu muryango we, bakaganira ku mubano w\u2019abana babo no ku bijyanye n\u2019ubukwe.\nIbikorwa bibanziriza gusaba umugeni.\nGutegura gusaba.\nUmusore abanza kubwira ababyeyi be ko ashaka kurongora cyangwa gushaka umugore. Umuryango w\u2019umusore uhitamo abavugizi cyangwa abakuru bu muryango aribo bakunze kwitwa abasaza (abantu bavuga mu muhango), ubundi bakamenyesha umuryango w\u2019umukobwa umunsi bazaziraho gusaba.\nKugera mu rugo rw\u2019umukobwa no gutangira umuhango wo gusaba umugeni.\nUmuryango w\u2019umusore ugera mu rugo rw\u2019umukobwa witwaje impano arizo zizwi nkibisabishwa akenshi haba harimo ibiseke birimo ibiribwa, inkangara irimo inzoga ya kinyarwanda isaba umugeni, ibyo kunywa, amasuka abiri(2) harimo isuka na majagu, akananjoro kahira ubwatsi nikibumbiro n\u2019ibindi.Abavugizi b\u2019impande zombi batangira ikiganiro mu mvugo y\u2019umuco harimo ibiganiro,imivugo n\u2019amagambo yo kwubahana.\nIkiganiro cyo gusaba.\nIkiganiro cyo gusaba ni igice cy\u2019ingenzi cyane mu muhango wo gusaba umugeni. Aha ni ho abakuru b'imiryango yombi bagirana ibiganiro byubaha, bakoresheje amagambo y\u2019umuco, imigani, n\u2019imvugo irimo ubwitonzi.\n1. Gutangira ikiganiro.\nIyo abashyitsi bageze mu rugo rwiwabo w\u2019umukobwa babanza kubaramutsa no kubakira neza. Abavugizi cyangwa abakuru bumuryango w\u2019umukobwa babaza abashyitsi bati:\"\u201cMwadusuye muturutse he? Ni iki kibazanye?\u201d,\" Ibi ntibabazwa mu buryo busanzwe gusa, ahubwo babivuga mu mvugo y\u2019umuco yuje ikinyabupfura.\n2. Gusobanura impamvu yabazanye.\nAbavugizi b\u2019umusore ni bo batangira gusobanura impamvu yabazanye.Akenshi bavuga mu buryo bw\u2019ikinyabupfura bavuga ko baje gushaka ururabo cyangwa umutako uri muri urwo rugo mbese bazimiza ariko bashaka kuvuga ko bashaka umukobwa muri urwo rugo. Ntibavuga izina ry\u2019umukobwa ako kanya, babanza gukoresha amagambo azimije.\nUrugero rw\u2019amagambo bashobora kuvuga harimo naya\u201cTwumvise ko muri uru rugo hari ururabo rwiza cyane twifuza ko rwazaba mu rugo rwacu, ni yo mpamvu twaje gusaba.\u201d ubundi uko ikiganiro kienga gikura bakaza kwerura bavuga ko basaba umugeni.\n3. Ibibazo biva ku ruhande rw\u2019umukobwa.\nAbavugizi b\u2019umukobwa ntibahita bemera. Babanza kubaza ibibazo nka:uwo musore musabira ni nde?,akomoka he?, afite iyihe myitwarire? ese ashobora kwita ku mukobwa wacu neza? Ibi bikorwa mu mvugo itaziguye cyane, ahubwo mu migani n\u2019ibitekerezo by\u2019umuco.\nIyo ikiganiro kimaze kugenda neza abavugizi b\u2019umusore bavuga izina ry\u2019umukobwa bashaka. Abavugizi b\u2019umukobwa babaza mu rugo niba uwo mukobwa yemera uwo musore.Iyo yemeye, ikiganiro gikomeza neza.Nyuma y\u2019ibiganiro impande zombi zemeranya ku mubano w\u2019abana babo.Bashobora gutangira kuganira ku nkwano n\u2019intambwe zizakurikiraho.Iyo byumvikanyweho neza, bavuga ko ubusabe bwemewe.\nIkiganiro cyo gusaba ni ingenzi cyane kuko kibumbatiye umuco w'ubwubahane hagati y\u2019imiryango.Gishyira imbere ubushishozi n\u2019imvugo y\u2019umuco nyarwanda.Gihuza imiryango yombi mbere y\u2019ubukwe.\nInkwano.\nInkwano ni kimwe mu bice by\u2019ingenzi cyane mu muhango wo gusaba umugeni mu muco nyarwanda. Inkwano ni impano umuryango w\u2019umusore uha umuryango w\u2019umukobwa nk\u2019ikimenyetso cy\u2019icyubahiro n\u2019ishimwe ku babyeyi bareze umukobwa. Mu muco nyarwanda wa kera, inkwano yatangwaga cyane cyane mu nka, kuko inka zari ikimenyetso cy\u2019ubukire, icyubahiro n\u2019umugisha mu muryango. Gutanga inkwano ntibyari kugura umukobwa, ahubwo byari uburyo bwo gushimira ababyeyi bamureze no kwerekana ko umusore n\u2019umuryango we biteguye kubaka urugo rushingiye ku kubahana.\nIyo ikiganiro cyo gusaba kigenda neza kandi impande zombi zishimanye, abavugizi batangira kuganira ku bijyanye n\u2019inkwano. Iki kiganiro gikorerwa mu bwitonzi no mu mvugo y\u2019umuco, aho buri muryango agira uruhare mu kugena uko inkwano izatangwa. Abavugizi b\u2019umuryango w\u2019umukobwa bashobora kuvuga umubare w\u2019inka wifuzwa, hanyuma abavugizi b\u2019umusore bakagaragaza icyo bashoboye gutanga. Ibiganiro bigamije kugera ku bwumvikane bwubaka aho kuba impaka. Intego nyamukuru ni uko imiryango yombi yumvikana kandi igakomeza kugirana umubano mwiza.\nMu gihe cyo kuganira ku nkwano, hanemeranywa uburyo izatangwa n\u2019igihe izatangwa. Mu muco nyarwanda wa kera, inkwano yashoboraga gutangwa yose icyarimwe cyangwa igatangwa mu byiciro bitewe n\u2019ubushobozi bw\u2019umuryango w\u2019umusore. Hari igihe umuryango w\u2019umukobwa wemereraga umusore gutanga igice cy\u2019inkwano ku munsi runaka hanyuma ibisigaye bikazatangwa nyuma. Ibi byagaragazaga ubwumvikane n\u2019ubufatanye hagati y\u2019imiryango yombi. Muri iki gihe, nubwo inkwano ikiri igice cy\u2019umuco, hari aho usanga inka zisimbuzwa amafaranga cyangwa ibindi bintu bitewe n\u2019imibereho y\u2019iki gihe."}
{"id": "22214", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22214", "title": "Umuhango wo gufata irembo ry'umugeni", "text": "Gufata irembo ry\u2019umugeni ni umwe mu mihango y\u2019ingenzi ikorwa mu bukwe bwa kinyarwanda. Uyu muhango uba mbere gato yo kujyana umugeni mu rugo rw\u2019umugabo. Ukorwa nk\u2019ikimenyetso cy\u2019uko umuryango w\u2019umusore ugeze ku muryango w\u2019umukobwa ugiye kumujyana, kandi ugakorwa mu buryo bw\u2019umuco burimo ibyishimo, indirimbo n\u2019imvugo zubaha impande zombi.\nMu muco nyarwanda, irembo rifatwa nk\u2019ahantu h\u2019ingenzi cyane mu rugo kuko ari ho abashyitsi binjirira. Iyo umuryango w\u2019umusore ugeze ku rugo rw\u2019umukobwa ku munsi w\u2019ubukwe, bahagarara ku irembo mbere yo kwinjira mu rugo. Icyo gihe hatangira ibiganiro cyangwa imikino y\u2019umuco hagati y\u2019abantu bahagarariye umuryango w\u2019umukobwa n\u2019abahagarariye umuryango w\u2019umusore. Intego ni ukugaragaza ko umuryango w\u2019umusore uje mu cyubahiro kandi witeguye kubaha umuryango w\u2019umukobwa.\nMuri uwo muhango, akenshi abahagarariye umuryango w\u2019umukobwa bashobora kubanza kubuza abashyitsi kwinjira, bakababaza impamvu baje n\u2019icyo bashaka muri urwo rugo. Ibi bikorwa mu buryo busetsa kandi bushimishije, ariko bifite n\u2019igisobanuro cy\u2019umuco. Abavugizi cyangwa abantu bo ku ruhande rw\u2019umusore basobanura ko baje gutwara umugeni bemerewe mbere mu muhango wo gusaba. Bashobora no gutanga impano cyangwa amafaranga make nk\u2019ikimenyetso cyo gufungura irembo.\nUko bikorwa.\nIyo ibiganiro birangiye neza, umuryango w\u2019umukobwa wemera gufungura irembo. Ibi bivuze ko bemeye ko abashyitsi binjira mu rugo kandi ko umugeni ashobora gutegurwa ngo ajyanwe mu rugo rw\u2019umugabo. Uyu mwanya uba ari uw\u2019ibyishimo kuko akenshi habaho kuririmba indirimbo z\u2019umuco, kubyina no kwishimira uwo munsi wihariye mu buzima bw\u2019umugeni n\u2019umuryango we.\nNyuma yo gufungura irembo, abashyitsi binjira mu rugo bagakomeza indi mihango y\u2019ubukwe nko kwakira umugeni, kumusezera ku muryango we, no gutangira urugendo rumujyana mu rugo rw\u2019umugabo. Bityo, gufata irembo ni ikimenyetso cy\u2019uko urugendo rwo kwimura umugeni rutangiye ku mugaragaro kandi ko imiryango yombi yemeye gukomeza uwo mubano w\u2019ubushyingiranwa.\nMuri rusange, umuhango wo gufata irembo ni igice cy\u2019umuco nyarwanda cyuzuyemo ibyishimo, gusabana n\u2019icyubahiro hagati y\u2019imiryango. Ugaragaza ko ubukwe atari ihuriro ry\u2019abantu babiri gusa, ahubwo ari ihuriro ry\u2019imiryango ibiri igiye kubana mu mubano mushya."}
{"id": "22215", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22215", "title": "Umuhango wo gusaba irembo ry'umugeni", "text": "Umuhango wo gusaba irembo ry\u2019umugeni ni umwe mu mihango igaragara mu muco nyarwanda ibanziriza umuhango wo gusaba umugeni. Uyu muhango uba ari intambwe ya mbere yerekana ko umusore n\u2019umuryango we bafite umugambi wo kuzaza gusaba umukobwa ku mugaragaro. Ni umuhango woroshye ugereranyije no gusaba nyirizina, kandi ugamije gutangiza umubano hagati y\u2019imiryango yombi no gutegura inzira izaganisha ku gusaba no ku bukwe.\nMu muco nyarwanda, gusaba irembo bisobanura ko umuryango w\u2019umusore ujya mu rugo rw\u2019umukobwa gusaba uburenganzira bwo kuzaza gusaba umukobwa wabo ku mugaragaro. Muri uwo muhango, abantu bake baturutse ku muryango w\u2019umusore ni bo bajya gusura umuryango w\u2019umukobwa, akenshi harimo ababyeyi cyangwa abahagarariye umuryango. Bageze mu rugo rw\u2019umukobwa, baganira n\u2019ababyeyi be mu buryo bwubaha, bakababwira ko umusore wabo akunda umukobwa wabo kandi ko bifuza kuzaza gusaba mu buryo bwemewe n\u2019umuco.\nUko umuhango ukorwa.\nIbiganiro byo gusaba irembo bikorwa mu mwuka w\u2019ubwubahane no kuganira neza hagati y\u2019impande zombi. Umuryango w\u2019umukobwa ushobora kubaza ibibazo bitandukanye kugira ngo umenye neza umuryango w\u2019umusore n\u2019impamvu bashaka uwo mukobwa. Intego nyamukuru si ugufata imyanzuro ikomeye nk\u2019iyo mu gusaba nyirizina, ahubwo ni ugutangiza umubano no kumenyana hagati y\u2019imiryango. Iyo ibiganiro bigenda neza, umuryango w\u2019umukobwa wemera ko umuryango w\u2019umusore uzaza gusaba umukobwa mu muhango uteguye neza.\nIyo irembo ryemewe, biba bivuze ko umuryango w\u2019umukobwa wemeye kwakira umuryango w\u2019umusore mu muhango wo gusaba uzaba nyuma. Icyo gihe bashobora no kumvikana ku gihe cyangwa ku buryo uwo muhango uzategurwa. Ibi bituma gusaba nyirizina bigenda neza kuko imiryango iba yamaze kumenyana no kubaka icyizere hagati yayo.\nMuri rusange, gusaba irembo ni intambwe y\u2019ingenzi mu muco nyarwanda kuko itegura inzira iganisha ku gusaba umugeni. Uyu muhango ufasha imiryango yombi kumenyana, kuganira no gutangira kubaka umubano uzavamo ubukwe. Ni bwo buryo bwo kubahiriza umuco w\u2019icyubahiro no kwerekana ko ubukwe atari umubano w\u2019abantu babiri gusa, ahubwo ari isano ihuza imiryango ibiri."}
{"id": "22216", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22216", "title": "Umuhamuro", "text": "Umuhamuro ni ibigabiro, imihango, cyangwa amagambo y'indangagaciro yakoreshwaga mu muco nyarwanda, cyane cyane mu gushimangira ubwami, ubumwe, n'imigenzo y'Imandwa. Ibi bikorwa bishimangira ubumwe n'umuco nyarwanda.\nUmuhamuro.\nUmuhamuro ubundi iri ambo ryumvikana nk'imvugo ikoreshwa mu buryo bw'ikigereranyo cyangwa se inshoberamahanga, bitavugwa mu buryo bweruye ngo yumvikane ako kanya, ahubwo ikeneye gusobanurwa n'abazi umuco n'amateka y'u Rwanda."}
{"id": "22217", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22217", "title": "Imandwa", "text": "Kubandwa Imana ni umuhango watangiye mu wa 1510 mu ntango y\u2019Ingoma ya Ruganzu II Ndoli, akaba ari umuhango wahurizaga hamwe Abanyarwanda mu Icyeza Mana, icyo gihe ni ho hahanzwe idini y\u2019Abanyarwanda, akaba ari naryo zina rusange ry\u2019abari bibumbiye muri uwo muryango.\nGutangira.\nKubandwa byatangiye mu muhango watangijwe na Ryangombe rya Babinga mwene Nyundo ukomoka mu Bufumbira muri Uganda, akaba yarakomokaga mu bwoko bw\u2019Abanyoro mu nzu y\u2019Abakonjo yari umupfumu.\nUmumaro.\nImandwa nizo zari zishyigikiye idini gakondo, kubandwa kwari ukugaragaza ikimenyetso cy\u2019ubuyoboke, hakabamo imigenzo ihuza abantu n\u2019Imana."}
{"id": "22218", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22218", "title": "Umuhango wo Gukwa Umugeni", "text": "Gukwa umugeni ni umwe mu mihango y\u2019ingenzi cyane mu bukwe bwa kinyarwanda. Uyu muhango uba nyuma y\u2019uko umuryango w\u2019umusore wamaze gusaba umukobwa kandi impande zombi zumvikanye ku mubano w\u2019abana babo. Gukwa bisobanura gutanga inkwano, ni ukuvuga impano umuryango w\u2019umusore uha umuryango w\u2019umukobwa nk\u2019ikimenyetso cy\u2019icyubahiro no gushimira ababyeyi bamureze.\nMu muco nyarwanda wa kera, inkwano yatangwaga cyane cyane mu nka, kuko inka zari ikimenyetso cy\u2019ubukire, icyubahiro n\u2019umugisha mu muryango. Gutanga inkwano ntibyari bivuze kugura umukobwa, ahubwo byari uburyo bwo gushimira ababyeyi bamureze no kugaragaza ko umusore n\u2019umuryango we biteguye kwakira umukobwa mu muryango wabo. Inkwano yashimangiraga umubano hagati y\u2019imiryango yombi kandi ikaba ikimenyetso cy\u2019uko ubukwe bwemewe n\u2019imiryango yombi.\nUko umuhango wo gukwa umugeni ukorwa.\nMu muhango wo gukwa, umuryango w\u2019umusore wateguraga inka cyangwa ibindi bintu byemeranyijweho bakabijyana mu rugo rw\u2019umukobwa. Abagize imiryango yombi barahuraga bakishimira uwo muhango, bagasangira ibiryo n\u2019ibinyobwa mu byishimo. Icyo gihe habaga n\u2019indirimbo n\u2019imbyino z\u2019umuco zagaragazaga ibyishimo byo gukomeza umubano hagati y\u2019imiryango.\nHari n\u2019igihe inkwano yatangwaga mu byiciro bitewe n\u2019ubushobozi bw\u2019umuryango w\u2019umusore. Bashoboraga gutanga igice cyayo ku munsi runaka, hanyuma ibisigaye bikazatangwa nyuma. Ibi byagaragazaga ubwumvikane n\u2019ubufatanye hagati y\u2019imiryango yombi. Muri iki gihe cya none, nubwo umuco wo gutanga inkwano ukiriho, hari aho usanga inka zisimbuzwa amafaranga cyangwa ibindi bintu bitewe n\u2019imibereho y\u2019iki gihe.\nMu by\u2019ukuri, umuhango wo gukwa ni intambwe ikomeye mu bukwe bwa kinyarwanda kuko ushishikariza kubahana hagati y\u2019imiryango, gushimira ababyeyi b\u2019umukobwa no gushimangira isano iri hagati y\u2019imiryango yombi. Uyu muhango ni na wo utuma ubukwe bwitabirwa n\u2019imiryango yombi mu buryo bwemewe n\u2019umuco, bityo ukaba igice gikomeye cy\u2019umuco nyarwanda."}
{"id": "22219", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22219", "title": "Imigenzo", "text": "Imigenzoya hozeho mu Rwanda rwo hambere aho nka banyarwanda twari dufite imico n\u2019imigenzo nk'abanyarwanda imwe muri iyo igenda isimburwa n\u2019indi nkuko ibihe bisimburana. Imigenzo, imwe n'imwe harimo iyo twagiye twasigiwe n\u2019abasokuruza ndetse n'abakurambere harimo imyiza myinshi.\nImigenzo.\nhari imimigenzo myinshi twagira nka banyarwanda kuva kera ku u Rwanda rwaremwa na Gihanga ngoma igihumbi harimo iyi gufashanya mu byerekeye imyaka n\u2019amatungo, gutabarana no kwakira abashyitsi. Kuva kera Abanyarwanda bahoze bafashanya, bagakorera hamwe. ibyo bikaboneka cyane cyane kuguzanya, kwata no kugwatiriza. iyo umuntu yabaga yejeje imyaka, undi atareza cyangwa yararumbije, uwejeje yagurizaga utejeje; na we akazamwishyura cyangwa akazamwitura ku bundi buryo.Uwabaga akeneye umurima, yajyaga kwa mugenzi we akabimutekerereza; mugenzi we akamwatira umurima, agateramo imyaka yamara kweza akazamuha icyatamurima."}
{"id": "22222", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22222", "title": "Umuhango wo Kwakira Umukazana", "text": "Kwakira umukazana ni umwe mu mihango ikomeye cyane mu bukwe bwa kinyarwanda, kandi ni igice gikurikira umuhango wo gukwa Umugeni. Uyu muhango uba ku munsi umugeni ajyanwa mu rugo rw\u2019umugabo, aho umuryango w\u2019umugabo umwakira ku mugaragaro nk\u2019umunyamuryango mushya. Ni intambwe yerekana ko umugeni yinjiye mu muryango w\u2019umugabo kandi ko ubuzima bushya bwo kubaka urugo butangiye mu buryo bw\u2019umuco n\u2019icyubahiro.\nIntangiriro y\u2019umuhango.\nIyo umugeni ageze mu rugo rw\u2019umugabo, umuryango we ndetse n\u2019abashyitsi baturutse ku mpande zombi baba bahari. Ababyeyi b\u2019umugabo, abavugizi n\u2019abandi bantu b\u2019ingenzi mu muryango bahita bamwakira ku irembo ry\u2019urugo, akenshi habaho indirimbo z\u2019umuco n\u2019imbyino bigaragaza ibyishimo byo kwakira umukazana.\nUyu muhango si ukwemera gusa ko umugeni yinjiye mu rugo, ahubwo ni ikimenyetso cy\u2019icyubahiro, aho abashyitsi bose hamwe n\u2019umuryango w\u2019umugabo berekana ko bemeye umukazana nk\u2019umunyamuryango mushya.\nImyitwarire y\u2019umukazana.\nMu muco nyarwanda, umukazana agomba kwitwara mu buryo bwubahisha umuryango mushya yashatsemo, asezera ku muryango w\u2019iwabo,birangiye akerekana ko yiteguye kuba mu muryango mushya, aba agomba kwambara neza bijyanye n'umuco, akagaragaza isura nziza n\u2019icyubahiro ikindi aba agomba kwigira ku babyeyi n\u2019abasaza b\u2019umugabo mu by\u2019umuco n\u2019imyitwarire y\u2019urugo. Uuyu mwanya uba ari ingenzi cyane kuko werekana ko umugeni azi inshingano ze z\u2019urugo.\nIbirori bijyana no kwakira umukazana.\nIyo umukazana amaze kwakirwa, akenshi habaho ibikorwa bikurikira: Kuririmba no kubyina indirimbo z\u2019umuco zishimira umubano mushya.guutanga impano ntoya ku muryango w\u2019umugabo cyangwa ku mukazana kugira ngo bamwakire neza,abashyitsi baturutse ku mpande zombi basangira ibiryo n\u2019ibinyobwa, bagashimangira umubano hagati y\u2019imiryango. Uyu muhango uba umwanya wo kwishimira ubuzima bushya bwo kubaka urugo no kugaragaza umuco nyarwanda mu buryo bufatika.\nAkamaro kuyu muhango.\nGuhuza imiryango yombi,kwakira umukazana ni intambwe ishimangira ko imiryango yombi yemeye umubano.Kwerekana icyubahiro n\u2019umuco, Umukazana yinjiye mu rugo rw\u2019umugabo mu buryo bw\u2019icyubahiro kandi ababyeyi b\u2019umugabo bamwakiriye neza.Gutangira ubuzima bw\u2019urugo bushya, Uyu muhango uherekeza umugeni mu rugo rwe rushya, akiga inshingano n\u2019imyitwarire y\u2019urugo.\nMu by\u2019ukuri, kwakira umukazana ni umuhango w\u2019ingenzi mu bukwe nyarwanda kuko ushyira ku mugaragaro ko umugeni yinjiye mu muryango w\u2019umugabo, uherekeza ubuzima bushya bw\u2019urugo, kandi ukazana ibyishimo n\u2019ubwubahane hagati y\u2019imiryango yombi."}
{"id": "22223", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22223", "title": "Ibigabiro", "text": "Ibigabiro ni ibiti byabaga mu Rwanda, ibigabiro bikaba byari ibiti by'imivumu cyangwa ibihondohondo batera ahantu hari urugo rw'umwami, cyangwa se ingoro yu Mwami, kandi bajyaga babitera ndetse n'ahantu bashyinguye umugongo wu mwami, ngo hatazibagirana, Byafatwaga kandi nk'ibigabiro by'igihugu.\nAkamaro.\nIbigabiro kandi byari ibigabiro byari bifite akamaro gakomeye mu Rwanda, nkaho byari ibimenyetso by'ububasha bw'umwami, ubusugire bw'igihugu, n'imigenzo y'umuco nyarwanda, "}
{"id": "22225", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22225", "title": "Umuhango wo Gutekesha Umukwe n'Umugeni", "text": "Mu muco nyarwanda, umuhango wo gutekesha umukwe n\u2019umugeni ni umwe mu mihango y\u2019ubukwe igaragaza ubushobozi bw\u2019abashyingiranwa mu mirimo y\u2019urugo n\u2019ubwumvikane hagati yabo. Uyu muhango ukunze gukorwa nyuma yo kwakira umukazana mu rugo rw\u2019umugabo, kandi uba umwanya wo kwerekana ko bombi biteguye gufatanya mu rugo no kubaka umuryango.\nIntangiriro y\u2019umuhango.\nUyu muhango ukurikira iminsi mike nyuma y\u2019ubukwe, bitewe n\u2019imico y\u2019umuryango. uyu muhango utegurwa n'umuryango w'umukwe mu rwego rwo kubaha uburenganzira bwo gutangira guteka no kwita ku rugo rwabo. Mu muco nyarwanda, umukwe n\u2019umugeni basabwa kugaragaza ubuhanga n\u2019ubwitonzi mu mirimo y\u2019urugo, cyane cyane mu gutegura amafunguro cyangwa ibikorwa bifatika by\u2019urugo. \nMu gihe cy\u2019umuhango, umukazana agaragaza ubushobozi bwo guteka amafunguro y\u2019umuco, gutegura ibiryo, no gukora imirimo yo mu rugo.Umukwe afasha cyangwa akorana n'umugeni mu gutegura ibyo bikorwa, agaragaza ko ashoboye gufatanya mu rugo.Uyu muhango ukorwa mu buryo bwo kugaragaza ubushobozi n\u2019ubushake bwo kubaka urugo rugendera ku muco.\nIbyo umukwe n\u2019umugeni bagaragaza.\nMu gihe cyo gutekesha,umugeni agaragaza ubushobozi bwo gutegura no guteka ibiryo by\u2019umuryango, kandi akabikora mu buryo bw\u2019umuco n\u2019ubwitonzi.umukwe afatanya cyangwa ayobora igikorwa mu buryo buboneye, agaragaza ko ari umugabo witeguye gufasha no gukorana umugeni.Bombi bagaragaza ubwumvikane no kwubahana hagati yabo n\u2019umuryango wabo.Uyu muhango kandi uba umwanya wo kwerekana ko ubuzima bw\u2019urugo bushya buherekejwe n\u2019ubufatanye n\u2019ubushishozi.\nAkamaro k\u2019umuhango.\nGushimangira ubwumvikane bw\u2019abashyingiranwa, uyu muhango ugaragaza ko umukwe n\u2019umugeni bashobora gufatanya mu rugo.Kwerekana ubushobozi bw\u2019umugeni n\u2019umukwe mu muryango,ababyeyi n\u2019abashyitsi babona ko bombi biteguye inshingano z\u2019urugo.Guhuza imiryango n\u2019abashyitsi,indirimbo, imbyino n\u2019ibirori bikurikirana umuhango bigaragaza ibyishimo n\u2019icyubahiro hagati y\u2019imiryango yombi.\nUmwihariko w\u2019uyu muhango.\nUyu muhango utandukanye no gutekesha umugeni wenyine kuko wibanda ku bufatanye bw\u2019abashyingiranwa bombi. Bugaragaza ko ubukwe nyarwanda atari umubano w\u2019abantu babiri gusa, ahubwo ari ubufatanye bw\u2019imiryango, ubushobozi bw\u2019abashyingiranwa n\u2019ubwumvikane mu rugo.\nMu by\u2019ukuri, gutekesha umukwe n\u2019umugeni ni umuhango w\u2019ingenzi kuko utuma habaho icyizere hagati y\u2019abashyingiranwa, kugaragaza ubushobozi bwo gufatanya mu rugo no gukomeza umuco nyarwanda mu bukwe."}
{"id": "22226", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22226", "title": "Ururimi rw\u2019Urukonjo", "text": "Urukonjo ni ururimi rw\u2019ikinyabupfura n\u2019ikinyabwenge rwakoreshwaga mu mateka n\u2019umuco nyarwanda, cyane cyane mu mihango yabaga iyo gukorera imandwa cyangwa se imyambaro y\u2019icyubahiro. Uru rurimi rw'urukonje kandi rugizwe n\u2019amagambo yihariye, asimbura amagambo asanzwe y\u2019Ikinyarwanda ku mpamvu z\u2019ubupfumu, kubandwa, cyangwa kugaragaza icyubahiro."}
{"id": "22227", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22227", "title": "Umuhango wo Gutwikurura Abageni", "text": "Gutwikurura abageni ni umwe mu mihango y\u2019ingenzi mu bukwe bwa kinyarwanda, ukaba uba ku musozo w\u2019ubukwe cyangwa ku munsi umugeni ajyanwa mu rugo rw\u2019umugabo. Uyu muhango ugaragaza gutangira urugendo rushya rw\u2019abashyingiranwa nk\u2019umugabo n\u2019umugore, kandi uba ari umwanya wo kwerekana ibyishimo, icyubahiro no guha umugeni n\u2019umukwe inama n\u2019ihumure n\u2019umuryango.\nIntangiriro y\u2019umuhango.\nGutwikurura abageni bivuga gufata umugeni n\u2019umukwe bakava ku rugo rw\u2019umuryango w\u2019umukobwa bajya mu rugo rw\u2019umugabo cyangwa ku rugo rushya rwabo. Mu muco nyarwanda, uyu muhango uba umwanya wo gusezera ku babyeyi b\u2019umukazana n\u2019abandi bagize umuryango. Umwanya wo gutangira inshingano zo kwubabaka urugo nkabashakanye aho umugeni n'umukwe bagaragarizanya amarangamutima n\u2019ubwuzu hagati yabo. Uherekezwa n\u2019indirimbo z\u2019umuco, imbyino n\u2019ibirori byo kwishimira umubano n'ubuzima bushya.\nUyu munsi uba ari intangiriro y\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019urugo rushya kandi uba umwanya wo kwerekana icyubahiro ku muryango w\u2019umukobwa no ku muryango w\u2019umugabo.\nImyitwarire y\u2019abageni.\nMu gihe cyo gutwikurura, abageni bagomba Kwitwararika, bakiyubaha, bakerekana ko bubaha umuryango w\u2019umukobwa n\u2019umugabo.Kugaragaza ibyishimo no gushimira umuryango, cyane cyane ababyeyi bamureze umukazana. Kwitegura ubuzima bushya mu muryango w\u2019umugabo, bagaragaza ubwumvikane n\u2019ubufatanye.Akenshi, abageni bagiye mu rugo rushya cyangwa ahantu ubukwe bukomereza, baherekejwe n\u2019abavugizi, ababyeyi n\u2019abashyitsi, bagaragaza ibimenyetso by\u2019icyubahiro n\u2019ubushuti hagati y\u2019imiryango.\nIbirori bijyana n\u2019umuhango.\nGutwikurura abageni akenshi bijyana n\u2019ibikorwa birimo:Indirimbo n\u2019imbyino z\u2019umuco zerekana ibyishimo by\u2019umuryango,gutanga impano cyangwa amafaranga y\u2019ishimwe ku muryango w\u2019umukobwa.Gusangira ibiryo n\u2019ibinyobwa n\u2019abashyitsi kugira ngo ibyishimo byuzure umuryango wombi.Uyu muhango uba igice gikomeye cy\u2019ubukwe kuko ugaragaza ko ubukwe burangiye ku mugaragaro, umugeni n\u2019umukwe batangiye ubuzima bushya, kandi imiryango yombi ihuriza hamwe ibyishimo n\u2019icyubahiro.\nAkamaro k\u2019umuhango.\nGusezera ku muryango w\u2019umukobwa no kugaragaza icyubahiro.Gutangira urugendo rushya rw\u2019urugo nk\u2019umugabo n\u2019umugore.Guhuza imiryango yombi mu byishimo n\u2019umuco.Kwerekana ubwumvikane n\u2019ubufatanye bw\u2019abageni ku mugaragaro."}
{"id": "22228", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22228", "title": "Umuhango wo kujya guca mw'irembo", "text": "Umuhango wo kujya guca mw\u2019irembo kw\u2019abageni ni umwe mu mihango y\u2019ingenzi ikurikiraho nyuma y\u2019ubukwe nyarwanda. Uyu muhango ukorwa nyuma y\u2019uko umugeni ajyanwe mu rugo rw\u2019umugabo, aho abageni hamwe n\u2019umuryango w\u2019umusore bajyana umugeni gusura urugo rw\u2019iwabo. Ni umuhango w\u2019icyubahiro kandi w\u2019amarangamutima, kandi ugamije guhuza imiryango yombi nyuma y\u2019ubukwe no gukomeza umubano n\u2019umuco.\nIntego y\u2019umuhango.\nGuhuza imiryango yombi nyuma y\u2019ubukwe no kujya gushimira umuryango w'umukobwa ko wabahaye umugeni mwiza. Umugeni asubira mu rugo rw\u2019iwabo hamwe n\u2019umugabo we kugira ngo imiryango ikomeze gusabana mu rwego rwo kwerekana icyubahiro ku muryango w\u2019umukazana,umugeni agaragaza ko akomeje kubaha ababyeyi n\u2019umuryango we. uyu muhango kandi ishimangira umubano n\u2019ubwumvikane Uyu muhango ugaragaza ko abageni n\u2019imiryango yabo bashyigikiye ubukwe kandi biteguye gufatanya mu byishimo n\u2019inshingano z\u2019urugo.\nUko umuhango ukorwa.\nUmuryango w\u2019umusore hamwe n\u2019abageni bategura urugendo berekeza mu rugo rwaho umukobwa avuka. Bitwaza inkangara irimo ishimwe ry'umuryango ko babahaye umugeni mwiza, iyo batashimye umugeni bafata inkangara bakuzuzamo ibyatsi byitwa ibitovu murwego rwo kwerekana ko umugeni babahaye batamushimye. Abageni bahabwa ikaze n\u2019umuryango umukazana avukamo ku irembo ry\u2019urugo, baririmba indirimbo z\u2019umuco.\nMuri uyu muhango, abageni baganira n\u2019umuryango w\u2019umukazana, basangira ibiryo n\u2019ibinyobwa, banaganira ku buzima bushya bw\u2019urugo.Umugeni agaragaza ubwitonzi n\u2019ubushishozi mu rugo rwe rwa kera, naho umugabo agaragaza icyubahiro ku muryango w\u2019umukazana.\nIbirori n\u2019imyitwarire.\nAbashyitsi n\u2019imiryango baririmba kandi babyina kugira ngo bagaragaze ibyishimo byo gusabana.Uyu muhango ushobora kujyana no gutanga impano nk\u2019ikimenyetso cy\u2019icyubahiro n\u2019ubushuti. Umuryango w\u2019umukazana n\u2019umuryango w\u2019umusore basangira ibiryo, bagasangira ibyishimo by\u2019umubano mushya.Umuhango ukomeza kugeza abageni bateguye gusubira mu rugo rwabo, ariko umubano hagati y\u2019imiryango yombi ugahora uhamye kubera ibyishimo no gusabana byagaragajwe.\nAkamaro k\u2019umuhango.\nUyu muhango ugaragaza ko abageni bashyigikiwe n\u2019imiryango yabo mu rugo rushya.Umugeni akomeza kugaragaza ko yubaha ababyeyi be n\u2019umuryango.Uyu muhango uhuza indirimbo, imbyino, n\u2019ibirori byo gusabana.Bifasha ko imiryango ikomeza kubana neza no gufashanya mu bihe bitandukanye.\nMuri rusange, umuhango wo kujya guca mw\u2019irembo kw\u2019abageni ni intambwe ikomeye mu gukomeza ubufatanye n\u2019ubusabane hagati y\u2019abageni n\u2019imiryango yabo nyuma y\u2019ubukwe, kandi ni igice cy\u2019umuco nyarwanda kigaragaza icyubahiro, ibyishimo n\u2019ubwumvikane."}
{"id": "22229", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22229", "title": "Ibigabiro bya Nyabakonjo", "text": "Ibigabiro bya Nyabakonjo ubundi ibigabiro ni ibiti by'imivumu cyangwa byaba ibiti by'ibihondohondo batera ahantu hari urugo rw'umwami, cyangwa se bashyinguye ingoro wu Mwami, ngo hatazibagirana, Byafatwaga kandi nk'ibigabiro by'igihugu.\nNyabakonjo.\nNkuba ya Nyabakonjo yari ubwami bw\u2019i Bwanacyambwe, rero ibimenyetso ndangamateka by\u2019ibigabiro byaho abami b\u2019u Bwanacyambwe byaho bari batuye birahari kuva 1378-2019 biri mu Mudugudu wa Amahoro, Kagali ka Rukiri II mu Murenge wa Remera mu Karere ka Gasabo."}
{"id": "22230", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22230", "title": "Ibigabiro bya Rwabugiri", "text": "ibigabiro bya Rwabugiri ni ibiti nk\u2019imivumu cyangwa ibihondohondo biteye aho abami babaga batuye ku ngo zabo bakundaga kuhatera ibyo biti maze bikitwa ibigabiro.\naho biri.\nibigabiro bya Rwabugiri ibigabiro bya Rwabugiri byahoze i Rwamagana byari byinshi kandi ari binini cyane, byatemwe nyuma y\u2019Intambara ya mbere y\u2019Isi. Byatemeshejwe n\u2019abapadiri bubaka Misiyoni ya Rwamagana, babifashijwemo n\u2019umutware witwaga Rwabutogo rwa Kabare ka Rwakagara wategekaga u Buganza bw\u2019epfo."}
{"id": "22231", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22231", "title": "Ibigabiro bya Nkungu", "text": "Nkungu iherereye mu karere kahoze ari u Buganza bw\u2019epfo. Ubu ni mu Mudugudu wa Kiryango, Akagari ka Nkungu, Umurenge wa Munyaga, mu Karere ka Rwamagana, mu Ntara y\u2019Iburasirazuba, akaba ariho hari ibigabiro bya Nkungu, rero niho mu kinyejana cya 15 ku ngoma ya Ruganzu I Bwimba, yagiye kuhabera umucengeri mu Gisaka.\nIbigabiro.\nIbigabiro bya Nkungu aho niho Ruganzu I Bwimba yatangiye maze hamera igiti cy\u2019umuguruka kirakura kiba inganzamarumbo, kandi abantu bakagitinya kuko cyameze aho umwami yatangiye Nyuma y\u2019igihe kirekire, icyo giti kirasaza kigwa hasi kirahaborera gusa hari n\u2019ikindi giti cy\u2019umuguruka kinini kandi kirekire, bivugwa ko cyashibutse ku muzi w\u2019icyo cyahoze aho umwami yatangiye."}
{"id": "22232", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22232", "title": "Ibigabiro bya Munyaga", "text": "Umusozi wa Munyaga ni umusozi uri ku nkengero z\u2019aho u Rwanda rwa hanaga urubibi na rwagabaniraga ndetse na Gisaka, mbere y\u2019uko rwigarurira icyo gihugu mu kinyejana cya 19 ku ngoma ya Mutara II Rwogera. Ingabo zabaga ziri ku rugerero zirinze inkiko z\u2019u Rwanda.\nIbigabiro bya Munyaga.\nIbigabiro bya Munyaga ni ibigabiro bya Sharangabo na Ndabarasa na we wari igikomangoma yabaye kuri urwo rugerero rw\u2019i Munyaga ari kumwe n\u2019Abakemba, Mu mpinga y\u2019uwo musozi ari na ho hahoze urugerero, hitwa mu Nkamba kuva icyo gihe kugeza magingo aya. Ubu ni mu Mudugudu wa Kigabiro, Akagari ka Kaduha, Umurenge wa Munyaga, Akarere ka Rwamagana."}
{"id": "22233", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22233", "title": "Ubukannyi mu Rwanda", "text": "Ubukannyi mu Rwanda, wari umwuga wari utunze benshi bakuragamo imyenda yo kwambara mu impu zitandukanye ndetse Uyu mwuga wari ufitiye Abanyarwanda akamaro gakomeye kuko wari ubaatunze kandi wari umwe mu mirimo gakondo ya ba kurambere, ababukoraga bitwaga abakannyi.\nIbikoresho.\nUbukannyi bwari uburyo bwo kuboha cyangwa gutunganya impu z\u2019inyamaswa nk'inka, ihene, intama cyangwa izindi nyamaswa z'ishyamba) kugira ngo zivemo imyenda yoroshye kandi ikwiriye kwambarwa."}
{"id": "22234", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22234", "title": "Pasika", "text": "Umunsi wa Pasiki ni umunsi abemera Yesu kristo (Yezu kristu) wari umwana w\u2019Imana bivugwa yuko yazutseho, nyuma y\u2019iminsi itatu yari amaze mu gituro, yari amaze mumva. Ni umunsi usobanura intsinzi y\u2019ubuzima ku rupfu nu mucyo ku mwijima, akaba ari umunsi ngaruka mwaka mu myemerere ya Gikristo.\nImigenzo.\nUmunsi wa Pasika ni umunsi abakristo bizihiza ko Yesu yazutse kugira ngo akize abantu imbaraga z\u2019icyaha n\u2019urupfu, abahuze n\u2019Imana Data, buri mwaka irzihizwa gusa nta tariki izwi neza bizihirizaho uyi munsi.\nInkomoko.\nPasika ifite inkomoko mu migenzo ya kera mu idini y'abayahudi bibuka uko Imana yabakuye mu bubata bwa Misiri. Hari n\u2019ibimenyetso bimwe byaje bivuye mu migenzo ya kera (nko gukoresha amagi n\u2019inkwavu) bishushanya uburumbuke n\u2019ubuzima bushya."}
{"id": "22236", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22236", "title": "Ukwezi kwa Ramadhan", "text": "ukwezi kwa Ramadhan cyangwa igisibo cya Ramadhan cyangwa se Ramadan ni ukwezi kwa cyenda ku ngengabihe ya kisilamu ku isi, aba ari ukwezi gutagatifu kurusha ayandi yose mu idini ya Islamu. Iki ni ukwezi kugenewe gusenga, kwiyiriza, no kwegera Imana, kandi ni imwe mu nkingi eshanu z\u2019idini ya Isilamu.\nImyitwarire.\nUkwezi kwa Ramadhan aha muri uku kwezi, abayisilamu basubiramo igitabo gitagatifu cya Qu'ran, bakiyongerera amasengesho, kandi bakitwara neza, bagaragaza ubugwaneza no gufasha abakene, Abayisilamu bafite ubuzima bwiza basabwa kwiyiriza (kureka kurya no kunywa) kuva mu rukerera kugeza izuba rirenze.\nAmasengesho.\nMuri Ramadhan abayisilamu bose basenze umunsi wose batariye maze buri mugoroba izuba rirenze, bararya maze bagafata bafungura, kenshi bakabikora bahuriye hamwe n'imiryango cyangwa inshuti zabo."}
{"id": "22237", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22237", "title": "Umunsi wa Noheli", "text": "Umunsi mukuru wa Noheli ni umwe mu minsi mikuru igize umwaka twizihiza mu Rwanda ariko cyane cyane umwaka wa Gikristo, wizihizwa n\u2019abantu batari bacye hirya no hino ku Isi. Kuri uyu munsi abakirisitu bajya mu nsengero kw'izihiza ivuka rya Yezu / Yesu kristo/kristu) wavukiye i Betelehemu.\nUko watangiye kwizihizwa.\nNoheli nk'umunsi watangiye kwizihizwa nk\u2019umunsi w\u2019ikiruhuko ahagana mu kinyejana cya 4, rero Noheli yizihijwe bwa mbere kuwa 25 Ukuboza mu mwaka wa 336 nyuma y\u2019ivuka rya Yezu/ Yesu mu bwami bw\u2019Abaromani, umwami Constantin, umwami w\u2019Abaromani na Papa Liberius Ahagana mu kinyejana cya 3 cyangwa icya 4, nibwo uyu munsi mukuru wa Noheli watangiye kwizihizwa nk\u2019umunsi abantu bibukaho ivuka ry\u2019umukiza Yezu / Yesu Kristu."}
{"id": "22238", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22238", "title": "Umuganura mu Rwanda", "text": "Umuganura mu Rwanda ni umwe mu munsi mukuru w'ingirakamaro mu muco w'u Rwanda ukaba ari umunis wizihizwa ku munsi 5 wu kwezi kwa Kanama waburi mwaka. Ubundi uyu munsi usobanura kurya cyangwa kuganura ku mbuto za mbere zeze cyangwa \"gusangira ku musaruro wabonetse muri icyo gihe cy'ihinga, n\u2019isarura aho Abanyarwanda bishimira ibyagezweho mu ngeri zinyuranye z'ubuzima.\nAmateka.\nUmuganura mu Rwanda watangiye kwizihizwa mu Rwanda ku ngoma ya Gihanga Ngomijana mu kinyejana cya 9. Waje guhabwa imbaraga zidasanzwe n'Umwami Ruganzu II Ndoli mu kinyejana cya 16 nyuma yo kubohora igihugu.\nUko wizihizwa.\nUmunsi wu muganura mu Rwanda ni umunsi w'ubusabane aho imiryango n'inshuti bahura bagasangira ibiribwa gakondo aha harimo umutsima, ibishyimbo, n'amata, rukasharara, ndetse bakananywa. Mu birori byo ku rwego rw'igihugu, habaho imbyino gakondo, imivugo, n'imikino. \nUbu.\nUmuganura nyuma yo gusubizwa agaciro wari ufite maze na Guverinoma y'u Rwanda kuva mu 2011, Umuganura ntiwizihizwa gusa mu rwego rw'ubuhinzi. Muri iki gihe, Abanyarwanda bishimira umusaruro uva mu ngeri zose zirimo, Ikoranabuhanga, Uburezi, n'Inganda, Ubuzima, Imikino, n'Ubukerarugendo hamwe n'imiyoborere n'iterambere."}
{"id": "22239", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22239", "title": "Ubunani", "text": "Ubunani ubundi ni umunsi wa mbere utangira umwaka mushya, mbese ni itariki ya mbere Mutarama, ni umunsi abantu bakunda kuba bari mu birori, mu miryango yayo,hari impano zitanduaknye, ndetse usanga n'abacuruzi bakatuye ibintu bagurisha, Ni ikiruhuko rusange aho abantu bajya mu nsengero, ibitaramo, cyangwa bakitegura mu ngo, bakarangwa n'imyambarire mishya n'ibiryo byihariye.\nUko wizihizwa.\nUbunani ubundi hakunzwe gucurangwa umuziki, hakabaho n'imbyino, ndetse n'ibishashi by'umuriro bicanwa, abana bakambikwa imyenda mishya, abandi bajya gusenga basa umugisha mu mwaka mushya, abandi bajya mu cyaro iwabo kurira ubunani n'imiryango yabo, abandi bagateka ibiryo bidasanzwe nk'umuceri, inyama."}
{"id": "22240", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22240", "title": "Ingoro ya Yezu Nyirimpuhwe", "text": "Ingoro ya Yezu Nyirimpuhwe ni ingoro yitiriwe Kwa Yezu Nyirimpuhwe, ni ingoro ntagatifu ya Kiliziya Gatolika ubundi iri ahantu hitiriwe Yezu nyirimpuhwe hakaba ari mu kibaya ariko kitwa icya mahoro, cyikaba giherereye mu murenge wa Ruhango, mu Karere ka Ruhango, Intara y'amajyepfo y'u Rwanda.\nAmateka.\nKwa Yezu nyirimpuhwe ubundi ni ahantu hamenyekanye cyane bitewe n'abantu benshi bahajya bavuga ko bahakirira indwara zitandukanye kandi zikomeye ariko binyuze gusa binyuze mu isengesho. Kwa Yezu kristo nyirimpuhwe ni ishami rya Paruwasi Gatolika ya Ruhango, muri Diyosezi ya Kabgayi."}
{"id": "22241", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22241", "title": "Ikinimba", "text": "Ikinimba ni imbyino yo mu majyaruguru y'u Rwanda, ubusanzwe ikorwa cyangwa imbyinwa n'urubyiruko bari mu mihango yo kurambagizanya. akaba ari indirimbo ziherekeza imbyino akenshi zigira inama abagore batashyingiranywe uko bakwitwara kuri ba sebukwe; kandi ubundi abagore ntibakoraga izi mbyino bamaze gushyingirwa.\nImbyino.\nUbundi mu Rwanda rwo hambere ndetse nuba hari amako atatu y'imbyino, Izo mbyino zirimo\nGusa kubera iminsi yagiye yiyongera ndetse hakazamo nabandi bantu b'abanyarwanda hajemo izindi byino twaguva:"}
{"id": "22242", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22242", "title": "Imbyino yo Gusaama", "text": "Imbyino yo Gusama cyangwa Gusaama, ni imbyino ikaba ari umwihariko n'umuco w'abaturage bo ku Nkombo, ni ikirwa giherereye mu Kiyaga cya Kivu mu Karere ka Nyamasheke, intara y'iburengerazuba bwu Rwanda. Iyi mbyino ifatwa nk'indangagaciro ikomeye ndetse n'akarusho kaka gace, ikaba izwiho umuvuduko n'uburyo budasanzwe bwo kunyeganyezamo ibice by'umubiri.\nIbyo wayimenyaho.\nGusama bifite Umwihariko mu mibyinire gusama birangwa no kunyeganyezwa kw'ibitugu n'umubiri wose mu buryo bujyanye n'ingoma n'amajwi yihariye y'abanya-Nkombo. Ni imbyino ifite imbaraga nyinshi kandi isaba ubuhanga bwo guhuza n'injyana, ndetse Itorero ry'Abasaamyi ni torero ni ryo rizwi cyane mu kubyina iyi njyana. "}
{"id": "22243", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22243", "title": "Ikinyemera", "text": "Imbyino y'ikinyemera ni imbyino ikomoka mu Majyaruguru y\u2019Iburengerazuba bw\u2019u Rwanda, ahitwa mu Bigogwe nka Rwankeli, Nkuli, Akanage, Kingogo. Bitewe n\u2019uko ako ari agace kiganjemo ubworozi bw\u2019inka kuva mu bihe byo hambere, iyi mbyino bayiserukana barata inka, bikagaragarira no mu ndirimbo ziherekeza izo mbyino.\nkumbyina.\nUbyina ikinyemera yibanda cyane ku gutega amaboko yigana imiterere y\u2019amahembe y\u2019inka. Umubyimba nawo awukoresha aworoheje uretse ko igihe kigera hakazamo no gutigisa intugu. Userukana iyi mbyino acinya ikirenge hasi; agatangira ahozoza abyina mu buryo bworoheje, akageza igihe yongereramo imbaraga mu cyiciro cyitwa Umurindi w\u2019inka. Ikinyemera ni imbyino iserukanwa n\u2019ibitsina byombi bagatandukanira mu gutega maboko, mu ntambwe no buryo abagore bakoresha umwitero mu cyiciro kitwa kuvugutira inka."}
{"id": "22244", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22244", "title": "Igishakamba", "text": "Imbyino y'Igishakamba ni imbyino ikomoka mu Nkore mu gihugu cy\u2019Ubuganda. Yaje kugera mu Rwanda inyuze mu Mutara w\u2019i Ndorwa, mu Ntara y\u2019Iburasirazuba bw\u2019u Rwanda. Iza gusakara mu Buganza, ikwira mu gihugu hose.\nAbagabo.\nAbagabo baseruka bacinya ikirenge inshuro ebyiri zikurikirana ku butaka babisikanya amaguru, ukw\u2019ibumoso n\u2019ukw\u2019iburyo, bakabanza gucunda amaboko bayerekeza imbere n\u2019inyuma cyangwa iburyo n\u2019ibumoso. Igihe kiragera bakongera umurindi w\u2019ikirenge, bakerekeza amaboko mu kirere bigana uko amahembe y\u2019inka ateze. Abahimbawe cyane bacishamo bakizengurukaho ndetse bakaba banabisikana. \nAbagore.\nAbagore babyina igishakamba babanza guseruka ukwabo babyina kimwe nk\u2019abagabo. Igihe kiragera bose bagasobeka bakajyanamo akanya, nyuma abagabo bagaca bugufi ndetse bamwe bagatera ivi, bakomera amashyi abagore. Abagore bakarushaho guhimbarwa, bakabigaragaza mu kwikunda no mu kunyeganyeza mu mbavu, mu gihe abagabo banyuzamo bakamamaho ibiganza iburyo n\u2019ibumoso, bigana uko abungeri bakubita inka ibizinzo."}
{"id": "22245", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22245", "title": "Imbyino", "text": "Imbyino rikomoka ku nshinga kubyina bisobanura guhondagura ibirenge ku butaka ku buryo buboneye ukabigira wikaraga mu mubyimba kandi urusaku rw\u2019\u00edbirenge rukajyanirana n'indirimbo yabigenewe. Naho ijambo imbyino ryo rigasobanura Indirimbo iherekejwe n'\u00famudiho.\nInka.\nImbyino nyinshi mu Rwanda rwo hambere zari zishamikiye ku kuvuga inka n\u2019bwiza. Koko rero, izi mbyino zivoma mu myireko ifite aho ihuriye n\u2019urugamba kuko inka zivugwa ari inyambo zihanganishwa ku rugamba hagati y\u2019Ibihogo n\u2019Amagaju. Byongeye kandi, usanga ubwiza bw\u2019inka (inyambo) bugererenywa n\u2019ubwiza bw\u2019Umunyarwandakazi."}
{"id": "22247", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22247", "title": "Sherrie Silver Foundation", "text": "Sherrie Silver Foundation ni umuryango udaharanira inyungu washinzwe mu mwaka wa 2015 na Sherrie Silver, umubyinnyi n\u2019umutoza w\u2019imbyino ukomoka mu Rwanda. \nUyu muryango ugamije gufasha abana n\u2019urubyiruko kubona amahirwe yo kwiteza imbere binyuze mu mpano z\u2019ubuhanzi n'imbyino, umuziki n\u2019imyidagaduro.\nIntego nyamukuru zawo ni ugufasha abana cyane cyane abaturuka mu miryango itishoboye kuvumbura impano zabo, kwiyubaka no kugira icyizere mu bushobozi bwabo. Binyuze mu mahugurwa, ibikorwa by\u2019ubuhanzi n\u2019inkunga mu mibereho n\u2019uburezi, uyu muryango ugamije guteza imbere urubyiruko no kurufasha kugira uruhare mu iterambere ry\u2019umuryango nyarwanda.\nUmuryango kandi utegura ibikorwa bitandukanye bigamije Guteza Imbere Urwanda Rwejo\nIbyo Bakora.\nSherrie Silver Foundation ni umuryango washinzwe na Sherrie Silver ugamije guteza imbere impano z\u2019abana bo muri Afurika, cyane cyane abaturuka mu miryango itishoboye, binyuze mu buhanzi nko kubyina no kuririmba. Uyu muryango uha abana amahugurwa n\u2019amahirwe yo kwagura impano zabo, bikabafasha kwiteza imbere no gufasha imiryango yabo mu mibereho\nIndirimbo.\nJe Mappelle \nUzagaruka\nCall Me \nOnly One\nMama"}
{"id": "22248", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22248", "title": "Gushyingura mu Rwanda", "text": "Gushyingura kuva mu Rwanda bajyaga kera Abanyarwanda bafite uko bashyingura ababo babaga bapfuye kuva kera mu bakurambere bari bafite uko babikora ndetse n'imihango bakoraga.\nMu muco.\nMu muco wacu mu Rwanda abantu bazima bashimwa n'Imana n'abazimu bacu batazima bakajya kuruhukira muri Muhabura yahabuye abana b'u Rwanda, abajyaga mu muriro ntabwo bari abi Rwanda rero abajya muri Nyiragongo ihora yaka maze bagashya bagatokombera, mugihe ababaye ibirumirahabiri bacishwa muri kalisimbi bakabanza gukubitwa akanyafu n'ubukonje bwaho amaherezo bakazabona kujyanwa mu gitaramo cy'Abakuru b'i Rwanda muri Muhabura.\nImihango.\nkera iyo bajyaga gushyingura hari imihango y\u2019ikitegererezo bakoraga mu gutsirika umuzimu aribyo Guhambanwa ikara Umuntu wapfaga atarashatse cyangwa atarabyaye, akenshi yahambanwaga ikara.\nIkara.\nIbi byakorwaga kugira ngo umuzimu we utazagaruka guteza amahane mu muryango kandi byafatwaga nk\u2019ikosa ry\u2019umuryango kuba uwo muntu yaragejeje igihe cyo gushaka ntibabimufashemo, bityo bakamutsirika ngo atazaza kubishyuza.\nInkuba.\nKera uwakubiswe n\u2019inkuba mbere yo gushyingura uwishwe n\u2019inkuba, habanzaga gukorwa imihango yo kugangahura no kuraguza kugira ngo bamenye icyateye icyo kiza.\nInyama.\nKirazira ku kiriyo byaraziraga kurya inyama mu kiriyo cy\u2019uwapfuye, kuko byafatwaga nko kurya intumbi cyangwa se umurambo w'uwapfuye."}
{"id": "22249", "revid": "17987", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22249", "title": "Nyirarumaga", "text": "Nyirarumaga ni umwe mu bagore b\u2019ingenzi cyane mu mateka ya gakondo nyarwanda. Yabaye Umugabekazi w\u2019ingoboka ku ngoma ya Ruganzu II Ndoli, umwami wategetse u Rwanda mu kinyejana cya 16. Nyirarumaga yavukaga mu muryango w\u2019Abasinga, kandi yari azwi cyane kubera ubwenge, ubwitange n\u2019ubuhanga mu buhanzi bw\u2019ubusizi. Mu mateka y\u2019u Rwanda afatwa nk\u2019umubyeyi w\u2019ubusizi nyarwanda, kuko yagize uruhare rukomeye mu gutuma ubusizi bukoreshwa mu kubika amateka y\u2019igihugu no gusingiza abami. \nAmateka yamuranze.\nNyirarumaga yabaye umuntu ukomeye mu buzima bwa Ruganzu II Ndoli. Igihe se wa Ruganzu yari amaze kwicwa n\u2019abanzi, umwana we yahungiye i Karagwe (aho muri Tanzaniya y\u2019ubu). Nyirarumaga yamubereye umurinzi n\u2019umujyanama, ndetse aza kugirwa nyina w\u2019ingoboka w\u2019umwami (umugabekazi). Yagize uruhare rukomeye mu kumufasha kugaruka mu Rwanda no kongera kubaka igihugu cyari cyarasenyutse. Mu mateka bavuga ko yigeze no gukiza ubuzima bwa Ruganzu Ndoli igihe yari agoswe n\u2019abashakaga kumwica, ndetse akababazwa cyane kuko yigeze no gutakaza urutoki kubera kwanga kuvuga aho umwami yari yihishe. \nUbuhanzi.\nMu buhanzi, Nyirarumaga ni we watangije uburyo bw\u2019ubusizi bwitwa Impakanizi. Ubu ni ubusizi bwavugaga amateka y\u2019abami n\u2019igihugu, aho buri mwami yongerwaga mu gisigo nk\u2019aho wongera isaro ku runigi. Ibi byari uburyo bwo kubika amateka y\u2019u Rwanda mu magambo, kuko icyo gihe nta nyandiko zari zihari. Umwe mu mirimo ye izwi cyane ni igisigo cyitwa \u201cUmunsi ameza imiryango yose\u201d, cyavugaga inkomoko y\u2019ingoma n\u2019umuco w\u2019Abanyarwanda. Ubu buryo bwo gusiga amateka mu bisigo bwaje kuba inkingi ikomeye y\u2019umuco nyarwanda. \nNyirarumaga kandi yashyizeho Intebe y\u2019Abasizi, aho abasizi b\u2019ibwami bateraniraga bagahimba ibisigo by\u2019amateka n\u2019ibisingiza abami. Aho hantu hari ku musozi wa Kiruri mu karere ka Huye, ahafatwaga nk\u2019ahera ku basizi. Abahanzi bazamukaga kuri uwo musozi mu gitondo bakicara mu bwigunge bagahimba ibisigo, hanyuma bakamanuka bakabigeza ku bami n\u2019abantu. Uwo muco w\u2019ubusizi wagize uruhare rukomeye mu kubika amateka y\u2019u Rwanda mu buryo bw\u2019imivugo n\u2019inkuru. \nKubera uruhare rwe mu mateka n\u2019umuco, Nyirarumaga afatwa nk\u2019umwe mu bagore b\u2019intwari mu mateka y\u2019u Rwanda. Uyu munsi izina rye rikomeje kubahwa mu bikorwa bitandukanye by\u2019umuco n\u2019ubusizi, ndetse hari n\u2019ibihembo n\u2019ibirori byitiriwe izina rye bigamije guteza imbere ubusizi n\u2019ubuvanganzo nyarwanda. Umurage yasize ni uko ubusizi bwabaye igikoresho cyo kubika amateka, gusigasira umuco no gukomeza kwigisha ibisekuru bizaza amateka y\u2019igihugu."}
{"id": "22250", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22250", "title": "Pirigatori", "text": "Pirigatori ni inyigisho yo mu idini Gatolika ku isi ndetse no mu Rwanda, ivuga ko ari ahantu cyangwa imimerere abapfuye bafite ibyaha bito bito cyangwa batarangije guhanirwa ibyaha byabo bahawe imbabazi, banyura ngo bakurweho imyanda y'ibyaha mbese ba kweza mbere y'uko binjira mu ijuru.\nImyemerere.\nAbagatolika bemera ko amasengesho n'ibitambo bya misa bishobora gufasha ubugingo buri mu pirigatori kwihuta kwinjira mu ijuru, ni nko kweza ubugingo kugira ngo bwemererwe kwinjira mu bwami bw'Imana butunganye."}
{"id": "22251", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22251", "title": "Kwiyiriza ubusa", "text": "Kwiyiriza ubusa ni igikorwa cy\u2019abantu basenga Imana, bagikora kugira ngo bicuze ibbyaha bakoze cyangwa se Imana ibarebe neza.\nAbatemerewe kwiyiriza.\nKwiriza ubusa ni ikintu cy\u2019ingenzi mu buzima akaba ari ni ukumenya ko atari byiza kwiyiriza mu gihe uri gufata imiti cyangwa se ufite ubundi burwayi. Mu gihe wifuza kubikora kandi umeze utyo, ni ngombwa kubijyaho inama na muganga wawe. Abagore batwite n\u2019abonsa bo babujijwe gukora iki gikorwa, kereka gusa igihe babisabwe n\u2019abaganga.\nIbwiza bwo gusenga.\nKwiyiriza ubusa ku mubiri wubukora ushaka uburyo wisukura, ukivanamo imyanda ishobora kuba yawangiza. Ibi bishoboka iyo umuntu atariye, utunyangingo twe duhindura imikorere tukabasha gusukura umubiri w\u2019umuntu., nanone ni uko iyo umuntu atariye nko mu gihe cy\u2019amasaha 12, umubiri we utangira gukoresha isukari wifashishije ibinure wabitse n\u2019ibindi bitandukanye, ibi bikaba byagabanya ibyago byo kuba umuntu yarwara indwara zirimo umutima cyangwa se akagira umuvuduko ukabije w\u2019amaraso."}
{"id": "22252", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22252", "title": "Urutonde rwabagore bintwaari mu rwanda", "text": "uru ni urutonde rwabagore bakoze ibintu bikomeye mugihugu cyacu cy'Urwanda."}
{"id": "22253", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22253", "title": "Amasengesho y'Agatatu", "text": "Amasengesho y'Agatatu cyangwa amasengesho yo ku wa Gatatu) ni amasengesho akunze kuba ku munsi w'agatatu akaza kumenyekana nk'amateraniro y'umunsi wose akaba ari ayo guhembuka n'ububyutse, no gusengera ibyifuza, kuramya, guhimbaza, ububyutse, kwiga ijambo ry'Imana akenshi akorerwa mu nsengero zitandukanye."}
{"id": "22254", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22254", "title": "Amaturo", "text": "Amaturo ni ijambo ry'ikinyarwanda akaba ari ijambo ry'abanyamadini, aho bisobanura umusanzu, ituro, impano, utangana ubushake, bikaba biri muri gahunda z'imihango, idini, cyangwa se mu idini ya isilamu, Rero mu buryo bw'umwuka, bituma umuntu agera ku bakomeye. Mu muco nyarwanda n'uw'idini, bifatwa nk'ikimenyetso cyo gushimira Imana, gufasha abakene, no kwiyegereza abakomeye. \nIntego.\nIntego z'amaturo atangwa kugira ngo ashyigikire imirimo y'Imana, gufasha abatishoboye, cyangwa gushimira, Amaturo akaba yitwa Zakat mu Isilamu akaba ari ituro ryoroheje rikuwe mu mutungo w'abishoboye rigahabwa abakene."}
{"id": "22255", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22255", "title": "Icya cumi", "text": "Icya cumi (cyangwa icyacumi) ni amafaranga cyangwa se ikintu cyose wungutse maze muribyo ugatanga kimwe mu bice icumi (1/10) by\u2019ibyo umuntu yungutse bivuye mu musaruro, maze bikitwa ko gihabwa Imana haba mu misigiti cya urusengero.\nInkomoko.\nIcyacumi gifite Inkomoko cyangwa cyatangiye gukoreshawa nkuko bi iboneka muri Bibiliya, aho Abisirayeli basabwaga kugitanga kugira ngo gishyigikire umurimo w\u2019Imana n\u2019abatambyi (Abalewi) batagiraga gakondo, Mu gihe cya kera, cyatangwaga mu biribwa cyangwa imyaka cyangwa amatungo, ariko muri iki gihe mu madini atandukanye gitangwa mu mafaranga."}
{"id": "22256", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22256", "title": "Urusengero", "text": "urusengero ni inyubako cyangwa ahantu hagenewe guhurira abantu bari kuramya Imana, kumva ijambo ry'Imana, gutura ibitambo, no gukora imihango y'idini, bwese rufatwa nk'inzu yera yahariwe gusengerwamo Imana.\nInsengero.\nMu Rwanda hari insengero zitandukanye aha twagaragaza nka: "}
{"id": "22257", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22257", "title": "Idini", "text": "Idini rifite inkomoko mu rurimi rw'Igiswahili cyangwa se mu rurimi rw'icyarabu rikaba risobanura Ukwemera. Idini ahanini imyemerere inshiye ku myizerere, cyangwa uburyo abantu basengamo bigendanye n'imihango, amahame bikuzwa n'itsinda ry'abantu kugirango bagaragaze ubumwe n'ubunyangamugayo. \nIdini.\nidini rihaza icyifuzo cy'ibanze cy'umuntu cyo gushaka intego y'ubuzima no kumenya imbaraga zimukuriye. Icyakora, abantu benshi bagaragaza ko idini ritandukanye n' itorero cyangwa umubano wihariye n'Imana, aho idini rifatwa nk'uburyo bwo hanze n'amategeko, mu gihe kwizera nyakuri ari ibyo mu mutima."}
{"id": "22259", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22259", "title": "Iteraniro", "text": "Iteraniro cyangwa Itorero mu rwego rwa Gikristo, itorero ntirivuga inyubako cyangwa inzu gusa, ahubwo ryerekeza ku iteraniro ry'abantu, Ni ihuriro ry'abantu basangiye imibereho n'imyizerere muri Yesu Kristo, guhamagarwa mu bandi cyangwa guteranyiriza hamwe, rero itorero ni ihuriro cyangwa ishuri ry\u2019abantu bahujwe n\u2019imyizerere cyangwa idini cyangwa indangagaciro z\u2019umuco n\u2019iterambere."}
{"id": "22260", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22260", "title": "France Mpundu", "text": "Marie-France Munyampundu Gusenga, uzwi ku izina rya France Mpundu, ni umuhanzikazi w\u2019Umunyarwandakazi wavukiye kandi akurira mu Karere ka Nyanza, mu Ntara y\u2019Amajyepfo y\u2019u Rwanda. Yatangiye kugaragaza impano yo kuririmba akiri muto, aririmba no muri korali ya Kiliziya. Yamenyekanye cyane nyuma yo gutsinda irushanwa ry\u2019impano mu muziki rya \"I\u2019m the Future\" mu mwaka wa 2018. Mu mwaka wa 2025, yitabiriye irushanwa rya televiziyo \"Secret Story Afrique\", aho yageze mu cyiciro cya nyuma, arangiza ku mwanya wa kane.\nUbuzima bwe bwite.\nFrance Mpundu yavukiye kandi akurira mu Karere ka Nyanza. Akiri muto, yakundaga kuririmba muri korali ya Kiliziya, ari na ho yakomeje guteza imbere impano ye. Yize amashuri abanza kuri St. Joseph Primary School, ayisumbuye mu cyiciro rusange kuri College Christ-Roi, akomereza mu cyiciro cya kabiri cy\u2019amashuri yisumbuye kuri Notre Dame i Karubanda.\nUmwuga w\u2019umuziki.\nUrugendo rwa France Mpundu mu muziki rwamenyekanye cyane mu mwaka wa 2017, ubwo yitabiraga irushanwa rya \"I\u2019m the Future\", ryateguwe na David Tuyishime uzwi nka David Pro. Yegukanye iryo rushanwa mu mwaka wa 2018, bituma abona amahirwe yo gukomeza guteza imbere umuziki we.\nMu ndirimbo ze harimo \"Sinabirota\", \"Bitwayiki\", \"Gake\", \"Selfish Love\", \"Darlin\" na \"Umutima\". Indirimbo \"Darlin\" yayikoranye na Yvan Buravan, naho \"Over\" ayikorana na Juno Kizigenza. Indirimbo ze za mbere zasohotse ubwo yari muri Future Record, inzu y\u2019umuziki yari yarateguye irushanwa rya \"I\u2019m the Future\".\nMu mwaka wa 2023, yatangiye gukorana na Huha Records, itsinda rifasha abahanzi barimo Juno Kizigenza. Iyi mikoranire yamufashije gukomeza gushyira hanze indirimbo no guteza imbere ibikorwa bye by\u2019umuziki. Indirimbo \"Umutima\" yayikoze afatanyije na Juno Kizigenza, wamufashije no mu kuyandika.\nAmarushanwa.\nMu mwaka wa 2025, France Mpundu yitabiriye irushanwa rya televiziyo \"\", ryabereye muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo kandi rikanyuzwa kuri Canal+ Magic. Yageze mu cyiciro cya nyuma ari kumwe n\u2019abandi bahatanaga. Mugenzi we Moctar, ukomoka muri Niger, yamuhaye amahirwe yo guhita ajya muri finale nyuma yo kubona kode y\u2019ibanga yamuhaga uburenganzira bwo gukomeza. Mu musozo w\u2019irushanwa, Moctar yegukanye igihembo nyamukuru, naho France Mpundu arangiza ku mwanya wa kane.\nIbikorwa biheruka.\nKu wa 16 Mutarama 2026, France Mpundu yakoze igitaramo cye cya mbere cya muzika mu buryo bwa \"live\" muri French Institute i Kigali. Yaririmbye indirimbo ze zirimo \"Sinabirota\" na \"Darlin\", anataramana na Juno Kizigenza, baririmbana indirimbo yabo \"Over\". Igitaramo cyitabiriwe n\u2019abakunzi be n\u2019abagize umuryango we.\nKu wa 6 Kamena 2026, France Mpundu yaririmbye mu birori byo gusoza icyiciro cya kabiri cy\u2019irushanwa rya \"Nouvelle Reine\", ryabereye muri C\u00f4te d\u2019Ivoire. Icyo gihe yari atwite inda nkuru yiteguraga kwibaruka. Inkuru yabivuzeho yasohotse muri \"People TV\" ku wa 6 Nyakanga 2026.\nUbuzima bw\u2019umuryango.\nFrance Mpundu na Moctar bahuriye mu irushanwa rya \"Secret Story Afrique\", aho umubano wabo wagiye umenyekana mu gihe irushanwa ryari rikomeje. Ku wa 15 Ugushyingo 2025, Moctar yamwambitse impeta y\u2019urukundo amusaba ko bakomeza umubano wabo, maze France Mpundu arabyemera.\nKu wa 27 Nyakanga 2026, France Mpundu na Moctar bibarutse umwana wabo wa mbere. Ku wa 18 Nzeri 2026, Moctar yahaye France Mpundu imodoka yo mu bwoko bwa BYD Leopard 3. Ku wa 7 Ukwakira 2026, berekanye umwana wabo ku mugaragaro binyuze ku mafoto basangije abakunzi babo ku mbuga nkoranyambaga."}
{"id": "22261", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22261", "title": "Imisango y'Ubukwe mu Rwanda", "text": "Imisango y'ubukwe igiye itandukanye uhereye mu gihe cyohambere hagendewe ku muco,imyizerere naho abantu bagiye baherereye mu Rwanda.\nHabanza Gusaba no Gufata Irembo.\nNi Imisango yaberega iwabo w'umukobwa, byabanzirizwaga no kurambagiza. Umuhango wo gusaba no gufata irembo bigomba kuba byihuse ubusanzwe mu muco nyarwanda ntawimana irembo igihe umuryango w'umusore wabaga wemerewe irembo, byakurikirwaga no gufata irembo. Igihe abo mu muryago w'umusore bagiye kumufatira irembo babaga bageze iwabo w'umukobwa, barabakira bakabazimanira n'uko uhagarariye umuryango w'umukobwa akababaza ikibagenza. Ise w'umusore cyangwa undi umuryango w'umusore batoranije nibo bajyaga gusaba no gufata irembo. Umuryango usaba watangaga inka y'ifatarembo ku bifite cyangwa isuka kubabaga baciriritse. Byabaga ari ubwa mbere imiryango yombi ihuye, ikaganira kubijyanye n'ubukwe, bakajya inama kubizakorwa n'ibizakenerwa mu ubukwe bw'abana babo. \nHakurikira Gusaba no Gukwa.\nMu imisango y'ubukwe gusaba umugeni ni umuhango wakurikiraga gufata irembo, nabwo ukabera iwabo w'umukobwa. Mu muhango wo gusaba, umuryango w'umusore watoranyaga abakwe bajya kuwusabira, bakagenda bayobowe n'umukwe mukuru, kandi bitwaje inzoga yo gusabisha. Wari umuhango woguha agaciro imiryango yombi kuko umusore ntiyabaga yemerewe gutwara umukobwa atamuhawe. Ibyo byari ikimenyetso cy'uko umuryango w'umuhungu uhaye agaciro umuryango wareze umukobwa. Mu guhe cyo gusaba umuryango w'umukobwa ntiwahitaga wemerera umuryango w'umusore umugeni, ibyo bikagaragaza kwihesha agaciro nk'umuryango no kugahesha abawukomokaho. Nyuma yogusaba hakurikiragaho umuhango wo gukwa ugakorwa n'umuryango w'umusore n'ubundi bikabera iwabo w'umukobwa. Umusore yakwaga inka,andi matungi cyangwa isuka gusa byose byitwaga ko bakoye inka. Inkwano byabaga ari ikimenyetso cy'uko imiryango ibaye inshuti. Inkwano yari ipfundo ry'ubumwe hagati y'imiryango yombi. Kandi mu muco nyarwanda inkwano ntiyabaga inzitizi, Yaba ibonetse cyangwa itabonetse, ntibyakuragaho k'ubukwe butaha. Igihe inkwano yabaga ibuze, umusore yashoboraga gutenda, bivuze gufata igihe aba kwa sebukwe akora akazi gasimbura inkwano cyangwa agahabwa umugeni w'ubuntu. ni uko imisango y'ubukwe igenda ikorwa."}
{"id": "22262", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22262", "title": "Kurongora no kurongorwa", "text": "Kurongora no kurongorwa byabanzirizwaga n'imisango y'ubukwe mu muco wa kinyarwanda. Iyo igihe cyabaga kigeze, umuryango w'umukobwa bahekaga umukobwa bakamushyira umuryango w'umusore.\nUburyo byakorwaga mu gihe cyo hambere.\nUmukobwa igihe yabaga ageze kwa sebukwe, hari imihango yakorwaga yokumwakira igiye itandukanye bitewe na gace byakorerwagamo. Hari aho iyo yabaga akiri mubingi by'amarembo, yahagararaga hejuru yaho batabye urusyo, nyirabukwe akamukoza umwuko ku mpanga. Hari aho umugeni yinjiraga agasanga sebukwe yicaye ikambere akamwicaza ku bibero akamuha inka y'ibibero akabona kujyanwa mu mbere. Mu gihe ibirori by'ubukwe byabaga bigeze hagati. se w'umusore yamujyanaga kurongora. Mu kurongora hakoreshwaga umwishywa, umusore akawambika umugeni hanyuma akavuga ati ndakurongoye ndi kanaka mwene kanaka, maze ababyeyi bakavuza impundu. Ibirori byarakomezaga kugeza mu gitondo, abaje baherekeje umugeni bagasezera bagataha. Nyuma y'uko abaje bahetse umugeni bageze iwabo w'umukobwa bagashikiriza ababyeyibe umwishywa. Hakurikiragaho umuhango wo kwakira umwishywa ukabanzirizwa no gucunda.\nIbindi wamenya.\nNta mukobwa washyingirwaga yaratakaje ubusugi kuko kubutakaza byabaga ari igisebo ku mukobwa, umuryango akomokamo n\u2019igihugu. Uwabaga yatwise atarashyingirwa, yafatwaga nk\u2019uwatesheje igihugu ubusugi, kugira ngo igihugu gisubirane iryo shema ry\u2019ubusugi bwacyo, umukobwa bakamucira mu mahanga cyangwa bakamuroha. Nyuma yo kurongorwa, hari iminsi umugeni yamaraga ari mu nzu adasohoka. Muri icyo gihe cyo gutinya yaboheraga nyirabukwe akebo k\u2019ibara rimwe, bitaga nyirabitabo. Gutinya byafashaga umukobwa kumenyerana n\u2019umuryango ajemo, akamenya imyitwarire n\u2019imico biranga umuryango mushya ajemo. Hakurikiraga gutwikurura. Ni umuhango wakorwaga hagamije gusohora umugeni kugira ngo bamuhe uburenganzira bwo kujya ahagaragara, kugira ngo atangire imirimo ye. Habanzaga gukura abageni mu nyegamo, kubogosha amasunzu, guha abana amata no kubereka imitwa.Mu kwerekwa imitwa, urugo rushya rwahabwaga ibyangombwa nkenerwa birimo ibikoresho, ibiribwa n\u2019ibindi. Umuryango w\u2019umukobwa wabaga wamuzaniye ibiribwa, imyaka n\u2019ibikoresho byo mu gikoni. Umukwe mukuru ni we watumwaga mu rugo ngo ayobore uwo muhango, aherekejwe n\u2019abakuze n\u2019amasugi. "}
{"id": "22263", "revid": "18922", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22263", "title": "HAGENIMANA Jean Paul (Bushali)", "text": "HAGENIMANA Jean Paul ni umuhanzi nyarwanda uzwi cyane kwizina rya Bushali, Bushali kandi ni we nkingi ya mwamba y'injyana nshya yitwa Kinyatrap. Yayihimbye afite imyaka 24 gusa, maze avanga injyana ivuye hanze n'umuco gakondo wacu.\nUmudiho we utandukanye n'iyindi, Ihuza uburyo bwo kuririmba budasanzwe, ibisigo, n'ingoma zifite imbaraga, bigatuma Trap ihinduka umwimerere w\u2019Abanyarwanda.\nNi umuhanzi ufite impano idasanzwe yo guhuza ibya kera n'ibigezeweho. Ibi nibyo bituma afatwa nk\u2019umwe mu bahanzi b\u2019ejo hazaza h\u2019umuziki w\u2019u Rwanda.\nAmateka.\nBushali yatangiye kugaragara mu muziki mu mwaka wa 2016. Avuka mu muryango w'abana barindwi, akaba yaragize igitekerezo cyo gukora umuziki utandukanye n'uwo bandi bakoraga. Ntabwo yifuzaga kwigana injyana za America gusa, ahubwo yashakaga uburyo yahuza injyana igezweho n'imivugire ndetse n'umuco w'i Kigali, cyane cyane mu gace k'i Nyamirambo aho yakuriye.\nIvuka rya Kinyatrap na \"Nituebue\" (2018).\nUmwaka wa 2018 ni wo wabaye imbarutso ikomeye mu mateka ye:\nGuhanga Injyana: Bushali, ari kumwe n'abandi bahanzi nka B-Threy na Slum Drip, bashinze injyana bise Kinyatrap. iyi njyana ntabwo yari imudiho gusa, ahubwo yari uburyo bushya bwo gukoresha ururimi rw'ikinyarwanda (slang) mu muziki wa Trap.\nIndirimbo \"Nituebue\": Mu Ugushyingo 2018, nibwo hasohotse indirimbo \"Nituebue\". Iyi ndirimbo yahinduye amateka, ituma Kinyatrap imenyekana mu gihugu hose kandi ituma Bushali n'abo bafatanyaga bamenyekana nk'abahanzi b'abahanga\nAlubumu ya mbere: Murui uwo mwaka kandi yasohoye alubumu ye ya mbere yise \"Nyiramubande\", yagaragaje ko ari umuhanzi uzi kuvuga amateka n'ubuzima bwo mu muryango nyarwanda."}
{"id": "22272", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22272", "title": "Zuba Ray", "text": "Soleil Uwase Irahari ni umuhanzikazi nyarwanda Uzwi nka Zuba Ray Wavutse Mu 2005 uri mu bahanzi bakizamuka, usanzwe abarizwa muri KINA Music. Mu mwaka wa 2024, yamenyekanye nk\u2019umwe mu bahanzi bashya bafite intego yo kugera ku rwego mpuzamahanga no kwigarurira abakunzi b\u2019umuziki mu Rwanda no hanze yarwo.\nUmuziki.\nZuba Ray yatangiye kumenyekana ubwo yaririmbaga mu gitaramo cyo kumurika album \"Vibranium\" ya Nel Ngabo na Platini P.\nAmashuri yize.\nZuba Ray yize mu Rwanda School of Music, aho yagaragaje impano ye mu muziki akiri umunyeshuri. Aho ni ho yateje imbere ubumenyi bwe mu kuririmba no gukora umuziki, bituma atangira kumenyekana mu ruhando rw\u2019abahanzi bakizamuka. \nIbihangano.\nIgisabo\nUtuntu\nIkirezi"}
{"id": "22273", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22273", "title": "Kubatizwa", "text": "Kubatizwa ni umuhango w'abakirisitu muri rusange, kubatizwa kandi birimo amako menshi bitewe n'amatorero cyangwa imyizerere, kwibizwa mu mazi menshi ku bavutse ubwakabiri(abarokore), cyangwa se gusukwa amazi mugahanga kuri kiriziya gatolika, akaba ari igikorwa cy'ingenzi mubuzima bwa gikristo kigaragaza ko umuntu yiyeguriye Imana, kandi akiyemeza gukurikira inyigisho za Yesu Kristo. Ijambo \"kubatizwa\" rikomoka mu rurimi rw'ikigiriki risobanura kwibiza mu mazi.\nKubatizwa.\nKubatizwa ni iri jambo rikomoka ku rurimi rw'Ikigiriki risobanura kwibiza mu mazi, akaba ari nayo mpamvu imyizerere myinshi ishingiye kuri Bibiliya ishimangira ko umubatizo nyakuri ari uwo kwibizwa wese mu mazi menshi.\nKubatizwa kandi ni umuhango wo gutanga izina mu madini amwe namwe nka gatolika,kuko iyo utabatijwe akenshi usanga umuntu afite izina rimwe atemerewe kugira irya kabiri ugasanga rero umuntu afite ipfunwe ko adafite izina rya kabiri ndetse bakamwita ko ari umupagani.\nTukiri ku myizerere hari na batisimu ya Mwukawera/Roho mutagatifu bivugwa ko ari ugusabana n'imana kurwego rwo hejuru ndetse bakagira n'umwanya wo kuvuga mu ndimi zitamenyekana nkuko byabaye ku ntumwa kubantu bizera bibiliya."}
{"id": "22274", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22274", "title": "Ishimwe Adelaide", "text": "Ishimwe Adelaide uzwi ku mazina ya Ida Adelaide ni umukobwa w'umunyarwanda akaba ari umunyamakuru w'imikino w'umupira w'amaguru mu Rwanda. azwi cyane mu gukurikirana no kugeza ku banyarwanda amakuru y'imikino itandukanye aho ari umuyobozi wikiganiro cy'umupira w'amaguru.\nUbuzima.\nIda Adelaide mbere yo kwinjira mu itangazamakuru, yamenyekanye ubwo yitabiraga irushanwa rya Miss Rwanda muri 2022, aho yari ahagarariye Intara y'Amajyaruguru.\nUmwuga.\nIda Adelaide akaba ari ni umunyamakuru kuri Radio TV10 aho akora mu kiganiro Zoom Sports na 10Zone, ndetse akaba ari ny'umuyobozi w'ikiganiro kuri radiotv 10."}
{"id": "22275", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22275", "title": "Ibihe by'ubuhinzi bwohambere mu Rwanda", "text": "Kera u Rwanda nk'igihu cyari gituwe n'abanyarwanda kavukire basangiye umuco, ururimi ndetse n'indagagaciro nakirazira \nbagiraga ibikorwa bitandukanya byabafashaga mumibereho yabo yaburi munsi. Aho wasangaga bakora imirimo itandukanye y'amaboko nko kubaza, guhinga, gucura, kubumba, kuboha, kumasha, korora amatungo magufi n'amaremare ibi byatumaga babasha kwishakamo ibisubizo igihe amapfa yabaga abugarije.\nby'umwihariko reka tugaruke kubyarangaga ibihe by'ubuhinzi mu u Rwanda rwakera nkumwe mu mirimo fatizo yakozwe kuvakera u Rwanda rwahangwa na Gihanga.\nnubwo ubwo buhinzi bwakorwaga nkumwe mumirimo shingiro y'abatura Rwanda, ubuhinzi bwagenderaga kubihe bine byigenzi aribyo: \nUmuhindo.\nUmuhindo nka kimwe mubihe byingenzi by'ihinga mu Rwanda cyari igihe cyagiraga imvura iringaniye nkeya murugero, abahinga barahingaga ibihingwa by'amako atandukanye nk'amasaka, imyumbati, ibigori, ndetse n'ibishyimbo. cyari igihe cyiza cyagutera ibihingwa ngandura rugo, cyangwa se ibiribwa bw'ibanze. Umuhindo watangira mukwezi kwa Nzeri ukarangira mukwezi k'Ukuboza.\nUrugaryi.\nUrugaryi narwo rwari igihe kingenzi kiza mubihe byari bigize igihe cy'ubuhinzi mu Rwanda rwohambere, murikino gihe hagwaga imvura nkeya ndetse nizuba ridakanaganye aho babashaga gusarura ibihingwa byabaga byarahinzwe mu muhindo.\nIgihe cy'urugaryi cyatangiraga mukwezi kwa Mutarama cyikarangirana na Gashyantare.\nItumba.\nItumba naryo nigihe cyari ngenzi mubihe by'ubuhinzi mu Rwanda aho inzura yagwaga ari nyinshi cyane bitandukanye no mubindi bihe byaranga ubuhinzi. abahinzi bahingaga ibihingwa bitandukanye harimo ibijumba, imyumbati, n'ibishyimbo by'itumba. Bitewe nimvura yagwaga arinyinshi kandi igihe kirekire byatumaga abahinzi bahinga ibihingwa bitangizwa namazi menshi cyangwa imvuranyinshi.\nImpeshyi.\nImpeshyi cyar'igihe cyizuba ry'inshi kandi ry'igihe kirekire aho abahinzi basaruraga mu itumba bakanafata umwanya wo kongera gutegura imirima guhanga ibyobo byogufata amazi y'isuri ashobora gutwara imyaka no kuraza ubutaka.\nIbibihe byose byari bishingiye kubuhanga gakondo bwo kumenya nogutegura ubuhinzi bashingiye ku kirere, aho abahinzi bakoreshaga ibikoresho byoroshye nk'isuka, imihoro, agataro ndetse nimbaragazabo. nubwo ububuhinzi bwateye imbere, ubu buryo bwoguhinga ukurikije ibihe by'imvura n'izuba bwarangaga u Rwanda rwo hambere."}
{"id": "22276", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22276", "title": "Kanjogera", "text": "Kanjongera yari umugabekazi kumazina yibwami yitwaga Kanjogera akaba yari nyina w'umwami Yuhi V Musinga, azwiho kuba umugore wari ufite imbaraga n\u2019ijambo rikomeye mu mitegekere y\u2019igihugu cyu Rwanda. Yagize uruhare mu bihe bikomeye by\u2019amateka harimo no guhangana n\u2019abakoloni.\nAmateka.\nNyirayuhi Kanjogera yatwaranye ingoma n\u2019abami nka Mibambwe IV Rutalindwa, ndese n\u2019umuhungu we Yuhi V Musinga, kuva ku wa 15 Nzeri 1895 kugeza ku wa 12 Ugushyingo 1931, ubwo umwami Musinga na Nyirayuhi Kanjogera wari umubereye umugabekazi, babacaga ku bwami.Mu rufatiro rw\u2019ibinyoma byifashishijwe mu mpinduramatwara ikuraho ubwami, hari n\u2019ibinyoma byafatiwe kuri Kanjogera by\u2019uko yashakaga guhagukura, agafata inkota akayishinga mu nda z\u2019abana b\u2019abahutu, akabapfumura akabona guhaguruka."}
{"id": "22277", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22277", "title": "Nyagakecuru wa Bwanacyambwe", "text": "Nyagakecuru wa Bwanacyambwe ni umugore w'abayeho kera cyane mu Rwanda ahari nubwo amateka ye avugwa mu buryo bw\u2019imigani, azwi nka umugore w\u2019imbaraga wari utuye ku musozi wa Huye akaba yararwanyije abami b\u2019u Rwanda akoresheje uburyo bw\u2019amayeri n'ubumanyi.\nImyifatire.\nNyagakecuru wa Bwanacyambwe ubundi yari azwiho kuba umugore w'umunyabwenge, umupfumu ukomeye, kandi w'intwari wari ukomeye ku buryo umwami Ruganzu Ndoli yagorwa no kumutsinda ndetse akaba yaramutinyaga cyane, Ubu aho yari atuye habaye ahantu nyaburanga hasurwa."}
{"id": "22278", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22278", "title": "Mujawamahoro Marie Chantal", "text": "Mujawamahoro Marie Chantal ni umugore akabaya yari umunyeshuri mu ikigo cy'inyange, akaba ari umwe mu banyeshuri b'intwari bishwe n'abacengezi mu mwaka wa 1997 i Nyange, ubu ni mu karere ka Ngororero, bakaba barishwe bazira kwanga kwitandukanya nk'Abahutu n'Abatutsi, ahubwo bagahitamo kuvuga ko bose ari Abanyarwanda.\nIntwari.\nMujawamahoro Marie Chantal yishwe azira ubutwari bwo kubumbatira ubumwe bw'Abanyarwanda n'ubutwari bwo kwanga gucikamo ibice, yari atuye muri segiteri Nyange."}
{"id": "22280", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22280", "title": "Mbanza Chance", "text": "Mbanza Chance ni umugore Ben Serugo, akaba aribo bagize itsinda rya (Ben &amp; Chance) akaba azwi cyane mu Rwanda mu ndirimbo zo kuramya no guhimbaza Imana.\nIndirimbo.\nBakaba bari gutegura igitaramo muri BK Arena aho Ben na Chance bateganyije gukora igitaramo cyiswe Easter Jubilee kizabera muri BK Arena ku itariki ya 05 Mata 2026, bakaba bafite indirimbo zitanduaknye."}
{"id": "22281", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22281", "title": "Hirwa Benie Christella", "text": "Hirwa Benie Christella uzwi nka Christella ni umunyamakuru w'umunyarwandakazi ukorera ikiganiro Ishya gitambuka kuri YouTube. Ni umwe mu bagore bane agikoraho aribo Aissa, Mich\u00e8le, Cyuzuzo, na Christella bayobora iki kiganiro gisesengura imibereho n'ubuzima busanzwe.\nUbuzima.\nHirwa Benie Christella ubusanzwe akora muri Phalumaci, akaba arinabyo yize mu mashuri makuru ya kaminuza, gusa abifatanya no gukora itangazamakuru."}
{"id": "22282", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22282", "title": "Mukazayire Nelly", "text": "Mukazayire Nelly yavutse ku babyeyi b'Abanyarwanda mu Rwanda muri 1982. ni minisitit ushinzwe siporo mu Rwanda. \nAmasomo.\nMukazayire Nelly yize amashuri abanza nayisumbuye mu Rwanda. Afite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cy'akabili cya kaminuza mu bukungu mpuzamahanga, Afite kandi impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu cy\u2019iciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza mu micungire y\u2019ubukungu yakuye muri kaminuza ya Makerere, mu gihugu cy\u2019abaturanyi cya Uganda.\nAkazi.\nMukazayire akora umuyobozi wa leta nka abaminisitiri kuva mu Kwakira 2018, yagizwe umuyobozi mukuru wa Biro y\u2019amasezerano y\u2019u Rwanda, ishami rya leta. Kuri ubu, ari ku rwego rwa Minisitiri w\u2019igihugu."}
{"id": "22283", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22283", "title": "Urwina rw'ibitoki", "text": "Urwina rw\u2019ibitoki mu muco nyarwanda ni igice cy\u2019ingenzi cy\u2019umuco w\u2019ubuhinzi bw'ibitoki n\u2019imihango y\u2019imiryango. Ibitoki byari ifunguro rikomeye kandi ry\u2019ingirakamaro, kandi urwina rwabyo rwafatwaga nk\u2019ikimenyetso cy\u2019umugisha n\u2019ubutunzi mu muryango nya Rwanda. Ubuhinzi bw'urutoki bwafatwaga nkimwe munkingi ngandura rugo ndetse no mukwihaza kubiribwa ariko bikomoka kunsina ndetse nogusabana kwimiryango.\nUrwina rw'ibitoki nirwo rwifashishwaga mukugirango babashe kubyaza urutoki inzoga mu ibitoki byabaga byeze nkumusaruro nkumusaruro warukomotsemo. kugeza nubu nubwo harikuza ikoranabuhanga mubijyanye no gutara ibitoki tuzi nka(smart urwina) hari bamwe mubanyarwa bakirukoresho mukubyaza umusaruro ubuhinzi bw'urutoki.\nMu guhuza ubuzima bwa buri munsi, urwina rw\u2019ibitoki rwakoreshwaga mu buryo butandukanye. Abanyarwanda bo hambere babikoraga kugira ngo barusheho kugira umusaruro mwiza kandi urambye uturutse munsina. Urwina rw\u2019ibitoki rwari rufite uburyo bwo kubika no gutunganya ibitoki mbere yo kubirya cyangwa kubigurisha, rugashyirwa ahantu haboneye kandi hameze neza, rugashyirwaho ibikoresho by\u2019umwimerere n\u2019isuku. Ibi byari bigamije kurinda ko ibitoki byangirika, bigatuma umuryango ukomeza kugira ubushobozi bwo kubona ifunguro ryiza.\nMu migenzo y\u2019imihango, urwina rw\u2019ibitoki rwafatwaga nkahantu cyangwa nk\u2019igikoresho cy\u2019ingenzi mu mihango y\u2019ubukwe, ubusabane, n\u2019amasabukuru y\u2019umuryango. Hari ubwo ibitoki byavugwaga mu buryo bw\u2019icyubahiro mu mihango yo gusangira cyangwa gutanga impano, bigaragaza umugisha, ubutunzi, n\u2019icyubahiro cy\u2019umuryango watanze ibitoki. Gutanga urwina rw\u2019ibitoki byashimangiraga ubumwe n\u2019ubusabane hagati y\u2019imiryango, kandi byari bimwe mu bimenyetso by\u2019uburumbuke.\nMu myemerere y\u2019iyobokamana n\u2019umuco, urwina rw\u2019ibitoki rwafatwaga nk\u2019ikimenyetso cy\u2019umugisha w\u2019Imana cyangwa w\u2019abakurambere. Kubika, gutunganya no kurufata neza urwina rw\u2019ibitoki, byari uburyo bwo kugaragaza ko umuryango wubaha imihango n\u2019umuco, ndetse bikanafasha mu gukomeza gutunganya imyaka neza.\nMuri make urwina rw\u2019ibitoki ntabwo rwari urw\u2019ifatizo gusa mu ifunguro, ahubwo rwari igice cy\u2019ingenzi cy\u2019umuco, umugisha n\u2019ubutunzi bw\u2019umuryango. Rugaragazaga uko Abanyarwanda bo hambere ndetse nabubu babona ifunguro, ubutunzi, n\u2019imihango yabo, ndetse n\u2019uburyo bwo kubyaza umusaruro muburyo bunoze ubuhinzi bw\u2019urutoki."}
{"id": "22284", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22284", "title": "Uwicyeza Pamela", "text": "Uwicyeza Pamella (yavutse 31 Mutarama 2000)ni umunyarwandakazi uzwi cyane nk'umugore w'umuhanzi witwa Mugisha Benjamin, uzwi nka The Ben. Pamella Uwicyeza yitabiriye amarushanwa ya Miss Rwanda mu 2019, aho yaje mu bakobwa 20 ba nyuma. Yavukiye mu Rwanda, bakaba bafitanye umwana umwe witwa Lunah. \nUbuzima.\nUwicyeza Pamella yize amashuri abanza ndetse yiga n'amashuri yisumbuye mu bijyanye n'Amateka, Ubukungu n'Ubumenyi bw'Isi (HEG) kuri APADE ku Kicukiro, yitabiriye Miss Rwanda 2019, ahagarariye Intara y'Amajyepfo, yabaye Igisonga cya Mbere cya Miss Zuri Africa Queen 2019, rero tariki 18 Werurwe 2025, nibwo yatangaje ko yibarutse imfura ye na The Ben."}
{"id": "22285", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22285", "title": "Ubudehe", "text": "Ubudehe mu muco gakondo w\u2019Abanyarwanda ugamije gufashanya hagati y\u2019abaturage bu Rwanda mu bikorwa bitandukanye. Mugihe cyohambere, abaturarwanda bafatanyaga mu mirimo y\u2019ubuhinzi, ubworozi, kubaka amazu, ndetse no mu gihe cy\u2019ibibazo by\u2019umuryango cyangwa igihugu. Ubudehe ntago bwari busanzwe nk\u2019akazi gusa, ahubwo bwari ikimenyetso cy\u2019ubufatanye, ubumwe n\u2019ubusabane mu muryango no mu baturanyi.\nMu muryango.\nMu muryango nyarwanda, ubudehe bwari uburyo bwo gushyigikirana no kwita ku mibereho y\u2019abagize umuryango nyarwanda. Abagize umuryango bafashaga umwe kuw'undi mu gihe cyo guhinga, gusarura, cyangwa kubaka inzu. Ibi byatumaga abantu bakura, bakamenya gukorana neza, gufashanya, no kwiyubakira icyizere mu muryango. Ubudehe bwarimo kandi inyigisho ku kubaha abakuze no kurera abana mu bufatanye burambye hagati yabatuye umuryango nyarwanda. Mu muryango byari uburyo bwo kuganira, gufashanya no gusangira ibitekerezo ku mibereho y\u2019umudugudu. Umuntu wese yashoboraga gutanga icyo ashoboye, yaba ari imbaraga, ubumenyi, cyangwa ibikoresho.\nIndangagaciro z'ubudehe.\nUbudehe bwari bushingiye ku ndagaciro mu banyarwanda nku:\nUbumwe: guhuriza hamwe imbaraga mu nyungu z\u2019abaturage rusange\nUbufatanye: kuzamurana mu buryo rusange aho kuba inyungu yawe bwite gusa.\nUbupfura n\u2019icyubahiro: kubahana hagati yabavandimwe, abakuru n\u2019abaturanyi.\nGusangira: kugabana umusaruro n\u2019ibyo umuntu yagezeho mu bufatanye nta mururumba hagati y'abanyarwanda.\nUbudehe bwa mu igihe cya none.\nNubwo ubu abantu benshi babona ubudehe mu buryo bw\u2019ikoranabuhanga cyangwa mu bikorwa bya leta nk\u2019akazi rusange mu mudugudu, igitekerezo nyamukuru cy\u2019ubudehe nticyahindutse, ni gufashanya no gushyigikirana hagati mubatura Rwanda ndetse n'abaturanyi. Hari n\u2019ahantu ubudehe bukoreshwa mu mishinga y\u2019ubukungu y\u2019abaturage, mu guhingira hamwe, cyangwa mu kubaka ibikorwa rusange bibateza imbere.\nMuri ikii gihe nanone Ubudehe ni gahunda yo gushyira imiryango nyarwanda mu byiciro hashingiwe ku mibereho n'ubukungu, ikoreshwa na Leta yu Rwanda mu gutanga ubufasha n'ingamba z'iterambere (nk'ubwisungane mu kwivuza, VUP, Girinka). Ubu hakoreshwa ibyiciro bitanu (A, B, C, D, E) byashyizweho mu 2021, bigamije kugaragaza abakeneye ubufasha binyuze mu ikoranabuhanga n'inyito nshyashya yubu."}
{"id": "22286", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22286", "title": "Rehema Dudu", "text": "Rehema Dudu (yavutse 25 Gicurasi)ni umugore wa Niyonzima Moses, akaba abarizwa muri Korali y\u2019i Gihogwe, anazwi mu itsinda ry\u2019abafasha umuhanzi Papi Clever uri mu muziki uhimbaza Imana, akaba n\u2019umunyamakuru kuri Life Radio ya ADEPR, Umuhango wo gusezerana imbere y\u2019Imana wabaye ku wa 14 Ugushyingo 2020.\nUbuzima.\nRehema Dudu ni umugore akaba ari umukristo mu itorero rya Adepr, akaba afite umugabo ndetse n'abana."}
{"id": "22287", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22287", "title": "Guhunika", "text": "Mu Rwanda rwohambere mu muco wabanyarwanda guhunika cyari igikorwa cy'ingenzi kandi gifite agaciro kihariye kikaba cyararebanaga n'uburyo abantu bateguraga ibiribwa cyangwa ibikoresho bagamije kugirango birambe kandi baniteganiriza ibihe byamage byabagwirira.\nGuhunika ni ukubika, gutunganya, cyangwa kurinda ibiribwa n'ibikoresho muburyo burambye kandi bwizewe kugirango birambe igihe kirekire kandi hanateganywa ko amapfa yatera bakabyifashisha. Nko mubuhinzi bafataga imyaka itandukanye nk'ibishyimbo, amasaka, imyumbati, ibitoki ndetse nibindi bitandukanye hagamijwe kugirango bazigame imbuto ndetse nibizabafasha kwihaza muribyo.\nMu muco guhunika byari nkimenyetso cyubuhanga n'ubunararibonye mu murya ngo. aho wasangaga umusaruro warabitswe neza muburyo bwoguteganyiriza ejo hazaza mu muryango, byari igikorwa cy'ubufatanye, aho ingeri zose bafatanyaga mukubungabunga ibyahunitswe.\nMu muco nyarwanda ndetse nubu ni uburyo bwo kwizigamira ugamije kubika, kurinda no gutunganya umusaruro muburyo buboneye kandi bwizewe nkigikorwa kingenze mu muryango kandi cyagaragazaga ubushishozi, icyubahiro, ubufatanye n'ubwitonzi mubanyarwanda."}
{"id": "22288", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22288", "title": "Nyambo Jesca", "text": "Nyambo Jesca ni umunyarwandakazi akaba ari umukinnyikazi wa filime mu Rwanda, uzwi ku mazina yakazi ka Nyambo cyangwa Miss Nyambo Akina mu rukurikirane rw\u2019amafilime atandukanye anyura kuri YouTube nka Ibanga cyangwa The Message, aho akunze kugaragara ari kumwe n\u2019abandi bakinnyi nka Killaman cyangwa se Niyori.\nUmwuga.\nNyambo yahawe mugihe cyashize yigeze no guhabwa igihembo nk\u2019umukinnyi mwiza wa filime w\u2019umwaka mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "22289", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22289", "title": "Muyango claudine", "text": "Muyango claudine (uzwi nka Coco yavutse wa 19 Werurwe 1997) ni umugore akaba ari umunyarwandakazi wamenyekanye cyane binyuze mu marushanwa y'ubwiza no ku mbuga nkoranyambaga akaba yarigeze guhatanira mu irishanwa ry'umbwiza missa Rwanda aba umukobwa uzi kwifotoza akaberwa neza.\nubuzima.\nMuyango claudine yavukiye mu intara ya Majyepfo y'u Rwanda ku wa 19 Werurwe 1997, yari mu irushanwa rya Nyampinga w\u2019u Rwanda mu mwaka wa 2019, aho yegukanye ikamba rya Miss Photogenike (umukobwa uzi kwifotoza akaberwa n'amafoto), Ni umugore w'umunyezamu w'ikipe y'igihugu Kimenyi Yves, bakaba bafitanye umwana w'umuhungu."}
{"id": "22290", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22290", "title": "Miss Rwanda", "text": "Miss Rwanda ni irushanwa ryitwa Miss Rwanda aho ari irushanwa ry'abakobwa beza mu Rwanda, rikaba rya ratanhiye guhatanirwa mu RWanda kuva 1993, gusa ryae ryahagaritswe by\u2019agateganyo nyuma ya 2022, bitewe n\u2019ibibazo byaje kugaragara mu mitegurirwe yaryo, bityo nta wundi nyampinga wari yatorwa kugeza uyu munsi.\nBanyampinga.\ngusa nyampinga wa mbere w'u Rwanda yabaye Dalila Uwera hari mu mwaka wa 1993."}
{"id": "22291", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22291", "title": "Kwizera Emelyne", "text": "Kwizera Emelyne, uzwi ku mazina ya Ishanga, (yavutse mu 2002) ni umukobwa akaba ari umunyarwandakazi wamenyekanye ku mbuga nkoranyambaga biturutse ku mashusho y\u2019urukozasoni yagiye asakaza, gusa muri Mutarama 2025 yage gupfugwa, akaba ayoboye itsinda ryitwa Rich Gang.\nGufungwa.\nKwizera Emelyne yatawe muri yombi tariki 17-20 Mutarama 2025, afungirwa kuri sitasiyo za RIB zitandukanye, kubera gahunda z'urukozasoni., gusa nyuma yo gufungurwa yaje kwakira agakiza "}
{"id": "22292", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22292", "title": "Imivugo n'indirimbo by'inka", "text": "Imivugo n\u2019indirimbo by\u2019inka ni kimwe mu bice by\u2019ingenzi by\u2019umuco nyarwanda, byerekana neza urukundo, icyubahiro n\u2019agaciro Abanyarwanda bahaga inka. Mu Rwanda rwo hambere, inka ntiyari itungo risanzwe gusa kandi nomuri kinogihe, ahubwo yari ikimenyetso cy\u2019ubutunzi, uburumbuke n\u2019ishema ry\u2019umuryango. Ni yo mpamvu abantu bayihimbazaga bayivuga mu buryo bwihariye, bakoresheje imivugo n\u2019indirimbo.\nMu bisobanuro byimbitse, imivugo y\u2019inka ni amagambo ahimbwe mu buryo bw\u2019ubuhanzi, agaragaza imiterere, ubwiza n\u2019imico y\u2019inka. Umworozi yashimagizaga inka ye ayivuga imyato, ayigereranya n\u2019ibintu byiza karemano bidukikije hano mw'isi. Ibi byari uburyo bwo kugaragaza ko inka ifite agaciro gakomeye, ndetse bikanafasha umworozi kuyitaho no kuyishimira. Imivugo y\u2019inka yigishaga kandi kuvuga neza no gutunganya amagambo akoreshwa muburyo bwokuyitaho.\nKu rundi ruhande, indirimbo z\u2019inka zari indirimbo zicurangwa cyangwa ziririmbwa n\u2019aborozi igihe baragiye, bakama cyangwa baruhuka. Izi ndirimbo zagaragazaga ibyishimo, ituze n\u2019urukundo bafitiye inka zabo. Zafashaga no gutuza inka, kuko byemerwaga ko inka yumva amajwi y\u2019umworozi wayo, bityo igatuza cyangwa ikongera amata. Indirimbo z\u2019inka zari n\u2019uburyo bwo gusabana no gusangira umuco hagati y\u2019aborozi.\nImivugo n\u2019indirimbo by\u2019inka byari bifite kandi uruhare mu kurinda no gukomeza umuco. Byifashishwaga mu kwigisha abakiri bato amateka, indangagaciro n\u2019imyitwarire myiza. Abana bigaga kuvuga imivugo no kuririmba indirimbo, bigatuma bakura bazi kubaha inka, gukunda umurimo no kubaha umuco wabo. Ibi byafashaga mu gukomeza umuco nyarwanda no kuwurinda gusenyuka.\nMu ncamake, imivugo n\u2019indirimbo by\u2019inka ni uburyo bw\u2019ubuhanzi bwagaragazaga urukundo n\u2019icyubahiro Abanyarwanda bahaga inka, kandi bikagira uruhare mu myigire, mu busabane no mu kubungabunga umuco. Nka kimwe mu bimenyetso by\u2019ingenzi byerekana uko inka zari ishingiro ry\u2019ubuzima n\u2019umuco nyarwanda.\nurugero rw'indirimbo z\u2019inka zaririmbwaga n\u2019abashumba cyane cyane igihe baragiye cyangwa bakama:\n\u201cNgwino nka yanjye nziza, Ngwino nkwamire amata meza, Uri umutungo wanjye,Uri ibyishimo byanjye.\u201d\nIyi ndirimbo, Ihamagara inka mu buryo bwuje urukundo n'isano hagati y\u2019umushumba n\u2019inka\nIndi ndirimbo ishobora kumvikana itya:\u201cInka zanjye nziza zirabyagiye,Zirantunga, ziratanga, Iyo ziri murwuri aba ari amahoro.\nImivugo y\u2019inka yabaga igizwe n\u2019amagambo meza, yuzuye ishimwe n\u2019ubwiza bw'inka.\nurugero: Inka yanjye ni iya gaciro, Iteye ishema ku gasozi,Ifite amabere yuzuye amata, Ni ishema ry\u2019umuryango wanjye."}
{"id": "22293", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22293", "title": "Mukagatete Emeline", "text": "Mukagatete Emeline ni umunyarwandakazi akaba ari umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru ukina nka rutahizamu mu ikipe ya Rayon Sports Women Football Club mu Rwanda.\nIbitego.\nMukagatete Emeline Azwiho kuba rutahizamu utanga umusaruro mu mikino ikomeye, ndetse ni rutahizamu ukina muri iyi kipe y'abagore ya Rayon Sports anyuza ku kuguru kwiburyo, kandi yatsinze igitego ikipe y' Indahangarwa WFC mu gikombe cy'Ubutwari ndetse yanatsinze muri FERWAFA Super Cup 2025."}
{"id": "22294", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22294", "title": "Umunyarwandakazi", "text": "Umunyarwandakazi ubundi ni ijambo ry'Ikinyarwanda risobanura umugore cyangwa umukobwa ukomoka mu Rwanda cyangwa se ufite inkomoka y'umwe mu bayeyi biwe bakomok mu Rwanda, Bagaragaza umuco binyuze mu mwambaro gakondo nku mushanana.cyangwa Ishabure.\nUmwenegihugu.\nUmunyarwandakazi ni Iri jambo rikoreshwa ku banyagihugu bose b'igitsina gore bafite ubwenegihugu bw'u Rwanda, baba batuye imbere cyangwa hanze y'igihugu, bazwiho kurangwa n'umuco nyarwanda, gukunda umurimo, n'uburanga."}
{"id": "22295", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22295", "title": "Ihirwe Regine", "text": "Ihirwe Regine (yavutse 2006) ni umunyarwandakazi akaba ari n'umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka mu Rwanda, ukina kuruhande rw'inyuma ibumoso muri bannyugariro mu ikipe ya Rayon Sports y'abagore.\nUbuhanga.\nIhirwe Regine yaje kumenyekanye cyane mu mwaka wa 2025/2026 ubwo yavaga muri ikipe ya APR FC y'abagore yerekeza muri Rayon Sports nyuma y'urubanza rurerure."}
{"id": "22296", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22296", "title": "Imibereho y'inka mu Rwanda", "text": "Mu Rwanda rwakera, inka zari umutima w\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019Abanyarwanda. Ntizafatwaga gusa nk\u2019itungo, ahubwo zari ikimenyetso cy\u2019ubutunzi, icyubahiro n\u2019ishema ry\u2019umuryango. Umuntu wagiraga inka nyinshi yubahwaga mu bandi, kandi inka zakoreshwaga mu mibereho yose, zatangaga amata yo kunywa, zigatanga inkwano kubageni, ndetse zikaba n\u2019impano yo kubaka ubucuti hagati y\u2019imiryango. Inka zari zifite n\u2019agaciro mu mihango y\u2019umuco, aho zaririmbirwaga, zigahimbwa mu mivugo, ndetse zigahabwa amazina yihariye.\nImibereho y\u2019inka muri icyo gihe yari ishingiye ku kwahura inka zikarishiriza kugasozi. Inka zaragirwaga ku misozi n\u2019ahari ubwatsi bwinshi, zikabaho mu bwisanzure. Abashumba bazitaho buri munsi, baziririmbira indirimbo, bakazivuga imivugo, banazirinda indwara. Kwita ku nka byari igikorwa cy\u2019icyubahiro, kandi habagaho imigenzo myinshi ijyanye n\u2019isuku yazo, gukama amata, no kuzitaho mu buryo bwitondewe. Inka zari zifitanye isano ikomeye n\u2019umuntu ku buryo zafatwaga nkizigize umuryango.\nMu Rwanda rw\u2019ubu, imibereho y\u2019inka yarahindutse kubera iterambere n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ubuzima. Ubu hakunze gukoreshwa uburyo bwo kororera mu biraro, aho inka zitagisohoka cyane, ahubwo zororerwa mu biraro zigahabwa ubwatsi n\u2019amazi byateguwe neza. Ibi byatumye habaho kongera umusaruro w\u2019amata, kurinda ubutaka kwangirika, no gukoresha ubumenyi bugezweho mu korora. Aborozi bakoresha imiti, inkingo n\u2019ubuvuzi bwa kijyambere mu kurinda indwara.\nNubwo uburyo bwo korora bwahindutse, inka ziracyafite agaciro gakomeye mu muco nyarwanda. Ziracyari ikimenyetso cy\u2019iterambere n\u2019imibereho myiza, kandi ziracyakoreshwa mu bintu bimwe na bimwe by\u2019umuco nko gutanga inkwano cyangwa kwakiriza abashyitsi amata. Hari na gahunda z\u2019igihugu zishyigikira ubworozi bw\u2019inka, zigaragaza ko zigifite uruhare runini mu guteza imbere imibereho myiza y\u2019abaturage.\nu Rwanda rwakera inka zari zifite uruhare rukomeye mu muco n\u2019imibereho ya buri munsi, zigahabwa icyubahiro gikomeye kandi zikabaho mu bwisanzure ku gasozi. Mu Rwanda rw\u2019ubu, nubwo uburyo bwo kuyorora bwahindutse bugana ku ikoranabuhanga n\u2019iterambere, agaciro n\u2019icyubahiro cy\u2019inka mu muco nyarwanda biracyahari kandi birakomeje.\nMu Rwanda rwakera, hariho inka zizwi cyane nk\u2019inyambo. Izi nka zari iz\u2019agaciro gakomeye cyane, cyane cyane mu bwami. Zatoranywaga hashingiwe ku bwiza bwazo: amahembe maremare, umubiri mwiza, n\u2019imiterere itandukanye. Inyambo ntizari izo gutanga amata menshi cyane, ahubwo zari izo gushimisha no kugaragaza icyubahiro n\u2019ubwami. Zaririmbirwaga indirimbo, zigahimbwa imivugo, kandi zikitabwaho mu buryo bwihariye cyane.\nInyambo zari zifite uruhare rukomeye mu mihango y\u2019ubwami n\u2019umuco. Zakoreshwaga mu birori bikomeye, zigatambagizwa mu buryo bw\u2019icyubahiro, ndetse zikaba ikimenyetso cy\u2019ubutware bw\u2019Umwami. Abantu bazitagaho cyane, bakaziririmbira indirimbo zidasanzwe, bigatuma zimenyerana n\u2019abantu ndetse zigahora zituje kandi zifite isuku.\nMu Rwanda rw\u2019ubu, habaho ubwoko bw\u2019inka bwahindutse kandi bwinshi. Ubu aborozi bibanda cyane ku nka zitanga amata menshi n\u2019umusaruro mwinshi, nk\u2019inka z\u2019ikomoka mumahanga nk\u2019izivanze n\u2019iz\u2019iwacu. Izi nka ntizitwarwa cyane ku bwiza cyangwa imiterere nk\u2019uko byari bimeze ku nyambo, ahubwo harebwa umusaruro amata menshi, gukura vuba, n\u2019inyungu mu bukungu.\nNanone kandi, inka zo muri iki gihe zororerwa mu buryo bwa kijyambere (nko mu biraro), zigahabwa ubwatsi bwateguwe neza, imiti n\u2019inkingo, bigatuma zitanga umusaruro uhagije. Ubu ubworozi bwibanda ku guteza imbere ubukungu bw\u2019umuryango n\u2019igihugu, aho kuba gusa ikimenyetso cy\u2019umuco n\u2019icyubahiro.\nAriko nubwo hari izi mpinduka, inyambo ziracyafite agaciro mu muco nyarwanda. Zigaragara mu birori by\u2019umuco, mu bukerarugendo no mu kwibuka amateka y\u2019u Rwanda. Zikomeza kwibutsa Abanyarwanda inkomoko yabo n\u2019uburyo inka zari zifite agaciro gakomeye mu mibereho ya kera."}
{"id": "22297", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22297", "title": "Imigenzo y'isuku ku inka", "text": "Imigenzo y\u2019isuku ku nka mu muco nyarwanda yari ingenzi cyane, kuko inka zafatwaga nk\u2019umutungo w\u2019agaciro kandi zigahabwa icyubahiro gikomeye. Isuku ntiyari igamije gusa kurinda ubuzima bw\u2019inka, ahubwo yari n\u2019ikimenyetso cy\u2019umuco, ubupfura n\u2019imibereho myiza y\u2019umuryango.\nMu Rwanda rwo hambere, isuku y\u2019inka yakorwaga burimunsi. Aborozi bahanaguraga inka zabo, bakazisukura umubiri wose kugira ngo zikureho umwanda n\u2019udukoko. Ibi byakorwaga cyane cyane mu gitondo cyangwa nimugoroba, bigafasha inka kumererwa neza no kwirinda indwara. Inka isukuye yafatwaga nk\u2019ikimenyetso cy\u2019umworozi wita ku mutungo we kandi wubaha umuco.\nIkindi gikomeye ni isuku y\u2019ikiraro. Ibiraro by\u2019inka byagombaga guhorana isuku, bikurwamo amase zabaga zataye mukiraro buri gihe, bigasukurwamo amazi cyangwa bikubakirwa mu buryo butuma umwanda utinjiramo. Ibi byafashaga kurinda indwara no gutuma inka zibaho neza. Kandi umworozi wabaga afite ikiraro gisukuye yubahwaga mu bandi, kuko byagaragazaga ko afite gahunda n\u2019ubwitonzi.\nMu muco nyarwanda, isuku y\u2019amata n\u2019ibikoresho byayo na yo yari ingenzi cyane. Icyansi n\u2019ibindi bikoresho byakoreshwaga mu gukama byabanzaga guhanagurwa cyangwa kozwa kugira ngo bisukure kandi biha amata impumuro nziza. Ibi byerekana ko isuku y\u2019inka itandukanye n\u2019isuku y\u2019amata, ariko byose byahuriraga ku kwita ku mutungo w\u2019inka.\nNanone kandi, kwita ku ruhu n\u2019imiterere y\u2019inka byari igice cy\u2019isuku. Aborozi bakuragaho udusazi, bakayihanagura, zicanirwa amafumba kubiraro yirukana amazi ndetse bakayitaho kugira ngo igire umubiri mwiza n\u2019uburanga bushimishije. Ibi byari ingenzi cyane ku nka zifite agaciro nk\u2019inyambo, kuko zo zar'izigaragaza n'icyubahiro cy\u2019umuryango cyangwa cy\u2019ubwami.\nIkindi ni uko inka zanywaga amazi meza hafukurwa ibibumbiro zinyweramo,kandi zigahabwa ubwatsi bwiza kuturiro twabugenewe. Isuku ntiyarebaga hanze gusa, ahubwo yanarebaga ku byo inka zirya n\u2019ibyo zinywa ndetse nibyo ziryamira. Ibi byafashaga inka kugira ubuzima bwiza no gutanga amata meza kandi menshi. imigenzo y'isuku ku nka mu muco nyarwanda yari igamije: kurinda ubuzima, kongera umusaruro w'amata, kugaragaza icyubahiro n'ubutunzi bw'umuryango, gutoza abantu ubwitonzi n'isuku mu mibereho yabo. Ibi byose bigaragaza ko mu muco nyarwanda, isuku y\u2019inka yari igice cy\u2019indangagaciro z\u2019imibereho myiza, kandi ko kwita ku nka byafatwaga nk\u2019inshingano ikomeye.\nMu muco nyarwanda, hari ibintu byinshi byari bibujijwe gukorwa ku nka, cyane cyane ibirebana n\u2019isuku n\u2019imibereho yayo, kuko inka yafatwaga nk\u2019umutungo w\u2019agaciro kandi wubahwa. Muribyo harimo: Kureka inka mu mwanda, Kudakaraba ibikoresho by\u2019amata, Gukama inka wanduye ndetse no kureka inka igira udukoko n'indwara byafatwaga nkokudaha umutung agaciro."}
{"id": "22298", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22298", "title": "Kubogora Amata", "text": "Kubogora amata mu muco wabanyarwa nigikorwa gifatwa nko kumena amata utari ugambiriye kuyamena hasi, mugihe wabaga winikije uri mugikorwa cyo gukama, urikuyabuganiza uyavana mucyansi uyabuganiza mukindi ndetse niyo wabaga urimogukama winikije inka igatera umugeri amata akameneka bavukako inka yateye umugeri ikabogora amata.\nMu mumuco wabanyarwanda iyo umennye amata wabigambiriye nabyo bifite indi nyito itandukanye no ku yabogora."}
{"id": "22299", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22299", "title": "Kubyarira amata", "text": "Kubyarira amata mu muco nyarwanda bikorwana naborozi b'inka kuko ni umugenzo ukorwa mugihe amata yabaga yakamwe akabuganizwa mucyansi agaterekwa kuruhimbi, iyo habagabo impamvu ituma ayo mata ahumana cyangwa iyo yaterekwaga agamijwe kuba yanyobwa ari ikivuguto hanyuma akarinda agera ubwo ahinduka umushari barayafata bakayamena kubushake bwabo bitewe nizo mpamvu twavuze hejuri nibyo byitwa kubyariira amata cyangwa kubikira amata."}
{"id": "22301", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22301", "title": "Ingoro y'Umwami", "text": "Mu mateka n'umuco by'u Rwanda, ingoro yari inzu cyangwa urusobe rw'inyubako zidasanzwe zabagamo umwami, ariko si aho yabaga gusa yari nkikimenyetso cy'ubutegetsi, ubusugire bw'igihugu n'umuco nyarwanda. Ingoro y'umwami yabaga ari ahantu hatoranijwe neza kugirango hagaragaze icyubahiro n'icyerekezo cy'ubwami. Yubakwaga hakoreshejwe ibikoresho by'umwimerere nk'ibiti, ibyatsi ariko hubahirizwa imiterere yihariye.\nIgenamiterere ry'ingoro ryakurikizaga gahunda ituma habaho ubwirinzi, ituze n'imigendekere myiza y'uzima bw'ibwami, aho buri gice cyabaga gifite inshingano yihariye. Impamvu umwami yabaga mu ngoro nk'iyi ni uko yagombaga kuba ahantu hamurinda, hamugaragaza nk'umuyobozi w'igihugu kandi hakana mworohereza kuyobora abaturage, kwakira abashyitsi n'abatware, no gukorera imihango y'umuco n'ubutegetsi.\nIngoro y\"umwami yari ifite ibintu byihariye byayitandukanyaga n'izindi nzu zisanzwe. Yabaga ifite ubwirinzi bukomeye, gahunda y'abantu bayibagamo harimo abiru, abagaragu, abarinzi, abashumba ndetse n'abagore b'umwami n'i,igenzo yihariye y'aho buriwese yabaga yemerewe kugera.\nyari fite kandi imitako n'imiterere igaragaza ubwiza n'icubahiro by'ibwami, ndetse n'ahantu ho gukorera imihango y'umuco nk'imivugo, indirimbo nindi mihango y'ibwami."}
{"id": "22302", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22302", "title": "Uwanyirigira Sifa Aimee", "text": "Uwanyirigira Sifa Aimee ni umukinnyi w'umukobwa akaba ari umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'umunyarwandakazi ukina mu ikipe ya Rayon Sports Women FC akaba akina mu bamwugariro..\nUmwuga.\nUwanyirigira Sifa Aimee muri 2024 n'intangiriro za 2025, aho yatoranyijwe nk'umwe mu bakandida b'umukinnyi w'ukwezi muri rayon sports y'abagore."}
{"id": "22303", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22303", "title": "Nyirandagijimana Diane", "text": "Nyirandagijimana Diane ni umukobwa akaba ari umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'umunyarwandakazi akaba yarakinnye mu ikipe ya AS Kigali WFC, aho yagaragaye nk'umukinnyi ukina mu kibuga hagati ubu akaba ari umukinnyi ubu wa reyon sport y'abagore.\nUmwuga.\nNyirandagijimana Diane yaje gusinyishwa na Rayon Sports WFC mu ntangiriro za 2025, akaba yarakinanye na Sifa Uwanyirigira muri iyo kipe ya AS KIGALI."}
{"id": "22304", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22304", "title": "Kalisa Winnie", "text": "Kalisa Winnie ni umunyarwandakazi w\u2019umuhanzi ukora ibihangano mu ibumba (ceramics) kandi akaba n\u2019umushoramari mu buhanzi. Yavukiye kandi akurira mu Rwanda. Kalisa Winnie ni umuhanzi wiyigishije (self-taught ceramist). Yize gukora ibumba yifashishije amasomo yo kuri YouTube, cyane cyane mu gihe cya COVID-19.\nIbikorwa bye n\u2019iterambere.\nKalisa Winnie ni uwashinze Laini Studio, aho akorera ibihangano bye ndetse anigisha abandi ubukorikori. Yafunguye Laini Studio mu 2019 kandi izwiho guhuza ubuhanzi bwa kera n\u2019ubugezweho.\nYavuzwe mu bantu bahindura urwego rw\u2019ubuhanzi mu Rwanda, aho: yitwa \u201cself-taught ceramist uplifting local pottery traditions.\u201d"}
{"id": "22305", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22305", "title": "Nyirarunyonga", "text": "Nyirarunyonga yari umugore w'umusingakazi w'igishegabo mumateka y'u Rwanda yari atuye ku Rugarika rwa Kigese na Mbirizi muri Rukoma, ahahoze hitwa i Gitarama ubu ni mumajyepfo. ubu ni mukarere ka Kamonyi, ku ngoma ya Yuhi Gahindiro mu mwaka w'i 1700. Yari umupfakazi ariko afite abakwe n'abakazana. Nyirarunyonga ntiyigeze abura igisubizo ku kibazo cyose yabazwaga, kandi yasaga n'udasanzwe ugereranije n'abandi bagore bo mugihe cye.\nNyirarunyonga ubwo abahigi bari babyukije imbogo i KIgese mu nkuka ya Nyabarongo igeze mu kadasaya ka Ngoma, abagore baje kuyireba batangarira ukuntu ari inyamanswa nini, banatangira kugira impungenge z'abagabo babo bari bayikurikiye.\nariko Nyirarunyonga ntiyaterwa ubwoba n'imbogo, we yabonaga inyama kubera ko yari yarukanywe n'abagabo b'ibigwi. Niko kubwira abo bagore ati \"Nimujyende Mwanike amasaka musye, mu bone icyo muri burishe inyama. Burya mubana n'abagabo mutazi!\" Aha ninaho havuye wa mugani ugira uti \" agakurikiwe n'abagabo...\".\nIbikorwa bya Nyirarunyonga.\nNyirarunyonga azwi ho ibikorwa byinshi bitandukanye byatumye yitwa uwo kurubu (shuga mami wa mbere). Yakundaga gusamabana n'abana babasore bakiri bato, maze ubwo abagore bagenzi be baje kumunegura impamvu asambana n'abana abyaye, arabasubiza ati:\" Ntamupfakazi ugaya imboro.\" Nyirarunyonga kandi yaje kwudukana ingeso yo gusamabana n'abakwe be. Aha naho abagore bagenzi be baje kumubaza impamvu ashaka gusenyera abakobwa be, na none arabasubiza ati \" Ntago arigusamba ahubwo mba mbatinyura\"."}
{"id": "22307", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22307", "title": "Nibagwire Sifa Gloria", "text": "Nibagwire Sifa Gloria (yavutse 14 Kanama 1982) ni umugore akaba umunyarwandakazi aho ari umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru mu Rwanda akaba na kapiteni w'ikipe y'Igihugu ya mavubi y'abagore n'abakobwa.\nUbuzima.\nNibagwire Sifa Gloria yavutse ku wa 14 Kanama 1982. Yakiniye amakipe akomeye mu Rwanda arimo AS Kigali, Scandinavia WFC, ndetse na Indahangarwa WFC, Yabaye kapiteni w'ikipe y'igihugu guhera mu mwaka wa 2018, asimbuye Shadia Uwamahoro wari wavunitse.\nUmwuga.\nNibagwire Sifa Gloria yinjiye mu mwuga w\u2019ubutoza kandi akora no muri Komisiyo ishinzwe iterambere rya ruhago ya bagore mu banyamuryango bo muri FERWAFA, ubu ari gufasha mu mishinga itandukanye igamije kuzamura impano z'abato."}
{"id": "22308", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22308", "title": "Mwizerwa Angelique", "text": "Mwizerwa Angelique ni umugore akaba umunyarwandakazi aho ari umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru mu Rwanda akaba na kapiteni w'ikipe y'Igihugu ya mavubi y'abakobwa."}
{"id": "22309", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22309", "title": "Mutuyemariya Florentine", "text": "Mutuyemariya Florentine cyangwa se Kalaba, ni umunyarwandakazi akaba ari umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru ukina mu ikipe y'abagore ya AS Kigali WFC.\nUmwuga.\nMutuyemariya Florentine yamenyekanye nk'umukinnyi ufite ubuhanga, aho yafunguye amazamu mu mukino wa Shampiyona y'Abagore y'Icyiciro cya Mbere, aho AS Kigali yatsinze Bugesera WFC."}
{"id": "22310", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22310", "title": "Niyomungeri Peace Olga", "text": "Niyomungeri Peace Olga ni umukinyi w\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru w'abigize umwuga, kuri ubu ukina mu Rwanda mu ikipe ya Rayon Sports Women FC, akaba akina nka rutahizamu kuri numero 10.\nUmwuga.\nNiyomungeri Peace Olga Kuri ubu akina muri Rayon Sports WFC, aho yinjiye muri Mutarama 2025 avuye mu ikipe y'abagore mu ikipe y' AS Kigali, Azwi ku kabyiniriro ka Pogba kubera imikinire ye,yakiniye ikipe nka La Colombe FC yo mu Burundi n'andi makipe yo muri Uganda."}
{"id": "22311", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22311", "title": "Kwita Izina Abana b'Ingagi", "text": "Mu muco nyarwanda, umwana uvutse ahabwa izina, guha izina inyamaswa ni ukuziha agaciro, no kuzirinda kugirango zidacika.Ni Umuhango ubera mu kinigi mu karere ka Musanze hafi na pariki y'Igihugu y'Ibirunga isanzwe ibarizwamo ingagi. Ni umuhango umaze imyaka irenga 20, hakaba hamaze kwitwa abana b\u2019ingagi barenga 395. \nIbyo twamenya k'Umuhango wo Kwita Izina.\nKwita izina byatangiye mu mwaka wa 2005. Kwita Izina umuhango ubera mu Kinigi ku birenge by\u2019ibirunga.Kwita izina, \u00a0Umuhango witabiriwe na Perezida Paul Kagame. Kwita Izina (2005), Izina Byishimo, izina ry\u2019umwana w\u2019ingagi ryiswe na \u00a0Perezida Paul Kagame ku nshuro ya mbere.Kwita Izina,umuhango witabirwa n\u2019umufasha wa Perezida wa Repuburika Jeanette Kagame rimwe na rimwe.Kwita Izina wabaye umuhango ngirakamaro ku isi mu kubungabunga ibidukikije.Kwita Izina, Umuhango witabirwa n\u2019abantu bakomeye bavuye hirya no hino ku isi; abashakashatsi, abashoramari, abayobozi b\u2019ibigo, abahanzi, abakinnyi, ibyamamare mu ngeri zitandukanye.. Kwita Izina mu mwaka wa 2008 k'Inshuro 4,umuhango witabiriwe na Craig Hatkoff umuyobozi wa Wildlife Direct, umwanditsi wa Owen and Mzee. We n\u2019umukobwa we bise izina Mushya umwana w\u2019ingagi. Kwita Izina,n'umuhango wanitabiriwe n\u2019umuhanzi Oliver Ngoma muri 2008.Kwita Izina,biliyoni 12, 58 zimaze gutangwa mu gufasha abaturage baturiye pariki mu mishanga, kubaka amashuri, kubaka amavuriro, n\u2019ibiraro. Kwita Izina 2017,umuhango witabiriwe na Mugisha Benjamin (The Ben) yise izina Uruyange umwana w\u2019ingagi. Uwomwaka Kwita Izina,n'umuhango wanitabiriwe na Turahirwa Moise (Co Founder:Moshions) yise izina Kwanda.Kwita izina 2019 inshuro ya 15, witabiriwe na Amina Mohammed (Umunyamabanga wungirije w\u2019umuryango w\u2019Abibumye yise izina Ingoga umwana w\u2019ingagi.Kwita izina uwo mwaka, n'umuhango witabiriwe na Meddy, yise izina Inkoramutima umwana w\u2019ingagi. Kwita Izina 2021 k'unshuro ya 17,umuhango wabereye ku ikoranabuhanga kubera icyorezo cya COVID19. Kwita Izina 2022 (Inshuro 18), wabaye tariki ya 2 Nzeri 2022, Igikomangoma cya Walles \u00a0Charles Philip Arhur George yise izina Ubwuzuzane. Umwana wo mu muryango Muhoza. Kwita Izina 2022 (Inshuro 18),umuhango witabiriwe na Didier Drogba yise izina Ishami umwana w\u2019ingagi. Kwita Izina 2022 uwo mwaka,umuhango witabiriwe na Louise Mushikiwabo (OIF) yise izina Turikumwe, umwana wo mu muryango Ntambara. Kwita Izina 2023 ku nshuro ya 19, umuhango witabiriwe na Dr Zurab Pololikashvili uyobora UNWTO, wise izina Inshingano umwana w\u2019ingagi. Kwita Izina, umuhango uha agaciro inyamaswa z\u2019ingagi zirimo gucika ku isi ziba muri Pariki y\u2019igihugu y\u2019ibirunga. Kwita Izina uwo mwaka,n'umuhango witabiriwe na Mme Audrey Azoulay,(umuyobozi wa UNESCO) yise izina Ikirango umwana w\u2019ingagi. Kwita Izina,umuhango wo guha agaciro, abaturage baturiye pariki, abavura inyamaswa, abakora mu gusigasira ibidukikije, abashakashatsi, abarinda n\u2019abacunga parki n\u2019abandi. "}
{"id": "22312", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22312", "title": "Umutambagiro Mutagatifu", "text": "Umutambagiro mutagatifu ni igikorwa cyatangijwe na Abraham afatanyije n\u2019umuhungu we Ismail. Bavuga ko Intumwa y\u2019Imana Muhamad ari we waje gutangiza ku mugaragaro icyo gikorwa mu mwaka wa 9 wa Hijiri, ugendeye ku ndangaminsi y\u2019Abayisilamu. \nIbyo wamenya.\nUmutambagiro mutagatifu ukorerwa i Macca mu ngoro yubatswe na Abraham n\u2019umuhungu we Ismail. Abakora Umutambagiro Mutagatifu, bakora ibikorwa bitandukanye birimo amasengesho, gusura ibice bitandukanye by\u2019amateka yaranze Intumwa y\u2019Imana Muhammad no gukora indi mihango itandukanye igamije kwiyegereza Imana cyane. kandi bikaba ari itegeko kuri buri muyisilamu ufite ubushobozi bw\u2019imbaraga z\u2019umubiri n\u2019iz\u2019amafaranga. Ni itegeko rya Isilamu rireba umuntu ufite imyaka y\u2019ubukure warenze imyaka yo kwitwa umwana; si itegeko ku mwana, si itegeko kandi ku muntu ufite uburwayi bwo mu mutwe. Ikindi kandi ku badafite imbaraga z\u2019umubiri bari mu zabukuru cyangwa bafite ubumuga bw\u2019ingingo bashyiriweho uburyo bwo gukora umutambagiro aho bahabwa utugare kugira ngo babashe kuzuza iyo nkingi ya gatanu. Kandi buri gihugu kiba gifite umubare ntarengwa w\u2019abantu bacyo cyagenewe kujyana kuko bitemewe ko umuntu ajya gukora umutambagiro mutagatifu ku giti cye yijyanye atajyanye n\u2019itsinda ry\u2019abaturutse mu gihugu runaka bikaba kandi bibujijwe ko Igihugu cyajyana umunyamahanga. Mu bihe bya kera ibihugu byemererwaga gutwara abanyamahanga baza kubikuraho kuko byagaragaye ko hari abanyagihugu batabonaga ayo mahirwe kubera ko abanyamahanga babaye benshi kandi batanga amafaranga menshi kuko hari ibihugu biba bifite abayisilamu benshi ku buryo umubare bemerewe wuzura bakajya guhagurukira mu bindi bihugu biza guhagarikwa.\nInkingi Eshanu z'Idini ya Isilamu.\nUbundi hari inkingi eshanu idini ya Isilamu ishingiraho zibimburirwa n\u2019 inkinyi yo Kwemera Imana imwe rukumbi na Mohamed akaba intumwa yayo.Inkingi ya Kabiri ni Ugusenga nibura 5 ku munsi, inkingi ya gatatu ni ugutanga ituro ku muyisilamu wese ubushoboye, iryo turo rifasha abatishoboye. Inkingi ya kane ni Ugusiba mu gihe cy\u2019ukwezi, bigakorwa rimwe mu mwaka, ariko umuyisilamu ubishatse wifuza kubona ibihembo by\u2019Imana, ahobora no gusiba kenshi mu mwaka. Inkingi ya gatanu ni ugukora umutambagiro mutagatifu ubera i Maka,nibura rimwe mu buzima.Ibyo gukora umutambagiro mutagatifu i Maka, Abayisilamu babishingira ku mateka yo mu gitabo gitagatifu Korowani. Kuko aho i Maka ari ho hari inyubako ntagatifu yitwa Kaaba, ikaba yarubatswe ku itegeko ry\u2019Imana yubakwa mu gihe cy\u2019umukurambere Aburahamu. Intumwa y\u2019Imana Mohamed nayo ikomoka mu gisekuru cya Aburahamu yahawe inshingano zo gukomeza kubaka iyo nyubako kugira ngo Abayisilamu bo ku isi yose yajya baza kuyizenguruka baramya Imana.Umuyisilamu wese aho atuye hose ku isi, iyo asenga agomba kuba yerekeje uburanga bwe ahari iyo nyubako ntagatifu ya Kaaba.Mu misigiti yo mu Rwanda Ahubakwa \u201cMinbar\u201d wagereranya n\u2019uruhimbi rwo mu rusengero, hagenwa bikurikije ahari iyo nyubako ntagatifu i Maka muri Arabia Saudite, no mu ngo z\u2019Abayisilamu, ni ko bigenda, Umuyisilamu ugiye gusenga (Gusali) ntiyerekeza uburanga bwe aho abonye, ahubwo baba barigishijwe uko umuntu agena icyerekezo cy\u2019i Maka ahari inyubako ntagatifu ya Kaaba, bityo agasali yerekejeyo isura.Ikindi kandi gituma Abayisilamu bakorera umutambagiro mutagatifu i Maka, ni uko ari ho idini ya isilamu yavukiye, ndetse n\u2019intumwa y\u2019Imana Mohamed akaba ari ho akomoka.Umutambagiro mutagatifu w\u2019i Maka \u201cHijj\u201d ugira amahame awugenga.Icya mbere ni uko uwukora ahitamo Hajj ashaka gukora kuko irimo amoko atatu ariyo \u201cTamattou\u201d \u201cAl Qiran\u201d cyangwa \u201cAl Ifr\u00e2d\u201d. Yose ikaba imitambagiro yemewe, ariko bamwe mubasobanukiwe n\u2019uyu mutambagiro Hajji bavuga ko bitandukanira ku bitambo, ngo iyo ufite igitambo ukora Tamattou, ariko udafite igitambo akora uwo mutambagiro witwa Al Ifrad. Ujya gutangira uwo mutambagiro, agomba kubanza akajya kuri imwe muri za \u201cMiqat\u201d esheshatu, ni ukuvuga aho abantu bagomba kunyura aho muri Arabia, bitewe n\u2019aho baje baturutse. Aho kuri \u201cMiqat\u201d ni ahantu umuntu afatira umugambi w\u2019uko agiye kwitwara mu mutambagiro mutagatifu. Iyo umuntu ageze kuri \u201cMiqat\u201d,ari umugabo agomba kwambara ibyo bita \u201cIhram\u201d. Ihram ni ibintu bimeze nk\u2019ibitenge cyangwa nk\u2019amashuka y\u2019umweru, kimwe akagikenyera ikindi akakitera, ariko nta kindi ashyiramo imbere, kuko ntibyemewe kwambara ikariso muri icyo gihe cy\u2019umutambagiro. Abagore bo ngo bakomeza kwambara imyambaro yabo isanzwe ariko batipfutse mu maso no ku ntoki. Ku munsi wa 8 w\u2019ukwezi kwa 12 ari na wo wambere w\u2019umutambagiro, abakora umutambagiro mutagatifu barara mu Kibaya kitwa Mina, ni ahantu haba harateguwe neza, hubatswe amahema arimo ibyangombwa byose bikenewe ku Muyisilamu uje mu mutambagiro. Aho rero barara basenga, bavuga ko nta yindi Mana ibaho, bakitunganya, bubahiriza ibijyanye n\u2019umutambagiro byose. Kuri uyu munsi kandi ukora urugendo abanza kujya mu Musigiti wa Al-Haram agasenga isengesho rya saa sita ryitwa \u201cDhor\u201d. Iyo bukeye mu gitondo ku munsi wa 9, bajya mu Kibaya cya Arafat, aha mu kibaya cya Arafat ahari \u201cUmusozi w\u2019impuhwe \u201cDjabani Rahma\u201d aho Adamu yahuriye na Hawa (Eva) ni ahantu hafatwa nk\u2019ahakomeye muri uwo mutambagiro, kuko barahirirwa, haba haje abahanga bakomeye muri Islamu bakigisha abari mu mutambagiro. Bahamara umunsi wose, bakahasengera bahava izuba rirenze, nimugoba bakarara ahitwa \u201cMouzdalifa\u201d, ni ahantu hameze nka \u201ctransit \u201c bava mu Kibaya cya Arafat basubira Mina."}
{"id": "22313", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22313", "title": "Ndabaga", "text": "Kera hambere umugabo yabaye aho, az kubyara umwana w'umukobwa amwita izina Ndabaga. Amaze kumubyara, asiga ari uruhinja. Aratabara, nuko yabona abaturutse iwabo nabo baje kw'itabaro akababaza uko umwana we angana. Bakamubwira ngo ameze kuba inkumi ni mukuru. abandi batabaranye nawe bagakurwa bagataha, we akabura umukura, kuko yari yaravutse ari umwana umwe, nawe akaba yaratarabyara umutabazi.\nNdabaga akura atazi se, amaze kuba inkumi amaze kumenya ubwenge, yiga gusimbuka no kurasa. Aho kwitoza imirimo y;abakobwa, akihata imirimo y'abahungu gusa, abandi abandi bakabiseka batazi icyo abigirira. Ndabaga yashakaga uko yazajya gucungura se mu itabaro kuko yari ahamaze imyaka itabarika.\nNdabaga yaragiraga inka akazishora, akazicira icyarire, akazisasira, akazikenura kuburyo bwose. Ndabaga amaze kuba inkumi, ajya mu bucuzi,asaba kumucuzi kumuca amabere, ati \"kandi nzabahemba\" amabere ayamukirizaho, bamwomoza imigera icanye. amaze gukura abwira nyina ati \"Ngiye gucungura data,dore ikigihe cyose amaze ibwami\"\nNdabaga araboneza ajya gutabara. ageze mu rugerero aboneza asanga se,nta we abajije, aramwibwira. Nuko bajya ahiherereye. Ndabaga abwira se ko yize imiimo y'abahungu kuburyo nta muhungu umurusha gusimbuka cyangwa ngo amurushe kwivuga cyangwa kurasa. ata \"Ejo uzizinduke utaha nzagusigarira ibwami.\" Buracya ise arataha.\nBiratinda baza kumenya ko Ndabaga ari umukobwa! Babwira umwami,biramutangaza cyane, ati \"Nta mukobwa ugira ubutwari nka we!\" Nuko umwami ahamagaza ingabo zari mu itabaro ati \"Nimutahe ibintu byageze iwa Ndabaga! Mbega n'iyo byageze u Rwanda rusigaye ruhuruza n'abagore!\"\nUmwami abaza Ndabaga Inka yazanye! Ndabaga ati \"ni nyinshi.\" Umwami azimugororera zose kandi ati \"Ugende ubwire so ko yabyaye!\" Ni aha imvugo yavuye ngo \"Ibintu byageze iwa Ndabaga!\"\nNdabaga nti yari intwari gusa, ahubwo yari n'umunyabwenge n' umunyakuri wakundaga igihugu n'umuryango we cyane. Inkuru ye igaragaza ko nubwo yari umukobwa yashoboye gukora ibirenze ibyari byitenzwe kuri we icyo gihe. Ibi byatumye ahinduka urugero rwiza rw'ubutwari n'ubwitange ku Banyarwanda bose.\nIyinkuru itwigisha ko umuntu agomba kugira intego no gukorera inzozi ze atitaye ku byo abandi bavuga, Ndabaga yagaragaje ko ubwitange n'umurava bituma umuntu agera ku intsinzi."}
{"id": "22314", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22314", "title": "Nyirakigwene Dancille", "text": "Umutwarekazi Nyirakigwene ni mwene Mpabuka wa Ntembe rya Rutinywa rwa Sengenge rya ka Sekisengo cya Nzuki. Ni umusinga kazi wo munzu yabaganzu, abaganzu bakomoka kuri Nzuki za Semugeshi wa Ndoli. Mumwaka wa 1980-1990, bwakozwe imiryango y'abaganzu wasangaga yiganje mu cyahoze ari Butare ku misozi ya Mbazi,Muganza,Nyaruhengeri. Naho mu cyahoze ari Kibuye bari ku misozi nka Gishyita, Rwamagatamu na Kivumu. Muri Gitarama wabasanga ahitwa i masango.\nUmutwarekazi Nyirakigwene, mu mabyiruka ye yashyingiwe umuhungu wa Kabare ka Rwakagara witwa Nyantabana watwaraga i Mbuye mu Nduga. Umutware Nyantabana yabyaranye na Nyirakigwene Umwana w'umuhungu bamwita Bangambiki. Uyu Nyanatabana yaje gutabaruka,bivugwa ko yari muto cyane.\nNyirakigwene akimara kuba umupfakazi,yasabye Umwami Yuhi V Musinga ko yasimbura umugabo we ku butware kuko umwana wabo yari muto. Nyirakigwene uyu yaje gutwara kugeza ubwo umwana we akuriye yuzuza imyaka imwemerera kuba yaba umutware.\nNyiakigwene yabaye umutwarekazi wa i Mbuye mu Nduga ubu ni mu karere ka Muhanga. Nkumutwarekazi yari umuyobozi wigitinyiro cyinshi kandi wanga akarengane n'ubusumbane mubo yayoboraga. Yarafite uburanga buhebuje, abahanzi n'abasizi baramutatse biratinda mu ndirimbo no mu bisigo. Inanga y'igisingizo izwi cyane kandi yanaririmbwaga i bwami ni yitwa \" Garuka \" aho abasizi n'abahanzi bamutakaga.\nUmutwarekazi Nyirakigwene yavukanaga n'abatware batwaraga imisozi itandukanye mu Rwanda aribo Rugiga, Kanuma na Sekanyambo. Muri abao hiyongeraho Nyiramasuka, Umugore wa Furumba Symphorien w'umurinyonza watwaye i Kirengo Nduga"}
{"id": "22315", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22315", "title": "Nyiramibambwe", "text": "Nyiramibambwe ni umwe mubagore bavugwa cyane mumateka y'u Rwanda,cyane mu gihe cy'ubwami. Yari azwi Nkumugore w'umwami witwaga Mibambwe I Sekarongoro Mutabazi, umwe mu bami bakomeye bo hambere mumateka y'urwanda. \nNyiramibambwe yari umugabekazi, kandi izina rye rikomoka ku mugabo we Mibambwe. Mu muco nyarwanda wa kera,umugore w'umami yitirirwaga izina ry'umwami, ari ho haturutse Nyiramibambwe.\nAmateka yaranze Nyiramibambwe.\nYafashaga umwami kuyobora igihugu cyane mu mibereho n'ubuzima bw'ibwami nk'umugabe kazi kandi yagiraga ijambo rikomeye mubibazo by'ibwami harimo n'imibanire y'imiryango n'abatware.\nYari mu bagore bagize uruhare mugukomeza umuco n'imigenzo y'abanyarwanda bo hambere.\nIcyo azwiho.\nNubwo atanditsweho amateka menshi cyane ku buryo burambuye nk'ay'abami, Nyiramibambwe yakunze kuvugwa nk'urugero rwabagore bafite ijambo rikomeye mu bwami bw'u Rwanda bwa Kera ikindi gikomeye kurusha ibindi nuko yagiraga igitsure cyatumaga abasha kunoza inshingano ze nkumugabe kazi."}
{"id": "22317", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22317", "title": "Tadhim Uwizeye", "text": "Tadhim Uwizeye ni umwe mu bagore b\u2019Abanyarwanda bageze ku rwego rwo hejuru mu bijyanye n\u2019ikoranabuhanga n\u2019ubucuruzi bwo kuri internet (e-commerce). Ni we washinze kandi akaba umuyobozi mukuru (CEO) wa kompanyi yitwa Olado Business Group, yatangiye mu mwaka wa 2017, igamije koroshya uburyo abantu bagura bakanagurisha ibicuruzwa hifashishijwe ikoranabuhanga. \n= Amashuri yize =\nTadhim Uwizeye yize amasomo ajyanye na computer science n\u2019imicungire y\u2019amakuru (information systems management). Ibi byamufashije kugira ubumenyi bukomeye mu bijyanye n\u2019ikoranabuhanga ndetse n\u2019ubucuruzi bwo kuri internet. \n= Umwuga n\u2019ibikorwa bye =\nMbere yo gutangiza ubucuruzi bwe, Tadhim yakoraga mu rwego rw\u2019ikoranabuhanga (IT). Nyuma y\u2019uko kompanyi yakoragamo ifunze, yabonye ko ari amahirwe yo gutangira umushinga we bwite. Ni bwo yashinze Olado, urubuga ruhuza abaguzi n\u2019abagurisha, rugateza imbere cyane cyane ibicuruzwa bikorerwa mu Rwanda (Made in Rwanda). \nAfite uburambe burenga imyaka 10 mu bijyanye n\u2019ikoranabuhanga, ubucuruzi n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019imishinga (entrepreneurship), kandi yagiye anagira uruhare mu gufasha urubyiruko n\u2019abagore kwiteza imbere binyuze mu mahugurwa no kubagira inama (mentorship).\n= Uruhare mu iterambere n\u2019ubuyobozi =\nTadhim Uwizeye ni umwe mu bagore b\u2019indashyikirwa mu Rwanda mu guteza imbere ubucuruzi bukoresha ikoranabuhanga. Yatoranyijwe no kuba umuyobozi (Community Leader) mu mushinga wa eTrade for Women ugamije guteza imbere abagore mu bucuruzi n\u2019ikoranabuhanga ku rwego mpuzamahanga. \nYagize kandi uruhare mu guteza imbere imishinga ifasha ibigo bito n\u2019ibiciriritse (MSMEs) gukoresha e-commerce, cyane cyane mu gihe cya COVID-19, aho ubucuruzi bwo kuri internet bwagize akamaro kanini. \n= Icyerekezo n\u2019intego =\nIntego nyamukuru ya Tadhim Uwizeye ni uguhindura uburyo Abanyarwanda bagura n\u2019uko bagurisha, bakoresha ikoranabuhanga mu buryo bworoshye. Yanagaragaje ko nubwo e-commerce yatangiye igihirahiro mu Rwanda, yakomeje gukora cyane mu gushishikariza abantu kuyikoresha no kuyizera. \nAmashakiro"}
{"id": "22318", "revid": "16551", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22318", "title": "Ikinyabirayi", "text": "Ikinyabirayi ni igikoresho gikozwe mu giti, cyakoreshwaga mu kubika no gutunganya amata. Cyabaga kibajwe neza n\u2019ababaji (abahanga mu kubaza ibiti), kikagira isura nziza kandi gishobora no gushushanywa.\n= Uko cyakoreshwaga =\nMu muco nyarwanda, amata yari afite agaciro kanini cyane. Ikinyabirayi cyakoreshwaga mu:\nCyabaga gifite igifuniko kugira ngo amata adahumanywa n\u2019umukungugu cyangwa udukoko.\n= Imiterere n\u2019ubukorikori =\nIkinyabirayi cyakorwaga mu biti bikomeye, kikaba:\nIbi byagaragazaga ubuhanga bw\u2019ababaji b\u2019Abanyarwanda ba kera.\n= Akamaro mu muco nyarwanda =\nIkinyabirayi nticyari igikoresho gisanzwe gusa, ahubwo:"}
{"id": "22319", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22319", "title": "Nyiransibura", "text": "Nyiransibura wanyaye i kivu tumuzi cyangwa se tumwumva munkuru nyinshi zitandukanye zanditswe zivuga kumateka y'u Rwanda rwohambere. Nyiransibura avugako yamenyekanye mu myaka 800 ishize. amataka avugako inkuru y'uko yanyaye ikivu ngo byaturutse aho yaratwite inda agiye kuyibyara mu iguhe isuha yarimenetse ngo nibwo habaye ikiyaga cya kivu. "}
{"id": "22320", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22320", "title": "Robwa Nyiramateke", "text": "Ubutwari bwa Robwa Nyiramateke.\nIgikomangoma Robwa Nyiramateke yemeye kumena amaraso ngo atabyarana n'umwami w'igisaka hato i Gisaka kitazigarurira u Rwanda.\nkubazi amateka y'u Rwanda, ikigikomangoma Robwa ni ishema n'icyubahiro kubanyarwandakazi aho bava bakagera. \nuyumukobwa yategetswe na se kurongorwa nabo mu gihugu cya Gisaka arabyanga abitegetswe na se. nyuma yuko se amaze gutanga kungoma nibwo baje kumushyingira gukagahato ariko arabarwanya kugeza ubwo yaje kugwa hasi bamutega ingoma ayigwa kurutsike acikamo kabiri umwana wari uri undanda ye aragwa maze nawe arapfa maze apfa nkumutabazi na musaza we Bwimba.\nUrupfu rwa Rwoba rwamugize ikimenya bose mu bakobwa n'abagore bose mumateka y'u Rwanda. ntiyatinye kumenera amaraso igihugu nubwo yari akiri muto ndetse akaba yari n'igikomangoma waribuzavemo umugabekazi w'igisaka. Ndetse yanga nkubyarana n'umwami w' i Gisaka \nMugikorwa gikomeye yitanze atyo apfana numwana yari atwite. Ibi byamugize intwari ikomeye mumateka y' uRwanda, Robwa afatwa nk'ikimenyetso cy'ubwitange, ubudahemuka n'urukundo rwinshi yakundaga igihugu cye."}
{"id": "22321", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22321", "title": "Nyirarucyaba", "text": "Nyirarucyaba.\nMwene Gihanga na Nyamususa, akaba umukobwa umwe rukumbi mubahungu umunani Gihanga yabyaye kubagore batandukanye. Nyirarucyaba yaje gukura arashyingirwa mubazigaba bagengaga ingoma y'u Mubali aha nyirakuru Nyirarukanganga yakomokaga. Amate ntago atwereka uwo bashakanye ariko baje kubyarana umwna w'umuhungu bamwita Gacyaba.\nGacyaba ni we sekuru w'ubwoko bw'abacyaba bagenga Ingoma y'Ubugara, nubwo Nyirarucyaba yashyingiwe amateka atwereka ko yari umwe mubanyamirimo ku ngoma ya se, ariko babita abakozi b'igihugu muri icyo gihe. Yabaye umuyobozi w'umugore wambere munzego zohejuru z'igihugu mu mateka y'u Rwanda. Niwe wari umutware w'ingabo zitwaga \"Abahiza\" Wari umutwe w'ingabo zishinzwe kwikorera imitwaro yose y'ibwami.\nUbutwari n'ibigwi bye amanyekana cyane ndetse n'abana be bose"}
{"id": "22323", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22323", "title": "Ibonekerwa ry\u2019i Kibeho", "text": "Ibonekerwa ry\u2019i Kibeho ryabaye mu mwaka wa 1981 ryabereye i Kibeho, rero Kibeho ni umujyi muto uherereye mucyahoze ari Gikongoro ubu ni mu karere ka Nyaruguru mu intara ya majyepfo y\u2019u Rwanda. Ni ahantu hamenyekanye igihe habaga amabonekerwa Mariya Klara Mukangango, Alphonsine Mumureke na Nathalie Mukamazimpaka ubu afite imyaka 50.\nIshusho.\nIkibeho niho naho hari ishusho ya Yezu ku rwego rwa Afurika ifite icyicaro aho i Kibeho; niyo shusho nini ku isi ifite uburebure bwa metero esheshatu (6), ipima ibiro magana cyenda na mirongo itanu (950 kg), Iyo shusho igaragara ahantu hatandatu ku Isi kuko buri mugabane w\u2019Isi ufite ishusho imwe nk\u2019iyo. Umugabane w\u2019Afurika rero ishusho wagennye iri ku musozi wa Nyarushishi uherereye mu murenge wa Kibeho, akarere ka Nyaruguru mu Ntara y\u2019Amajyepfo.\nIbonekerwa.\nKu italiki ya 28 Ugushyingo mu mwaka w\u2019i 1981, mu ishuri ryisumbuye ry\u2019abakobwa ry\u2019i Kibeho habereye ibintu bidasanzwe. Ubwo hari mu ma saha ya nyuma ya saa sita abana barangije gufungura, ariko bakiri hamwe mu cyumba cy\u2019amafunguro, umukobwa witwa Alphonsine Mumureke wari ageze mu kigero cy\u2019imyaka cumi n\u2019itandatu, yumvise ijwi ryoroheje rimuhamagara mu kinyarwanda rigira riti: \u201cMwana wanjye\u201d. Ubwo nawe ahaguruka bwangu akurikira iryo jwi ridasanzwe mu kirongozi, maze abona umugore ufite ubwiza buhebuje amuhagaze imbere,Yari yambaye umwambaro wera kandi yitwikirije umwenda w\u2019ubururu mu mutwe. Ibiganza bye byari bibumbiye mu gituza, ariko intoki zireba hejuru. Nta nkweto yari yambaye. Alphonsine amubazanya igihunga agira ati: \u201cUri nde ?\u201d Uwo mugore amusubiza bwangu avuga ati:\u201cNdi Nyina wa Jambo\u201d."}
{"id": "22324", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22324", "title": "Gukomezwa", "text": "Ugukomezwa ni isakaramentu rya Yezu Kristo wazutse aduheramo imbaraga zihariye za Roho Mutagatifu, zituma tubera Kristu abagabo mu bantu maze tukamuvugira tu kamwamamaza dushize amanga. \nIsakaramentu.\nUgukomezwa ni isakaramentu rifatwa nk\u2019urugendo rwo kuzuza ibyatangiye mu Ibatizwa, aho umukirisitu aba umuhamya wa Kristu agashobora kurwanirira ukwizera kwe mu magambo no mu bikorwa, \nUmuhango.\ngukomezwa ubusanzwe ritangwa n'umwepiskopi (cyangwa umupapadiri yabiherewe uburenganzira), ashyira amavuta matagatifu (cyangwa Karisima ku ruhanga rw'uwemejwe, amuvuraho amagambo agira ati: Habwa ikimenyetso cya Roho Mutagatifu, ingabire y'Imana."}
{"id": "22325", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22325", "title": "Umuranga", "text": "Umuranga yafatwaga nk'inkingi yamwamba y'umuryango mu Rwanda rwohambere.\nUmuranga yafashaga m'Umuhango w'ubukwe.\nUmukobwa wabaga atarabona umushima akamushimagiza akamuranga mu muryango ufite umusore, yaheraga iwabo n\u2019ubwo bitakundaga kubaho. Iyo niyo yabaye inkomoko y\u2019umugani w\u2019Ikinyarwanda ugira uti Umukobwa wabuze umuranga, yaheze mwa nyina. Cyari ikizira mu Rwanda rwo hambere ko Umusore cyangwa se inkumi birambagiriza, ababyeyi na bo byari umuziro ko binjira mu byo gushakira abana babo. Aho rero niho hakenerwaga umuhuza w\u2019imiryango yombi ngo izagere ku ntego yo kubana, uwo niwe bitaga Umuranga. Mu muco wo mu Rwanda rwo hambere na n\u2019ubu utaracika, habagaho umuntu witwaga Umuranga wabaga afite uruhare runini mu bukwe bwa Kinyarwanda, akagira inshingano zikomeye zo guhuza imiryango ibiri ikabasha gushyingirana. Umuranga ni we wafashaga imiryango y\u2019abateganya gushyingiranwa kumenyana no gutunganya neza imihango ijyanye no kurambagizanya kwayo. Umuranga yabaga ari inshuti y\u2019imiryango yombi ishaka guhana abageni cyangwa akaba umuvandimwe w\u2019umuryango umwe, ariko aziranye n\u2019abantu bo mu muryango bashakamo amaboko. Iyo umuranga yamenyeshaga imiryango uwo yatoranyije, umusore n\u2019inkumi bashoboraga guhura, bakamenyana cyangwa bakaganira mu buryo busanzwe.\nUmuranga yabagaho ate muri sosiyete.\nUmuranga yatoranywaga n\u2019imiryango ifite abasore n\u2019inkumi bagejeje igihe cy\u2019ubukure bashobora kuba bashyingiranwa, niyo mpamvu wasangaga agasozi aka n\u2019aka gafite umuranga umwe udahinduka, bitewe n\u2019imyitwarire myiza bamubonyeho. Umuranga yabaga ari umuntu ukomeye mu muryango nyarwanda, by\u2019umwihariko agace atuyemo, yabaga ari umuntu uzi kubana no kuganira, ku buryo abasha gutanga ibisubizo ku bintu runaka byananiranye. Niyo mpamvu umuntu umeze atyo yitabazwaga kenshi mu birori bihuza abantu benshi nk\u2019ubukwe. Umuranga yashoboraga guhuza imiryango ifite abana bakuze bashobora gushaka, akabaranga yaba yabisabwe cyangwa se atabisabwe, maze akazagira ubuhanga n\u2019ubugeni bwo kuzahuza imiryango yombi ayereka ukuri nyako k\u2019uko bashobora gushyingirana. Ni we muntu wagiraga imirimo myinshi mu muhango w\u2019ubukwe, haba mbere yabwo ndetse na nyuma yabwo. Uw\u2019ibanze ari nawo wamuhaga iryo zina, ni uwo kuranga umukobwa wa kanaka ugeze igihe cyo kurongorwa, akamurangira umuhungu wa kanaka na we ukeneye kurongora."}
{"id": "22326", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22326", "title": "Isakaramentu ry'ukarisitiya", "text": "Ukaristiya ni Isakaramentu ririmo Yezu kristu ubwe gusa, n\u2019umubiri we n\u2019amaraso ye, mu bimenyetso by\u2019umugati na divayi, akatubera icyarimwe Igitambo, Ifunguro\u00a0 n\u2019Incuti tubana.\nIsakaramentu.\nAbakristu bahimbaza iri sakaramentu binyuze mu Gitambo cya Misa, kandi bakagaragaza ukwemera kwabo binyuze mu gushengerera Yezu mu Isakaramentu no gukora ingendo nyagatifu aribyo imitambagiro."}
{"id": "22327", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22327", "title": "Kugabirana Inka", "text": "Igihango cyo kugabirana Inka kiba hagati y\u2019Umunyarwanda n\u2019Inka, igihugu cye, umunyarwanda mugenzi we, umunyamahanga ukunda u Rwanda.\nIgihango cyo Kugabirana.\nIgihango cyo kugabirana n'igihango cyo guhana Inka, ni kimwe mu bihango u Rwanda rwasangiraga n\u2019amahanga kimwe no gushyingirana. Igihango cyo guhana Inka, cyabanzirizwaga n\u2019uko buri Munyarwanda na we agomba guhana igihango n\u2019Inka kugira ngo zimukundire abashe kuzorora zororoke. Hanyuma umutunzi w\u2019amashyo n\u2019amagana, akaba yayifatiraho agirana igihango n\u2019abandi. Mu igihango cyo guhana Inka kw\u2019Abanyarwanda, byatumye ihabwa imimaro irenze iyo yari ifite mu muco n\u2019amateka y\u2019u Rwanda. Inka yarenze kuba itungo ryororwa ngo ritange ifumbire n\u2019 amata, inyama n\u2019impu zo kwambara, ihinduka n\u2019igikoresho cya Politiki y\u2019Ububanyi n\u2019amahanga, Imibereho myiza y\u2019abaturage, Ubukungu, n\u2019umutekano. Igihango cyo guhana Inka, ni kimwe mu bihango by\u2019Abanyarwanda bimaze igihe kirekire, kuko cyahanganywe n\u2019u Rwanda. Igihango cyo guhana Inka, ni igihango cyaremwe na Gihanga ahasaga mu wa 1100, ubwo yashyiraga Inka mu bigomba kwifashishwa mu mushinga wo kubaka u Rwanda cyane cyane mu gisata cy\u2019Ububanyi n\u2019amahanga.Muri ibyo bihe, ni bwo Gihanga yaremye gahunda yitwaga \u201cGabirwa\u201d yari igamije guteza imbere ubworozi bw\u2019Inka no kuzigaba. Haherewe ku bihugu bituranye n\u2019u Rwanda byari bitaratera imbere ku bworozi bw\u2019Inka nk\u2019u Buliza n\u2019u Bwanacyambwe."}
{"id": "22328", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22328", "title": "Isimbi model", "text": "Isimbi Model.\nMURAGIJIMANA VESTINE uzwi ku izina rya Isimbi the model ukunda kwiyita umukobwa wo mu cyaro ni umunyarwandakazi wa rwiyemezamirimo, umunyamideli, ndetse n'umu infuruwensa wavukiye i Gitwe mu Karere ka Ruhango. Yavutse mu 1990 avukira mu muryango wishimye yaje kubura mu 1994 muri Jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda; azakubura bamubona nyuma y'imyaka 5 aho yasanzwe mu kigo cy'imfubyi atangira kurerwa na nyirakuru kuva icyo gihe. Isimbi kuva kera yari umukobwa w'umushabitsi aho yacuruzaga imboga n'imbuto afite imyaka 9 agakuramo ayo kwishyura ibikoresho by'ishuri ndetse akanafasha nyirakuru kuko bari abana benshi.\nUmuryango.\nYashakanye na SHAUL HATZIR uturuka muri Isiraheli(Israel) muri 2022. Bahuye 2018 muri Kigali Convention Center bose bavuye mu nama, amwambika impeta ya fiyansaye 2019, basezerana mu rukiko 2021, kuri 20 Gashyantare 2022 nibwo bakoze ubukwe muri Kigali Concention center. \nImirimo akora.\nAfite ibikorwa bitandukanye ahuriza mu kigo kimwe cyitwa ISIMBI GROUP kigizwe na:\nIntego ye.\nNi umwe mu banyarwandakazi bizerako gusangiza abandi inkuru ye byafasha wa mwana w'umukobwa uri guca mu bihe bikomeye.Aho agira ati:\"Nshaka ko inkuru yanjye abo bana bato babakobwa batagomba gucika intege mu gushaka ubuzima bwiza.\""}
{"id": "22329", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22329", "title": "Igihango cy'Urushako", "text": "Inkomoko y\u2019urushako ni Imana. Urushako rukwiye kubaho uko Imana ishaka kandi rugaharanira inyungu z\u2019Imana. Urushako si amasezerano ahubwo ni isezerano cyangwa igihango.\nIbyo Twamenya ku Igihango cy'Urushako.\nIgihango ntikigira iherezo kuko ntacyo wakora ngo usibe amateka, ahubwo uhora wibukako hari igihango wagiranye n\u2019umuntu. Ku ruhande rwawe ukora ku buryo ubuhemu butazaguturukaho kugira ngo no mu gihe byanze rwose, umutima ntuzigere ugushinja ko ari wowe watatiye igihango. Urugo rwubakwa n\u2019imbabazi, iyo uhuye n\u2019uwagiriye ibibazo mu rushako ntakubwira intege nke ze ahubwo avuga iza mugenzi we. Agaragaza ko mugenzi we ari we umunanije. Umuntu wese muri twe anezeze mugenzi we kugira ngo amubere inyunganizi amukomeze, buri wese akwiriye gufasha mugenzi we kugira ngo amwunganire, amukomeze. Hari abantu bajya murushako bumva bagiye kugerageza kugira ngo nibyanga bazatandukane. Gusa iyo wiyemeje, burya ujye umenya ko ari akaramata kandi ko uzaba wanditse amateka atazibagirana. Kimwe mu bituma ingo zangirika ni uko inyinshi nta Mana ibamo. Igihe cyose Imana atari yo yabanje imbere mu rushako, ngo ibe urufatiro rwubakiyeho, umenyako imiyaga niza bitazoroha. Ntibivuzeko ingo z\u2019abubaha Imana zidahura n\u2019ibibazo. Biraza ariko urufatiro rw\u2019iyo nzu urushako rukomeza gukomera. Urugo ni umushinga watangijwe n\u2019Imana mu ngobyi ya Edeni. Kuva icyo gihe ibibera mu rugo Imana ibikurikiranira hafi kuko ntiyari gukomeza kubumbabumba itaka ngo abantu babeho. Ahubwo yahisemo guhuza umugabo n\u2019umugore ngo babyare bororoke bakwire isi, bigishe urubyaro rwabo kuramya Imana. Kandi Uwiteka Imana iravuga iti si byiza ko umuntu aba wenyine, imuremere umufasha umukwiriye."}
{"id": "22330", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22330", "title": "Isakaramentu", "text": "Isakaramentu ni ijambo risobanura ikimenyetso kigaragara cy\u2019ubuntu bw\u2019Imana kidashobora kubonwa n\u2019amaso, cyashyizweho na Yezu Kristu kugira ngo kiduhe ubugingo n'ubutagatifu.\namasakaramentu.\nHari amasakaramentu yo kwinjira mu bukristu:"}
{"id": "22331", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22331", "title": "Victoria NGANYIRA", "text": "Yahoze ari umunyamakuru wa Radiyo Rwanda, akaba azwiho kuba ari umunyamakuru wakoze kuri Radio Rwanda imyaka irenga mirongo ine ndetse no kuba yarabyariye muri Sitidiyo ya Radio ubwo yararimo gusoma amakuru. \nAmateka.\nVictoria NGANYIRA yavutse mu mwaka wa 1940 avukira mu karere ka Kamonyi. Yigiye amashuri abanza muri aka karere, naho amashuri yisumbuye ayigira mu kigo kigisha ibijyanye nokwigisha cyitwa Muramba Teachers Training College giherereye ku Gisenyi. Nyuma yo gusoza mashuri yisumbuye yigishije umwaka umwe, nyuma atangira gukora kuri Radio Rwanda, aho yakoze mu kiganiro WARI UZI KO? imyaka isaga 42.\nVictiria NGANYIRA yabyaye abana barindwi, harimo Louise Victoria NGANYIRA na we waje kuba umunyamakuru"}
{"id": "22332", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22332", "title": "Igitambo cy'amisa", "text": "Igitambo cya Misa ni isengesho ry'ikirenga mu idini rya Gatolika, aho abemera begerana n'Imana kugira ngo bazirikane kandi basubire mu buryo bw'iyobera ry'urupfu n'izuka bya yezu Kristu.\nIbice.\nMisa igabanyijemo ibice bibiri by'ingenzi, harimo liturujiya y\u2019Ijambo ni gusoma no kumva ijambo ry'Imana mu ntagatifu, ndetse hari na liturujiya y\u2019Ukaristiya aribyo guhazwa, aho abemera barya Umubiri wa Kristu mu buryo bw'umugati na divayi bihindutse."}
{"id": "22333", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22333", "title": "Isengesho", "text": "Isengesho ni ukuganira n'Imana. Ni ikiganiro kiba hagati y'umuntu n'Imana yamuremye rero Isengesho ni yo nzira ya mbere Abizera bahawe yo kumenyesha Imana amarangamutima yabo no kubaho mu busabane bweruye hagati yabo n'Imana.\nUko basenga.\nIsengesho ushobora kurikora uvuga byumvikana cyangwa se kimwe rishobora gukorwa bucece, utavuga, isengesho rikorwa hagati y'umuntu umwe n'Imana, cyangwa hagati y'abantu benshi mbese itsinda icyarimwe n'Imana. Isengesho hari ibintu 3 by'ingenzi rigomba kuba ryujuje:"}
{"id": "22334", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22334", "title": "Louise Victoire Nganyira", "text": "Yabaye umunyamakuru wa Radiyo Rwanda kuva mukwa 12 mu mwaka wa 2002 kugeza mu mwaka wa 2013. Ni umukobwa wa Victoria NGANYIRA wahoze ari umunyamakuru kuri Radiyo Rwanda.. \nAmateka.\nLouise Victoire Nganyira yavukiye muri Sitidiyo we n'impanga ye NGANYIRA Louis Victor, ubwo mama wa bo Nganyira Victoria yasomaga amatangazo. Louise Victoire yize muri Kaminuza Nkuru y'U Rwanda mu bijyanye n'uburezi. Mu mwaka wa 2002 Louise Victoire NGANYIRA yatangiye gukora kuri Radiyo Rwanda, nyuma aza kuhava ajya kwikorera mu mwaka wa 2013 \nIkintu gikomeye batojwe numubyeyi wabo ni ugusenga,kwihanganirana mubuzima bwabo bwose kuko ntazibana zidakomanya amahembe. Ikndi yabaraze kwiga nk'impamba izababeshaho muminsi y'ubuzima bwabo kandi koko Imana yarabafashije babigeraho. Akunda kugira inama urubyiruko ngo bajye basenga cyane badaheranwa na gahinda k'ibibazo bahuye nabyo, kwirinda kujarajara mukazi, kunoza akazi kabo kudahemuka kandi rugakundana rudashingiye kubintu cyangwa ikintu kindi icyaricyo cyose."}
{"id": "22335", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22335", "title": "Igaburo ryera", "text": "Igaburo Ryera cyangwa Ifunguro Ryera) ni umuhango ukomeye mu bukristo ushushanya gusangira umubiri n'amaraso bya Yesu Kristo binyuze mu kurya umutsima no kunywa amaraso yiwe nkingi yu bukrosto ndetse n'ikimenyesho Yesu Kristo yadusigiye.\nUmuhango.\nIgaburo ryera mu matorero menshi, uyu muhango ugenewe abamaze kwizera no kubatizwa, kandi basabwa kubanza kwisuzuma mu mutima no kwihana ibyaha mbere yo kuwegera, ndetse abapasteri cyangwa abayobozi b'itorero bakoresha uyu muhango nk'ikimenyetso cyo kuvugurura isezerano hagati y'umwizera n'Imana."}
{"id": "22336", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22336", "title": "Ukaristiya", "text": "Ukaristiya ni isengesho rikuru, risingiza Imana kandi rikayishimira. Nk\u2019uko Gatigisimu ibivuga. Ukaristiya ni isakramentu ririmo Yezu Kristu n\u2019umubiri we n\u2019amaraso ye, mu bimenyetso by\u2019umugati na Divayi, akabera icyarimwe igitambo.\nTumenye Isakramentu Ukaristiya.\nUkaristiya rikomoka ku ijambo ry\u2019ikigereki (Eucharistia), riva ku nshinga (Eucharistein) bivuga gushimira, rikavuga kandi kimwe n\u2019irindi jambo (Eulogein). Aya magambo yibutsa ugushimira kw\u2019Abayahudi, igihe bamamazaga ibikorwa by\u2019Imana cyane cyane mu gihe cya Pasika. Gutura igitambo cy\u2019Ukaristiya ni ugusangira isengesho ryo kwibuka gushimira Imana. Kuva kera gushimira Imana biri mu muco w\u2019abantu bayo. Umunsi mukuru w\u2019Isakaramentu Ritagatifu ry\u2019umubiri n\u2019amaraso bya Yezu, wahimbajwe bwa mbere mu mateka mu mwaka wa 1246. Kuwizihiza bwa mbere byabaye mu kinyejana cya cumi na gatatu biturutse ku mubikira Yuliyana wa Koroniyo Julienne de Cornillon, muri Diyoseze ya Liyeje (Li\u00e8ge) mu Bubiligi. Ni Papa Urbain IV wasabyeko uwo munsi mukuru wajya uhimbazwa muri Kiliziya y\u2019isi yose. Icyari kigamijwe mu guhimbaza uwo munsi mukuru batambagiza Isakaramentu ritagatifu, kwari ukongera gushishikariza abakiristu kujya bahazwa ari benshi, kuko muri icyo gihe bahazwaga ari ngerere, bivuze ko ntacyo Yezu uri mu isakaramentu ry\u2019Ukarisitiya yari akibabwiye. Nyamara kwa kino gihe, iyo umuntu yitegereje, kuba abantu bahazwa ari benshi cyane, si cyo kimenyetso gifatika cy\u2019urukundo n\u2019inyota abantu bafitiye Yezu uri muri Karistiya. \nAmateka y'Isakrantu ry'Ukaristiya.\nIsakaramentu Ritagatifu nyuma yo guhaza basigazaga Isakaramentu rigenewe abarwayi n\u2019abagiye gupfa, nta kindi babaga bagambiriye. Kuva mu 1209, umubikira Yuliyana yagize amabonekerwa menshi, maze umunsi umwe ahishurirwa ko hari umunsi ubuze muri Kiliziya gatolika ari wo w\u2019Isakaramentu Ritagatifu. Uwo mubikira yasabwe guharanira ko wajyaho kugira ngo abakirisitu bemere ko Yezu Kristu ari mu Isakaramentu ry\u2019Ukaristiya, ubutumwa arabutangira, ariko ahura n\u2019ibigeragezo. Abakire bo muri uwo mujyi bahagurukiye kumurwanya kuko basabwaga gusiba kurya kuri uwo munsi, ntibabone uko binezeza. Abihayimana na bo baramurwanyije bamushinja kwihangishwaho. Byamuviriyemo guhunga, ava aho yari atuye mu muryango, akihishahisha mu bigo by\u2019abihayimana.Ibyo bigeragezo ntibyamubujije gukomeza gushishikariza abantu uwo munsi mukuru waje kwemerwa na Papa Urban wa 4 tariki ya 8 Nzeri mu mwaka 1264. Icyemezo cya Papa Urban cyanafatiye ku kuba muri icyo gihe hari umupadiri w\u2019i Boheme witwa Petero wa Prage washidikanyaga bikomeye ko Yezu ashobora kuba ari mu bimenyetso by\u2019Umugati na Divayi, waje kubigaragarizwa mu buryo bufatika. Umunsi umwe uwo mupadiri yari yakoze urugendo nyobokamana, arimo atura igitambo cya Misa, ageze mu gihe cya konsekarasiyo aho padiri azamura umugati na Divayi yigana Yezu wavuze ko ari umubiri n\u2019amaraso ye abona Hositiya ihindutse ukundi, ifata ibara ry\u2019iroza, maze itangira kuva amaraso, ibitonyanga byayo bigwa ku nsasirwagitambo no hasi kuri sima. Icyo gihe uwo mupadiri ngo yahise agwa mu kantu, abura icyo akora n\u2019icyo areka, nuko kera kabaye yigira inama yo gusubika igitambo cya Misa, afata rya sakaramentu arijyana mu Sakirisitiya. Ibi byahuruje abantu benshi harimo na Papa Urban wa 4, waje gutangaza ku mugaragaro ko hagomba kubaho muri Kiliziya umunsi mukuru w\u2019Isakaramentu Ritagatifu kugira ngo abakirisitu baramye Yezu uri mu gisa n\u2019Umugati na Divayi.Uwo munsi yawushyize ku munsi wa kane ukurikira iminsi umunani nyuma ya Pentekositi, awugira itegeko ku bakristu bose, anasaba uwaje kuba Mutagatifu Tomasi w\u2019Akwini gushyira ku murongo ibijyanye n\u2019uko uzajya ugenda.Icyakora, icyo gihe habayeho abasenyeri n\u2019abahanga mu bya tewolojiya inyigisho z\u2019ubuhanga mu by\u2019iyobokamana barwanyije icyo cyemezo, byatumye Papa Clement wa 5 akigarukaho, yemeza burundu uwo munsi mu mwaka 1311. Kugeza icyo gihe, umutambagiro ntiwagendaga nk\u2019uko tuwuzi uyu munsi. Washyizweho na Papa Yohani wa 22, mu mwaka 1318, wasabye ko igihe bizihiza uwo munsi abakirisitu bazajya bakora umutambagiro mu muhanda no mu mayira kugira ngo Yezu ayihe umugisha. Inama Nkuru ya Kiliziya yabereye i Taranti mu mwaka wa 1545 kugeza mu mwaka 1563 nayo yemeje uwo mutambagiro, maze ihamya ko iyo abakirisitu batambagiza Isakaramentu Ritagatifu ku manywa y\u2019ihangu baba bahamya ukwemera kwabo ko Yezu ari rwose mu Isakaramentu Ritagatifu ry\u2019Ukaristiya.I Roma ho umutambagiro watangiye gukorwa mu kinyejana cya 15, igihe Nicolas wa 5 yari Papa. "}
{"id": "22337", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22337", "title": "Igitaramo", "text": "Igitaramo ni ibirori, umuhango, cyangwa ikoraniro ry\u2019abantu rigamije kwidagadura, gusabana, kwizihiza umuco, cyangwa kwiga binyuze mu ndirimbo, imbyino, imivugo, n\u2019umurishyo w\u2019ingoma, gusa hari ibitaramo nyarwanda ndetse n'ibitaramo bya gikristo.\nIgitarmo gakondo.\nmu gitaramo habagamo gahunda nyinshi twavugako habaga harimo nko:"}
{"id": "22338", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22338", "title": "Gushengerera", "text": "Gushengera ni ukurangamira Yezu Kristu uri mu isakaramentu ry\u2019ukaristiya, ukamwiyegurira wese mu ndoro no mu bitekerezo bityo ugashobora gutuza no kumutega amatwi ngo wumve icyo akuganiriza.\nIbindi wamenya ku Gushengerera.\nMu gihe cyo gushengerera, ukaristiya ntagatifu ishyirwa mu gikoresho cyabugenewe cyererana ku buryo isakaramentu rigaragarira ushoboye kureba icyo gikoresho. Mu masengesho yose abaho muri kiliziya gatolika, irisaba umutuzo kurusha ayandi ni iri ryo gushengerera. Bisaba umutuzo uhagije, ugomba gutuza muri wowe, ugacecekesha amajwi yose akubyiganiramo. Ushengerera agirwa inama yo kudahambira umutima we ku bitekerezo bidafite akamaro. Ibibazo, imihangayiko, umujinya n\u2019ibindi bikurimo ntugomba kubyizirikaho ahubwo ubitura Yezu ugaharanira ko muri iryo sengesho nta wundi wundi Roho, umutima n\u2019ubwenge byawe bizirikanaho keretse Yezu uri aho mu karistiya. Ibi ntabwo byoroheye umuntu, niyo mpamvu tugomba gusaba Imana ingabire yo kwisiga no kwizera. Ni ngombwa kumenya ko uri cyangwa winjiye ahantu ho gusengera, aho urahurira na Yezu mu Isakaramentu ry\u2019Ukaristiya; bityo ni ngombwa gutegurira ku buryo bwimbitse umutima wawe kwinjira aho hantu.Ushengerera ntagomba kumara umwanya we asaba cyangwa aganya. Agomba gushimira agasabana n\u2019Imana. Aho kwirirwa atekereza ku byo abura, ushengerera agomba gushimira Imana uko abayeho, ibyo atunze ndetse n\u2019ibyo azabona ejo. Mu gihe unaniwe cyangwa uhuye n\u2019ibirangaza bikurogoya, ntugomba gucika intege ahubwo ongera utangire isengesho ryawe ryo mu mutima rituje kandi usabe inkunga ya Roho Mutagatifu kugira ngo imbaraga ze zigaragarize mu ntege nke zawe kandi zikubere buri gihe umuyobozi wawe.Kuguma mu mutuzo urimo uzirikane ko Bikira Mariya, inyenyeri yo mu rukerera akaba n\u2019irembo ry\u2019ijuru akuri hafi mu rugendo rwawe akwereka inzira kandi akugeze mu Ijuru. Ni we uzakumvisha ko igihe urangamiye Yezu mu mutuzo, uzabona ubutatu butagatifu muri wowe. "}
{"id": "22339", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22339", "title": "MTN Iwacu Muzika Festival", "text": "Ni ibitaramo byatangiye muri kamena mwaka wa 2019 muri 2020 bikomwa munkokora nicyorezo cya COVID-19 gusa bikanyuzwa kuri terevisiyo y'Igihugu aho abahanzi bagiye batandukanye bataramiraga abakunzi babo babasusurutsa mu bihe bya guma mu rugo.\nIbyo wamenya kw'ibi Bitaramo.\nNi ibitamo by'umuziki byari bisanzwe byitwa Iwacu Muzika Festival byahindutse MTN Iwacu Muzika Festival nyuma y'uko sosiyete ya MTN ibaye umutera nkunga mukuru w'ibi bitaramo bitegurwa na EAP.Ni ibitaramo byitabirwa n\u2019abahanzi batandukanye bagezweho, hagamijwe gutanga ibyishimo ku bakunzi b\u2019umuziki. MTN Iwacu Muzika Festival ni iserukiramuco ry\u2019ibitaramo bizenguruka igihugu biba buri mwaka.Abahanzi bagaragaza ko ari amahirwe adasanzwe yo baba babonye yo kongera gutaramira abakunzi babo hirya no hino mu gihugu bakabizeza kuzatanga ibyishimo bidacagase. Umwaka ushize, ibi bitaramo byari byatumiwemo abahanzi nka King James, Riderman, Bull Dogg, Juno Kizigenza, Ariel Wayz, Kivumbi King, na Nel Ngabo. Abo barimo abahanzi bakiri bato nka Juno Kizigenza, Kivumbi King, Ariel Wayz na Nel Ngabo, usanga bakunzwe na benshi mu bice bitandukanye by\u2019igihugu, ariko batarashobora gususurutsa abakunzi babo hirya no hino. Ibi bitaramo bitegurwa na Sosiyete ya MTN Rwanda ku bufatanye na EAP Rwanda, bikomeje gushyira hamwe bamwe mu bahanzi bakomeye mu gihugu no hanze yacyo. Kuri taliki 11 Gashyantare uyumwaka wa 2026 EAP isanzwe itegura ibi bitaramo yatangaje ko kuri iyi nshuro bizabera mu mijyi irindwi y\u2019u Rwanda. Bavuga ko ibi bitaramo bizatangira ku taliki ya 20 Kamena 2026 bikarangira ku tariki ya 1 Kanama 2026, bizaca mu mijyi nka Huye, Ngoma, Nyagatare, Karongi, Muhanga, Musanze na Rubavu. Byitezwe ko ibi bitaramo bizitabirwa n\u2019abahanzi batandukanye bagezweho, hagamijwe gutanga ibyishimo ku bakunzi b\u2019umuziki."}
{"id": "22340", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22340", "title": "Igitaramo nyarwanda", "text": "Igitaramo nyarwanda ni igikorwa cy'ubusabane gihuza Abanyarwanda hakaba hari gahunda nyinshi zihakorerwa nko kuganira, bakaririmba, bakabyina, cyangwa bagahana ubumenyi n'amateka mu rwego rwo kwishima no gusigasira umuco.\nAmoko y'ibitaramo.\nu Rwanda rwohambere bagiraga ibitaramo bitandukanye, aha twavuga ibtaramo nk'amoko y'ibitaramoo Nyarwanda,"}
{"id": "22341", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22341", "title": "Igitarano cya gikristo", "text": "Igitaramo cya Gikristo ni igikorwa cyangwa umuhango uhuza abemera Kristu bakamurindira, bakamusenga, cyangwa bakamusingiza binyuze mu ndirimbo n\u2019ijambo ry\u2019Imana. Ibi bitaramo bishobora kuba mu buryo butandukanye:\nGutarama.\nSibyo gusa kuko hari ama radio ndetse n'inyakira mashusho zifite muri gahunda yazo ibitaramo by'agikristo."}
{"id": "22342", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22342", "title": "Umutambagiro", "text": "Umutambagiro ni urugendo rw'imyemerere rukorewe hamwe n'abizera kumwe cyangwa se akaba ari igikorwa cyo kugendera hamwe gikunze gukorwa n'abakirisitu bo mu idini gaturika, cyangwa se kandi abayisilamu bakora urugendo rutagafitu bakunze kwita Hijja aho baba bagana ahantu hatagatifu.\nMu Gatolika.\nRero muri kiliziya Gatolika, umutambagiro ukunze kuba ari uwo kwereka icyubahiro baha Yezu Kristo mu Isakaramentu, ndetse no kuzirikana ububabare yagize, baba bagenda n'amaguru ndetse no kuririmba indirimbo.\nIslam.\nUmutambagiro wa basilamu witwa Hijja, aho abayisilamu bakora urugendo rugana i Maka, ruzwi nka Hijja, bikaba ari inkingi ya gatanu y'ubuyisilamu ku bafite ubushoboziaho bagomba kuya I Maka."}
{"id": "22343", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22343", "title": "Roho mutagatifu", "text": "Roho mutagatifu cyangwa se umwuka wera usobanurwa mu buryo butandukanye bitewe n'imyemerere ya gikristo, ariko ahanini ufatwa nk'imbaraga z'Imana muri rusange.\nmwuka wera.\nAmatorero menshi yigisha ko Umwuka Wera ari Imana mu buryo bwuzuye, akaba uwa gatatu mu cyitwa Ubutatu Butagatifu (Data, Umwana, n'Umwuka Wera), Umwuka Wera afasha abizera kunesha ibishuko, kugira imico myiza (imbuto z'Umwuka), no gusobanukirwa Ibyanditswe Byera."}
{"id": "22344", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22344", "title": "Leatitia Nyirazinyoye", "text": "Prof. Laetitia Nyirazinyoye, Umwarimu muri kaminuza nkuru y'u Rwanda mw'ishami ry'ubizima rusange n'ubuvuzi bw'imiti. amashuri yisumbuye yayize mwishuri ry'ubuforomo n'ububyaza i Rwamagana mu mwaka wa 1996. Yabonye impamya bushobozi y'ikiciro cya kabiri mubuzima rusange mu mwaka wa 2002 muri kaminuza nkuru y'u Rwanda ni nabwo yahise yinjira mubakoze bakaminuza muri uwo mwaka.\nMu mwaka 2007 yakiriye impamyabumenyi ya yikirenga (master) mwishami ry'iterambere rusange ndetse n'ikoranabuhanga nyuma yaho yaje kubona PhD mu mwaka wa 2011 Mu ishami ry'ubuzima rusange mpuzamahanga ni terambere muri kaminuza ya Tulane(Tulane University). \nIbikowa byindashyikirwa yakoze..\nYakoze muri kaminuza y'urwanda imyaka makumyabiri (20), yakoreye ubushakashatsi muri ministeri y'ubuzima muburyo bwokuyifasha gushakibisubizo by;ugarije igihugu.Yakoreye muri minisiteri y'ubumwe n'uburere mboneragihugu, ndetse no mukigo k'igihugu gishinzwe ubuzima, yabaye umufatanyabikorwa wa leta mu iterambere, mubushakashatsi mubigo bitandukanye ndetse n'impinduka mubaturage ko kuzamura imyumvire kumibereho n'iterambere mu Rwanda ndetse no Kwisi."}
{"id": "22345", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22345", "title": "Diane kalinda", "text": "Diane Kalinda ni Umunyarwandakazi witinyutse akabasha gukorera mukigo gishinzwe gukwirakwiza cyangwa gutwara amaraso,imiti mubigo by'ubuvuzi mu rwanda cyitwa ZipLine gikoresheje utudege duto(drone). Diane Kalinda umufatanyabikorwa wa Zipline yakoze ibikorwa byinshi byintashyikirwa aho yabashije kubona impamyabushozi y'icyikiciro cya kabiri cyaminuza mu ishami rishinze abakozi no kugenzura Imitungo(Human Resource) na impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga mu ishami ry'uburezi mpuza mahanga muri kaminuza yomuri leta zunze ubumwe z'amerika.\nNyuma yogusoza kwiga no kubona izo mpamya bushobozi yafashe umwanzuro wokuza gushyira mubikorwa ibyo yari amaze igihe yiga kugirango bitange umusanzu we kugihugu cye. Nibwo yahise yinjira mugice gishinzwe kwinjiza no abakozi muri ikikigo cya ZipLine kugeza ubu umusaruro atanga ugaragarira amaso naburi wese, ibanga akoresha ngo nukubana nabantu bose neza kandi mumahoro kuko aribyo bisha gutuma yuzuza inshingano ze uko bikwiye."}
{"id": "22346", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22346", "title": "Nadine Karema", "text": "Nadine Karema ni umuyobozi w'indashyikirwa mu rwego rw'ubuzima mu Rwanda, ubu akaba ayobora umuryango Partners In Health(PIH). Azwi mu Rwanda nk'umuntu yaba nyabuzima doreko atari ya kariyeri yiwe. Afite impamyabumenyi y'ikiciro cyakabiri mu ikoranabuhanga yakuye muri kaminuza ya Alliant International University. yo muri amerika. Afite nindi mpamyabumenyi yikirenga mu micungire y'ibigo(Organizational Leadership).\nafite ubu nararibonye bw'imyaka 10 mugushyira mubikorwa gahunda z'ubuzima, cyane mugukoresha imibare n'ikoranabuhanga mugufata ibyemezo. Ubu ni umuyobozi wa GHE(University of Global Health Equity) i Butaro, ndetse ni numwarimu wigisha iby'imitegekere n'ikoranabuhanga mu buzima. Ikindi akora nk'umuhuza hagati ya PIH na Minisitere y'ubuzima mumatsinda yikoranabuhanga mubuzima."}
{"id": "22347", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22347", "title": "Niyonkuru Florence", "text": "Niyonkuru Florence umunyarwandakazi uzwi mugukina umukino wogusiganwa kumaguru, azwi cyane mugusiganwa mu ntera ndende ndetse ziringaniye nka marato nakimwe cya kabiri cya marato.\nNiyonkuru Florence muri 2025 si cyera cyane,yaciye agahigo kokuba ariwe munyarwandakazi watwaye irushanwa Kigali International Marathon ubwo yatsindiye umudari wa golude(gold) aho yari yahize abandi barenga 2899 basiganwaga muri iri rushanwa.\nNi isiganwa yegukanye akoresheje isaha imwe, iminota 10 n'amasegonda 14, arusha iminota icyenda n'amasegonda 13. Niyonkuru Florence akinira ikipe ya sina Gelard, yanegukanye umudari wa zahabu muri Lyon Half Marathon yaberaga mu bufaransa uyumunyarwanda kazi nkuwahize abandi yaje gushimwa na Minisitiri wa siporo Nelly Mukanzayire "}
{"id": "22348", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22348", "title": "Ikiriyo", "text": "Ikiriyo ubundi ni umuhango w'abanyarwanda kuva kera mubakurambere akaba uwo kuboroga no guhoza umuryango wabapfushije, aho abaturanyi, inshuti n'abavandimwe bateranira mu rugo rw'uwapfushije bakamara iminsi m'ugahinda, bakamufasha kwakira no guhangana n'urupfu.\nGuhumuriza.\nIkiriyo ni ni umwanya w'ubumwe n'ubufatanye mu bihe by'akababaro kandi ni igihe kirangwa no gusangira, guhumuriza ababuze, ndetse n'imigenzo irimo no gukura ikiriyo cyangwa se gusoza ikiriyo."}
{"id": "22349", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22349", "title": "Gufata irembo", "text": "Gufata irembo cyangwa Gusaba irembo ni umuhango gakondo wakorwaga n'bakurambere bu Rwanda m'ubukwe nyarwanda, ukaba ariwo ukurikiraho nyuma yo kurambagiza, aho umuryango w'umusore avukamo ujya gusaba maze nyuma yaho umuryango w'umukobwa ubyemeye bagashinga urugo. Byerekana guhabwa ikaze kw'abakwe, ikaba intambwe ya mbere y'imikoranire ishyira akadomo ku kurambagiza.\nUko bikorwa.\nGufata irembo Uko bikorwa nuko umuryango w'umusore uzana inzoga ziherekejwe n'isuka y'ifatarembo hamwe n'inka y'ifatarembo, hakaba hari umwanya wokwakira abakwe, kumenyesha ko umukobwa asabwe, ndetse n'ibimenyetso nk'isando mbese akabando k'umusave byashyirwaga mu bikingi by'amarembo, habaga hari abasaza n'imiryango yombi, ariko umusore n'umukobwa ntibabonekagamo muri ibyo birori."}
{"id": "22350", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22350", "title": "Umuhango", "text": "umuhango ni ijambo rifite ibisobanuro binyuranye bitewe n'aho rikoreshejwe, haba mu muco n'Imigenzo, mu buzima bw'Igitsina Gore ndetse no mu mibanire y'abantu. Umuhango ni igikorwa cyangwa umugenzo ukorwa mu buryo bwihariye kandi bukurikiza amabwiriza runaka yateganyijwe. Ibi bikunze kugaragara mu bihe by'ingenzi by'ubuzima.\nuko rikoreshwa.\nUmuhango ubukwe ubundi rikoreshwa ahantu hatandukanye muburyo butandukanye, haba mu bukwe, Kwita umwana izina, Imihango y'iyobokamana gakondo, Gushyingura, Imihango, (Ibi ni ikimenyetso by'umukobwa cyuko umubiri we ukuze kandi ushobora kubyara, Umuhango nanone kandi ushobora gusobanura igikorwa cyo gusura abantu cyangwa guhura na bo mu buryo bw'icyubahiro."}
{"id": "22351", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22351", "title": "Igisirimba", "text": "Igisirimba ni imbyino gakondo y'umuco nyarwanda, ikunze kugaragara nk'imbyino y'ibyishimo, ishimwe, n'umunezero mwinshi mu bitaramo ndetse cyane cyane mu nsengero, aho abantu babyina bazunguriza amaboko n'amaguru bafatanyije, basimbuka hejuru bagaruka hasi biherekewe n'umudiho. \nKuyibyina.\nIgisirimba Mu gihe cya none ni imbyino ikoreshwa mu kuramya no guhimbaza Imana nk'ikimenyetso cy'ibyishimo by'abakristu, Ababyinnyi bakunze gukora uruziga, bakazunguza amaboko n'ibitugu, bagacinya akadiho, rimwe na rimwe bakaba bakunze gukoreshamo amapendo bayibyina."}
{"id": "22352", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22352", "title": "Ikigoyi", "text": "Ikigoyi ni ururimi rw\u2019Ikirera rushamikiye ku kinyrwanda, aho rukoreshwa n'abaturage bo mu duce tumwe na tumwe tw'u Rwanda. Ni rumwe mu ndimi zunganira Ikinyarwanda m'umwimerere warwo. \nAho rukoreshwa.\nIkigoyi ubundi ni ururimi rukoreshwa n' imiryango imwe n\u2019imwe yo mu karere twa Rubavu na ndetse n'akarere ka Nyabihu aho usanga mu muryango ugizwe n'umugabo, umugore n\u2019abana bavuga Ikinyarwanda, ariko usamga umwe muribo avuga Ikigoyi. Ni nako bimeze ku miryango ituye mu karere ka Burera."}
{"id": "22353", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22353", "title": "Kwirabura", "text": "Kwirabura ni ijambo rya kera mu kinyarwanda mu muco wa kera wa bakurambere, byerekezaga ko ari umuhango wo kujya mu cyunamo cyangwa kugaragaza agahinda k'uwapfuye.\nKwera.\nKwera ni uburyo bw\u2019uruhererekane rwo kwakira urupfu. Kwirabura byabanzirizaga no kwera akaba wari umuhango wo gusoza ikiriyo abantu bakiyuhagira cyangwa bakisiga ingwa ko igihe cya marira kirangiye batangiye ubuzima bushya."}
{"id": "22354", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22354", "title": "Kwera", "text": "Kwera ni umuhango wo mu muco nyarwanda mu bakurambere, Kwera kujya kujyana no Kwirabura, Mu muco nyarwanda wa kera, kwera wari umuhango wakorwaga nyuma y\u2019igihe cy\u2019icyunamo mbese (kwirabura) cyo gupfusha umuntu. Wari umuhango wo kuva mu kigandalo no gusubira mu buzima busanzwe nyuma yu mubabaro n'agahinda.\nKugandara.\nKugandara ni igihe cy\u2019icyunamo n\u2019agahinda k\u2019umuryango wapfushije. Muri iki gihe, abantu baba bari mu mwijima (umukara), ntabwo biyogosheshaga, kandi bakiyiriza ubusa, bimwe mu bikorwa by\u2019ibyishimo bakabihagarika nk\u2019ikimenyetso cy\u2019akababaro no kunamira uwagiye."}
{"id": "22355", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22355", "title": "Icyunamo", "text": "Icyunamo ni umuhango wa kera mu bakurambere mu muco nyarwanda, ni igihe cy'akababaro kidasanzwe cyo kwibuka ndetse no guha icyubahiro uwapfuye. mu muco, babaga bagamije gufashanya, guhumurizanya, no guha ikiriyo n\u2019icyubahiro ababuze ababo.\nUmuriro w\u2019Icyunamo.\nmu cyunamo bacanaga Umuriro w\u2019Icyunamo mu muco wa kera, mu gihe cy\u2019icyunamo cyangwa ikiriyo nk\u2019ikimenyetso cyo kugaragariza abantu uburyo ubuzima bwabo bugenda.\nIcyunamo cy'Igihugu:.\nUyu munsi mu Rwanda, Icyunamo rikoreshwa cyane mu gihe cy' Icyumweru cy'Icyunamo gitangira ku itariki ya 7 Mata, cyibuka Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994, kikaba kirangwa n'ituze, ibiganiro, no gusura inzibutso."}
{"id": "22356", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22356", "title": "Gukaraba", "text": "Gukaraba nyuma y'urupfu ni umuhango wo kwiyeza cyangwa gukaraba intoki mwihunguraho urupfu, uyu ni umwe mu migenzo cyangwa imihango yabagaho nyuma yo gushyingura umuntu abavuye gushyingura bagombaga gukaraba kugira ngo biyambure umwaku cyangwa igitsure cy'urupfu, bakagaruka mu buzima busanzwe bameze nk'abatojwe cyangwa abejejwe.\nUmuco.\nGukaraba mu muco ntibigarukira ku mazi n'isabune gusa, ahubwo ni n'uburyo bwo kwipakurura amakuba cyangwa kwitegura gukomeza gukora imihango y'ubuzima busanzwe nyuma y'umubabaro."}
{"id": "22357", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22357", "title": "Kwirabu ivu", "text": "Kwiraba ivu cyangwa gusigwa ivu ni umuhango ukorwa n'abakirisitu, cyane cyane mu idini rya kiliziya gaturika, uba ku munsi Uwa Gatatu w'Ivu. Uyu munsi uba ari uwa mbere w'Igisibo Gishya buri mwaka mbese utangira iminsi 40 yo kwi tegura Pasika, izuka rya Yezu kristo.\nIvu.\nIvu rikoreshwa ahangaha ntabwo rituruka ku bintu ibyo ari byo byose; akenshi ivu rikoreshwa riva mu mashami y'imigano cyangwa indi mikindo yabaga yakoreshejwe ku cyumweru cy'amashami y'umwaka wawubanjirije, maze agashyirwa mu muriro akavamo ivu."}
{"id": "22358", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22358", "title": "Umunsi wa Mashami", "text": "Umunsi wa Mashami ni umunsi mukuru w'abakirisitu wizihizwa ku cyumweru kibanziriza Pasika, ni umunsi w'izihizwa n'idini ya kiliziya gatolike. uyu munsi ufatwa nk'intangiriro y'Icyumweru gitagatifu.\nImikindo.\nni umunsi wizihizwa mu rwego rwo kwibuka igihe Yezu Kristu yinjiraga mu mugi wa Yeruzalemu nk'umwami, abemera bitwaza amashami y'imikindo mu gutambagira, bashaka kwigana uko abantu ba kera bakiriye Yezu bayasanza mu nzira no kuyazunguza mu kirere bamusingiza."}
{"id": "22359", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22359", "title": "Pst. Madeleine Ndayisenga", "text": "Bwa mbere ku myaka irenga mirongo inani uyu Pst. Madeline Ndayisenga ni umwe mu bagore bagize uruhare mu guhatanira akoreshe imbaraga ze zose mu kugira ngo abashe gusengerwa ajye mu kiciro cy'abashumba b'itorero rya (ADEPR) mu Rwanda. Nkumwe mu bagore ba mbere bahawe inshingano z'ubushumba muri iri torero, taliki ya 9 Ukuboza 2025 mu birori byabereye mu Karere ka Nyamagabe, Umurenge wa Gasaka.\nIMIRIMO YAKOZE\nMbere y'uko yimitswe agahabwa uburenganzira bwo kuba Umushumba Mukuru, yakunze kugaragara nk'umuvugabutumwa ndetse akaba n'umwe mu bayobozi b'abagore bashyize imbaraga mu bikorwa by'iyobokamana mu mibereho myiza y'abakirisitu.\nYabaye umusemburo w'impinduka muri ADEPR, aho yerekanye ko abagore bafite ubushobozi bwo kuyobora amatorero n'amaparuwasi ku rwego rw'Ubushumba. Kandi azwiho gufasha no kwigisha ijambo ry'Imana abakirisito mu buryo bw'umwuka, cyane mu bice by'amajyepfo y'u Rwanda aho akorera mu buzima bwe busanzwe bwa buri munsi.\nKimwe n'abandi bayobozi bo muri ADEPR, agira uruhare mu bikorwa by'amajyambere n'imibereho myiza no gufasha abadafite ubushobozi binyuze mu muryango w'itorero."}
{"id": "22360", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22360", "title": "Ibirundo mu Itorero Ry'abadivantisite", "text": "Ibirundo, Abadivantisite b'umunsi wa karindwi ni rimwe mu matorero abarizwa mu Rwanda kuva mumyaka myinshi itambutse ageza inyigisho z'ubutumwa bwiza kubemera bab'anyarwanda. hari ibikorwa binshi bitandukanye imigenzo, n'imihango babahiriza hari nicyi bita ibirundo.\nIbirundo niki?\nIbirundo nigahunda idasanzwe yo gutanga amaturo cyangwa ituro ryo gushima Imana ibyo yagejeje ku bizera basengera mu itorero mugihe cy'umwaka. Bitandukanye nicyacumi gitangwa cyangwa ituro risanzwe ritangwa ryaburi sabato, uhubwo ni umwanya abizera bafatanyiriza hamwe gushima Imana kubwimigisha yabahaye mu mirirmo bakora yabo nk'ubuhizi,ubucuruzi, ububumbyi, nibindi bitandukanye bibafasha mukwiteza imbere.\nImpamvu babyita Ibirundo?\nInyito \"Ibirundo\" bikomoka kuburyo kera amaturo yakusanywaga mu gihe cya Bibiliya mu gihe cy'ubwami Hezekiya, aho abantu bazanaga imyaka yabo bakayishyira hamwe kugeza ibaye ibiundo bini cyane. Si imyaka gusa baturaga bashoboraga no gutura amafaranga agakusanyirizwa hamwe kugeza abaye menshi Nkicyerekanaga ubwinshi bw'ishimwe ry'abizera. Iyigahunda ishingiye kubivugwa mubitabo 2Ngoma 31:4-10, aho abisirayeli bazanye amaturo menshi cyane bakayarunda hasi biba ibirundo.\nNiryari ayamaturo atangwa?\nMu Rwand ayamaturo y'ibirundo atangwa akunze gutangwa hagati y'amezi ya Gicurasi na Nyakanga. A kenshi bishingira kugihe kisarura kuri burigice kugirango abantu babone ibyo bashima Imana babikuyemu byo basaruye cyagwa mu nyungu babonye mu mirimo yaba bakora yaburi munsi."}
{"id": "22361", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22361", "title": "Jeanne-Fran\u00e7oise Mubiligi", "text": "Jeanne Francoise Mubiligi, ni umwe mubagore mbarwa bayoboye ibigo bitandukanye muri Africa, Kugeza ubu murwanda ayoboye Urugaga rwabikorera(PSF), ururugaga rubumbatiye ibihumbi by'ibigo by'ubucuruzi bifite agaciro kabarirwa mu mafaranga menshi. Yayoboye PSF kuva muri Gashyantare 2023, nyuma yaho uwari ukiyoboye yeguye kunshingano Robert Bapfakurera. yayoboye kandi ikigo gikora imirimo y'ubwubatsi cya E.M.P Ltd.\nIbikorwa by'indashyikirwa yakoze.\nNkuko twabivuze hejuru ni umuyobozi muru w'urwego rwbikorera murwanda kandi ya nayoboye ikigo gikomeye gikora ibijyanye n'ubwubatsi cya E.M.P Ltd.\nYayoboye ihuririro rikuru ry'inama yabagore bikorera kugiti cyabo, ikindi yabashije no mukuba yagiragize uruhare mwihinduka rijyanye n'imisoro kubikorera. agira uruhare rukomeye mugushakira abanyeshuri basoje amashuri kubashakira aho biga bimenyereza akazi murwego rwo kubongerera ubumenyi bufite ireme. "}
{"id": "22362", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22362", "title": "Mukamazimpaka Anathalie", "text": "Nathalie Mukamazimpaka ni umwe mu banyarwandakazi byemejwe ko babonekewe ikibeho, yavutse mu 1964, akomoka mucyahoze ar'intara ya Gikongoro ubu ni mu majyepfo mukarere ka Nyaruguru ababyeyi be ni Laurent Ngango na Gaudance Mukabaziga.\nIcyatumye Amenyekana\nNi umwe mubakobwa batatu babonekewe babona bikiramariya i Kibeho mu Rwanda. Yatangiye kubona ibyo yise amabonekerwa ku 12 Mutarama 1982 ubwo yari umunyeshuri mu ishuri ry'abakobwa i Kibeho Mwishuri rikuru, yabonekewe arihamwe Alphonsine Mumureke na Marie claire Mukangango.\nAmateka y'ingenzi \nAya mabonekerwa yabaye hagati muwi 1981-1983 ariko ntiyahita yemerwa akomeza kugera mu 1989 ubwo yaje kongera kuba.\nBakavugako babonye Bikiramariya witwa Nyina wa Jambo, yabahaga ubutumwa ababwira ati \"Mwicuze ibyaha byanyu, Musenge cyane, Mukunde kandi Mubababarirane.\". Ku ya 15 Kanama 1982, Nathalie na bagenzi be babonye iyerekwa riteye ubwoba babona amaraso menshi, abantu bapfa bicwa nibindi byinshi bivugwako byari ubuhanuzi kuri Jenocide yakozwe mu 1994.\nMu 2001 nibwo hemejwe na Kiliziya ko ayamabonekerwa ari ukuri bwambere mubantu bemejwe kumugaragaro harimo uyu Nathalie. \nMugihe cya Jenocide yahungiye mugihugu cya Congo ahava ajya muri Kenya Nyuma yaho yagarutse i Kibeho, yiyeguriye ubuzima bwo gusenga no kwakira abaje gusura aho hantu. kugeza nubu aracyari i Kibeho."}
{"id": "22363", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22363", "title": "Rose Rwabuhihi", "text": "U Rwanda n' Iterambere ry' Uburinganire.\nu rwanda rumaze gutera intambwe ikomeye mu kwimakaza uburinganire n'ubushobozi bw' abagore mu myaka irenga 30 ishize. ibi byabaye urugendo rutoroshye kuko mumatekaumuco w'igihugu wari ushingiye ku butegesti bw'abagabo bwagiraga abagore abo mu rwego rwo hasi batabona amahirwe angana naya bagabo. \nUruhare rwa Rose Rwabuhihi mu iterambere.\nRose rwabuhihi i umwe mu bagize uruhare rukomeye muri uru rugendo.yabaye Umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe gukurikirana ihame ry'uburinganire (chief gender monitor). yagize uruhare mu kongera kubaka igihugu nyuma ya jenoside yakorewe Abatusti mu 1994,no gushyiraho amategeko n'amahame arengera abagore.\nUbuzima bwa Rose Rwabuhihi.\nRwabuhihi yavukiye i kigali ariko ajya mubuhungiro mu mwaka 1960 kubera imvururu zari zishingiye ku moko. yize mubihugu bitandukanye, aza kubona buruse imujyana kwiga itangaza makuru n'itumanaho mumahanga nutwo atari yarigeze abyifuza na mbere.\nUburyo itangazamakuru yize ryamuhinduriye ubuzima..\nNubwo itangaza makuru atari inzozi ze ryamufashije gufungura amaso kubibazo byugarije \nabagore n'abakobwa. yabonye ihohoterwa n'akarengane bakorerwaga, bituma yiyemeza guharanira uburenganzira bwabo no gushaka icyo yakora ngo abateze imbere.\nUburyo yiyemeje kurengera abagore n 'abakobwa.\nMu myaka 1980, abagore bari ibibazo bikomeye mu bihugu byinshi byo muri africa, Rwabuhihi yabonye ko abagore bafite ubushobozi bwo gukora no gukemura ibibazo bitandukanye, ariko badafite amahirwe cyangwa ijwi. Ibi byatumye yiyemeza kubafasha kubona uburenganzira, ubuvugizi n'amahirwe angana n'ay'abagabo.\nUburyo Rose yavuye mwitangazamakuru akajya mu bidukikije..\nNyuma y'itangazamakuru, yinjiye mu bikorwa byo kurengera ibidukikije. yabonye ko abagore bagira uruhare runini mu gukoresha umutungo kamere, bityo bagomba no kugira uruhare mu kuyirinda no kuyiteza imbere.\nGukangurira abaturage binyuze kuri radio.\nRwabuhihi yakoresheje radiyo nk'uburyo bwo kwigisha abaturage uburenganzira bwabo,cyane cyane mu byaro. yigishaga abagabo n'abahungu kubaha no gushyigikira uburinganire.\nAkazi ke mu muryango w'abibumbye no mu Rwanda..\nRose Rwabuhihi yakoranye n'umuryango wabibumbye (UN) imyaka myinshi, aho yunguste ubunararibonye kubwego mpuzamahanga. yagaruste mu Rwanda mu mwaka 1995, akora muri minisiteri y'uburinganire, nyuma aza kuba Chief Gender Monitor mu 2013.\nIterambere ry' uburinganire mu Rwanda..\nMu myaka 30 ishize u Rwanda rwageze ku iterambere rikomeye harimo nko kuba abagore bafite uburenganzira ku mutungo, uburezi, kwitabira politike nibindi. ibi byari ibintu bidashoboka mbbereya 1994.\nUburezi nk'Inkingi y'iterambere.\nU Rwanda rwashyize imbaraga mu guteza imbere uburezi bw'abakobwa. Ubu abakobwa n'abahungu bafite amahirwe angana mu mashuri no mu masomo yose, nubwo hakiri icyuho mu masomo ya siyance nikoranabuhanga.\nImyumvire yabatuturage..\nNubwo amategeko ateza imbere uburinganire, haracyari imyumvire ya kera igifata abagore nk'abagomba kuba mu nshingano zimwe gusa. guhindura iyi myumvire ni cyo kibazo gikomeye gisigaye.\nintabwe zatewe mu buzima n'imari..\nAbagore ubu bashobora gufungura konti muri bank, gutunga umutungo no kuyobora ibigo.hari n' abagore bari mu myanya ikomeye nk'ubuyobozi bwa banki nkuru. naho mubuzima impfu zababyeyi bapfa babyara zaragabanuste cne.\nImbogamizi zigisigaye.\nNubwo hari iterambere ariko hari nimbogamizi abagore bagihura nazo, nko kwizerwa mubucuruzi, gushyirwaho igitutu cyo gushyingirwa kare, n'imyumvire ibabuza kwiga amasomo akomeye\nUruhare rwitangazamakuru mu guhindura imyumvire.\nRwabuhihi asanga itangazamakuru rigomba kugira uruhare rukomeye muguhindura imyumvire yabanyarwanda nko:\nibi byafasha guhindura uko sosiyette ibabona\nIcyerekezo cy'ahazaza.\nRwabuhihi yifuza u rwanda aho umuntu adacirwa urubanza hashingiwe ku gistina cye, ahubwo ashingiye ku bushobozi bwe. ashaka igihugu aho abana bose,abahungu n' abakobwa, bagira amahirwe angana yo gustinda."}
{"id": "22364", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22364", "title": "Chantal kayitesi", "text": "Amateka ya Chantal Kayitesi\nChantal Kayitesi ni umwe mu Banyarwanda bafite inkuru ikomeye y'ubuzima, igaragaza ububabare n'ubutwari mubihe byabanjirije Jenocide yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994. Yari umwe mu barokotse ubwicanyi bwakorewe Abagogwe mu Majyaruguru y'u Rwanda hagati ya 1991 na 1993, aho benshi mu bagabo n'abahungu bishwe, abagore n'abana bagahungira ahantu hatandukanye bashaka ubuhungiro.\nMugihe yari amaze gukubitwa bikome n'ingabo za leta, Chantal yasigaye atekereza ko ubuzima bwe burangiye. Icyakora, yahuriye n'ingabo za RPA (Inkotanyi) zamutabaraga zimwizeza umutekano. Uwo mwanya wabaye intangiriro y'ubuzima bushya kuri we. \nChantal yahise atanga amakuru ku bandi bagogwe bari bagiye kwicirwa ku rusengero rwa Mugali. Inkotanyi zateguye igikorwa cyo kubarokora zibasha kubakura aho bari bari mukaga. Zibajyana ahatekanye. Ibi byatumye abantu barenga 300 barokoka urupfu rwa rubategereje.\nNyuma y'aho, Chantal yakomeje kubaho ubuzima bushya, anatanga ubuhamya ku mateka mabi yabaye mu Rwanda. Anashimira Inkotanyi zamurokoye. Uyu munsi, afite icyifuzo cyo kwandika igitabo kizafasha abigihe kizaza kumenya amateka n'amasomo akomeye yakuye muri ibyo bihe.\nInkuru ya Chantal Kayitesi ni urugero rw'ubutwari, ukwihangana n'icyizere, igaraza ko n'iyo bihe biba bibi gute, ubuzima bushobora kongera kubakwa bundi bushya."}
{"id": "22365", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22365", "title": "Beatrice Mukasine", "text": "Amateka ya Beatrice Mukankusi.\nBeatrice Mukankusi yabaye umukozi uhoraho mu Muryango w'Abaholandi ushinzwe iterambere witwa SNV(the netherlands development organization) mu gihe cyimyaka 17 yose, kuva 2001-2019 yakoraga mubyiciro bijyanye nuburinganire, imiyoborere myiza ndeste n'imicungire ihuriweho y'umutungo w'amazi. akaba afite impamyabumenyi y'ikiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza (Master's) mubyubucuruzi nimiyoborere(Business Administration), kandi ni ninzobere mu bijyanye n'amazi,nisuku n'isukura \nMukasine Beatrice yari umwarimu ukiri muto wigishaga mu mashuri yisumbuye mu ntara y'amajyepfo mu rwanda igihe amashuri yafungwaga kubera jenoside yakorewe abatusti. nyuma yabo yatangiye igikorwa cyo kongera guhuza abana batabnye nimiryango yabo, yaba iyabo bwite cyangwa imiryango ibakira.yagize kandi uruhare rukomeye mu gukangurira abagore kumenya uburenganzira bwabo, cyane cyane ku bijyanye no gutanga no kuzungura umutungo.\nYakoze kandi muri Minisiteri y'uburinganire no mu Muryango w'Abibumbye, aho yungutse ubunararibonye mpuzamahanga. Mu 2013, yabaye Perezida w'Inama y'Igihugu y'Abagore.\nKugeza ubu muri Ministeri y'Umukozi Ushinzwe umushinga wa Water for Virungas, ugamije guteza imbere imicungire y'amazi no kugabanya amakimbirane mu gace ka Virung. Afite ubunararibonye mu gukorana n'abaturage no guteza imbere uburinganire n'iterambere rirambye."}
{"id": "22366", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22366", "title": "Mare Claire Mukangango", "text": "Marie claire Mukanga umwe mu bagize itsinda ry'abakobwa batatu(3) bagize amabonekerwa i Kibeho, yavutse mu 1961 muri paruwase ya Mushubi, aha hoze ari Rusekera muri diyosezi ya Gikongoro, ubu ni muntara y'amajyepfo. se umubyara yitwa Baseka, nyina akitwa Velonika Nyirantuza, witwbyebye imana mu 2009 gusa se yaje kwitaba Imana akiri muto cyane. Yvukiye mu muryango wabana barindwi yabatijwe taliki ya 12 Kamena 1966 afite imyaka itanu, yahawe isakaramentu ry'ukarisitiya taliki ya 15 Kamena 1969 akamezwa mu 1975.\nImibereho yamuranze.\nMukangango Marie claire yari umwana usanzwe uturuka mu mumuryango utishoboye bituruka kubibazo yahuye nabyo byokubura umubyeyi akiri muto, amashuri abanza yayize mu kigo cya Bishyiga ku Gikongoro ubu ni muri paruwasi ya Bishyiga. Yaje gutsinda ikizamini cya leta kumanota yambere yoherezwa gutangira ayisumbuye muri Gisenyi naho ahava akomereza kwiga muri Rwunge(College) yabakobwa i Kibeho mu mwaka wa mashuri wa 1977-19778.\nAha ninabwo hahise hazamo amabonekerwa yagiriye ikibeho nkayabaye 15/8/1985 aho yahawe ubutumwa bwo kwigisha aba kirisitu ishapule y'ububare burindwi. yaje kuva i Kibeho amaze kwiga ntiyabasha gukomeza kuba yakwiha Imana ahubwo yaje Gushyingirwa mu mwaka 1987, nyuama azakwitaba Imana we n'umutware we muri Jenocide yo 1994 batarabyara umwana.\nImyitwarire yamuranze.\nYari umwana usanzwe ucisha make kandi witonda cyane, bitewe n'ubuzima yaciyemo ntiyakunda gusahinda cyangwa kugira amanyanga ahubwo yarangwaga n'ukuri kandi kuboneye. Ikindi yakundaga gutebya, gutera urwenya nabandi gusabana, kubyina akananga akarengane kabagenzi. Muri rusange yabaniraga neza abantu bose kandi agakunda gusenga cyane "}
{"id": "22367", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22367", "title": "Umutoni christine", "text": "Mutoni Christine.\nMUTONI CHRISTINE ni umukobwa w'umunyarwandakazi, wandika ibitabo. Kuri 25 Werurwe 2026 yamuritse igitabo cye cya mbere cyitwa:\" Pride of Tomorrow.\", mu kinyarwanda bivuze ngo:\" Ishema ry'ejo Hazaza\"."}
{"id": "22368", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22368", "title": "Martina Abera Kabagambe", "text": "Ni muntu ki?\nKabagambe Abera Martina ni umunyarwandakazi w'umunyamakurukazi wa RBA ugaragara cyane kuri KC2. Yavutse mumwaka wa 2001uyu munyamakurukazi yamenywe cyane mu kuyobora ibiganiro akoresha ururimi rw'icyongereza.Yanakoze mu nama ya CHOGM yabereye mu Rwanda mumwaka wa 2022"}
{"id": "22369", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22369", "title": "Uwimana ciney aisha", "text": "Ciney.\nuwimana Aisha ciney wamenyekanye ku izina rya ciney ni umuraperi wumunyarwandakazi wavukiye mu gihugu cya gabon.\narubatse kuva muri 2017 ndetse afite nabana\nnubwo benshi bibeshya ko yaba ari umuyisilamu kubera izina rye aisha, we yavuze ko irizina ryakomotse kumuhanzi aisha kone wo muri gabon bitewe nuko nyina yamukundaga cyane.\nNyuma yo kumara imyaka 12 aretse umuziki mumwaka wa 2025 yatangaje ko yawusubukuye kandi ko abakunzi be batazongera kumukumbura ahita anasohora indirimbo yise \"Avec toi\""}
{"id": "22370", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22370", "title": "Rulinda charlotte", "text": "Charly.\nRulinda charlotte yavutse 1990,wamenyekanye cyane mu itsinda rya Charly na Nina ku izina rya Charly, akaba ari umunyarwandakazi wakoraga umwuga wo kuririmba anyuze mu itsinda rya charly na Nina.\nAkazi.\nCharly yatangiye aririmba ku giti cye gusa aza gucika intege, mu mwaka wa 2011 nibwo yatangiye kugaragara mu baririmbyi bafasha abahanzi, no kubunganira aba bazwi nka back up singers(bakapu singezi) muri za Primus Guma Guma Superstar. Mu mwaka wa 2014 nibwo yahuye na Nina maze bakora itsinda rya charly na Nina.Mu ntangiriro z'umwaka wa 2020 haje kwasaswa inkuru ivuga ko yatandukanye na Nina bityo, gukora umuziki nk'itsinda bikaba bihagaze nyuma yaho Nina yaririmbye mu gitaramo cya EAC iDeserve wenyine. Gusa nyuma yaho baje kubinyomoza bavuga ko bari baragiye mu karuhuko, ko ibyo gutandukana ari ibihuha.Mu mwaka wa 2022 nibwo we na mugenzi we bongeye gusohora indirimbo bise\" Lavender\", gusa nyuma yaho ntago bongeye kuira indi ndirimbo basohora.\nIndirimbo yasohoye.\nCharlotte yabanje kuba umuririmbyi ku giti cye mu mwaka wa 2012, asohora indirimbo nyinshi zirimo: Ntawe ukuruta, warezwe nande, Uragumana nanjye, Ndabirambiwe n'izindi.\nAbatunganya indirimbo bakunze gukorana.\nProducer Fazzo, Washington, Chris Cheetah, Piano the grooveman."}
{"id": "22371", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22371", "title": "Nina fatuma", "text": "MUHOZA FATUMA wamenyekanye mu itsinda rya Charly na Nina ni umunyarwadakazi wavutse kuri 12 Nyakanga 1987.\nAkazi.\nMu mwaka wa 2009 nibwo yatangiye umuziki, aho yasubiragamo indirimbo z'abandi bahanzi mu mwimerere wazo.\nMu ntangiriro z'umwaka wa 2014 nibwo yihuje na Charlotte bakora itsina rya Charly na Nina(The Sterioz). \nAmarushanwa yitabiriye.\nMu mwaka wa 2013 yitabiriye irushanwa rya Tusker Project Fame rimwe mu marushanwa akomeye abera muri Afurika Y'uburasirazuba.\nAho yaririmbye.\nYaririmbiye mu mahoteli menshi akomeye yo mu Rwanda harimo:\nIndirimbo ze.\nMbere yuko yifatanya na Charly yari yarasohoye indirimbo ze ebyiri arizo: Uzabaze na Igihe kizagera."}
{"id": "22372", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22372", "title": "Melissa Akanigi Ishimwe", "text": "Ni muntu ki?\nMelissa ni umukinnyi wa golf w'umunyarwandakazi w'imyaka 23, akaba avuka ari umwana wa gatatu. Yamamaye cyane kubera kwandika amateka kurwego mpuzamahanga.\nyitabiriye irushanwa rya miss Rwanda mu mwaka wa 2020 nubwo nta kamba yegukanye\nYatangiye uyu mukino muri nyakanga mu mwaka wa 2023 ariko abikora bitari umwuga.\nMu mwaka wa 2025, Melissa yakoze amateka yinjira muri Guinness World Records nyuma yo gukina imyobo 18 (18 holes) mu minota 52 nta bufasha, aba umugore wa mbere ku isi ubikoze mu gihe kiri munsi y\u2019iminota 55"}
{"id": "22373", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22373", "title": "La Reina", "text": "UWIMANZI Oda Martine uzwi ku izina rya La Reina ni umunyarwandakazi wavukiye mu Karere ka Nyamagabe.\nUbuzima bwite.\nLa Reina avuka ari ubuheture cyangwa umwana wa gatatu mu muryango w'abana barindwi. Akaba avugwa mu rukundo rumaze imyaka itandatu n'umuhanzi kandi unatunganya imiziki Prince Kiiz.\nAkazi.\nNi umuhanzi\nYigisha kuririmba rimwe mu mashuri ya Kigali.\nAmashuri yize.\nMu mwaka wa 2019 yagiye kwiga umuziki mu ishuri ry'u muziki ry'u Rwanda riherereye mu karere ka Muhanga yasoje muri 2022.\nImpano.\nAfite impano zitandukanye harimo niyo gucuranga Guitar kuko akenshi aririmba akanicurangira.\nKwandika indirimbo, aho hari n'abandi bahanzi yagiye afasha harimo Bruce Melodie, n'indirimbo yahuriyemo Ariel wayz na Juno KIzigenza yitwa Injyana.\nIndirimbo ze.\nNditinya ikaba ari nayo ndirimbo ye ya mbere yasohoye ndetse na Basi.\nIndirimbo z'uruhererekane 6 Yise EP 1(Extendede Playlist 1), harimo:\nInzu itunganya imiziki abarizwamo.\nLa Reina mu mwaka wa 2024 yasinanye na n'inzu itunganya imiziki yitwa \"Hybrid Music\" amasezerano azamara imyaka 5."}
{"id": "22374", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22374", "title": "Honorine iribagiza", "text": "Ibimwerekeyeho.\nHonorine Iribagiza ni umukinnyi w\u2019Umunyarwandakazi uzwi mu gusiganwa ku maguru (athletics), cyane cyane mu cyiciro cya 800m.\nYamenyekanye akiri muto mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga, aho yegukanye umudari wa bronze mu irushanwa rya Africa Youth Athletics Championships ryabereye muri Mauritius mu 2015. \nYakomeje kwitwara neza no mu marushanwa y\u2019abato (junior), aho yitabiriye African Junior Athletics Championships ndetse n\u2019andi marushanwa mpuzamahanga ahagarariye u Rwanda."}
{"id": "22375", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22375", "title": "J-sha", "text": "J-SHA.\nJ-Sha ni itsinda ry'abakobwa babiri b'impanga bavutse mumwaka wa 2001.Aba banyarwadakazi binjiye mu muziki mu mwaka wa 2023. Amazina yabo ni Bukuru Jennifer na Butoyi Shakira. Bakaba bararirimbye mu birori bikomeye byabereye mu gihugu cyacu harimo; CHOGM, Kigali Up, Commonwealth, AU Summit.\nAmashuri.\nMu mwaka wa 2018 batangiye amashuri yabo yibijyanye n'umuziki mu Ishuri ry'umuziki ry'u Rwanda bayasoza mu mwaka wa 2021.\nIndirimbo zabo.\nMabukwe, ikaba ariyo ndirimbo yabo ya mbere basohoye\nHobby\nGanza\nNtibizongera, indirimbo yo Kwibuka\nFaya bakoranye na Kenny Sol\nDo it bakoranye na Andy Bumuntu.\nAbahanzi bakoranye.\nAndy Bumuntu\nKenny Sol\nIbitaramo bitarabiriye.\nUnveil Africa Fest 2024"}
{"id": "22376", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22376", "title": "Vestine Ishimwe", "text": "Ni muntu ki?\nIshimwe Vestine ni umuririmbyi w'indirimbo zo kuramya no guhimbaza imana ukomoka mu Rwanda, akaba azwi cyane mubagize itsinda vestine na dorcas afatanyije na murumuna we Dorcas. Vestine yavutse tariki ya 2 gashyantare 2004.Avukira mu karere ka Musanze muntara y'amajyaruguru.\nyatangiye umuziki aririmba muri Goshen choir i musanze. baza kutangira kuririmba kugiti cyabo mur 2018. guhera muri 2020 nibwo we na murumuna we batangiye gukora na Murindahabi Irenee muri MIE\nKugeza ubu Vestine arubatse na ouedraogo Idrissa kuva mu mwaka wa 2025"}
{"id": "22377", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22377", "title": "Sarah sanyu\\", "text": "Ibyo wamenya kuri Sarah SANYU..\nAmazine ye bwite ni: Sarah UWERA, Uyu ni umuhanzikazi wamenyekanye muri Ambassadors of Christ Choir mu itorero ry'abadivantisiti b'umunsi wa karindwi, kurubu akaba asigaye akora umuziki ku giti cye. yakunzwe kubera indirimbo nyinshi za Ambassadors yumvikanamo aziyoboye mu ijwi ryizihira abaryumva, nka \"Birakwiye gushima\", \"Yesu we\" n'izindi."}
{"id": "22378", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22378", "title": "Shimwa Akaliza Gaella", "text": "Ni muntu ki?\nShimwa Akaliza Gaella avuka mu muryango w'abana 3 akaba ari we mfura. Ni umukobwa, abandi bavandimwe be babiri ni abahungu. Yatangiye kuririmba afite imyaka 3 y'amavuko, atangira kuririmba muri Injili Bora ajyana na nyina.\nShimwa Akaliza n'ubwo ari muto mu myaka ariko ni munini cyane mu muziki, dore ko ari na we wateye indirimbo yakunzwe bikomeye yitwa \"Shimwa\" ya Injili Bora imwe mu makorali akunzwe muri Kigali. Uretse kuririmba, ni n'umuhanga cyane mu kubwiriza."}
{"id": "22379", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22379", "title": "Sharon Gatete", "text": "Ibyo wamenya kuri sharon Gatete.\nNi umuhazikazi akaba n'umwanditsi w'indirimbo zo kuryamya no guhimbaza imana. Yavukiye mu karere ka Gasabo, umurenge wa kacyiru mumujyi wa kigali.\nSharon yamenye ko afite impano yo kuririmba afite iyaka 9 ubwo yigaga muri kigali parent school. Arangije amashuri yisumbuye nibwo yahisemo gukurikirana umuziki abigize umwuga. Mu mwaka wa 2018 yiyandikishije mu ishuri ry'umuziki riherereye ku nyundo\nmu mwaka wa 2021 nibwo yarangije mu ishuri rya muzika ryo ku Nyundo afite ubuhanga mu bijyanye nimiziki,ubucuruzi bw'umuziki ndetse no guhimba indirimbo.\nubuzima bwite.\nSharon Gatete arubatse na Chryso Rudasingwa"}
{"id": "22380", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22380", "title": "Kibasumba confiance", "text": "Umusizi Kibasumba Confiance uri kwigaragaraza cyane muri iki gihe..\nUyu mukobwa amazee igihe ari gutegura Album ye ya mbere, ni nyuma y'uko ashyize hanze Ibisigo binyuranye birimo n'ibyo yahuriyeho n'abarimo abaraperi nka Racine, Mr Kagame, umusizi Rumaga n'abandi.\nUyu kandi yavuzeko inganzo y'ubusizi yaganje muri we biturutse ku kuba yarakuranye amatsiko, kuko n'iyo abajije mu bisekuru bye nta musizi wigeze uba mu muryango w'iwabo.\nYavuzeko kubera kubika amagambo menshi muri we binyuze mu gusoma ibigtabo no gusobanura bakuru be byabaye imvano yo kumva ko yayabyazamo amagambo atondekanyije agatyanga ubutumwa bugari kuri sosiyete kandi bukabagirira akamaro.\nAvuga ko muri 2020, ari bwo yamenye ko ibikorwa bye ashobora kubinyuza kuri Youtube, ndetse atangirira ku gihangano yise 'Impano' yahimbiye inshuti ye yari yagize isabukuru y'amavuko.\nRumaga, umusizi wamutinyuye kandi yiiteguye gutera ikirenge mu cye.\nKu wa 23 Ugushyingo 2023, nibwo uyu mukobwa yashyize hanze igisigo cye yise 'Impanuro' yakoranye n'umusizi mugenzi we Rumaga. Ni igisigo avuga ko cyahinduye urugendo rwe rwo gusiga. Asobanura Rumaga nk'ishusho y'umusizi u Rwanda rukeneye Ati \" Ukivuga ibisigo uhita utekereza Rumaga.\"\nKibasumba yavuze ko Rumaga ari umuntu udatererana ubusizi, kandi buri gihe ahora amwibutsa gushyira imbaraga mu bihangano bye.\nKibasumba yatangaje ko burigihe agerageza gutera ikirenge mu cya Rumaga."}
{"id": "22381", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22381", "title": "Akingeneye olga", "text": "ibyo wamenya kuri Olga Akingeneye.\nAkingeneye olga ni umunyarwandakazi w'imyaka 25. yize itangazamakuru n'itumanaho muri kaminuza ya mount kenya ariko ubu akaba ari rwiyemeza mirimo mugucuruza ibirungo by'ubwiza(make up)\nOlga yahiye isura afite imyaka 3 ariko ntibyamubujije gutinyuka akiteza imbere ndetse no gukangurira abandi bitinya kubera ubumuga runaka bafite.\nAkingeneye arubatse n'umugabo we Arthur Ndoba."}
{"id": "22382", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22382", "title": "Igiraneza Ange", "text": "Umukobwa wahize abandi mu marushanwa y'Imibare ku munsi Mpuzamahanga w'Imibare..\nIgiraneza ange wiga kuri New Vision HIgh School mu Mujyi wa Kigali, yaje ku mwanya wa Kabiri mu marushanwa yateguriwe abanyeshuri biga mu mashuri yisumbuye mu Mibare, akaba n'uwa mbere mu bakobwa, yavuze ko abakobwa benshi batinye imibare kuko badakunda kwigora.\nUmunsi Mpuzamahanga w'Imibare (\u03c0-day) wizihizwa buri tariki ya 14 Werurwe, hazirikanwa akamaro kayo muri sosiyete. Mu Rwanda wizihijwe ku nshuro ya kabiri ku bufatanye bwa Kaminuuza y'Urwanda n'ibindi bigo bifite aho bihuriye no guteza imbere siyansi.\nAya marushanwa yahuje abana 114 barimo abakobwa 55 n'abahungu 59 baturutse mu Mujyi wa Kigali no mutundi turere dutandatu, mu bigo 24 by'amashuri.\nMuri rusange uwa mbere yabaye Munezero Aimee Cedrick wiga kuri Petit Seminaire Ndera wahembwe iPAD n'amadorari 500, uwa kabiri aba Igiraneza Ange wiga kuri New Vision High School wahembwe amadorali 500 n'impamyabushobozi naho uwa Gatatu aba Magambo Richard na we wiga kuri Petit Seminaire Ndera wahembwe amadorali 500.\nMu butumwa Ange yahaye abandi bakobwa yagize ati \" Ikintu gikenewe ni uko bagomba kumenya ko imibare ikenewe ahantu hose, ikintu cyose ni imibare, niyo waba utambuka ni imibare uba ukoresha.\""}
{"id": "22383", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22383", "title": "Chacha", "text": "IMFURIKEYE CHARTINE wamenyekanye ku izina rya Chacha Imfurikeye ni umuhanzikazi ukizamuka mu njyana ya POP ndetse n'umwanditsi w'indirimbo. Yakuriye mu karere ka Kicukiro, mu muryango w'abana batandatu, abakobwa batatu. Chacha avuka mu muryango umushyigikiye kandi nabo bakunze kugaragara mu bikorwa bitandukanye by'imyidagaduro, kuko afite Nyirasenge wamamaye mu ikinamico Urunana ku izina rya Agnes, kandi na Nyina umubyara yari umwanditsi w'indirimbo mu gihe cyahise. \nAmashuri yize.\nAmashuri yisumbuye ikiciro rusange yayize College Marie Reine De La Paix Rwamagana na Institut Don Bosco Kabarondo. Icyiciro cya kabiri cyamashuri yisumbuye kizwi nka Combination yize icungamutungo kukigo cya Lycee Saint Alexandre Sauli de Muhura gusa ntago yabikomeje yahise ajya kwiga mu Ishuri ry'umuziki rya Nyundo ryaje kwimukira mu Karere ka Muhanga ibijyanye n'injyana no kwandika indirimbo. Yasoje kuhiga 2022\nIndirimbo.\nChacha yasohoye indirimbo zitandukanye harimo iyitwa \"Mureke abeho\" ari nayo ya mbere yasohoye 2023,Riding High yakoranye na Ella Rings, Intashyo yakoranye na Fox Makare, Hose yakoranye na Bill Ruzima na Mike Kayihura ndetse na Nshuti yanjye yahuriyemo na Bill Ruzima.\nChacha kandi yafashije abahanzi batandukanye kwandika indirimbo harimo Ariel Ways na France Mpundu.\nAbahanzi bakoranye.\nNkuko twabibonye haruguru Chacha yakoranye n'abahanzi batandukanye mu gihe gito amaze mu muziki nyarwanda. Harimo: Bill Ruzima, Mike Kayihura, Fox Makare, Ella Rings."}
{"id": "22384", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22384", "title": "Giramata olga", "text": "Giramata olga ni muntu ki?\nGiramata olga ni umwe mu bahanzi babakobwa bakizamuka mu rwanda yatangiye kumenyekana mu ruhando rwa muzika ahagana mu mwaka wa 2019-2020.\nGiramata yitabiriye irushanwa rya miss rwanda 2022 afite igitekerezo cyo kuvugira abahanzikazi bahura n'ibibazo byo gusabwa ruswa irimo n'ishingiye ku gitsina \nGiramata yemeza ko icyo ashimira imana ari uko yabashije kunyura mu mitego yamusabaga no gutanga ruswa ariko akahava atayitanze\nKuri ubu Giramata ni umwe mu bahanzi binjijwe muri SAGE music, sosiyete nshya ifasha abahanzi yinjiye ku isoko ry'urwanda"}
{"id": "22385", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22385", "title": "Uwineza Catherine", "text": "Uwineza Catherine, umu Physiotherapist w' amakipe akomeye muri Tour du Rwanda.\nTour du Rwanda ni iki?\nIsiganwa mpuzamahanga ry'amagare rya Tour du Rwanda, ni irushanwa riba ririmo amakipe n'abakinnyi bakomeye, ariko nanone kugira ngo bitware neza, haba hari ababafasha barimo abakanishi n'abaganga.\nUbuzima bwa Uwineza Catherine ku bijyanye n'umwuga we\nUwineza Catherine, umaze imyaka umunani akora akazi ko kunanura imitsi y'abakinnyi mu makipe akina Tour du Rwanda n'andi marushanwa y'amagare akomeye, yize amashuri ye yose mu Rwanda mu bijyanye n'Ubugenge, Ubutabire n'Ibinyabuzima, aminuriza muri Kaminuza y'u Rwanda mu Ishami ry'Ubuzima n'Ubuvuzi, aho yamaze imyaka ine yiga Physiotherapy.\nYinjiye mu mukino w'amagare mu 2018, ubwo yakoranaga n'Ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda y'Abagore yari mu mikino ya Shampiyona ya Afurika.\nMu 2022 yahise atangira gukorana na Saris Rouvy Sauerland Team yo mu budage, ari nayo yaje guhinduka Rembe-Rad-Net Pro Cycling Team ari nayo akorana nayo kugeza ubu.\nAkorera he mu busanzwe?\nIyo nta marushanwa ahari, Uwineza aba ari umukozi muri HVP Gatagara Orthopedic and Rehabilitation Hospital, aho akorera akazi ke ka buri munsi ko gufasha abarwayi kunanura imitsi."}
{"id": "22386", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22386", "title": "Umuryango remezo", "text": "Umuryango remezo cyangwa umuryangoremezo ni umuryango shingiro muri Kiliziya Gatolika ku rwego rw\u2019ibanze mbese kurwego rwohasi, aho abakristu batuye begeranye haba mu midugudu, akagari cyangwa se mu masegiteri, ibi bishyira hamwe imiryango kugirango basangire Ijambo ry\u2019Imana, basengere hamwe, ndetse kandi bafashanye mu buzima bwa buri munsi.\nIshingano z'umuryango remezo.\numuryango remezo haba hari inshingano zitandukanye twavuga gusangira Ijambo ry'Imana abagize umuryango remezo barahura bagasomera hamwe Bibiliya, ijambo ry'Imana, kandi ni ihuriro ryo gusengera hamwe, ndetse Ubufatanye n'Urukundo."}
{"id": "22387", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22387", "title": "Paruwasi", "text": "Paruwasi ni icyicaro cy'ubuyobozi cyangwa kikaba uhurira rya santarale,umidugudu, Sikilisali bakorera imimuriko, ndetse n'ubuyobozi bwa Kiliziya gatolika cyangwa amadini yandi asazwe gusa muri Kiliziya Gatolika kiba kigizwe n'abakristu batuye mu gace kamwe k'akarere runaka, bayobowe na Padiri Mukuru cyangwa pasiteri ariwe mushyumba.\nIshingano.\nKuri Paruwasi niha habera ibinyu byinshi bitandukanye harimo ubuyobozi icyicaro cya padiri mukuru, ndetse no gutanga inshingano nko gutanga amasakaramentu, kwigisha ijambo ry'Imana, no gufasha binyuze muri Caritasi. paruwasi ya mbere yashinzwe mbere mu Rwanda ni Save yashinzwe muri 1900."}
{"id": "22388", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22388", "title": "Kwita izina", "text": "Kwita izina ni umugenzo wa bakurambere aho wakorerwaga umwana wuruhinja wavutse, maze bakamwakira umuntu mushya kuva cyera mu muryango w\u2019Abanyarwanda, habaga hari ababyeyi n\u2019abaturanyi baje kumuterura.\nubunnyano.\nubunnyano rero impamvu kwita izina babyita ubunnyano, nuko abana babahaga ibyo kurya ku ntara ariko bakaba babumbabumbye utubumbe twinshi, tumeze nk\u2019uko umwana annya impande zose, ariko abo bana bagataha iwabo ari uko umwana aneye."}
{"id": "22389", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22389", "title": "Gukwikurura", "text": "Gutwikurura ni umuhango wa korwaga nyuma ubwo babaga bamaze gusoza imihango y\u2019ubukwe mu muco nyarwanda. rero iri jambo gutwikurura ikomoka ku nshinga gutwikura, bishaka kuvuga gukura umwitwikiro ku mugeni. \nibikorwa mu gutwikurura.\nUyu muhango wo gutwikurura ufite ibikorwa biyana nawo, ahatwavuga gusohora umugeni aho cyari igikorwa cyo guha umugeni uburenganzira bwo gusohoka mu muryango mbese mu inyegamo, akajya ahagaragara kugira ngo atangire imirimo yomu rugo rushya, Kumenyera umuryango, Bibafasha umugeni kumenyerana n'umuryango mushya ashatsemo, kumenya imyitwarire n'imico yawo."}
{"id": "22390", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22390", "title": "Kurambagiza", "text": "Kurambagiza ni umwe mu migenzo yakorwaga n'abacyera abakurambere, aho cyari igikorwa cyangwa urugendo rutoroshye rwo kumenyana no gusuzuma niba imiryango ibili ifite ibantu abantu babiri bakundana bashobora kubana mbese kureba ko umugabo ndetse n'umugore niba bombi bufite intego n'indangagaciro bihuye mbere yo gufata icyemezo cyo gushyingiranwa.\nIntego.\nKurambagiza byari bifite Intego yo gushinga urugo, Kurambagiza nyakuri ntibiba ari ukwishimisha gusa, ahubwo biba bifite intego yo kureba niba mwazubaka urugo, Kumenyana byimbitse, Ni umwanya wo kuganira ku mico, amateka, n'imyizerere ya buri wese kugira ngo mumenye niba mushobora kuzuzanya, kandi ni umwanya usaba ubushishozi, bisaba kureba imyifatire y'undi, kumenya imiryango avukamo, n'uburyo afata ibyemezo."}
{"id": "22391", "revid": "106", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22391", "title": "Umuryango", "text": "Umuryango ubundi ugizwe n'umugabo, umugore, n'abana, ariko ukaba ushobora no kwaguka ukageza kuri ba sekuru, ba nyogokuru, n'abandi banyamuryango.ubundi umuryango ni ihuriro ry'abantu bafitanye isano wenda rishingiye ku gushyingiranwa, ku maraso, cyangwa ku kurera, umuryango ufatwa nk'inkingi ya mwamba y'ubuzima n'iterambere.\nAmaraso.\nBurya umuryango ubaho gusa atari kuba dusangiye amaraso,ni harya hantu abantu bose baba bagukunda, uko waba umeze kose,aho banezerererwa iterambere ryawe uko biba biri kose."}
{"id": "22392", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22392", "title": "Gusaba", "text": "Gusaba umugeni ni umuhango wakurikiraga uwo gufata irembo, ukabera iwabo w\u2019umukobwa, mu muhango wo gusaba, umuryango w\u2019umusore watoranyaga abakwe bajya kuwusabira, bakagenda bayobowe n\u2019umukwe mukuru, bitwaje inzoga yo gusabisha.\nAgaciro.\nGusaba ukaba wari umuhango wo guha agaciro imiryango w'umukobwa, kuko umusore ntiyabaga yemerewe gutwara umukobwa atamuhawe, Ibyo byari ikimenyetso cy\u2019uko umuryango w\u2019umuhungu uha agaciro umuryango wareze umukobwa. gusa ariko nanone mu gihe cyo gusaba, umuryango w\u2019umukobwa ntiwahitaga wemerera umuryango w\u2019umusore umugeni, ibyo bikagaragaza kwihesha agaciro nk\u2019umuryango no kugahesha abawukumokamo."}
{"id": "22393", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22393", "title": "Gukwa", "text": "Gukwa ni umuhango wabaga nyuma yo gusaba, mu muhango wo gukwa wakorwaga n\u2019umuryango w\u2019umusore kandi ukabera iwabo w\u2019umukobwa. Umusore yakwaga inka, isuka cyangwa andi matungo nubwo hose bavugaga ko bakoye inka.\nInkwano.\nInkwano yabaga ari ikimenyetso hagati y\u2019imiryango yombi, ko ibaye inshuti. Inkwano yari ipfundo ry\u2019ubumwe hagati y\u2019imiryango yombi,mu muco Nyarwanda, inkwano ntiyabaga inzitizi. Yaba yabonetse cyangwa itabonetse, ntibyabuzaga ubukwe gutaha. Igihe inkwano yabaga ibuze, umusore yashoboraga gutenda, ni ukuvuga gufata igihe aba kwa sebukwe akora akazi gasimbura inkwano cyangwa agahabwa umugeni w\u2019ubuntu."}
{"id": "22394", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22394", "title": "Umuhango wo gutebutsa", "text": "Gutebutsa uyu ni umuhango ukomeye ukurikira gusaba no gukwa, Aha umuryango w\u2019umusore ujyaga iwabo w'umuryango w\u2019umukobwa hagamijwe kuganira ku gihe umugeni bazamubazanira mbese igihe bazamubahekera bakamubazanira.\nAgaciro.\nGutebutsa hari uduce tumwe na tumwe gutebutsa byakorwaga cyangwa bikorwa inshuro zirenzwe imwe, aha umuryango w\u2019umukobwa ugakomeza kwihagararaho kugira ngo umuryango w\u2019umusore ubone agaciro k\u2019umukobwa wabo."}
{"id": "22395", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22395", "title": "Kurongorana", "text": "Kurongorana ni umuhango uba hagati y'umugabo n'umugore baherejwe n'imiryango yabo yombi bagiye kurongorana, akaba ari igihe iyo kigeze, umuryango w\u2019umukobwa waramuhekaga ukamushyira umuryango w\u2019umusore. Iyo yabaga ageze kwa sebukwe, hari imihango yakorwaga yo kumwakira ikagenda itandukana bitewe n\u2019agace.\nUmugeni.\nUmugeni iyo yabaga akiri mu bikingi by\u2019amarembo, yahagararaga hejuru y\u2019aho batabye urusyo, nyirabukwe akamukoza umwuko ku mpanga gusa nanone umugeni arakomeza maze akinjira agasanga sebukwe yicaye ikambere akamwica ku bibero akanamuha inka y\u2019ibibero akabona kujyanwa mu mbere.\nUmukwe.\nIyo ibirori by\u2019ubukwe byabaga bigeze hagati, se w\u2019umusore yamujyanaga kurongora, mu kurongora hakoreshwaga umwishywa, umusore akawambika umugeni hanyuma akivuga ati ndakurongoye ndi kanaka mwene kanaka\u2019 maze ababyeyi bakavuza impundu. Ibirori byarakomezaga kugeza mu gitondo, abaje baherekeje umugeni bagasezera bagataha.\nUbusugi.\nNta mukobwa washyingirwaga yaratakaje ubusugi kuko kubutakaza byabaga ari igisebo ku mukobwa, umuryango akomokamo n\u2019igihugu. Uwabaga yatwise atarashyingirwa, yafatwaga nk\u2019uwatesheje igihugu ubusugi, kugira ngo igihugu gisubirane iryo shema ry\u2019ubusugi bwacyo, umukobwa bakamucira mu mahanga cyangwa bakamuroha."}
{"id": "22396", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22396", "title": "Gutinya", "text": "Gutinya umwanya cyangwa igihe kiba nyuma y'ubukwe akaba ari umuhango wo mu muco nyarwanda gakondo kuva kera mu bakurambere mu Rwanda, aho umugeni yamaraga mu nzu i kambere iminsi runaka iminsi igera kuri 7 cyangwa irenga nyuma yo kurongorwa, ntajye ahagaragara cyangwa ngo akore imirimo yo mu rugo.\nGukwikurura.\nGutinya byasoza n'umuhango wasozwaga n'undi muhango witwa Gutwikurura, aho umugeni yasohorwaga akerekanwa ku mugaragaro maze agatangira imirimo ye nk'umugore mu rugo rwe."}
{"id": "22397", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22397", "title": "Ubukwe", "text": "Ubukwe ni umuhango ubumbatiye Umuco nyarwanda. Uyu muhango w'ubukwe ukorwa hagati y'imiryango ibiri ihana umugeni n'umukwe, ni ukuvuga umuryango w'umusore n'umukobwa, Ubukwe ni itangiriro ryo kubaho k'umuryango, ubukwe akaba ari igihe abafashe Umwanzuro wo kubana batanya binyuze mu mucyo, bakemera gushyigikirwa maze nabo bakajya kubaka umuryango wabo witezweho kwagura igihugu binyuze mu kubyara no kurera abana bazaba Rwanda rwejo.\nImihango y'ubukwe.\nUbukwe bugira imihango mwinshi itandukanye aha twavuga:"}
{"id": "22398", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22398", "title": "Gushyingirwa", "text": "Gushyingirwa ni umuhango cyangwa isezerano ryo guhuza umugabo n'umugore bakemeranya kubana akaramata nk'umuryango umwe, harimo abemeza gushyingirwa mu idini cyangwa gushyingirwa mu mategeko gusa, ariko abashyingirwa ni abafite nibura imyaka 18.\nIsezerano.\nGushyingirwa ni igikorwa cyo guhamya isezerano ry'abashakanye imbere y'ubuyobozi bwa Leta mbese mu murenge, aho biyemeza kubana no gufashanya bakurikije amategeko agenga umuryango,Ku bemera Imana, gushyingirwa bifatwa nk'isakaramentu cyangwa umuhamagaro uturuka ku Mana, aho umugabo n'umugore bafatanya mu kurema no kurera umuryango mushya, Intego nyamukuru ni ugushinga urugo rugengwa n'urukundo, ubwuzuzanye, no gukomeza igisekuru binyuze mu kubyara no kurera neza."}
{"id": "22399", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22399", "title": "INDWARA Z'INYAMASWA", "text": "Indwara zinyamaswa &lt;mark&gt;ni indwara zandurira mu nyamaswa zikagera no ku bantu (Zoonoses), ziterwa n'udusimba duto, imibu, cyangwa guhurira n'inyamaswa z'inkazi, nk'uko bigaragazwa mu&lt;/mark&gt; REB e-learning.Kwirinda izi ndwara bisaba gukora isuku, gutema ibihuru, no kuryama mu nzitiramubu. Indwara zinyamaswa zikunze kwibasira inyamaswa n'abantu (Zoonoses):\nUko twakwirinda indwara zinyamaswa:\nKumenya no kwirinda izi ndwara ni ngombwa mu kubungabunga ubuzima bw'abantu n'inyamaswa, nk'uko bitangazwa ku REB e-learning. "}
{"id": "22400", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22400", "title": "IKIZA K'IMWITOZO NGORORA MUBIRI KU BAGORE BATWITE", "text": "Bamwe mubagore batwite ndetse n'imirwango yabo bibaza ngo imwitozongorora mubiri nimwiza k'umugore utwite.bamwe bavuga ibitandukanye harabavugako siporo ari nzinza,abandi ngo ni byemewe.\nsiporo ni ngenzi kubagore batwite\nishami ryubuzima ryita kubuzima (OMS),ryemezako siporo k'umugore utwite aringenzi kubuzimabwe bwiza nubw'umwana atwite.\nkandi bavugako kumugore utwite yarasanzwe akora siporo agomba kuzikomeza muburyo bworoheje, budatuma bananirwa cyane,ariko ngo no kubadasanzwe bagomba kuyikora ku bw'ibyiza byayo.\nGukora siporo cyangwa imyitozo ngorora mubiri aringenzi kubagore batwite' ku bibarinda kugira ibyago byokugira ikibazo icyitwa\"pre-eclampsia\" gikunze kugaragara kubagore batwite bamwe nabamwe."}
{"id": "22402", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22402", "title": "INGARUKA ZOGUKORA IMYITOZO NGORORA MUBIRI IKABIJE", "text": "Tumenyereyeko imwitozo ngorora mubiri aringenzi mubuzima bwacu kuko bidufasha kugira ubuzima buzira umuze.iyo myitozo idufasha gukomeza amagufwa,ndetse nokuturinda ibibazo byumutima.\nIcyakora muri Mutarama 2016 abahanga mubijyanye nimitekerereze ya muntu bo muri Amerika,bagaragajeko imyitozo ikabije ari mibi mubuzima bwamuntu.\nDavide Malinda, umwe mubakoze ubushakashatsi yagize ati\"gukora imwitozo ngorora mubiri ikabije ryose ishobora kugira ingaruka kubuzima bwawe.\nKurenza Urugero \nkurenza urugero nigihe urikwisunikira mugukora imwitozo ngorara mubiri buri kanya.\nbagaragazako kudafata ikiruhuko gihagije,kudafata ifunguroringana n'imwitozo ukora,kudasinzira, byose bishobora kugira ingaruka kubuzima bwawe.\nImyitozo ngorora mubiri ihoraho\nimyitozo ikabije,nkuko National Institutes Health ibivuga,nigihe imyitozo utacyumwa nk'igikorwa wahisemo gukora,ahubwo ukumwako uzajya ugikora burigihe niyo waba urwaye (igihe imyitozo yabaye ny'ikiyobya bwejye)."}
{"id": "22403", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22403", "title": "Akamaro ka tungurusumu", "text": "Tungurusumu benshi bakoresha nk\u2019ibirungo mu mboga zitandukanye,benshi baziko zitekwa gusa,nyamara kuyirya ari mbisi mu gihe cy\u2019amafunguro bigira akamaro kanini mu kurinda indwara zitandukanye.\nUmuntu wese ufite igikomere aho ariho hose, haba ari inyuma cyangwa imbere mu mubiri, ntabwo yemerewe gukoresha tungurusumu.\nUrugero ni nk\u2019umugore cyangwa umukobwa uri mu mihango cyangwa wabyaye, ndetse n\u2019undi muntu wese ufite igikomere inyuma ku mubiri cyangwa n\u2019ahandi hose haba hashobora kuva amaraso.\nUmugore utwite, kuva agisama kurinda abyaye na we ntiyemerewe gukoresha tungurusumu kuko tungurusumu ikora mu kongera ubwaguke bw\u2019imitsi kugira ngo amaraso atembere neza.\nKu mubyeyi utwite rero twibuke ko aba afite ingobyi umwana arimo ari nayo imugaburira ikabahuza bombi.\nIyi ngobyi rero ibamo imitsi nk\u2019iba mu bindi bice by\u2019umubiri. Umubyeyi aramutse akoresheje tungurusumu rero amaraso agatembera muri iyo mitsi mu buryo budasanzwe, iyo ngobyi ishobora guhita irekura wa mwana yari ifashe bityo inda ikavamo.\nAbantu barwaye igifu (ulcere gastrique)na bo ntibemerewe gukoresha tungurusumu kuko mu biyigize harimo amatembabuzi ashobora kugera mu gifu akamurya,ndetse n\u2019abana bari munsi y\u2019imyaka 2 n\u2019umubyeyi wonsa umwana uri munsi y\u2019amezi 6.\nKwirinda ni inshingano ya buri wese,kuko kwivuza bigora kuruta kwita ku buzima bwacu butahura n\u2019ibibazo.\nTungurusumu ni umuti urinda indwara nyinshi zirimo n'indwara y'impatwe kuko ifasha urwungano ngogozi\nNi byiza kuyirya ari mbisi kurusha kuyirwa itetse mu biryo,kandi nta kurenza impeke 3 cyangwa kuri zimwe zibumbye hagakoreshwa kamwe\nBirabujijwe kuzirya igihe ufite ibikomere"}
{"id": "22404", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22404", "title": "Gusezerana imbere y'amategeko", "text": "Gusezerana mu murenge cyangwa gusezerana mu mategeko cyangwa se gusezerana imbere y'amategeko mu Rwanda ni umuhango wemewe n'itegeko rigenga abantu n'umuryango, ni umuhango ukorerwa imbere y'umwanditsi w'irangamimerere mu murenge, ugashimangira urushako, ukubahiriza uburenganzira bw'abashyingiranywe ku mutungo n'abana.\nIbyangorwa.\nGusezerana mu murenge bisaba kuba ufite imyaka 18, ndetse hari ibyangombwa ugomba kuba ifite, ibi bisabirwa ku Irembo mu Rwanda, nibura iminsi 23 mbere y'ubukwe, bisaba kandi ibyemezo by'amavuko, indangamuntu, n'inyandiko zigaragaza ko ari ingaragu, ubutane, cyangwa gupfakara.\nGusezerana.\nGusezerana mu murenge abashakanye bahitamo uburyo butatu bwo gucunga umutungo wabo, burimo ivangamutungo rusange, ivangamutungo w\u2019umuhahano, n\u2019ivanguramutungo risesuye cyangwa se uburyo bwa kane bwo gucunga umutungo aho abashaka gushyingiranwa bazajya bitegurira amasezerano y\u2019uburyo bashaka ko umutungo wabo ucungwa."}
{"id": "22406", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22406", "title": "Gushingirwa imbere y'Imana", "text": "Gusezerana imbere y'Imana cyangwa gusezerana mu idini ni umuhango ukomeye w'iyobokamana aho ari umuhango ubanziriza gusezerana imbere y'amategeko ya Leta yu Rwanda,aho abateganya kubana nk'umugabo n'umugore bahamya isezerano ryabo imbere y'Imana n'imbaga y'abantu.\nUmuhango.\nGusezerana imbere y'Imana ni umwanya wo guhabwa umugisha n'Imana binyuze mu bayobozi b'idini harimo abashumba, abapadiri, cyangwa abashehe, Amadini amwe na hamwe nka ADEPR cyangwa Abadivantisite asaba ko abagiye kubana baba bahuje imyemerere cyangwa idini, mu gihe andi nka Kiliziya Gatolika na Angilikani ashobora gusezeranya abadahuje imyizerere. gusezerana mu idini ya Islam icyo bita Nikah bishobora gutwara abageni amafaranga ibihumbi 30 Frw kugeza kuri 230 Frw bitewe n'aho umuhango ubera n'ibindi byangombwa.\nIcyaha.\nMu madini menshi, abantu babana badasezeranye mu idini cyangwa imbere y'Imana bafatwa nk'abaguye mu cyaha cyangwa se uburaya, kandi bashobora guhagarikwa ku mirimo y'itorero cyangwa ntibahabwe amasakramentu."}
{"id": "22411", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22411", "title": "Kayonza modern secondary school", "text": "KAYONZA MODERN SECONDARY SCHOOL ni ikigo cy'amashuri yisumbuye giherereye mu karere ka kayonza mu ntara y'iburasirazuba\nUbumenyi Butangwa mu Kigo cya Kayonza Modern Secondary School.\nMuri iki kigo cya Kayonza modern secondary school hatangirwamo amasomo atandukanye arimo:\namasiyanse n'ubumenyingiro:PCB,PCM,MPC,HEL,MEG NA HGL.Uretse aya masomo batanga,bagiye batwara n'ibihembo bigiye bitandukanye birimo icya AI,ROBOTICS,na COMPUTER SCIENCE(ubumenyingiro)."}
{"id": "22415", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22415", "title": "Mukasahaha Diane", "text": "MUKASAHAHA DIANE ni umugore w'umunyarwandakazi ufite umugabo umwe n'abana bane(4),yamenyekanye nkumugore windashyikirwa mu Rwana.\nAmashuri yize.\nMukasahaha Diane yize amashuri abanza nayisumbuye, afite impamyabumenyi zitandukanye harimo iya Bachelor muby'ubuforomo,iy'icyiciro cya kabiri(Master's)mubuzima rusange(public healthy)yakuye muri kaminuza ya Manchester,afite kandi na Dipolome mu kwita ku barwayi bageze mubihe bikomeye(palliative care)yakuye mu Bufaransa.\nIbyo yakoze.\nMukasahaha Diane niwe Munyarwanda wabashije kugera mu 10 bambere mu marushanwa ya AFRICA'S BUSINESS HEROES ahemba ba rwiyemezamirimo bafite imishinga myiza aho yacyuye ibihumbi 100$(arenga milion 145 Rwf).Yashinze aba n'umuyobozi mukuru wa sosiyete ya DIKAM Ltd,uruganda rukora imyenda rwibanda kuguteza imbere abagore n'urubyiruko.Yamenyekanye cyane nyuma yo guhindura umwuga we yarafite mubuzima rusange akinjira mu nganda."}
{"id": "22428", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22428", "title": "Ubunane", "text": "Ubunane ni ijambo rikoreshwa mu Kinyarwanda risobanura umunsi mukuru umunsi w'ambere utangira umwaka mushya wizihizwa tariki ya 1 Mutarama, Ubunane ni ijambo rifite inkomoko ku rurimi rw'Igifaransa (\"Bonne Ann\u00e9e\"), bishatse kuvuga Umwaka mwiza.\nInkomoko.\nInkomoko ry'ijambo ubunane ryakomotse ku buryo Abanyarwanda bakiriye interuro y'Igifaransa Bonne Ann\u00e9e. Kera, abana bavutse kuri uyu munsi akunze kwitwa ba Bunani niba ari abahungu cyangwa Mukabunani niba ari abakobwa.\nUmunsi.\nUbunane ni igihe cyo gusura imiryango, gusangira ifunguro rya saa sita ridasanzwe, no guhana impano."}
{"id": "22429", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22429", "title": "Kuvumba", "text": "Kuvumba mu Kinyarwanda ni umwe mu muco wa kera w'abanyarwanda, ni ijambo rikoreshwa cyane mu rurimi rw'abantu baciriritse ku giti cyabo bikaba bivuze kujya mu birori, mu bukwe, cyangwa ahatari ibiryo utatumiwe, ugamije kurya, kunywa, no kwishimana n'abandi ariko utaratumiwemo."}
{"id": "22430", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22430", "title": "Ubugeni nyandarwa", "text": "Ubugeni mu muco nyarwanda ni isomo cyangwa ubumenyi bukubiyemo ibintu byose bijyanye n'ubuhanzi, ubwiza, n'ubuhanga bw'ibyaremwe n'abantu mu buryo bugaragaza imibereho n'indangagaciro by'Abanyarwanda.\nUmuco.\nUmuco nyarwanda wari ufite ubugeni bwinshi harimo ubugeni bw'amabara nk'ibishushanyo, ibimenyetso, Ubugeni bw'umuziki hazagamo icyembe, Ubugeni bw'imbyino, Ubugeni bw'ubukorikori. "}
{"id": "22456", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22456", "title": "Rlutta", "text": "Alice Lambert RUTAYISIRE wamenyekanye ku izina rya Rlutta uririmba injyana ya Afrobeat ni umuhanzikazi w'umunyarwanda ukizamuka wavutse mu mwaka wa 2000.Rlutta yavukiye kandi akurira mu gihugu cy'abaturanyi cya Tanzaniya, yaje mu Rwanda mu mwaka wa 2013, ubwo yari afite myaka 13 y'amavuko.\nIndirimbo ze.\nRlutta amaze gukora ibihangano bigiye bitandukanye harimo n'indirimbo z'uruhererekane zikunzwe kwita Extended Play(EP)mu ndimi z'amahanga.Mu ndirimbo yakoze harimo:\nUmeze bon, A moment of silence, Don't bother me, Hold my hands, n'izindi.\nAmashuri.\nAmashuri abanza yayigiye mu gihugu cya Tanzaniya, naho amashuri yisumbuye yize Ubugenge, Ubutabire n'ubumenyamuntu, ibi twita Physics, Chemistry and Biology(PCB). Muri Kaminuza yize ibijyanye na Mudasobwa(Computer).Amashuri ya Kaminuza yayasoje 2023.\nLabel.\nRlutta ubu abarizwa muri label yitwa Info Atassi Music.\nAbahanzi bakoranye.\nLogan Joe, Angell Mutoni, thedicekid, The Rabbeatz, MaestroBoomin."}
{"id": "22457", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22457", "title": "GIRAMATA Jeanne D'Arc", "text": "GIRAMATA Jeanne d'Arc wamenyekanye nka \"Giramata\" ni umuhanzikazi w'umunyarwanda uririmba indirimbo zo kuramya no guhimbaza Imana. Giramata yavutse mu mwaka wa 2004.\nAkazi.\nGiramata yatangiye kuririmba kera akiri umwana muri za Korari zitandukanye.Mu mwaka wa 2021 nibwo yatangiye umuziki, atangira asubiramo indirimbo z;abandi bahanzi, nyuma aza no gusohora indirimbo. Harimo Amahirwe ya kabiri, Amarira ndirairimo ubutumwa buhumuriza abarokotse Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994\nAbahanzi akunda.\nGiramata akunda cyane Vestina na Dorcas, Tasha Kobbs na Ada Ehi.\nAmarushanwa.\nMu mwaka wa 2022 yitabiriye irushanwa rya Gospel Talent Hunt ryateguwe na Rise and Shine World Ministries."}
{"id": "22458", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22458", "title": "Alicia&amp; Germaine", "text": "\"Alica &amp; Germaine\" ni itsinda ry'abakobwa babiri bavukana baririmba indirimbo zo kuramya no guhimbaza Imana.Amazina yabo ni Ufitimana Alicia na Ufitimana Germaine. Aba banyarwandakazi bavuka mu karere ka Rubavu, Umurenge wa Rugerero, Akagari ka Gisa, Umudugudu wa Gihira; bakaba basengera mu idina rya ADERR Ruhangiro.Alicia yavutse mu mwaka wa 2005 naho Germaine avuka mu mwaka wa 2007.\nAmashuri.\nAlicia yiga muri Kaminuza y'u Rwanda mu bijyanye n'ubuvuzi rusange no kubaga mu mwaka wa 3 naho Germaine yiga mu mwaka wa gatandatu w'amashuri yisumbuye ibijyanye n'indimi n'ubuvanganzo muri Ecole de Lettres de Gatovu mu karere ka Nyabihu.\nIndirimbo zabo.\nAlicia na Germaine bamze gusohora indirimbo zitandukanye zirimo: Urufatiro, Rugaba, Wa mugabo, Ihumure, Uriyo, Ibendera, Ndahiriwe,\nLabel.\nABA Music niyo nzu ireberera umuziki wa Alicia na Germaine. Iyo nzu ikaba ikuriwe na Se ubabyara."}
{"id": "22459", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22459", "title": "Kelly madla Machenzie", "text": "Uwineza Kelly wamamaye ku izina rya Kelly Madla mu itsina rya Machenzies ni umunyarwandakazi wa rwiyemezamirimo ukora ibijyanye n'ubwiza n'imideli binyuze mu nzu yabo nka machenzie yitwa \"Zoi\", akaba anakora ibiganiro bizwi nka Podcast kuri Youtube.\nAmashuri.\nMu mwaka wa 2024 yasoje amashuri ye ya Kaminuza muri African Leadership University(ALU), aho yize ibijyanye n'ubucuruzi mpuzamahanga [International Business&amp; Trade]. \nUmuryango.\nKelly Madla ubarizwa mu itsinda rya Machenzi ni Nyirasenge wa Miss Naomie Nishumwe, Nyampinga w'u rwanda 2020. Mu mwaka wa 2023 yashakanye na Lt David Nsengiyumva."}
{"id": "22460", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22460", "title": "Audia Intore", "text": "\"Alice Diane Uwimana\" wamenyekanye ku izina rya Audia Intore ni umuhanzikazi w'umunyarwanda uririmba mu njyana ya Gakondo.Yavutse 05 Gahyantare 1992.\nUbuzima bwite.\nKu itariki ya 05 Gahyantare 2025 Cyiza Kelly yamusabye ko bazabana maze arabyemera.Kuri 26 Nyakanga 2025 basezerana kubana akaramata.\nAkazi.\nMu mwaka 2012 nibwo Audia Intore yatangiye gusubiramo indirimbo z'abandi bahanzi baririmba indirimbo za kinyarwanda, nyuma aza no gusohora ize.\nIndirimbo ze.\nMu mwaka wa 2023 ku itariki ya 08 Werurwe yasohoye Album ye ya mbere yise 'Uri Mwiza Mama'Yari igizwe n'indirimbo 10 nka Bwari bwije,Ndinda, Urungano,Akwiye ikamba yakunzwe cyane n'izindi. Audia Intore yamamaye mu ndirimbo ye yise 'Sine ya Mwiza\".Izindi ndirimbo ze harimo:\" Umutoni, Araje,Uri mwiza, Simbi ryanjye, Rwangabo, Bisangwa, Imbaraga z'urukundo, Umugozi umwen'izindi.\"\nIbitaramo yaririmbyemo.\nAudia Intore yaririmbye mu bitamo byinshi cayne, bimwe muri byo ni: Umurage nyawo Kamaliza Concert, Iwacu Concert, Gakondo Accoustic Gala, Rwanda Connect Gala, Smart Service Awards ndetse n'ibindi byinshi.\nAbahanzi bakoranye.\nYakoranye na Bill Ruzima indirimbo yitwa Simbi ryanjye."}
{"id": "22461", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22461", "title": "UBWOROZI BW'AMAFI MURI RUSANGE", "text": "Ubworozi bw'amafi mu Rwanda ni umwuga urimo gutera imbere cyane,ukorwa ahantu hatandukanye hagamijwe kongera umusaruro w'amafi kuko ari isoko nziza y'intungamubiri.\nAhanini ubworozi bw'amafi muri rusange bukorwa ahantu hakurikira:\nIbintu by'ingenzi byitabwaho mu bworozi bw'amafi:"}
{"id": "22462", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22462", "title": "Wari uziko amazi menshi mu mubiri angira ingaruka mbi?", "text": "Nubwo buri wese aziko amazi arimeza mu mubiri ariko nanone ntago twakirengagiza ko iyo urungeje urugero rw'ayougomba kuba ufite kobishoboraguteza ikibazo.\nMugihe abahanga badahwema kugira inama abagwayi kunywa amazi menshi,abahanga nano bavugako amazi menshi mu mubiri atari meza.\nUmuganga, wo mubitaro byo muri Tanzaniabyitwa 'Hospital ya taifa Muhimbili(MNH)'Dr Sadick Sizya, avugako iyo amazi abaye menshi mu mubiri kurusha ayakenewe atari byiza,kuko icyogihe umuntu yisanga mubyago byo kugira uburozi mu mubiri bituma hari ubutare bw'ingenzi bugabanuka,harimo n'ubwitwa Sodium.\nDr Sadick sizya,aganira n'ikinyamakuru kitwa'mwananchi yagize ati'Hari ubwo abantu dushishikariza kunywa amazi menshi tutitaye kurugero rwayo.\nByashobokako umuntu yabona mugenzi we anywa amazi nka litiro eshanu ku munsi maze nawe agatangira kumwigana.kandi atitaye kubanza ngo amenye ko umubiri we ubyemerewe cyangwa utabyemerewe."}
{"id": "22463", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22463", "title": "Akamaro k'imwitozo ngorora mubiri ku bana", "text": "Inzobere mu bijyanye nubuzima bw'abana bato zigaragazako abanabagenda bahura n'ibibazo bitandukanye by'ubuzima, bitewe ntokudakora imyitozo ngorora mubiriri birimo,kugira umubyibuho ukabije,kugira inda itandukanye ningano yibindi bice bye byumubiri.\nDore bimwe mubyiza byogukora imyitozo ku bana bato\nKwigirir icyizere abana bakora imyitozo bibafasha mukubongerera ikizere ndetse nokugararagara neza mubijye ni shusho yumubiri wabo.\nGukomera amagufa imyitozo ifasha umwana kutiremereza nk' igihe yurira ahantu cyangwa asimbuka ari byo binamufasha mukongera uburemere bw'amagufaye no gukomera kwayo."}
{"id": "22464", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22464", "title": "Amateka ya bruce melody", "text": "Bruce Melodie ni umuhanzi ufite amateka maremare haba k'ubuzimabwe ndetse no mumuziki. kandi nawe ntatinya kuvugako ari \"bavakure\".Ariko ibyo byose yarabirenze ubu ni umuhanzi wikirangirire murwanda.indirimboze zirakunzwe cyane muri Africa ndetse amaze no kwigarurira imitima y'abantu benshi cyane cyane muri Afrika y'iburasirazuba nko muri kenya nahandi muri Africa.Murwanda ho yamaze gufata abantu bugwate kuburyo n'abamwangaga batangiye gukunda ibihangano bye.Akunze kwitabazwa n'abahanzi benshi ngo baririmbane,kuko indirimbo yashyizemo ibirungo ntakabuza irakundwa.Itahiwacu bruce uzwi ku izina nka bruce melodie kandi yakuze abwirwa ko ari mubi ariko ibyo ntibyamwangarije kariyeri ngobimubuze gukomeza umwuga we w'ubuhanzi.Bruce melodie ubu numwe muhanzi bahagaze neza mu muziki nyarwanda kandi bakunzwe cyane.Bruce Itahiwacu yavutse mu 1992 i kanombe mu mugi wa kigalih"}
{"id": "22465", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22465", "title": "Ibura rya Helium mu nganda", "text": "Umwuka utari mwiza mu Burasirazuba bwo Hagati uri guteza ibura rya gaz helium ku isi bikaba byaratangiye kugira ingaruka mbi kunganda z'ikoranabuhanga.\nHelium ni ingenzi cyane mu gukora utwuma duto cyane tubika amakuru [chips], by\u2019umwihariko mu gukonjesha no gukora ibisaba ubwitonzi, ubuhanga n\u2019ubushishozi bwo hejuru.\nIbibazo by'umutekano muke no gukererwa mu bijyanye n'ubwikorezi biri gutuma ibiciro byiyi gaze bizamuka cyane bigatuma igorana kuboneka. abayobozi b'ibigo by'ikoranabuhanga bavuga ko ibi bibazo bikomeje kudindiza akazi kabo.\nIbigo byinshi biri kugorwa no kubona abandi babigezaho iyi gaz, aho ubu bimwe biri kwerekeza amaso muri Amerika.\nIbikoresho by\u2019ibanze bituruka mu bihugu nka Israel na byo biri kuba bike kubera ubukererwe bukomeye mu bwikorezi.\nInzobere zivuga ko helium nikomeza kubura, inganda zishobora kuzagabanya cyangwa guhagarika burundu gukora utwuma duto tubika amakuru [chips].\nKubera ko chips ari ubwonko bw\u2019ibikoresho byinshi by\u2019ikoranabuhanga tumenyereye, ibi bivuga ko habaho n\u2019igabanyuka rikomeye mu bikoresho byinshi nka telefoni zigezweho, ibikoresho by\u2019amashanyarazi, n\u2019iby\u2019imodoka."}
{"id": "22466", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22466", "title": "Ubuhinzi bw'ibihumyo", "text": "Aya mafaranga ngo ashobora no kwikuba gatatu mu gihe haba hakoreshejwe imbuto nshya y\u2019ibihumyo abo bahinzi bahuguriwe gukoresha.\nBavuga ko ikilo(kg) kimwe cy\u2019ibihumyo byari bisanzwe bya \u2019oyster\u2019 ari amafaranga 2,000Frw, mu gihe icy\u2019ibihumyo bishya bya \u2019button\u2019 kigurishwa arenze 5,000Frw.\nUmukozi w\u2019Ikigo \u2019Development Network\u2019 gihinga kikanatunganya ibihumyo, witwa Antoinette Nyirazaninka avuga ko Abanyarwanda babura ubutaka bungana na m\u00b2 imwe yo guhingaho ibihumyo ari bake cyane mu Gihugu.\nNyirazaninka agira ati \"Wahinga imigina 62 kuri m\u00b2 imwe, buri mugina weramo amagarama(g) 500, wakuba na 62 ukareba, mu minsi iri hagati y\u2019irindwi n\u2019icumi (7-10) uba watangiye gusarura ugana isoko hagashira amezi atatu. Ibihumbi 50Frw washoye waba wayabonye ndetse wasigaranye na cya gishoro cyangwa waranguye indi migina.\"\nUndi muhinzi w\u2019ibihumyo witwa Bizimana Vincent avuga ko iki kiribwa gifite isoko rinini cyane haba mu Rwanda no mu mahanga.\nBizimana avuga ko umuhinzi wabishyizemo umwete ashobora kubona umusaruro w\u2019ibiro 50-100 ku munsi kandi mu gihe cyose cy\u2019umwaka, kuko bihingwa ahantu hatwikiriye bikavomererwa."}
{"id": "22467", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22467", "title": "Ubworozi bw'amafi muri mugesera", "text": "Ubu bworozi bw'amafi buri gukorerwa mu nkengero z'Ikiyaga cya Mugesera mu Murenge wa Rukumberi mu Karere ka Ngoma. Bukorwa n'ikigo cyitwa National YIPIN Technology Agriculture cyashinzwe na Fuan Lin.\nUyu mugabo yaguze ubutaka bungana na hegitari 3.5 iruhande rw'Ikiyaga cya Mugesera. yabwubatseho uruganda rutunganya ibiryo by'amafi, ubuso busigaye abwubakamo 'green house' nini, azishyiramo ibigega 150 ari nabyo agenda yororeramo amafi kuva atangiye kuyategura akiri mato kugeza ku manini ajyana ku isoko.\nHiganeza Sylas usanzwe ari umutekanisiye muri ubu bworozi bw'amafi, Yavuze ko ubu buryo bw'ibigega mu bworozi bw'amafi busa n'aho buri kugeragezwa mu kureba ko bwatanga umusaruro mwinshi urenzeuw'ubundi buryo bwajya bukoreshwa mu Rwanda nka kareremba.\nAti \"Ugereranyije igihe tumaze cy'umwaka umwe, tumaze gusarura toni zirenga 50 z'amafi,turi kugenda twongera ibigega kuko twabonye ko bigenda neza.\"\nHiganeza yavuze ko kimwe mu bintu bibagora muri ubu bworozi ari uburyo umuriro ubura rimwe na rimwe kandi uba ari ingenzi cyane ku buryo bisanga bakoresheje mazutu nyinshi.\nYavuze ko kandi abatekenisiye bazi iby'amafi ari bake cyane ku buryo bakigorwa no kwigisha Abanyarwanda babfasha mu gukurikirana aya mafi.\nHiganeza yavuze ko isoko ry'amafi mu Rwanda rihari rinini cyane ku buryo batapfa kurihaza, ashimangira ko bashaka kongera umubare w'ibigega kuko babonye ko ubu buryo butuma ifi ziboneka vuba kandi ari nyinshi."}
{"id": "22473", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22473", "title": "INGABIRE MUZIGA MAMY", "text": "Ingabire Muziga Mamy ni umunyarwandakazi w'umunyamwuga mubijyanye no kuzamura ikoranabuhanga akoresheje Drone ndetse afite ubushobozi n'ubunararibonye buhambaye mugutegura no gucunga imishinga na gahunda zigamije kuzamura imibereho y'abantu no guhindura ejo hazaza habo.Azwi kandi nk'umuyobozi mukuru (Managing Director),Charis Animanned Aerial Solution Rwanda.\nAmashuri yize.\nUyu munyarwandakazi uzwi ku mazina ya Ingabire Muziga Mamy yize amashuri abanza ndetse nayisumbuye.Yakomeje kwiga aho afite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya Kaminuza (Barchelor's Degree) mu bumenyingiro bw'ubuzima (Applied Life Sciences),yibanze kuri Biotekinoroji(Biotechnology)aho yayikuye muri Midland i Johannesburg, muri Africa y'Epfo. Yanize kandi amasomo ajyanye n'imicungire y'imishinga(Project Management) ndetse niyoboramutungo n'imiyoborere(Leadership management) ikorerwa kuri murandasi.\nAkazi akora(imirimo akora).\nIngabire Muziga Mamy akorana n'imiryango itandukanye nka CTA n'imiryango mpuzamahanga itari iya Leta(NGOs),mugufasha abahinzi bato kongera umusaruro wabo.Service za Drone zishingiye mugukusanya amakuru,kugirango bahe abahinzi amakuru bakeneye.Ahuza ubumenyi,ikoranabuhanga n'ubuyobozi,Ni umutoza n'umujyanama,ateza impinduka nziza abinyujije mudushya.Ayobora ibigo bikurikira:\n1.UAV(Unmanned Aerial Vehicle) Indege itagira umu pilote arizo Drone.\n2.CTA(Technical Centre for Agriculture and rural cooperation ni ikigo gishinzwe ubuhinzi n'iterambere ry'icyaro."}
{"id": "22474", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22474", "title": "NAMAHIRWE IMMACULEE", "text": "Namahirwe Immaculee ni umunyarwandakazi ukora ibikorwa byindashyikirwa mu gihugu harimo gukora ubushakashatsi ku binyabuzima(biodiversity),kwigisha abaturage ibijyanye n'ihindagurika ry'ikirere no gukora ibijyanye no gutangaza amakuru(content creation),yamenyekanye kandi ubwo yitabiraga ibikorwa mpuzamahanga bitandukanye harimo Swiss-Africa Exchange Program 2025 yabereye muri Lucerne Univeristy of Applied Scienceas Arts,yibanda kuri hydrogen itangiza ibidukikije(green hydrogen)n'ingufu zirambye,niwe washinze ikigo cyitwa FROMGREEN Rwanda.\nAmashuri yize.\nNamahirwe Immaculee yize amashuri abanza nayisumbuye akomeza muri kaminuza ya African Leadership university(ALU) Barchelor in Entrepreneur Leadreship,Alx-Africa in Barchelor's degree in computer software engineering.\nIbihembo yahawe.\nM'ugushyingo 2025,FROMGREEN Rwanda yatsindiye igihembo cya Best Social Environmental Impact Project muri gahunda ya Restoration Factory Program.Muri 2026 yatoranijwe mubahatanira igihembo cya Queen of Green mu birori bya Women in Leadership Summit&amp;Awards.\nIbyo akora.\nNamahirwe Immaculee yahinze ikigo cyitwa FROMGREEN Rwanda igamije gufasha abaturage batishoboye cyane cyane abagore barera abana bonyine bo mu byaro byumwihariko mu karere ka Musanze binyuze mu buhinzi burambye.Nanone kandi yazanye umushinga witwa igiti kimwe cya Avoka kuri buri muryango(One avocado per family) aho uyu mushinga ugamije gutanga ingemwe z'ibiti za Avoka byatewe mu buryo bugezweho ku miryango,hagamijwe gusubiranya ubutaka bwangiritse,kongera imirire myiza mungo no kubafasha kubona amafaranga."}
{"id": "22475", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22475", "title": "UFITEYESU LEAH", "text": "Ufiteyesu Leah ni umunyarwandakazi uzwi kumbuga nkoranyambaga mubikorwa biziwi nko gutanga ubujyanama muby'imirire (nutritionist na dietician).Ayobora ikigo gitanga serivise z'imirire giherereye i Kigali,mu Rwanda,ndetse afite muyoboro ukunzwe kuri Youtube(content creator).\nAmashuri yize.\nUfiteyesu Leah kandi yize amashuri abanza nayisumbuye akomeza muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda hagati ya 2012 na 2016 aho yahakuye impamyabumenyi ya Barchelor's degree muri Human nutrition and dietetics(A0).\nIbyo akora.\nUfiteyesu Leah yabaye umuyobozi mukuru muri Nyakanga 2021 nka Managing Director wa NUTRI MEDIPLUS ikigo gitanga ubujyanama ku mirire giherereye ikigali mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "22477", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22477", "title": "Dj flixx", "text": "DJ Flixx.\n\"Ishimwe Cyomoro Fanny\" uzwi ku izina rya \"Dj Flixx\" wamenyekanye mu kuvanga imiziki mu Rwanda, ni umukobwa w'umunyarwandakazi wavukiye mu karere ka Nyagatare, mu ntara y'iburasirazuba y'u Rwanda.\nIbitaramo yakozemo.\nDj Flixx yakoze ku bitaramo bitandukanye harimo: The New year Groove cya 2025, ndtese na Album Launch ya The ben muri Uganda yitwa Plenty Love mu mwaka wa 2025."}
{"id": "22478", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22478", "title": "TESSY", "text": "Yvonne Kayitesi.\n\"Yvonne Kayitesi\" wamenyekane ku izina rya \"Tessy\" ni umunyamakurukazi w'umunyarwandakazi.Yakoranye n'ibitangazamakuru bitandukanye harimo Isango star,akaba afite ikiganiro anyuza kuri Youtube channel yitwa 'This and That' anyuza kuri youtube hamwe na mugenzi we Blandy star.\nUmuryango.\nKuri 10 Mutarama 2026 nibwo Tessy yasabwe, arakobwa ndetse asezerana na Hakizimana Ishimwe Agappe w'umuraperi uzwi ku izina rya Shizzo."}
{"id": "22479", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22479", "title": "UWASE BLANDINE", "text": "Blandy Star.\n\"Uwase Blandine\" wamenyekanye ku izina rya \"Blandy Star\" ni umunyamakauru w'umunyarwandakazi ukora kuri Radio &amp;Tv10, ndetse akaba afite ikiganiro cyitwa 'this and That anyuza kuri youtube channel nayo yitwa gutyo, aho akorana na mugenzi we Tessy."}
{"id": "22480", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22480", "title": "Lynda priya", "text": "Lynda Priya.\n\"Uwankusi Nkusi Linda\" wamenyekanye ku izina rya \"Lynda Priya\", ni umunyarwandakazi ukina \"Filime nyarwanda\".Yitabiriye irushanwa rya Nyampinga w'u Rwanda mu mwaka wa 2021 na 2022.\nUmuryango.\nKu itariki ya 08 Gashyantare 2026 yasezeranye na Irenge Christian kubana akaramata.\nAkazi.\nYakoze imirimo itandukanye harimo kuba umunyamakuru ku Isibo Tv, yanditse filime zitandukanye zirimo na Bamenya series. Filime ye yasohoye bwa mbere ni iyitwa 'Choose Love'."}
{"id": "22481", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22481", "title": "Kayirebwa marie paul", "text": "Kayirebwa Marie Paul.\n\"Miss Kayirebwa Marie Paul\" ni umukobwa w'umunyarwandakazi witabiriye irushanwa rya Nyampinga w'u Rwanda 2021, aho yatwaye ikamba ry'umukobwa wakunzwe n'abaturage Miss Popularity 2021.\nIndirimbo.\nMiss Marie Paul yagiye yifashishwa mu ndirimbo nyinshi zitandukanye harimo: Solo ya Nel Ngabo, We don't care ya Rj the Dj, Meddy na Rayvanny, Ikinyafu ya Bruce melodie na Kenny sol,na Niko Yaje ya Chriss Hart.\nMiss Rwanda.\nMu mwaka wa 2018 nibwo bwa mbere yitabiriye irushanwa rya Nyampinga w'u rwanda gusa avamo mu majonjora. Yaje kugaruka mu mwaka wa 2021 aho yaje kuba Miss Popularity 2021.\nAkazi.\nMu mwaka wa 2021 Miss Kayirebwa Marie Paul yabaye Brand Ambassador wa MTN Rwanda mu gihe kingana n'umwaka."}
{"id": "22482", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22482", "title": "Analyssa umunyana", "text": "Mama Sava.\nUmunyana Analyssa wamenyekanye ku izina rya Mama Sava, ni umunyarwandakazi ukina filime nyarwanda.Yavutse mu mwaka wa 1995.\nAmashuri.\nYize icungamutungo ku ishuri rya College de l'Espoir de Gasogi.\nFilime.\nYatangiye gukina filime mu mwaka wa 2017.Akaba yarakinnye filime zitandukanye harimo izuruhererekane nka Seburikoko na Papa Sava,Mucoma:The couples Battle\nAmarushanwa.\nMu mwaka wa 2025 yitabiriye amarushanwa ya Africa Movie Academy Awards (AMAA) aho yari ahatanye mu cyiciro cya Best Actress in a leading role. "}
{"id": "22483", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22483", "title": "Withintech rwanda", "text": "= WithinTech Rwanda =\nWithinTech Rwanda ni umuryango w\u2019ikoranabuhanga ufite intego yo guteza imbere urubyiruko binyuze mu kubaha ubumenyi mu bijyanye na coding, robotics, na digital skills zitandukanye. Washinzwe n\u2019umukobwa ukiri muto witwa Aline Niyomungeli, ufite icyerekezo cyo guteza imbere abakobwa n\u2019abahungu mu ikoranabuhanga no kubafasha kubona amahirwe mu isi ya digital.\nAmateka y\u2019ishingwa.\nWithinTech Rwanda yashinzwe hagamijwe gukemura ikibazo cy\u2019abakiri bato badafite amahirwe yo kubona ubumenyi bujyanye n\u2019ikoranabuhanga rigezweho. Aline Niyomungeli yatangiye uyu muryango ashingiye ku bunararibonye bwe mu kwigisha no gukorana n\u2019urubyiruko, aho yabonye ko hari icyuho kinini mu myigire ya digital skills cyane cyane ku bakobwa.\nUyu muryango watangiye ari igitekerezo gito, ariko ugenda waguka binyuze mu mahugurwa, camps, n\u2019ibikorwa bitandukanye bigamije guteza imbere urubyiruko.\nIntego (Mission).\nIntego ya WithinTech Rwanda ni:\nIcyerekezo (Vision).\nWithinTech Rwanda ifite icyerekezo cyo kuba umuryango uyoboye mu guteza imbere ubumenyi bw\u2019ikoranabuhanga mu rubyiruko mu Rwanda no muri Afurika, aho buri mwana wese yagira amahirwe angana yo kwiga no gukoresha ikoranabuhanga mu buzima bwe bwa buri munsi.\nIbikorwa n\u2019ingaruka (Impact).\nWithinTech Rwanda imaze kugira uruhare rukomeye mu:\nAbanyeshuri benshi bamaze kunyura muri izi gahunda bagaragaje impinduka zirimo:\nUruhare mu muryango nyarwanda.\nWithinTech Rwanda igira uruhare mu guteza imbere gahunda za leta zigamije kubaka ubukungu bushingiye ku ikoranabuhanga. Uyu muryango ukorana n\u2019ibigo by\u2019amashuri, abafatanyabikorwa, n\u2019imiryango itandukanye mu rwego rwo kugeza ubumenyi ku rubyiruko rwinshi.\nUmusozo.\nWithinTech Rwanda ni urugero rwiza rw\u2019uko urubyiruko rushobora gutangiza impinduka mu gihugu, ruyobowe n\u2019umukobwa ukiri muto Aline Niyomungeli, ukomeje guharanira ko nta mwana usigara inyuma mu bijyanye n\u2019ikoranabuhanga\nNiba ushaka byinshi kuri iyi nkuru masura imbuga za Withintech Rwanda \nwithintech official website"}
{"id": "22484", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22484", "title": "Yvonne ingabire", "text": "Ingabire Yvonne.\n\"Ingabire Yvonne\" ni umunyamakuru w'umunyarwandakazi ukorera Rwanda Broadcasting Agency(RBA), ikigo cya Leta gishinzwe gutangaza amakuru mu Rwanda. Yvonne azwi cyane mu biganiro bya radiyo na Televiziyo, cyane cyane kuri Radio Rwanda na Televiziyo y'u Rwanda(RTV).\nUbuzima bwite.\nKu italiki ya 5 Kanama 2023 yashakanye na \"Nkubito Egide.\"\nIbiganiro.\nYakoze kandi akora ibiganiro bitandukanye birimo:\nWaramutse Rwanda, Umuti, Amahumbezi, ndetse n'ibindi."}
{"id": "22485", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22485", "title": "KATABARWA MURENZI Gilbert", "text": "KATABARWA MURENZI Gilbert ni umunyarwanda wavukiye mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda. Akaba afite impamyabumenyi yikirenga (Doctorate) akaba na engeniyeri (Engineer) aho yabikuye muri Kaminuza yo mu Bushinwa, Shanghai bita Tongji University. Muri iyi Kaminuza kandi ni umwarimu mu bijyanye na (Ubuhanga ku bumenyi bw'isi)Ge-informatics na (Kugenzura) Surveying muri iyo Kaminuza. Muri ibyo ni byo yize akan=ba yarihuguye no ku mujya uri mu buryo bw'ikoranabuhanga(Smart City Development). \nUbushakashatsi yakoze.\nKatabarwa Murenzi Gilbert yavumbuye ikoranabuhanga rya \"Maglev Obsatcle detection\" ryerekana mbere inzitizi ziri mu nzira ya Gari ya Moshi zizwi nka \"Maglev\" bityo bikayirinda gukora impanuka.Mu 2002 u Bushinwa niho bwatangiye gukoresha bwa mbere gari ya moshi izwi nka Maglev (magnetic levitation) zigira umuvuduko mwinshi cyane zikaba ziri mu zihuta cyane ku Isi.Ni gari ya moshi ikoresha ikoranabuhanga rya rukuruzi, aho igice cyayo gitwara abagenzi kigenda gikururuka ku nzira ikozwe muri rukuruzi, bikayiha imbaraga zidasanzwe zo kwihuta."}
{"id": "22486", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22486", "title": "Alice niragire", "text": "Dr Alice NIRAGIRE.\nAlice Niragire ni umuganga w'umunyarwandakazi w'inzobere mu kubaga(general surgeon),uzwi cyane kuba ariwe mugore wa mbere mu Rwanda muri ako kazi. Yavukiye mu Karere ka Ruhango, intara y'amajyepfo mu mwaka 1982.\nAmashuri.\nAmashuri abanza yayize Ecole Primaire de Nyarurama, ayisumbuye ayiga muri Ecole des sciences Byimana ahiga Biology and Chemistry. Mu mwaka 2004 nibwo yagiye kwiga muri Kaminuza Nkuru y'u Rwanda, yiga mu ishami ry'ubuvuzi bw'abantu (General medecine and surgery) Imyaka 6. Mu mwaka wa 2015 nibwo yaje gusoza amasomo y'ikirenga(masters) mu kubaga(MMed Surgery). Aba abaye umugore wa mbere wabonye iyo mpamyabumenyi mu Rwanda kuva iyi gahunda yatangira mu mwaka wa 2006.\nUmwuga.\nDr Niragire yakoze mu bitaro bitandukanye mu Rwanda, aho yatangiriye gukora hari mu bitari bya Rwamagana, aho yakoraga mu bikorwa byo kubaga no kuvura abarwayi, akaba yarahakoze umwaka umwe.Nyuma yaho yaje kwimukira muri Kigali University Teaching Hospital (CHUK), bimwe mu bitaro bikuru byigisha mu Rwanda, aho akorera nka General Surgeon.\nKamwe mu kazi akorayo nuri munsi harimo:"}
{"id": "22487", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22487", "title": "Francoise mukagaju", "text": "Dr Francoise MUKAGAJU.\nDr Francoise Mukagaju ni umuganga w'umunyarwanda w'inzobere mu kubaga no gusana imyanya y'umubiri (plastic and reconstructive surgery). Azwi nko kuba ari we mugore wa mbere wabaye umu plastic surgeon mu Rwanda, akaba ari umwe mu bagize uruhare rukomeye mu guteza imbere ubu buvuzi mu gihugu.\nAmashuri.\nDr Mukagaju yatangiye yiga ubuvuzi rusange (general medecine) muri Kaminuza y'u Rwanda. Nyuma yaje gukomeza mu mahugurwa yihariye ya Plastic surgery, binyuze mu bufatanye bwa University of Rwanda na Operation Smile. Icyo gihe yahakuye ubumenyi n'ubunararibonye bwo ku rwego mpuzamahanga, bituma aba umwe mu baganga ba mbere batojwe neza muru uru rwego mu Rwanda.\nUmwuga.\nDr Mukagaju akora nka Plastic Surgeon mu Rwanda, akorera cyane cyane mu bitaro bikomeye byitiriwe umwami Fayisari (King Faisal Hospital Rwanda).\nBimwe mubyo akora harimo: Kubaga no gusana imyanya yangiritse (reconstructive surgery), Kuvura abana bafite ibibazo by'ibibari(Cleft Lip and Palate), ndetse kandi akanagaragara mu bushakashatsi mpuzamahanga ku bijyanye no kubaga no gusana imyanya y'umubiri.\nUruhare mpuzamahanga.\nDr Mukagaju akorana n'imiryango mpuzamahanga mu bikorwa byo gutoza abaganga bashya, guteza imbere ubuvuzi mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere, gutanga ubuvuzi ku bantu badafite ubushobozi. Akaba afite uruhare mu ishingwa nrya Operation Smile, ifasha abana bafite ibibazo byo mu maso."}
{"id": "22488", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22488", "title": "Gisele Bunogerane Juru", "text": "Dr Gisele BUNOGERANE JURU.\n\"Gisele Bunogerane Juru\" ni umuganga w'umunyarwanda w'inzobere mu kubaga(General Surgery), akaba afite umwihariko mu kubaga abana (Pediatrics Surgery). Juru ni umwe mu bagore ba mbere bize General medecine ndetse akaba ari nawe mugore wa mbere mu Rwanda ubaga abana(pediatrics surgery).\nAmashuri n'amahugurwa.\nAmashuri ya Kaminuza yayize muri Kaminuza y'u Rwanda ahiga ubuvuzi rusange, icyiciro cya mbere n'i cya Kabiri[(General Medecine), na Post graduate]. Yabaye umunyeshuri w'ungirije mu cyiciro cya gatatu cya Kaminuza(Fellowship trainee) muri COSESCA mu bijyanye no kubaga abana (Pediatrics Surgery). Binyuze kubufatanye hagati ya Kaminuza y'u Rwanda na Kaminuza ya Furorida(University of Florida) yagiye kuri iyo Kaminuza kugira ngo arebe uko abandi bakora mu gihe kingana n'ukwezi. \nUmwuga.\nDr Juru akorera ku bitaro bikuru bya Kaminuza CHUK. Akaba abaga abana, kuvura indwara z'abana zikwiye kubaga, gukorera mu byumba by'indembe.\nUbushakashatsi.\nDr Juru ni umwe mu baganga b'abanyarwanda bagira uruhare mu bashakashatsi mpuzamahanga mu bivuzi. Yanditse kandi akanafatanya n'abandi mu nyandiko z'ubushakashatsi ku:\nUruhare mpuzamahanga.\nDr Juru yitabiriye amahugurwa n'ubufatanye mpuzamahanga, harimo:\nYagiye mu mahugurwa yo hanze y'igihugu agamije:"}
{"id": "22489", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22489", "title": "Grace Kansayisa", "text": "Dr Grace KANSAYISA.\n\"Dr Kansayisa Grace\" ni umuganga w'inzobere mu kubaga amagufwa n'ingingo(Orthopedic Surgeon) mu Rwanda. Niwe mugore wa mbere mu Rwanda winjiye mu mwuga wo kubaga amagufwa, akaba n'umwarimu muri Kaminuza y'u Rwanda mu ishuri ry'ubuvuzi n'ubuzima(CMHS).\nAmashuri.\nDr Kansayisa yize amashuri yisumbuye muri Lycee Notre Dame de Citeaux aho yize imibare n'ubugenge, yiga ubuvuzi rusange muri Kaminuza y'u Rwanda. Aza gukomeza amasomo mu bijyanye no kubaga (surgery), aho yakuye impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu cya Kaminuza (Masters of Medecine in Orthopedic Surgery) mu mwaka wa 2021 muri Kaminuza y'u Rwanda. Yabonye impamyabumenyi y'icyubahiro(Fellowship) binyuze mu muryango wa COSESCA (College of Surgeons of East, Central and Southern Africa), ari nawo uhuza ababaga b'inzobere mu burasirazuba, hagati n'amajyepfo ya Afurika muri 2020.Mu mwaka 2024 yagiye kwiga kurushaho kubaga ikirenge n'akagombambari (orthopedic foot and ankle surgery) mu gihugu cya Singapore, akarangiza mu mwaka wa 2026.\nUbushakashatsi n'inzobere.\nDr Kansayisa yibanda cyane mu bijyanye no kubaga amagufwa y'abana (pediatric Orthopaedics). Azwiho ubumenyi abana bafite ibibazo by'imivukire nk'amaguru agobye (club foot) n'izindi mvune zikomeye.\nYagize uruhare mu bushakashatsi butandukanye bwagiye butangazwa mu binyamakuru by'ubuvuzi, bwibanda ku bibazo by'amagufwa n'uburyo bwo kunoza serivisi z'ububazi mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere."}
{"id": "22491", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22491", "title": "Lt Col Colonel Seraphine Nyirasafari", "text": "Lt Col Colonel Seraphine Nyirasafari ni umugore w'umunyarwandakazi uzwi nkumwe mubanyabigwi mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda.Yavutse taliki 16 Gicurasi 1970,avukira mu majyaruguru y'u Rwanda.Ni umubyeyi washakanye na Juvenal Marizamunda,minisitiri w'Ingabo w'u Rwanda bakaba bafitanye abana bane.\nAmashuri yize.\nLt Col Colonel Seraphine Nyirasafari yize amashuri abanza nayisumbuye afite imyamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya Kaminuza mubijyanye n'imari yakuye muri Kaminuza y'u Rwanda ndetse n'impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu cya Kaminuza mu bijyanye n'umutekano nayo yakuye muri Kaminuza y'u Rwanda.Yize mu ishuri rikuru rya gisirikare ry'Ingabo z'u Rwanda hagati ya 2020 na 2021.\nIbyo akora.\nLt Col Colonel Seraphine Nyirasafari yinjiye mu gisirikare mu 1991,muri Mutarama 1994 ahabwa ipeti rya Sous Lieutenant.Yakoze imirimo itandukanye irimo ushinzwe ibikoresho,akora mu ishami rya RDF rishinzwe abakozi mu bijyanye n'imari.Yabaye kandi umucungamari mukuru mu ishami rya Gisirikare rishinzwe ubwishingizi(MMI),aba umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe ubucuruzi,ububiko n'ikwirakwizwa ry'ibicuruzwa ku isoko rya gisirikare rizwi nka Armed Forced Shop.Kuri ubu ni Umuyobozi Mukuru w'Agateganyo wa Armed Forced Shop.\nIbindi.\nLt Col Colonel Seraphine Nyirasafari yafashe amasomo anitabira amahugurwa atandukanye mu Rwanda no mu mahanga harimo ajyanye no gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe abahoze mu mitwe yitwaje intwaro ndetse najyanye no kurinda abana yafatiye i Nyakinama,amasomo ajyanye no kurinda Abasivile yafatiye muri Kenya ndetse n'ajyanye no kurwanya ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina yafatiye mu Butaliyani."}
{"id": "22492", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22492", "title": "Lausanne Ingabire Nsengimana", "text": "Lausanne Ingabire Nsengimana ni umwe mu banyarwandakazi bazwiho mugukora ibikorwa by'indashyikirwa mu gihugu kuko ni umwe mu bakiri bato mu gisirikare cy'u Rwanda bahawe ipeti rya Coloneli.\nAmashuri yize.\nLt Col Lausanne Ingabire Nsengimana yize amashuri abanza ndetse nayisumbuye akomeza mu ishuri rya Gisirikare mu Bubiligi,Loyal Military Academy arangiza Cadet mu 2011.\nIbyo akora.\nLt Col Lusanne Ingabire Nsengimana yakoze mu myanya itandukanye ku cyicaro gikuru cya RDF n'ahandi nk'i Gako,i Musanze abona n'andi masomo ya Girikare nk'agenewe abasirikare bakuru yaherewe i Fort Leavenworth muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za America,ari kandi no mu basirikare b'u Rwanda bagiye mu butumwa bw'amahoro muri Repubulika ya Centrafrique.Muri 2019 Col Ingabire yahawe inshingano zindi mu gisirikare cy'u Rwanda agirwa Umuyobozi Mukuru ukuriye Urwego rw'Imikoranire y'Ingabo n'abasivili.Ntabwo akiri kuri izi nshingano kuko mu minsi ishize yoherejwe mu zindi muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika."}
{"id": "22493", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22493", "title": "Lt Col Stella Uwineza", "text": "Lt Col Stella Uwineza ni umunyarwandakazi w'imyaka 42, n'umubyeyi ufite abana batatu(3) ari mubakora akazi ko kurinda umutekano w'igihugu cy'u Rwanda mu mwaka wa 2002.\nIbyo akora.\nLt Col Stella Uwineza mu 2020 yari afite ipeti rya Major,ubu yahawe ipeti rya Colonel.Yakoze inshingano ze za Gisirikare mu bice bitandukanye aho mu 2020 yoherejwe mu butumwa bw'amahoro muri Sudan y'Epfo.Icyo gihe yari inshuro ya kabiri ajya muri ubu butumwa,nyuma yo kuva muri i Darful muri Sudan hagati ya 2020 na 2021.Nubwo yagombaga gusoza ubutumwa bwe bw'umwaka muri Werurwe icyorezo cya Coronavirus cyatumye agumayo.\nIbihembo yahawe.\nLt Col Stella Uwineza ni umwe mubagize Rwanda Air Force,aho yakoze amateka agashimirwa nk'umwe mu bagore barindwi bambere bageze ku Ipeti rya Koloneli,bazamuwe bavuye ku ipeti rya Liyetona Coloneli kuwa 19 Ukuboza 2023."}
{"id": "22494", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22494", "title": "Gahamanyi Bibiane Mbaye", "text": "Gahamanyi Bibiane Mbaye.\nHonorable Gahamanyi Bibiane Mbaye ni umunyarwandakazi wavutse 02/12/1957. Ni umusenateri mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko y'u Rwanda, kuva muri Nzeri 2024, aho ari muba senateri bane(4) bashyizweho na Nyakubahwa Perezida wa Repubulika Paul KAGAME.Honorable Bibiane akaba afite ubwenegihugu bburi ubw'u Rwanda n'ubwa Senegal.\nAkazi.\nHonorable Gahamanyi Bibiane Mbaye azwi mu guharanira burenganzira bwa muntu(human rights advocates). Akaba yarakoze mu bijyanye n'uburenganzira bwa muntu mpuzamahanga, Uburinganire, ubuzima bw'imyororokere n'uburenganzira bwabwo,ubufatanye mpuzamahanga n'iterambere.\nHon. Gahamanyi Bibibane Mbaye yakoze mu myanya ikomeye mu miryango mpuzamahanga itandukanye irimo:\"International Planned Parenthood Federation(IPPF), Oxfam GB, Action Aid International, African Centre for Democaracy and Human Rights Studies,\" Yanakoranye n'imiryango ya Afurika nka:\"ENDA(Environment and Developmant Africa), UAPS(Union for African Population Studies).\"\nIbihugu yakoreyemo.\nHon. Gahamanyi Bibiane Mbaye yakoze mu bihugu bitandukanye harimo Gambia(Banjul), Kenya(Nairobi), na Senegal(Dakar).\nIndimi.\nHon. Gahamanyi Bibiane Mbaye azi neza indimi 4: Ikinyarwanda, icyongereza, igifaransa,n'igiswahili."}
