{"id": "22496", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22496", "title": "Hope tumukunde Gasatura", "text": "Hope Tumukunde Gasatura.\nHonorable Hope Tumukunde Gasatura ni umunyarwandakazi ukora muri Nteko Ishinga Amategeko y'u Rwanda manada ya Kane 2024-2029, akabarizwa mu mutwe w'abadepite.\nAmashuri.\nYize imitekerereze ya muntu n'imibare mu kiciro cya mbere muri Kaminuza muri Kaminuza ya Makerere muri Uganda. Ikiciro cya Kabiri cya Kaminuza yakize muri Kaminuza ya New York muri Amerika aho yize Imiyoborere ya Leta(Masters' Degree in Public Admnistration).\nAkazi.\nMu mahanga.\nHon. Hope yabaye:"}
{"id": "22497", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22497", "title": "G.S KAGUGU", "text": "G.S kagugu ni ikigo cy'amashuri giherereye mu karere ka Gasabo,umurenge wa Kinyinya,akagali ka Kagugu.iki kigo gitanga uburezi mu mashuri abanza(primary school),ikiciro rusange cy'amashuri yisumbuye(O'level).ikigo gifite ibyumba 53, ku buryo ku mpuzandengo nibura icyumba kimwe kibarirwa abana 80.\namateka ya G.S Kagugu\nNko mu mwaka wa 2015, mu banyeshuri basaga 400 bakoze ikizamini gisoza amashuri abanza, habonetsemo 110 batsinzwe bari mu cyiciro cya U.Icyakora mu 2016, ikigo cyikubise agashyi bagera kuri 70 mu mwaka wa 2017.Habanabakize avuga ko biterwa n\u2019ingamba bashyizeho zo kuzamura abana bari ku rwego rwo hasi, gusa bituma kuzamura abandi bari mu cyiciro cyo hagati bidindira.\nInkomoko"}
{"id": "22504", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22504", "title": "Kigali brilliant tower", "text": "kigali brilliant tower: iyi ni inyubako ifite amagorofa 15 yose hamwe. harimo abiri(2) ari munsi y' ubutaka ndetse hamwe 13 hejuru y' ubutaka, kigali brilliant tower ni inyubako y' umushoramari witwa Brian choi.iyi nyubako izubakwa binyuze mu kigo cye kitwa Brilliant holdings. \nAho inyubako iherereye.\nNi inyubako iri k' ubuso kwa meterokare 11.413 iri ku muhanda NO.11, KG7 Avenue,KG543 street,kigali,rwanda. Iherereye mu mugi wa kigali akarere ka Gasabo hafi y inzu z ubucuruzi \nnka kigali heights,radisson blu,kigali convection center(KCC), kigali alliance business center (KABC)\nhamwe na ambasade nk'iy'u Buyapani, u Bwongereza, u Buholandi na kaminuza ya kigali (UK).\nINKOMOKO"}
{"id": "22505", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22505", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Gisuna", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Gisuna ni rumwe mu nzibutso zihariye zishyinguyemo Abatutsi bishwe mu 1994, mu myaka yabanje guhera mu 1959, Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994Abatutsi batangiye kicwa mu buryo bw\u2019agashinyaguro burimo gutwikirwa amazu,kumeneshwa,babita amazina mabi abatesha agaciro n\u2019ubundi bugizi bwa nabi, batangira kubeshyerwa ko ari ibyitso by\u2019Inkotanyi; Uyu munsi, uru rwibutso rwa Gisuna rufite uruhare rukomeye mu kubungabunga aya amateka ya Jenoside no kwibutsa abakiriho kuzirikana no kumenya amateka mabi yaranze igihugu cyacu Jenoside%20n'ibibi%20byayo%2C%20birakomeza%20gutizwa%20umurindi%20n'uburyo ingaruka mbi z\u2019urwango n\u2019ivangura, hagamijwe kubaka igihugu kirangwa n\u2019ubumwe n\u2019amahoro.\nAHO URWIBUTSO RWA GISUNA RUHEREREYE.\nUrwibutso rwa Gisuna ruherereye mu karere ka Gicumbi, mu murenge wa Byumba, ahahoze ari Perefegitura ya Byumba, rukaba rushyinguyemo imibiri y\u2019Abatutsi bakuwe mu turere dutandukanye turimo Gatsibo, Nyagatare na Rulindo, ndetse no mu zahoze ari komine nka Muhura, Ngarama, Murambi, Muvumba, Kizinga, Buyoga na Tumba; uru rwibutso rufite amateka akomeye mu kubungabunga amateka ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 mu Rwanda, no gukomeza kwibutsa abanyarwanda bose n'abandi muri rusange kurwanya no kurandura ingengabitekerezo ya Jenoside kugira ngo dukumire burundu Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 no kubaka ubumwe n\u2019amahoro burambye.\nAMATEKA YA JENOSIDE YAKOREWE ABATUTSI MU 1994 MU RWANDA.\nUbwo Inkotanyi zatangizaga urugamba rwo kubohora igihugu tariki ya 1 Ukwakira 1990, Abatutsi benshi bo mu zahoze ari komini mu Majyaruguru batangiye gutabwa muri yombi bashinjwa kuba ibyitso, bafungirwa ahari urukiko rwa Perefegitura ya Byumba hafi y\u2019igisirikare; ubuhamya bwa bamwe mu barokotse Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 mu Rwanda, barimo Mupenzi Joseph, avuga ko kuva tariki ya 3 Ukwakira 1990 hatangiye igikorwa cyo gufata Abatutsi mu mujyi wa Byumba no mu nkengero zawo, bagakorerwa iyicarubozo rikomeye, bakicwa mu buryo bw\u2019agashinyaguro burimo gutemwa, gutwikwa no gutwikirwa, ndetse no gusukwaho ibintu bishyushye,Abatutsi bafashwe bavanywe mu bice bitandukanye nka Murambi, Muhura na Muvumba babita \u201cInyenzi\u201d, bagashyirwa mu kato bagakorerwa ubugome bukabije aho bamwe bicwaga nyuma yo kujyanwa mu kigo cya gisirikare, abandi bakajugunywa mu byobo ari bazima ndetse n'abandi Batutsi bakorerwaga iyicarubozo, mu gihe Abatutsi bamwe barokotse barekuwe nyuma y\u2019amezi abiri n\u2019akanama kari kagizwe n\u2019abayobozi barimo Superefe na Burugumesitiri, ariko benshi mu baturukaga mu zindi komini bagahitanwa n\u2019ubwicanyi bw\u2019indengakamere bwabibasiye bubasanga mu mayira."}
{"id": "22506", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22506", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyamigina", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyamigina ni urwibutso ruherereye mu Murenge wa Tare, mu Karere ka Nyamagabe, mu Ntara y\u2019Amajyepfo mu Rwanda, rwibukirwamo Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Uru rwibutso rushyinguwemo imibiri y\u2019abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994,biciwe muri ako gace no mu nkengero zako, rukaba rufite uruhare mu gusigasira amateka no kwigisha ku ngaruka z\u2019ingengabitekerezo ya Jenoside.Ku wa 20 Mata 2025, imibiri irenga ibihumbi bine (4,200) yari ishyinguye kuri uru rwibutso yimuriwe mu Rwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Murambi ruherereye mu Murenge wa Gasaka, mu rwego rwo kurushaho kunoza imicungire no kubungabunga inzibutso za Jenoside yakorewe abatutsi muri 1994 no guha icyubahiro gikwiye abacu abazize Jenoside.\nAmateka.\nKu wa 20 Mata 2025, imibiri 4,201 y\u2019abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 yari ishyinguye mu Rwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyamigina ruherereye mu Murenge wa Tare, yimuriwe mu Rwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Murambi ruherereye mu Murenge wa Gasaka, mu Karere ka Nyamagabe. Iki gikorwa cyari kigamije guhuza inzibutso za Jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu rwego rwo kurushaho kubungabunga amateka no kunoza imicungire y'inzibutso.Ubuyobozi bw\u2019Akarere ka Nyamagabe bwatangaje ko kwimura iyo mibiri byakozwe ku bufatanye n\u2019imiryango yarifite ababo bashyinguwe kuri uru rwibutso, bakaba barabyemeye hagamijwe kubaha icyubahiro gikwiye no gusigasira amateka. Umuyobozi w\u2019Akarere yashimiye imiryango yemeye icyo gikorwa, abizeza ko aho uru rwibutso rwari ruherereye hazakomeza kwitabwaho nk\u2019ikimenyetso cy\u2019amateka ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.Iki gikorwa cyakurikiwe n\u2019Umugoroba wo kwibuka wabereye ku Rwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyamigina, witabiriwe n\u2019abayobozi batandukanye, barimo Perezida w\u2019Inama Njyanama y\u2019Akarere, abayobozi bungirije b\u2019Akarere n\u2019abahagarariye inzego z\u2019umutekano, amadini n\u2019amatorero, hamwe n\u2019abaturage.Imibiri yimuwe yashyinguwe mu cyubahiro ku wa 21 Mata 2025 mu Rwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Murambi, hamwe n\u2019indi mibiri umunani, igizwe n\u2019irindwi yari ishyinguye mu miryango n\u2019umwe wabonetse nyuma."}
{"id": "22507", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22507", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kiziguro", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi rwa Kiziguro ni urwibutso ruherereye mu Murenge wa Kiziguro, mu Karere ka Gatsibo, mu Rwanda. Rushyinguyemo imibiri y'Abatutsi bishwe muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri 1994.\nAho ruherereye.\nUrwibutso rwa Kiziguro ruherereye mu murenge wa Kiziguro, mu karere ka Gatsibo. Ni ahantu ho kwibuka, gusobanukirwa amateka no guha icyubahiro Abatutsi bishwe muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994.\nAmateka.\nMu minsi ya mbere ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, Abatutsi benshi bo mu cyahoze ari komini Murambi no mu nkengero zaho bahungiye kuri Paruwasi Gatolika ya Kiziguro. Bizeraga ko bashobora kuharokokera.\nKu wa 11 Mata 1994, abagabye igitero barimo Interahamwe, abasirikare n'abandi bafatanyije na bo bateye Abatutsi bari bahungiye kuri paruwasi. Ubwicanyi bwatangiye mu gitondo bukomeza kugeza nimugoroba.\nAbari bahungiye kuri Paruwasi ya Kiziguro biciwe mu bice bitandukanye by'iyo paruwasi. Muri ibyo bice harimo igikari cy'abapadiri, hafi y'amashuri, ku bitaro bya Kiziguro no mu nkengero z'urusengero. Imibiri ya bamwe mu bishwe yajugunywe mu byobo byari hafi aho, indi ijugunywa mu rwobo rurerure rwari munsi y'amashuri.\nJenoside muri ako gace yateguwe kandi ishyirwa mu bikorwa n'abayobozi b'inzego nkuru n'iz'ibanze, bafatanyije n'Interahamwe n'abasirikare baturutse mu bigo bya gisirikare bitandukanye.\nUrwibutso.\nNyuma ya Jenoside, hashyizweho Urwibutso rwa Kiziguro kugira ngo rushyingurwemo imibiri y'abishwe kandi rubungabunge amateka y'ibyabereye muri ako gace.\nUrwibutso rushyinguyemo imibiri y'abazize Jenoside irenga ibihumbi 20.132. Mu gihe cyo kwibuka ku nshuro ya 31, hashyinguwe mu cyubahiro indi mibiri 21 yari imaze kuboneka.\nUrwibutso rwa Kiziguro rufasha mu bikorwa byo kwibuka, kwigisha amateka ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi no guhangana n'ipfobya n'ihakana rya Jenoside."}
{"id": "22508", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22508", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Musange", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Musange ni ahantu ho kwibukira no gushyingura abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, haherereye mu Murenge wa Musange, mu Akarere ka Nyamagabe, mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo y'u Rwanda.\nUru rwibutso ruruhukiyemo imibiri irenga 26 000. Rwakira buri mwaka imihango yo \"Kwibuka\".\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri mu Kagari ka Jenda, mu Murenge wa Musange, mu Karere ka Nyamagabe. Aha hahoze ari Komini Musange, muri Perefegitura ya Gikongoro.\nUbwicanyi bwabereye i Musange.\nMu minsi ya mbere ya Jenoside, abicanyi baturutse muri Komini Karambo bageze muri Musange. Ku wa 15 Mata 1994, abantu benshi bateraniye ku isoko rya Masizi. Bashakaga gutera Abatutsi bari bahungiye ku biro bya Komini Musange. Abapolisi barashe mu kirere, abo bantu baratatana. Abatutsi bamwe bo muri Musange bahungiye kuri Paruwasi ya Kaduha.\nMusange ni agace k'imisozi miremire, amashyamba n'ibihuru. Interahamwe zatwikaga ibihuru n'amazu kugira ngo hatagira uwihisha. Abatutsi bamwe bahungiye mu mashuri abanza ya Masagara na Musange. Abandi bahungiye mu nsengero, nka ADEPR Masizi na Kiliziya Gatolika ya Masagara. Interahamwe n'abasirikare ba FAR babasangagayo barabica. Bamwe barokotse kubera Abahutu babahishe.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Musange ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAmateka.\nMu cyahoze ari Gikongoro, Abatutsi bishwe kuva mu Ugushyingo 1959. Mu Ukuboza 1963, Abatutsi bagera ku 2 500 biciwe kuri Paruwasi ya Cyanika.\nNyuma ya Jenoside, bamwe mu bayikoze baburanishijwe n'inkiko Gacaca. Mu 2004, imibiri y'Abatutsi yabonetse yashyinguwe mu cyubahiro muri uru rwibutso. Urwibutso rwavuguruwe hagati ya 2018 na 2019.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rwa Musange ruruhukiyemo imibiri irenga 26 000. Buri mwaka, abaturage ba Musange bahurira ku rwibutso mu gihe cyo kwibuka."}
{"id": "22510", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22510", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Muyumbu", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi rwa Muyumbu ni urwibutso ruherereye mu Murenge wa Muyumbu, Akarere ka Rwamagana, mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba y'u Rwanda. Rwibukirwaho Abatutsi bishwe muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, kandi ni hamwe mu hantu ha mbere hashyizweho mu Rwanda hagamijwe gushyingura mu cyubahiro no kwibuka abazize Jenoside. Mu 2026, amakuru yatangajwe yagaragazaga ko urwibutso rwari rushyinguyemo imibiri 14 401.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Muyumbu ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAho urwibutso ruherereye.\nUrwibutso ruherereye mu Murenge wa Muyumbu, mu Akarere ka Rwamagana, mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba, iburasirazuba bwa Kigali.\nMuyumbu ni kamwe mu duce two mu Karere ka Rwamagana twegereye umujyi wa Kigali. Urwibutso ni rumwe mu nzibutso zashyizweho mu Rwanda kugira ngo zibungabunge amateka ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi kandi zibe ahantu ho kunamira no gushyingura mu cyubahiro abazize Jenoside.\nAmateka.\nKu wa 13 Ugushyingo 1994, i Muyumbu hashyinguwe mu cyubahiro imibiri 400 y'Abatutsi bishwe muri Jenoside. Amakuru yatangajwe mu 2026 avuga ko icyo ari cyo gikorwa cya mbere cyo gushyingura mu rwibutso rwa Jenoside cyabaye mu Rwanda. \"The New Times\" na yo yagaragaje Muyumbu nk'ahari urwibutso rwa mbere rwa Jenoside mu Rwanda.\nMu Mata 2017, indi mibiri 26 yashyinguwe mu cyubahiro kuri uru rwibutso.\nKu wa 11 Mata 2022, hashyinguwe indi mibiri icumi yari yabonetse, irimo irindwi yabonetse mu Murenge wa Nzige n'itatu yabonetse mu Murenge wa Muyumbu. Icyo gihe iyi mibiri yiyongereye ku 14 309 yari isanzwe ishyinguye muri uru rwibutso, bituma yose iba 14 319.\nKu wa 11 Mata 2026, hashyinguwe mu cyubahiro indi mibiri ine yari iherutse kuboneka. Ku wa 29 Mata 2026, \"Muhazi Yacu\" yatangaje ko urwibutso rwari rushyinguyemo imibiri 14 401.\nKwibuka no kubungabunga amateka.\nKu Rwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Muyumbu habera ibikorwa byo Kwibuka abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, kunamira abahashyinguye no gushyingura mu cyubahiro imibiri igenda iboneka.\nAbayobozi b'Akarere ka Rwamagana bagaragaje ko ibikorwa byo kwibuka bifasha no kwigisha urubyiruko amateka ya Jenoside, ubumwe, kubana neza no kurwanya ingengabitekerezo ya Jenoside.\nMu 2026, Perezida wa IBUKA mu Karere ka Rwamagana, Musabyeyezu Dative, yagaragaje impungenge z'uko hakiri imibiri y'abazize Jenoside itaraboneka kubera ko hari abantu bataratanga amakuru y'aho yajugunywe. Minisitiri w'Uburinganire n'Iterambere ry'Umuryango, Uwimana Consol\u00e9e, na we yasabye abafite ayo makuru kuyatanga kugira ngo imibiri itaraboneka ishobore gushyingurwa mu cyubahiro."}
{"id": "22512", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22512", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Mutete", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Mutete ni urwibutso rushyingurwemo imibiri 1,095 ya abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994.\nAho ruherereye.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Mutete ruherereye mu murenge wa Mutete, mu Karere ka Gicumbi, mu ntara y\u2019Amajyaruguru y\u2019u Rwanda.\nUrwibutso rwa Mutete ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAmateka.\nAmateka y'urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Mutete mbere y\u2019uko ruvugururwa agaragaza ko rwari rushyinguwemo imibiri 1,049 y'abazize jenocide ya mu buryo bworoheje imibiri y\u2019abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 biciwe mu murenge wa Mutete n\u2019inkengero zaho. Mu gihe cya Jenoside n\u2019imyaka ya mbere yakurikiyeho, abaharokokeye n\u2019abaturage bashyinguye ababo mu mva rusange zitari zifite ibikorwa remezo bihagije cyangwa imiterere ijyanye n\u2019icyubahiro gikwiye. Uru rwibutso rwabanje kuba rudafite inyubako zihagije, rutunganijwe neza cyangwa ibisobanuro birambuye ku mateka, bikagabanya ubushobozi bwo kwakira abarusura no gutanga inyigisho zihagije ku mateka ya Jenoside. Nyuma, Leta n\u2019abafatanyabikorwa batangiye ibikorwa byo kuruvugurura no kurushyira ku rwego rushimangira icyubahiro cy\u2019abahashyinguye no kurufasha kuba ahantu hizewe ho kwibukira no kwigira ku mateka.\nIvurugurura ryur'urwibutso.\nUru rwibutso rwa Mutete rwari rusanzwe rushyinguwemo imibiri 1,049 ariko rutaravugururwa, muri iyo 33 yavanywe mu ngo z'abantu aho yari ishyinguwe naho 13 yavanywe mu rundi rwibutso rwa Nyamiyaga aho bita mataba, ubu uru rwibutso ruruhukiyemo imibiri igera ku 1095. \nAmateka yaranze Mutete mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 ni amateka akomeye kandi ababaje, agaragaza ubwicanyi bukabije, ubuhunzi n\u2019ingaruka zikomeye ku baturage. \nMutete ni agace kari mu Majyaruguru y\u2019u Rwanda (mu Karere ka Gicumbi ubu). Jenoside itangiye muri Mata 1994, ubwicanyi bwahise butangira no muri aka gace, cyane cyane bwibasira Abatutsi. \nIbyabaye muri Mutete Abatutsi benshi bo muri Mutete barishwe mu buryo bw\u2019agashinyaguro n\u2019interahamwe. Hari abagerageje guhungira mu misozi no mu mashyamba, ariko benshi baricwaga bakurikiranywe. Abaturage bamwe bashatse guhungira ku mipaka ya Uganda kubera ko Mutete yegereye umupaka, ariko si bose bahageze neza. Abari abayobozi cyangwa abari bafite ububasha muri ako gace bagize uruhare mu gutegura no gushyigikira ubwicanyi. \nUbutabazi n\u2019ihagarikwa rya Jenoside. Jenoside yaje guhagarikwa n\u2019ingabo za Rwanda Patriotic Front, zagiye zifata uduce dutandukanye tw\u2019igihugu harimo n\u2019aka gace ka Mutete. Ibi byatumye ubwicanyi buhagarara, nubwo hari hashize iminsi myinshi abantu bamaze kwicwa. \nIngaruka ku baturage ba Mutete Abantu benshi bahasize ubuzima. Hari imiryango yatsembwe burundu. Abacitse ku icumu basigaye bafite ibikomere byo ku mubiri no ku mutima. Abaturage benshi bahungiye mu bihugu by\u2019abaturanyi mbere yo kugaruka nyuma. 5. Kwibuka no kubaka ubumwe Uyu munsi, Mutete kimwe n\u2019ahandi mu Rwanda, hibandwa ku: Kwibuka Jenoside buri mwaka mu gihe cya Kwibuka. Kwigisha amateka nyayo kugira ngo Jenoside itazongera kubaho ukundi. Kubaka ubumwe n\u2019ubwiyunge hagati y\u2019Abanyarwanda."}
{"id": "22513", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22513", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Mibirizi", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Mibirizi ni urwibutso rusigasiye imibiri yabazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 mu Rwanda, ruherereye mu karere ka Rusizi,mu murenge wa Nyakarenzo (hafi ya paruwasi ya Mibirizi),mu Kagari ka Mibirizi.Uru rwibutso rushyinguyemo imibiri yAbatutsi bishwe muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. \nAmateka.\nImibiri 520 y'abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi yari ishyinguye mu buryo budahwitse hafi y'ingo yashyinguwe mu rwibutso rwa Mibirizi ruri mu karere ka Rusizi tariki 30/02/2013. Urwibutso rwa Mibirizi rumaze gushyingurwamo imibiri y'irakarengane 7520.\nIyi mibiri yavuye mu mirenge ya Nyakarenzo na Rwimbogo nk'uko byatangajwe n'imiryango ifite Abatutsi babo bazize Jenoside baruhukiye mu rwibutso rwa Mibirizi. Banagaruka ku mateka n'inzira y'umusaraba abashyinguwe banyuzemo mbere yuko bicwa n'Interahamwe aho bamwe bajugunywaga mu byobo ari bazima,bakabatemagura,bakabicisha uduhiri,amacumu,n'ibindi abandi bakicwa n'inzara kugera banogotse.\nAbafite ababo baruhukiye muri uru rwibutso rwa Mibirizi bavuga ko uburyo rwubatse bitajyanye n'igihe kandi ko bidahesha agaciro abaruhukiye muri urwo rwibutso.\nUbuyobozi bw'Akarere ka Rusizi buvuga ko kugeza ubu mu karere ka Rusizi hari inzibutso zirindwi(7) ziruhukiyemo imibiri y'abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 mu Rwanda, eshatu murizo ziri ku rwego rw'Akarere bakifuza kandi ko zizagenda zivugururwa uko ubushobozi buzagenda buboneka..\nUbuhamya.\nfilime mbarankuru ngufi ku mateka ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi i mibirizi.\nkanda hano wumve ubuhamya mubihangano (videwo)"}
{"id": "22514", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22514", "title": "Urwibusto rwa Mvuzo", "text": "Urwibusto rwa Mvuzo ni rumwe mu rwibusto rubiste imibiri yinzirakarengane zishwe mu mwaka 1994 ingana n' ibihumbi 6,709\nAho Ruherereye.\nUrwibusto rwa Mvuzo ni urwibusto ruherereye mu ntara yamajyaruguru mu karere ka Rulindo mu murenge wa murambi\nAmateka yur' URwibusto rwa Mvuzo.\nUrwibusto rwa Mvuzo rufite amateka akomeye cyane kubera ko jenocide yahabaye ari naho ibirindiro by'ingabo za FAR n'abayobozi bakomeye bayishyigikiraga, iyi misozi yari ituwe n'imiryango myinshi y'Abatusti, ariko abenshi barishwe ku buryo hari ni miryango burundu.\nabahakomokeye bavuga ko mbere ya jenoside abantu bari babanye neza, ariko jenoside iza kubatanya cyane. Hari kandi nindirimbo \" Mfura zo ku Mugote\" yumuhanzi Munyanshoza dieudonnne igaragaza ayo mateka, igatera amarangamutima aba hakomoste. \njenoside murako gace yakajijwe nintera hamwe n'ubukangura mbaga bwa bayobozi MRND, ndeste n'indirimbo zibira urwango. Nyuma ya jenoside,haracyari ikibazo cyo kutabona imibiri yabishwe ngo ishyingurwe mu cyubahiro kuko hari abantu banze kwerekana aho bayijugunye.\nNubwo bimeze bityo, abarokoste jenoside bashimira leta y'urwanda n'Inkotanyi zabarokoye, kuko zabafashije kongera kubaho neza no kwiyubaka, bagaragaza ko bababariye abahemukiye, ariko bagasaba ko bagaragaza aho imibiri y'abishwe iri.\nAbayobozi basaba abaturage gukomeza gufasha abarokoste jenoside, kwirindaingenga bitekerezo yayo no kuyirwanya, cyane cyane mu rubyiruko, kugira ngo igihugu gikomeze kubakwa mu bumwe n'ubwiyunge."}
{"id": "22516", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22516", "title": "Abarangije ibihano ku byaha bya jenoside", "text": "Guhugura abagororwa bari kurangiza ibihano ku byaha bya Jenoside.\nMinisiteri y'ubumwe bw'Abanyarwanda n'Inshingano Mboneragihugu (Minubumwe) yatangaje ko kuva muri werurwe 2025 itangije gahunda yo guhugura abangororwa bari kuarangiza ibihano ku byaha bya Jenoside kugeza ubu nta n'umwe mu barekuwe wari wagaragaraye mu isubiracyaha nk'uko byagijyaga bigenda.\nAmahugurwa bahabwa.\nNi amahugurwa yahawe abagororwa baribarangije ibihano bahise barekurwa n'ababirangije mu mwaka wa 2025 bakayahabwa kugeza ku itariki ya 18 Werurwe 2026."}
{"id": "22517", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22517", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Rutare", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi rwa Rutare ni rumwe mu nzibutso zibumbatiye amateka n\u2019ukuri ku byabaye mu Rwanda mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Ruherereye mu Murenge wa Rutare, Akarere ka Gicumbi mu Ntara y\u2019Amajyaruguru. Uru rwibutso rushyinguyemo mu cyubahiro imibiri isaga 2,000 y\u2019abazize Jenoside, rukaba ahantu ho kwibukira, kwigira amateka no gushishikariza abaturarwanda n\u2019abashyitsi kwimakaza ubumwe n\u2019ubwiyunge. Nk\u2019izindi nzibutso zo mu gihugu, Urwibutso rwa Rutare rufite uruhare rukomeye mu kubungabunga amateka, guha icyubahiro abishwe muri Jenoside no gukomeza guhangana n\u2019ingaruka za Jenoside. \nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Rutare ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAmateka.\nAmateka y\u2019Urwibutso rwa Rutare ashingiye ku byabaye mu cyahoze ari Komini Rutare muri Perefegitura ya Byumba, aho Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 yatwaye ubuzima bw' Abatutsi benshi bazira uko bavutse. Muri ako gace, nk\u2019ahandi henshi mu gihugu, Jenoside yateguwe igihe kirekire hashingiwe ku macakubiri n\u2019urwango byabibwe n\u2019ubutegetsi bwariho icyo gihe.Mu gihe cya Jenoside, Abatutsi benshi bo mu Murenge wa Rutare bahigwaga n\u2019interahamwe ndetse n\u2019abasirikare, Abatutsi bamwe bakicirwa mu ngo zabo abandi bakicirwa mu bice bari bahungiyemo bashaka ubuhungiro. Hari n\u2019abagerageje kwihisha cyangwa guhunga, ariko benshi baricwa. Nyuma y\u2019uko Jenoside ihagaritswe n\u2019Ingabo za RPA-Inkotanyi, hatangiye igikorwa cyo gushakisha imibiri y\u2019Abatutsi bishwe kugira ngo ishyingurwe mu cyubahiro.Urwibutso rwa Rutare rwashyizweho kugira ngo ruhuze kandi rusigasire imibiri y\u2019Abatutsi bishwe muri Jenoside, ndetse rukaba n\u2019ahantu ho kwigisha amateka y\u2019ukuri ku byabaye. Kugeza ubu, uru rwibutso ruruhukiyemo imibiri igera kuri 275 y\u2019abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994.Uretse kuba ari ahashyinguwe Abatutsi bishwe, uru rwibutso rukoreshwa mu bikorwa byo kwibuka buri mwaka, cyane cyane mu cyumweru cy\u2019icyunamo n\u2019iminsi 100 yo kwibuka Jenoside, aho abaturage, abayobozi n\u2019abashyitsi bahahurira bagasubiza amaso inyuma, bagaha icyubahiro abazize Jenoside, ndetse bagafata ingamba zo kurwanya ingengabitekerezo ya Jenoside no kubaka ejo hazaza harangwa n\u2019amahoro n\u2019ubumwe.\nBumwe mu buhamya bw'Aabatutsi barokotse Jenoside muri Rutare:.\nGutangiza icyumweru cy'icyunamo n'iminsi 100 yo kwibuka ku nshuro ya 32 Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, mu karere ka Gicumbi, byabereye mu Murenge wa Rutare kuwa Kabiri tariki ya 7 Mata 2026.Mu buhamya bwa Higiro Damas warokokeye Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 mu cyahoze ari komini Rutare muri perefegitura ya Byumba, yagarutse ku buryo higishijwe amacakubiri n'ivangura mu Banyarwanda nuko urwango rwo kwanga Abatutsi rwabibwe n'ubutegetsi imyaka myinshi kugeza ubwo habaga Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994.Higiro yavuze ko muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi yahizwe n'interahamwe zashakaga kumwica ndetse ko bigeze no kumubika bavuga ko yapfuye mu byukuri ataribyo, anashimira Inkotanyi zarokoye Abatutsi barimo abari bahunguye ku mupadiri ukomoka muri Espagne.Yagize ati \"Iyo mvura rero imbera igisubizo, nzamuka muri iyo mvura ndaza ngaruka aha ariko kubera ko bambonye manuka ntibambone nzamuka baramutse babwira ab'iwacu ko napfuye, naguye ahangaha.\"Kamizikunze Anastase Perezida wa IBUKA mu karere ka Gicumbi yashimiye Inkotanyi zemeye kwitanga zihagarika Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994.Yagize ati \"Hari abo dushima bakoze ijoro n'amanywa aribo Nkotanyi ndetse na hano i Rutare niko byagenze, hari abasirikare bitanze, yemwe hari n'abasiviri bitanze, kugirango uyu munsi tube turiho, birumvikana hari n'abatakaje ubuzima bwabo kugirango baturokore.\""}
{"id": "22519", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22519", "title": "Onomo Hotel Kigali", "text": "Onomo Hotel Kigali: ni hotel ifite inyenyeri 3,yafunguye imiryango muri 2018.ifunguwe ni itsinda Onomo hotel rikaba rigenzurwa ni ikigo gishoramari cya batipart. iyii hoteli ifite ibyumba byose hamwe 109.\nAho iherereye.\nOnomo hotel kigali: iherereye mukarere ka nyarugenge mu minota mi uva mu mujyi rwagati, ikaba ari ibirometero 8 uvuye ku kibuga cy' indege mpuzamahanga., ikaba iri mugace karimo ibindi bikorwa nka M HOTEL,RURA RSSB,"}
{"id": "22520", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22520", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kibungo - Ngoma", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kibungo-Ngoma ni urwibutso rwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 ruherereye mu Murenge wa Kibungo, mu Akarere ka Ngoma, mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba y'u Rwanda. Rushyinguwemo imibiri y'Abatutsi bishwe muri Jenoside mu Mujyi wa Kibungo no mu bice bitandukanye by'icyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Kibungo. Mu 2026, amakuru yatangajwe yagaragazaga ko urwibutso rwari rushyinguwemo imibiri isaga 25 000.\nUrwibutso ni ahantu ho kunamira abazize Jenoside, gushyingura mu cyubahiro imibiri igenda iboneka no kubungabunga amateka ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Kibungo.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Kibungo - Ngoma ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAho urwibutso ruherereye.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kibungo-Ngoma ruherereye mu Murenge wa Kibungo, ari na wo urimo umujyi ukoreramo ubuyobozi bw'Akarere ka Ngoma, mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba.\nUrwibutso ruri ku bipimo by'isi bya 2\u00b009\u203253.18\u2033 S na 30\u00b032\u203229.58\u2033 E.\nKibungo yari icyicaro cy'icyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Kibungo. Iyo perefegitura yari igizwe n'amakomini 11 ari yo Kayonza, Rutonde, Muhazi, Rukara, Kabarondo, Kigarama, Birenga, Mugesera, Sake, Rukira na Rusumo. Ubu uturere twaho tugabanyijwemo ahanini Rwamagana, Kayonza, Ngoma na Kirehe.\nAmateka.\nJenoside mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Kibungo.\nUbushakashatsi bwakozwe na Komisiyo y'Igihugu yo Kurwanya Jenoside (CNLG) bugaragaza ko Abatutsi bo mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Kibungo bahuye n'ivangura, itotezwa n'ubwicanyi mu myaka yabanjirije Jenoside yo mu 1994. Ubushakashatsi bwa CNLG bugaragaza ko mu 1994 ubwicanyi bwakorewe Abatutsi muri iyo perefegitura bwabaye cyane hagati ya tariki ya 7 n'iya 27 Mata.\nMu Mujyi wa Kibungo, ahantu Abatutsi benshi bahungiye harimo Economat ya Kibungo, yari imwe mu nyubako z'Diyosezi ya Kibungo, ibitaro n'ahandi batekerezaga ko bashobora kubona ubuhungiro.\nKu wa 13 Mata 1994, abicanyi bageze kuri Economat ya Kibungo bagamije gutera ubwoba Abatutsi bari bahahungiye. Ku wa 15 Mata, abasirikare n'Interahamwe bagabye ibitero kuri iyo Economat, hicwa benshi mu bari bayihungiyemo.\nAmakuru y'ubuyobozi bw'Intara y'Iburasirazuba agaragaza kandi ko ku wa 15 Mata 1994 Abatutsi benshi bari bahungiye kuri Economat ya Kibungo no mu Bitaro bya Kibungo bishwe.\nUbushakashatsi bwa CNLG bugaragaza ko mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Kibungo hari imitwe yitwaraga gisirikare n'Interahamwe zari zaratojwe mbere ya Jenoside, kandi ko abayobozi benshi bo mu nzego z'ibanze bagize uruhare mu gutegura no gushyira mu bikorwa ubwicanyi.\nIshyirwaho n'iyubakwa ry'urwibutso.\nNyuma yo guhagarika Jenoside, hatangiye ibikorwa byo gushakisha imibiri y'Abatutsi bishwe, kuyikura mu mva rusange no mu handi yari yarajugunywe, no kuyishyingura mu cyubahiro.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kibungo rwubatswe bwa mbere mu 1997, hamwe n'izindi nzibutso zari zarashyizweho muri ako gace. Uko imyaka yagiye ishira, hagaragaye ko inyubako ya mbere itari ihagije mu kubungabunga neza imibiri yari irushyinguwemo, bituma hatangira gahunda yo kuruvugurura no kurwubaka ku buryo bugezweho.\nMu rwego rwo kubungabunga inzibutso no guhuriza hamwe imibiri yari ishyinguye mu nzibutso nto, Akarere ka Ngoma kagiye gateganya inzibutso nke z'ingenzi zo ku rwego rw'Akarere. Urwibutso rwa Kibungo rwari rumwe muri zo.\nGushyingura imibiri mu cyubahiro.\nKu wa 15 Mata 2017, imibiri y'Abatutsi basaga 7 000 bishwe muri Jenoside, yari yarakuwe mu bice bitandukanye by'Akarere ka Ngoma, yashyinguwe mu cyubahiro mu Rwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kibungo.\nMu 2024, ubuyobozi bw'Akarere ka Ngoma bwatangaje ko urwibutso rwari rushyinguwemo imibiri y'Abatutsi basaga 25 000 bazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nKu wa 15 Mata 2025, mu gihe cyo Kwibuka ku nshuro ya 31 Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, hashyinguwe mu cyubahiro indi mibiri umunani y'Abatutsi bishwe muri Jenoside. Iyo mibiri yari yarabonetse mu Mirenge ya Remera na Kibungo.\nMu 2026, mu gihe cyo Kwibuka ku nshuro ya 32, amakuru yatangajwe yongeye kugaragaza ko imibiri y'Abatutsi basaga 25 000 yari iruhukiye mu Rwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kibungo-Ngoma.\nKwibuka no kubungabunga amateka.\nKu Rwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kibungo-Ngoma habera ibikorwa byo Kwibuka abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Mu Karere ka Ngoma, uru rwibutso ni hamwe mu hantu h'ingenzi habera imihango yo gutangiza no gukomeza ibikorwa byo kwibuka ku rwego rw'Akarere.\nMuri ibyo bikorwa, abarokotse Jenoside batanga ubuhamya, abayobozi n'abaturage bakunamira abahashyinguye kandi bagashyira indabo ku mva. Ibikorwa byo kwibuka bikoreshwa kandi mu kwigisha amateka ya Jenoside, gushishikariza urubyiruko kuyamenya no kurwanya ingengabitekerezo ya Jenoside.\nUbuyobozi bw'Akarere ka Ngoma n'Intara y'Iburasirazuba bwagiye busaba abaturage bafite amakuru y'aho hakiri imibiri y'Abatutsi bishwe muri Jenoside kuyatanga kugira ngo iyo mibiri iboneke kandi ishyingurwe mu cyubahiro.\nMu 2026, abayobozi bongeye gushimangira ko kubungabunga amateka y'ibyabereye i Kibungo ari uburyo bwo gufasha abarokotse n'abazavuka kumenya amateka no kurwanya ihakana n'ipfobya rya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi."}
{"id": "22521", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22521", "title": "Singita Kwitonda Lodge and Kataza House", "text": "Singita Kwitonda Lodge and Kataza House: ni amahoteli y' ubukerarugendo aherereye mu karere ka musanze,mu murenge wa kinigi,kumbibi z'ibirunga.\niyi hoteli ifatwa nkiyi icyiciro cyo hejuru cyane bimenyerewe nka hoteli y' inyenyeri 5 (5-star hotel).ikaba ifite ibyumba 13 bose hamwe.uyu mushinga wa amahoheli watangijwe ni umuyobozi mukuru luke bailes.singita kwitonda lodge and kataza house yafunguwe kumugaragaro tariki 1 kanama 2019 na perezida wa repubulika\npaul kagame."}
{"id": "22523", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22523", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Rwamagana", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Rwamagana ni urwibutso rwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Ruri mu Murenge wa Kigabiro, mu Akarere ka Rwamagana, mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba y'u Rwanda.\nUrwibutso rushyinguyemo abazize Jenoside. Ni ahantu ho kwibuka no kunamira abazize Jenoside. Akarere ka Rwamagana gafite izindi nzibutso nyinshi za Jenoside.\nAho ruherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri mu Murenge wa Kigabiro, mu Karere ka Rwamagana. Ako karere kari mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba.\nUrwibutso rwa Rwamagana ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu. Inzibutso za Jenoside zikoreshwa mu gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kunamira, kubika amateka no kwibuka.\nInzibutso enye za Jenoside zo mu Rwanda ziri ku rutonde rw'Umurage w'Isi wa UNESCO. Izo nzibutso ni Nyamata, Murambi, Gisozi na Bisesero.\nAmateka.\nUrwibutso rwa Rwamagana rufitanye isano n'ubwicanyi bwabereye mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Kibungo. Ruri mu nzibutso zashyizweho nyuma ya 1994 mu Karere ka Rwamagana.\nMu 2022, \"KT Press\" yavuze ko Akarere ka Rwamagana gafite inzibutso 11. Izo nzibutso zishyinguyemo nibura abazize Jenoside 83\u00a0729. Mu 2023, \"The New Times\" yatanze umubare wa 83\u00a0851.\nMu Karere ka Rwamagana, ubwicanyi buzwi cyane ni ubwabereye i Mwulire. Abatutsi benshi bahungiye ku musozi wa Mwulire. Birwanyeho hafi ibyumweru bibiri. Nyuma, Interahamwe zifashijwe n'abayobozi n'ingabo za Leta zarabishe. Nibura abantu 15\u00a0000 biciwe ku musozi wa Mwulire.\nImibiri y'abazize Jenoside iracyashyingurwa mu cyubahiro. Urugero, muri Mata 2024, imibiri 128 yashyinguwe mu rwibutso rwa Mwulire.\nMu 2023, ubuyobozi bw'akarere bwavuze ko inzibutso 11 zizahurizwa hamwe. Zizasigara ari inzibutso 6. Iteka ryo mu 2019 rigena uko inzibutso za Jenoside zihurizwa hamwe.\nKwibuka.\nBuri mwaka, imihango yo \"Kwibuka\" ibera mu Karere ka Rwamagana. Urugero, mu 2019 imihango yabereye ku rwibutso rwa Mwulire. Mu 2023, imihango yo kwibuka abana bishwe muri Jenoside yabereye i Sovu, mu Murenge wa Kigabiro.\nItegeko ryo mu 2016 rigena imihango yo kwibuka Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Iryo tegeko rigena kandi imicungire y'inzibutso za Jenoside."}
{"id": "22525", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22525", "title": "Ingaruka za jenocide", "text": "\"INGARUKA ZA JENOCIDE YAKOREWE ABATUTSI MU RWANDA\"\nJenoside ni igikorwa kibi cyane aho itsinda ry\u2019abantu (nk\u2019ubwoko, idini, igihugu cyangwa itsinda runaka) rigerageza kurimburwa burundu cyangwa igice kinini cyaryo. Ibi bikorwa ku bushake, kandi bishobora gukorwa mu buryo butandukanye nko:\nJenocide yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 (Genocide against the Tutsi) ni kimwe mu bihe bikomeye cyane byaranze amateka y\u2019u Rwanda. Yabaye mu gihe gito cyane cy\u2019amezi atatu, ariko yangiza bikomeye ubuzima bw\u2019abantu, ubukungu bw\u2019igihugu, ndetse n\u2019imibanire y\u2019Abanyarwanda. Ingaruka zayo zabaye ndende kandi zikomeye, zigaragara kugeza n\u2019uyu munsi mu nzego zitandukanye z\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019igihugu.\nJenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 ni kimwe mu bihe bikomeye cyane byaranze amateka y\u2019u Rwanda. Yabaye mu gihe gito cyane cy\u2019amezi atatu, ariko yangiza bikomeye ubuzima bw\u2019abantu, ubukungu bw\u2019igihugu, ndetse n\u2019imibanire y\u2019Abanyarwanda. Ingaruka zayo zabaye ndende kandi zikomeye, zigaragara kugeza n\u2019uyu munsi mu nzego zitandukanye z\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019igihugu.\nMbere na mbere, Jenoside yasize igihombo gikomeye cy\u2019abantu. Abantu barenga miliyoni imwe barishwe, bituma imiryango myinshi isenyuka burundu. Abana benshi basigaye ari imfubyi, abandi babaho mu miryango iyobowe n\u2019abana (child-headed families), mu gihe abapfakazi benshi basigaye mu buzima bugoye cyane. Iki gihombo cyagize ingaruka zikomeye ku mibare y\u2019abaturage no ku bushobozi bw\u2019igihugu bwo kongera kwiyubaka.\nIkindi kandi, Jenoside yasize ihungabana rikomeye ryo mu mutwe ku bayirokotse. Abacitse ku icumu benshi bagize ibibazo bikomeye byo mu mutwe nko kwiheba, guhora bibuka ibihe bibi banyuzemo, ndetse n\u2019ubwoba bukabije. Ibi byatumye benshi batabasha gukomeza ubuzima busanzwe, kandi byagize ingaruka ku mikurire y\u2019abana bakuriye muri ayo mateka. Ihungabana si ikibazo cy\u2019igihe gito gusa, ahubwo ni ikibazo gikomeza kugaragara mu mibereho y\u2019abantu no mu muryango nyarwanda.\nKu ruhande rw\u2019ubukungu, Jenoside yasenye bikomeye ibikorwa by\u2019iterambere. Ubuhinzi, ubucuruzi n\u2019inganda byarahungabanye kubera kubura abakozi n\u2019abakiriya. Ibikorwaremezo byinshi nk\u2019amashuri, imihanda n\u2019ibitaro byarasenywe. Byongeye kandi, abakozi benshi b\u2019abahanga n\u2019abafite ubumenyi barishwe cyangwa bahunga igihugu, bituma habaho icyuho gikomeye mu bumenyi (brain drain). Ibi byose byatumye u Rwanda rusubira inyuma cyane mu iterambere, bisaba igihe kinini n\u2019imbaraga nyinshi kugira ngo rwongere kwiyubaka.\nJenoside yanagize ingaruka zikomeye ku mibanire y\u2019abantu. Icyizere hagati y\u2019Abanyarwanda cyarasenyutse, urwango n\u2019amacakubiri biriyongera. Kubana hagati y\u2019abacitse ku icumu n\u2019abakoze ibyaha cyangwa imiryango yabo byabaye ikibazo gikomeye. Gusa nyuma y\u2019igihe, igihugu cyashyizeho gahunda zitandukanye zigamije kugarura ubumwe n\u2019ubwiyunge, harimo n\u2019izashyigikiwe na National Unity and Reconciliation Commission, zafashije Abanyarwanda kongera kubana mu mahoro.\nNanone kandi, Jenoside yateje ikibazo gikomeye cy\u2019impunzi. Abantu benshi bahunze igihugu bajya mu bihugu bituranye nka Democratic Republic of the Congo, Tanzania na Uganda, mu gihe abandi babaye abimuwe mu byabo imbere mu gihugu. Ubuzima mu nkambi z\u2019impunzi bwari bugoye cyane, burimo ubukene, inzara n\u2019indwara, bikomeza kongera ubukana bw\u2019ingaruka za Jenoside.\nBy\u2019umwihariko, abagore n\u2019abana bahuye n\u2019ihohoterwa rikomeye. Abagore benshi bafashwe ku ngufu, bamwe banduzwa indwara nka VIH/SIDA. Abana benshi bahohotewe cyangwa bagizwe impfubyi, abandi bavukira muri ayo mahano, bakura bafite ibibazo by\u2019imibereho n\u2019irondabwoko. Ibi byasize ibikomere bikomeye ku buzima bw\u2019aba baturage.\nMu rwego rwo kugarura ubutabera, hashyizweho uburyo butandukanye bwo gukurikirana abakoze Jenoside. Inkiko gakondo za Gacaca zafashije kuburanisha ibihumbi by\u2019abakekwagaho ibyaha, mu gihe urwego mpuzamahanga nka International Criminal Tribunal for Rwanda rwakurikiranye abari abayobozi n\u2019abateguye Jenoside. Ibi byagize uruhare mu kugarura ubutabera no kongera icyizere mu baturage.\nNubwo Jenoside yasize ibikomere bikomeye, u Rwanda rwafashe inzira yo kwiyubaka bushya. Hashyizweho gahunda zo kwibuka Jenoside buri mwaka, hubakwa inzibutso, ndetse hashyirwa imbaraga mu kwigisha amateka kugira ngo Jenoside itazongera kubaho ukundi. Igihugu cyashyize imbere ubumwe, amahoro n\u2019iterambere, bituma kiba urugero rwiza ku bindi bihugu.\nMu gusoza, Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 yasize ingaruka zikomeye kandi z\u2019igihe kirekire ku Rwanda. Nubwo byari ibihe bikomeye cyane, u Rwanda rwerekanye ko bishoboka kongera kubaka igihugu no kugarura ubumwe bw\u2019abaturage. Iyi Jenoside itwigisha akamaro ko kurwanya ivangura, kubaha ubuzima bw\u2019umuntu, no kubaka amahoro arambye."}
{"id": "22526", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22526", "title": "Itegurwa rya jenocide yakorewe abatutsi", "text": "Itegurwa rya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi ryatangiye kera binyuze mu kubiba amacakubiri n\u2019ivangura rishingiye ku moko. Guhera mu gihe cy\u2019abakoroni no mu Repubulika ya mbere n'iya kabiri, Abatutsi batangiye kugaragazwa nk\u2019abanyamahanga n\u2019abanzi b\u2019igihugu. Hashyizweho indangamuntu zanditsemo amoko kugira ngo bitwaze uburyo bwo kubatoteza, kubambura uburenganzira bwabo, no kubameneshea mu nzego z\u2019uburezi n\u2019umurimo, ibyo byose bikaba byari urufatiro rwo kumvisha abaturage ko Umututsi atari umunyarwanda nk'abandi.\nMu ntangiriro z\u2019imyaka ya 1990, itegurwa ryahinduye isura rishyirwa mu bikorwa binyuze mu ikubitiro ry\u2019itangazamakuru ry\u2019urwango n\u2019icengezamatwara mubisha. Hashyizweho radio RTLM n\u2019ikinyamakuru Kangura byakwirakwizaga amagambo n\u2019inyandiko bisebya Abatutsi, babita \"Inyenzi\" n\u2019ibindi bikoresho by\u2019itoteza. Inyandiko nka \"Amategeko icumi y'Abahutu\" yagize uruhare rukomeye mu gushishikariza abaturage kwanga no guha akato Abatutsi, bituma igice kimwe cy'abaturage cyumva ko kwica undi ari inshingano yo kurinda igihugu.\nHagati aho, ubutegetsi bwariho bwatangiye gushinga no gutoza gisirikare imitwe y\u2019urubyiruko rw\u2019Inkeragutabara ruzwi nka Interahamwe n\u2019Impuzamugambi. Urwo rubyiruko rwahabwaga imyitozo yo kwica no gukoresha intwaro mu gihugu hose, ndetse runahabwa intwaro gakondo n\u2019imbunda. Muri icyo gihe, inzego z\u2019ubuyobozi bwite bwa Leta zakoze amalisiti y\u2019Abatutsi n\u2019abahutu batavugaga rumwe n\u2019ubutegetsi kugira ngo bazahite bicwa umunsi umushinga nyirizina watangiye.\nMbere y\u2019uko Jenoside nyirizina itangira muri Mata 1994, habayeho amagerageza y'ubwicanyi mu bice bitandukanye by\u2019igihugu nka Kibirira, Bugesera, na Mutara. Ibi bikorwa byari bigamije kureba uko abaturage bitwara mu bwicanyi no gusuzuma niba amahanga azagira icyo akora. Kubera ko amahanga yacecetse kuri ayo magerageza, abateguraga Jenoside bahawe intege zo gukomeza umushinga wabo, kugeza igihe ihanurwa ry'indege ya Habyarimana ryakoreshejwe nk'imbarutso yo gutangiza itsembatsembanyi ryari ryarateguwe mu buryo bwose: mu mitekerereze, mu nzego z\u2019ubuyobozi, no mu bikoresho."}
{"id": "22530", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22530", "title": "Umugenzo wo Gutsirika", "text": "Umugenzo wo Gutsirika.\nGutsirika ni umugenzo gakondo ukorwaga mu muco nyabanyarwanda hagamijwe gukumira, gukingira cyangwa kurinda abantu ndetse nibintu kugirango hatagira ikibi kigera kubantu cyangwa ibintu.\nUmugenzo wo gutsirika wakorwaga n'abakurambere gusa no mur'iyinsi hari abakibikora nkumuco. Dore uburyo butandukanye gutsirika byakorwagamo ni ubu:\nGukingira ikibi (Ubwirinzi):.\nNi umugenzo abakurambere bakoraga bafunze inzira z'ikibi(nk'uburozi, imbaraga mbi cyangwa umuvumo) kugirango zitagera kumuntu, kunyamanswa cyangwa se ku matungo.\nGukingira umuhoro/ubutaka:.\nNi ugufunga ikibanza cyangwa imyaka kugira ngo ntihagire inyamanswa cyangwa umuntu ubyangiza, binyuze mu mihango y'ubupfumu gakondo.\nGukumira ibyonnyi by'imyaka:.\nMu muco n'imigenzo gakondo yab'abanyarwanda hari ubwo gutsirika byakoreshwaga mubahinzi bakumira ibyonnyi bishobora kwangiza umusaruro wimyaka bahinze nk'amasaka, amashaza,ibitoki, ubunyobwa nibindi bitandukanye."}
{"id": "22531", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22531", "title": "Kugangahura", "text": "Kugangahura.\nNi umugenzo gakondo wakorwaga nabanyarwa bo hambere mbere yuko abakoroni baza, kuganagahura byabagaho igihe inkuba yabagakubise abantu cyangwa ahantu kugirango hakumirwe kuba yakongera gukubita aho hantu.\nbivugwako iyo inkuba yakubitaga ahantu habaga hari ubwandu ubwo bwandu bukavanwaho nuko bakoraga ikigikorwa cyo kugangahura kuko cyaraziraga kuba inkuba yakubita umuntu, itungo cyangwa igiti ngo babe harigikorwa kindi bakora kuri uwo muntu cyangwa icyo kintu batarakigangahura.\nkugangahura byakorwaga hifashishijwe urubingo,amazi y'ubuhoro, kamaramahano,umunyu n'ibindi bitandukanye.\nEse iyo inkuba yakubitaga ahantu cyangwa umuntu byagendaga gute?\nBafataga ayo mazi avanze n'imiti itandukanye bakayatera hahantu inkuba yakubise Noneho bijyanye n'indagu babaga bereje, bagahumanura aho hantu ibyo bigakorwa kugirango hatazagira uwo byongera kubaho aho hantu cyangwa se umuzimu w'abo bantu akaba yatera abasigaye.\nkandi ntibyari byemewe gukora kumuntu wakubiswe n'inkuba umugangahuzi atarahagera ngo bamugangahure"}
{"id": "22565", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22565", "title": "Urutonde rw'inzibutso za jenoside mu Rwanda", "text": "jenoside.\nNi ubwicanyi bwateguwe kandi bugakorwa bugamije kurimbura itsinda ry\u2019abantu binzirakarengane hashingiwe ku bwoko bwabo, akarere bakomokamo, ibara ryuruhu nibindi baba batarahisemo bo ubwabo.Urugero rukomeye ni Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, yabaye hagati ya Mata na Nyakanga 1994 ya tangiye ku wa 7 mata, aho Abatutsi barenga miliyoni bishwe bazira uko bavutse.\nMu rwego rwo gusigasira ayo mateka asharira igihugu cyanyuzemo hari zimwe mu nzibutso za jenocide yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda Zubatswe twavugamo:"}
{"id": "22567", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22567", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Mvuzo", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Mvuzo ruherereye mu Karere ka Rulindo mu Ntara y\u2019Amajyaruguru y\u2019u Rwanda. Rwibukirwaho Abatutsi bishwe muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, cyane cyane abiciwe ku misozi ya Mvuzo na Mugote. Muri uru rwibutso hashyinguwe imibiri isaga 6,700, rukaba ruri mu nzibutso z'ingenzi ho kwibukira amateka ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 muri ako gace.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Mvuzo ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAho ruherereye.\nUrwibutso rwa Mvuzo ruherereye mu Murenge wa Murambi, mu Karere ka Rulindo. Umusozi wa Mvuzo uteganye n\u2019uwa Mugote uherereye mu Murenge wa Ngoma, iyo misozi yombi igakikizwa n\u2019imirenge ya Cyinzuzi, Burega, Masoro na Ntarabana, ahahoze ari Komini Buriza. Aka gace kazwi kandi nka Remera y\u2019Abaforongo, gafite amateka y'u Rwanda ya kera ajyanye n\u2019Igikomangoma Mibambwe I Sekarongoro I Mutabazi uzwi nka Forongo.\nAmateka ya Jenoside.\nMbere ya Jenoside, Mvuzo na Mugote byari bituwe n\u2019Abatutsi benshi babanaga n\u2019abandi baturage mu mahoro. Icyakora, mu gihe cya Jenoside, ako gace kabaye hamwe mu habaye ubwicanyi bwakorewe Abatutsi mu buryo bukomeye bitewe n\u2019imiterere yaho igoye guhunga no kwihisha, ndetse no kuba hari ibirindiro bikomeye by\u2019ingabo za FAR zari zifite intwaro zikomeye. Jenoside yaho yahawe ingufu n\u2019abayobozi bakomeye b\u2019icyo gihe bakomokaga muri ako gace, barimo abanyapolitiki ba.\nInterahamwe zakoraga Jenoside zari zarahuguriwe i Gako, zikora ubwicanyi bukomeye zica Abatutsi ziyobowe n\u2019abari bazwi cyane muri ako gace. By\u2019umwihariko, ubukangurambaga bwakozwe n\u2019abayobozi nka Mathieu Ngirumpatse bwafashije gukwirakwiza ingengabitekerezo ya Jenoside, bufashwa n\u2019indirimbo z\u2019urwango zakwirakwizwaga muri icyo gihe.\nJenoside yabereye muri ako gace yatumye imiryango myinshi y\u2019Abatutsi izima burundu; bivugwa ko hafi kimwe cya kabiri cy\u2019imiryango yaho cyarimbuwe ku buryo nta warokotse wo gusigara atanga ubuhamya. Jenoside muri aka gace yarangiye itinze ugereranije n\u2019ahandi mu gihugu, kuko ingabo za FAR zari zigihanganye n\u2019Inkotanyi kugeza ku itariki ya 5 Nyakanga 1994.\nNyuma ya Jenoside, hubatswe urwibutso rwa Mvuzo rushyingurwamo imibiri y\u2019abazize Jenoside, nubwo kugeza n\u2019ubu hari imibiri igishakishwa kugira ngo ishyingurwe mu cyubahiro. Uru rwibutso rukoreshwa mu bikorwa byo kwibuka no kwigisha amateka ya Jenoside, ndetse rukaba ikimenyetso cy\u2019ingaruka Jenoside yasize muri aka gace."}
{"id": "22568", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22568", "title": "Umurenge wa Musange", "text": "Umurenge wa Musange ni umwe mu mirenge 17 igize Akarere ka Nyamagabe, mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Musange wari utuwe n'abaturage 20 345. Abaturage bose batuye mu cyaro. Umuryango GiveDirectly watangije umushinga wo guha amafaranga ingo zo muri uyu murenge.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAbaturage.\nUmurenge wa Musange ni umwe mu mirenge 17 y'Akarere ka Nyamagabe.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Musange wari utuwe n'abaturage 18 680. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 20 345. Abagabo bari 9 885. Abagore bari 10 460.\nAbaturage bose batuye mu cyaro.\nIbikorwa remezo.\nUmuhanda uhuza Umurenge wa Musange n'umujyi wa Nyamagabe ufite uburebure bwa kilometero 30. Mu Ukwakira 2012, Kigali Today yatangaje ko uwo muhanda ugiye gukorwa.\nImishinga y\u2019iterambere.\nUmuryango GiveDirectly watangije umushinga mu Murenge wa Musange. Uwo mushinga wari guha ingo zo muri uyu murenge amafaranga arenga 800 000. Ayo mafaranga yari gutangwa mu byiciro bibiri. Abakozi ba GiveDirectly ni bo bari gusura ingo. Abaturage basabwe kwirinda abantu babaka ruswa. Iyi nkunga ifasha imiryango kugura amatungo no kuvugurura amazu."}
{"id": "22570", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22570", "title": "IBYARANZE TALIKI YA 7 MATA 1994", "text": "Kuri iyo taliki nibwo Interahamwe n'umutwe w'abasirikare barindaga Perezida Habyarimana Juvenal batangiye gushyiraho amabariyeri mu duce twinshi tw'Umujyi wa Kigali no kwica Abatutsi.\nUwari Minisitiri w'intebe, Uwilingiyimana Agathe n'abasirikare icumi b'Ababiligi bo mu ngabo z'Umuryango w'Abibumbye bari bashinzwe umutekano we, bishwe babanje gukorerwa iycarubozo n'abasirikare ba Leta y'u Rwanda.\nMu mugambi wo kwica abanyepolitiki batavugaga rumwe na Leta ya Habyarimana ndetse batari bashyigikiye umugambi wa Jenoside, Perezida w'Urukiko rushinzwe kurinda Itegeko Nshinga, Kavamahanga Joseph,ba Minisitiri Frederick Nzamurambaho wari na Perezida wa PSD,Felicien Ngango, wari Visi Perezida wa PSD, Faustin Rucogoza na Landouald Ndasingwa bishwe ku ikubitiro n'Abasirikare barindaga Habyarimana.\nKuri uyu munsi kandi ni nabwo Major Ntabakuze Aloys, wayoboraga umutwe w'aba Para-commando yategetse abasirikare yayoboraga gutangira kwica abafite indangamuntu z'Aabatutsi n'abataravugaga rumwe n'ubutegetsi batuye hafi y'ikigo cya gisirikare, ahitwa mu kajagari i Kanombe.\nKuko uwo munsi taliki 7 Mata,abasirikare bafatanije n'interahamwe bishe Abatutsi basaga 500, kuri iyi taliki kandi Abatutsi bagera kuri 17 biganjemo abapadiri,abaseminari n'ababikira barishwe.\nMu bishwe harimo Padiri w'Umuyezuwiti Chrysologue Mahame wari ufite imyaka 67, wayoboraga Centre Christus i Remera akaba yari mu bashinze Umuryango uharanira Uburenganzira bwa Muntu no Kwimakaza Amahoro. Abo bosebishwe n'abasirikare barindaga Umukuru w'Igihugu bafatanije n'interahamwe.\nInterahamwe n'Abasirikare barindaga umukuru w'Igihugu bari bafite umugambi wo kujya kwica Abatutsi bari muri Sitade Amahoro hafatwaga nk'ahantu harinzwe kubera ko hari hakambitse Ingabo z'Umuryango w'Abibumbye MINUAR.\nUwo mugambi kuburizwamo n'imirwano hagati y'ingabo za FPR Inkotanyi n'abasirikare barindaga umukuru w'Igihugu bituma abenshi mu Batutsi bari muri Sitade Amahoro barokoka.\nKuri iyi taliki kandi Radiyo Muhabura ya FPR Inkotanyi ni yo yabaye iya mbere mu kwamagana iyicwa ry'Abatutsi n'Abanyapolitiki b'Abahutu batari bashyigikiye Jenoside.Umugaba Mukuru w'Ingabo za FPR Inkotanyi yatangaje ko bafite inshingano zikomeye zo kurinda abaturage b'inzirakarengane b'Abatutsi bicwaga.\nUbwo Radiyo Rwanda RTLM yacishagaho itangazo ryashizweho umukono na Col.Bagosora mu izina rya Minisitiri w'Ingabo ryemezaga urupfu rw'umukuru w'Igihugu Perezida Habyarimana Juvenal, muri ako kanya ku Kacyiru Interahamwe zahise zishinga za bariyeri zitangira kwica Abatutsi.Ubwicanyi bwakwiriye hirya no hino mu Rwanda, Aabatutsi babarirwa mu bihumbi baricwa.\nUbwicanyi bwabaga buyobowe na ba Burugumesitiri n'abandi bayobozi bo mu nzego z'ibanze.Kuri Komini Giciye, hiciwe Abatutsi benshi barimo n'umugore wa Bazivamo Christophe.Muyahoze ari komini Runda yegeranye na Kigali, ubu ni mu Karere ka Kamonyi, ubwicanyi bwatangiye ku italiki ya 7 Mata 1994.\nAbatutsi biciwe mu duce dutandukanye twa Komini Runda nka Biharabuge, kuri Nyabarongo ahitwa mu Rubamba, ku Isenga, kuri Ruliba, mu Gasharara, ku Idongo, kuri Sitasiyo i Runda, kuri bariyeri ya Bishenyi hari n'abajugunywe mu cyuzi cya Cyabariza.Abatutsi biciwe kuri Cocobeka n'ahitwa Intwari kuri Nyabarongo mu yahoze ari Komini Kayenzi.\nMuri Komini Gisuma, Perefegitura ya Cyangugu, abajandarume batangiye kwica Abatutsi. Abatutsi biciwe ahitwa Ruramba, ubu niho mu karere ka Nyaruguru.Muri Muko, Perefegitura ya Gikongoro, abicanyi bagera ku ijana, bayobowe n'umukuru wa Polisi ya komini afatanije na Burugumesitiri Kayihura, bishe Abatutsi bagera kuri 14 bari bahungiye kuri Paruwasi ya Mushubi.\nIntagondwa y'umu CDR akaba na Burugumesitiri wa Komini Bicumbi,Rugambarara Juvenal yateguye umugambi wo kwica Abatutsi muri Komini Bicumbi. Uyu Rugambarara yemereye urukiko mpuzamahanga mpanabyaha rwashyiriweho u Rwanda ko we ubwe yishe Abatutsi bagera ku 100. Kwica Abatutsi byakomereje i Nyamata muri Bugesera na Sake muri Perefegitura ya Kibungo.\nAbatutsi barenga 800 biganjemo abana n'abagore bari bahungiye kuri Paruwasi Gatolika ya Nyundo, muri Gisenyi, barishwe.Ubwicanyi mu yahoze ari Perefegitura ya Gisenyi bwateguwe kandi buyoborwa n'uwari umuyobozi w'Ingabo muri ako gace Col. Nsengiyumva Anatole.\nKu mugoroba wa taliki ya 7 Mata 1994, Abatutsi bagera kuri 50 biciwe mu iseminari Ntoya ya Nyundo, abageraku 150 bicirwa muri Paruwasi Gatolika ya Bisasamana.Ahitwa Kabasheja mu Murenge wa Rugerero, hiciwe Abatutsi bari bakuwe n'interahamwe kuri Komini Rubavu, ubu ni mu Karere ka Rubavu.\nAbatutsi biciwe muri Centre St Pierre, mu Nzu y'abakobwa ba Musenyeri, mu yahoze ari Rwandex ya Gisenyi,ku kiliziya Stella Maris no kuri Komini Rouge, ubu ni mu Karere ka Rubavu. Uwari Burugumesitiri wa Komine Mukingo, muri Perefegitura ya Ruhengeri, Kajerijeri Juvenal yatwaye abapolisi n'interahamwe bajya kwica Abatutsi bagera kuri 43 bari bahungiye kuri Paruwasi ya Busogo.\nHabaye inama yo gutangiza Jenoside, ibera kwa Nzirorera Joseph, wari Umunyamabanga Mukuru wa MRND, yitabirwa na Col.Ephrem Setako, Harerimana (wari Burugumesitiri wa Komini Nkuli muri icyo gihe, Col Augustin Bizimungu, Casimir Bizimungu, Jean Baptiste Nyabusore, Esdras Baheza, Jonathan Bambonye, Jean Damascene Niyoyita, Dominique Gatsimbanyi, Assiel Ndisetse na Lazare Ndangiza.\nInterahamwe zagumye hanze zitegereje ikiva mu nama, iyo nama yafashe icyemezo ko Abatutsi bicwa bitarenze mu gitondo.Hemejwe kandi ko hatangwa imbunda no gushyiraho bariyeri; Coloneli Bizimungu ashingwa gushyira mu bikorwa icyo cyemezo; atanga imbunda aziha abari ba konseye na bo baziha abaturage n'abakuru b'interahamwe barimo Burugumesitiri Kajerijeri na Baheza Esdras.\nKuri iyo taliki 7 Mata, mu masaha y'isacyenda Abatutsi bose bari bamaze kwicwa, imitungo yabo yasahuwe n'inzu zatwitswe ku buryo iminsi yakurikiyeho interahamwe n'amahindure(laves) bajyaga gutanga umusada ahandi; ni muri urwo rwego zagiye kwica Abatutsi bari bahungiye ku Rukiko rw'Ubujurire mu Mmujyi wa Ruhengeri, Nyabihu, Musumba(Nkuri) na Nyakinama.\nIcyo gihe urugamba rw'Ingabo zaRPF Inkotanyi rwararakomeje bafata uduce tw'u Mutara, utwa Ruhengeri na Byumba ari nako barokora Abatutsi bicwaga n'interahamwe n'abasirikare ba Leta ya Habyarimana. Icyo gihe Ingabo za FPR Inkotanyi zarokoye Abatutsi muri za Komini nka Buyoga, Mugambazi,Rutongo, Giti, Bwisige na Rutare.\nKu mugoroba wo ku italiki ya 7 Mata 1994,ni bwo abasirikare 200 b'Ingabo za FPR Inkotanyi basohotse muri CND, bagerageza kurokora Abatutsi bari batuye mu duce dukikije CND(ubu ni inyubako ikoreramo Inteko Ishinga Amategeko).Muri Perefegitura ya Gikongoro, kuri iyi taliki, Abatutsi bari bahungiye kuri Paruwasi Mushubi ubu habarizwa mu Karere ka Nyamagabe, barishwe bose.\nKuva ku italiki 7 kugeza ku ya 12 Mata 1994, Abatutsi biciwe mu Murenge wa Muko, muri Centre ya Kigoma ahitwa Ngangi n'ahitwa Mayora, mu Karere ka Gicumbi. Hishwe Abatutsi mu Bugarama muri Perefegitura ya Cyangungu, ubu ni mu Karere Rusizi, babakuraga mu ngo zabo bagahita babica bakabaroha mu Migezi ya Rusizi, Ruhwa na Rubyiro. Hishwe kandi Abatutsi i Gikundamvura(Hinduka)muri Rusizi.\nHishwe Abatutsi muri Centre ya Kivuruga,hishwe Abatutsi ku biro bya Komine Musasa no mu nkengero zayo, hishwe abatutsi i Muhondo(Gakenke), Hishwe Abatutsi ku yahoze ari komini Tare, hishwe Abatutsi ku bitaro bya Nemba no muri Centre ya Gakenke, hishwe Abatutsi b'i Kananira muri Nkungu (Cyangugu), Abatutsi bari bahungiye mu Rusengero rw'Abadive rwa Hesha mu Murenge wa Mukamira bari bavanwe muri Segiteri Nanga muri Perefegitura ya Ruhengeri, barishwe ubu ni mu Karere ka Nyabihu, Abatutsi bari bahungiye mu Rusengero rw'Abadive rwa Gisizi mu Murenge wa Muringa, ubu ni mu Karere ka Nyabihu, barishwe.\nHishwe Abatutsi Abatutsi bari bahungiye mu kigo cya Gisirikare cya Mukamira muri Perefegitura ya Ruhengeri, ubu ni mu Karere ka Nyabihu, hishwe kandi Abatutsi bari bahungiye mu Kiliziya ya Rambura mu Murenge wa Rambura, ubu ni mu Karere ka Nyabihu, hishwe Abatutsi bari bahungiye mu kigo cya Gisirikare cya Bigogwe muri Perefegitura ya Gisenyi, ubu ni mu Karere ka Nyabihu, hishwe Abatutsi bari bahungiye kuri Segiteri Byahi muri Perefegitura ya Gisenyi, ubu ni mu Karere ka Rubavu."}
{"id": "22603", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22603", "title": "Ubuhinzi bw\u2019umuceri mu karere ka nyagatare", "text": "Bamwe mu bahinzi bo mu Karere ka Nyagatare bafite impungenge z'umusaruro bazabona mu gihembwe cy'ihingacya 2025 B,nyuma y'aho imvura itinze kugwa.\nIbi babigarutseho ku wa 20 werurwe 2025 ubwo hatangizwaga igihembwe cy'ihinga cya 2025 B e mu Murenge wa Rukoimo ahatewe imbuto y'ibishyimbo yitwa RWR3194.\nSHYAKA Laurent ati \"igihembwe gisa n'aho kiri gutinda kubera ikirere kidasanzwe cyagaragayemo izuba ryinshi."}
{"id": "22604", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22604", "title": "IBINTU UDAKWIYE KUBWIRA UMUKUNZI WAWE", "text": "Bamwe mubantu bazi ibijyanye ni byurukundo bakangurira abakunda ko batagomba kubeshyanya cyangwa kugira nakimwe bakingana.gusa ariko nanone haribimwe bigararagako dukwiye kubahisha. harimo:\nUmubare w'abo mwakoranye iminonano mpuzabitsina\nharimo bamwe babibwira abakunzi babo kugirango bizerane maze bakababwira imibare yabo babikoranye gusa kubushakashatsi bwakozwe bwagaragajeko atari byiza kuko harigihe wamukomeretsa muburyo utazi.\nAbantu uba wumva ufitiye urukundo\nImpamvu nuko umuntu mukundana urukundo rwanyu rufite intego biba bivuzeko ntawundi muntu wemerewe kujya murukundo nawe.\nKumubwira aabandi banu bakubwirako bagukunda\nbamwe muba mumva mwabivuga kandi nanikibi mugamije gusa iyo ubwiye umukunzi wawe umukobwa cyangwa umuhungu urikukubwirako arikugukunda sibyiza pe kuko uwo mukundana asobora kubyakira uko utabimubwiye akumvako ushaka kumuca inyuma cyangwase kumwanga."}
{"id": "22605", "revid": "18097", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22605", "title": "MV Hondius icyorezo cya hantavirusi", "text": "Muri Mata 2026, hagaragaye icyorezo cya hantavirusi cyatewe na virusi ya Andes mu bwato bw\u2019Abaholandi bwa MV \"Hondius\". Ku ya 1 Mata 2026, ubwato bwavuye muri Ushuaia, muri Arijantine. Umugenzi wari muri ubwo bwato yapfuye azize iyo virusi ku ya 11 Mata. Umurambo we wakuwe mu bwato i Saint Helena ku ya 24 Mata, aho umugore we yavuye mbere y\u2019uko apfira mu bitaro i Johannesburg nyuma y\u2019iminsi ibiri. Umugenzi wa gatatu yapfiriye muri ubwo bwato.\nUmugenzi w\u2019Umwongereza yoherejwe kuvurirwa i Johannesburg, mu buzima bugoye ariko buhamye. Nubwo ubwato bwamaze iminsi itatu buhagaze i Praia, muri Kapu Veri, nta muntu wabuvuyemo kuko ibigo byo muri ako gace bitashoboye kwimurwa mu buryo bwizewe. Nyuma y\u2019uko Minisiteri y\u2019Ubuzima ya Esipanye yemeje ko ubwato bugera mu birwa bya Canary, bwahagurutse yerekeza i Tenerife ku ya 6 Gicurasi, aho abagenzi bagomba kwimurwa mu bihugu byabo."}
{"id": "22606", "revid": "18677", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22606", "title": "Ubwandu bwa Hantavirus", "text": "Ubwandu bwa hantavirus cyangwa indwara ya hantavirus ni indwara yandura.\nIterwa na virusi zo mu bwoko bwa virusi za \"Orthohantavirus\"."}
{"id": "22608", "revid": "18097", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22608", "title": "MV Hondius", "text": "MV \"Hondius\" ni ubwato bw\u2019Abaholandi butwara abantu mu ngendo bufitwe na Oceanwide Expeditions. Bwakozwe na Brodosplit i Split, muri Korowatiya, bwatangiye gukoreshwa mu 2019 kandi bukorera cyane cyane mu turere twa Antarigitika."}
{"id": "22609", "revid": "18097", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22609", "title": "Hantavirusi", "text": "Orthohantavirus ni ubwoko bwa virusi zirimo hantavirusi zose (umuryango wa \"Hantaviridae\") zitera indwara mu bantu. Hantavirusi zisanzwe ziboneka cyane cyane mu mbeba. Ubwandu bwitwa ubwandu bwa hantavirusi."}
{"id": "22612", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22612", "title": "Education Perfect", "text": "Education Perfect (EP; Ikinyarwanda: \"Uburezi Butunganye\") ni ikigo cy\u2019ikoranabuhanga mu burezi gikorera muri Nuveli Zelande gitanga urubuga rwo kwigira kuri interineti rugenewe gufasha abanyeshuri n\u2019abarimu mu masomo atandukanye. Uru rubuga rutanga amasomo ahuza, isuzumabumenyi, n\u2019ibikoresho byo gusesengura kugira ngo byorohereze imyigire yihariye no gukurikirana iterambere ry\u2019abanyeshuri."}
{"id": "22613", "revid": "18411", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22613", "title": "Ikibazo cy'umutekano wa Canvas", "text": "Ikibazo cy\u2019umutekano wa Canvas ni ikibazo gikomeje kugaragara ku mutekano w\u2019ikoranabuhanga, guhagarara no kwangiza amakuru ku birebana na Canvas LMS, sisitemu yo gucunga imyigire ikorwa n\u2019ikigo cyigenga Instructure. Mu ntangiriro za Gicurasi 2026, Instructure yatangaje ko irimo gukora iperereza ku kibazo cy\u2019umutekano w\u2019ikoranabuhanga kijyanye n\u2019amakuru amwe n\u2019amwe y\u2019abakoresha, harimo amazina, aderesi za imeri, nimero z\u2019indangamuntu z\u2019abanyeshuri, n\u2019ubutumwa mu bakoresha. Isosiyete yavuze ko nta bimenyetso yabonye bigaragaza ko ijambo ry\u2019ibanga, amatariki y\u2019amavuko, indangamuntu za leta, cyangwa amakuru y\u2019imari byagize uruhare muri ubu bujura.\nNubwo Instructure yavugaga ko ikibazo cyakemutse, ku ya 7 Gicurasi, Canvas yongeye kwibasirwa; urupapuro rwayo rwo kwinjira rwasimbuwe n'ubutumwa bwa ransomware bwa ShinyHunters, itsinda ry'abagizi ba nabi ryatangaje ko ariryo ryabigizemo uruhare. ShinyHunters yateye ubwoba ko izasohora amakuru y'ibanga ya Canvas keretse iyo incungu yayo yishyuwe bitarenze impera z'itariki ya 12 Gicurasi. Ariko, kugeza ku itariki ya 8 Gicurasi, Instructure yatangaje ku rubuga rwabo nta kibazo na kimwe cyabayeho gifitanye isano n'urukozasoni rwo ku ya 7-8 Gicurasi, kandi ivuga ko abakoresha benshi bongeye kubona urubuga rwabo."}
{"id": "22614", "revid": "18097", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22614", "title": "ShinyHunters", "text": "ShinyHunters ni itsinda ry\u2019abagizi ba nabi bo kuri interineti, ryatangiye gukora kuva mu 2020 cyangwa mbere yaho."}
{"id": "22617", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22617", "title": "Ngayaboshya samuel", "text": "Ngayaboshya samuel ni umunyarwanda, wavukiye mu karere ka nyamagabe umurenge wa gatare\nakaba afite impamyabumenyi y'ikiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza yakuye muri unuversity of Rwanda ishami rya huye mubirebana n'ubukungu(international economics)\nakaba yaravutse kuwa 28 werurwe 1996, arubatse afite umugore umwe."}
{"id": "22618", "revid": "8075", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22618", "title": "BTN Rwanda", "text": "BTN TV Rwanda ni imwe muri televiziyo yigenga ikorera mu Rwanda, ifite icyicaro gikuru i Kigali mu Karere ka Nyarugenge. Yashinzwe mu mwaka wa 2012, yandikwa mu buryo bwemewe n\u2019amategeko mu 2013, BTN TV Rwanda igamije guteza imbere itangazamakuru rigezweho, imyidagaduro n\u2019ikoranabuhanga mu Rwanda.\nBTN TV izwi kandi nka \u201cBig Television Network\u201d, ikaba ifite imiyoboro irimo BTN TV na B+ TV. Iyi televiziyo itangaza ibiganiro byinshi mu rurimi rw\u2019Ikinyarwanda birimo amakuru, siporo, ikoranabuhanga, umuco, ubuzima ndetse n\u2019imyidagaduro.\nBTN TV yagiye ikora ibikorwa byinshi bifasha urubyiruko n\u2019abahanzi nyarwanda, harimo amarushanwa y\u2019imbyino, ibiganiro by\u2019imyidagaduro ndetse no guha umwanya impano nshya. Yanabaye imwe muri televiziyo zikoresha cyane uburyo bwa Live Streaming mu gutambutsa amakuru n\u2019ibiganiro mu Rwanda.\nIyi televiziyo iboneka kuri StarTimes, Canal+ ndetse no kuri internet binyuze ku rubuga rwayo rwa official. BTN TV ikomeje kuba umwe mu miyoboro ikurikirwa cyane mu Rwanda mu bijyanye n\u2019amakuru, siporo n\u2019imyidagaduro.\n= Inkomoko ="}
{"id": "22619", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22619", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Gashora", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Gashora, ni urwibutso rushyinguyemo imibiri isaga 5,200 y'Abatutsi bishwe muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Gashora ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAho ruherereye.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Gashora,ruherereye mu Karere ka Bugesera, Intara y'Iburasirazuba, rushyinguyemo imibiri isaga 5,200 y'Abatutsi bazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Uru rwibutso rwibukiramo cyane cyane abiciwe mu cyahoze ari Komini Gashora, harimo n'abishwe nyuma yo guhungira kuri ISAR Karama na Kiliziya.\nAmateka.\nMu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, agace ka Gashora kari mu hiciwe Abatutsi benshi cyane. Abatutsi benshi bahungiye mu nsengero, ku bigo by\u2019amashuri no mu bice batekerezaga ko byari kubarinda, ariko bicirwayo n\u2019Interahamwe hamwe n\u2019abasirikare bari bafatanyije na Leta yariho icyo gihe.\nAbenshi biciwe:\nHari n\u2019abajugunywe mu byobo cyangwa mu bishanga, bituma hari imibiri yakomeje kuboneka nyuma y\u2019imyaka myinshi Jenoside ihagaritswe."}
{"id": "22620", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22620", "title": "Umurenge wa Nyankenke", "text": "Umurenge wa Nyankenke ni umwe mu mirenge 21 igize Akarere ka Gicumbi, mu Ntara y'Amajyaruguru y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Nyankenke wari utuwe n'abaturage 27 183. Abaturage bose batuye mu cyaro.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAbaturage.\nAkarere ka Gicumbi kagizwe n'imirenge 21. Umurenge wa Nyankenke ni umwe muri yo.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Nyankenke wari utuwe n'abaturage 21 560. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 27 183. Abagabo bari 14 830. Abagore bari 12 353.\nAbaturage bose batuye mu cyaro."}
{"id": "22621", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22621", "title": "IBYARANZE TALIKI YA 8 MATA 1994", "text": "Nyuma y'umunsi umwe Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi itangiye mu Rwanda, taliki ya 8 Mata 1994 ubwicanyi bwarakomeje mu bice bitandukanye by'igihugu, ku rundi ruhande ingabo za FPR Inkotanyi nazo zakomeje urugamba zigamije guhagarika Jenoside.\nKuri iyi taliki, Maj. Gen. Paul Kagame wari Umugaba Mukuru w'Ingabo za FPR Inkotanyi, yatangaje ko atangiye intambara kuri Leta yakoraga Jenoside kuko bitari bigishoboka kubahiriza amasezerano y'amahoro ya Arusha. Ingabo za FPR Inkotanyi zatangije urugamba mu Mujyi wa Kigali, ziyemeza guhagarika Jenoside mu maguru mashya. Nkuko tubikesha CNLG, izi ngabo zubuye imirwano mu duce twa Byumba na Ruhengeri kugira ngo zihagarike Jenoside yakorerwaga Abatutsi.\nMu Karere ka Nyaruguru Abatutsi bari bahungiye mu ruganda rw'icyayi rwa Mata barishwe bose. Uwo munsi Abatutsi bageragezaga guhungira mu cyahoze ari Zaire, interahamwe zarabatangiraga, zikabakusanyiriza ahitwa Rusura, mu Murenge wa Bugeshi muri Gisenyi, zikabica. Abasirikare b'Abafaransa n'Ababiligi, batangiye igikorwa cyo gucyura abanyaburayi babaga mu Rwanda. Abafaransa bacyita Operation Amarylis naho Ababiligi bacyita Silver Back.\nAbatutsi bari bahungiye Mwiri ku musozi wa Nyawera (muri Kayonza)barishwe. Interahamwe n'abasirikare barindaga Perezida Habyarimana Juvenal bishe Abatutsi bari bahungiye kuri Paruwasi Gatolika yitiriwe Mutagatifu Karoli Lwanga no mu kigo cy'Abafureri b'Abayozefiti i Nyamirambo.\n-Abatutsi bari bahungiye mu Ishuri rya St Andre i Nyamirambo barishwe. Kuva ku italiki ya 8, 14, 25 Mata 1994, Abatutsi bari bahungiye kuri Paruwasi Gatolika ya Ruhuha, barishwe. Ubwicanyi bwibasiye Abatutsi bwatangiye muri Komini Rutsiro muri Perefegitura ya Kibuye.\nIngabo za FPR Inkotanyi zageze i Kigali, Kagame Paul amenyesha MINUAR ko agiye kohereza umutwe w'Ingabo gufatanya n'Ingabo za Leta mu guhagarika ubwicanyi bwakorwaga n'Abasirikare barindaga Perezida Habyarimana. Mu Kinigi, Koloneli Setako Ephrem yategetse Interahamwe kwica Abatutsi baho. Uwo munsi Ingabo za FPR Inkotanyi zahageze zibasha kurokora bake bari basigaye bataricwa.\nAbatutsi bagera ku 5000 bari bahungiye ku rusengero rw'Abadiventisite rwa Cyambara mu Murenge wa Bigogwe muri Perefegitura ya Gisenyi, ubu ni mu Karere ka Rubavu. Hishwe Abatutsi bari bahungiye mu Bitaro bya Shyira muri Perefegitura ya Ruhengeri, ubu ni mu Karere ka Nyabihu.\nHishwe Abatutsi bari bahungiye ku rusengero rw'Adiventisiti rwa Mudende muri Perefegitura ya Gisenyi, ubu ni mu Karere ka Rubavu. Hishwe Abatutsi bari bahungiye ku rusengero rw'Adiventisiti rwa Bweramana muri Perefegitura ya Gisenyi, ubu ni mu Karere ka Rubavu. Abatutsi bari bahungiye ku rusengero rwa ADEPR Kabumba, Perefegitura ya Gisenyi barishwe. Abatutsi bari bahungiye muri Kaminuza y'Adiventisiti ya Mudende muri Perefegitura ya Gisenyi barishwe, ubu ni mu Karere ka Rubavu. Hishwe Abatutsi ku musozi wa Kesho muri Rubaya(Ngororero).\nHishwe Abatutsi i Kavumu no mu nkengero zaho(mu yari Komini Ramba). Hishwe Abatutsi benshi muri Centre ya Gakenke. Hishwe Abatutsi i Bukeri(muri Komini Ndusu) ku mugezi wa Mukungwa ku gice kigana muri Vunga. Hishwe Abatutsi kuri Superefegitura ya Busengo.\nAMASHAKIRO;"}
{"id": "22622", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22622", "title": "IBYARANZE TALIKI YA 9 MATA 1994", "text": "Taliki ya 9 Mata 1994, Ingabo z'Abafaransa zatereranye Abatutsi. Leta y'abicanyi yakomeje umugambi wayo mubisha wo gutsemba Abatutsi hirya no hino mu gihugu. Iyi nyandiko igaragaza hamwe mu hantu hashoboye kumenyekana hiciwe Abatutsi taliki ya 9 Mata 1994, Ingabo z'Abafaransa baje mu cyo bise Operation Amaryllis zatereranye Abatutsi mu maboko y'abicanyi.\nTaliki ya 9 Mata 1994, ni bwo icyo bise Operation Amaryllis yatangiye mu Rwanda kugera taliki 12 Mata. Igisobanuro cy'iyo operasiyo kwari ugucyura Abafaransa n'abanyamahanga bari mu Rwanda. Iyo Operasiyo yabaye igihe Abatutsi bicwaga cyane muri Kigali n'ahandi henshi mu gihugu, bicwa n'abasirikare n'interahamwe. Izo ngabo z'abafaransa zarebaga Abatutsi bicwaga nyamara ntibigeze babatabara, barabaretse baricwa bikomereza gucyura bene wabo.\nAbafaransa ntibashatse gutabara kugira ngo bahagarike ubwicanyi bwakorerwaga mu maso yabo, cyane cyane ku kibuga cy'indege cya Kanombe bahasize benshi babasigira interahamwe. Hari Abatutsi bari bashoboye kurira mu modoka z'Abasirikare b'Abafaransa zacyuraga abanyamahanga, ariko bagera kuri bariyeri bakabakuramo bakabicira imbere y'Ingabo z'Abafaransa. Imiryango yarimo abashakanye hagati y'Umufaransa n'Umunyarwanda barabatandukanije, abanza gutandukana barabasiga. Mu marira menshi abagore bashakanye n'Abanyarwanda basabye ko abo bashakanye n'abana babo, babatwara baranga. Abakozi ba ambasade y'u Bufaransa cyane cyane Abatutsi barasigaye, abenshi baricwa. Nyamara ambasade y'u Bufaransa yafunguriye imiryango yayo umuryango w'uwahoze ari perezida, abari mu mutwe w'abicanyi bashyizweho na Leta yariho, n'ibyegera bya Habyarimana Juvenal byari ku isonga ry'Akazu. Abatutsi bageragezaga kurira urukuta rwa ambasade y'u Bufaransa barakubitwaga bakabasubiza inyuma, interahamwe zirabica. Abakozi bo mu nzu yareraga imfubyi(Orphelinat Ste Agatha) yari iya Agathe Kanziga umugore wa Habyarimana Juvenal, barabatwaye, ariko u Bufaransa bwima ubuhungiro abana ba nyakwigendera Minisitiri w'Intebe Agathe Uwiringiyimana, wari umaze iminsi 2 yishwe n'abasirikare b'u Rwanda bayobowe na Majoro Bernard Ntuyahaga. Icyemezo cyo gucyura Abafaransa nticyafashwe indege ya Habyarimana ikimara guhanurwa cyangwa se iminsi 2 yakurikiyeho, icyo cyemezo cyafashwe n'Abanyepolitiki bashakaga guha ingufu ingabo z'u Rwanda zari ku rugamba. \nUwo munsi, umuryango wa Hbyarimana n'abandi bahezanguni buriye indege z'Abafaransa bajyanwa i Bangui, bakomereza i Paris. Mu ntagondwa z'abajenosideri batwawe n'Ingabo z'Abafaransa harimo Felisiyani Kabuga wabaye umushoramari wa Jenoside na Ferdinard Nahimana wabaye umukangurambaga wa Jenoside. Bombi bari mu bashinze RTLM yakoreshejwe mu kwamamaza ikorwa rya Jenoside, ishyirwaho rya guverinoma y'abicanyi yari iyobowe na Kambanda. Mu gitondo cy'italiki ya 8 Mata, Bagosora yakoranyije abayobozi bagize Hutu-Power, kugira ngo bashyireho guverinoma, bose bavaga mu mashyaka y'abahezanguni. Ishyirwaho ry'iyo guverinoma ryabereye muri Ambasade y'Abafaransa. MRND yari ihagarariwe na Matayo Ngirumpatse,Edouard Karemera, visi perezida we na Joseph Nzirorera, umunyamabanga Mukuru, MDR ihagarariwe na Froduald Karamira, Donat Murego, PL ihagarariwe na Justin Mugenzi na Agnes Ntamabyariro, PSD yari ihagarariwe na Francois Ndungutse na Hyacinthe Nsengiyumva Rafiki, PDC ihagarariwe na Jean- Marie Vianney Sibomana, Celestin Kabanda na Gaspard Ruhumuriza. MRND yashyizweho na Dr Theodore Sindikubwabo nka Perezida wa Repubulika, Bagosora nawe ashyiraho Jean Kambanda ku mwanya wa Minisitiri w'intebe.\nIyo guverinoma yari ifite gahunda imwe gusa; gutanga umurongo w'uko Jenoside igomba gukorwa mu gihugu cyose, gutanga intwaro, gukangurira abaturage gukora Jenoside no kuyisobanurira mu mahanga. Abatutsi biciwe kuri Paruwasi gatolika yitiriwe Mutagatifu Visenti wa Pallotti i Gikondo muri Kigali. Taliki ya 09 Mata 1994, interahamwe n'abasirikare barindaga Habyarimana, bishe Abatutsi bari bahungiye kuri paruwasi gatulika yitiriwe Mutagatifu Visenti wa Pallotti i Gikondo bagera kuri 500. Kuri uwo munsi, Ingabo za Loni zaboneye ubwicanyi bwakorewe Abatutsi biganjemo abana muri Kiliziya i Gikondo. Uwo munsi kandi ni nabwo abasirikare ba Leta batwitse Abatutsi bari bahungiye mu Mudugudu wa Nyakabanda II munsi ya Hoteli BAOBAB. Ikinyamakuru cy'Abafaransa Liberation ni cyo cya mbere cyise ubwo bwicanyi Jenoside, mu nyandiko yanditswe n'umunyamakuru Philippe Ceppi wari mu Rwanda mu gihe cya Jenoside. Abatutsi bakomeje kwicwa ahantu hanyuranye mu gihugu; muri Kibungo, Kigali, Ruhengeri, na Kibuye. Kuri uwo munsi kandi Abatutsi bari bahungiye ku misozi ya Murama, Murundi, Mwiri, Nyamirama, na Kabare mu Karere ka Kayonza, kimwe n'abari bahungiye kuri paruwasi gatolika ya Kabuye mu Murenge wa Jabana mu Karere ka Gasabo barishwe.\nInterahamwe zishe Abatutsi bari bahungiye muri Segiteri Nyagatare I mu Karere ka Nyagatare ndetse n'abari bahungiye kuri paruwasi ya Zaza muri Kibungo aho guhera taliki 09 Mata ubwo bwicanyi bwarakomeje, ababarirwa hagati ya 500 na 800 bishwe. Guhera taliki ya 09 Mata, Interahamwe zatangiye kwica Abatutsi bari bahungiye i Kiramuruzi mu Karere ka Gatsibo, hamwe n'abari bahungiye ku musozi wa Nyamagumba muri Komine Mabanza muri Perefegitura ya Kibuye. Mu minsi yakurikiyeho hishwe Abatutsi barenga 12000. Kuri uwo munsi na none, hishwe Abatutsi bari bahungiye i Nybikenke, ku biro byahoze ari iby'Umurenge wa Karama muri Bumbogo ndetse n'ahandi hantu hatandukanye harimo i Cyabingo muri Perefegitura ya Ruhengeri, muri centre y'ubucuruzi ya Karama no mu Mataba mu Karere ka Gakenke, ku rusengero rw'Ababatisita rwa Rusiza muri Kabumba, Perefegitura ya Gisenyi, muri Kiliziya ya Nyundo no mu nkengero zayo, ndetse no muri Maternite ya Nyundo muri Perefegitura ya Gisenyi, ubu ni mu Karere ka Rubavu. Ahitwa mu Kivuruga muri Komini Cyabingo hari huzuye abasirikare batangiraga Abatutsi bageragezaga guhunga. Uretse aho kuri bariyeri, Abatutsi biciwe i Cyabingo na Busengo. Interahamwe zabishe zazaga kuri kaburimbo ahitwa kuri Mukinga zifite ibiganza by'abo zamaze kwica; zigakomereza i Rwaza mu yari Komini Ruhondo kwica abandi Batutsi.\nUmusozo; Ubwicanyi bwibasiye Abatutsi bwarakomeje hirya no hino mu gihugu, bukorwa kimwe, ni ukuvuga ko uwitwa Umututsi wese yishwe, abenshi bishwe bahunga. Kuri iyi taliki abenshi biciwe mu nsengero na za kiliziya, kuko abantu bibeshyaga ko bashobora kuharokokera."}
{"id": "22623", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22623", "title": "IBYARANZE TALIKI YA 10 MATA 1994", "text": "Taliki ya 10 Mata 1994, umunsi abasirikare ba Habyarimana Juvenal bishe abarwayi kuri Faisal, kuri iyi taliki ubwicanyi bwarakomeje mu buryo bukomeye aho mu bice byinshi abatutsi bishwe mu buryo butagira ingano. Icyo gihe abasirikare barindaga Perezida Habyarimana Juvenal barashe amasasu bikomeye ku Bitaro byitiriwe Umwami Faisal, bica abarwayi 29, abandi bagera kuri 70 barakomereka.\nNi wo munsi Abatutsi barenga 7564 biciwe kuri Kiliziya Gatolika i Gahanga muri Komini Kanombe, abarenga 2522 bicirwa i Karembure, muri Gahanga. Ibitero byabishe biyobowe n'uwari wungirije Burugumesitiri muri Komini Kanombe n'abapolisi ba Komini, hiyongereyeho uwari konseye wa Gahanga akaba yarahoze mu gisirikare ndetse n'abandi bantu bavuye mu gisirikare aribo Zirarushya, Kimonyo,Francais, hiyongeraho abasirikare bari barinze ikiraro cya Kanzenze n'abari ku musozi wa Rebero barindaga RADAR bose bahuriye i Gahanga. Icyo gihe kandi abatutsi bari bahungiye ku biro bya Komini Gashora no mu kigo cya ISAR Karama (ubu ni mu Murenge wa Ririma), barishwe bose.\nKuva taliki 10 kugeza 15 Mata 1994, Abatutsi bajyanwaga kwicwa n'abasirikare muri Camp GP ku Kimihurira. Abari bahungiye ku Bitaro bya Kiziguro (ubu ni mu Karere ka Gatsibo), nabo nibwo bishwe. Ikindi kandi Abatutsi bari bahungiye ku ishuri ribanza rya Gikumba muri Bumbogo, barishwe. Interahamwe zo muri Komini Ngororero na Giciye ku Gisenyi, zishe Abatutsi barenga 14500 bari bahungiye ku Ngoro ya Muvoma. Harokotse abantu babiri gusa. Ni cyo gihe Ambasade ya Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika mu Rwanda, yafunze imiryango yayo maze Ambasaderi Rawson hamwe n'abandi banyamerika 250 barahungishwa. Mu mujyi wa Kigali kandi Abatutsi bari bahungiye ku Bigega bya Gatsata, barishwe.\nImibiri ivangavanze n'inkomere igera ku 10,000 y'Abatutsi yaratoraguwe mu mihanda ya Kigali maze ijyanwa mu Bitaro binyuranye. Kuri Kiliziya Gatolika ya Ruhuha no mu nkengero zayo muri Komini Ngenda, muri Bugesera; kuri iyi taliki hiciwe Abatutsi bagera 10,000. Impuzamugambi zifatanije n'interahamwe zishe Abatutsi bagera 10,000 bari bahungiye kuri Komini Gashora no ku kiyaga cya Rumira na Kidogo muri Bugesera. Ni nawo munsi Umutwe w'ingabo za FPR Inkotanyi wari uturutse Byumba wageze muri CND uje gufasha Ingabo zari zihari gukomeza kurokora Abatutsi bicwaga.\nAbarwayi bagera ku 100 biciwe mu Bitaro bya Kigali (CHUK) bishwe n'abasirikare ba Leta. Ni nako kandi Abatutsi benshi b'i Kangazi muri Nkanka (Cyangungu) baroshywe mu Kiyaga cya Kivu. Ahandi habereye ubwicanyi bukomeye; hishwe Abatutsi b'i Ntura muri Giheke(Cyangugu), hishwe Abatutsi b'i Ntendezi, Hishwe Abatutsi benshi i Musasa muri Centre ya Ruli, hishwe Abatutsi i Rwankuba."}
{"id": "22645", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22645", "title": "MINEDIC yashyizeho inkunga kubanyeshuri barira ku mashuri", "text": "Ni uburyo MINEDIC yatangije kuwa 12 mata 2024 binyuze mubukangurambaga yise 'nditeguye'cyangwa' Ndi Ready'.\nUbu buryo byatangiriye muri GS Kacyiru 2 mujyi wa Kigali\nBizashyirwa mubikorwa kubufatanye ni shyirahamwe Umwalimu SACCO ndetse izaba irimo na konti yokuzajya ijyaho iyo nkunga."}
