{"id": "22652", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22652", "title": "Inyinya", "text": "Mu muco wurwanda inyinya ni umwanya cyangwa icyuho cyiba hagati yamenyo abiri yimbere. murwego rwamuganga cyangwa science icyi cyuho cyitwa diastema\nIbyo wamenya kunyinya\nIkirango cyubwiza:mumuryango nyarwanda ndetse nahandi muri africa inyinya ifatwa nkikimenyetso gikomeye cyubwiza no gukurura abandi cyane cyane kubagore\nImyandiko nimyemerere:hari abizerako abantu bafite inyinya baba bafite amahirwe ari abahanga kandi bazi gucunga neza umutungo namafaranga "}
{"id": "22672", "revid": "15853", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22672", "title": "Muhondo sector", "text": "Umurenge wa Muhondo\numurenge wa Muhondo ni umwe mu mirenge 19 igize Akarere ka Gakenke, mu Ntara y\u2019Amajyaruguru y\u2019u Rwanda. Ni umurenge ufite amateka akomeye n'iterambere rishingiye ku bikorwaremezo n'ubuhinzi.Ibintu by'ingenzi byaranga uyu murenge bikurikira hano:Ubuyobozi n'ImiterereUbuyobozi: Umunyamabanga Nshingwabikorwa (Gitifu) w\u2019uyu murenge ni Gasasa Evergiste.Abaturage: Umurenge utuwe n'abaturage basaga ibihumbi 24.Utugari: Ugizwe n'utugari 9, turimo Akagari ka Gasiza, Huro, Ruganda, n'akazi ka Bwenda.Ibiro by'Umurenge: Hubatswe inyubako nshya igezweho igeretse inshuro imwe mu Mudugudu wa Gahinga, Akagari ka Gasiza, yuzuye itwaye amafaranga y'u Rwanda asaga miliyoni 380.Imihanda: Muhondo iri mu mirenge ikora ku muhanda wa Kaburimbo."}
{"id": "22673", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22673", "title": "Umurenge wa Rushashi", "text": "Umurenge wa Rushashi ni umwe mu mirenge 19 igize Akarere ka Gakenke, mu Ntara y\u2019Amajyaruguru y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Rushashi wari utuwe n'abaturage 18 835. Ugizwe n'utugari 8. Koperative y\u2019abahinzi b\u2019ikawa Abakundakawa ikorera muri uyu murenge.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUtugari.\nAkarere ka Gakenke kagizwe n'imirenge 19, utugari 97 n'imidugudu 617. Umurenge wa Rushashi ugizwe n'utugari 8:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Rushashi wari utuwe n'abaturage 17 806. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 18 835. Abagabo bari 8 974. Abagore bari 9 861. Abaturage 6 368 bari bafite munsi y\u2019imyaka 15. Abaturage 11 194 bari bafite imyaka hagati ya 15 na 64. Abaturage 1 273 bari bafite imyaka 65 cyangwa irenga. Abaturage bose batuye mu cyaro.\nUbukungu.\nUbuhinzi bw\u2019ikawa ni kimwe mu bikorwa by\u2019ubukungu muri Rushashi. Koperative Abakundakawa ikorera mu Murenge wa Rushashi. Yashinzwe mu 2004. Ifite abanyamuryango 1 962.\nIgishushanyombonera cy\u2019Akarere ka Gakenke giteganya guteza imbere isantere ya Rushashi. Iyi santere iri ku muhanda uhuza Giticyinyoni, Ruli na Gakenke."}
{"id": "22674", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22674", "title": "Janja sector", "text": "Umurenge wa Janja\nUmurenge wa Janja ni umwe mu mirenge 19 igize Akarere ka Gakenke mu Ntara y'Amajyaruguru y'u Rwanda. Uyu murenge wagiye ugaragaza iterambere mu bikorwa remezo nka serivisi z'amashanyarazi, uburezi, n'ubuzima. [1, 2, 3]\nImiyoborere n'Imiterere"}
{"id": "22675", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22675", "title": "Umurenge wa Rusasa", "text": "Umurenge wa Rusasa ni umwe mu mirenge 19 igize Akarere ka Gakenke, mu Ntara y\u2019Amajyaruguru y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Rusasa wari utuwe n'abaturage 19 242. Ugizwe n'utugari 6.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUtugari.\nAkarere ka Gakenke kagizwe n'imirenge 19, utugari 97 n'imidugudu 617. Umurenge wa Rusasa ugizwe n'utugari 6:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Rusasa wari utuwe n'abaturage 18 250. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 19 242. Abagabo bari 9 124. Abagore bari 10 118. Abaturage bose batuye mu cyaro."}
{"id": "22676", "revid": "651", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22676", "title": "LinkedIn", "text": "LinkedIn ni urubuga nkoranyambaga rw'abanyamwuga rukoreshwa mu kubaka umuyoboro w'imibanire y'akazi, gushaka no gutanga akazi, kwamamaza ibikorwa by'ubucuruzi no gusangira ubumenyi bw'umwuga. Ni rwo rubuga runini ku isi rw'abanyamwuga, rufite abanyamuryango barenga miliyari imwe mu bihugu n'uturere birenga 200.\nUrubuga rwashinzwe mu 2002, rutangira gukoreshwa ku mugaragaro mu 2003. Kuva mu 2016 ni ishami rya Microsoft, nyuma yo kugurwa ku gaciro ka miliyari 26.2 z'amadolari ya Amerika.\nAmateka.\nLinkedIn yashinzwe na Reid Hoffman afatanyije na Allen Blue, Konstantin Guericke, Eric Ly na Jean-Luc Vaillant. Igitekerezo cyari ugukora urubuga rwafasha abanyamwuga kubaka no gukomeza umubano w'akazi hakoreshejwe interineti. \nUrubuga rwatangiye gukoreshwa ku mugaragaro muri Gicurasi 2003.\nMu 2005, LinkedIn yatangiye gutanga serivisi zo gutangaza imyanya y'akazi no gufasha ibigo gushaka abakozi.\nMu 2007, isosiyete yatangiye kubona inyungu mu bikorwa byayo, kandi yari imaze kugira abanyamuryango barenga miliyoni 15.\nMu 2011, LinkedIn yinjiye ku isoko ry'imigabane (IPO), ikusanya miliyoni 353 z'amadolari ya Amerika kandi iba imwe mu masosiyete ya mbere y'imbuga nkoranyambaga ageze kuri urwo rwego.\nMu 2016, Microsoft yatangaje gahunda yo kugura LinkedIn ku gaciro ka miliyari 26.2 z'amadolari. Ubugure bwarangiye mu Ukuboza 2016, LinkedIn ikomeza gukoresha izina ryayo n'imiterere yayo nk'ishami rya Microsoft.\nImikorere.\nAbakoresha LinkedIn bashobora gukora urupapuro rw'umwirondoro rw'umwuga rurimo:\nAbakoresha bashobora kandi guhuza n'abandi banyamwuga, gukurikira ibigo, amashuri makuru, imiryango n'impuguke mu nzego zitandukanye.\nGushaka no gutanga akazi.\nKimwe mu bikorwa by'ingenzi bya LinkedIn ni uguhuza abakoresha n'abashaka akazi. Ibigo bishobora gutangaza imyanya y'akazi, gushakisha abakandida no kubatumira gusaba akazi.\nAbashaka akazi bashobora: Gushakisha imyanya y'akazi, Kohereza ubusabe, Kwakira amatangazo y'akazi mashya, Kugaragaza ubumenyi n'uburambe bwabo. Kubona amakuru ku masosiyete n'abakozi bayakoreramo. Izi serivisi zabaye imwe mu nkingi z'ingenzi z'ubucuruzi bwa LinkedIn.\nIbirimo n'itumanaho.\nLinkedIn yemerera abakoresha gutangaza inyandiko, amashusho, amafoto n'ibitekerezo ku ngingo zirebana n'umwuga, ubucuruzi, ikoranabuhanga n'ubuyobozi.\nAbakoresha bashobora:\nUbushakashatsi bw'isosiyete bwerekanye ko gushakisha amakuru ari kimwe mu bikorwa bikunze gukorwa ku rubuga.\nAmahugurwa n'ubumenyi.\nLinkedIn itanga serivisi z'amahugurwa kuri interineti binyuze muri LinkedIn Learning. Amasomo akubiyemo:\nIkoranabuhanga, Ubuyobozi, Ubucuruzi,Itumanaho, Icungamutungo, Ubugeni n'itangazamakuru. \nIyi gahunda yaturutse ku kwagura ibikorwa by'isosiyete nyuma yo kugura urubuga rw'amahugurwa Lynda.com.\nUbucuruzi n'inkomoko y'amafaranga.\nLinkedIn yinjiza amafaranga binyuze mu:\nIzi ni zo nkingi z'ingenzi zigize ubucuruzi bw'isosiyete.\nUbunini n'ingaruka.\nLinkedIn ikoreshwa n'abayobozi, abanyeshuri, abashakashatsi, ibigo n'imiryango mpuzamahanga. Nk'uko isosiyete ibitangaza, ifite abanyamuryango barenga miliyari imwe ku isi. \nUrubuga rwashyigikiye indimi nyinshi kandi rwagiye rwagura ibikorwa byarwo mu bihugu bitandukanye, harimo no gutangiza serivisi z'Igishinwa mu 2014.\nIbibazo n'inenge.\nNk'izindi mbuga nini zo kuri interineti, LinkedIn yagiye ihura n'ibibazo birebana na: Kurinda amakuru bwite y'abakoresha, Umutekano w'amakuru, Imyirondoro ituzuye cyangwa idahwitse, Gukoresha amakuru y'abakoresha mu buryo bwubahiriza amategeko. \nIsosiyete ikomeje kuvugurura uburyo bwo kurinda amakuru no kuzamura ubuziranenge bw'ibikubiye ku rubuga."}
