{"id": "22682", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22682", "title": "Shakira", "text": "Shakira Isabel Mebarak Ripoll (wavutse ku ya 2 Gashyantare 1977) ni umuririmbyi n\u2019umubyinnyi w\u2019Umunyakolombiya, uzwi cyane ku izina ry'Umwamikazi w'umuziki wa Latin. Afatwa nk\u2019umwe mu bahanzi bagize uruhare rukomeye mu kinyejana cya 21 kandi nk\u2019umwe mu bahanzi bakomeye mu mateka yose. Azwi cyane ku ndirimbo ye yitwa \"Hips Don't Lie\"."}
