{"id": "22688", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22688", "title": "Gukina igisoro", "text": "Gukina Igisoro Igisoro ni umwe mu mikino izwi ko ari iya kera cyane mu Rwanda. Igisoro kibazwa mu giti cyangwa kikabumbwa ariko n\u2019abana bashobora kugikora bacukura utwobo mu butaka. Igisoro kigizwe n\u2019impande ebyiri, buri ruhande rugizwe n\u2019utwobo cumi na dutandatu aho buri kamwe kitwa icuba. Bivuze ko utwobo twose tugize igisoro ari mirongo itatu na tubiri. Igisoro gikinwa n\u2019abantu babiri bakoresheje utubuye tw\u2019igisoro mirongo itandatu na tune."}
{"id": "22689", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22689", "title": "Gusimbuka urukiramende", "text": "Urukiramende rugira uduti dutatu, udushingwa tubiri n\u2019umutambiko wa gatatu. Abakina uyu mukino bagenda basimbuka maze ugushije umutambiko w\u2019urukiramende bakavuga ko arunereye. Abo basimbuka bahora bunguruza bazamura hejuru bagahagararira aho rubananiriye. Uyu mukino wakundwaga cyane n\u2019urubyiruko kuko wabashimishaga kandi ukerekana ko koko bafite ingufu."}
{"id": "22690", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22690", "title": "Sebutimbiri", "text": "Sebutimbiri ni ugusimbuka uzamuriye rimwe amaguru ugasimbuka inkiramende zikurikiranye. Iyo abantu bakinaga Sebutimbiri bakurikiranyaga inkiramende zigeze kuri esheshatu bakagenda bazisimbuka Sebutimbiri. Izo nkiramende aba ari ngufi cyane nka sentimetero mirongo itanu, ugushije rumwe akaba aratsinzwe."}
{"id": "22691", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22691", "title": "Gukirana", "text": "Gukirana ni umukino wakinwaga n\u2019abantu babiri aho bafatanaga mu nda hanyuma bakagundagurana ariko badakubitana. Uwitwaga ko yatsinze ni uwashoboraga gutura undi hasi."}
{"id": "22692", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22692", "title": "Kunyabanwa", "text": "Kunyabana wari umukino njyarugamba wakinwaga n\u2019abashumba bapfa ibuga aho inka zanyweraga amazi. Uyu mukino wakinishwaga inkoni hagamijwe kureba uganza bityo inka ze zikabanza kunywa amazi mbere."}
{"id": "22693", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22693", "title": "Intembe", "text": "Intembe ubundi ni inguri y\u2019insina babazagamo uruziga rwo guhirika, rwabaga rufite hagati umwenge babonezamo barasa. Abakinaga intembe babaga bafite umuheto n\u2019imyambi y\u2019ibisongo bagahagarara kuri gahunda bitegeye kuyibonezamo. Umwe akayihirika imbere yabo, hakavamo uboneza akayirasa yihirika akaboneza muri wa mwenge wayo akaba atsinze abandi igitego maze bagakomeza bose bakarushanwa."}
{"id": "22694", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22694", "title": "Kumasha", "text": "Kumasha Kumasha ni umukino wo kurushanwa kuboneza. Bareba ahantu hameze neza bakahateranira bafite umuheto n\u2019impiru, bakareba icyo bashinga ngo bakimashe. Ibi babyitaga kandi kurasa intego. Bamwe bakundaga gushinga nk\u2019umutumba w\u2019insina. Uyu mukino watumaga urubyiruko rwitoza kuboneza kugira ngo ku rugamba cyangwa mu muhigo bazashobore guhiga abandi."}
{"id": "22695", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22695", "title": "Kwiyasira", "text": "Kwiyakira byarakorwanga n\u2019abakurambere b\u2019abanyarwanda ubwo babaga bari mu mukino w\u2019amahigi. Ni umukino abakurambere bakinaga bahiga inyamaswa aho muri uwo muhigo bashoboraga kuvanamo ibyo kurya, imyambaro n\u2019ibindi. Uyu ntubarwa nk\u2019umukino gusa kuko wari n\u2019umwuga wa mbere wakozwe n\u2019abanyarwanda bo hambere mbere yo kumenya guhinga no korora."}
