{"id": "22705", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22705", "title": "Igihe", "text": "IGIHE ni ikinyamakuru cyo kuri interineti cyo mu Rwanda. Gitangaza amakuru mu Ikinyarwanda, mu Icyongereza no mu Igifaransa.\nIGIHE cyashinzwe na Meilleur Murindabigwi. Ni kimwe mu binyamakuru bisomwa cyane mu Rwanda.\nAmateka.\nMeilleur Murindabigwi ni we washinze IGIHE. Ni umuyobozi mukuru w'ikigo IGIHE Ltd. Mu ntangiriro, abanyamakuru benshi ba IGIHE bari abanyeshuri ba kaminuza. Abasomyi bashobora gutanga ibitekerezo ku nkuru.\nMu mwaka wa 2011, Murindabigwi yahawe igihembo na Jeannette Kagame. Yagihawe kubera ko yashinze IGIHE.\nAbasomyi.\nNk'uko IREX ibivuga, abantu bari hagati ya 50 000 na 80 000 basuraga urubuga rwa IGIHE buri munsi.\nMu mwaka wa 2024, IGIHE cyari gifite abantu barenga 396 000 bagikurikira kuri Facebook. Cyari gifite kandi abarenga 596 000 kuri X, n'abarenga 423 000 kuri Instagram."}
