{"id": "22746", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22746", "title": "Ikibariro Nyarwanda", "text": "Ikibariro nyarwanda mu abanyarwanda bo hambere babaraga iminsi, amezi n\u2019imyaka bagendeye ku kwezi, imyanya yako ikaba ari yo igenga imihango, ariko amezi akagomba guhura n\u2019ibihe by\u2019imvura n\u2019izuba, kuko ari byo byagengaga imirimo y\u2019ubuhinzi, n\u2019imihango yabwo, Guhuza ibyo byose rero ntibyabaga byoroshye. Wari umurimo ugomba ubwenge n\u2019ubushishozi, cyane cyane mu byo kugena ikibariro cy\u2019imihango ikorwa mu gihugu cyose. Ariko no muri rubanda hasangwa abafite ubumenyi buhagije mu bireba ubuzima bwabo n\u2019ubw\u2019umuryango."}
{"id": "22747", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22747", "title": "Imihango y\u2019Ubwiru", "text": "Imihango y'Ubwiru ni nayo yitwa inzira z\u2019ubwiru. Inzira rero ni urujyano rw\u2019imihango y\u2019ubwiru yagengaga imirimo mikuru y\u2019ibwami n\u2019imibereho y\u2019Abanyarwanda. Inzira zari 18, ariko hamenyekanye 17 gusa. Muri iyo mihango habagamo iy\u2019ingarukamwaka, iy\u2019ingarukakinyejana, n\u2019indi ikorwa iyo habaye impamvu. Mu mihango yakorwaga habaye impamvu harimo iyimika n'ishyingura ry\u2019abami, hakaba igenewe gusubya ibiza n\u2019amahano, no kugwiza ibyiza, kurumbura no gutanga umugisha. Mu ngarukakinyejana, harimo umuhango mukuru cyane wo \u201ckubyarira\u201d umuriro wa Gihanga, wakorwaga ku ngoma ya Yuhi, uko amazina y\u2019abami yakurikiranaga."}
{"id": "22748", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22748", "title": "Imihango y\u2019ubwiru yatugezeho", "text": "Imihango y'Ubwiru yagiraga abahanga bayo, ikagira abafataga amagambo yayo mu mutwe, igihe cyagera bakayasubiramo. Iby'Ubwiru byagenzurwaga n'Abami, bakabishinga Abiru mu nzego zabo, ariko bakabikurikirana, ngo hatazagira igitakara cyangwa kigahinduka, bikaguma uko abakurambere basize babitegetse. Imihango y\u2019ubwiru yabwiwe Padiri Alexis Kagame mu mwaka wa 1945, arayandika, hanyuma iza gusohorwa na M. D'Hertefelt &amp; A. Coupez mu wa 1964, mu gitabo bise \"La Royaut\u00e9 sacr\u00e9e de l'ancien Rwanda\".\nIgitabo.\nIcyo gitabo kirimo Ubwiru uko Padri Kagame yabwanditse mu Kinyarwanda, inzira bazihindura no mu rurimi rw\u2019Igifaransa, zisohoka mu gitabo kimwe, ziri muri izo ndimi zombi. Mu gitabo cy'ubwiru harimo Inzira 17, ariko Kagame yavuze ko yasanze zari 19, izibuzemo zikaba iyo kwimika amapfizi, n\u2019iyo gutaha umurwa w\u2019umwami, ariko ntiyavuze uko zamucitse."}
{"id": "22749", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22749", "title": "Imihango ngarukamwaka", "text": "Imihango ngaruka mwaka yari imihango y\u2019ubwiru ya buri mwaka iri mu yarebwaga n\u2019Abanyarwanda bose, igakorwa mu gihugu cyose. Indi na yo, rubanda rwayigiragamo uruhare, ariko ruto, ibyinshi ari ibigenewe gukorwa n\u2019umwami n\u2019umugabekazi n\u2019abiru gusa. Iyi mihango ya buri mwaka, yikurikiranyaga ihereye mu kwa Gicurasi, igihugu kinjira mu cyunamo, icyo kikazakurwa mu kwa Kamena, n\u2019ibirori byako, byamaraga icyumweru, bikitwa \u201cgukura Gicurasi\u201d. Ibyo bikarangira bajya kwitegura umuganura, kuko wategurwaga nk\u2019ubukwe, urugo ruzakira umuryango mugari n\u2019incuti rugatwererwa, ariko bagasurana bamaze kuganura mu rwabo rugo."}
{"id": "22750", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22750", "title": "Icyunamo cya Gicurasi", "text": "Icyunamo cya Gicurasi yari icyunamo cyari umuhango utegura uwa Kamena, maze yombi hamwe igategura uw\u2019Umuganura, wo muri Nyakanga. Icyunamo cyatangiraga ku mboneka ya Gicurasi. \nKu mboneka ibwami batangiraga igihe cyo guceceka, ibirori bigahagarara, imirimo ikagumya igakorwa, ariko bucece. Ingoma ntizongere kuvuga, keretse Indamutsa, kuko yari ngombwa mu mirimo y\u2019umwami. \nMu myijima y\u2019uko kwezi kwa Gicurasi igihugu cyose gitangira icyunamo, ibirori byose bigahagarara, mbese bikaba nk\u2019igihe cyo kwirabura, kizakurwaho n\u2019ibirori bya Kamena."}
{"id": "22751", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22751", "title": "Ibirori bya Kamena", "text": "Ibirori bya Kamena mu mboneka za Kamena, batangiraga imihango y\u2019icyunamuro, bakayita \"gukura Gicurasi.\" Babaga bibuka uko Ruganzu Ndori yunamuye u Rwanda, igihe rwayogozwaga n\u2019Abagara biturutse ku bugambanyi bw\u2019Abanyabyinshi ba Byinshi bya Bamara ba Yuhi Gahima. \nBagakora imihango myiza yibuka uko umutabazi Ruganzu Ndori yaje nk\u2019ukwezi muri iryo curaburindi, abundutse i Karagwe kwa Karemera, umugabo wa nyirasenge witwiga Nyabunyana."}
{"id": "22752", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22752", "title": "Umuganura wo hambere", "text": "Umuganura wakorwaga mu kwezi kwa Nyakanga, ku nzora, nk\u2019uko turi bubyerekane, ukaba umunsi mukuru wo kwibuka amasaka ya mbere yasaruwe mu Rwanda, Ruganzu Ndori amaze kurwunamura. Icyo gihe u Rwanda rwakoze iminsi mikuru ikomeye yo gusangira uwo mutsima w'amasaka yeze mbere y\u2019andi, ari ko kuganura.\nAbato.\nHari bamwe mu bakiri bato bajya bavuga ko umuganura ari umunsi mukuru w\u2019umusaruro, ariko si byo: ni umunsi wo kuganura \u2013 kurya amasaka yatanze ayandi kwera. Ntawayaryaga ataraganura."}
{"id": "22753", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22753", "title": "Kibariro cya Myaka ya Gihe", "text": "Kibariro cya Myaka ya Gihe uhereye ku baturage basanzwe, bafite ubumenyi bw\u2019ukwezi n\u2019imyanya yako, akibwira ko byaturukaga ku gukunda kwitegereza ikirere. Ariko iryo shishoza ry\u2019ikirere baribangikanyaga n\u2019ubumenyi bw\u2019ibihe by\u2019imvura n\u2019iby\u2019amapfa, n\u2019ibimera bihingwa n\u2019ibyimeza, bakabigereranya n\u2019ibihe by\u2019ukwezi.\nBirumvikana rero ko niba rubanda rwaritegerezaga ikirere, abiru bari bashinzwe gutegura imihango bakurikije igihe cyayigenewe, basuzumaga ijuru kurusha abaturage. Uwo mwete ugatuma bamenya ukwezi kwakurikizwa mu kugena ikibariro cy\u2019umwaka, n\u2019icy\u2019imihango."}
{"id": "22754", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22754", "title": "Ihagikamwaka", "text": "Ihagikamwaka Kera isi yose yabaraga umwaka ikurikije ibihembwe by\u2019ukwezi, bakabigenderaho bategura imirimo y\u2019ubuhinzi, n\u2019iy\u2019imihango n\u2019iminsi mikuru y\u2019iyobokamana. Hakaba ibihugu bigira abahanga babikurikirana, ariko bakundaga kuboneka mu banyamihango, kuko ikibandwagaho cyane cyari ikibariro cy\u2019imihango nyine. Bakanabigira ibanga, bikajya mu mabanga y\u2019ubwiru"}
{"id": "22755", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22755", "title": "Ukwezi kw\u2019ihagiko", "text": "Ukwezi kw\u2019ihagiko ukwezi kw\u2019ihagiko kwajyaga mbere ya Gicurasi, ikisunika, igasunika Kamena, kugira ngo Nyakanga izahurirane n\u2019umwero w\u2019amasaka. Ubwo amasaka aba atarera neza, ariko ntihaburemo azakoreshwa mu kuganura. Kagame avuga ko Mata ari ko kwezi kw\u2019ihagiko, ariko nk\u2019uko tubizi, Mata ni ukwezi kwihariye. Ahubwo ihagiko ryongerwa kuri Mata, nk\u2019aho ari Mata ikomeje."}
{"id": "22756", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22756", "title": "Urutonde rw\u2019amezi ya kinyarwanda", "text": "1. Nzeri: septembre-octobre \n2. Ukwakira: novembre \n3. Ugushyingo: novembre-d\u00e9cembre \n4. Ukuboza: d\u00e9cembre-janvier \n5. Mutarama: janvier-f\u00e9vrier \n6. Gashyantare: f\u00e9vrier-mars \n7. Werurwe: mars-avril \n8. Gicurasi: avril-mai \n9. Kamena: Mai-juin \n10. Nyakanga: juin-juillet \n11. Tumba-Nyakime: juillet-ao\u00fbt \n12. Tumba-Kanama: ao\u00fbt-septembre."}
{"id": "22757", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22757", "title": "Ukwezi k\u2019umuganura", "text": "Inzira y\u2019Umuganura yerekana ibihe byo kubiba no kuganura, ariko bishingiye ku masaka yabibwaga mu cyi15, mu nkuka z\u2019ibishanga. Ntituzi igihe wimukiye ku masaka abibwa mu kwa mbere, ntituzi n\u2019icyabiteye, ariko ni byo dukurikiza muri iyi nyigo."}
