{"id": "22759", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22759", "title": "Utonde rwa mezi rwa kijyambere", "text": "1. Mutarama: janvier \n2. Gashyantare: f\u00e9vrier \n3. Werurwe: mars \n4. Mata: avril \n5. Gicurasi: Mai \n6. Kamena: juin \n7. Nyakanga: juillet \n8. Kanama: ao\u00fbt \n9. Nzeri: septembre \n10. Ukwakira: octobre \n11. Ugushyingo: novembre \n12. Ukuboza: d\u00e9cembre."}
{"id": "22760", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22760", "title": "Ubwuzu", "text": "Ubwuzu ni ubushobozi bwo gukunda icyo ubwenge bwashimye. Ubwuzu bukurikira ubwenge. Kimwe n'igice cy'ubwenge, igice cy'ubwuzu nacyo kiragutse. Muri iki gice cy'umutima, hatsitsemo imbaraga z'urukundo zitangaje."}
{"id": "22761", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22761", "title": "Ubushake", "text": "Ubushake Ni ubushobozi butagira ingano. Ni imbaraga zigambiriye gushyira mu ngiro igikwiye. Izo mbaraga z'umutima zipfunduka iyo ubwenge bwemeje ko ikigambiriwe gukorwa gikwiye kandi umutima wagikunze."}
{"id": "22762", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22762", "title": "Ijambo ryiza", "text": "Ijambo ryiza Riboneka mu mvugo yabo, mu myandiko zitandukanye, mu mbwirwaruhame, mu nyandiko z'ubuvanganzo (ibyivugo, amazina y'inka, ibisigo, imigani, ibisakuzo, indirimbo n'ibindi)."}
{"id": "22763", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22763", "title": "Ijambo rihumuriza", "text": "Ijambo rihumuriza ni ijambo rituma umuntu atekana ku mutima, ntiyihebe."}
{"id": "22764", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22764", "title": "Urwenya ruruhura", "text": "Urwenya ruruhura ni ijambo nk'Indyoheshabirayi."}
{"id": "22765", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22765", "title": "Inkeneragihamya", "text": "Inkeneragihamya mu muco ni wo shingiro ry\u2019iterambere rirambye: mu migirire n\u2019imyitwarire ya muntu mu muryango ni iki kitari umuco? - Ikoranabuhanga mu itumanaho n\u2019isakazabumenyi rifite uruhare rukomeye mu gutuma umuco ukungahara, ugakwira, kandi ukabyazwa ubukungu. Ikoranabuhanga ariko na none ni umuyoboro ushobora kwifashishwa mu gutokoza umuco."}
{"id": "22766", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22766", "title": "Iterambere ry\u2019ibihugu", "text": "Iterambere ry\u2019ibihugu Kimwe mu biranga umuntu ku isi yose no mu bihe byose ni iterambere. Rikaba indatana n'imigirire y'umuryango w'abantu, uko waba uteye imbere kose mu by'ikoranabuhanga n'inganda. Ni igipimo kigaragaza imibereho myiza y'umuryango w'abantu bitabaye ngombwa ko hitabwa ku buhambare bw'ikoranabuhanga na politiki ihanitse nk'uko bimeze ku bihugu byo mu burengerazuba bw'isi."}
{"id": "22767", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22767", "title": "Umuco n\u2019Itegeko Nshinga", "text": "Umuco n\u2019Itegeko Nshinga muco ni isoko ivomwamo imigirire n\u2019uburyo bw\u2019imikorere igamije iterambere, nk\u2019uko bishimangirwa n\u2019Itegeko Nshinga rya Repubulika y\u2019u Rwanda ryo mu 2003 ryavuguruwe mu 2015, mu ngingo yayo ya 11. Rihamya ko umuco ari isoko yo kwishakamo ibisubizo (Repubulika y'u Rwanda, 2015)."}
{"id": "22768", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22768", "title": "Umuco na politiki z\u2019iterambere", "text": "Umuco na politiki z\u2019iterambere Icyerekezo 2050 gihamya ko u Rwanda rwihaye intego yo kuba igihugu gikize gishingiye ku umuco wo kugira ishyaka no guhiganwa mu nzego zose. Kimwe mu byo kwitabwaho by\u2019ingenzi ni ugupiganwa mu by\u2019iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu hifashishijwe ikoranabuhanga, uguhanga ibishya binyuze mu inozaburyo, gukora ubushakashatsi, kubaka ibikorwaremezo bifite ireme, gukora ibikorwa bibyara umusaruro ku giciro gikwiye no kongera uburyo bw\u2019ibyazamusaruro. "}
{"id": "22769", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22769", "title": "Politiki y\u2019umuco", "text": "Politiki y\u2019umuco iteganya ko umuco w\u2019u Rwanda ugomba kwagura amarembo ugasabana n\u2019indi mico mu gihe iyo mishyikirano ikungahaza Abanyarwanda, igatuma ibihugu birushaho kumvikana no kugira amahoro. Ibyo bigakorwa mu bwubahe bw\u2019umwihariko wa buri muco, ubw\u2019urusobe n\u2019ubwuzuzanye by\u2019imico."}
{"id": "22770", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22770", "title": "Kurambagiza umukobwa", "text": "Kurambagiza ni ukureba uburanga bw\u2019umukobwa cyangwa umuhungu, ubwiza, imico n\u2019imyifatire bye. Mu kurambagiza kandi habagaho kumenya no kugenzura imyitwarire, imibereho, imikorere, isuku ndetse n\u2019umuryango umuhungu cyangwa umukobwa akomokamo kugira ngo umenye niba yarahawe uburere."}
{"id": "22771", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22771", "title": "Gusaba no gufata irembo", "text": "Gusaba no gufata irembo ni umuhango wakurikiraga kurambagiza, ukabera iwabo w\u2019umukobwa. Uyu muhango wari ugamije guhuza umuryango w\u2019umusore ku nshuro ya mbere n\u2019umuryango w\u2019umukobwa mu rwego rwo kumenyana mbere y\u2019uko baziyemeza guhana abageni. Imisango yo gusaba no gufata irembo akenshi irihuta kuko ubusanzwe mu kinyarwanda ntawimana Iyo umuryango w\u2019umusore wemerewe irembo, hakurikiraho umuhango wo kurifata."}
{"id": "22772", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22772", "title": "Gusaba no gukwa", "text": "Gusaba ni umuhango ukurikira uwo gufata irembo ukabera iwabo w\u2019umukobwa. Mu muhango wo gusaba umuryango w\u2019umusore watoranyaga abakwe bajya kuwusabira, bakagenda bayobowe n\u2019umukwe mukuru bakagenda bitwaje inzoga zo gusabisha."}
{"id": "22773", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22773", "title": "Ibyakorwaga mu kurongora no kurongorwa", "text": "Mu Rwanda rwo hambere, mbere yo kurongora no kurongorwa umuryango w\u2019umukobwa waramuhekaga ukamushyira uw\u2019umusore. Iyo yabaga ageze kwa sebukwe bitewe n\u2019akarere, hari imihango yakorwaga mu kumwakira. Hari aho, akiri mu bikingi by\u2019amarembo yahagararaga hejuru y\u2019aho batabye urusyo nyirabukwe akamukoza umwuko mu mpanga. Ahandi, umugeni yarinjiraga agasanga sebukwe yicaye ikambere akamwicaza ku bibero, akanamuha inka y\u2019ibibero akabona kujyanwa mu mbere."}
{"id": "22774", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22774", "title": "Nyuma yo gushyingirwa", "text": "Nyuma yo kurongora no kurongorwa, hakurikiragaho gutinya, gutwikurura, gutekesha, guca mu irembo no gusura abageni."}
{"id": "22775", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22775", "title": "Gutekesha", "text": "Gutekesha Gutekesha cyangwa gukora ku mashyiga ni umuhango wakorwaga n\u2019iwabo w\u2019umuhungu nyuma yo kurongora kugira ngo bamushyigikire mu rugo rushya. Uyu muhango wakorwaga n\u2019umugeni, umugabo we na nyirabukwe na sebukwe. Nyirabukwe yamuzaniraga bimwe mu bikoresho byo mu rugo nk\u2019urukebano cyangwa akabindi. Uyu muhango wari ugamije guha uburenganzira bwo gukora imirimo no gutinyuka sebukwe na nyirabukwe. Muri uyu muhango umusore n\u2019umukobwa bakoraga umuhango wo gufatanya guteka ibyo ababyeyi babaga bazanye."}
{"id": "22776", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22776", "title": "Guca mu irembo", "text": "Guca mu irembo byakorwaga n\u2019umusore washyingiwe n\u2019umugeni we, ubwo basuraga iwabo w\u2019umukobwa. Uyu muhango wabaga nyuma y\u2019igihe runaka abashyingiwe baramenyereye urugo kandi baratangiye kurukorera, umusore akajya gukura ubwatsi."}
{"id": "22777", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22777", "title": "Imihango y\u2019ubukwe mu muco w\u2019Abanyarwanda", "text": "Mu Rwanda rwo ha mbere, ubukwe bwari ubw\u2019umuryango. Imiryango iyo yabonaga ko umusore cyangwa inkumi bakuze kandi ko bageze igihe cyo gushinga urugo, yatangiraga gutera intambwe zagenwaga n\u2019umuco. Umugeni yasabwaga umuryango kandi agahabwa umuryango w\u2019umusore bityo amakimbirane n\u2019ibindi bibazo byashoboraga kuvuka muri urwo rugo rushya byakemurwaga n\u2019umuryango uhurije hamwe (Kwirinda no Gukemura amakimbirane mu miryango)."}
{"id": "22778", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22778", "title": "Guca mu irembo no kuramukanya", "text": "Guca mu irembo byakorwaga n\u2019umusore washyingiwe n\u2019umugeni we, ubwo basuraga iwabo w\u2019umukobwa. Uyu muhango wabaga nyuma y\u2019igihe runaka abashyingiwe baramenyereye urugo kandi baratangiye kurukorera, umusore akajya gukura ubwatsi. \nMuri uyu muhango bajyanaga na se w\u2019umuhungu, umuranga cyangwa se undi muntu washoboraga kubavugira ijambo. Bajyanaga inzoga basangira kandi bakaganira hagamijwe gushimira umuryango w\u2019umukobwa ko watanze umugeni mwiza. \nMuri uyu muhango dusangamo indangagaciro yo gushima no gushimira kubera ko urugo rushya rwafataga umwanya rukajya gushimira umuryango wabashyingiye. Ibi byatumaga imiryango irushaho kubana neza n\u2019umurunga wayo ugakomera."}
{"id": "22779", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22779", "title": "Inama zigirwa abateganya gushinga ingo", "text": "Ibibazo bigaragara mu bukwe muri iki gihe, ahanini biterwa n\u2019uko umuryango utagiha agaciro umuco n\u2019intego nyamukuru y\u2019ubukwe. Ibi bituma umusore, inkumi n\u2019imiryango bakomokamo muri rusange bavanga ibyo umuco w\u2019u Rwanda ugena n\u2019ibiva mu mahanga mu mihango y\u2019ubukwe. \nUmuco urakura, uratanga kandi ukakira. Ariko mu mihango ndangamuco nk\u2019iy\u2019ubukwe haba hakwiriye guhabwa agaciro indangagaciro zawo kubera akamaro kazo mu kubaka no gushimangira uwo muhango n\u2019icyo ugamije mu kubaka umuryango nyarwanda. \nKugira ngo ibi bikemuke, ni ngombwa ko buri wese abigiramo uruhare, akamenya indangagaciro dusanga mu mihango y\u2019ubukwe zadufasha kubaka umuryango uhamye kandi ukomeye."}
{"id": "22780", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22780", "title": "Umurimo", "text": "umurimo ni igikorwa gikoreshejwe imbaraga z\u2019umubiri cyangwa z\u2019ubwonko kugira ngo umuntu agere ku ntego cyangwa ibisubizo. Umurimo rero ni inkingi ya mwamba, ituma umuntu agera ku ntego yihaye zose akoresheje ubwenge cyangwa imbaraga z\u2019amaboko ye.\nNi na yo mpamvu Leta y\u2019u Rwanda yawushyize mu bigomba kuranga Abanyarwanda kugira ngo bazagere ku ntego bihaye, biteze imbere, bashobore kwihaza mu ngo ndetse banasagurire amasoko. Ikindi kandi iyo wakoze bigutera kugira ubuzima bwiza, umubiri wawe ukubakika kandi ibyo ukura mu murimo ukora bikagufasha kubaho neza. \nDushishikarizwa kudasuzugura akazi kuko burya ngo Nta kazi k\u2019umunyagara kabaho\u201d ikindi ngo Udakora ntakarye."}
{"id": "22781", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22781", "title": "Gukunda Igihugu", "text": "Gukunda Igihugu ni amagambo abiri abumbye ijambo rimwe. Gukunda bivuga kumva ubwuzu bwimbitse ufitiye umuntu cyangwa kwishimira cyane. Bamwe bajya bavuga ngo urukundo ni impumyi abandi ngo urukundo ni ukurindagira k\u2019umutima, gutuma ubona umuntu mu buryo butandukanye n\u2019ubwo abandi bamubonamo, ukanishyiramo ko afite uruhare rukomeye mu buzima bwawe\u201d. Aha rero si kimwe no gukunda igihugu."}
{"id": "22782", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22782", "title": "Indangasoko", "text": "Indangasoko ni ibigaragaza aho wakuye ibyo wanditse."}
{"id": "22783", "revid": "18377", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22783", "title": "Belmont Cameli", "text": "Philip Belmont Cameli (wavutse ku ya 28 Gashyantare 1998) ni umukinnyi wa filime w\u2019umunyamerika, uzwi cyane kubera filime yakinnye yitwa Jamie Spano muri filime \"Saved by the Bell\" reboot (2020\u20132021), Eli muri filime ya Netflix \"yitwa \" (2022) na Garrett Graham muri serivise ya Amazon Prime Video \"Off Campus\" (2026\u2013Kugeza ubu).\nAkiri muto.\nPhillip Belmont Cameli yavukiye i Naperville, muri leta ya Illinois. \nAhanini bijyanye n' inkomoko ya se aturuka mu Butaliyani. Sekuruza we, Belmondo Cameli, yavukiye i San Benedetto del Tronto mbere yo kwimukira muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika maze ahindura izina rye ry'umuryango yitwa Belmont. Ababyeyi ba Cameli ni bo bamuhaye iryo zina rya sogokuru.\nMu mashuri yisumbuye, yakinaga imikino itatu. Nyuma yo kurangiza amashuri ye, yize muri Kaminuza ya Illinois nk'ishuri rikuru ry'ubucuruzi mu gihe cy'umwaka umwe mbere yo kuhava. Yagumye i Chicago umwaka umwe akurikirana umwuga wo kwerekana imideli, hanyuma yimukira i Los Angeles mu 2019. Afite mukuru we, Patrick, na mushiki we muto, Julia. \nUmwuga.\nCameli yatangiye gukina filime ubwo yatumirwaga muri \"Empire\" mu 2018. Yamenyekanye cyane kubera gukina Jamie Spano, umuhungu w' umukinnyi wa Elizabeth Berkley witwa Jessie Spano, muri filime \"ya Saved by the Bell\". \nMu 2022, Cameli yakinnye muri filime ya Netflix \"yitwa Along for the Ride\", ishingiye ku gitabo cya Sarah Dessen. Yakinnye ari Eli, umuntu utuje ugirana isano n'umukinnyi w'ingenzi muri iyo filimi. \nYakinnye Frankie Boy muri filime y'aba polisi \"yitwa The Alto Knights\", yasohotse mu 2025. \nCameli yagaragaye muri \"Until Dawn\", fiime ishingiye k'umukino wa videwo (video game) wo muri 2015 wakozwe na kompanyi ya Supermassive games witwa \"Until Dawn\". Iyi filime yasohotse ku wa 25 Mata 2025, igaragaza inkuru nshya n'abakinnyi, aho Cameli akina nka Abe. \nMu 2026, Cameli yakinnye nka Garrett Graham muri serivise ya \"Off Campus\" kuri Amazon Prime Video. \nMu buzima bwite.\nMu 2018, Cameli yahaye impyiko ye umuntu atazi mu runigi rw'abantu 14 rwatumye abantu barindwi barokoka. \nKu wa 6 Kamena 2026, Cameli yacuranze indirimbo \"Girls\" hamwe na The Kid LAROI nyuma y'uko indirimbo igaragaye mu kiganiro cya televiziyo \"cya Off Campus\". "}
{"id": "22785", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22785", "title": "Rwanda Water Resource Board", "text": "Rwanda Water Resources Board (RWB) ni ikigo cya Leta y'uRwanda gifite inshingano zo gucunga, kurengera no guteza imbere umutungo w'amazi mu gihugu. RWB yashyizweho n'Itegeko No. 71/2019 ryo ku wa 29 Mutarama 2020, kandi ifite ubuzima gatozi n'ubwisanzure mu micungire y'ubutegetsi n'iy'imari. Ikora nk'urwego rwa Leta rutagamije inyungu z'ubucuruzi.\nAmategeko.\nRwanda Water Resource Board yashinzwe hagamijwe gukomeza kunoza imicungire y'umutungo w'amazi mu Rwanda no gushyira mu bikorwa politiki, amategeko n'ingamba z'igihugu zijyanye n'umutungo w'amazi. Icyicaro gikuru cyayo giherereye iKigali, umurwa mukuru w'u Rwanda\nIntego.\nIntego nyamukuru ya Rwanda Water Resource Board ni uguharanira ko amazi ahagije kandi acunzwe neza aboneka kugira ngo ashyigikire iterambere rirambye ry'igihugu."}
{"id": "22786", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22786", "title": "Umugezi wa Karundura", "text": "Karundura ni umugezi uherereye mu Karere ka Nyamasheke. "}
{"id": "22787", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22787", "title": "Imiti isukura amazi", "text": "Imiti isukura amazi (mu cyongereza: \"Water treatment chemicals\") ni ibinyabutabire bikoreshwa mu gukuraho umwanda, imyanda ikomeye, bagiteri, virusi, n'ibindi bintu bishobora kwanduza amazi kugira ngo abe akwiye gukoreshwa n'abantu cyangwa mu nganda. Iyi miti ifite uruhare runini mu kubungabunga ubuzima n'isuku, dore ko ku isi yose abantu bagera kuri miliyoni 3.4 bapfa buri mwaka kubera indwara ziterwa no kutagira amazi meza yo kunywa.\n= Ubwoko bw'imiti isukura amazi =\nGusukura amazi bikoresha imiti itandukanye hashingiwe ku cyo ushaka gukuramo cyangwa urwego amazi agezeho atunganywa:\n= Inyandiko zifashishijwe ="}
{"id": "22788", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22788", "title": "Ikiraro cya Kyaka", "text": "Ikiraro cya Kyaka, rimwe na rimwe cyitwa ikiraro cya Akagera, ni ikiraro muri Tanzaniya cyambukiranya uruzi rwa Kagera. Iki kiraro cyaturikijwe n'inzobere zo muri Uganda zo muri Kilembe Mines mu 1978 mu gihe cy'intambara ya Uganda na Tanzaniya. \nIkiraro cy'ubu (truss) ni ikiraro cya Callender-Hamilton gitangwa n'abakora ibyuma by'ubwubatsi b'Abongereza Painter Brothers."}
{"id": "22789", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22789", "title": "Water Access Rwanda", "text": "Water Access Rwanda ni ikigo cy'imibereho myiza n'ubucuruzi (social enterprise) gikorera mu Rwanda, gifite intego yo gutanga amazi meza kandi yizewe ku baturage binyuze mu kubaka no gucunga ibikorwa remezo byamazi. Cyashinzwe mu mwaka wa 2014, gifite icyicaro i Kigali, kandi gikora ibikorwa byacyo no mu bindi bihugu byo mu Karere ka Afurika y'Iburasirazuba\nAmateka.\nWater Access Rwanda yashinzwe muri 2014 hagamijwe gukemura ikibazo cy'ibura ry'amazi meza no guteza imbere uburyo burambye bwo kugeza amazi ku baturage. Kuva cyashingwa, ikigo cyagiye cyagura ibikorwa byacyo mu Rwanda ndetse no mu bihugu bituranye birimo Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, u Burundi na Uganda.\nintego.\nIntego ya Water Access Rwanda ni ugushyiraho ibikorwa remezo by'amazi byizewe, byoroshye kugerwaho kandi bihendutse muri Afurika.\nIcyerekezo.\nIcyerekezo cy'ikigo ni uko amazi meza yaboneka ku buryo bworoshye \"ku gufungura robine\" (safe water at the turn of a tap)\nIngaruka kubaturage.\nNkuko imibare yatangajwe niki kigo igaragaza abaturage barenga 230,000 bafite amazi meza babikesha ibikorwa Water Access Rwanda kandi yubatse kandi icunga imiyoboro mito y\u2019amazi (mini-grids) ifasha abaturage bo mu bice by\u2019icyaro kubona amazi meza hafi yabo"}
{"id": "22790", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22790", "title": "Uburyo bugezweho bwo gutunganya amazi", "text": "Uburyo bugezweho bwo gutunganya amazi ni bumwe mu buryo bukoreshwa mu nganda n'imijyi hagamijwe guhangana n'ikibazo cy'ibura ry'amazi meza ku isi no mu Rwanda muri rusange. Bitewe n'ubwiyongere bw'abaturage, iterambere ry'imijyi, n'iry'ubukungu, amazi asanzwe ntabwo aba agihagije, bityo chimie n'ikoranabuhanga bikaba byarahaye inganda uburyo bushya bwo gutanga amazi meza yo guteka, kunywa, kuhira, n'ay'inganda.\n= Uburyo 4 bwifashishwa mu gutunganya amazi =\n= Indangasoko ="}
{"id": "22791", "revid": "13531", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22791", "title": "Umugezi wa Zoki", "text": "Zoki ni uruzi ruherereye mu majyaruguru ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Rutemba rugana mu gace ka Aketi mu Karere ka Bas-Uele, muri Repubulika iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. "}
{"id": "22792", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22792", "title": "Ikiraro Mpuzamahanga cya Rusumo", "text": "Ikiraro Mpuzamahanga cya Rusumo ni ikiraro mpuzamahanga, cyafunguwe muri 2014, hakurya y'uruzi rw'Akagera. Gisimbura ikiraro cyahoze ari icya Rusomo cyahuzaga u Rwanda na Tanzaniya. Uyu mushinga watewe inkunga n'Ikigo Mpuzamahanga cy'Ubutwererane cy'Abayapani. "}
{"id": "22793", "revid": "18343", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22793", "title": "Uruzi rwa Mono", "text": "Uruzi rwa Mono ni rwo ruzi runini rwo mu burasirazuba bwa Togo.\nUfite uburebure bwa kilometero 400 (250 km), kandi utemba amazi mu kibaya kingana na kilometero kare 7.700 (7.700 sq mi), uzamuka hagati y'umujyi wa Sokod\u00e9 n'umupaka na Benin, maze ugatemba ugana mu majyepfo. Mu gice cy'amajyepfo y'uruzi ugana ku munwa warwo, ugize umupaka mpuzamahanga hagati ya Togo na Benin. Uruzi rutemba mu kiyaga cya Benin runyuze mu nzira nini y'amazi y'umunyu n'ibiyaga, harimo n'ikiyaga cya Togo.[1] Igice cy'uruzi cyegereye umunwa warwo ni cyo cyonyine gishobora gukoreshwa mu mazi. Igice kinini cy'uruzi kiri ku kibaya cyo hejuru gihingwamo ibigori, ibirayi, umuceri, ipamba n'imyumbati.[2]\nUruzi rufite uruzitiro ruri ku ntera ya kilometero 160 (mi 99) uvuye ku munwa warwo n'urugomero rwa Nangbeto, ubufatanye hagati ya Benin na Togo bwarangiye mu 1987. Ubushakashatsi bwagaragaje inyungu z'ubukungu zikomoka kuri urwo rugomero, harimo ubukerarugendo n'uburobyi mu kiyaga kiri inyuma yarwo. Iyubakwa ry'urwo rugomero ryakuyeho abantu bari hagati ya 7.600 na 10.000, ariko ubushakashatsi bwerekana ko rwahinduye cyane ibidukikije by'ikiyaga kiri ku munwa w'uruzi binyuze mu kugabanya ihindagurika ry'ibihe mu gihe cy'amazi. Umushinga wa kabiri w'urugomero, Adjarala, watanzweho igitekerezo cyo kubakwa ku ruzi ruri hagati ya Nangbeto n'umunwa w'uruzi mu myaka ya 1990 [1] ariko ntirwabonye inkunga kugeza mu 2017 ubwo Ikigega cy'Iterambere ry'Ubushinwa n'Afurika cyemeye gushyigikira uyu mushinga. [2] Kubaka urwo rugomero ni kimwe mu bigize gahunda ya leta yo kongera ubushobozi bwo gutanga amashanyarazi mu gihugu cya Benin kuva kuri 20 kugeza kuri 70% kuko amashanyarazi menshi ya Togo na Benin agomba gutumizwa mu rugomero rwa Akosombo muri Ghana. [3]\nHafi ya kilometero 35 (22 mi) uvuye ku kanwa kayo, hari imigezi itandatu ikurikiranye. Munsi yayo, uruzi rugenda buhoro kandi rutemba mu kibaya cyuzuyemo imyuzure, kandi hari agace kanini k'ibishanga bihana imbibi muri Togo na Benin. Aka gace gafite urubingo rwinshi, sedges n'ibyatsi, kandi muri urwo ruzi harimo manatee, ingona n'imvubu.[1]"}
{"id": "22794", "revid": "18379", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22794", "title": "Afram", "text": "Uruzi rwa Afram ni uruzi rufite uburebure bwa kilometero 100 (mil 62) ruherereye muri Ghana. Mbere y'uko hubakwa urugomero rwa Akosombo mu myaka ya za 1960, Afram rwari rumwe mu nzuzi nini zisuka mu Ruzi rwa Volta. Muri iki gihe, rukomeje kuba uruzi rw'ingenzi rusuka mu kiyaga cya Volta (Lake Volta). \nUru ruzi rutembera rwerekeza ahanini mu majyepfo y'uberengerazuba (sourthwest) kandi rukusanya amazi yose ava mu migezi ya Kwahu, rukayageza mur Lake Volta."}
{"id": "22795", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22795", "title": "Umugezi wa Kiwira", "text": "Umugezi wa Kiwira ni uruzi ruherereye mu Karere ka Rungwe rukagera no mu Karere ka Kyela mu ntara ya Mbeya, mu gihugu cya Tanzaniya.\nIsomo.\nUruzi ruzamuka mu misozi ya Poroto ahashyira mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba bw'intara ya Mbeya kandi rubona imigezi myinshi ituruka ku misozi ya Rungwe, harimo Marogala, Sinini, Kipoke, Kilasi na Mulagala. Amasumo ya Kijungu ari ku nzira yo hejuru y'uruzi. Hanyuma atemba mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba akamanuka mu mpera y'amajyaruguru y'ikiyaga cya Malawi hafi y'umujyi wa Kyela. Inzira yo hasi inyura mu kibaya cya Kyela, kiri mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bw'ikiyaga cya Malawi mu kibaya cya East African Rift. Ikibaya cya Kyela gihingwa cyane hamwe n'umuceri n'ibindi bihingwa. "}
{"id": "22796", "revid": "18374", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22796", "title": "Akarere ka Rusumo", "text": "RUSUMO yari akarere(akarere)mu cyahoze ari intara yu Rwanda ya kibungo.Aka kaarere kavanyweho hamwe n'intara ya kibungo.mu kuvugurura inzego z'ibanze mu 2006. Abaturage 149.643(imibare 2002):ubuso:kilometero kar601.Itandukanijwe na tanzania n'umugezi wa kagera n'amazi ya Rusumo.\nUmujyi.\nHariho kandi umujyi wa iryo zina umujyi "}
{"id": "22797", "revid": "17618", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22797", "title": "Uruzi rwa Mwogo", "text": "Uruzi rwa Mwogo ni uruzi ruherereye mu burengerazuba bw'u Rwanda rutembera m'umugezi wa Nyabarongo. \nIsomo.\nUmugezi wa Mwogo uturuka mu gihugu cy\u2019amashyamba mu majyepfo y\u2019u Rwanda mu burasirazuba bw\u2019igice cya Kongo-Nile. [1] Ukaba ufite amasoko mu murenge wa Kitabi mu Karere ka Nyamagabe. Unyura iburasirazuba unyuze Nyarusiza ukomeza mu Karere ka Huye. [2] Uca mu gice cy'amajyaruguru y\u2019uburasirazuba bw' igihugu unyuze mu gice cy\u2019uburengerazuba bw\u2019aka karere, winjira mu karere ka Nyanza. [3] Mu karere ka Nyanza unyura mu majyaruguru y\u2019uburasirazuba, unyura i Mweya aho uruzi rwa Gihimbi rwinjirira uturutse ibumoso. [4] Munsi y\u2019iyi ngingo uhurira n\u2019uruzi rwa Rukarara uturutse ibumoso. [2] Hanyuma ugizeumupaka w\u2019iburengerazuba bw\u2019Akarere ka Ruhango kugeza igihe uhurira ibumoso n\u2019uruzi rwa Mbirurume mu majyepfo ya Bwakira. Umugezi uhuriweho witwa uruzi rwa Nyabarongo, rukomeza mu majyaruguru. [5] [a]\nHydrology.\nMwogo ni imwe mu masoko y'ingenzi y'uruzi rwa Nyawarungu. [1] Ibipimo by'imvura n'amazi aturuka mu kirere kuri sitasiyo ya Nyabisindu bigaragaza ko ikibaya cy'uruzi rwa Mwogo gitanga amazi angana na. [8] Mu bice bimwe by'ikibaya cy'umugezi, imisozi yaciwemo ibiti, bitera isuri n'ibibazo byo kuzura umucanga. Harimo gushyirwamo imbaraga zo kongera gutera ibiti. [9] Mwogo na Rukarara ni byo bitanga isoko y'amazi y'umujyi wa Nyanza. [10]\nIndangasoko.\nInyandiko\nVuga\nAmasoko"}
