{"id": "22799", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22799", "title": "Umugezi wa Ruvu", "text": "Umugezi wa Ruvu uturuka mu majyepfo y'imisozi ya Uluguru, ukamanuka werekeza iburasirazuba ukagera mu Nyanja y'Ubuhinde hafi ya Bagamoyo. Umugezi wawo munini wisuka mo ni umugezi wa Ngerengere, uturuka mu majyaruguru ya Uluguru, ugatemba mu mujyi wa Morogoro mbere yo kwinjira muri Ruvu. Ruvu yambukanya ahantu hafite ubuso bwa11.789.\u00a0km\u00b2, harimo ibice by'akarere ka Morogoro na Pwani. Agace k'umugezi wa Wami kari mu majyaruguru no mu burengerazuba, naho agace k'umugezi wa Rufiji kari mu majyepfo.\nUmugezi wa Ruvu ni isoko y'amazi y'ingenzi ku ngo, imirima ivomererwa, n'inganda zo mu duce turi ku nkengero z'uruzi. Ni nawo soko y'ingenzi y'amazi ya Dar es Salaam, umujyi munini muri Tanzaniya, uherereye ku nkombe z'iburasirazuba bw'umugezi wa Ruvu. Uhura n'ikibazo cy'umwanda ukabije uterwa no kurekura amazi y'ingo adasukuwe n'amazi mabi y'inganda mu ruzi. "}
{"id": "22800", "revid": "18373", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22800", "title": "Uruzi rwa Knysna", "text": "Uruzi rwa Knysna (mu rurimi rw'ikinyafurika: Knysnarivier) ni uruzi rutemba mu ntara ya Cape y'Iburengerazuba muri Afurika y'Epfo. Rufite isoko mu misozi ya Outeniqua, mu karere ka Edeni, hanyuma rugana mu Nyanja y'Ubuhinde, aho rufungukira n'umugezi munini, aho hari umujyi wa Knysna, izina ryawo rikomoka ku ruzi. Inzira yarwo, ifite uburebure bwa kilometero 40, ni yo ishobora gukoreshwa mu bwato mu gice cyayo cya nyuma gusa. \nUmunwa w'uruzi witwa Imitwe. \nIzina Knysna ryagaragaye mu nyandiko zitandukanye kuva ahagana mu myaka ya 1770.[1] Ryitwaga 'Nysna' muri imwe mu nzandiko za mbere za James Callander, umusare wo muri Ecosse, woherejwe na guverinoma ya gikoloni ya Cape mu 1798 kugira ngo akore ubushakashatsi kandi atange raporo ku mashyamba, ibigobe n'imigezi byo muri ako karere. Yiyubakiye inzu muri The Heads. Ashushanya ikarita ya mbere y'uruzi rwa Knysna \"Imbonerahamwe ya Knysna, Inkombe y'inyanja, Amaki arindwi mu burengerazuba bwa Plettenberg's Bay\" kandi agaragaza igitekerezo cye cy'uko Knysna iruta kure Plettenberg Bay nk'ahantu ho kohereza ibiti.[2]"}
{"id": "22801", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22801", "title": "Pishon", "text": "&lt;templatestyles src=\"Hlist/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Sidebar/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;&lt;templatestyles src=\"Hlist/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;&lt;templatestyles src=\"Hlist/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;Igice cy'uruhererekane kuri\nBibiliya\nAmategeko n'ibitabo\nTanakh\nTorah\nNevi'im\nKetuvim\nIsezerano rya Kera (Iteka rya Kera)\nIsezerano Rishya (Iteka rya Kera)\nDeuterokanoni\nAntilegomena\nIbice n'imirongo\nApocrypha\nAbayahudi\nIteka rya Kera\nNT\nUbwanditsi n'iterambere\nUbwanditsi\nAmatariki\nAmategeko y'Igiheburayo\nAmategeko y'Isezerano rya Kera\nAmategeko y'Isezerano Rishya\nImiterere ya Torah\nUbwanditsi bwa Mose\nInzandiko za Pawulo\nInzandiko za Petrine\nIbitabo bya Yohananine\nUbuhinduzi n'inyandiko\nImizingo yo mu Nyanja y'Umunyu\nUmwandiko wa Masoreti\nPentateuch y'Abasamariya\nTargumim\nSeptuagint\nPeshitta\nVetus Latina\nVulgate\nBibiliya ya Gothic\nBibiliya ya Luther\nBibiliya y'Icyongereza\nukurikije ururimi\nInyigo za Bibiliya\nUbucukumbuzi bw'ibyataburuwe mu matongo\nIbikoresho by'ubucukumbuzi bw'ibyataburuwe mu matongo\nIbikoresho by'ubucukumbuzi bw'ibyataburuwe mu matongo\nIbitabo by'ubucukumbuzi bw'ibyataburuwe mu matongo\nIbitabo by'amateka\nUburyo bwo guhuza imbere\nAbantu\nAhantu\nAmazina\nBiblia Hebraica Stuttgartensia\nSeptuagint ya Rahlfs\nTestamente ya Novum Graece\nIgitekerezo cy'inyandiko\nIkibazo cya synoptic\nIbyiciro by'inyandiko za NT\nIsesengura rya Bibiliya\nAmateka\nInyandiko\nInkomoko\nIfishi\nGusubiramo\nCanonical\nUbusobanuro\nHermeneutics\nPesher\nMidrash\nPardes\nUbusobanuro bw'ikigereranyo\nUburyo bw'amateka-ikibonezamvugo\nIhumekero\nUbuvanganzo\nInzogaInyigisho y'ubugambanyi\nAmahame\nIgihano cy'urupfu\nUbutinganyi\nUrwenya\nUbusambanyi\nMuhammad\nUbuhanuzi\nGufata ku ngufuInzoka\nIgitsinaUbucakaraIhohoterwa\nIntambara\nAbagore\nImyumvire\nGnostic\nIsilamu\nKorani\nKutagira amakosa\nKudakosa\nInegurwa rya Bibiliya\nUbubasha bwa Bibiliya\nIncamake y'ingingo zijyanye na Bibiliya\nUrubuga rwa Bibiliya\nPishon (Igiheburayo: \u05e4\u05b4\u05bc\u05d9\u05e9\u05c1\u05d5\u05b9\u05df P\u012b\u0161\u014dn; Ikigereki Koine: \u03a6\u03b9\u03c3\u03ce\u03bd Phis\u1e53n) ni umwe mu nzuzi enye (hamwe na Hiddekel (Tigiri), Perath (Efurate) na Gihoni) zavuzwe mu gitabo cya Bibiliya cy'Intangiriro. Muri icyo gice, uruzi rutemba ruva muri Edeni ruvomera ubusitani bwa Edeni kandi kuva aho rugabanyamo imigezi ine yitwa imigezi. Pishon isobanurwa ko izengurutse \"igihugu cyose cya Havila ahari zahabu; bdeliyumu n'ibuye rya onigisi.\" [2]\nIndangamuntu.\nBitandukanye na Tigiri na Efurate, Pishon ntabwo yigeze iboneka neza. Bivugwa muri make hamwe na Tigiri mu Bwenge bwa Siraki (24: 25/35), ariko iyi nyandiko ntigaragaza urumuri aho uruzi ruherereye. Umuhanga mu by'amateka y'Abayahudi n'Abaroma Flavius \u200b\u200bJosephus, mu ntangiriro ya kera ya kera y'Abayahudi (mu kinyejana cya mbere nyuma ya Yesu) yerekanye Pishoni n'Agatsiko. [1] Umwarimu w\u2019Abafaransa wo mu kinyejana cya 5 Rashi yabigaragaje na Nili.\nBamwe mu bahanga bo mu gihe cya none nka Antoine Augustin Calmet (1672\u20131757) n'abandi bantu bakurikiyeho nka Ernst Friedrich Karl Rosenm\u00fcller (1768\u20131835), na Carl Friedrich Keil (1807\u20131888), bizeraga ko uruzi rwakomokagaho [Edeni] rwari akarere k'amasoko: \"Pishoni na Gihoni byari imigezi yo mu misozi. Iya mbere ishobora kuba yari Phasis cyangwa Araxes, naho iya nyuma ikaba Oxus.\"[1]\nJames A. Sauer, wahoze ari umuyobozi w\u2019Ingoro Ndangamurage ya Semitic ya Harvard, yavuze ashingiye ku bumenyi bw\u2019isi n\u2019amateka ko Pishon yerekezaga ku cyahoze ari Wadi al-Batin, umuyoboro w\u2019amazi w\u2019amazi usanzwe uturuka mu misozi ya Hijaz hafi ya Medina, ugana mu majyaruguru y\u2019uburasirazuba ugana muri Koweti. [1] Akoresheje amafoto ya satelite, Farouk El-Baz wo muri Kaminuza ya Boston yakurikiranye umuyoboro w\u2019amazi uturutse muri Koweti ugana kuri Wadi al-Batin n\u2019umuyoboro wa Wadi al-Rummah uturuka hafi ya Medina kuri Jib\u0101l al Abya\u1e11. [2]\nDavid Rohl yavuze ko Pishoni ari Uizhun, [agace gakenewe] gashyira Havila mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba bwa Mezopotamiya. Uizhun izwi muri ako gace nk'uruzi rwa Zahabu. Izamuka hafi y'umugezi wa stratovolcano Sahand, inyura hagati y'ibirombe bya zahabu bya kera n'imirongo ya lapis lazuli mbere yo kugaburira inyanja ya Kaspiyani. Uwo mutungo kamere uhuye n'uwo mu gihugu cya Havila mu Itangiriro.[1]\nDan'el Kahn wo muri Kaminuza ya Haifa yavuze ko izina Pishon rishobora kuba ryaraturutse ku ijambo ryo mu Misiri pA-Shen, risobanura inyanja. Ikarita y'Isi ya Babiloni yita inyanja \"uruzi rusharira\".[1]Itangiriro 2:10\nItangiriro 2:11\nYozefu, Flavius. \"Ibya kera by'Abayahudi - Igitabo cya I\". Igice cya 1.3. Kandi Phison, yerekana imbaga y'abantu, biruka mu Buhinde, isohoka mu nyanja, kandi ni ku Bagereki bitwaga Ganges. Uruzi rwa Efurate narwo, kimwe na Tigris, rumanuka mu Nyanja Itukura.\nImpyisi, Shaul. \"Inzuzi enye ziva muri Edeni ziri he?\". Chabad.org. Byakuwe ku ya 2 Kamena 2018.\nDuncan, George S. (Ukwakira 1929) \"Aho Umuntu Yavukiye\" The Scientific Monthly 29 (4): pp. 359\u2013362, p. 360.\nJames A. Sauer, \"Uruzi Rurakama,\" Biblical Archaeology Review, Vol. 22, No. 4, Nyakanga/Kanama 1996, pp. 52\u201354, 57, 64\nFarouk El-Baz, \"Uruzi ruri mu butayu\", Discover, Nyakanga 1993.\nSandys, Edwin. \"Bibiliya ya Musenyeri\". studybible.info. Byakuwe ku ya 5 Gicurasi 2020.\nDan'el Kahn, igitekerezo kuri Academia.edu, cyashyizwe ahagaragara Kanama 2024\nAncillotti, Sofia. \"Libri d'Oro Ebraici\".&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Side box/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;&lt;templatestyles src=\"Sister project/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;\u00a0"}
{"id": "22802", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22802", "title": "Umugezi wa Chambeshi", "text": "Uruzi rwa Chambeshi (cyangwa Chambezi) rwo mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba bw'igihugu cya Zambiya ni rwo ruzi rufite uburebure bunni cyane kurusha uruzi rwa Kongo (mu burebure) bityo rukaba rufatwa nk'isoko y'uruzi rwa Kongo. (Ariko, ukurikije ingano y'amazi, uruzi rwa Lualaba rutanga mumigezi myinshi igana muri Kongo.)\nChambeshi izamuka nk'umugezi mu misozi yo mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba bwa Zambiya hafi y'ikiyaga cya Tanganyika ku butumburuke bwa hejuru y'inyanja. Itemba ku gipimo cya 480\u00a0km mu bishanga bya Bangweulu, biri mu kiyaga cya Bangweulu. Mu mpera z'igihe cy'imvura muri Gicurasi, uruzi ruzana umwuzure ukongera amazi mu bishanga kandi ukazura ubwatsi bwa Zambezi mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba. Amazi ahita atemba ava mu bishanga nk'uruzi rwa Luapula. \nKu bantu barenga 100\u00a0km y'uburebure bwarwo uko rutemba mu burasirazuba bwa Kasama, uruzi rugizwe n'imiyoboro myinshi mu bishanga bigera kuri 2\u00a0ubugari bwa km, mu kibaya cyuzuyemo amazi kugeza kuri 25\u00a0Ubugari bwa kilometero. Munsi y'uruzi, aho ruhurira n'umuhanda wa Kasama-Mpika na gari ya moshi ya Tazara, umuyoboro munini uhoraho ufite ubugari bwa metero 100, kandi ubugari bwa metero 400 mu gihe cy'umwuzure. "}
{"id": "22803", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22803", "title": "Uruzi rwa Cuvo", "text": "Cuvo ni uruzi ruri muri Angola yo hagati. Umugezi uturuka ku nyanja ya Atalantika ku kigobe cya Benguela, mu ntara ya Cuanza Sul. Kwitwa Cuvo byavuye mu nkengero z'uru ruzi zo hejuru, inzira yo hasi yitwa Keve cyangwa Queve. Uruzi rushobora kugendwamo n'amato ugana ku masumo ya Binga hafi ya Gabela.\nInkombe zayo z'ingenzi zirimo uruzi rwa Cussoi.\nUruzi rushobora kuba ari rwo ruherereye mu majyepfo y'ubwoko bw'inyoni zo muri Afurika. Ikibaya cya amazi cy'uruzi n'ishyamba rya Kumbira ni bimwe mu bigize ahantu h'ingenzi h'inyoni hafite amoko menshi y'inyoni adakunze kuboneka ahandi hantu. \nUmunwa w'uruzi ufite ahantu hameze nk'ibiti bya mangrove. "}
{"id": "22804", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22804", "title": "Umugezi wa Koko (Akarere ka Rusizi)", "text": "Uruzi rwa koko ni uruzi ruherereye mukarere ka rusizi mumajyepfo y'iburengerazuba bw' u rwanda.rukaba ari uzuzi rw'ruhwa rutembera iburyo rugize umupaka uhuza uturere tw'iburengerazuba bw'urwanda n'u burundi mu burebure bwarwo bwinshi runyura muri pariki y'igihugu ya Nyungwe "}
{"id": "22805", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22805", "title": "Umugezi wa Makhaleng", "text": "Uruzi rwa makhaleng ni uruzi rwo mu burengerazuba bwa lesotho. Ruzamuka mu misozi ya maloti, muri rusange rutemba mu cyerekezo cy'amajyepfo rugan ku ruzi rwa Orange ku mupaka na Free State muri Afurika y'epfo. \nIsomo.\nuruzi rutukura mu majyaruguru y'uburengera y'uburengerazuba, ku butumburuke bwa metero 2,886 (ft 9,469) mu misozi ya Machache iri muri Maluti. Rutemba rugana mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba, rukanyura mu misozi miremire ya lesotho, rukanyura,ruknyura mu mijyi n'imidugud nka Molimo-nthuse, Makhaleng, Ramabanta na Qaba. Nyuma yaho, rwisuka mu ruzi rwa Orange ku mupaka uhuza Free State n'igihugu cya Lesotho, hafi y'ikiraro cya Makhaleng. Ku butumburuke bwa metero 1,400 (ibirenge 4,593), ahantu uru ruzi rwa Makhaleng rwisukira mu rwa Orange ni ho hantu h'ubutumburuke buke kurusha ahandi hose muri Lesotho. \nINDANGASOKO"}
{"id": "22807", "revid": "17699", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22807", "title": "Umugezi wa Agwei", "text": "Umugezi Agwei cyangwa umugezi wa Agwei, nanone wandika Agvey, ni umugezi utemba mu ruzi rwa Pibor runyura mu burasirazuba bwa Sudani y'Amajyepfo. Imigezi yarwo irimo imigezi ya Abara na Kongkong. Umugezi ni \"wadi\", cyangwa ravine, gishobora kuma mu gihe cy'izuba ariko kigahita kiba umuyoboro w'amazi bitewe n'imvura nyinshi mu gihe cy'imvura."}
{"id": "22808", "revid": "18373", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22808", "title": "Uruzi rwa Congue", "text": "Congue ni uruzi rwo mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bwa Guin\u00e9e Equatorial. Rugize igice cy'umugezi wa Muni hamwe n'imigezi ya Mitong, Mandyani, Mitimele, Utamboni na Mven.[1][2]"}
{"id": "22809", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22809", "title": "Stormsrivier", "text": "Umugezi wa Storms (Afrikaans) n'uruzi ruri muntara ya Cape y'Iburasirazuba muri Afurika y'Epfo. Umugezi uturuka muri Pariki y'Igihugu ya Tsitsikamma. Inzira ya Otter y'iminsi 5 itangirira kumugezi wa Storms."}
{"id": "22810", "revid": "18374", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22810", "title": "Uruzi rwa Adabay", "text": "uruzi rwa Adabay ni uruzi rwo muri etiyopiya yo hagati hamwe n'uruzi rwa wanchet,rwagennye akarere kahoze ari marra Biete.Inkombe zarwo zirimo chacha,beresa,n'indi migezi itatu ihurira hejuru y'umugezi muremure."}
{"id": "22811", "revid": "17550", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22811", "title": "Uruzi rwa Maputo", "text": "Uruzi rwa Maputo (Portuguese), Ndetse rukunze kwitwa Great Usutu, uruzi rwa Lusutfu, cyangwa uruzi rwa Suthu, ni uruzi rwo muri Afurika y'Epfo, Eswatini, na Mozambike. Izina \"Suthu\" risobanura abaturage ba Basotho bari batuye hafi yarwo, ariko Swaziland yabagabagaho ibitero. Ndeste bikaba bivugwa ko ryasonara ibara ryumukara wijimye, kandi bisobanura amazi y'urwondo yo mu ruzi. Hagati aho izina Maputo risobanura Umwami Mabhudu Tembe, wategetse mu kinyejana cya XVIII muri ako karere. \nIsomo.\nUruzi ruzamuka hafi ya Amsterdam, Mpumalanga, Afurika y'Epfo, Eswatini akaba ariho runyura muburas, aho rwinjira mu misozi ya Lebombo.\u00a0Ikibaya cya km kigize umupaka uri hagati ya Eswatini na Afurika y'Epfo. Ku birometero bigera kuri makumyabiri, kigize umupaka uri hagati ya Afurika y'Epfo (intara ya Kwazulu-Natali) na Mozambike. Aho ngaho, muri Pariki y'inyamaswa ya Ndumo, yinjirira umugezi wayo munini, uruzi rwa Pongola. Uhita unyura mu kibaya cyo ku nkombe za Mozambike ukamena cyangwase ukisuka mu majyepfo ya Maputo Bay, nko muri kilometero 85 uvuye aho. \nMuri Eswatini, uruzi rwitwa Great Usutu cyangwa Lusutfu rutemba no mu mujyi ya Bhunya, Luyengo, Siphofaneni, na Big Bend. Umujyi wa Big Bend uri hafi y'aho uruzi runyura mu buryo butunguranye. Great Usutu ni wo mugezi munini muri Eswatini, niho hari agace gato ka Eswatini (metero 21 hejuru y'inyanja), kandi azwiho kugira amazi yurwererane.ndetse nta ni mijyi minini yabashije kwirema ku hafi yaarwo kubera ibibaya ibibaya birerire bito na mashyamba menshi. Ariko, niho hari ibibuga bimwe na bimwe bya golf, amahoteli, n'ibidukikije.\nImigezi.\nKuva inkomoko kugeza ku munwa, uko bikurikirana, imigezi ni: Sihanahana, Bonnie Brook, Mpuluzi, Buhlungu, Umvenvane, Lusushwana, Sidvokodvo, Mkhondvo, Mhlamani, Mzimneni, Mzimphofu, Mhlathuzane, Mtsindzekwa, Nyetane, Funuane R, "}
{"id": "22812", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22812", "title": "Uruzi rwa South Fork Kern", "text": "Uruzi rwa South Fork Kern ni umugezi utembamo uruzi rwa Kern muri Sierra Nevada muri leta ya California muri Amerika. Ni rumwe mu migezi iri mu majyepfo cyane ku musozi w\u2019iburengerazuba bw\u2019imisozi, kandi rutemba amazi mu gihugu cy\u2019imisozi miremire kandi yumye ifite ku nkengero za Sierra Crest. Agace ko hejuru k'Amajyepfo gaca mu mikokwe miremire, ariko kandi gatuma amazi mu kibaya gishashe kandi cyuzuye ibishanga mbere yo kwinjira mu ruzi rwa Kern ku kiyaga cya Isabella.\nUruzi rutangirira mu ishyamba rya Leta rya Inyo (Inyo National Forest), ku ruhande rwa Tulare ku murongo utandukanya Inyo County na Tulare County, mu kibaya gito ku mpinga ya Sierra Crest, hafi y'inzira ya Pacific Crest Trail. Uruzi runyura mu majyepfo, runyura mu bibaya n'imigezi migari, rugenda rwegera cyane Golden Trout Creek, umugezi w'uruzi rwa Kern uri iburengerazuba. Igice kinini cy'inzira y'uruzi mu majyepfo kiri hafi gato y'iburengerazuba bwa Owens Valley, ikibaya kiri iburasirazuba ku musozi wa Sierra. \nHanyuma uruzi rwinjira mu ishyamba rya Sequoia National Forest maze rufata Trout Creek iburyo. Ukinjira mu mwobo, uruzi runyura mu buso -umugezi munini mbere yo kuva mu misozi hafi ya Onyx. Aho niho wakira umugezi wa Canebrake hanyuma ukerekeza mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba. Hanyuma South Fork Kern inyura muri Weldon na Kern River Preserve. Iyo yegereye ikiyaga cya Isabella amazi yayo yihuta agenda buhoro buhoro akwirakwira mu bishanga binini. Uruzi rwinjira mu kigega kiri ku mpera y'uruzi ruto. Aho rwahuriraga n'uruzi rwa Kern ruri munsi y'ikiyaga, cyagizwe n'urugomero rwa Isabella. \nIkibaya cy'uruzi rwa Lower South Fork Kern cyigeze guturwa n'ubwoko bwa T\u00fcbatulabal na Kawaiisu. Abantu bamaze imyaka igera ku 3.000 batuye ku nkengero z'uruzi. Mu 1834, Joseph R. Walker n'itsinda rye ry'abashakashatsi basuye ku nkengero z'uruzi bagerageza gushaka inzira yo hasi inyura mu misozi ya Sierra Nevada. Mu rugendo rwabo, bavumbuye Walker Pass, kilometero imwe hejuru y'inyanja, iri ku isoko ry'umugezi wa Canebrake, uruzi runini rwa South Fork. Walker yagarutse mu 1843, ayoboye itsinda rya mbere ry'abimukira bambuka Sierra banyuze muri iyo nzira. Ibitero bya zahabu byazanye abacukuzi b'amabuye y'agaciro muri ako gace mu myaka ya 1850 na 1860, kandi imiturire ya mbere ihoraho ku nkengero z'uruzi yubatswe mu 1859. Habayeho amakimbirane hagati y'abashya n'abaturage kavukire, maze umutwe w'ingabo za Amerika, Camp Leonard, ushingwa ku ruzi kugira ngo ugenzure ako gace. \nIgice kinini cy'uruzi gitemba amazi menshi \u2013 nta ngomero zirimo kandi hari inzira nke zo kunyuramo \u2013 uretse kimwe gusa. Mu 1953, urugomero rwa Isabella rwubatswe ku ruzi rwa Kern hafi ya Bodfish n'ingabo za Amerika zishinzwe injeniyeri, rwuzura ibice byo hasi bya North Fork Kern (igiti kinini kiri hejuru ya Isabella) na South Fork Kern munsi y'ikiyaga cya Isabella kugira ngo rutange uburyo bwo kugenzura imyuzure n'amashanyarazi. Ariko, habayeho ibibazo ku nyubako y'urugomero, bitera ibyago byinshi byo kwangirika. Gusenyuka k'urugomero, bishobora guterwa n'umutingito ku cyuho cya Kern Canyon kiri munsi y'inyubako, bishobora kurenga umujyi wa Bakersfield mu masaha make. \nByongeye kandi, ibibaya bya Kern yo hepfo, South Fork Kern na Canebrake Creek bitanga inzira y'ingenzi yo gutwara abantu. Umuhanda wa Leta ya California 178 unyuramo, uhuza Bakersfield na Inyokern, biri ku mpande zombi za Sierra, unyuze kuri Walker Pass. SR178 ni imwe mu nzira nke zinyura muri iki gice cy'imisozi. Uyu muhanda watangiye kubakwa mu myaka ya 1890. Wongewe kuri sisitemu y'imihanda ya leta ya California mu 1919, kandi wakozwemo kaburimbo mu 1940. "}
{"id": "22813", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22813", "title": "Uruzi rwa Munyati", "text": "Uruzi rwa Munyati (ruzwi ku izina ry'uruzi rwa Umniati) ruri muri Zimbabwe. Ku butegetsi bwa Rhodesiya, rwitiriwe Umniati, ariko imyandikire yarwo yahinduwe mu maka 1983 kugira ngo rumeze neza n'imvugo nyayo ya shona.\nUruzi ruturuka mu burasirazuba bwa Mashonalande, mu majyaruguru ya chivuhu, kandi rugera kubiro metero 100 mu majyepfo ya Harare. Utembera hafi mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba kandi igice kinini cy'uburebure bwawo cyabanje kuba umupaka w'amajyepfo y'intara ya Mashonalande. Uruzi ruhuriraho n'uruzi rwa Mupfure (ruzwi kandi nka Umfuli). Munsi y'iyi ngingo, uru ruzi rukunze kwitwa Sanyati. Nyuma y'amazi agera ku ibiro metero 500 uruzi rutemba rujya muri Kariba (igice cya Zambezi kiri hagati y'urugomero rwa Kariba n'ikibaya cya Batoka), bigatuma kiba igice cy'umugezi cya Zambezi.\nUruzi rurahinduka cyane, rugaragaza itandukaniro rikomeye mu miterere y'ikirere hagati y'ibihe by'izuba n'iby'imvura. Hagati y'Ukuboza na Gicurasi rutemba cyane kandi rugera kuri metero 3 mu bujyakuzimu ku kibaya, mu bugari (nubwo ari ndende kuva kuri metero 80 kugeza 100 ayi cy'umwaka, iragabanuka cyane kandi itemba buhoro, akenshi metero 2 gusa ndende, kandi hafi yumuka mu bihe bidasanzwe mu gihe cy'amapfa akomeye; nk'uko byaherukaga mu 1984.\nIgitonyanga kinini ku ruzi kiri ku Masumo ya Gandavaroyi. Nk\u2019uko bivugwa mu rurimi rw\u2019igishona, \"ganda\" bivuga \" gutera \", naho \"varoyi\" bivuga \"abapfumu\", \"mu buryo busanzwe bwo gusiga no gukoresha neza, abaturage bo muri ako gace bise cataract bakurikije umuco mwiza bari bafite wo gutera abapfumu bazwiho kuba hejuru y\u2019isumo. Aha hantu byakekwaga ko ari hera kandi kugeza n\u2019uyu munsi, abaturage bake ni bo bakunda gusura aha hantu. Nyuma y\u2019iki gitonyanga, umugezi munini ni uruzi rwa Mvumvuze runyura muri Vashe."}
{"id": "22815", "revid": "18343", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22815", "title": "Uruzi rwa Kulfo", "text": "Uruzi rwa Kulfo ni uruzi ruri mu majyepfo ya Etiyopiya ruzamuka mu gice cy'iburengerazuba cy'agasozi ka Etiyopiya gakomeye mu misozi ya Guge.\nInyura muri Arba Minch hanyuma ikanyura muri Pariki y'Igihugu ya Nechisar ku gice cy'ubuso kiri hagati y'ikiyaga cya Chamo n'ikiyaga cya Abaya. Ubusanzwe imanuka mu kiyaga cya Chamo ariko ishobora no kumanuka mu kiyaga cya Abaya nyuma y'imvura nyinshi inyuze mu gace k'uburengerazuba bw'amajyepfo y'ikibuga cy'indege cya Arba Minch.\nAhantu ho hasi h'uruzi rwa Kulfo hakora nk'inzira y'amazi yinjira mu kiyaga cya Abaya mu kiyaga cya Chamo iyo hari ikiyaga kinini. Aho amazi y'amazi yiyongereye haba munsi y'umufana w'amazi ku butumburuke bwa metero 1.190 (kuri 6\u00b000\u203239\u2033N 37\u00b035\u203207\u2033E\ufeff / \ufeff6.0109\u00b0N 37.5854\u00b0E). Hanyuma amazi y'ikiyaga asohoka mu kiyaga cya Chamo.[1]\nIkiraro cy'ingenzi ku ruzi cyaravuguruwe mu 2006. Uruzi rwumye cyane mu myaka ya vuba aha.\nIbiranga.\nNi uruzi rufite ubugari bwa metero 300. Rufite ubugari bwa metero 20 hafi y'umunwa warwo, rufite ubuhaname bwa metero 10/km. Ubugari bw'imyenda yo kuryamaho ni mm 14 (urubura).[1]\nUbwikorezi bw'imyanda.\nUruzi rutwara toni 53.480 z'imitwaro yo kuryamaho na toni 327.230 z'ibishanga birekuye buri mwaka mu kiyaga cya Chamo.[1]\nUdukoko two mu turere dushyuha.\nIsesengura rya cytotaxonomic rya chromosomes z'ibibuno zo mu gace k'uruzi rwa Kulfo ryagaragaje ko hari ubwoko bubiri bushya bw'udusimba tw'umukara mu ruzi, Simulium kulfoense na S. soderense; nyamara bitandukanye n'izindi dusimba tw'umukara, ubwo bwoko si bwo butwara Onchocerca volvulus.[1]"}
{"id": "22816", "revid": "17617", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22816", "title": "Uruzi rwa Comaile", "text": "&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Message box/ambox.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;\u00a0\nUruzi rwa Comaile (nanone rwitwa Komalie) rufite isoko hagati y'imijyi ya Adi Keyh na Senafe. Rutemba rugana mu burasirazuba bwa Eritrea kugeza mu mujyi muto wa Foro hafi y'inkombe z'inyanja itukura. Aha hantu ruhurira n'izindi nzuzi ebyiri, uruzi rwa Aligide n'uruzi rwa Haddas. Kuva aha rukomeza kugeza rusendereye mu Nyanja itukura.[1]:\u200a2\u200a\nAmareferensi.\nFinlinson, George T.; Reclamation, Ibiro bya Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika bya (1962). Raporo ku mushinga wa Zula Plain, Eritrea (Raporo). Ikigo gishinzwe iterambere mpuzamahanga."}
{"id": "22817", "revid": "17617", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22817", "title": "Uruzi rwa Atakora", "text": "&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;\u00a0\nUruzi rwa Atakora ni umugezi w\u2019ikiyaga cya Volta muri Ghana, rutemba nko muri kilometero 60 ugana iburasirazuba bw\u2019ikiyaga cya Volta. Inzira yarwo yose iri mu majyepfo ya Ghana.[1]"}
{"id": "22818", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22818", "title": "Uruzi rwa Alwero", "text": "Umugezi wa Alwero (nanone wandikwa Aloru, Aluoro na Alwero) ni umugezi muri Abobo wearda wo mu karere ka Gambela, muri Etiyopiya. Itemba muri parike y'igihugu ya Gambela no mu bishanga ukaruhukira mu ruzi rwa Openo / Baro.\nMu mwaka wa 2012, Saudi Star yateganyaga kuyobya amazi menshi ava mu ruzi anyuze mu umuyoboro wa sima wo kuhira umuceri. "}
{"id": "22819", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22819", "title": "Ikiyaga cya Aguelmame Sidi Ali", "text": "Aguelmame Sidi Ali ni ikiyaga cyo mu Ntara ya Kh\u00e9nifra, B\u00e9ni Mellal-Kh\u00e9nifra, muri Maroc. Aguelmame Sidi Ali iherereye ku butumburuke bwa metero 2,080, ifite ubuso bungana na n'uburebure bwa. Iri hafi y'umupaka w'intara ya Ifrane mu misozi ya Middle Atlas. Ni igice cya Pariki y'Igihugu ya Khenifra, agace karinzwe kashinzwe mu 2008. \nIbisobanuro.\nIkiyaga giherereye mu misozi ya Middle Atlas ku butumburuke bwa kandi ifite ubuso bungana na. Yakorewe muri Upper Miocene / Quaternary aho ibice bibiri bihurira. Iherereye mu mwobo karemano mu rutare rwa basalt kandi ikorwa mu bibaya bibiri, bitandukanyijwe n'umuraba w'amazi ugaragara iyo urugero rw'amazi rugabanutse. Itungwa n'amazi atemba, urubura rushonga n'amasoko ya karst. pH ni 9.1 kandi ubutare burimo ni buke cyane hamwe n'ubushobozi bwo gutwara amashanyarazi bwa 1200\u20131600 uScm-1. \nUbumenyi bw'ibidukikije.\nAgace gakikije ikiyaga kari gafite amashyamba meza arimo Atlas cedar (\"Cedrus atlantica\"), ariko vuba aha, iri shyamba ryangiritse kandi agace gakikije ikiyaga kabaye ibihuru byumye, byuzuye amahwa byiganjemo juniper yo muri Esipanye (\"Juniperus thurifera\"). Plankton n'ibimera biri mu kiyaga bikungahaye kuri diatome, cyane cyane ibyo mu bwoko bwa \"Cyclotella\", kandi ibi byakoreshejwe mu gutanga ibimenyetso by'imiterere y'ikirere n'impinduka zijyanye n'ikirere cy'amazi mu kiyaga mu myaka myinshi ishize. \nMu mwaka wa 2005, Aguelmams Sidi Ali / Tifounassine complex, ibishanga bitatu byo mu misozi biri ku butumburuke buri hagati ya, byagizwe ahantu ha Ramsar; bitanga ahantu hakomeye ho gucumbikira inyoni zo mu bishanga zimuka mu gihe cy'itumba harimo n'inyoni zo mu bwoko bwa ruddy shelduck (\"Tadorna ferruginea\") n'inyoni zo mu bwoko bwa crested coot (\"Fulica cristata\"). Kugabanuka kw'imvura byatumye amazi y'ikiyaga agabanuka, kandi igishanga cyari kiri ku mpera y'uburengerazuba bw'amajyepfo ntikikiriho. Kuba abashumba b'inka n'ihene baragiraga amashyo y'intama n'ihene mu mpeshyi no mu mpeshyi byakuyeho ibimera byo mu mazi ku nkengero z'ikiyaga. Umubare muto w'inyoni zo mu mazi zisura ikiyaga mu gihe cy'itumba kandi inyoni nini yo mu bwoko bwa crested grebe ntiyororokera hano. Nubwo irinzwe, inyoni zo mu bwoko bwa ruddy shelduck n'izindi nyoni zo mu gasozi zihura n'ubujura bw'amafi. \nIki kiyaga cyari ahantu honyine ku isi habaga \"Salmo pallaryi\", ubwoko bw'inyamaswa zo mu bwoko bwa trout, ariko ayo mafi yarazimye nyuma y'uko inyoni yo mu bwoko bwa common carp (\"Cyprinus carpio\") irekuwe mu kiyaga mu 1934. Pike yo mu majyaruguru (\"Esox lucius\") na zander (\"Sander lucioperca\"), ni andi moko y'amafi atari ay'umwimerere nayo yazanywe muri icyo kiyaga. "}
{"id": "22820", "revid": "18343", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22820", "title": "Volta y'umweru", "text": "Volta y'umweru cyangwa Nakamb\u00e9 (mu gifaransa: Volta blanche) ni yo nkomoko y'uruzi rwa Volta, umuyoboro w'amazi mukuru wa Ghana.[1][2] Volta y'umweru ituruka mu majyaruguru ya Burkina Faso, inyura mu majyaruguru ya Ghana ikajya mu kiyaga cya Volta muri Ghana.[1] Imigezi ikomeye ya Volta y'umweru ni Volta y'umukara na Volta y'umutuku.[1]\nInzira n'ikibaya.\nVolta Yera ni imwe mu migezi y\u2019ingenzi y\u2019uruzi rwa Volta. Ituruka muri Burkina Faso nka Nakanb\u00e9 ikamanuka mu majyepfo igana mu majyaruguru ya Ghana kugira ngo ikore ikiyaga cya Volta.[3] Ikibaya cy\u2019uruzi rwa Volta kigizwe n\u2019ibibaya by\u2019amazi by\u2019uruzi rwa Volta n\u2019amashami yarwo atandukanye, harimo ibibaya by\u2019amazi bya Volta Yera, Volta Yirabura, Volta Itukura, Oti, na Volta yo hasi.[4]\nIkibaya cya White Volta giherereye mu bice bimwe na bimwe bya Burkina Faso na Gana. Muri Gana, White Volta ni ingenzi mu karere k'amajyaruguru y'igihugu, aho itanga amahirwe yo kubaho mu cyaro binyuze mu buhinzi bwo mu bibaya byuzuyemo imyuzure, kuhira amatungo, kuroba no gukoresha amazi yo mu ngo.[5] Akamaro kayo kari mu kuba umuyoboro w'amazi yo muri Afurika y'Iburengerazuba anyura mu turere dutandukanye twa Volta.\nImigezi.\nVolta Yera ihera ku ruzi rwitwa Nakanb\u00e9 muri Burkina Faso. Volta Itukura, cyangwa Nazinon, kimwe na Sissili, ni bibiri mu migezi minini ya Volta Yera, kandi ikomoka no muri Burkina Faso.[4] Hariho kandi Volta Yirabura, cyangwa Mouhoun, imwe mu mashami y'ingenzi muri sisitemu ya Volta; icyakora, igomba gufatwa ukwayo nk'isoko ry'uruzi rwa Volta rwose.[4][3]\nImigezi ya White Volta iha uruzi akamaro karwo mu karere kubera ko amazi n'ubushobozi bwo kuzura ku nkengero z'uruzi biterwa n'ingano y'imvura muri Burkina Faso.[6]\nVolta y'umweru ni isoko ikomeye y'amazi yo kunywa ku baturage benshi bo ku nkengero zayo no kure y'umuyoboro w'amazi. Inatera imyuzure mu bihe by'umwaka ku baturage benshi bo ku nkengero zayo.[7]"}
{"id": "22821", "revid": "17617", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22821", "title": "Uruzi rwa Nini", "text": "Nini ni uruzi ruri mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bwa Ghana. Ni rumwe mu ruzi rwahawe izina rya Pariki y'Igihugu ya Nini-Suhien (ubu ibarizwa mu gace gashinzwe kubungabunga ibidukikije ka Ankasa).[1] Itemba mu ruzi rwa Tano."}
{"id": "22822", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22822", "title": "Umugezi wa Swart", "text": "Umugezi wa Swart ruturuka hafi ya Caledon, Western Cape, Afurika y'Epfo, rukamanuka mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba, ahoruhurira n'uruzi rwa Bot mumajyaruguru ya Hermanus."}
{"id": "22823", "revid": "18373", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22823", "title": "Uruzi rwa Coporolo", "text": "Coporolo ni uruzi rugenda ruhagarara muri Angola. Rutemba muri Dombe Grande mu Ntara ya Benguela. Hari igihe rwafatwaga nk'umugezi uhoraho.[1] Inka yarwo iri ku Nyanja ya Atalantika kandi ubuso bw'amazi bugera kuri kilometero kare 15,674 (6,052 mi).\nImyuzure y'ibihe ni ikibazo gikomeje kugaragara aho abantu 6.700 bakuwe mu byabo bazize umwuzure muri Nyakanga 2011. [2] Imirimo yo kugenzura imyuzure y'ibihe kugira ngo barinde umujyi n'imirima yagombaga gukorwa mu mwaka ukurikiyeho."}
{"id": "22824", "revid": "17783", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22824", "title": "Uruzi rwa Faro", "text": "Uruzi rwa Faro ni umugezi ufite uburebure bwa kilometero 310 utemba ukata ku mupaka uhuza Nijeriya na Kameruni muri Afurika. Uyu mugezi ukomoka mu gace k'imisozi miremire twa Adamawa (Adamawa Plateau) gasanzwe gaherereye mu majyepfo y\u2019uburasirazuba bw\u2019umujyi wa Ngaound\u00e9r\u00e9, mu Karere ka Adamawa muri Kameruni. Faro iza kwisuka mu ruzi rwa Benue, aho rurema ihuriro ryazo neza neza ku mupaka uhuza ibi bihugu byombi\nAmareferensi.\n&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Coordinates/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;9\u00b020\u203200\u2033N 12\u00b055\u203230\u2033E\ufeff / \ufeff9.3333\u00b0N 12.9250\u00b0E\ufeff / 9.3333; 12.9250"}
{"id": "22825", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22825", "title": "Umugezi Tamboti", "text": "Umugezi rwa Tamboti ni uruzi rurimu Ntara ya Limpopo muri Afurika y'Epfo. N'uruzi rutembera iburyo rw'uruzi rurerure rwa Limpopo. "}
{"id": "22826", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22826", "title": "Uruzi rwa Angereb", "text": "Angereb izwi kandi nka Bahr as-Salam ni umugezi wo muri Etiyopiya na Sudani y'iburasirazuba, rukaba rumwe mu masoko ya Nili. Ruzamuka hafi ya Daqwa, mu majyaruguru y'umujyi wa Gondar mu Karere ka Amhara, rutemba rugana iburengerazuba rugana ku ruzi rwa Atbarah. Akarere k'amateka ka Armachiho gaherereye ku nzira yako. \nUrugomero rwa Angereb, rwatangiye gukoreshwa mu mwaka wa 1997, rwari rugamije gukemura ikibazo cy'amazi meza mu mujyi mu gihe cy'imyaka 25. Ikigega cya Angereb n'amasoko y'amazi yo munsi y'ubutaka abiri ni byo bitanga amazi menshi muri uyu mujyi, hamwe n'ubushobozi bwo gukora bwa metero kube 8,298 ku munsi."}
{"id": "22827", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22827", "title": "Uruzi rwa Black Kei", "text": "Uruzi rwa Black Kei, ruva mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bwa Queenstown, nyuma rugahura n'uruzi rwa White Kei, zikabyara uruzi rwa Great Kei. Imidugudu myinshi iherereye ku nkombe zarwo, harimo McBride Village, Qabi, Ntabelanga, Thornhill, Loudon, Mitford, Basoto, Baccle's Farm na Tentergate. \nUrugomero rwa Thrift ni rwo rugira akamaro gakomeye nk' ikigega cy' amazi kuri uruzi. Kuri ubu uru ruzi ni igice cya.. \nIgice cyo hejuru cy'uru ruzi kigize umupaka wo mu burengerazuba Tsolwana Nature Reserve, kandi hagati mu myaka ya 1800, Black Kei n'umugezi wayo wa Klipplaat byagize urubibi rw'amajyaruguru rwa Kaffraria y'Abongereza. Imigezi ya Klaas Smits na Klipplaat niyo migezi ikomeye igeramo. "}
{"id": "22828", "revid": "17699", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22828", "title": "Umugezi wa Ataba", "text": "Umugezi wa Ataba ni umugezi wo mu majyaruguru ya Etiyopiya ukaba n'umugezi wa Tekez\u00e9. "}
{"id": "22829", "revid": "17617", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22829", "title": "Uruzi rwa Kulpawn", "text": "&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;\u00a0\nUruzi rwa Kulpawn ni rumwe mu migezi minini yo mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bwa Ghana, hamwe n'imigezi ya Black Volta na Sisili. Rutemba mu Karere ka Municipal ka Wa.[1] Ishyamba ry'inkombe rikikije inkengero za Kulpawn muri Wahabu rikunzwe cyane n'abahanga mu by'inyoni, bitewe n'ubwoko bwinshi bw'inyoni.[2].\nUruzi runyura mu kigo cy\u2019umutungo wa Gbele uturutse iburengerazuba ugana mu majyepfo y\u2019uburasirazuba. Wilks, Ivor (4 Nyakanga 2002). Wa na Wala: Isilamu na Politiki mu Majyaruguru y'Amajyaruguru ya Ghana. Cambridge University Press. p. 10. ISBN 978-0-521-89434-0.\nBriggs, Philip (4 Mutarama 2014). Ghana. Bradt Travel Guides. p. 474. ISBN 978-1-84162-478-5.\n\"Urupapuro rw'ingenzi rw'amakuru yerekeye uturere tw'inyoni: Gbele Resource Reserve (inyandiko)\"\". www.birdlife.org. Byakuwe ku ya 3 Kamena 2021."}
{"id": "22830", "revid": "18343", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22830", "title": "Uruzi rwa Sene", "text": "Uruzi rwa Sene ni uruzi rwa Ghana.[1] Rutemba mu Karere ka Sene."}
{"id": "22831", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22831", "title": "Umugezi wa Ataye", "text": "Ataye ni umugezi uri muri Etiyopiya yo hagati. utemba mu ruzi rwa Awash unyuze mu gace k'umugezii utiswe izina. "}
{"id": "22832", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22832", "title": "Uruzi rwa Caledon", "text": "Uruzi rwabanje kwitwa \"Prinses Wilhelminas Rivier\" mu 1777, na Koloneli RJ Gordon.Umugezi wa caledon ni uruzi runini ruherereye muri afurika y'epfo yo hagati. uburebure bwarwo bwose ni 642 km (399 mi), izamuka mu misozi ya Drakensberg ku mupaka wa Lesotho, itemba yerekeza mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba hanyuma igana iburengerazuba mbere yo kwinjira mu ruzi rwa Orange hafe ya bethulie mu majyepfo ya leta ya free. \nUbumenyi Bw'isi.\nUruzi rwa Caledon ruturuka mu cyahoze ari Bantustan cya QwaQwa, hafi y'umupaka na Lesotho, mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bwa Witsieshoek. Nyuma yaho, rutemba rugana mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba, rugana ku murwa mukuru wa Lesotho, Maseru, kandi rugakora umupaka uhuza Afurika y'Epfo na Lesotho mbere yo kwinjira mu ntara ya Free State muri Afurika y'Epfo (mu majyaruguru ya Wepener). Rugana mu burengerazuba mbere yo kwinjira mu ruzi rwa Orange hafi ya Bethulie mu majyepfo ya Free State, mbere gato y'uko rwisuka mu rugomero rwa Gariep. Uburebure bwarwo bwose ni nka kilometero 480 (ibirometero 300), kandi ikibaya cyarwo kigira impinduka zikomeye z'ubushyuhe. Ubutaka buri hagati y'uruzi rwa Caledon n'uruzi rwa Orange bugize Pariki y'ibidukikije ya Tussen-die-Riviere ifite ubuso bwa hegitari 22,000. \nUruzi.\nUruzi ni rwo soko y'amazi ya Maseru, umurwa mukuru wa Lesotho, uhagaze ku ruzi. Mu gihe cy'imvura nke, hashobora kubaho ibura ry'amazi. Kugira ngo ibi birwanye, hakozwe ibigega byinshi bifite inyubako nk'urugomero rwa Muela n'urugomero rwa Meulspruit. Mu 2003, amazi yavuye hano kugira ngo hirindwe &lt;amapfa&gt;. \nIkibaya cya Caledon ni ingenzi mu mateka y'abaturage ba Basotho. Aka gace kari gafite ubukungu bwinshi kandi kashoboraga guhingwa nta kuhira. Ibi byatumye kiba cyiza kandi ni kimwe mu byateye amakimbirane hagati ya Basotho n'Ababoeri. Ibigori bihingwa ku bwinshi mu kibaya cya Caledon. "}
{"id": "22833", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22833", "title": "Umugezi waTimbavati", "text": "Umugezi wa Timbavati ni uruzi ruri mu Ntara ya Mpumalanga mur'Afurika y'Epfo. Rutemba cyane cyane muri Pariki y'Igihugu ya Kruger nyumayo kwinjira muri Pariki yegeranye n'inkambi ya Maroela Caravan."}
{"id": "22834", "revid": "18373", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22834", "title": "Umugezi wa Chongwe", "text": "Uruzi rwa Chongwe ni uruzi rwo muri Zambiya.[1] Uruzi rutangirira mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba bw'umurwa mukuru Lusaka, kandi iruhande rw'uruzi runini rwa Kafue, rutemba mu ruzi rwa Zambezi. Rugize urubibi rw'iburengerazuba bwa Pariki y'Igihugu ya Zambezi yo hasi.[2]"}
{"id": "22835", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22835", "title": "Uruzi rwa Nyando", "text": "&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;\u00a0\nUruzi rwa Nyando ruri mu burengerazuba bwa Kenya, runyura mu turere twa Kericho, Nandi, na Kisumu mbere yo kwisuka mu kiyaga cya Victoria. Uru ruzi n'ikibaya cyarwo bigira uruhare runini mu bijyanye n'amazi, ubukungu, n'ibidukikije by'ikibaya cy'ikiyaga cya Victoria. Uru ruzi rufite uburebure bwa kilometero hafi 153.\nUbumenyi bw'isi.\nUmugezi wa Nyando ukomoka mu misozi miremire y'ishyamba rya Tinderet mu misozi ya Nandi no mu turere tw'agace k'umugezi wa Mau. Rutemba rugana iburengerazuba runyuze mu Karere ka Kericho na Muhoroni rwerekeza mu kibaya cya Nyando cyo mu Karere ka Kisumu, runyura hafi ya Ahero mu kibaya cya Kano mbere yo kwisuka mu kigobe cya Winam mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba bw'ikiyaga cya Victoria.. \nUruzi n'amazi.\nUruzi rwa Nyando rufite ubuso bwa kilometero kare 3.600, aho ubutumburuke bwarwo buri hagati ya metero 2.700 hamwe na metero 1.100. Iki kibaya kigira ibihe bibiri by'imvura mu mwaka, ibyo bikaba bigira uruhare mu kuzura kuruzi haba imvura yaguye igihe kirekire cyangwa igihe kigufi. \nImyuzure ku ruzi rwa Nyando ni ikibazo gikunze kugaragara, cyane cyane mu duce tw' ibibya bya Kano, Ahero, Kadibo, na Nyando. Mu 1961 habaye imyuzure ikomeye yakurikiye El Ni\u00f1o yo mu 1997 - 1998, naho mu 2020 amazi yasubiye mu kiyaga cya Victoria yuzura mu midugudu yo muri Ahero na Kano y' iburengerazuba. Imvura nyinshi no gutema amashyamba yo mu misozi bitera gutenguka kubutaka buri kunkome ya amazi, guiba kw'imiyoboro ya amazi no kwimuka kwa baturage. Kugira ngo tugabanye izo ngaruka mbi, inzego za leta n'imiryango itegamiye kuri leta (imiryango itegamiye kuri leta) barimo gushyira mu bikorwa imishinga itandukanye yo kurwanya imyuzure no gucunga amazi. \nibidukikije.\nIbishanga, n\u2019ibyatsi byo mu misozi miremire ni bimwe mu biba mu gace gatuwe n\u2019abantu benshi mu kibaya cya Nyando. Ibi binyabuzima ni ingenzi mu kororoka kw\u2019amafi, inyoni nyinshi, no kuyungurura amazi mu kiyaga cya Victoria. Ariko, iterambere ry\u2019ubuhinzi, gukurura amafi, n\u2019umwanda uturuka mu mijyi n\u2019amazi aturuka mu mirima bibangamira ubuzima bw\u2019ibidukikije. \nimikoreshereze y'ubutaka.\nBitewe n'ibumba, biragoye kuvoma amazi gusa birakwiriye cyane guhingamo umuceri, uyu mugezi ukoreshwa ni bigo bitandukanye mukuhira, harimo na gahunda yo kuhira ya Ahero, ikoreshwa n'Ikigo cy'Igihugu gishinzwe kuhira kandi bigatanga umusaruro w'umuceri, ibigori, n'imboga. Abaturage bo muri iki kibaya bakoresha uyu mugezi mu kuroba, gushaka amazi yo gukoresha mu ngo, no mu buhinzi buciriritse. Mu myaka ya vuba aha, habayeho imbaraga zo gushishikariza imicungire irambye y'ubutaka no kongera gutera amashyamba mu miyoboro miremire. Inkombe z'umugezi zicukurwa cyane kugira ngo haboneke umucanga ukoreshwa mu bwubatsi muri ako karere.\nIndangasoko.\nImigezi ya Kenya"}
{"id": "22836", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22836", "title": "Uruzi rwa Daga (Sudani y'Amajyepfo)", "text": "&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;\u00a0\nUruzi rwa DAGA(khor Daga) ni uruzi uri muri sudan yamajyepfo.ruzamuka mu misozi yo muri zone ya Mirab welaga. muri etiyopia,iburasirazuba bw'umupaka wa sudani yamajepfo na etiyopia aho ruzwi nka DEQE SONKA SHET.Rutemba rugana iburengerazuba runyuze mumujyi wa DAGA POST mu bishanga bya MACHAR MARSHES "}
{"id": "22837", "revid": "18373", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22837", "title": "Uruzi rwa Chitake", "text": "Uruzi rwa Chitake runyura muri Pariki y'Igihugu ya Mana Pools, muri Zimbabwe, kandi rufite isoko mu kibaya cya Zambezi. Isoko ni isoko idashira iri ku misozi miremire, itemba kilometero imwe mu nkuta z'umugezi. Uruzi rutemba mu ruzi rwa Rukomechi.\nHari ahantu hanini hanini hashashe ibisigazwa by'ibinyabuzima ku ruzi rwa Chitake, aho habonetse umubare munini wa Syntarsus rhodesiensis.\nInkomoko:"}
{"id": "22838", "revid": "17987", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22838", "title": "Uruzi rwa Tano", "text": "Uruzi rwa Tano cyangwa Tano\u00e9 (Igifaransa: Rivi\u00e8re Tano) ni uruzi rwo muri Gana. Rutemba mu birometero 400 uvuye mu mujyi witwa Traa, akarere ka Techiman, umurwa mukuru w\u2019Akarere ka Bono k\u2019Iburasirazuba muri Repubulika ya Gana ukagera kuri Ehy Lagoon, Tendo Lagoon hanyuma amaherezo Aby Lagoon muri Ivory Coast aho winjira mu Nyanja ya Atalantika. Uruzi rwa Tano rugize ibirometero bike bya nyuma by\u2019umupaka mpuzamahanga w\u2019ubutaka hagati ya Gana na Ivory Coast.[1][2] [3]\nImyizerere y\u2019abaturage kavukire ya Bond ivuga ko Taakora, imana nini cyane ya Bono ku Isi, ituye ku isoko y\u2019uruzi.[1]\nInyamaswa nke za nyuma za Miss Waldron's Red Colobus (Piliocolobus badius waldronae), imwe mu nyamaswa ziri mu kaga gakomeye ku isi, bikekwa ko ziba mu ishyamba riri hagati y'uruzi na Ehy Lagoon.[1] Hagati mu mwaka wa 2008, aka gace kateganijwe gutemwa n'Unilever, hagamijwe kugasimbuza imirima y'ibitoki.[2][3]\nMuri Mutarama 2020, ikamyo yari irimo aside sulfure nyinshi yaguye mu ruzi rwa Tano. Ku ya 13 Mutarama abaturage bagiriwe inama yo kutanywa amazi kubera umwanda. Kuva icyo gihe uruzi rwasubijwe uko rwari rumeze mbere.[1]"}
{"id": "22839", "revid": "17699", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22839", "title": "Umugezi wa Awetu", "text": "Awetu ni umugezi uri mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bwa Etiyopiya, uherereye mu ntara ya Oromia. haruguru yawo higanje ibikorwa by'ubuhinzi; hanyuma umugezi utemba ugana mu mujyi wa Jimma. Ni umugezi utembamo umugezi wa Gilgel Gibe. \nIkigereranyo cy'amazi y'imvura awinjiramo ku mwaka asaga mm 1699. Ubuso bw\u2019icyogogo ni km 81.9. Ubutumburuke bw\u2019icyogogo ni metero 1698 kugeza 2589 hejuru y\u2019ubuso bw\u2019inyanja. Icyogogo cy'umugezi ahanini giherereye mu cyaro kandi gikorerwaho ubuhinzi, naho igice cy\u2019iburengerazuba kikaba cyugarijwe n\u2019amashyamba. "}
{"id": "22840", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22840", "title": "Uruzi rwa Kolinbin\u00e9", "text": "Uruzi rwa Kolinbin\u00e9 (Igifaransa: \"Rivi\u00e8re Kolinbin\u00e9\") ni uruzi ruri muri Afurika y'Iburengerazuba. Ruturuka mu majyepfo ya Mauritaniya rukamanuka, rukaba igice cy'umupaka mpuzamahanga hagati ya Mauritaniya na Mali. Muri Mali, ruhura n'uruzi rwa S\u00e9n\u00e9gal 5km uvuye mu mujyi wa Kayes.\nUruzi rutemba mu mwobo muke wuzuyemo amazi mu gihe cy'imvura nke (Nyakanga kugeza Nzeri). Ikiyaga kinini muri byo ni ikiyaga cya Magui kimara hafi imyaka 30.\u00a0km mu cyerekezo cy'amajyaruguru ugana mu majyepfo. Ikiyaga kiri kuri 55km mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba bwa Kayes kuri"}
{"id": "22841", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22841", "title": "Akalamm Abkhane", "text": "Akalamm Abkhane (izwi kandi ku izina ry'Ikiyaga cy'Umukara) ni ikiyaga giherereye hafi muri ikomoka mu Ntara ya Kh\u00e9nifra. Igaragaza ikimenyetso cy'ingenzi cy'ibidukikije mu Ntara ya Khenifra, cyane cyane mu karere ka Temdaghas Ait Lahcen. \nIki kiyaga gituwe n'amoko atandukanye y'inyoni, harimo imbata n'inkoko z'umukara. Ariko, nta mafi arimo bitewe n'imyunyu ngugu irimo uburozi, nka lisansi, ndetse n'umunyu mwinshi mu mazi yacyo. \nIkiyaga ni agace karemano gatuwe n'amasoko yo munsi y'ubutaka, cyane cyane ku buryo buzwi cyane kubera ubujyakuzimu bwabyo, cyane cyane ku ruhande rw'iburasirazuba. Iki kiyaga giherereye ku butumburuke bwa, ifite ubuso bwa, ifite ubujyakuzimu bugera kuri. "}
{"id": "22842", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22842", "title": "Uruzi rwa Amisa", "text": "Uruzi rwa Amisa (ruzwi kandi ku mazina ya Ochi Amisa, Okyi-Amisa, Eminsa)kye, na Emisa Okye) rutangira kandi rutangirira kandi rugatembera mu karere ka Central muri Ghana. Runyura mu mujyi wa Mankessim, hanyuma rugasuka mu Kiyaga cya Amisa Lagoon), mbere yo kwinjira mu Nyanja ya Gulf of Guinea, mu majyepfo gato y'agace ka Suprudu, hafi y'umujyi wa Saltpond. \nIkibaya cy'amazi (basin) cy'uruzi rwa Amisa gifite ubuso bungana na kilometero kare 15,576 (15,576 km\u00b2).Mu mwaka wa 2007, iki kibaya cyari gituwe n'abaturage bake ugereranyije n'ibindi bibaya by'inzui bituranye, aho hari impuzandengo y'abaturage 150 kuri kilometero kare imwe.\nAgace k'amazi yegeranywa n'uruzi (drainage area) gafite ubuso bwa kilometero kare 1,368 (1,368 km\u00b2), kandi mu mwaka wa 1998, byagereranijwe ko amazi y'uru ruzi yatemberaga ku gipimo cya metero kibe 12.8 ku isegonda (12.8 m\u00b3/s) ku mpuzandengo y'umwaka.\nuru ruzi ruzwiho kugira ibishanga binini kandi byinshi (Extensive wetlands) ndetse n'umwana mugari uhurira n'inyanja (wide inlet) aho rusukira mu Nyanja ya Gulf of Guinea.\nUruzi rwa Amisa ni rumwe mumasoko icyenda y'ingenzi atanga amazi meza yo kunywa mu karere ka Central muri Ghana. Sisitemu yo gutunganya no gukwirirakwiza ayo mazi iherereye ahitwa Baifikrom Headworks.\nNanone kandi, uru ruzi rufite uruhare rukomeye mu kuhira imyaka ku buhinzi, kuko amazi yarwo akoreshwa mu bikorwa by'ubuhinzi bitandukanye. kiyaga cyarwo cya Amisa Lagoon, gifite ubuso bwa kilometero kare 2.1 (2.1 km\u00b2), gifite akamaro kanini mu gukora umunyu no mu bworozi bw'amafi n'uburobyi, bikaba bifasha mu mibereho n'ubukungu bw'abaturage bahaturiye.\nUruzi rwa Amisa rugaburira kimwe mu byuzi bibiri binini biri mu ishyamba gakondo ritagatifu rya Nananom Pow, ari cyo cyuzi kizwi ku izina rya Atsendu Pond. Iki cyuzi gifite agaciro gakomeye mu muco n'imigenzo y'abaturahe baho, kuko gifatwa nk'ahantu hera kandi hafite amateka yihariye."}
{"id": "22843", "revid": "18374", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22843", "title": "Uruzi rwa Fah", "text": "Uruzi rwa Fah\nni uruzi rwo muri eritreyarwisuku mu ruzi rwa anseba,igice\ncy'ikibaya cy'uruzi rwa Barka.Retembera iruhande rw'umudugudu wa Fah.\nWari ikigo gikomeye cy'ishyaka ryaba \"Eitrea people's Liberation Front\"mu gihe cy'intambara y'ubwigengebwa Eritrea."}
{"id": "22844", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22844", "title": "Umugezi wa Tongwane", "text": "Uruzi rwa Tongwane nuruzi ruri mu Ntara ya Limpopo, muri Afurika y'Epfo. Rutemba rugana mu majyepfo kandi n'umugezi wa Olifants, ruwuhuriraho mumajyepfo y'uburasirazuba bwa Polokwane.\nUmugezi wa Tongwane rushobora kuba witiriwe abarwanyi ba Mohlatlole barwanyintambara hafi ya Mafefe muri Limpopo mumyaka ya 1500."}
{"id": "22845", "revid": "17618", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22845", "title": "Uruzi rwa Great Brak (uruzi)", "text": "&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;\u00a0\n&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;\u00a0\nUruzi rwa Great Brak River (Afrikaans: Groot-Brakeivier) ni uruzi ruri mu gace ka Cape y'Iburengerazuba, muri Afurika y'Epfo. Aho uru ruzi ruturuka mu mujyi wa Great Brak River uherereye munsi y'Umujyi wa Mossel Bay. Imijyi yegereye ni Mossel Bay, 24\u00a0km mu burengerazuba, n'umujyi munini mu karere ka George, 34\u00a0km iburasirazuba ukoresheje umuhanda.\nInkombe z'ingenzi za Great Brak ni uruzi rwa Perdeberg, uruzi rwa Tweeriviere n'uruzi rwa Varings. Uruzi rwa Wolwedans ni rwo rugomero rwonyine ruri muri urwo ruzi.\nMu 1734, Jan de la Fontaine, Guverineri w\u2019Intara ya Cape, yigaruriye Mossel Bay nk\u2019ikigo cy\u2019Abaholandi cy\u2019Ubuhinde bw\u2019Iburasirazuba, n'uruzi rwa Great Brak rutangazwa ko ari rwo rubibi rw\u2019iburasirazuba bwa Cape. Uru ruzi ntirugomba kwitiranywa n\u2019uruzi rwa Brak mu Ntara ya Limpopo."}
{"id": "22846", "revid": "17783", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22846", "title": "Uruzi rwa Damas (Eritereya)", "text": "Uruzi rwa Damas ni uruzi ruba mubihembwe byibihe bitandukanye muri eritrea.runyura hanze yumujyi wa ghinda. &lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;\u00a0\n&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Coordinates/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;15\u00b042\u203242.088\u2033N 39\u00b06\u203217.467\u2033E\ufeff / \ufeff15.71169111\u00b0N 39.10485194\u00b0E\ufeff / 15.71169111; 39.10485194"}
{"id": "22847", "revid": "17699", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22847", "title": "Umugezi wa Ayesha", "text": "Umugezi wa Ayesha ni umugezi usanzwe uboneka mu Burasirazuba bwa Etiyopiya. Ikibaya cy'amazi yawo kiri mu gice cy'Uburasirazuba bwa Afurika.\nIncamake.\nMinisiteri y\u2019Umutungo w\u2019Amazi ya Etiyopiya yashyize ubuso bw\u2019amazi ya Ayesha mu rutonde rw\u2019ibibaya cumi na bibiri binini mu gihugu. Gifite ubuso bwa kilometero kare 2.223, ariko ntabwo ingano y'amazi utwara izwi. "}
{"id": "22848", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22848", "title": "Umushinga Amazi.Rw", "text": "Amazi.rw ni gahunda y'ibisubizo byo kwegeranya amazi y'imvura, kuyayungurura no kuyageza ku bayakoresha nk'amazi meza yo kunywa. Iyi gahunda ikorwa na Water Access Rwanda mu Rwanda, igamije kongera uburyo bwo kubona amazi meza, kugabanya ikiguzi cy'amazi no guteza imbere ikoreshwa ry'amazi y'imvura mu ngo, amashuri n'ibigo by'ubucuruzi.\nAmavu n'amavuko.\nAmazi.rw yatangijwe mu mwaka wa 2020 nk'umushinga ugamije guteza imbere ikoreshwa ry'amazi y'imvura no kuyahindura amazi meza ashobora gukoreshwa mu kunywa no mu mirimo ya buri munsi. Umushinga wavutse mu rwego rwo gukemura ibibazo bifitanye isano n'ikiguzi cy'amazi, imyuzure iterwa n'amazi atabungabunzwe neza, ndetse n'ikibazo cy'ibura ry'amazi meza mu bice bitandukanye\nIkorana buhanga mugufata neza Amazi yumushinga wa Amazi.rw.\nSisitemu ya Amazi.rw ikoresha uburyo bwo kwegeranya amazi y'imvura ku bisenge, ikayanyuza mu byiciro bitandukanye byo kuyungurura mbere yo kuyageza ku bayakoresha. Iyi sisitemu ishobora gukoresha amazi y'imvura cyangwa andi mazi asanzwe, hagamijwe gutanga amazi meza ku mavomo yose yo mu nyubako."}
{"id": "22849", "revid": "16452", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22849", "title": "Uruzi rwa Tsomo", "text": "Uruzi rwa Tsomo n'uruzi rurimu Ntara ya Cape y'Iburasirazuba mur'Afurika y'Epfo. N'umugezi utembamo uruzi rwa Great Kei.\nUruzi rwagizweho ingaruka n'umwanda waturutse kumushinga wogutunganya amazi yanduye utararangira wasizwiheruheru kandi wangijwe. \nAbashakashatsi bavumbuyingero z'udukoko turwanya imiti mumazi y'uruzi rwa Tsomo. "}
{"id": "22850", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22850", "title": "Umugezi wa Casamance", "text": "Uruzi rwa Casamance (mu gifaransa: \"Fleuve Casamance\") ruherereye mu gihugu cya Senegali aho rutemba rugana iburengerazuba mu Nyanja ya Atalantika mu nzira ya mu burebure. Ariko muri hafatwa nk'igice cy'uruzi cyoroshye kugendamo. Casamance ni wo mugezi mukuru w\u2019uturere twa Kolda, S\u00e9dhiou, na Ziguinchor mu gice cy\u2019amajyepfo ya Senegali. Uherereye hagati y\u2019uruzi rwa Gambia mu majyaruguru n\u2019imigezi ya Cacheu na Geba mu majyepfo.\nHari ikiraro cya Ziguinchor, kimwe mu mijyi ikomeye kuri urwo ruzi, gihuza na Bignona ku nkombe y'amajyaruguru. Indi midugudu ikomeye ku nkombe zarwo irimo Goudomp, Sedhiou, Diattakounda, Tanaff, na Kolda.\nUruzi rwitiriwe \"Kasa Mansa\", cyangwa umwami w'ubwami bwa Kasa mu gihe cya mbere y'ubukoloni. "}
{"id": "22851", "revid": "18379", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22851", "title": "Angongwi", "text": "Uruzi rwa Angongwi ni uruzi ruherereye muri Ghana. Ruboneka mu gice cy'amajyepfo y'iburasirazuba bw'icyo gihugu, hafi ya kilometero 100 (mil 62) mu majyaruguru y'umujyi wa Accra.\nAya mazi y'uru ruzi asuka mu Ruzi rwa Volta mbere y'uko na rwo rusuka mu Nyanja ya Gulf of Guinea. Bityo, Angogwi ni rumwe mu nzuzi zifasha kongera amazi yinjira muri Volta mbere y'uko agera ku nyanja."}
{"id": "22852", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22852", "title": "Umugezi wa Balagas", "text": "Umugezi wa Balagas, uzwi ku izina rya Beleghas, ni umugezi wo mu majyaruguru ya Etiyopiya. Ni umugezi wa Tekez\u00e9, ni igice cy'ikibaya cya Nili. "}
{"id": "22853", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22853", "title": "Uruzi rwa Couffo", "text": "Couffo cyangwa Kouffo ni uruzi ruri ruherereye muri Afurika y'Iburengerazuba. Ruzamuka muri Togo ariko runyura munzira yarwo y'ibirometero125(78 mi) muri Benin, Rukagera mu kiyaga cya Ah\u00e9m\u00e9. Rugize igice cy;umupaka wa Togo na Benin kandi rukaba nk'umupaka uhuza ishami rya Kouffo na Zou rya Benin."}
{"id": "22854", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22854", "title": "Uruzi rwa Gorgol", "text": "&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;\u00a0\nUruzi rwa Gorgol ni umugezi wo mumajyepfo ya mauritania uhana imbibi nuruzi rwa senegali. Uruzi rugizwe n'aho Gorgol Noir ihurira (194)\u00a0uburebure bwa km), hamwe na Gorgol Blanc (345\u00a0uburebure bwa km). Gorgol ihurira n'uruzi rwa S\u00e9n\u00e9gal kuri Ka\u00e9di. \nIkibaya cy'uruzi kigira uruhare runini mu iterambere rya Mauritaniya riterwa inkunga n'ishoramari mu myaka ya 1970. "}
{"id": "22855", "revid": "17618", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22855", "title": "Umugezi wa Hout", "text": "Uruzi rwa Hout (Afrikaans: Houtrivier) ni uruzi ruherereye mu majyaruguru y'Intara ya Limpopo, muri Afurika y'Epfo. Ni rumwe mu migezi yinjiza amazi mu ruzi rwa sand(Polokwane).\nIsomo.\nUruzi rwa Hout ruhera mu burasirazuba bwa Waterberg rugatemba mu cyerekezo cya NNE. Inzira yarwo iherereye ku rugomero rwa Mathala, ruzwi kandi ku izina rya \"Houtrivier Dam\", urugomero rwonyine rukomeye mu kibaya cyose cy'uruzi rwa Sand. Rukomeza gutemba NNE kugeza rugeze mu majyepfo ya Soutpansberg iyo ruhindukiye rwerekeza kuri ENE ku birenge by'imisozi mbere yo guhura n'inkombe y'ibumoso y'uruzi rwa Sand itari kure y'ikibaya cya Waterpoort. \nMu gihe cy'imyuzure mu mwaka wa 2000, uru ruzi rwatwaye igice cy'umuhanda wa kaburimbo ku ruhande rw'iburengerazuba rw'ikiraro cya Hout River, rusiga abahinzi bo muri ako gace babuze aho bahurira n'amazi mu gihe cy'amezi menshi. "}
{"id": "22856", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22856", "title": "Umugezi wa Birbir", "text": "Umugezi wa Birbir wo mu majyepfo yo m'uburengerazuba bwa Etiyopiya ni umugezi wa Baro, ukorerwa aho uhurira na Gebba. Ni ingenzi muri politiki kuko inzira yarwo igena igice cy'umupaka uri hagati y'uturere twa Mirab Welega na Illubabor two mu karere ka Oromia. Richard Pankhurst avuga ko Birbir ari ingenzi mu bukungu mu kuvumbura mu 1904 ibisigazwa bya platine mu nzira yarwo. "}
{"id": "22857", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22857", "title": "Ribeira Grande de Santiago (umugezi)", "text": "Ribeira Grande de Santiago ni umugezi uri mumajyepfo y'ikirwa cya santiago muri cape verde. Mu gice cyo hejuru cyitwa \"Ribeira Cadacina\". Inkomoko yawo iri mu misozi yo hagati y'ikirwa, hafi ya Monte Tchota, mu burengerazuba bwa Rui Vaz, mu karere ka S\u00e3o Domingos. Utemba werekeza mu majyepfo, ugahurira n'inyanja ya Atalantika muri Cidade Velha. Imidugudu iri ku nkengero zacyo ni Achada Loura, Salineiro na Calabaceira. Ikigega cyo kuhira cyubatswe hafi ya Salineiro mu 2013. "}
{"id": "22858", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22858", "title": "Umugezi wa Borkana", "text": "Umugezi wa Borkana ni umugezi wo muri Etiyopiya rwagati. Numugezi wibumoso wa Awash. Johann Ludwig Krapf yanditse ko witwaga \"Tshaffa\" n'abaturage ba Oromo baho. "}
{"id": "22859", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22859", "title": "Umugezi wa Mkulumuzi", "text": "Uruzi rwa Mkulumuzi ni uruzi rwo mu Karere ka Tanga mu gihugu cya Tanzaniya. Uruzi rutemba rugana mu kibaya cya Tanga rukomeza mu muyoboro wa Pemba. Ni igice cy'uruzi rwa Pangani. "}
{"id": "22860", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22860", "title": "Ikiyaga cya Rukwa", "text": "Ikiyaga cya Rukwa ni ikiyaga cyo mu majyepfo y'iburengerazuba bwa Tanzaniya. Kiri hagati y'Ikiyaga cya Tanganyika n'Ikiyaga cya Malawi.\nIkiyaga cya Rukwa ntikigira ubujyakuzimu bunini. Mu 2016, munsi y'ako karere havumbuwe gaze ya helium.\nImiterere.\nIkiyaga cya Rukwa kiri mu kibaya cya Rukwa, mu majyepfo y'iburengerazuba bwa Tanzaniya. Kiri ku butumburuke bwa m 800. Hafi kimwe cya kabiri cy'ikiyaga kiri mu ahantu harinzwe h'inyamaswa ha Uwanda.\nHelium.\nMu 2016, havumbuwe helium nyinshi mu karere k'Ikiyaga cya Rukwa. Iyo helium ishobora kwinjiriza Tanzaniya miliyari 3,5 z'amadolari y'Amerika."}
{"id": "22862", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22862", "title": "Ikiyaga cya Natron", "text": "Ikiyaga cya Natron ni ikiyaga cy'amazi y'umunyu cyo mu majyaruguru ya Tanzaniya. Igice cyacyo cy'amajyaruguru kiri muri Kenya.\nAmazi y'Ikiyaga cya Natron ashyuha cyane. Ntikigira ubujyakuzimu bunini.\nImiterere.\nIkiyaga cya Natron kiri mu majyaruguru y'Akarere ka Ngorongoro, mu Ntara ya Arusha. Impera yacyo y'amajyaruguru igera mu turere twa Kajiado na Narok muri Kenya.\nAmazi menshi y'ikiyaga aturuka mu mugezi wa Ewaso Ng'iro. Uwo mugezi uturuka rwagati muri Kenya. Ikiyaga gihabwa kandi amazi n'amasoko ashyushye.\nUbujyakuzimu bw'ikiyaga buri munsi ya m 3. Ikiyaga gifite uburebure bwa km 57. Ubugari bwacyo ntiburenza km 22. Imvura igwa ahanini hagati y'Ukuboza na Gicurasi. Igera kuri mm 800 ku mwaka. Ubushyuhe bw'amazi bukunze kurenga dogere 40.\nKubungabunga ibidukikije.\nMu 2025, umushinga w'ubucukuzi bw'amabuye ku Kiyaga cya Natron wahagaritswe. Uwo mushinga wari wateje impaka."}
{"id": "22864", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22864", "title": "Ikiyaga cya Manyara", "text": "Ikiyaga cya Manyara ni ikiyaga cy'amazi y'umunyu cyo mu majyaruguru ya Tanzaniya. Abaturage b'Abiraqw bacyita Ikiyaga cya Moya.\nIkiyaga cya Manyara ntikigira ubujyakuzimu bunini. Igice cyacyo kiri muri Pariki y'Igihugu y'Ikiyaga cya Manyara.\nImiterere.\nIkiyaga cya Manyara kiri mu Karere ka Monduli, mu Ntara ya Arusha. Ni ikiyaga cy'amazi y'umunyu, kidashinga cyane. Kiri mu Kibaya Kinini cya Rift.\nIkiyaga gifite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 470. Ni icya karindwi kinini muri Tanzaniya. Igice cyacyo cy'amajyaruguru y'iburengerazuba gifite km\u00b2 200. Icyo gice kiri muri Pariki y'Igihugu y'Ikiyaga cya Manyara. Ni kimwe mu bigize ahantu harinzwe h'ibinyabuzima ha Manyara, hashyizweho na UNESCO mu 1981.\nIkibaya gikikije ikiyaga cyahoze gifite amazi menshi kurusha ubu. Abahanga bashushanyije inkombe za kera z'ikiyaga bakoresheje amafoto y'icyogajuru.\nIzina.\nIzina \u00abManyara\u00bb rishobora guturuka ku ijambo ry'Abamasai \u00abemanyara\u00bb. Iryo jambo risobanura uruzitiro rw'ibihuru by'amahwa."}
{"id": "22865", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22865", "title": "Uruzi rwa Cheli", "text": "Uruzi rwa Cheli ni uruzi rubarizwa mu Karere ka Tabora mu gihugu cya Tanzaniya. Uru ruzi ni igice cy'uruzi rwa Sibiti rwinjira mu kiyaga cya Kitangiri, uru ruzi kigira ahanini mu kibaya cy'amazi akoreshwa ku urugomero rwa Mwamapuli ruri ku mugezi wa Cheli gifite uburebure bwa metero 10 n'ubushobozi bwa megawati 28. "}
{"id": "22866", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22866", "title": "Uruzi rwa Mwaru", "text": "Uruzi rwa Mwaru ni uruzi ruri mu karere ka Singida mu gihugu cya Tanzaniya. akaba aru uruzi ni igice cy'uruzi rwa Sibiti rwinjira mu kiyaga cya Kitangiri."}
{"id": "22867", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22867", "title": "Ikiyaga cya Eyasi", "text": "Ikiyaga cya Eyasi ni ikiyaga cy'amazi y'umunyu cyo mu majyaruguru ya Tanzaniya. Kiri mu Karere ka Karatu, mu Ntara ya Arusha.\nIkiyaga cya Eyasi kiri mu Kibaya Kinini cya Rift. Amazi yacyo ahindagurika cyane bitewe n'ibihe by'umwaka.\nImiterere.\nIkiyaga cya Eyasi kiri munsi y'ikibaya cya Serengeti. Kiri mu majyepfo ya Pariki y'Igihugu ya Serengeti. Kiri kandi mu majyepfo y'iburengerazuba bwa Ngorongoro. Ikiyaga ni kirekire. Cyerekeje kuva mu majyepfo y'iburengerazuba ugana mu majyaruguru y'iburasirazuba.\nMu gihe cy'izuba, ikiyaga gishobora gukama hafi ya cyose. Icyo gihe, abashumba b'Abadatoga n'abahigi b'Abahadza bacyambuka n'amaguru. Mu myaka y'imvura nyinshi, ikiyaga kiruzura. Icyo gihe, imvubu ziva muri Serengeti ziza ku nkombe zacyo. Ndetse no mu gihe cy'imvura, ubujyakuzimu bw'ikiyaga bukunze kuba munsi ya m 1.\nIbinyabuzima.\nIkiyaga cya Eyasi ni ahantu inyoni zimuka zihagarara, cyane cyane \"flamingo\". Mu gihe cy'imvura, abaturage barobamo amafi make. Akenshi ni amafi yo mu bwoko bwa \"catfish\" n'amafi y'ibihaha. Aya mafi aturuka mu migezi n'amasoko agaburira ikiyaga."}
{"id": "22868", "revid": "17699", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22868", "title": "Umugezi wa Cheleleka", "text": "Cheleleka ni umugezi rwo muri Etiyopiya rwagati. "}
{"id": "22869", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22869", "title": "Ikiyaga cya Balangida", "text": "Ikiyaga cya Balangida ni ikiyaga gito gifite amazi y'umunyu. Kiri mu majyaruguru rwagati ya Tanzaniya.\nImiterere.\nIkiyaga cya Balangida kiri mu Karere ka Hanang, mu burengerazuba bw'Intara ya Manyara. Kiri mu gice cy'Ikibaya Kinini cya Rift, hamwe n'Ikiyaga cya Natron n'Ikiyaga cya Manyara. Amazi yacyo ntashinga.\nUbutaka bukikije ikiyaga bukoreshwa mu buhinzi no mu bworozi."}
{"id": "22870", "revid": "17699", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22870", "title": "Umugezi wa Zigina", "text": "Umugezi wa Zigina ni umugezi wo mu majyepfo ya Etiyopiya. Ni umugezi utemba ugana mu majyepfo y'umugezi wa Omo, uwinjiriramo ku nkombe y'iburyo. "}
{"id": "22871", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22871", "title": "Uruzi rwa Simiyu", "text": "Uruzi rwa Simiyu ni uruzi ruherereye mu Karere ka Simiyu ho mu intara ya Arusha mu gihugu cya Tanzaniya. Rutemba mu Kiyaga cya Victoriya mu karere ka Afurika k'Ibiyaga Bigari. Nk'umwe mu miyoboro migari igera kuri itandatu y'ingenzi igana ku Kiyaga cya Victoria, rugize igice cy'amazi yo hejuru ya Nili. Akarere ka Simiyu kakaba karitiriwe uru ruzi.\nUbumenyi bw'isi.\nIsoko y'uyu mugezi iri ku nkengero z'iburengerazuba bw'umusozi wa Loolmalasine n'imisozi miremire ya Ngorongoro mu karere ka Arusha. Utemba mu gice cy'amajyepfo ya Pariki y'Igihugu ya Serengeti ugana mu kigobe cya Magu cy'ikigobe cya Speke cy'ikiyaga cya Victoriya. Simiyu ifite imigezi ibiri y'ingenzi yinjira iburyo, ari uruzi rwa Duma n'uruzi rwa Komahola, n'urundi ibumoso rw'uruzi rwa Maloho. Hari ubuhinzi bwinshi mu nkengero zo hasi z'ikibaya cya Simiyu, butera amazi y'ifumbire n'imiti yica udukoko. Inkombe ya Simiyu ni igishanga gitangira hepfo y'umujyi wa Magu. Uvuye i Magu munsi gato y'ishyamba rya Ndagalu hari umudugudu wa Samilunga. \nAmateka.\nMuri 1875, Henry Morton Stanley ni we Munyaburayi wa mbere wabonye uruzi rwa Simiyu. \nIkirere.\nHari ibihe bibiri by'imvura, icy'urumuri kuva mu Gushyingo kugeza muri Mutarama, n'icy'imvura nyinshi kuva muri Werurwe kugeza muri Gicurasi, bigatuma habaho ibihe 700 kugeza kuru mm 1000 z'imvura igwa buri mwaka. Munsi ya 10% by'imvura igwa igera ku mugezi bitewe n'igipimo cyo hejuru cyane cy'ubushyuhe bw'amazi. "}
{"id": "22872", "revid": "17699", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22872", "title": "Umugezi wa Dechatu", "text": "Umugezi wa Dechatu ni umugezi wo mu burasirazuba bwa Etiyopiya. uturuka mu misozi ya Ahmar ugatemba ugana mu majyaruguru unyuze mu mujyi wa kabiri mu bunini mu gihugu, Dire Dawa, werekeza mu mugezi wa Awash. Umugezi usa nkaho uburira mu kibaya cya Cantur (Buren Meda) mu majyaruguru ya Dire Dawa, mu gihe umugenda wawo unyuranyura mu misozi ukagera mu kiyaga cya Abbe mu gace gato k'amazi. \nImyuzure.\nUmugezi wuzura mu gihe cy'imvura kuva muri Kamena kugeza muri Nzeri. Mu 2005 abantu bagera kuri 200 bishwe n'amazi y'umwuzure n'ingona. Umwuzure wo muri Kanama 2006 wahitanye abantu basaga 300, barimo 200 mu mujyi wa Dire Dawa. Uyu mujyi warangiritse cyane ndetse n'abaturage bawo ibihumbi n'ibihumbi barawimuka. Ibikorwa remezo by'itumanaho byarangiritse ndetse n'umuhanda munini ugana mu murwa mukuru Addis Ababa urahagarara. Ku ya 24 Mata 2020, bitewe n'imvura nyinshi mu misozi miremire, umugezi wa Dechatu waruzuye uhitana abantu bane ndetse usiga abaturage babiri bakomeretse bikomeye, utwara amazu arenga mirongo itatu."}
{"id": "22873", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22873", "title": "Uruzi rwa Kasai", "text": "Uruzi rwa Kasai ni umugezi utemba ibumoso bw'uruzi rwa Kongo, uherereye muri Afurika yo Hagati. Uru ruzi rutangirira muri Angola yo hagati rugatemba mu burasirazuba kugeza rugeze ku mupaka wa Angola na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, aho rwerekeza mu majyaruguru rukarukorera nk'umupaka kugeza rugeze muri congo. Kuva Ilebo, hagati y'aho uruzi rwa Lulua ruhuri n'uruzi rwa Sankuru, uruzi rwa Kasai ruhindukira rwerekeza mu cyerekezo cy'iburengerazuba. Igice cyo hasi cy'uruzi, kuva aho uruzi rwa Fimi.\nIkibaya cya Kasai kigizwe ahanini n'uturere tw'ishyamba ry'inzitane, dutanga ubutaka bw'ubuhinzi mu gace kazwiho ubutaka bw'umucanga butari buhingwa. Ni umugezi wa Kongo kandi diyama zibonekamo. Hafi 60 % bya diyama mu Bubiligi zituruka ku mugezi wa Kasai mu gutema no gushushanya.\nUbushakashatsi.\nHenry Morton Stanley yageze aho uruzi rwa Nkutu ruhurira ku ya 9 Werurwe 1877, yise uruzi rwa Nkutu, ariko yemera ko rukomoka kuri Kwango ya David Livingstone. \nImigezi.\nImigezi minini ya Kasai ituruka mu ihuriro rya Kongo: "}
{"id": "22874", "revid": "17699", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22874", "title": "Umugezi wa Kabenna", "text": "Kabenna ni umugezi wo muri Etiyopiya yo hagati. Ni umugezi ushamitse k'umugezi wa Awash mu burengerazuba bwawo, ufite isoko mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bwa Ankobar. GWB Huntingford ivuga ko ushobora kuba ari wo mugezi umwe n'uwa Kuba, uvugwa muri \"Futuh al-Habasha\" (\"Intsinzi ya Abyssinia\"), inkuru ivuga ku kwigarurira kwa Imam Ahmed ibn Ibrahim al-Ghazi ubwami bwa Etiyopiya. "}
{"id": "22875", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22875", "title": "Umugezi wa Mbridge", "text": "Umugezi wa Mbridge ni uruzi ruherereye mu majyaruguru ya Angola. Umunwa wacyo uri ku nyanja ya Atalantika hafi y'umujyi wa N'Zeto mu Ntara ya Zayire. Inkomoko yawo iri hafi yumujyi wa Cuimba, kandi igize igice cyu mupaka uhuza Intara za Zayire na Uige. Inzuzi zawo zikomoka zirimo Lufunde, Lucunga, Luqueia, na Lufua.\nBiteganijwe ko kubaka ikiraro hejuru yuruzi hafi ya N'Zeto cyarangiye mu mpera za 2013. "}
{"id": "22876", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22876", "title": "Uruzi rwa Dande", "text": "Umugezi wa Dande ni uruzi ruri mu majyaruguru ya Angola rufite isoko mu misozi ya Crystal. Umunwa warwo uri ku Nyanja ya Atalantika ahitwa Barra do Dande mu i Ntara ya Bengo. Utemba kandi mu mujyi wa Caxito, no mu Ntara ya Uige. Uruzi rufite kiometero 285. Igice cyo hepfo cy'uruzi ni ikibaya cyuzuyemo ibiyaga bito byinshi birimo Ibiyaga bya Sungue, Ibendua na Morima. \nUrugomero rwa Mabubas rwa wate 18 ruri kuri Dande ni isoko ikomeye y'amashanyarazi mu majyaruguru ya Angola. "}
{"id": "22877", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22877", "title": "Umugezi wa Bengo", "text": "Umugezi wa Bengo ni uruzi ruri mu majyaruguru ya Angola rufite isoko mu misozi ya Crystal. Umunwa wacyo uri ku nyanja ya Atalantika mu birometero 20 mu majyaruguru ya Luanda mu Ntara ya Bengo. Uruzi rufite uburebure bwa kilometero 300 rufite ubuso bwa mazi bungana na kilometero kare 7.370. "}
{"id": "22878", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22878", "title": "Uruzi rwa Lucala", "text": "Uruzi rwa Lucala ni uruzi rubarizwa mu gihugu Angola, uruzi rutembera iburyo rw'uruzi runini rwa Angola, uruzi ruzwi kwa Cuanza. \nIsoko ya Lucala iherereye mu Ntara ya U\u00edge, inyura mu Ntara ya Malanje, aho igaburira amasumo ya Kalandula, hanyuma igatemba mu ruzi rwa Cuanza hafi ya Massangano mu Ntara ya Cuanza Norte, mu birometero bike uvuye i Dondo."}
{"id": "22879", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22879", "title": "Umugezi wa Cutato", "text": "Uruzi wa Cutato ni uruzi rubarizwa hagati mu gihugu cya Angola rwagati, hafi y'uruzi rwa Cuanza. Itemba mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba bwa Benguela. "}
{"id": "22880", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22880", "title": "Uruzi rwa Longa", "text": "Uruzi rwa Longa ni uruzi ruri mu gace ka Angola yo hagati. ni uruzi rugize umupaka wo mu majyepfo ya Pariki y'Igihugu ya Kissama n'umupaka w'Intara ya Bengo n'Intara ya Cuanza. Umunwa warwo urinzwe n'umucanga muremure unyura mu Nyanja ya Atalantika. Rufite imigezi ibiri minini, Nhia na Mugige. Ikibaya cyuzuye kiri mu nkengero z'uruzi kirimo ikiyaga cya Hengue n'ikiyaga cya Toto.\nInzu y\u2019uburobyi bw\u2019 abakerarugendo n\u2019ibidukikije iri ku munwa w\u2019uruzi. Hari ikigo cy\u2019abacancuro cyari ku ruzi rwa Longa mu gihe cy\u2019Intambara y\u2019Abongereza. \nIfi ya Chiloglanis sardinhai (ifi y'inka) izwi gusa mu ruzi rwa Longa. "}
{"id": "22881", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22881", "title": "Rio Quicombo", "text": "\"Umugezi wa\" Rio Cubal ni umugezi uri mu majyepfo ya Sumbe mu gihugu cya Angola mu majyaruguru ya Kikombo mu Ntara ya Cuanza Sul. akaba ari Igicucu cy'amabuye y'umucanga giherereye ku mpande zombi za Rio Quicombo. Giherereye ku kiraro cyambukiranya umugezi. "}
{"id": "22882", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22882", "title": "Umugezi wa Rio Quicombo", "text": "Umugezi \"wa\" Rio Cubal ni umugezi uri mu majyepfo ya Sumbe mu gihugu cya Angola mu majyaruguru ya Kikombo mu Ntara ya Cuanza Sul. akaba ari Igicucu cy'amabuye y'umucanga giherereye ku mpande zombi za Rio Quicombo. Giherereye ku kiraro cyambukiranya umugezi. "}
{"id": "22883", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22883", "title": "Uruzi rwa Cunene", "text": "Umugezi wa Cunene cyangwa Kunene ni uruzi rwo muri Afurika y'Amajyepfo. Rutemba ruva mu misozi miremire ya Angola rugana mu majyepfo ku mupaka na Namibiya. Hanyuma rutemba rwerekeza mu burengerazuba ku mupaka kugeza rugeze ku Nyanja ya Atalantika.\nUbumenyi bw'isi.\nImwe mu migezi mike ihoraho muri ako karere, Cunene ifite ubuso bugera kuri kirometero 1,050 z' uburebure, hamwe n'ubuso bugera kuri kilometero kare 106,560. hari igipimo cy'imvura cy'umwaka ni metero 174\u00a0m kugeza kuri 222\u00a0m ku munwa wayo. Amasumo ya Epupa ari ku ruzi. Urugomero rwa Olushandja ruyobora umugezi wa Etaka, kandi rufasha guha Sitasiyo y'amashanyarazi ya Ruacana amazi.\nUmugezi uzamuka muri dogere 30 z'uburengerazuba no mu birometero bigera kuri 160 mu murongo utaziguye uvuye ku nyanja i Benguella. "}
{"id": "22884", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22884", "title": "Ubwikorezi muri Lesotho", "text": "Iyi ngingo ivuga ku buryo bwo gutwara abantu n'ibintu mu gihugu cya Lesotho. Nk'igihugu kidakora ku nyanja, Lesotho nta Cyambu cyangwa icyambu ifite, ariko ifite imihanda, ubwikorezi bw'indege, ndetse n'ibikorwaremezo bike bya gari ya moshi.\nImihanda.\nMbere y'uko Lesotho ibona ubwigenge mu 1966, umuhanda wa kaburimbo wari umwe rukumbi muri icyo gihugu. Uwo muhanda witwaga Kingsway, ukaba warabarizwaga mu murwa mukuru, Maseru, uhuza ikibuga cy'indege cya Mejametalana n'Ingoro y'Umwami. Kuva mu ntangiriro za 1970, ibikorwa remezo by'imihanda byatejwe imbere cyane. Mu 1999, Lesotho yari ifite imihanda ifite uburebure bwa mu burebure, muri bwo hakaba zashyizwemo kaburimbo. Hashyizweho imbaraga nyinshi mu guhuza uturere dutandukanye tw'igihugu. Byongeye kandi, imihanda yo hagati muri Lesotho nayo yaravuguruwe, ibi bikaba byari igice cy'ibikenewe mu bwubatsi bw'umushinga w'amazi wa Lesotho Highlands Water Project. \nGari ya moshi.\nUmuhanda wa gari ya mosh wonyine muri Lesotho ni ishami rya maseru, rihuza umurwa mukuru maseru n'umurongo wa bloemfontein - Bethlehem,Umuhanda wa gari ya moshi uhuza na Afurika y'Epfo. Muri uyu muhanda, kilometero 1.6 (ibirometero 1.0) byafunguwe ku ya 18 Ukuboza 1905, biherereye mu mbibi za Lesotho. Uhera ku kiraro cy'umupaka kiri ku ruzi rwa Mohokare, ukanyura mu gice cy'inganda cyo mu majyaruguru ya Maseru, ukagera kuri sitasiyo y'uwo mujyi. Iyi sitasiyo ni yo yonyine ya gari ya moshi iri muri icyo gihugu. \nGuhera mu 2008, habayeho ibiganiro byo kubaka gari ya moshi nshya ihuza Lesotho na Durban na Port Elizabeth. \nUbwikorezi bw'indege.\nMuri Lesoto hari ibibuga by'indege 28, muri byo 3 bifite inzira zo kunyuramo za kaburimbo. Ikibuga cy'indege mpuzamahanga cyonyine ni ikibuga mpuzamahanga cya Moshoeshoe I kiri i Mazenod, Ikibuga cy'indege cya Moshoeshoe giherereye mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba bwa Maseru. Mu bibuga by'indege byo muri iki gihugu, iki kibuga ni cyo cyonyine gifite inzira ndende irenga metero 1,523, kuko inzira yacyo nyamukuru ifite uburebure bwa metero 3,200\nMu bindi bibuga by'indege byo muri iki gihugu, kimwe gifite inzira y'indege yashyizwemo kaburimbo ifite uburebure buri hagati ya metero 914 na 1,523. Ikindi kibuga gifite inzira y'indege nayo yashyizwemo kaburimbo, ariko ifite uburebure buri munsi ya metero 914.Hari kandi ibibuga by'indege bine bifite inzira z'indege zidafite kaburimbo, zifite uburebure buri hagati ya metero 914 na 1,523. Ibindi bibuga by'indege bifite inzira zidafite kaburimbo zifite uburebure buri munsi ya metero 914. ibyiciro byose bigenwa hakurikijwe uburebure bw'inzira ndende cyane ku kibuga cy'indege.\nUbwikoreze bwo mu mazi.\nLesotho ni gihugu cyi misozi miremire kandi idafite inzira kandi ishingiye cyane kuri Afurika y'Epfo mu gutwara abantu mu mazi. Icyambu kinini cya hafi n'aho ubwato bujyanwa ni Durban. Vuba aha kubera gutinda kuva Durban, amasosiyete menshi yagiye akoresha ibikoresho bya Port Elizabeth biri mu majyepfo amasaha abiri. \nUbwikorezi bwo mu mazi imbere mu gihugu bugarukira ku bwato buto butwara ubwato aho imigezi yambukira, kandi Guverinoma ya Lesotho ikoresha ubwato aho imigezi minini yambukira.\nUburyo busanze bwo gutwara abantu.\nuburyo bw'ingenzi bwo gutwara abantu (IMTs) bukoreshwa ni amapine y'imodoka n'amatungo y'akazi. Amapine y'imodoka akoreshwa cyane mu mijyi no mu byaro kandi akoreshwa cyane n'abagore n'abagabo mu gutwara ibiribwa, ibinyampeke byo gusya, amasanduku y'amazi, n'ibikoresho by'ubwubatsi. Akamaro k'amapine y'imodoka yo gufata amazi kagenda kagabanuka buhoro buhoro bitewe no gutanga robine z'amazi. Ikindi gikunze kugaragara mu turere two mu misozi miremire no mu bibaya ni amapine y'imodoka zo mu bwoko bwa \"scotch cards\" afite amapine abiri. Yakururwaga cyane cyane n'inka, ariko mu myaka ya vuba aha hakomeje kwiyongera ingeso yo gukoresha inka (inka z'abagore), kuko abahinzi bakunze kudatunga inka.Amapine y'imodoka akorwa mu buryo butandukanye. Amwe muri yo akorwa hakoreshejwe ibice by'amapine bishaje, andi akaba akorwa hakoreshejwe insinga zishaje. Menshi muri aya mapine akorwa n'amaduka mato muri Lesotho cyangwa Afurika y'Epfo. Ikindi kigaragara ni uko inyinshi muri zo zishushanyijeho irangi ritukura.Ibiganiro n'abakora aya mapine bigaragaza ko ikibazo nyamukuru bahura nacyo ari ukubona amapine n'insinga zikwiye, kimwe n'ibindi bikoresho fatizo, ku giciro abakiriya babo bashobora kwishyura.\nAmafarashi ya Basotho ni ingenzi cyane mu misozi miremire mu gutwara abantu. Hari igihe amafarashi akoreshwa nk'inyamaswa zo gutwara imizigo, ariko ibi ntibikunze kubaho. Ku rundi ruhande, indogobe zikoreshwa cyane nk'inyamaswa zo gutwara imizigo mu bice byose by'akarere. Amafarashi akunze kugendeshwa n'abasore, cyane cyane abatari basanzwe kandi akenshi nta ntebe. Ni ibisanzwe ko abagore bagendera ku mafarashi, ariko abagore bake bagendera ku mafarashi. Hari abantu bake, cyane cyane abagabo bakuze, bagenda ku mafarashi afite intebe. Inyumbu ntizikunze kubaho, kandi zishobora gukoreshwa mu gutwara abantu cyangwa gutwara imizigo. Gukoresha amafarashi, inyumbu n'indogobe mu gutwara imizigo ni bike cyane. Amafarashi make cyane akurura indogobe cyangwa amagare y'amafarasi, nubwo ayo mafarashi akunze kugaragara cyane mu bindi bihugu byo mu majyepfo, iburasirazuba, iburengerazuba no mu majyaruguru ya Afurika. Nibura mu mijyi ibiri (Maputsoe na Mafeteng) umubare muto w'abacuruzi bakoresha amagare cyangwa amagare afite amapine y'umwuka akururwa ahanini n'amafarashi amwe (kandi rimwe na rimwe n'indogobe ebyiri cyangwa inyumbu imwe). Muri Mafeteng, abatwara abagenzi bakoresha amagare y'amapine abiri, mu gihe muri Maputsoe, abatwara abagenzi bakoresha amagare y'amapine ane.\nUmubara w'amagare na moto zikoreshwa ni muto cyane. ubwinshi bw'amapikipiki kuri buri muntu muri Lesotho, ndetse n'amagare, bushobora kuba buri mu bantu bake cyane ku isi. Umubare muto w'abantu bakoresha amagare akenshi ni abana n'abasore, cyane cyane mu kwidagadura nubwo bamwe bayakoresha mu ngendo hagati y'imidugudu. hari abantu bake bakoresha amagare mu mikino, kandi bamwe muri Afurika y'Epfo n'abandi bakerarugendo banyura mu misozi miremire ku magare. hari umubare muto w'abacuruzi bakoresha amagare kugira ngo babone imibereho."}
{"id": "22885", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22885", "title": "Urugomero rwa \u00c1gua Vermelha", "text": "Urugomero rwa \u00c1gua Vermelha ni urugomero rw'amazi ruri ku Ruzi rwa Grande hafi ya Iturama muri Minas Gerais / S\u00e3o Paulo, muri Breziligukora ingufu z'amashanyarazi no kurwanya umwuzure. kubaka Urwo rugomero byatangiye mu 1973 kandi byarangiye no gukoreshwa mu 1978. Imashini ziheruka zitanga moteri zatangiye gukora mu 1979. \nIbisobanuro.\nUrugomero rufite uburebure bwa uburebure na urugomero rurerure rufite sitasiyo y'amashanyarazi ya sima n'igice cy'inzira yo gusuka amazi. Ingano ya sima iri mu nyubako y'urugomero ni. umuyoboro w'amazi y'urugomero urimo inzira umunani z'amazi, buri imwe ifite ubushobozi bwo gusohora amazi bwa ku giteranyo. Ikigega cy'urugomero gifite ubushobozi bwa,muri zo ni ububiko bw'ibinyabuzima (bukora cyangwa \"bw'ingirakamaro\"). Ubuso bw'ikigega ni Kandi urwego ntarengwa wayo hejuru y'inyanja ni kandi nibura ni. Sitasiyo y'amashanyarazi y'urugomero ifite umutwe w'amashanyarazi wa kandi ikubiyemo esheshatu moteri zikoreshwa na turbine za Francis zifite ubushobozi bwo gushyiramo. "}
{"id": "22886", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22886", "title": "Ikiyaga cya Ansoo", "text": "Ikiyaga cya Ansoo ni kiyaga giherereye mu kibaya cya Kaghan cya Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, Byasobunuwe nka Teardrop Lake. Nk'uko izina ryacyo ribigaragaza, ni amazi asa n'amarira aherereye mu Karere ka Mansehra muri Pakisitani. \nKu butumburuke bwa 4126 m hejuru y'inyanja, Ikiyaga cya Ansoo gihagaze nk'imwe mu biyaga birebire cyane mu misozi ya himalaya. Giherereye hafi ya Malika Parbat, umusozi muremure mu kibaya cya Kaghan.\nAmateka.\nIkiyaga cya Ansoo cyaaguye mu kaga mu 1993 n'abapilote b'ingabo Zirwanira mu kirere za pakisitani bagurukaga ku butumburuke buri hasi cyane muri ako karere. Ubukerarugendo bukomeje kwiyongera bwabangamiye inzira igana ku kiyaga Ubukerarugendo bukomeje kwiyongera bwabangamiye inzira igana ku kiyaga n'ibidukikije karemano, bigaragaza ko gifite ibidukikije bitoroshye. "}
{"id": "22890", "revid": "18343", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22890", "title": "Uruzi rwa Klaas Smits", "text": "Uruzi rwa Klaas Smits (Afrikaans: Klaas Smitsrivier) ni uruzi rugize urusobe rw'uruzi rwa Great Kei muri Cape y'Iburasirazuba, muri Afurika y'Epfo. Ruturuka mu majyepfo ya Molteno runyura muri Sterkstroom, rubanza rugana mu majyepfo hanyuma rugana mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba mbere yo kwihuza n'uruzi rwa Black Kei. Kuri ubu uruzi rwa Klaas Smits ni igice cy'akarere ka Mzimvubu kayobora amazi ka Keiskama.[1]\nUruzi rwa Komani ni umugezi wa Klaas Smits, uhurira n'inkombe y'ibumoso ku birometero 5 mu majyepfo ya Queenstown.\nIkibaya cy'uru ruzi cyagaragayemo ibikorwa byinshi by'abakomando mu Ntambara ya Kabiri y'Ababoer.[1]"}
{"id": "22891", "revid": "18343", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22891", "title": "Uruzi rwa Krom", "text": "&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;\u00a0\nUruzi rwa Krom cyangwa uruzi rwa Kromme (Afrikaans: Krommerivier) ni uruzi ruri mu Ntara ya Cape y'Iburasirazuba muri Afurika y'Epfo. Uruzi rutemba mu Nyanja y'Ubuhinde runyuze mu mugezi uri mu majyaruguru ya St Francis Bay, mu burengerazuba bwa Port Elizabeth. Uruzi rwa Krom rutemba mu cyerekezo cya ESE kandi rufite uburebure bwa kilometero 109 hamwe n'ubuso bw'amazi bwa kilometero 2.085.[1]\nUruzi rwa Churchill n'urugomero rwa Impofu ni ingomero ziri ku ruzi rwa Krom. Uru ruzi rwa nyuma ruherereye hafi ya Humansdorp. Kuri ubu uru ruzi ni kimwe mu bigize agace gashinzwe gucunga amazi ka Fish to Tsitsikama.\nUbumenyi bw'ibidukikije.\nMu 1995, ingero z'amafi yo muri Afurika y'Epfo yitwa Cape galaxias (Galaxias zebratus), ubwoko bw'amafi yo muri Afurika y'Epfo buboneka mu Karere k'Ibirunga bya Cape, zabonetse mu ruzi rwa Krom. Kugeza icyo gihe byatekerezwaga ko ikwirakwira ryayo ryari riherereye mu gace kari hagati ya Keurbooms n'uruzi rwa Olifants.[1] Nubwo muri Afurika y'Epfo iyi fi yoroshye cyane ishyirwa mu byiciro gusa nk'aho iri hafi kugera mu kaga, muri Ositaraliya ubwoko bumwe bwarazimye kubera salmonids zihanganye n'andi moko y'amafi yazanywe.[2] Kuva mu ntangiriro za 2021 habayeho umubare munini w'amafi yo mu bwoko bwa bull sharks ari muri urwo ruzi."}
{"id": "22892", "revid": "18343", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22892", "title": "Uruzi rwa Zomandao", "text": "Uruzi rwa Zomandao ni uruzi rufite uburebure bwa kilometero 283 mu turere twa Haute Matsiatra na Ihorombe mu majyepfo ya Madagasikari yo hagati. Rutangirira mu misozi ya Andringitra ku gasongero ka Boby, [1] agasongero ka kabiri mu burebure muri Madagasikari, kandi rutemba mu kibaya cya Zomandao. Ni rumwe mu ruzi rw'ingenzi rw'uruzi rwa Mangoky. Rufite amasumo amwe, harimo amasumo ya Riandahy n'amasumo ya Rianbavy.\nIkintu cy'ingenzi kiranga uruzi rwa Zomandao ni uruzi rwa Ihosy."}
{"id": "22893", "revid": "18343", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22893", "title": "Uruzi rwa Bemarivo", "text": "&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Hatnote/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;\u00a0\nUruzi rwa Bemarivo (/be.mari.v/), mu by'ukuri ari rwo runini rugufi, ruherereye mu majyaruguru ya Madagasikari. Rutemba rugana ku nkombe y'amajyaruguru y'uburasirazuba, mu Nyanja y'Ubuhinde. Rutemba mu gice cy'iburasirazuba cya Tsaratanana Massif n'igice cy'amajyaruguru cya Marojejy Massif.\nInyura kuri RN 5a hafi ya Nosiarina. Umunwa wayo uherereye muri kilometero 17[1] mu majyaruguru ya Sambava.\nIkora nk'inkombe y'amajyaruguru y'akarere kazwi nka Betsimisaraka.[2] Mu buryo buteye urujijo, umugezi wa Sofia witwa kandi uruzi rwa Bemarivo (Sofia).[3]"}
{"id": "22894", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22894", "title": "Umugezi wa Meki", "text": "&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Infobox/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;\u00a0\nMeki ni uruzi muri Oromiya rwagati, Etiyopiya. Isohora muri Hora-Dambal.\nO.G.S. Crawford agaragaza Meki n'uruzi ruri ku ikarita rwashushanyijwe mu 1662 (rwitwaga \"Machy\") kugira ngo hagaragazwe amateka ya Manuel de Almeida kuri Etiyopiya. Crawford asobanura ko umuhanga mu gushushanya amakarita yamenye iby'uyu mugezi ku bamisiyoneri b'Abayezuwiti babaga muri Etiyopiya mu gihe cy'Umwami Susenyos.[1]"}
{"id": "22895", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22895", "title": "Uruzi rwa Doring", "text": "Uruzi rwa Doring (Afrikaans: Doringrivier) ni uruzi ruri mu Ntara ya Cape y'Iburengerazuba, muri Afurika y'Epfo. Ni igice cy'uruzi rwa Olifants/Doring.[1]\nIzina 'Doring' rikoreshwa kandi ku gice cy'uruzi rw'Amajyepfo, ikindi gice cy'uruzi rwa Olifants, hagati mu nzira yarwo.[2]\nIsomo.\nDoring ituruka mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba bwa Ceres igahurira n'uruzi rwa Olifants hafi y'umujyi wa Klawer nk'uruzi rwa Oudrif nyuma y'aho uruzi rwa Koebee ruhurira. Imigezi irimo uruzi rwa Tankwa, uruzi rwa Riet, uruzi rwa Wolf na Brandewyn.[3]\nUbumenyi bw'ibidukikije.\nIfi y'umuhondo ya Clanwilliam (Labeobarbus capensis), ubwoko bw'inyamaswa zo mu gace runaka zigaragara mu gace kazo zifatwa nk'izishobora kwangirika na IUCN, ziboneka mu migezi ya Doring n'indi migezi yo mu kibaya cyayo.[4]"}
{"id": "22896", "revid": "10173", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22896", "title": "Umugezi wa Mvoti", "text": "Uruzi rwa Mvoti cyangwa umugezi wa uMvoti ni uruzi ruri mu karere ka KwaZulu-Natali muri Afurika y'Epfo.[1][2] Mu nkengero za KwaDukuza, umugezi wa Mvoti, ukunze gukoreshwa cyane mu gukuramo amazi, utanga amazi yo kuhira, gukoresha mu nganda, kuyakoresha mu mijyi, no kuyakoresha mu ngo mu midugudu iciriritse.[3]\nIkiyaga cya Mvoti (29\u00b024\u2032S 32\u00b020\u2032E\ufeff / \ufeff29.400\u00b0S 32.333\u00b0E) giherereye mu majyaruguru y'umujyi wa Durban uri ku nkombe z'inyanja. Uruzi rufite uburebure bwa kilometero 197 kandi rufite ubuso bwa kilometero 2829.[4]\nUruzi rwitiriwe Umuyobozi w\u2019Uruzi Mvoti Ncashange, wo mu muryango wa L\u2019la (abaturage b\u2019abaruhuke), batuye ku nkengero z\u2019uru ruzi.[5]"}
{"id": "22897", "revid": "18343", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22897", "title": "Uruzi rwa Sambirano", "text": "Sambirano ni uruzi rwo mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bwa Madagasikari mu gace ka Diana. Rufite amasoko ku mpinga ya Maromokotra kandi rutemba mu Kigega cya Tsaratanana rugana mu Nyanja y'Ubuhinde. Delta yarwo ifite uburebure bwa km2 250.\nThe ecosystem of the river, mainly forests and brushland, has many indigenous species, such as the Sambirano mouse lemur and Sambirano woolly lemur.[2]\nAmashyamba y\u2019inzitane yumye yo muri Madagasikari yiganjemo igice kinini cy\u2019ikibaya cy\u2019uruzi, nubwo ibiti bya mangrove bigaragara mu bice by\u2019inkombe z\u2019inyanja.[3]\nIkibaya cya Sambirano ni cyo gice cy\u2019ingenzi gihingwamo kakao muri Madagasikari. 60% (cyangwa toni 7500 kugeza ku 10 000 buri mwaka) bitangwa muri ako gace. Hari umuyoboro udafite kaburimbo uva Ambanja ujya Marovato, unyuze Bevony, Ambodimanga Ramena, Bemaneviky Ouest, Maevatanana, ariko bikaba bigoye cyane.[1] Kubera iyo mpamvu, kakao nyinshi yoherezwa mu mahanga itwarwa n\u2019ubwato ku ruzi rwa Sambirano ijya Ambanja no ku muhanda w\u2019igihugu wa 6."}
{"id": "22898", "revid": "18343", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22898", "title": "Uruzi rwa Ganale Doria", "text": "Uruzi rwa Ganale Doria (Somali: Webiga Janaale) (rwahinduwe kandi nka Genale Dorya) ni uruzi ruhoraho mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba bwa Etiyopiya. Ruzamuka mu misozi y'iburasirazuba bwa Aleta Wendo, Ganale itemba mu majyepfo no mu burasirazuba kugira ngo ihuze na Dawa ku mupaka na Somaliya maze iba Jubba. Inkombe z'uru ruzi zirimo Welmel, Weyib (izwi kandi nka Gestro), na Mena. Amasumo ya Del Verme ni ikintu kigaragara mu nzira yayo yo hagati.\nDukurikije inyandiko zasohotse n'Ikigo cy'Ibarurishamibare cya Etiyopiya, Ganale ifite uburebure bwa kilometero 858 (mile 533).[3] Minisiteri y'Umutungo w'Amazi ya Etiyopiya, ivuga ko ubuso bw'amazi mu kibaya cy'uruzi rwa Ganale Dorya-Dawa bufite uburebure bwa kilometero kare 31.900, aho amazi aturuka buri mwaka angana na metero kare 5.80 (205 \u00d7 109 cu ft), n'amazi yihariye angana na litiro 1.2 ku isegonda (0.042 cu ft/s) kuri kilometero kare.[4] Ubuso bw'amazi bugereranywa ko bufite ubushobozi bwo kuhira kilometero kare 1.070 (mile kare 410), no gutanga amasaha ya gigawati 9270 ku mwaka.[5]\nUruzi rwa Ganale rwahawe izina rya Ganale Doria n'umushakashatsi w'Umutaliyani Vittorio Bottego akurikije izina ry'umuhanga mu binyabuzima w'Umutaliyani witwa Giacomo Doria.[6]\nGanale Doria ni ingenzi mu mateka kuko yari umupaka uhuza Intara za Sidamo na Bale. Aho Ganale Doria ihurira na Dawa ni ahantu hazwi cyane nk'aho habanje gutangirira umupaka uhuza Etiyopiya na Kenya mu burengerazuba, n'aho hatangiriye umupaka uhuza Etiyopiya na Somaliya mu burasirazuba.[7] Mu 1936, Intambara ya Ganale Doria yarwaniwe mu majyepfo y'inzira y'uruzi."}
{"id": "22899", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22899", "title": "Umugezi wa Jikawo", "text": "Uruzi rwa Jikawo ni uruzi rwo mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bwa Etiyopiya. Ni umugezi wa Baro, uhurira kuri latitude na longitude 8\u00b022\u2032N 33\u00b046\u2032E\ufeff / \ufeff8.367\u00b0N 33.767\u00b0E.\nUruzi ruzamuka muri Etiyopiya, kandi mu nzira yarwo yo hasi rugize umupaka na Sudani y'Amajyepfo.[2]"}
{"id": "22900", "revid": "17617", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22900", "title": "Uruzi rwa Chinde", "text": "Muri Mutarama 2020, ikamyo yari irimo aside sulfure nyinshi yaguye mu ruzi rwa Tano. Ku ya 13 Mutarama abaturage bagiriwe inama yo kutanywa amazi kubera umwanda. Kuva icyo gihe uruzi rwasubijwe uko rwari rumeze mbere.[1]\nAmareferensi.\n&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Coordinates/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;18\u00b035\u2032S 36\u00b028\u2032E\ufeff / \ufeff18.583\u00b0S 36.467\u00b0E\ufeff / -18.583; 36.467"}
{"id": "22901", "revid": "17617", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22901", "title": "Uruzi rwa Ka", "text": "&lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Message box/ambox.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;\nUruzi rwa Ka (ruzwi kandi ku izina rya Gulbin Ka River) [1] ni uruzi ruri mu majyaruguru ya Nijeriya. Rukomoka muri Leta ya Zamfara, rukora ibirometero bigera kuri 250 (160 mi) mu burengerazuba bwa Leta ya Kebbi aho ruhurira n'uruzi rwa Sokoto mu birometero 100 (62 mi) mu majyepfo ya Birnin Kebbi, mbere gato yo kwinjira mu ruzi rwa Niger. [2] Uruzi rwa Ka ni igice cy'umugezi muri Nijeriya. Uruzi rwa Ka ruherereye hafi y'imidugudu ya Nasarawa na Tunga Lombo. [3] Byongeye kandi, Uruzi rwa Ka rukora nk'umupaka gakondo utandukanya indimi za Benue-Congo zo mu bwoko bwa Zuru Emirate n'itsinda rya Afro-Aziya rya Gummi na Bukkuyun mu majyaruguru ya kure. Imwe mu miryango ya kera y'Uruzi rwa Ka ni uturere twa Waje, Kyabu, Danko na Warri muri Leta ya Zuru muri Leta ya Kebbi.\nIkirere/Isi.\nUruzi rwa Gulbin Ka ni umugezi ufite kode y'inyuguti y'akarere ka Afurika/Uburasirazuba bwo Hagati. Imiterere y'ikirere cyarwo ni 11\u00b039'0\" N na 4\u00b010'60\" E muri DMS cyangwa 11.65 na 4.18333. Aho UTM iherereye ni FN28 naho urwego rwayo rw'amashusho y'imikorere ni NC31-03."}
{"id": "22902", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22902", "title": "RSSB Tigers BBC", "text": "RSSB Tigers Basketball Club ni imwe mu makipe akomeye ya Basketball iherereye I Kigali mu Rwanda kandi ikaba ikina muri Shampiyona y'Icyiciro cyambere mu Rwanda (Rwanda Basketball League - RBL). \nAmateka.\nIyi yahoze yitwa Tigers Basketball Club yashinzwe mu mwaka wa 2019 na Francis Shyaka, wahoze ari umukinnyi wa Basketball wabigeze umwuga wakiniye amakipe arimo APR BBC, Kigali Basketball Club (KBC) na Patriots BBC. Mu mwaka wa 2025, Tigers yageze kuntambwe ikomeye itwara Igikombe cy'U Rwanda muri Basketball (Rwanda Basketball Cup), nyuma ikurikizaho no gutwara Super Cup, itsinze APR BBC, Imwe mu makipe ifite amateka akomeye kandi yitwaye neza cyane muri Basketball yo mu Rwanda no mu karere. Mu mpera za shampiyona ya 2025 ikigo cy'ubwiteganyirize mu Rwanda (RSSB) Cyafashe uburenganzira bwose bw'iyi kipe, bituma ihindurirwa izina iba RSSB Tigers Basketball Club. Kugeza ubu RSSB Tigers iri mu makipe ayoboye shampiyona y'u Rwanda, kuko kuva shampiyona y'uyu mwaka yatangira yatsinzwe umukino umwe gusa. Iyi kipe yakomeje kwigaragaza nk'imwe mu bahatanira ibikombe bikomeye haba ku rwego rw'igihugu no ku rwego rwa Afurika. \nRSSB Tigers yatwaye Basketball Africa League (BAL).\nIyi ntsinzi yabaye amateka akomeye kuri RSSB Tigers ndetse no kuri basketball y'u Rwanda muri rusange, kuko iyi kipe niyo yabaye iyambere mu Rwanda yegukanye igikombe cya Basketball Africa League (BAL). Nyuma y'iyi ntsinzi bamwe mu bakinnyi ba RSSB Tigers na bo begukanye ibihembo by'umwihariko. Leonard Craig Randall II yahawe igihembo cy'Umukinnyi mwiza w'irushanwa (MVP) kubera ko yitwaye neza mu mikino yose y'irushanwa. Ku rundi ruhande, Muthiang Mangok yahawe igihembo cy'Umukinnyi Mwiza mu Kurinda (Best Defensive Player) kubera ubuhanga n'umusanzu we mu bwugarizi bw'ikipe. Iyi ntsinzi n'intambwe ikomeye cyane mu mateka ya Basketball y'u Rwanda kandi igaragaza uburyo u Rwanda rukomeje kwiyubakira izina muri siporo ku rwego rwa Afurika. Ni umukino nyakubahwa Perezida wa repubulika y'u Rwanda Paul Kagame yari yitabiriye uyumukino wa nyuma byarushijeho guha agaciro aka gahigo k'amateka, kazahora kibukwa nk'imwe mu ntsinzi zikomeye u Rwanda rwagize muri Basketball."}
