{"id": "22947", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22947", "title": "Uwera Jean Maurise", "text": "Uwera Jean Maurise ni umugabo w'imyaka 44 y'amavuko ufite abana 3. Uwera Jean Maurise yatangiye umwuga w'itangazamakuru mu mwaka wa 2011 nk'umuyobozi ushinzwe ibikorwa by'ikorwa ry'ibiganiro muri Flash FM&amp;TV, yari yabanje gukora mu rwego rw'amahoteli n'ubukerarugendo. \nUbumenyi afite.\nUwera Jean Maurise yize amashuri abanza ndetse n'ayisumbuye, afite impamyabushobozi ya kaminuza mu itangazamakuru n'itumanaho(Journalism and communication) yakuye muri Catholique Institute of Kabgayi.\nIbyo akora.\nJean Maurise Uwera yashyizwe ku mwanya w'Umuvugizi wungirije wa Guverinoma asimbuye Alain Mukarulinda, witabye Imana mu ntangiriro z'umwaka wa 2025. Kuva muri Gashyantare 2025 yari Umuyobozi Mukuru wa 93.9 SK FM, radiyo ikorera i Kigali yibanda ku makuru y'ubucuruzi n'ibiganiro bifitiye rubanda akamaro. Muri uwo mwanya yari ashinzwe kuyobora icyerekezo cya radiyo n'imikorere yayo y'itangazamakuru. Yakoze kuri Flash FM&amp;TV, yakoze kuri RTV(Rwanda Television), ndetse aba n'Umuyobozi wa Radiyo Magic FM."}
{"id": "22948", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22948", "title": "Ubwenge buhangano(ai) mu rwanda", "text": "Ubwenge Buhangano niki?\nUbwenge Buhangano (AI) ni ikoranabuhanga rituma imashini cyangwa mudasobwa zishobora gutekereza, kwiga, no gukora imirimo isanzwe ikorwa n'ubwenge bw'abantu, AI mu Rwanda ni rimwe mu mashami y'ikoranabuhanga arimo kwihutisha iterambere mu nzego zitandukanye zirimo ubuzima, uburezi, ubuhinzi, n'imiyoborere. Guverinoma y'u Rwanda yashyizeho politiki zigamije gushyigikira ishoramari muri uru rwego no guhugura urubyiruko kugira ngo igihugu kibe ihuriro ry'ikoranabuhano ku Isi\nU Rwanda na UAE byashyize umukono ku masezerano i Dubai ku wa 31 Nyakanga 2025 agamije guteza imbere ikoranabuhanga no gushyira mu bikorwa amahame ya C4IR. Aya masezerano ashyigikira gahunda ya NST2 y\u2019u Rwanda igamije kwihutisha iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu bushingiye ku ikoranabuhanga kandi muri iyo gahunda, abantu babarirwa muri miliyoni, cyane cyane urubyiruko, bazahabwa amasomo ya coding mu myaka itanu iri imbere, mu gihe abandi ibihumbi 500 bazahugurwa ku rwego rwo hejuru mu ikoranabuhanga hagamijwe kongera ubumenyi n\u2019ubushobozi bwabo\nEse ubwenge Buhangano Busasimbura Umuntu?\nUbwenge buhangano (AI) ntibuzasimbura ubwenge bwa muntu cyangwa abarimu, ahubwo buzabafasha gukora akazi kabo neza kandi vuba. Ibi byagarutsweho n\u2019impuguke mu kiganiro EdTech Monday, zigaragaza ko AI ifasha abarimu gukurikirana imyigire y\u2019abanyeshuri no gukosora imikoro mu gihe gito, ariko ko icyemezo cya nyuma n\u2019ubusesenguzi bikomeza gukorwa n\u2019umuntu, n'ubwo u Rwanda rukomeje guteza imbere ikoranabuhanga no guhugura abarimu benshi ku ikoreshwa rya AI mu burezi, haracyari imbogamizi zirimo ibura ry\u2019ububiko buhagije bw\u2019amakuru (Data Centre). Impuguke zirasaba abanyeshuri n\u2019abarimu gukomeza kwihugura mu ikoranabuhanga no gukoresha AI nk\u2019igikoresho kibafasha, aho kubifata nk\u2019ikizasimbura abantu\nUbwenge Buhangano mu Itangazamakuru.\nUbwenge buhangano (AI) bukomeje guhindura uburyo itangazamakuru rikora, bufasha mu gukusanya, gutunganya no gutangaza amakuru mu buryo bwihuse kandi bunoze. Nubwo iri koranabuhanga ritanga amahirwe menshi yo koroshya akazi no kongera umusaruro, impuguke zigaragaza ko ridashobora gusimbura burundu abanyamakuru. Ahubwo AI ikwiye gukoreshwa nk\u2019igikoresho kibafasha gukora neza no gutanga amakuru ku gihe, mu gihe umuntu akomeza kugira uruhare rukomeye mu kugenzura no gufata ibyemezo bya nyuma. Ibi bituma amahame y\u2019itangazamakuru, arimo ukuri, ubwizerwe n\u2019ubunyamwuga, akomeza kubahirizwa nubwo ikoranabuhanga rikomeje gutera imbere"}
{"id": "22949", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22949", "title": "Umufundi wabaye Minisitiri", "text": "Mu ijoro ryo ku wa 10 Kamena 2026, u Rwanda rwatangaje impinduka muri Guverinoma, aho Minisiteri y\u2019Ibikorwaremezo yahawe abayobozi bashya barimo Murwanashyaka Damien, umugabo watangiriye urugendo rwe mu rwego rw\u2019ubwubatsi rufatwa nk\u2019urw\u2019abafundi n\u2019abakora imirimo yo mu kibuga (field work), ariko akaza kugera ku rwego rwo kuyobora imishinga minini y\u2019Igihugu, Murwanashyaka Damien ni inzobere mu bwubatsi (Civil Engineer) ifite uburambe bw\u2019imyaka irenga 15 mu mishinga y\u2019iterambere n\u2019ibikorwaremezo. Yabanje gukora mu bigo bitandukanye by\u2019ubwubatsi nka ROKO Construction Ltd, Real Contractors Ltd na Gasabo 3D Design Ltd, aho yagiye yunguka ubumenyi buhambaye mu igenamigambi, igenzura ry\u2019imishinga n\u2019imicungire y\u2019ubwubatsi. Nyuma yaje no kuyobora ikigo Preferred Contractors, bikamufasha kurushaho kwagura ubunararibonye mu buyobozi."}
{"id": "22950", "revid": "17908", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22950", "title": "NIYOMWUNGERI Ildebrand", "text": "Niyomwungeri Ildebrand yavutse mumwaka wa 1986 avukira mumurenge wa Gatare muri Nyamagabe. Amashuri abanza n'ayisumbuye yabyize mukarere ka Nyamagabe yakomereje muri Kaminuza Nkuru y'u Rwanda (NUR): Yayizemo icyiciro cy'amashuri makuru (BSc with Hons in Chemistry) kuva mu mwaka wa 2007 kugeza mu 2011. Aha ni naho yabaye Umuyobozi w'Abanyeshuri (Guild President) hagati ya 2010 na 2011. Yakomereje mububiligi (Ghent University) Yayizemo icyiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza (Master of Science - MSc) mu bijyanye n'Isuku n'Ibidukikije (Environmental Sanitation) kuva mu mwaka wa 2013 kugeza mu 2015."}
{"id": "22951", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22951", "title": "Kevin Kade", "text": "Kevin Kade ni umwe mu banyarwanda b'abahanzi bagezweho kandi bakomeje kwamamara. Amazina ye bwite yahawe n'ababyeyi be ni Richard Ngabo, yavutse taliki 23 Nzeri 2000, avukira i Gikondo i Kigali. \nAmateka ye.\nKevin Kade ni umuhanzi uzwi cyane mu njyana ya AFRO FUSION, AFRO BEAT na R&amp;B. Yatangiye urugendo rwe rw'ubuhanzi akiri muto cyane, atangira kubyina afite imyaka 4, naho kuririmba abitangira afite imyaka 5.Yakuze akunda umuziki bitewe n'umuryango we wari uw'abakunzi b'umuziki ndetse anaterwa imbaraga n'ibyamamare mpuzamahanga nka Michael Jackson na Chris Brown.\nIndirimbo ze.\nNdi ready, Sikosa, Nyiragongo, Bebe, Nyanja, Munda, Nana,Tiana,Wankandi, Umuana, Pyramid, Amayoga, Kao."}
{"id": "22952", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22952", "title": "Diez Dola", "text": "Diez Dola ni umwe mu bahanzi b'ikiragano gishya mu muziki w'u Rwanda, gusa uzwiho gukora imiziki yihariye mu buryo bwe budasanzwe. Amazina ye nyakuri ni Kayumba Caleb yatangiye kumenyekana cyane mu ndirimbo ye yise \"Sad Generation(Dunhill)\", yagiye hanze 2023.\nAmateka ye.\nDiez Dola yatangiye gukunda umuziki akiri muto kuburyo byatumye ava mu ishuri ageze mu mwaka wa 4 w'amashuri yisumbuye, ahitamo kujya kuwiga mu gihe cyukwezi kumwe. Diez Dola yavutse 2004, avukira mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo, Akarere ka Huye.\nIndirimbo ze.\nToxic love, what If, Step father, Zangalewa, Ratata."}
{"id": "22953", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22953", "title": "Umutoni Uwase Belinda", "text": "Umutoni Uwase Belinda ni umwe mu bakobwa bahataniye ikamba rya Nyampinga w'u Rwanda 2017.\nAmateka ye.\nUmutoni Uwase Belinda wavukiye mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo, akaza no kwiyamamaza nka Nyampinga w'u Rwanda, yasezeranye n'umukunzi we Theo Gakire Ntarugero, umuhango wabereye mu mujyi wa Kigali mu busitani bwa SunSet i Kagugu mu gihe gusezerana imbere y'Imana byabaye taliki 7 Ukwakira 2017. Bafitanye abana b'impanga yibarutse mu ijoro ryo kuwa 2 taliki 23 Mutarama 2018, nyuma y'amezi ane bari bamaze barushinze."}
{"id": "22954", "revid": "17987", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22954", "title": "Havugimana Saidi", "text": "Havugimana Saidi ni umunyarwanda witeje imbere aho yashinze ikigo cyitwa Haji Enterprise izwi mu bucuruzi bw'ibiribwa bihiye cyane cyane amata. Yavutse 1967 afite umugore umwe n'abana 5 (abakobwa 3 n'abahungu 2).\nAmashuri yize.\nNubwo ari umucuruzi, yize amashuri abanza ndetse n'ayisumbuye aho yize i Runyombyi hafi y'umupaka w'u Rwanda n'Uburundi. Ubu ni umunyeshuri wiga muri Masters mu ishuri rya INLAK mu ishami rya MBA(Masters in Business Administration).\nIbyo akora.\nHavugimana Saidi ubu ni umucuruzi ufite ubucuruzi bwamaze kubaka izina aho bita kwa Haji Enterprise iherereye mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo mu Karere ka Nyanza aho acururuza ibiribwa bitetse cyane cyane abantu benshi bazi amata. Aho izina Haji ryavuye, ni Abakongomani bajyaga baza bavuga ko bagiye kwa Haji, biza kurangira abantu bose ariryo zina bahitiriye. Iki kigo cyamaze kwaguka kuko kigira abakozi bagera ku 100 k'umunsi bitewe n'akazi kaba gahari byaba ngombwa bakiyongera."}
{"id": "22955", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22955", "title": "UMUTESI Vanessa", "text": "Umutesi Vanessa ni Umuyobozi w'Ibikorwa by'Umusaruro(Production Manager) ufite ubunararibonye buhamye, wagaragaje ibikorwa by'indashyikirwa muri Brand Speak Global by'umwihariko mu kunoza imikorere no kugabanya ibiciro by'umusaruro. Afite ubumenyi buhambaye mu gutegura umusaruro no gucunga ibikorwa byawo. Aho yashoboye gushyira mu bikorwa ingamba za Lean Management zafashije kongera umusaruro, kunoza imigendekere no kuzamura imikorere rusange. Afite ubushobozi bwo kuzamura amakipe."}
{"id": "22956", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22956", "title": "Ikigo nderabuzima cya manyagiro", "text": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Manyagiro ni ikigo cy'ubuzima giherereye mu murenge wa Manyagiro, mu Karere ka Gicumbi, Intara y'Amajyaruguru y'u Rwanda. Cyashyizweho mu rwego rwo kongera no kunoza itangwa rya serivisi z'ubuzima zegerejwe abaturage, hagamijwe korohereza abatuye ako gace kubona ubuvuzi bw'ibanze n'izindi serivisi zifitanye isano n'ubuzima.\nserivisi zihatangirwa:.\nIki kigo nderabuzima gitanga serivisi zitandukanye zirimo kuvura indwara zisanzwe, kwita ku bagore batwite mbere na nyuma yo kubyara, gukingira abana, kuboneza urubyaro, gukurikirana imikurire y'abana, ndetse no gutanga ubujyanama ku bijyanye n'isuku n'imibereho myiza. Gikora kandi nk'ihuriro ry'ingenzi rifasha abaturage kubona serivisi z'ubuzima ku gihe no gukumira indwara binyuze mu bukangurambaga n'uburezi bw'ubuzima.\nIkigo Nderabuzima cya Manyagiro gifite uruhare rukomeye mu kuzamura imibereho myiza y'abaturage bo mu Murenge wa Manyagiro n'indi mirenge ituranye. Binyuze muri serivisi gitanga, gifasha kugabanya intera abaturage bakoraga bajya gushaka ubuvuzi no guteza imbere ubuzima rusange bw'abaturage bo mu Karere ka Gicumbi."}
{"id": "22957", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22957", "title": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Muyumbu", "text": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Muyumbu ni ivuriro rya leta ry'ibanze riherereye mu Murenge wa Muyumbu, mu Karere ka Rwamagana, mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba y'u Rwanda. Iki kigo gitanga serivisi z'ubuzima bw'ibanze ku banyarwanda banyuranye.\nImiterere n'Ahantu giherereye.\nIki kigo gihereye mu Murenge wa Muyumbu muri Rwamagana. Kubera kwegera umujyi wa Kigali, uyu murenge wagize ubwiyongere bukabije bw'abaturage mu myaka ya vuba. Ibi byatumye habaho n'ubwiyongere bw'abakeneye serivise.\nSerivisi gitanga:.\nIki kigo gitanga serivisi z'ibanze zirimo:\nIvugururwa n'Ukwagurwa kwacyo.\nMbere iki kigo cyari gito kigakora mu mazu ashaje, ibi bikabangamira serivisi zihabwa abagana ivuriro. Muri uwo rwego, hatangijwe umushinga wo kuryagura no kurivugurura ufite agaciro k'amafaranga y'u Rwanda arenga miliyoni 700 (700,000,000 Frw).Uyu mushinga watewe inkunga n'ubufatanye bwa Minisiteri y'Ubuzima (MoH), Akarere ka Rwamagana, n'umuryango utegamiye kuri leta wa Health Builders. Iri vagururwa ryafashije mu kongera ibyumba by'ababyeyi, ibyumba by'abari gukurikiranwa n'abaganga, n'aho kwakirira abaganga b\u2019inzobere, bituma abaturage batagikora ingendo ndende bajya ku Bitaro bya Rwamagana cyangwa i Kigali."}
{"id": "22958", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22958", "title": "Abakristu ba mbere b\u2019itorero ry\u2019abadivantisiti mu rwanda", "text": "Itorero ry\u2019Abadivantisiti b\u2019Umunsi wa Karindwi ni rimwe mu matorero amaze igihe kirekire mu Rwanda, aho ryatangiye ibikorwa byaryo mu mwaka wa 1919 rizanwe n\u2019abamisiyoneri Daniel Elie Delhove na Henry MonnierAba bagabo bageze i Kilinda muri Werurwe 1919 batangira umurimo w\u2019ivugabutumwa, bakusanya abakirisitu bari barasizwe n\u2019abamisiyoneri bari baravuye mu Rwanda nyuma y\u2019intambara ya mbere y\u2019isi yose. Nyuma baguye ibikorwa byabo hirya no hino mu gihugu, aho Delhove yerekeje i Nyanza agashinga Misiyoni ya Gitwe mu 1920, nyuma yo guhabwa ubutaka n\u2019Umwami Musinga.\nItariki ya 31 Kanama 2019 izahora yibukwa mu mateka y\u2019Itorero ry\u2019Abadivantisiti b\u2019Umunsi wa Karindwi mu Rwanda, ubwo ryizihizaga isabukuru y\u2019imyaka 100 rimaze ritangiye umurimo w\u2019ivugabutumwa. Ibirori byabereye muri Stade Amahoro byitabiriwe n\u2019ibihumbi by\u2019abakirisitu baturutse hirya no hino mu gihugu, bashima Imana ku rugendo rurerure iri torero rimaze gukora kuva mu 1919\nMu ntangiriro z\u2019iri torero, abaturage bake ni bo bitabiriye ubutumwa bwaryo, ariko ibikorwa by\u2019ivugabutumwa n\u2019uburezi byatumye rikura vuba. Ruvugihomvu ni we Munyarwanda wa mbere wabatijwe muri Misiyoni ya Gitwe mu 1924 ahabwa izina rya Yohani, akurikirwa na Rukangarajunga Petero, mu gihe Nyirabigwagwa Mariya yabaye umugore wa mbere wabatijwe mu 1925\nUmuyobozi ushinzwe itangazamakuru mu itorero, Yadusoneye Onesphore, yavuze ko uyu munsi ari umwanya wo gushimira Imana ku iterambere ry\u2019itorero, by\u2019umwihariko mu burezi, ubuzima n\u2019imibereho myiza y\u2019abaturage. Yagaragaje ko ibikorwa by\u2019iterambere by\u2019itorero birimo amashuri, ibitaro nka Mugonero, ndetse n\u2019imishinga y\u2019uburezi n\u2019ubuzima byagize uruhare rukomeye mu guteza imbere igihugu. Mu bikorwa by\u2019ingenzi byaranze uyu munsi harimo no kugaragaza imishinga ikomeye itorero ryagezeho, nk\u2019ishuri rikuru ry\u2019ubuvuzi riri i Masoro mu Karere ka Gasabo, ndetse n\u2019icyicaro gikuru cy\u2019itorero giherereye mu Mujyi wa Kigali. Hari kandi n\u2019imibare igaragaza ko kugeza icyo gihe itorero ryari rifite abakirisitu barenga 962,766 hamwe n\u2019insengero zigera ku 2,500 hirya no hino mu gihugu"}
{"id": "22959", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22959", "title": "Nshimiyimana Yunusu", "text": "Nshimiyimana Yunusu ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'Umunyarwanda ufite imyaka 24, ukina ku mwanya wa myugariro mu ikipe ya APR FC. Yavutse kuwa 31 Ukuboza 2001. Kugeza ubu Yunusu Nshimiyimana akinira ikipe ya APR FC.\nAmateka ye.\nNshimiyimana Yunusu afite abavandimwe nabo bakina umupira w'amaguru aribo Fitina Omborenga, Sibomana Abubah akaba ari umutoza w'ungirije muri Gorilla FC yabaye myugariro w'ibumuso ukomeye hano mu Rwanda no mu Karere ndetse n'undi muvandimwe wabo witwa Yamini Salumu. Taliki ya 17 Werurwe 2025, nibwo aba bavandimwe bakiriye inkuru y'akababaro y'urupfu rwa se ubwo yari yitanye Imana."}
{"id": "22960", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22960", "title": "MUHAWENAYO GAD", "text": "Muhawenayo Gad ni umunyarwanda ukina umupira w'amaguru. Yavutse taliki 30 Ugushyingo 1995. Yakiniraga ikipe ya Gorilla FC nyuma aza kwerekeza muri Marine. Mu mwaka ushize 2025/26 ntabwo Muhawenimana Gad yabonye umwanya uhagije wo gukina, dore ko yakinnye imikino 16 yo muri BK Pro League, itandatu muri iyo akaba atari yo yinijijwe igitego. Izamu rye ryinjiyemo ibitego 18.\nAmakipe yakiniye.\nMusanze FC yayikiniye nk'umunyezamu w'imena, nyuma yerekeza muri Gorilla FC, yongera gusinya amasezerano muri Marine y'imyaka 2, yanatangajwe nk'umukinnyi mushya wa APR FC."}
{"id": "22961", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22961", "title": "SINDI PAUL JESUS", "text": "Sindi Paul Jesus ni umunyarwanda uzwi mu mupira w'amaguru, ufite imyaka 21 wavukiye mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba, mu Karere ka Rwamagana. Ubu akaba abarizwa mu Ntara y'Iburengerazuba bw'u Rwanda gukomerezayo akazi, akaba yaramaze gusinyira Marine FC amasezerano y'imyaka ibiri(2).\nAmakipe yakiniye.\nTsindabatsinde, Rayon Sports, Marine FC."}
{"id": "22962", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22962", "title": "Ikigo nderabuzima cya Nyarubuye", "text": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Nyarubuye (mu Cyongereza: \"Nyarubuye Medicalized Health Center\"):ni ikigo cy'ubuvuzi gikomeye giherereye mu Murenge wa Nyarubuye, mu karere ka Kirehe, mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba mu Rwanda. Cyashinzwe bwa mbere mu myaka ya za 1950. Ku bw'ivugururwa rigezweho cyahawemo ubushobozi, cyashyizwe ku rwego rwisumbuye rw'ikigo nderabuzima gihabwa abaganga, bituma gitanga serivisi ku rwego rwa muganga w'inzobere (Dogiteri).\nSerivisi n'Ubushobozi.\nIki kigo gifite ubushobozi nki bw'ibitaro bitewe n'ibikoresho n'abaganga bacyo. Bimwe mu bikorwa remezo n'izindi serivisi zikirangwamo harimo:"}
{"id": "22963", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22963", "title": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Gacaca", "text": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Gacaca ni ikigo cy'ubuvuzi rusange giherereye mu Murenge wa Gacaca, mu karere ka Musanze, mu Ntara y'Amajyaruguru y'u Rwanda. Iki kigo cyubatswe mu rwego rwo kugabanya ingendo ndende abaturage b'uyu murenge bakoraga bajya kwivuriza mu mirenge baturanye nka Cyuve, Remera, Rwaza, na Gashaki.\nSerivisi zitangwa:.\nIki kigo gitanga serivisi z'ibanze z'ubuzima zirimo:\nIki kigo kiba cyunganirwa n'Ibitaro Bikuru bya Ruhengeri bikorera mu mujyi wa Musanze iyo hari abarwayi bakeneye ubuvuzi bwisumbuyeho.\nAmateka.\nUmurenge wa Gacaca utuwe n\u2019abaturage basaga ibihumbi 28, babarizwa mu Tugari 4 n\u2019Imidugudu 24. Mbere y'umwaka wa 2022, uyu murenge wari umwe mu bice bigize Akarere ka Musanze bitagiraga ikigo nderabuzima na kimwe hafi. Ibi byatandukanyaga cyane uyu murenge n'indi 16 y'aka karere yari asanganywe ibigo nderabuzima.Abaturage barwaraga cyangwa ababyeyi babyara batoraga imajyeri bakora ingendo ndende. Bitabazaga ibigo nderabuzima byo mu mirenge bihana imbibi nka Cyuza,Remera na Gashaki.Kuba abaturage benshi barisukiraga Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Karwasa, byaviragamo uwo murenge ubushereke n'ubwiganze bw'abarwayi, bigatuma serivisi zaho zuzura imirongo miremire ndetse rimwe na rimwe abaforomo bakabarangarana kubera umuvundo.\nImyubakire n'Igishoro:.\nGukemura iki kibazo cy'ingendo n'umuvundo mu mavuriro bituranye, Ubuyobozi bw'Akarere ka Musanze bwafatanyije na guverinoma gutangiza umushinga mugari wo kubaka Ivuriro rya Gacaca. Mu mpera z'umwaka wa 2021, imirimo yo kucyubaka yari igeze ku kigero cya 70%. Inyubako zacyo zashyizweho zari kijyambere kandi zujuje ubuziranenge, zifite amashami yose akenerwa ku kigo nderabuzima cy'icyerekezo. Iki kigo cyuzuye gitwaye ingengo y'imari nini y'akarere maze gitangira gufungura imiryango no gutanga serivisi z'ubuvuzi ku mugaragaro mu kwezi kwa Mutarama 2022.\nIbindi bikorwa remezo hafi aho:.\nHafi y'iki kigo hashyizweho n'ibindi bikorwa by'iterambere birimo nka \"Ubumwe Community ECD Center\" itanga uburezi budaheza, ndetse n'umushinga mugari w'ikigo cyo gutunganya imyanda cy'Akarere ka Musanze cyubatswe mu Kagari ka Karwasa mu Murenge wa Gacaca."}
