{"id": "22965", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22965", "title": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya KAGUGU", "text": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Kagugu ni ivuriro rya Leta riri mu Murenge wa Kinyinya, mu Karere ka Gasabo, mu Mujyi wa Kigali mu Rwanda. Iki kigo gitanga serivisi z'ibanze z'ubuzima ku baturage benshi batuye mu nkengero zacyo.\nserivise zihangirwa.\n1. Serivisi z'Ababyeyi n'Abana\n2. Gupima no Kuvura Indwara\n3. Ubuvuzi n'Ubwitange kuri VIH/AIDS n'izindi Ndwara z'Ibyorezo\n4. Ubuzima bwo mu mutwe n'Ibindi"}
