{"id": "22967", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22967", "title": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Karama", "text": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Karama (mu rurimi rw'icyongereza: \"Karama Health Center\") ni ivuriro rya Leta ry'ibanze riherereye mu Murenge wa Karama, mu Karere ka Huye mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo y'u Rwanda. Iki kigo ngerabuzima kigengwa n'Ibitaro Bikuru by'Akarere ka Huye bikorera munsi ya Minisiteri y'Ubuzima (MINISANTE).\nAho giherereye.\nIvuriro riri mu Murenge wa Karama, umwe mu mirenge 14 igize Akarere ka Huye. Giherereye hafi y'icyahoze ari ibiro bya Komini Runyinya mu mateka y'Ubuyobozi bwa kera, kikaba cyorohereza abaturage b'icyaro batuye kure y'Umujyi wa Huye (Butare) kubona ubuvuzi bwihuse.\nSerivisi zitangwa.\nNka kimwe mu Bigo nderabuzima byateganyijwe na Leta y'u Rwanda mu rwego rwo kwegereza abaturage ubuvuzi, Karama itanga serivisi z'ibanze zirimo:"}
{"id": "22968", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22968", "title": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Bumbogo", "text": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Bumbogo (mu Cyongereza: \"Bumbogo Health Center\") ni ivuriro rya leta ryo ku rwego rw'ibanze riherereye mu Murenge wa Bumbogo, mu Akarere ka Gasabo, mu mujyi wa Kigali, mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda. Iki kigo nderabuzima gicungwa n'Akarere ka Gasabo binyuze mu bitaro by'akarere bishinzwe kukibungabunga bya Kibagabaga (Ibitaro bya Kibagabaga).\nSerivisi zitangwa.\nIki kigo gitanga serivisi z'ibanze z'ubuzima nk'uko biteganywa na Minisiteri y'Ubuzima mu Rwanda (MINISANTE):\nKwivuza n'Ubwisungane.\nIkigo Nderabuzima cya Bumbogo cyakira abaturage bafite ubwisungane mu kwivuza butandukanye, cyane cyane ubw'abagize Ubwisungane mu Kwivuza rusange (Mutuelle de Sant\u00e9). Ibi bituma umuturage wishyura 10% gusa by'igiciro cy'imiti n'ubuvuzi ahabwa, ibindi bikishyurwa na Leta. Cyakira kandi n'abafite ubundi bwisungane bwemewe mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "22969", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22969", "title": "Habukuyabaho Hyacinth", "text": "Habukuyabaho Hyacinth uzwi nka Gitefano ni umugabo w'imyaka 48 wavukiye i Muhanga mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo, afite abana batanu(5) umwana we mukuru afite imyaka 22 naho umuhererezi afite imyaka itandatu(6). Uyu Gitefano amaze kwamamara mu ikinamico Urunana, ni umwe mu bakinnyi bakunze kugaruka cyane mu mitwe ya benshi iyo hagize uhingutsa iby'iyi kinamico ikundwa n'ingeri zitandukanye z'ababasha kumva Ikinyarwanda.\nAmashuri yize.\nHabukuyabaho Hyacinth amashuri abanza yayize aho bita ku Kivumu i Musambira mu Karere ka Kamonyi aho ababyeyi bimukiye ubwo yari akiri muto; ayisumbuye ayiga muri Ecole Technique de Save, ayasoreza mu Urwunge rw'amashuri Ndangaburezi ruherereye mu Ruhango.\nIbyo akora.\nHyacinth yatangiiye gukina ikinamico kuva mu buto bwe, impano igenda ikura mpaka ageze muri ORINFOR aho yatangiriye kuyikuza no kuyimenyekanisha ku rwego rw'igihugu. Yatangiye iby'ikinamico kera akiri umwana muto yiga mu mashuri abanza mu 1983 aho yajyaga kwitoreza mu kigo cy'Abafurere mu muryango wa Andre Kagwa i Kabgayi. Mu mashuri yisumbuye yabyinjiyemo neza mu Ukwakira 1994, ubwo yajyaga gukora akazi k'ubutekenisiye muri Orinfor ubu yahindutse RBA. Ubu ni umutekenisiye mu kigo cy'igihugu cy'itangazamakuru RBA, abikomatanya no gukina amakinamico mu Urunana, Umurage ndetse no mu Indamutsa. "}
{"id": "22970", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22970", "title": "NYIRABAGANDE Drocelle Fridaus", "text": "Nyirabagande Drocelle Fridaus wamamaye cyane mu ikinamico Urunana uzwi ku izina rya Langwida yitabye Imana ku myaka 64, ibi byabaye taliki ya 7 Kamena 2026 azize uburwayi bikekwa ko ari umuvuduko ukabije w'amaraso.\nAmateka ye.\nNyirabagande Drocelle Fridaus wari uzwi ku izina rya Langwida, yari atuye mu Karere ka Nyarugenge mu Murenge wa Nyamirambo mu Kagari ka Rugarama, mu Mudugudu wa Itetero. Langwida yatangiye kwiyumvamo impano yo gukina ikinamico ubwo yigaga mu mashuri abanza. Mu 1996, nibwo yagaragaje impano ye yo gukina, aho yatangiye akina mu itsinda rikorera mu muryango uharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu aho bakinaga imikino ku ihohoterwa ryakorerwaga abagore. Mu 2000 nibwo yinjiye mu bakinnyi b'Urunana, muri uwo mukino ubu akaba yari afite abana babiri, Anyesi na Shyaka n'abuzukuru batatu barimo na Lupesu(Lopez), umukobwa we Anyesi yabyariye iwabo."}
{"id": "22971", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22971", "title": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Kinyinya", "text": "Ikigo Nderabuzima \u00a0cya Kinyinya ni kimwe mu Bigo Nderabuzima 7 byo mu Karere ka Gasabo gifashwa na AHF Rwanda, kikaba cyaratangiye gukorana nayo kuva muri 2006."}
{"id": "22972", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22972", "title": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Nyange", "text": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Nyange ni ikigo cy\u2019ubuzima giherereye mu Murenge wa Nyange, Akarere ka Ngororero, mu Ntara y\u2019Iburengerazuba mu Rwanda. Gifasha abaturage mu mitangire ya serivisi z\u2019ubuzima rusange, kikaba cyaravuguruwe mu buryo bujyanye n\u2019igihe, hubakwa inyubako nshya n\u2019ibikoresho bigezweho."}
{"id": "22973", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22973", "title": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Nyarugunga", "text": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Nyarugunga ni rumwe mu bigo nderabuzima byo mu Mujyi wa Kigali, giherereye mu Murenge wa Nyarugunga mu karere ka Kicukiro kikaba gifasha abaturage mu rwego rw\u2019ubuzima rusange, serivisi z\u2019isuku, n\u2019ubuvuzi bw\u2019ibanze. "}
{"id": "22974", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22974", "title": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Hanika", "text": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Hanika ni ikigo cy\u2019ubuzima cy\u2019ibanze giherereye mu Murenge wa Busasamana, Akarere ka Nyanza, mu Ntara y\u2019Amajyepfo y\u2019u Rwanda. Iki kigo gitanga serivisi z\u2019ubuvuzi rusange ku baturage bo muri ako gace ndetse no mu nkengero zako.\nAho giherereye.\nIki kigo Nderabuzima giherereye mu Mudugudu wa Gihisi B, Akagari ka Kavumu, mu Murenge wa Busasamana, Akarere ka Nyanza. Ni kimwe mu bigo nderabuzima bifasha kwegereza abaturage serivisi z\u2019ubuzima hafi yabo.\nSerivisi zitangirwa.\nIkigo Nderabuzima cya Hanika gitanga serivisi z\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019ibanze zirimo:"}
{"id": "22975", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22975", "title": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Kazo", "text": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Kazo ni ikigo nderabuzima giherereye mu murenge wa Kazo, Akarere ka Ngoma, mu Ntara y\u2019Iburasirazuba mu Rwanda.\nAhantu giherereye.\nIki kigo nderabuzima giherereye mu Mudugudu wa Umuyange, Akagari ka Gahurire, mu Murenge wa Kazo. Ni agace gatuwe n\u2019abaturage barenga 32,000, bari basanzwe bajya kwivuza mu bindi bice birimo Kibungo, Mutenderi n\u2019ibigo nderabuzima byo mu mirenge ihana imbibi na cyo.\nAmateka n\u2019iyubakwa.\nImirimo yo kubaka Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Kazo yatangiye ku bufatanye bw\u2019Akarere ka Ngoma n\u2019umufatanyabikorwa NELSAP. Umushinga watwaye asaga miliyoni 630 Frw, ugamije kunoza serivisi z\u2019ubuzima mu Murenge wa Kazo, wari umwe mu mirenge itari ifite ikigo nderabuzima cyuzuye.\nSerivisi zihatangirwa.\nIki kigo nderabuzima gitanga serivisi z\u2019ibanze z\u2019ubuzima zirimo:\nAkamaro ku baturage.\nKuzura kw\u2019iki kigo nderabuzima byagabanyije cyane urugendo rurerure abaturage bakoraga bajya kwivuza mu bindi bigo nderabuzima nka Kibungo na Mutenderi. Ubu serivisi z\u2019ubuvuzi ziboneka hafi, bikongera umutekano w\u2019abarwayi n\u2019ubwiza bw\u2019ubuvuzi.\nImiterere y\u2019ubuzima mu Murenge wa Kazo.\nUmurenge wa Kazo utuwe n\u2019abaturage barenga 32,450 nk\u2019uko ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022 ribigaragaza. Ubu bafite uburyo bwiza bwo kubona serivisi z\u2019ubuzima binyuze mu kigo nderabuzima cyabo cyuzuye."}
{"id": "22976", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22976", "title": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Kabuye", "text": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Kabuye ni ikigo nderabuzima giherereye mu Rwanda, mu Mujyi wa Kigali. Iki kigo gitanga serivisi z\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019ibanze ku baturage bo mu gace giherereyemo n\u2019inkengero zacyo, kikaba ari kimwe mu bigo Nderabuzima bifasha mu kongera uburyo bwo kubona ubuvuzi hafi y\u2019abaturage.\nAhantu giherereye.\nIkigo Nderabuzima cya Kabuye giherereye mu Karere ka Gasabo mu Mujyi wa Kigali, mu gace kazwi nka Kabuye. Aha ni ahantu hatuwe n\u2019abaturage benshi, bigatuma serivisi z\u2019ubuzima zitangwa n\u2019iki kigo ziba ingenzi cyane.\nSerivisi zihatangirwa.\nIki kigo nderabuzima gitanga serivisi z\u2019ubuvuzi bw\u2019ibanze zirimo:\nUruhare mu buzima rusange.\nIkigo Nderabuzima cya Kabuye gifite uruhare rukomeye mu guteza imbere ubuzima rusange bw\u2019abaturage. Kiba hafi y\u2019abaturage, kikabafasha kubona ubuvuzi bw\u2019ibanze vuba, bityo kikagabanya umubare w\u2019abajya mu bitaro bikuru ku ndwara zoroheje.\nImiyoborere n\u2019imikoranire.\nNk\u2019ibindi bigo nderabuzima byo mu Rwanda, gikorana n\u2019Ikigo cy\u2019Igihugu gishinzwe Ubuzima (RBC) ndetse n\u2019ubuyobozi bw\u2019inzego z\u2019ibanze mu kunoza serivisi z\u2019ubuzima no guteza imbere gahunda z\u2019ubukangurambaga ku buzima."}
{"id": "22977", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22977", "title": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Ngeruka", "text": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Ngeruka ni ikigo cy\u2019ubuzima cya Leta giherereye mu Murenge wa Ngeruka, Akarere ka Bugesera, Intara y\u2019Iburasirazuba mu Rwanda. Iki kigo gitanga serivisi z\u2019ubuvuzi bw\u2019ibanze ku baturage batuye muri ako gace no mu nkengero zako.\nAho giherereye.\nIkigo Nderabuzima cya Ngeruka kiri mu Murenge wa Ngeruka, umwe mu mirenge igize Akarere ka Bugesera. Aka gace kazwi cyane kubera ibikorwa by\u2019ubuhinzi n\u2019ubworozi, kandi gatuwe n\u2019abaturage benshi bakeneye serivisi z\u2019ubuzima zegereye aho batuye.\nSerivisi zitangwa.\nIki kigo nderabuzima gitanga serivisi z\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019ibanze, zirimo:"}
