{"id": "22981", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22981", "title": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Nyamiyaga", "text": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Nyamiyaga ni ikigo cy'ubuvuzi bw'ibanze cya Leta, giherereye mu mudugudu wa Rugali,akagali ka kabeza,umurenge wa Nyamiyaga, mu karere ka Gicumbi, mu Ntara y'Amajyaruguru mu Rwanda. Iki kigo gishinzwe gutanga serivisi z'ubuzima no kwita ku baturage batuye uyu murenge n'inkengero zaho.\nImikorere n'Inshingano\nIkigo Nderabuzima cya Nyamiyaga gikora nk'urwego rw'ibanze runganira Ibitaro Bikuru bya Byumba (Byumba Level II Teaching Hospital), akaba ari na bwo buyobozi bukuru bwayo mu rwego rw'ubuvuzi mu Karere.\nSerivise zihatingirwa:.\nIki kigo gitanga serivisi zitandukanye zirimo:\nUbuyobozi:Iki kigo gicungwa ku bufatanye bwa Ministeri y'Ubuzima mu Rwanda (MINISANTE) n'ubuyobozi bw'Akarere ka Gicumbi. "}
{"id": "22982", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22982", "title": "CYUBAHIRO ROBERT", "text": "Cyubahiro Robert McKenna ni umunyamakuru w'ikigo cy'itangazamakuru(RBA), akunzwe mu biganiro bitandukanye haba kuri Magic Voice no kuri Televiziyo y'igihugu.\nAmateka ye.\nCybahiro Robert McKenna yambitse impeta umukunzi we amusaba ko bazabana bari bamaranye igihe mu munyenga w'urukundo, nawe amwemerera atazuyaje. Ibi byabaye taliki ya 12 Gashyantare 2026 nibwo abinyujije ku mbuga nkoranyambaga ze, Cyubahiro Robert McKenna yashyize hanze amafoto agaragaza ko yamaze kwambika umukunzi we impeta y'urudashira amusaba ko yazamubera umugore."}
{"id": "22983", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22983", "title": "DUSANGIRE LUNCH", "text": "Kuva gahunda ya \"DUSANGIRA LUNCH\" itangijwe abana miliyoni enye biga mu mashuri ya leta n'afashwa na leta mu Rwanda nibo bafatira ifunguro ku ishuri. MINEDUC ivuga ko ifunguro rihabwa abanyeshuri ku ishuri ritagamije gusa kubamara ahubwo, ahubwo bifite uruhare runini mu mibereho myiza y'abana, imitsindire yabo ndetse nuko bakora mu ishuri.\nNubwo gahunda igeze ku rwego rushimishije kugeza ubu, MINEDUC inkunga ya buri wese igikenewe kuko ishobora gutuma \"Dusangire lunch\" ikomeza kwagura ikagera ku bandi banyeshuri benshi kurushaho. \nuburyo bwo gutanga inkunga ku bari mu Rwanda bashobora gukoresha telefone bakanda*182*3*10*3#. inkunga inyuzwa nanone kandi k 'Umwalimu sacco."}
{"id": "22984", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22984", "title": "Umuhango wo gutanga impamyabumenyi muri Green Hills Academy", "text": "Abanyeshuri barangije amasomo muri Green hills academy (GHA) muri uyu mwaka wa 2026, basabwe gukomeza kurangwa ni indangagaciro nziza batojwe,gukoresha neza ubumenyi bungutse no kugira uruhare mu iterambere ry'igihugu n'isi muri rusange.\nIbi ni bimwe mubyo basabwa kui uyu wa Gatandatu mu muhango wo gutanga impamyabumenyi ku banyeshuri 120 barangije muri uyu mwaka, ibiro byitabiriwe na Madam Jeannette Kagame.\nUmuyobozi wa GHA Dr. Daniel hollinger, yabwiye aba banyeshuri ko intsinza yabo itareberwa ku byo bagezeho ubwabo."}
{"id": "22985", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22985", "title": "Nzabonimpa Th\u00e9odore", "text": "NZABONIMPA Th\u00e9odore ni we washinze akanaba Umuyobozi Mukuru wa Beyond the Gorillas Experience Ltd (BGE), sosiyete y\u2019ubukerarugendo ikorera i Musanze ahahoze hitwa Ruhengeri. Ni umuyobozi ufite uburambe mu gutanga serivisi z\u2019ubukerarugendo ku bakerarugendo bo mu gihugu, mu karere no mu mahanga.\nKuva mu mwaka wa 2010, BGE yigaragaje nk\u2019isosiyete ifite ubunararibonye mu gutanga ubukerarugendo bushimishije bushingiye ku gusura Pariki y\u2019Ibirunga no ku bikorwa bishingiye ku baturage (Community Based Tourism). Ibi birimo gusura imidugudu, gutembera mu misozi, kureba inyoni, gutwara ubwato ku biyaga bya Burera na Ruhondo, gusura imirima y\u2019ikawa, kuroba nijoro no gusobanukirwa umuco nyarwanda binyuze mu bikorwa bitandukanye\nBGE ikomeje guteza imbere ubukerarugendo burambye, aho igamije gufasha abaturage kungukira mu bukerarugendo bubasura, binyuze mu kurengera ibidukikije no guteza imbere ubukungu bw\u2019akarere ka Musanze"}
{"id": "22986", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22986", "title": "Ubwenge buhangano mu guteza imbere uburezi", "text": "Ikiganiro EdTech monday cyo kuri uyu wa mbere tariki ya 25 gicurasi 2026,kiragaruka ku ruhande rw' Ubwenge bu hangano n'ikoranabuhanga mu guteza imbere uburezi,nk'uko ari imwe muri gahunda leta y'u Rwanda yashyize imbere yafasha mu myigishirize.\nNi ikiganiro gitegurwa ku bufatanye na Mastercard Foundation kiba buri wa mbere wa nyuma w'ukwezi kwa Gicurasi gifite insanganyamatsiko igira iti:\"Uruhare rw'ubwenge buhangano (AI) n'ikoranabuhanga rigezweho mu guteza imbere uburezi bushingiye ku makuru n'ibyegeranyo."}
{"id": "22987", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22987", "title": "Amadini mu rwanda", "text": "AMADINI: ni uburyo abantu bishyira hamwe bakizera Imana cyangwa ikindi bemera cyera, bakagendera ku nyigisho, amahame n'imigenzo bibafasha kubaho no gusenga\nKugeza ubu, mu Rwanda habarurwa imiryango itari iya Leta igera ku 2,366, muri yo 577 ikaba ishingiye ku myemerere. RGB isaba ko hakazwa ubufatanye mu gukumira ibi byago hakiri kare, hagamijwe kurinda umutekano w\u2019igihugu n\u2019uw\u2019abaturage bose\nUrwego rw\u2019Igihugu rw\u2019Imiyoborere (RGB) rwatangaje ko imiryango itari iya Leta ishingiye ku myemerere (FBOs) ari yo ifite ibyago byinshi byo kwibasirwa n\u2019iyezandonke ndetse n\u2019ibikorwa by\u2019iterabwoba. Ibi byagarutsweho ku wa 17 Nzeri 2025, ubwo RGB yaganiraga n\u2019abayobozi b\u2019amadini n\u2019amatorero ku bijyanye na politiki nshya igamije kurwanya iyezandonke no gukumira iterabwoba\nImpamvu zatumye insengero zifungwa.\nInsengero nyinshi mu Rwanda zafunzwe n\u2019Urwego rw\u2019Igihugu rw\u2019Imiyoborere (RGB) kubera kutuzuza ibisabwa n\u2019amategeko n\u2019amabwiriza agenga ibikorwa by\u2019amadini n\u2019amatorero. Mu bugenzuzi bwakozwe, byagaragaye ko zimwe mu nsengero zakoreraga mu nyubako zitujuje ubuziranenge, zitagira imirindankuba, inzira zihagije zo gusohokamo mu gihe cy\u2019impanuka, cyangwa izindi ngamba z\u2019umutekano zarindaga abasengeramo. Hari kandi izakoraga zidafite ubuzima gatozi cyangwa zitemerewe gukora mu buryo bwemewe n\u2019amategeko. RGB yavuze ko izi ngamba zafashwe hagamijwe kurinda umutekano n\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019abaturage, kandi ko insengero zuzuza ibisabwa zikomeza kongera gufungurirwa nyuma y\u2019ubugenzuzi\nEse kugira idini ni ngombwa?\n\"Mu Abaheburayo 10:24, 25. haravuga ngo \u201cTujye tuzirikanana kugira ngo duterane ishyaka ryo gukundana no gukora imirimo myiza, tutirengagiza guteranira hamwe.\u201d kdi\" Mu Baheburayo 10:25 hakoreshwa imvugo igira iti \u201ctutirengagiza guteranira hamwe.\u201d Ayo magambo agaragaza ko Imana yifuza ko abantu bagira gahunda yo guteranira hamwe mu rwego rw\u2019itsinda bagasenga. Ariko se buri wese akwiriye kugira uburyo bwe bwo kumenya Imana n\u2019ibyo idusaba? Oya. Bibiliya ivuga ko abasenga Imana mu buryo yemera bose bagombye \u2018kuvuga rumwe, bakunga ubumwe mu bitekerezo kandi bakagira imyumvire imwe\u2019 (1 Abakorinto 1:10"}
