{"id": "22991", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22991", "title": "Bertrand Ndengeyingoma", "text": "Bertrand Ndengeyingoma ni Umuyobozi Mukuru ushinzwe Ikoranabuhanga na Inovasiyo muri Banki Nkuru y'u Rwanda(BNR).\nUbuzima bwe bwite.\nBertrand Ndengeyingoma afite imyaka 33, yashakanye n'umukobwa wa Perezida Kagame Paul witwa Angel Kagame aho ibirori by'ubukwe bwabo byabaye muri Nyakanga 2019 ubu bamaze kwibaruka abana babiri. "}
{"id": "22992", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22992", "title": "CYUZUZO Beyonce", "text": "Cyuzuzo Beyonce ni umunyarwandakazi ukiri muto wamenyekanye nk'umufotogarafe(photographer), ufite imyaka 21 y'amavuko. Yamenyekanye akiri muto ku myaka 18 gusa muri 2023.\nAmashuri yize.\nCyuzuzo yize amashuri abanza n'ayisumbuye akura impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya Kaminuzanmuri IPRC Kigali mu Kanama 2025."}
{"id": "22993", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22993", "title": "Ikigo nderabuzima cya Mubuga", "text": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Mubuga ni ikigo nderabuzima cya Leta kikaba kimwe mu bigo bitanga serivisi z'ubuvuzi bw'ibanze hagamijwe guteza imbere ubuzima bw'abaturage no kubafasha kubona ubuvuzi hafi y'aho batuye. Iki kigo gikorana n'ibitaro bireberera ndetse n'abajyanama b'ubuzima kugira ngo serivisi z'ubuvuzi zigere ku baturage mu buryo bunoze.\nAho giherereye.\nIkigo Nderabuzima cya Mubuga giherereye mu Murenge wa Mubuga, Akarere ka Karongi, mu Ntara y'Iburengerazuba y'u Rwanda. Gikorera abaturage bo muri uwo murenge n'abaturutse mu mirenge ituranye, kikaba kiri mu rwego rw'ibigo nderabuzima bitanga ubuvuzi bw'ibanze mbere yo kohereza abarwayi bakeneye ubuvuzi bwisumbuye ku bitaro.\nSerivise.\nIkigo Nderabuzima cya Mubuga gitanga serivisi zitandukanye z'ubuvuzi bw'ibanze zirimo:"}
{"id": "22994", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22994", "title": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Cor Unum", "text": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Cor Unum ni ikigo nderabuzima giherereye mu Murenge wa Kimisagara, Akarere ka Nyarugenge, mu Mujyi wa Kigali, u Rwanda. Ni kimwe mu bigo nderabuzima bikorana n'Ibitaro bya Muhima mu gutanga serivisi z'ubuvuzi bw'ibanze ku baturage.\nAmateka.\nIkigo Nderabuzima cya Cor Unum cyashyizweho hagamijwe kwegereza abaturage serivisi z'ubuvuzi no kugabanya intera bajyaga bakora bagana kwa muganga. Gikorana n'Ibitaro bya Muhima mu rwego rw'ubuvuzi bw'ibanze.\nSerivisi zihatangirwa.\nIki kigo gitanga serivisi zirimo:\nImikorere.\nIkigo Nderabuzima cya Cor Unum kiri mu muyoboro w'ibigo nderabuzima bikurikiranwa n'Ibitaro bya Muhima. Gikorana n'abajyanama b'ubuzima n'inzego z'ibanze mu guteza imbere ubuzima bw'abaturage."}
{"id": "22995", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22995", "title": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Yove", "text": "Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Yove ni ikigo nderabuzima cya Leta gikora mu rwego rw'ubuvuzi bw'ibanze, kikita ku buzima bw'abaturage bo mu Murenge wa Cyato n'utundi duce tugikikije.\nAho giherereye.\nIkigo Nderabuzima cya Yove giherereye mu Kagari ka Rugari, Umurenge wa Cyato, mu Karere ka Nyamasheke. Gikorana n'ibitaro byo ku rwego rw'akarere mu kohereza abarwayi bakeneye ubuvuzi bwisumbuyeho.\nSerivisi gitanga.\nIkigo gitanga serivisi zitandukanye z'ubuvuzi bw'ibanze zirimo:\nIbikorwaremezo.\nMu rwego rwo kunoza serivisi z'ubuzima, Ikigo Nderabuzima cya Yove cyagiye cyongererwa ibikorwaremezo n'ibikoresho bitandukanye. Mu mwaka wa 2023 cyashyikirijwe imbangukiragutabara (ambulance) ifasha gutwara abarwayi bakeneye koherezwa ku bitaro.\nUruhare mu iterambere.\nIkigo Nderabuzima cya Yove kigira uruhare mu guteza imbere ubuzima bw'abaturage binyuze mu bukangurambaga bwo kwirinda indwara, gahunda z'isuku n'isukura, ubukangurambaga bwo gukingira, no gukorana n'abajyanama b'ubuzima."}
{"id": "22999", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22999", "title": "Fidele Kajugiro Sebarinda", "text": "Umunyamakuru Fidele Kajugiro Sebarinda wamenyekanye cyane mu mikino kuri radiyo Rwanda mu myaka yashize yitabye Imana azize uburwayi, inkuru y'urupfu rwe yamenyekanye mu ijoro ryo kuwa gatandatu taliki ya 13 Kamena 2026.\nAmateka ye.\nFidele Kajugiro Sebarinda yakoze kuri ORINFOR ubu yabaye RBA(Rwanda Broadcasting Agency), nyuma arahava ajya gukorera komite Olempika. Uyu mugabo yasize umugore umwe n'umwana umwe, akaba yarareze abandi bana benshi bo mu muryango we bari barasigaye ari imfubyi za Jenoside Yakoreye Abatutsi mu 1994 mu Rwanda. Fidele yakundaga akazi, agakunda kwitabira imikino ya Volleyball cyane, yakundaga abantu ndetse agakora akazi ke neza kugeza ibintu bigenze neza. Yari umufana wa Mukura Victory Sports."}
{"id": "23000", "revid": "11347", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23000", "title": "Rayina Laf", "text": "Rayina Laf, wavutse ku itariki ya13 septembre 1933 i Genoa maze apfa ku itariki ya11 d\u00e9cembre 2024 Ni umunyamategeko n'umwarimu wagize uruhare runini mu burezi bw'amategeko no guharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu mu Rwanda. Azwi cyane cyane kubera uruhare yagize mu gusana urwego rw'ubutabera mu Rwanda nyuma ya jenoside yo mu 1994 no gushinga Ishuri ryigenga rya Ahazaza.\nUbuzima bwe.\nUrubyiruko n'amahugurwa.\nRayina Laf yavukiye i Genoa mu Butaliyani, kuri se w\u2019umunyabuligariya (umushushanyi) na nyina w\u2019umutaliyani; izina rye ry\u2019ubukobwa ryari Stefanoff. Yize amategeko mu Butaliyani, mu Bwongereza no mu Bufaransa, yibanda ku mategeko mpuzamahanga n\u2019amategeko mpanabyaha. Yakomeje kwitwa Georges Luff, izina ry'umugabo we w' umwongereza (ari naho yakuye ubwenegihugu), nubwo baje gutandukana. Nyuma yo kuba i Barcelone n\u2019umugabo we, aho babyaranye abana batatu, umuryango wimukiye mu Bubiligi. Yabonye impamyabumenyi ye y\u2019ubunyangamugayo muri Kaminuza yigenga ya Buruseli (ULB) ndetse akora ibijyanye n\u2019amategeko mu rugaga rw\u2019abavoka i Buruseli mbere yo gukorera Umuryango w\u2019Abibumbye.\nImirimo yakoze.\nMu 1995, yagiye mu Rwanda nk'umwe mu bagize ubutumwa bw'Umuryango w'Abibumbye bwo gufasha mu gusana urwego rw'ubutabera rw'igihugu. Yahuguye abanyamategeko ndetse atanga inama za tekiniki n'amategeko ku bayobozi ba leta.\nNk\u2019umwarimu, Rayina Laf yigishije amasomo mu mategeko mpanabyaha, imitunganyirize y\u2019ubutabera n\u2019ubumenyi bwa politiki muri Kaminuza Nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda (ubu ni UR) no mu Ishuri ry'ikirenga Gatolika rya Kabgayi (ICK).\nIshuri ryigenga rya Ahazaza.\nMu 2006, yashinze Ishuri Rigenga rya Ahazaza riri i Muhanga, mu Rwanda, agamije gutanga uburezi bufite ireme ku bana bakomoka mu miryango itishoboye. Iri shuri, rimwe mu mashuri ya mbere yemewe mpuzamahanga (Cambridge) muri ako karere, ryatanze buruse ku banyeshuri benshi.\nUbwitange bwe.\nRayina Laf yahariye ubuzima bwe kurengera uburenganzira bwa muntu no kubona uburezi bungana. Akunze kuvugwa nk'umuntu ukomeye mu guteza imbere ubutabera n'uburezi mu Rwanda. Yahawe igihembo cya Heneri La Fontene cya 2021.\nUrupfu Rwe.\nRayina Laf yapfiriye ku itariki ya11 Ukuboza 2024, afite imyaka 91, mu Bubiligi.\nUmurage.\nAkazi ke ko gushyigikira ubutabera n'uburezi kasize ikimenyetso kirambye ku Rwanda, kandi ahora avugwa nk'uwabitangiye n'abahoze ari abakozi be ndetse n'abanyeshuri."}
{"id": "23001", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23001", "title": "Gukamura amavuta mu bihingwa", "text": "Abanyeshuri ba College Gitwe mu karere ka Ruhango biga ibijyanye n'ubumenyi rusange, bagaragaje abayobozi n'imiryango yabo ubuhanga bamaze kwiga bwo gukamura amavuta mu Bihingwa,bifashishije ikoranabuhanga ry'inganda zigezweho ubu.\nBimwe mu bihingwa bakamuramo ayo mavuta ni Soya,Ubunyobwa,Ibihwagari n'Ibigori,hakaba hari n'ibiti bize gukamuramo amavuta nk'inturusu na sipure, byose bishobora gutanga amavuta yo guteka,ayo kwisiga n'ayo gukoresha mu binyabiziga.\nUmuyobozi w'ishuri rya collage Gitwe Nshimiyimana Gilbert,avuga ko ubwo bumenyi babuhawe ku bufatanye n'ikigo cyiita ku buhinzi cyo mu Gihugu cya Isiraheri,bakaba bizeye ko bizafasha abaharangije kwihangira imirimo, cyangwa gukora mu nganda zifite ikoranabuhanga rigezweho."}
{"id": "23002", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23002", "title": "Abanyeshuri bafite ubumuga", "text": "Inzego zitandukanye zifite aho zihuriye bo kwita ku bantu ubumuga mu Rwanda,zivuga ubushakashatsi bwakozwe,bwerekanye ko umubare nyawo w'abanyeshuri bafite ubumuga utanzwi, ariko kandi n'abazwi ko biga ngo ugasanga batiga neza uko bikwiye.\nVice perezida w'impuzamiryango y'abantu bafite ubumuga mu Rwanda (NUDOR),munyangeyo Augustin, yagaragaje ko ubu bushakashatsi bwamuritswe hagamijwe kwerekana imbogamizi abana bafite ubumuga bahura na yo, mu myigire yabo,kandi bikaba byari bikozwe ku nshuro ya mbere\nbimwe mu byagaragajwe muri ubu bushakashatsi,ni uko abana bafite ubumuga batabasha kwiga neza nk'abandi, kubera impamvu zitandukanye."}
{"id": "23005", "revid": "18520", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23005", "title": "Ben &amp; Jerry's", "text": "Ben &amp; Jerry's Homemade Holdings Inc.. ni ikigo cy'Abanyamerika gikora ice cream, yawurute ikonje, na sorbet. Yashinzwe mu 1978 i Burlington, Vermont, ikigo cyavuye ku iduka rimwe rya ice cream kijya ku isoko mpuzamahanga mu myaka mike ishize. Iyi sosiyete yagurishijwe mu 2000 n'ikigo cy'Abongereza conglomerate Unilever ariko ikora nk'ishami ryigenga. Icyicaro cyayo cy'ubu kiri i South Burlington, Vermont, aho uruganda rwayo ruri i Waterbury, Vermont."}
{"id": "23006", "revid": "18520", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23006", "title": "Braum's", "text": "Braum's Inc. ni urusobe rw'amaresitora y'Abanyamerika ice cream parlor na fast food. Braum's ifite icyicaro i Oklahoma City, yashinzwe mu 1968 na William Henry \"Bill\" Braum mu Mujyi wa Oklahoma. Iyi sosiyete ikora amaresitora arenga 300 muri leta 5, cyane cyane mu Amerika y'Amajyepfo, ni ukuvuga Amerika y'Uburengerazuba bw'Amajyepfo yo Hagati ya Oklahoma na Texas."}
{"id": "23007", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23007", "title": "Ingofero yo mumazi ya polo", "text": "Ingofero ya polo yo mu mazi n'agatambaro ko mu mutwe gakoreshwa mu mikino yo mu mazi. Izi ngofero zikoreshwa mu kwerekana umukinnyi n'ikipe ye, ndetse no kurinda amatwi ye imvune zishobora guterwa n'umupira wa polo wo mu mazi ukubise umutwe cyangwa se kind gice cyose giherereye ku mutwe.\nIkoreshwa ry' ingofero ya polo yo mumazi.\nIngofero zitandukanywa bitewe n'umubare wanditseho ndetse n'ibara. Abakinnyi b'ikipe y'abashyitsi bambara ingofero z'umukara, mu gihe abakinnyi b'ikipe y'iwabo bambara ingofero z'umweru. Abazamu bambara ingofero z'umutuku zifite inomero \"1\", mu gihe abasimbura bazamu bafite ingofero zifite inomero \"1-A\" mu mikino ya NCAA, cyangwa \"13\" mu mikino mpuzamahanga ya FINA. Bityo, buri kipe izaba ifite amaseti abiri y'ingofero: imwe y'umweru indi ifite ibara ryijimye. Dukurikije amategeko ya \"NFHS yo\" gukina umupira wo mu mazi, imibare iri ku ngofero itandukanya ibara ry'ingofero, kandi ibara ry'ingofero n'ibara ry'umubare bitandukanya ibara ry'umupira. \nlkoreshwa n'mu mikino yo munsi y'amazi.\nMu mupira w'amaguru wo munsi y'amazi, Hockey yo munsi y'amazi na Rugby yo munsi y'amazi, abarushanwa bambara ingofero za polo zo mu mazi kugira ngo bamenye amakipe bakinira, kandi barinde abantu impanuka nko gucika kw'amatwi bitewe n'ibyuma by'ibaba byakoze ku gutwi. Abakinnyi bakina muri Hockey yo munsi y'amazi na Rugby yo munsi y'amazi bambara rimwe mu mabara abiri - ingofero z'umweru cyangwa iz'umukara (ni ukuvuga ubururu cyangwa umukara) mu gihe abasifuzi bo mu mazi bambara ingofero zitukura. Umupira w'amaguru wo munsi y'amazi usa n'aho ukurikiza iyi ngingo. Ingofero zikoreshwa kandi muri Aquathlon (gusiganwa munsi y'amazi) mu rwego rwo kumenyana; umwe mu bahatana yambara ingofero y'umutuku cyangwa ubururu mu gihe undi muhatana yambara ingofero y'umweru cyangwa umuhondo. "}
{"id": "23008", "revid": "18401", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23008", "title": "ImikinoPolo yo mu mazi mu Buhinde", "text": "Imikino ya Polo yo mu mazi mu Buhinde iyoborwa n'Ishyirahamwe ry' amarushanwa yo koga mu Buhinde. Ikipe y' Ubuhinde igihe yitwaye yatwaye umudari wa zahabu mu mikino ya Aziya yo mu 1951. yegukanye umudari wa feza mu mikino ya Aziya yo mu 1970, itsindwa n'Ubuyapani ibitego 4 kuri 3 mu mikino ya nyuma. Ubutaha Ubuhinde bwegukanye umudari wa bronze mu mikino ya Aziya yo mu 1982.\nAmakipe y'abagabo y'Ubuhinde mu mikino Olempike.\nUbuhinde bumaze kwitabira inshuro ebyiri mu mikino Olempike.\nImakipe y'abagabo y'Ubuhinde mu mikino ya Aziya.\nUbuhinde bumaze kwitabira imikino y'Aziya inshuro 5."}
{"id": "23009", "revid": "18401", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23009", "title": "Ikibuga (imyenda yo kogana)", "text": "\u00a0Arena SpA ni ikigo cy\u2019Abataliyani gikora imyenda yo kogana mu ma rushanwa cyashinzwe mu 1973 na Horst Dassler. Iki kigo ubu gifite icyicaro gikuru i Tolentino, mu Butaliyani. Mu 1990, Arena yagurishijwe n' ikigo cy'Adidas ku kigo cy\u2019Abayapani cyitwa Descente Ltd., kigicuruza ibicuruzwa byacyo.\nIfite amashami mu bihugu bigiye bitandukanye harimo Ubufaransa, mu Budage, no muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ikaba ikora binyuze mu muyoboro mpuzamahanga w\u2019abakwirakwiza ibicuruzwa n\u2019ababitanga, ikaba iboneka mu bihugu birenga 100 ku isi. \nArena yashinzwe mu 1973 na Horst Dassler, umuhungu wa Adolf Dassler aroi we wanashinze Adidas, area yashinzwe kugira ngo ikore imyenda yo kogana mu marushanwa. Igitekerezo cyo gukora imyenda ya siporo cyaje kuri Dassler nyuma y'uko Mark Spitz, wari umukinnyi mu marushanwa yo koga, yitwaye neza mu mikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi yabereye i Munich mu 1972, aho yatsindiye imidari irindwi ya zahabu. \nMu 1973, iki kigo cyashyize ahagaragara ubwoko bwa mbere bw'imyenda yo kogana, \"Skinfit\", ikozwe mu mwenda woroheje cyane upima amagarama 18 gusa. Nyuma y'umwaka umwe, Arena yasinye amasezerano yayo ya mbere yo gutera inkunga umukinnyi wabigize umwuga mu marushanwa yo koga wo muri Ositaraliya Shane Gould, wari waratsindiye imidari 5 ya Olempike i Munich. Arena yasohoye icyegeranyo cy'imyenda yo kogana yanditseho izina rye. \nNyuma yo kubona ko inkunga ari ingenzi ku ntsinzi y'ikirango cye, Arena yasinyishije abandi bakinnyi babigize umwuga mu mikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi yabereye i Montreal mu 1976. Bamwe mu bakinnyi batewe inkunga harimo Mark Spitz, Novella Calligaris, Steve Furniss, David Wilkie, Shirley Babashoff, Gary Hall, Klaus Dibiasi, na Ulrika Knape, n'abandi. \nMu myaka ya 1980, Arena yakoze ikoti rya \"Flyback\", ryagenewe gufunga imishumi kugira ngo rikore imyenge minini y'ibitugu. Iyindi myenda yo kogana yakozwe ni \"AquaRacer\" (1990) na \"X-Flat\" (1997), mu gihe iki kigo cyakomeje gushaka impano nshya zo kongera ku rutonde rw'abaterankunga. Bamwe mu bakinnyi basinyiye ni Alexander Popov na Franziska van Almsick. "}
{"id": "23010", "revid": "18401", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23010", "title": "Igabanuka ryibikomoka kuri peteroli", "text": "Ibiciro by'ibikomoka kuri peteroli.\nIbiciro by'lbikomoka kuri peteroli byari bimaze igihe byaratumbagiye bishobora kuba bigiye kugabanuka nyuma yo kubona ko hashobora kuba hagiye kugaruka amahoro mu gice cy'uburasirazuba bwisi. Mu munsi ishize nibwo perezida w'igihugu cya Leta zunze ubumwe za America Donald Trump yagaragaje hashobora kuba hagiye kubaho agahenge ku macyimbirane yarahaze igihe avugwa hagati y'igihugu cye ndetse na Iran.\nNyuma yicyo gihe igiciro cy'ibikomoka kuri peteroli cyaragabanyutse kugera kigwa munsi y'amadorali ijana ku kagunguru. Ibi bije nyuma yuko bamwe badatinya kuvugango Ari ingaruka nziza ry'ifungurwa ry'umuhora wa Hormuzi.\nIri gabanuka r'ibikomoka kuri peteroli ribayeho nyuma yuko habayeho kwiyongera kw' ibi bikciro bibayeho mu ntangiriro z'umwaka nyuma yotangira ry'intambara ya Iran na Leta zunze ubumwe z'America yatangiye 28 Gashyantare yabangamiye urujya nuruza rw'amato anyura mu muhora wa Hormuzi acamo ahasaga kimwe cya gatanu kibikomoka kuri peteroli\nAmashakiro.\nhttps://kigalitoday.com/ubukungu/ubucuruzi/article/ibiciro-by-ibikomoka-kuri-peteroli-byatumye-ibindi-bicuruzwa-bizamukaho-11-5\nhttps://kigalitoday.com/ubukungu/ubucuruzi/article/ibiciro-by-ibikomoka-kuri-peteroli-byatumye-ibindi-bicuruzwa-bizamukaho-11-5"}
{"id": "23011", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23011", "title": "Umukino w'umupira w'amaguru &quot;Igikombe cy'isi 2026&quot;", "text": "Igikombe cy' isi Kiri kuber mu bihugu bitatu aribyo Leta zunze ubumwe z' America, Canada na Mexico Kiri kugaragaramo amategeko mashya agenda imisifurire ataregeze akoreshwa mu bindi bikombe byisi bya ahashishize.\nAmategeko mashya y'Imisifurire.\nGutinda gutera umupira(gutera koruneri cyangwa gutangira umukino).\nmu gihe umukinnyi agiye gutera koruneri cyangwa se giutangira umupira umusifuzi ashobora kubara amasegonda 5, iyo umukinnyi atubahirije igihe, umupira uhabwa ikipe bahanganye.\nGusimbuza abakinnyi.\numukinnyi usimbuwe agomba kuba mu kibuga vuba mu masegonda 10, bitabaye ibyo usimbuza ashobora gutegereza igihe runaka mbere yo kwinjira kandi imikino wakomeje.\nKuvurwa mu kibuga.\numukinnyi wo hanze amaze kuvurwa agomba kumara akanya gato hanze mbere yo kongera kwinjira,kugirango hatagira abakinnyi bakoresha imvune mu gutinda umukino.\nIgihe cyo gufata umupira kumuzamu.\numuzamu ntagomba gukomeza gufata umupira mu ntoki igihe kirekire, iyo arengeje igihe cyagenwe aricyo amasegonda umunani koruneri ishobora guhabwa ikipe bahanganye\nAyo namwe mu mategeko amwe yashyizweho muri iki gikombe cy'isi yaba areba abakinnyi, abatoza ndetse najyanye mu bice bimwe na bimwe by' umukino"}
{"id": "23012", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23012", "title": "Agatotsi kongeye hagati ya Leta zunze ubumwe z'America na Iran", "text": "Kuri uyu wa 8 Nyakanga 2026 habaye ibitero bisya hagati ya America na Iran.\nMu minsi ya vuba, umwuka mubi hagati ya Leta zunze ubumwe z'America na Iran wongeye gukomera cyane.Raporo zigaragaza ko habayeho ibitero bishya hagati y'impande zombi, ndetse n'ibikangisho byo gukomeza ibikorwa bya gisirikare, ibintu byashyize mu kaga umuhora wa horumuz, inzira inyuramo igice kinini cy'ubucuruzwa bwa peteroli ku isi.\nAmerica yagabye ibitero byinshi byo mu kirere ku birindiro bya gisirikare bya iran, ivuga ko byari igisubizo ku bitero bya Iran yari yagabye ku mato y'ubucuruzi anyura mu muhora wa Hormuz. Ibi bitero byibasiye ibikorwa by'ubwirinzi bwo mu kirere, radari, ububiko bwa missile n'ibindi bikorwa remezo bya gisisrikare.\nIran yahise isubiza irasa missile n'indege zitagira abapilote ku birindiro by'America biri muri Kuwait na Bahrain, inavuga ko ishobora kwagura ibitero n'ibikomeza. Pwerezida wa Leta zunze ubumwe z'America Donald Trump yavuze ko amasezerano y' agahenge yari arangiye, ariko asiga umuryango ufunguye ku biganiro by'amahoro mu gihe Iran yahagarika ibikorwa byayo. ibi byatumye impungenge z'uko intambara ishobora gukwira mu karere zongera kwiyongera. "}
{"id": "23013", "revid": "8075", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23013", "title": "&quot;Polygamist &quot; filime", "text": "The Polygamist ni filime y'uruhererekane yo muri Afurika y'Epfo yasohotse kurubuga rwa Netflix ku wa 12 Kamena 2026. Yubakiye ku gitabo cyanditswe na Sue Nyathi, ikaba igizwe n'ibice 22. Inkuru yayo ikaba ishingiye ku mugabo Jonasi Gomora, Umucuruzi w'icyamamre wubatse ubukungu bukomeye ariko ubuzima bwe bwo murugo burasenyuka kubera kugira abagore n'abakunzi benshi. Abagore be batangira kurwanira urukundo, ubutegetsi n'umutungo ibintu bikurura amabanga, ubuhemu n'intambara z'imbere mu muryango.\nUduhigo imaze guca.\nMu gihe gito imaze, The polygamist yabaye imwe muri filime 10 za Netflix zirikurebwa cyane ku isi, ndetse yigeze no kugera ku mwanya wa 3 ku rutonde rwiziri kurebwa cyane ku isi. Mu cyumweru cya kabiri nyuma yo gusohoka, yarebwe inshuro zingana na milliyoni 7.7 ku rwego rw'isi, iza ku mwanya wa 2 muri filime z'uruhererekane zitari mu cyongerereza zirikureba kuri uru rubuga.\nMu byumweru bine imaze,ikomeje kuguma muri 10 zambere za Netflix ku isi, yanashimwe n'abasesenguzi ba filime, aho Rotten Tomatoes amanota 75 ku isuzuma ry'ubusesenguzi. ibibyatumwe iba imwe muri filime z'uruhererekane zo muri Afurika y'Epfo zakunzwe cyane kuri Netflix muri 2026."}
{"id": "23014", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23014", "title": "Ibitaramo bya &quot;The summer country tour&quot;", "text": "Byinshi kubyo wamenya kuri ibi bitaramo.\nThe summer country tour ni uruhererekane rw'iitaramo byahuriyemo abakanzi bane bakomeye mu Rwanda bayobowe na Bluce Melodie, The ben bafatanyije na Bwiza ndetse na Kitoko. Ibi bitaramo byatangiye tariki ya 13 Kamena aho byabereye i Musanze, 20 Kamena i Nyagatare, 27 kamena Bugesera bisorezwa i Rubavu 4 Nyakanga.\nIbi bitaramo byabaye ibitaramo byambere bizenguruka igihugu bigaragayemo umuhanzi The ben ibintu byari bimaze bvisabwa n'abafana benshi. Igitaramo cya nyuma cyabereye i Rubavu cyitabiriwe n'ibihumbio by'abafana barimo nabaturutse mu gihugu cyigituranyi vya Repubulika iharanira Demokarasi ya Congo bituma kiba kimwe mu byitabiriwe cyane mu bindi byose.\nImpaka hagati y'abafana.\nIkigitaramo cyirangiye gisize impaka hagati y'abafana ba bahanzi babiri bakomeye hano mu Rwanda aribo Bluce Melodie ndetse na The ben aho abafana babo bagiya bagaraga mu ntambara z'amagambo aho buri ruhande ruhamya ko ari rwo rwitwaye neza muri ibi bitaramo by'uruhererekane. iki kikaba kiri no mubyatumye ikigitaramo kivugwa cyane ku mbuga nkoranya mbaga"}
{"id": "23015", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23015", "title": "Ibitaramo bya &quot; MTN Iwacu na Muzika Festival&quot;", "text": "MTN I wacu na Muzika Festival ni kimwe mu bitaramo bikomeye kandi bimaze igihe kinini mu Rwanda. Bitegurwa na East African Promoters (EAP) kubufatanye na MTN Rwanda, bikaba byaratangiye muri 2019 hagamijwe kugeza imyidagaduro ku baturage bo hirya no hino mu gihugu no guteza imbere umuziki nyarwanda.\nBimwe mu byaranze bino bitaramo mu myaka itandukanye.\nIbi bitaramo bimaze kwitabirwa n'abahanzi bakomeye mu njyana zitandukanye harimo nka Bluce melodie, king james, Chriss Eazy, Juno Kizigenza, Kivumbi king ndetse n'abandi. Byinshi muri ibi bitaramo byabaye ubuntu, igice cya VIP kikishyurwa make kugirango abantu benshi babashe kubyitabira.\nMTN Iwacu na Muzika Festival 2026.\nMuri uyumwaka ibi bitaramo bizenguruka igihugu bizabera Huye, Ngoma, Nyagatare, Karongi, Muhanga, Musanze na Rubavu. Umuhanzi kevin kade yagombaga kwitabira ariko aza kubivamo kubera impamvu z'uburwayi asimburwa n'abahanzi babiri aribo Amalon na Kivumbi king. Muri uyu mwaka ibi bitaramo byashyizwemo agashya aho hiyongereyemo n'abahanzi batwaye irushanwa rya Primus Guma Guma Super Star(PGGSS)"}
