{"id": "23017", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23017", "title": "Muhura", "text": "Umurenge wa Muhura ni umwe mu mirenge igize Akarere ka Gatsibo mu Ntara y\u2019Iburasirazuba mu Rwanda. Uyu murenge ugizwe n\u2019utugari n\u2019imidugudu itandukanye. Abaturage baho batunzwe cyane n\u2019ubuhinzi n\u2019ubworozi, bikaba ari byo bikorwa by\u2019ubukungu by\u2019ingenzi.\nMuhura ufite ibikorwa remezo bitandukanye birimo amashuri, ibigo nderabuzima, amasoko n\u2019ibiro by\u2019ubuyobozi bifasha abaturage kubona serivisi no guteza imbere imibereho yabo. Umurenge ugira uruhare mu iterambere ry\u2019Akarere ka Gatsibo binyuze mu buhinzi, ubworozi, ubucuruzi n\u2019ibindi bikorwa by\u2019iterambere ry\u2019abaturage."}
{"id": "23018", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23018", "title": "Kagarara", "text": "Kagarara uzwi ku izina rya Uwizeye Enock ni umunyarwanda wamenyekanye cyane ku mbuga nkoranyambaga aho mu minsi yashize yahuye n'umunyamerika Ashton Hall nawe wamamaye cyane ku mbuga nkoranyambaga kubera gukora siporo zidasanzwe by'umwihariko kwiruka.\nImpano yahawe.\nKagarara nyuma yo kumenyana n'uyu Ashton Hall ndetse n'undi witwa Indian Ashton Hall bazengurutse ibice bitandukanye byo mu Mujyi wa Kigali kuwa 10 Nyakanga 2026 mu bikorwa bya Ashton Hall byo kuzenguruka Africa. Ni ibikorwa bakoze guhera mu gitondo cyo kuwa 10 Nyakanga 2026 aho uyu munyamerika na Kagarara wahawe izina rya Ashton Small na Indian Ashton Hall basuye BK Arena bakinana nabo bahasanze umukino wa Basketball, bakomereje kuri Stade Amahoro, bahava bajya muri Zaria Court, nyuma basura Kigali Universe ari naho batunguriye Kagarara bamuha imodoka na cheque ya 5000$. Ni ibintu byatunguye Kagarara(Ashton Small) cyane ndetse agaragaza amarangamutima."}
{"id": "23020", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23020", "title": "MUSENYERI CELESTIN HAKIZIMANA", "text": "Musenyeri Celestin Hakizimana Yavutse ku wa 14 Kanama 1963 i Kigali, avukira muri Paruwasi ya Sainte Famille muri arc diyoseze ya kigali.\nAmashuri yize.\nAmashuri abanza yayize i Kigali muri paruwasi ya Sainte Famille.Amashuri yisumbuye yayize mu Iseminari Nto ya Mutagatifu Visenti (Petit S\u00e9minaire Saint Vincent) i Rulindo kuva mu mwaka wa 1977 kugeza mu 1983.Nanone yize mu Iseminari Nkuru (Imyiteguro) mumwaka w'imyiteguro (Prop\u00e9deutique) muri seminari Nkuru ya Rutongo."}
{"id": "23021", "revid": "18401", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23021", "title": "Umurinzi w'umuvandimwe wange (Igitabo cya Sheffield)", "text": "Igitabo cya My Brother's Keeper(Umurinzi w'umuvandimwe wange) cyanditswe na Charles Sheffield mu 1982, cyasohotse mu gitabo cyanditswe na Ace Books mu 1982. Cyasubiwemo gusohoka na Baen Books mu 2000.\nIyi nkuru yabayeho mu 2000 ishize ugendeye kuko byari bimeze mu ntangiriro ya za 80. Intwari y'iyi nkuru ni umukinnyi wa piyano w'umwuga mu bitaramo, ufite impanga ye ukora akazi k'amayobera muri Minisiteri y'Ububanyi n'Amahanga ya Amerika. Aba bavandimwe bakoze mpanuka ya kajugujugu kandi kugira ngo umwe muri bo abashe kubaho, abaganga babaga imitsi bahuje ibice by'ubwonko bwabo bisigaye kugirango babashe kurokora umwe. Umurwayi warokotse, n'umuvandimwe w'umucuranzi wa piyano aba ari we ugenzura umubiri, ariko ashobora kubona ibyo murumuna we yibuka kandi akamenya ko agomba kurangiza ubutumwa bwa nyuma bw'umutasi kuri we.\nKwakira.\nJohn Clute yavuzeko iy'inkuru \"ifite imbaraga ariko ifite icyaha cyo kunanirwa gutanga ibicuruzwa,\" anenga Sheffield kuba yarashyizeho \"ikibazo cyo gutandukanya ubwonko kugira ngo kirangize ibibazo byose byo gutandukanya ubwonko\" bitera ibibazo bikomeye bya filozofi, hanyuma akayijugunya mu kwandika \"igitabo mpuzamahanga giteye ubwoba.\""}
{"id": "23022", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23022", "title": "Bwambere mu mateka amakipe ane yambere kurutonde rwa FIFA ageze muri kimwe cya kabiri kigikombe cy'isi", "text": "Udushya mu gikombe cy'isi cya 2026 dukomeje kwiyongera uko iki gikombe kigenda kigera ku mpera, nibwo bwa mbere kuva urutonde rwa FIFA (FIFA World Rankings) rwatangira mu 1992, amakipe ane ya mbere ku rutonde rwa FIFA yose yageze muri kimwe cya kabiri cy'irangiza."}
{"id": "23023", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23023", "title": "Ibihembo by'abitwaye neza muri shampiyona y'ikiciro cya mbere mu Rwanda 2026 (BK PRO LEAGUE)", "text": "Shampiyona y'ikiciro cya mbere mu rwanda yahinduriwe izina ikitwa BK Pro League yatanze ibihembo k'ubakinnyi n' abatoza bitwaye neza mu mwaka w'imikino wa 2026.\nAbatwaye ibihembo by' abitwaye neza.\n1.Umukinnyi w'umwaka (Best player of the season):.\nJean Cloude Girumugisha umukinnyi ukomoka mu gihugu cy' u Burundi ukinira ikipe ya Al Hilal sc yo mugihugu cya sudani. Aho yahembwe imodoka ifite agaciro ka miriyoni 15 z' amanyarwanda.\n2. Umukinnyi watsinze ibitego byinshi (Top scorer):.\nCheick Outtara Djibril umukinnyi ukomoka mu gihugu cya Uganda ukinira ikipe ya APR aho yatsinze ibitego 18.\n3. Umutoza w' umwaka (Coach of the Year):.\nUmutoza Laurentio &lt;mark&gt;Aurelian Reghecampf&lt;/mark&gt; wa Al Hilal sc\nIkipe y'umwaka muri BK Pro League.\nUMUNYEZAMU: James desire(Kiyovu Sports)\nBA MYUGARIRO: Jean Gilbert Byiringiro(APR FC), Ernest Ruzoro(Al Hilal sc), Mustapha Mohamed(Al Hila sc), Mustapha Mohamed (Al Hilal sc), Daba Sogoba(Al Merrikh sc)\nABAKINA HAGATI: El Hadji Madick Kane(Al Hilal sc), Joseph Sackey(Mukura Vs), Jules Razafimaro(Al Merrikh sc)\nBA RUTAHIZAMU: Jean Cloude Girumugisha(Al Hilal sc), Mbonyumwami Taiba(Marine Fc), Djibril Outtara(APR FC) "}
{"id": "23024", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23024", "title": "Irushanwa ry'Igikombe cy'Isi", "text": "Igikombe cy'isi ni irushanwa ry'imikino ku isi aho hitabira amakipe yaturutse mu bihugu bitandukanye cyangwa abantu ku giti cyabo bahagarariye ibihugu byabo bahatanira igikombe cy'isi. Igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cy'ishyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru, cyatangiye mu 1930. Kuva icyo gihe habayeho imikino myinshi yitwa \"igikombe cy'isi\", nka ICC Men's Cricket World Cup, ICC Men's T20 World Cup, ICC Men's T20 World Cup, Rugby World Cup, Rugby League Cup, Basketball World Cup, na Hockey World Cup.\nIgikombe cy'isi muri rusange, nubwo atari buri gihe, gifatwa nk'irushanwa rikomeye mu mikino yacyo, aho uwatsinze abona icyubahiro gikomeye muri uwo mukino kandi akabasha kwegukana igikombe cy'abakinnyi beza cyane mu mikino yabo. Ariko, mu mikino imwe n'imwe, igikombe Olempike gifite nibura icyubahiro kimwe, mu gihe indi mikino nko kwibira no gukora siporo y'ubugeni itandukanye hagati y'amarushanwa yabo akomeye, nka Shampiyona y'Isi n'Imikino Olempike, n'Igikombe cy'Isi, gitegurwa nk'irushanwa rito ariko ryo ku rwego rwo hejuru.\nItandukaniro riri hagati y'igikombe cy'isi na shampiyona y'isi.\nAmwe mu mashyirahamwe agenga siporo akunda izina \" shampiyona y'isi \" cyangwa irindi jambo rifitanye isano; amwe ndetse ategura igikombe cy'isi na shamipiyona y'isi gifite amategeko atandukanye. Ubusanzwe, amarushanwa nk'ayo aba mu buryo bubiri: irushanwa rigufi ry'igihe runaka cyangwa inama z'umwaka wose, ariko akenshi imikino myinshi igira igikombe cy'isi (ubusanzwe kiba kigizwe n'ibikorwa byinshi mu gihembwe kimwe), na shampiyona y'isi (ubusanzwe kiba igikorwa kimwe).\nIgikombe cy'isi cyangwa shampiyona y'isi isanzwe rikorwa mu buryo bwa rya \"knockout\" (bibanzirizwa n'icyiciro cya mbere cy'amatsinda). Ibi biba mu minsi cyangwa ibyumweru byinshi, aho abitabiriye bagabanywaho kabiri, hanyuma irushanwa rikarangira ari umukino wa nyuma w'igikombe cy'isi. Uwatsinze (abatsinze) afata igikombe cya \"World Champion\" akagikomeza kugeza igihe irushanwa rizaba (ubusanzwe nyuma y'ine). Ubu buryo bukunze kugaragara mu mikino y'amakipe. Ariko mu mikino y'abantu ku giti cyabo, gutwara igikombe bishobora gutandukana bitewe n'igihe cy'irushanwa rikurikira hagati y'uwatsinze n'uwahanganye.\nImipangire y'igihe kirekire y'umwaka.\nIgitekerezo gitandukanye, gikunzwe mu mikino y\u2019abantu ku giti cyabo, ni irushanwa rimara umwaka wose rifite inama nyinshi mu gihe cyaryo. Muri ubu buryo, gutsinda mu nama y\u2019abantu ku giti cyabo binjiza amanota menshi, kandi, ubusanzwe, imyanya myinshi iri munsi yayo ibona amanota ajyanye n\u2019umwanya wabo. Abarushanwa bakusanya amanota menshi mu gihe cy\u2019umwaka (akenshi \" igihembwe \") kandi igiteranyo cyabo cyose nyuma y\u2019uko inama zose zirangiye ni cyo kigena umukinnyi watwaye igikombe cy\u2019isi cyangwa, mu buryo bworoshye, umukinnyi watsinze igikombe cy\u2019isi. Hanyuma uwatsinze afatwa nk\u2019umukinnyi watwaye igikombe kugeza ku gikombe cy\u2019isi gitaha."}
{"id": "23025", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23025", "title": "Mount Warren", "text": "umusozi wa Warren () uherereye mu misozi miremire ya Wind River muri Leta ya Wyoming muri Amerika. Iri songa ni ryo songa rya gatatu mu misozi miremire rikaba n'irya kane rirerire muri Wyoming. Isonga riherereye mu butayu bwa Fitzpatrick bw'ishyamba rya Shoshone National Forest kandi rizamuka hejuru y'ibirunga byinshi, izwi cyane ni Dinwoody Glacier iri mu majyaruguru y'umunara w'isonga. Uwo musozi uri ku nkengero, ariko nturi imbere, haba muri Bridger National Forest cyangwa Sublette County, Wyoming.\nIbyago.\nAmamadubu n'ikibazo gihangayikishije muri iyi misozi miremire ya Wind River. Hari n'izindi mpungenge, harimo udukoko dutandukanye, inkongi z'umuriro, urubura rubi n'ubukonje bwo mu ijoro. \nIcy'ingenzi ni uko habayeho impanuka zikomeye, harimo impfu ziturutse ku mpanuka, ziterwa no kugwa mu misozi miremire no kubera amabuye agwa, mu myaka yashize, harimo 1993, 2007 (harimo umuyobozi w'inararibonye wa NOLS), 2015 na 2018. Izindi mpanuka zirimo indege yakomeretse cyane yajyanywe hafi y'umusozi wa SquareTop mu 2005, n'impanuka y'umugenzi waguye mu misozi (iterwa no kugwa ku buryo butunguranye) mu 2006 yahuje leta n'abayirokoye. Ikigo gishinzwe amashyamba cya Amerika ntigitanga inyandiko zivuguruye ku mubare wemewe w'abapfuye muri Wind River Range."}
{"id": "23026", "revid": "18401", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23026", "title": "Pariki ya Leta ya Ahjumawi Lava Springs", "text": "Pariki ya Leta ya Ahjumawi Lava Springs ni pariki ya leta ya California muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Iyi pariki iherereye mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba bwa Shasta County kandi abantu benshi bayigeraho bakoresheje ubwato gusa. \nPariki ifite kandi ntarengwa ubugari bwa, kandi ifite y'inkombe. Ibungabunga ubutayu bw'amasoko y'amazi meza n'amazi aheruka gutemba mu buryo bw'ubutaka. Imigezi irimo uruzi rwa Fall n'imigezi n'ibiyaga bifitanye isano. Inkombe ifite ibigobe by'ubururu n'ibirwa byuzuye ibiti ku burebure bwabyo. Hafi y'amasoko hari ibisigazwa by'imitego y'amafi yubatswe n'amoko kavukire ya Kaliforuniya nka Achomawi, aho iyi pariki yitiriwe. Inkuta z'amabuye magufi zikingiye ibidendezi bito cyane aho bafashe sucker na trout. Hafi bibiri bya gatatu bya itwikiriwe n'amabuye yo mu bwoko bwa basalt y'umukara itose ishyizwe mu mazi y'ibirunga mu myaka ibihumbi bibiri kugeza ku bihumbi bitanu ishize. \nLeta ya Kaliforuniya yafashe ubwo butaka bwabikorera ku va mu 1975. \nAmateka.\nPacific Gas &amp; Electric ifite ibice binini by'igishanga cyo muri ako gace. Igice kinini cy'inkombe za pariki kiri ku kiyaga kinini, cyakozwe igihe hashyirwaga imiyoboro y'amazi n'imiyoboro y'amazi. Hakozwe ubuhinzi bwa muskrat kugeza mu myaka ya 1930. Muskrat iracyagaragara mu bishanga byo muri ako gace. Ubwoko bwizi nyamaswa zitari iza gakondo buzwiho guhindura aho buba mu bishanga, byongera ibyago byo kuzura. \nGusura pariki.\nNta mihanda rusange ijya kuri pariki ihari. Imodoka z\u2019abantu ku giti cyabo zibujijwe kwinjiramo. Abashyitsi bashobora gushyira ubwato mu kiyaga kinini mu itangirizwa ry\u2019ubwato rusange bwa Pacific Gas &amp;amp; Electric (PG&amp;E) buzwi nka Rat Farm. \nHari ahantu hatatu ho kuba mugihe wasuye iyi pariki. Abashyitsi bashobora kunyura mu nzira nto zo mu mazi bakoresheje ubwato cyangwa kayaks. Hari inzira zo gutemberamo zigera kuri kilometero 30. Kuroba birabujijwe ariko guhiga birabujijwe. \nAbanyamerika kavukire.\nIzina ry'iyi pariki riha icyubahiro Achomawi (rishobora kwandikwa nka \"Ajumawi\", \"Achumawi\", na \"Ahjumawi\") izina ryayo risobanura \"aho amazi ahurira\". Iyi pariki iherereye aho uruzi rwa Fall ruhurira, uruzi rwa Pit, rufite imigezi mito n'imigezi. Achomawi ni imwe mu matsinda cumi n'amwe y'ubwoko bwa Pit River bw'abaturage kavukire. Aba baturage batuye muri iyi pariki bitaga ku migezi yo muri ako gace, bakurikirana aho amafi avuka kandi bakagabanya amafi yabo kugira ngo bazigame amafi bakoreshaga nk'ibiribwa. Achomawi aracyatuye muri ako gace. \nAmateka y'ibimera karemano.\nPariki ni imwe mu nzira nini cyane z'amazi yo munsi y'amazi mu gihugu.\" Bakora hafi y'amazi meza ku munsi mu migezi yo hejuru y'ubutaka. Amazi yo mu masoko aturuka mu gushonga kw'urubura mu misozi miremire ya Medicine Lake Volcano. \nIyi pariki iri mu gice aho Modoc Plateau ihinduka akarere k\u2019ibimera ku nkombe. Akarere kahoze karashinzwe n\u2019ibikorwa by\u2019ibirunga kandi gafite ibintu byinshi bifitanye isano na geologiya, nk\u2019imiyoboro ya lava n\u2019ibirunga byuzuyemo amazi y\u2019isoko, amamsoko n'ibindi. \nIbimera byo muri aka gace birimo ibiti bya pinusi, ceanothus, juniper yo mu burengerazuba, birchleaf na curlleaf mountain mahogany, na Garry oak. Inyoni zo muri ako gace zirimo Canada geese, snow geese, American white pelicans, blue-winged teal, Lewis's woodpeckers, northern pygmy owls, na ospreys. Izindi nyamaswa zirimo impongo n'imbwa. "}
{"id": "23027", "revid": "10173", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23027", "title": "Ibishanga bya Myristica", "text": "Ibishanga \"bya Myristica\" n'ubwoko bw'ishyamba ry'ibishanga by'amazi meza bigizwe ahanini n'ubwoko bwa \"Myristica\". Ibi biboneka mu duce dutatu two mu Buhinde. Ibishanga bya \"Myristica\" bikunzwe kuzura amazi binyuze mu mizi y'ibiti n'imizi y'amavi. Ibishanga bya \"Myristica\" biboneka mu karere ka Uttara Kanada muri Leta ya Karnataka no mu majyepfo ya Kerala, mu mirima yera mo cyane cyane ya Goa n'ahantu habiri muri Maharashtra. \nAmateka.\nIbishanga bya \"Myristica\" byasobanuwe nk'ubwoko butandukanye bw'ishyamba ry'inzitane na Krishnamurthy mu 1960. Ibi byibanzweho mu 1988 ubwo Rodgers na Panwar babivugaga nk'urusobe rw'amashyamba ruri mu kaga gakomeye mu Buhinde. Ibishanga byo muri Karnataka byakozweho ubushakashatsi burambuye na Chandran, MDS na bagenzi be mu 1999. \nNair, PV n'itsinda bafatanyije bakoze ubushakashatsi burambuye ku bimera n'inyamaswa bigaragara muri bishanga bya \"Myristica\" byo mu majyepfo ya Kerala mu 2007. Muri Kerala, ibishanga bya Myristica biboneka cyane mu turere twa Kulathupuzha, Anchal na Shendurney nukuvga mu karere ka Kollam. Nair PV na Pandalai bongeye kuvugurura ubwoko bumwe bw'ibiti byo mu bishanga mu 2012. \nGushushanya amakarita.\nIbishanga biri ku mpande zombi z'imigezi. Umupaka w'ibishanga ugaragara neza mu murima bitewe n'imizi y'ibiti. Chandran n'itsinda bafatanyije bashoboye kubona ibishanga bisaga 51 muri Uttara Kannada. Bashoboye kubyerekana ku makarita, no gusobanura aho biherereye, ariko ikarita nyayo y'imipaka ntiyageragejwe. Ikarita ya Nairpv na bagenzi be mu 2007 yari irambuye kandi bashushanyije ibishanga 60 bakoresheje ikoranabuhanga rya GPS. Ibishanga byari bifite ubuso buri hagati ya hegitari 0.25 na 10. Ibishanga biri mu buryo bubiri bw'imigezi bukwirakwiriye mu turere tubiri. Ikarita y'imipaka yagaragaje ko ubuso bwose bw'ibishanga bya Myristica muri Kerala ari hafi 1.5 km2, bingana na 0.004% by'ubutaka bwose bwa Kerala (38.864 km2) na 0.014% by'ubuso bwose bw'ishyamba rya Kerala (11.126 km2). Ibishanga byo muri Karnataka biri ku butumburuke bwa metero 300, ibishanga byo muri Kerala biri ku butumburuke bwa metero 200.\nibimera.\nChandran na bagenzi be bafatanyije batanze ibisobanuro birambuye ku bimera bagendeye ku bushakashatsi bakoze. Basanze ibimera 63 muri 130 by'indabyo byagaragaye biboneka mu Burengerazuba bwa Ghats mu Buhinde. Ubwoko bw'ibiti bw'ingenzi ni \"Gymnocranthera canarica, Myristica fatua, Mastixia arborea, Semecarpus travancorica, Hopea ponga, Lophopetalum wightianum, Holigarna grahami, Sysygium laetum\", nibindi. Ubushakashatsi bwakozwe na Nair na bagenzi be bo mu majyepfo ya Kerala mu 2007 bwerekana ibiti mirongo inani na bibiri n'ubwoko mirongo icyenda na bine by'ibimera/ibihuru. Imirasire mirongo ine n'icyenda nayo yaranditswe. Ubwoko cumi na bubiri muri ibi bimera bwashyizwe ku rutonde rw'ibimera kandi amoko agera kuri 28 muri byo aboneka mu Burengerazuba bwa Ghats. Mu bice 19 by'icyitegererezo, \"Gymnacranthera farquhariana\" yari yiganje mu bice 10. \"Myristica fatua\" yari yiganje mu bishanga 6. Mu bice bisigaye, \"Vateria indica\" yari yiganje. \"Holigarna arnottiana\" na \"Lophopetalum wightianum\" byiganje mu zindi ngamba ebyiri. \nInyamaswa.\nNair na bagenzi be bo mu majyepfo ya Kerala mu 2007 bibanze no ku nyamaswa. Ubwinshi bw'ibinyabuzima byo mu bishanga bya Myristica bwari bugizwe na Platyhelminthes - (Bipalium-2, tapeworm-1) amoko 3, Nemathelminthes - ubwoko 1, Annelida (Oligochaeta -2 na Hirudinea -2) amoko 4, Mollusca - amoko 10, Crustacean itazwi - ubwoko 1, Insecta - amoko 281 agize imiryango 83 yamenyekanye, Myriapoda - amoko 6 na Arachnidae amoko 54, Pisces amoko 14, Amphibia amoko 56, Reptilia amoko 55, Aves amoko 129 na Mammalia amoko 27. Isesengura ry'imibare y'ubushakashatsi bwa herpetofauna ryagaragaje ko hari itandukaniro mu miterere y'ibidukikije imbere no hanze y'igishanga rigira uruhare runini mu kugenzura ubwinshi bw'ibinyabuzima n'ubwinshi bw'inyamaswa zo mu mazi n'izikururuka. Inyamaswa zo mu bwoko bwa Amfibia zari zoroshye guhura n\u2019impinduka mu bidukikije. Imiterere y\u2019ubwinshi n\u2019ubwinshi ku manywa na n'ijoro, mu bishanga no mu mezi yaratandukanye. Nta tandukaniro rinini ryagaragaye mu miterere y\u2019ubwinshi bw'inyamanswa bwanditswe mu myaka ibiri. Inyamaswa nyinshi zanditswe ziri mu byiciro by\u2019urutonde rutukura n\u2019ibyagaragaye mu gace k\u2019ibirwa hagendew kubushakashatsi.\nKubungabunga.\nNair na bagenzi be bo mu majyepfo ya Kerala bagaragaza ubwinshi bw'ibinyabuzima byo mu mashyamba y'ibishanga bya Myristica. Ubushakashatsi kandi bwerekana ko hari amwe mu amakuru adafite aho ahuriye n'ubushakashatsi bushobora kuzu zuzwa gusa n'ubundi bushakashatsi muri aka karere. Ikibazo n'uburyo ubundi bushakashatsi bushobora gukorwa hatabayeho guhungabanya urusobe rw'ibinyabuzima by'ibi bishanga. Ikibazo cy'ingenzi ni ukumenya niba abantu bose bagomba kubuzwa kwinjira mu bishanga byiza kandi bitabangamiye cyane, hagasigara gusa ibishanga bibangamiye abantu (ubukerarugendo n'ubushakashatsi ku bumenyi). Kubungabunga ibi bishanga bito kandi bitatanye bigomba no gukemura ibibazo biri mu duce dukikije ibi bishanga. Ingamba zo gucunga no kubungabunga zatanzwe muri urwo rwego haruguru. "}
{"id": "23034", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23034", "title": "Umurenge wa Bwishyura", "text": "Bwishyura ni umwe mu mirenge 13 igize Akarere ka Karongi, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba bw\u2019u Rwanda. Ufite ubuso bwa kilometero kare 46,21. Mu 2022, wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 40.720.\nMu 1994, Sitade ya Gatwaro yari muri Segiteri ya Bwishyura. Muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, Abatutsi biciwe muri iyo sitade.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n\u2019abaturage.\nUmurenge wa Bwishyura ni umwe mu mirenge 13 y\u2019Akarere ka Karongi. Ufite ubuso bwa kilometero kare 46,21.\nIbarura rusange ryo mu 2012 ryabaruye abaturage 31.960. Ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022 ryabaruye abaturage 40.720. Abagabo bari 19.930. Abagore bari 20.790. Abaturage 18.530 batuye mu mujyi. Abaturage 22.190 batuye mu cyaro. Ubucucike bwari abaturage 881 kuri kilometero kare.\nImitegekere.\nUmurenge wa Bwishyura ugabanyijemo utugari. Akagari na ko kagabanyijemo imidugudu. Kiniha ni kamwe mu tugari tw\u2019Umurenge wa Bwishyura. Umudugudu wa Ruganda uri mu Kagari ka Kiniha.\nAmateka.\nMu 1994, Bwishyura yari segiteri ya Komine Gitesi, muri Perefegitura ya Kibuye. Sitade ya Gatwaro yari yubatse muri Segiteri ya Bwishyura. Ibitaro bya Kibuye byari bifatanye n\u2019iyo sitade.\nMuri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, abategetsi ba Perefegitura ya Kibuye bajyanye Abatutsi muri Sitade ya Gatwaro. Ku isonga ryabo hari Perefe Cl\u00e9ment Kayishema. Ubwicanyi muri sitade bwatangiye ku cyumweru tariki ya 18 Mata 1994.\nIruhande rw\u2019ahahoze Sitade ya Gatwaro, mu mujyi wa Kibuye, hari urwibutso rwa Jenoside."}
{"id": "23039", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23039", "title": "Lamine yamal izina rikomeje kugarukwaho cyane kwisi", "text": "Lamine Yamal ni umwe mu bakinnyi b'umupira w'amaguru bakiri bato bafite impano idasanzwe mu mikino w'umupira w'amaguru muri iki gihe. Uyu mukinnyi akina nka rutahizamu anyura kuruhande rw'ibiryo mu ikipe ya FC Barcelona no mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Espanye.\nAmateka n'inkomoko.\nLamine Yamal yavutse ku itariki ya 13 Nyakanga 2007 avukira Esplugues de Llobregat, muri Kataluniya (Esipanye). Uyu mukinnyi avuka kuri Mounir Nasraoui ari we papa we akaba akomoka muri Marroc, naho nyina Sheila Ebana akaba akomoka muri Gunea Ekwatoriyali. Uyu mukinnyi ku myaka ye mike yakuriye mu gace ka Rocafonda i Mataro ikaba ari nayo mpamvu uyu mukinnyi iyamaze gutsinda igitego akunda gukora ikimenyetso cy'intoki cyerekana nimero 304 ikaba yari kode y'iposita y'i Rocafonda akaba abikoresha mu buryo bwo kuhazirikana no mu kuhaha agaciro.\nUko yisanze akinira Fc Barcelona ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Espanye.\nLamine yamal yatangiye ibya kariyeri ye yo gukina umupira mu ishuri ry'umupira w'amaguru rya Barcelona rya La Masia afite imyaka 7 gusa, azamuka vuba cyane kubera ubuhanga bwe. Muri Mata 2023, afite imyaka 15 n'am,amezi 9 yabaye umukinnyi muto kurusha abandi bakiniye ikipe nkuru ya Barcelona mu kinyejana cya 21. sibyo gusa kuko Lamine Yamal yabaye umukinnyi muto watsinze igitego muri shampiyona ya La Liga,Supercopa de Espana, na Copa del Rey.\nMuri Nzeri 2023, yabaye umukinnyi muto watsindiye Esipanye kandi akaba n'umuto wayitsindiye igitego ku mukino wayihuje na Geworogiya. Sibyo gusa kuko uyumukinnyi yahesheje Esipanye igikombe k'iburayi (Euro 2024) aho yabaye umukinnyi muto kurusha abandi watwaye iki gikombe, ahabwa n'igijhembo cy'umukinnyi muto mwiza wirushanwa (Young Player of the Tournament), igitego yatsinze ubufaransa muri kimwe cya kabiri cyatorewe kuba igitego cyiza kirushanwa, Sibyo gusa kuko uyu mukinnyi yanafashize igihugu ke gutwara igikombe cy'isi cya 2026."}
{"id": "23042", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23042", "title": "Cecafa kagame cup 2026", "text": "CECAFA Kagame Cup.\nCECAFA KAGAME CUP ni irushanwa rihuza amakipe akomeye uo muri Afurika y'iburasirazuba no hagati (CECAFA ZONE). Mu 2026 ryabereye i Kigali, Rwanda kuva ku wa 24 Nyakanga kugeza ku wa 7 Kanama 2026, ikaba ari imikino yakiniwe ku bibuga aribyo Amahoro stadium na Kigali Pele stadium.\nIri rushanwa ryitabiriwe n'amakipe 12 yaragabanyije mu matsinda atatu(3)\nItsinda 3.\nRayon Sport yaherukaga kugitwara mu 1988, yongeye kugitwara hashize imyaka 28 itsinze Gor Mahia yashakaag icya Kane ibitego 2 kuri 1. \nUdushya twabaye muri CECAFA KAGAME CUP 2026.\nIri rushanwa ryatangiye ikipe ya APR Fc ikubitwa ibitego 5 na Gor Mahia mu mukino wafunguye irir rushanwa. Jamus Fc ikipe yaje ititezweho byinshi yabaye imwe mu makipe yatangaje abantu cyane kubera ukuntu yitwaye neza bikaza no kuyiha amahirwe yo gukina imikino ya kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza.\nBimwe kubyo wamenya ku bakinnyi bahize abandi, Emmanuel Nshimiyimana kapiteni wa Rayon Sport yahawe igihembo cya Best Player of CECAFA Kagame cup 2026 kubera uruhare rukomeye yagize mu gufasha Rayons Sport kwegukan igikombe ndetse ikipe ya Al Hilar yatwaye umwanya wa 3 itsinze Jamus FC"}
{"id": "23043", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23043", "title": "Ihagarikwa rya bimwe mu binyobwa bisembuye bikunze kwitwa &quot;Ibyuma&quot;", "text": "Amabwiriza mashya ya Rwanda FDA agenga ibinyobwa bisindisha, yasize amoko 52 y'inzoga afatiwe ibyemezo byo guhagarikwa ndetse no kutemererwa gucuruzwa ku isoko ry' u Rwanda bitewe n'ibipimo by'umutekano n'ubuziranenge..\nKu wa 20 Nyakanga 2026, Polisi y' u Rwanda yatangije gahunda ya \"SI ZO ZAWE, ZANGE\" yo kurwanya inzoga zitemewe cyangwa zahinduwemo ibintu bishobora guteza uburwayi. Ibi bije nyuma y' amakuru mashya y'ihagarikwa ry'agateganyo itumizwa mu Rwanda ry' amoko 52 y'ibinyobwa bisembuye.\nItangazo rya Rwanda FDA ryasabye guhagarika itumizwa,ikwirakwiza ry'inzoga zitemewe zirimo izizwi cyane arizo Kiwingu Spirit, Konyagi, Diamonda Rock Gin zikorerwa muri Tanzania, Gilbey's Flavored Gin ikorerwa muri Uganda ndetse n'izindi. Si izo gusa kuko mu moko menshi yahagaritswe harimo izituruka muri Uganda, Tanzania, Burundi, India na Polanda.\nKuki zahagaritswe?\nIki cyemezo cyashyizweho mu rwego rwo kurengera ubuzima bw'abaturage no kugenzura ubuziranenge bw'ibinyobwa bisembuye, Rwanda FDA ikigo gifite inshingano zo kugenzura ibicuruzwa bishobora kugira ingaruka kubuzima rusange"}
{"id": "23044", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23044", "title": "Umwaka w'imikino 2026/2027 mu ma shampiyona akomeye kw'isi", "text": "Mu gihe hirya no hino kwisi amakipe akomeje kwitegura umwaka w'imikino wa 2026/2027 hirya no hino kw'isi hamaze kumenyekana igihe amashampiyona ndetse n'amarushanwa akomeye azagarukira\nIrushanwa rya amakipe yabaye ayambere iwayo mu bihugu byiburayi(UEFA Champions Legue).\nUEFA ishyirahamwe ry'umupira ritegura amarushanwa mu bihugu by'ibirayi ryamaze gutangaza ko imikino ya UEFA Champion League iztangira mu bihe bikurikira\nImikino yo gushaka itike yatangiye itariki 7 Nyakanaga 2026, kandi izarangira 26 Kanama 2026\nImikino yo mumatsinda, amakipe 36 azakina amatsinda imikino yayo izatangira muri Nzeri 2026\nUmukino wanyuma, amakipe azagera ku mukino wanyuma azakina umukino wanyuma 5 Kamena 2027 kuri Estadio Metropolitano i Madrid mu gihugu cya Espagne\nShampiyona y'ikiciro cya mbere mu bwongereza (English Premier League).\nShampiyona y'ikiciro cya mbere mu bwongereza 2026/27 biteganyijwe ko izatangira ku wa Gatanu, tariki 21 Kanama 2026. umukino ufungura ni Arsenal ifite igikombe giheruka ndetse na Coventry city yazamutse mu kiciro cya kabiri. Iyi shampiyona ikaba izarangira ku wa 30 Gicurasi 2027\nShampiona y'ikiciro cya mbere muri espagne (La Liga).\nMu gihugu cya Espagne biteganyijwe ko shampiona yabao y'ikiciro cya mbere izatangira ku wa 14 Kanama 2026 ikaba izarangira muri Gicurasi 2027. Umukino ufungura iyi shampiyona uzba hagati ya Alaves ndeste n'ikipe ya Getafe\nAndi mashampiyona abantu bategereje.\nShampiyona y'ikiciro cya mbere mu Bufaransa (Ligue 1) biteganyijwe ko izatangira ku wa 21 Kanama 2026 ikarangira 29 Gicurasi 2027\nShampiyona y'ikiciro cya mbere mu Butariyani (Serie 1) biteganyijwe ko izatangira 22-23 Kanama 2026 ikarangira 29 Gicurasi 2027\nShampiyona y'ikiciro cya mbere mu Budage (Bundesliga) biteganyijwe ko izatangira 28 Kanama 2026 ikarangira 22 Gicurasi 2027\nShampiyona y'ikiciro cya mbere mu Rwanda 2026/27.\nShampiyona y' u Rwanda mu mupira wa magauru (BK Pro League) y'umwaka wa 2026/27 izatangira ku wa 4 Nzeri 2026, mu ngengabihe nshyashya yashyizwe hanze na FERWAFA ishyirahamwe ry'imipira w'amaguru mu Rwanda igaragaza ko:"}
