{"id": "23049", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23049", "title": "Intara ya Beyla", "text": "Intara ya Beyla ni agace k'ubuyobozi bwa Gineya, gaherereye mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba bw'igihugu. Umurwa mukuru wayo ni umujyi wa Beyla.\nAmateka.\nMbere y'itegeko ryo ku ya 20 Kanama 2026, agace k'intara ya Beyla kari mu gace ka Nzerekore. Icyo gihe umujyi wa Beyla wari umurwa mukuru w'intara yitwaga iryo zina. Iteka rya Perezida ryashyizeho Beyla nk'intara kubuyobozi bwuzuye, gafite ububasha ku turere twa Beyla (umurwa mukuru), Sinko, Kouankan na Karala. Yashinzwe nk'agace k'ubuyobozi n'itegeko rya perezida ryo ku ya 20 Kanama 2026, rishyiraho Intara 11 n'uturere dushya 2.\nUbumenyi bw'isi.\nAho akarere gaherereye.\nAgace ka Beyla gaherereye mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba bwa Gineya, gahana imbibi na Kote d'Ivuware,na Liberiya. Mu majyaruguru ihana imbibi n'akarere ka Kankan, mu burasirazuba hari Kote d'Ivuware, mu majyepfo hari Liberiya, mu burengerazuba hari akarere ka Nzerekore.\nIbice bito.\nAgace ka Beyla kagizwe n'intara enye:"}
{"id": "23053", "revid": "18854", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23053", "title": "Obradoiro CAB", "text": "Obradoiro Clube de Amigos do Baloncesto, S.A.D. (lit, Obradoiro Inshuti za Basketball Club), izwi kandi nka Monbus Obradoiro kubwimpamvu zo gutera inkunga, ni ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya basketball ifite icyicaro i Santiago de Compostela, Galicia. Ikipe ubu irushanwa muri Liga ACB. Iyi kipe yashinzwe mu 1970."}
{"id": "23055", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23055", "title": "Hafidh Ameir Hassan", "text": "Hafidh Ameir Hassan, wavutse ku ya 1 Mutarama 1946 i Kisakasaka, agapfa ku ya 7 Nzeri 2026 i Zanzibar, yari umuhanga mu by'ubuhinzi n'uwahoze ari umuyobozi mu rwego rw'ubuhinzi muri Tanzaniya, akaba yari umugabo wa Perezida Samia Suluhu Hassan. Hafidh Ameir Hassan yabaye umugabo wa mbere wa Perezida wa Tanzaniya witiriwe \"First Gentleman\", nyuma y'uko Samia Suluhu Hassan abaye Perezida muri Werurwe 2021.\nUbuzima.\nAmashuri n'umwuga.\nHafidh Ameir Hassan yavukiye i Kisakasaka, muri Zanzibar, ku ya 1 Mutarama 1946. Kisakasaka iherereye mu karere ka Magharibi B, mu gice cya Unguja Urban-West. Hafidh Ameir Hassan yize amashuri abanza i Kombeni Shakani, akomereza amashuri yisumbuye muri Tumekuja School i Mkunazini, aho Hafidh Ameir Hassan yarangirije mu 1965.\nMu 1970, Hafidh Ameir Hassan yatangiye kwiga muri Zanzibar Teachers' College, arangiza amasomo mu 1973. Nyuma yaho Hafidh Ameir Hassan yabaye umwarimu mu bigo bitandukanye by'amashuri muri Tanzaniya. Hafidh Ameir Hassan yaje kwerekeza mu buhinzi, akurikirana amahugurwa yihariye muri Uyole Agricultural College i Mbeya.\nMu 1982, Hafidh Ameir Hassan yabaye umwigisha w'ubuhinzi muri Fidel Castro School ku kirwa cya Pemba. Hafidh Ameir Hassan yakomeje amahugurwa hanze y'igihugu, harimo muri Sri Lanka, aho Hafidh Ameir Hassan yize ubuhinzi kandi agira ubumenyi bwihariye mu buhinzi bw'imikindo itanga cocotier. Nyuma yaho, Hafidh Ameir Hassan yakurikiranye mu Bwongereza amahugurwa yo ku rwego rwa master's mu by'ubukanishi bukoreshwa mu buhinzi, yibanda ku mashini z'ubuhinzi.\nNyuma yo gusubira i Zanzibar, Hafidh Ameir Hassan yakoreye Minisiteri y'Ubuhinzi ya Zanzibar kugeza Hafidh Ameir Hassan agiye mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru mu 2005. Nyuma yaho Hafidh Ameir Hassan yakomeje kwigisha muri Kizimbani Agricultural College.\nUbuzima bw'umuryango.\nHafidh Ameir Hassan yashakanye na Samia Suluhu Hassan mu 1978. Hafidh Ameir Hassan na Samia Suluhu Hassan babyaranye abana bane, abahungu batatu n'umukobwa umwe. Umukobwa wa Hafidh Ameir Hassan na Samia Suluhu Hassan, Wanu Hafidh Ameir, yinjiye muri politiki kandi yakoze imirimo ya Leta muri Tanzaniya.\nFirst Gentleman wa Tanzaniya.\nIgihe Samia Suluhu Hassan yabaga Perezida wa Repubulika Yunze Ubumwe ya Tanzaniya muri Werurwe 2021, nyuma y'urupfu rwa Perezida John Magufuli, Hafidh Ameir Hassan yabaye umugabo wa mbere washakanye n'umuntu wari uyoboye Tanzaniya ku mwanya wa Perezida. Hafidh Ameir Hassan yatangiye kwitwa \"First Gentleman\" wa Tanzaniya.\nMu gihe Samia Suluhu Hassan yari afite uruhare muri politiki y'igihugu, Hafidh Ameir Hassan yakomeje kutagaragara cyane mu bikorwa rusange. Hafidh Ameir Hassan yari azwi cyane kubera umwuga wa Hafidh Ameir Hassan mu buhinzi no mu burezi.\nUrupfu.\nHafidh Ameir Hassan yapfuye ku ya 7 Nzeri 2026 mu bitaro bya Emilio Mzena Memorial i Zanzibar, aho Hafidh Ameir Hassan yari arimo kuvurwa indwara y'umutima. Urupfu rwa Hafidh Ameir Hassan rwatangajwe na Visi Perezida wa Tanzaniya Deogratius Ndejembi, wahumurije Samia Suluhu Hassan, umuryango wa Hafidh Ameir Hassan n'abandi bari hafi ya Hafidh Ameir Hassan.\nHafidh Ameir Hassan yashyinguwe uwo munsi i Kizimkazi, muri Zanzibar. Mu muhango wo gushyingura Hafidh Ameir Hassan hari abayobozi ba Leta, abanyamadini n'abanyapolitiki bo muri Tanzaniya."}
{"id": "23076", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23076", "title": "Mausole ya Sarakawa", "text": "Mausole ya Sarakawa (mu Gifaransa: \"Mausol\u00e9e de Sarakawa\") ni ahantu h'urwibutso haherereye i Sarakawa, muri komine ya Kozah 2, mu Perefegitura ya Kozah, Intara ya Kara, muri Togo. Hibutsa impanuka y'indege yabaye ku wa 24 Mutarama 1974, ubwo indege y'ingabo zirwanira mu kirere za Togo yari itwaye Perezida Gnassingb\u00e9 Eyad\u00e9ma n'abandi bayobozi yagwaga hafi ya Sarakawa. Eyad\u00e9ma yararokotse, ariko abantu benshi bari muri iyo ndege barapfa.\nAho hantu h'urwibutso harimo ibisigazwa by'indege, igishushanyo cya Gnassingb\u00e9 Eyad\u00e9ma n'inzibutso zahariwe abapfiriye muri iyo mpanuka. Ni na ho hakorerwa buri mwaka imihango ya Leta yo kwibuka ibyabaye.\nAmateka.\nKu wa 24 Mutarama 1974, indege yo mu bwoko bwa Douglas C-47 Skytrain y'ingabo zirwanira mu kirere za Togo, yari itwaye Perezida Gnassingb\u00e9 Eyad\u00e9ma hamwe n'abayobozi benshi ba politiki n'abasirikare, yakoze impanuka hafi ya Sarakawa ubwo yavaga i Lom\u00e9 yerekeza i Pya. Eyad\u00e9ma yararokotse, ariko abantu benshi bari muri iyo ndege barapfa.\nNyuma y'impanuka, Eyad\u00e9ma yavuze ko yari yaratewe n'igikorwa cyo kwangiza indege, kijyanye n'amakimbirane yari ashingiye ku bucukuzi bwa fosifate muri Togo. Kubera iyo mpamvu, mu mihango yemewe ya Leta ya Togo, ibyabaye byakunze kwitwa \"igitero cya Sarakawa\" (mu Gifaransa: \"attentat de Sarakawa\"), nubwo izindi nyandiko zibifata nk'impanuka y'indege.\nMausole yubatswe nyuma y'iyo mpanuka, maze igenda itunganywa kugira ngo ibe urwibutso rw'igihugu n'ahantu hakorerwa imihango yo kwibuka.\nUrwibutso.\nAhantu h'urwibutso harimo ibisigazwa by'indege yakoze impanuka. Ubushakashatsi bwakozwe ku kamaro ka politiki n'ibimenyetso byubatswe ku mateka ya Sarakawa bugaragaza ko ibisigazwa by'indege ari kimwe mu bintu by'ingenzi bigize urwo rwibutso.\nAho hantu kandi hari igishushanyo cya Gnassingb\u00e9 Eyad\u00e9ma ahagaze, gikikijwe n'ahantu hatatu h'urwibutso hari amafoto y'abajenerali batatu bapfiriye muri iyo mpanuka.\nImihango yo kwibuka.\nImihango yemewe yo kwibuka ibyabaye ikorerwa kuri mausole hafi y'itariki ya 24 Mutarama buri mwaka, ari yo sabukuru y'impanuka. Ubusanzwe iyo mihango irimo gushyira indabo ku rwibutso no guha icyubahiro abapfiriye muri iyo mpanuka.\nAbayobozi bakuru ba politiki, ubutegetsi, igisirikare n'abayobozi gakondo bakunze kwitabira iyo mihango. Faure Gnassingb\u00e9 yayoboye imihango myinshi yo kwibuka yabereye aho. Mu muhango wo kwizihiza isabukuru ya 52 wabaye muri Mutarama 2026, yashyize indabo kuri mausole ari Perezida w'Inama.\nGusana no kuvugurura.\nMausole ya Sarakawa yagiye isanwa kandi ivugururwa inshuro zitandukanye. Mu 2020, Guverinoma ya Togo yagennye miliyoni 25 z'amafaranga CFA kugira ngo hakorwe imirimo yo kuyisana.\nMuri Gashyantare 2021, Guverinoma yatangaje indi gahunda yo kuvugurura urwibutso, imirimo yari iteganyijwe kumara amezi atatu.\nMu 2025, Minisiteri y'Ibikorwa Remezo n'Imirimo ya Leta yongeye gutangaza isoko ry'imirimo yo kuvugurura Mausole ya Sarakawa."}
{"id": "23077", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23077", "title": "Ibishushanyo byo ku rutare bya Namoudjoga", "text": "Ibishushanyo byo ku rutare bya Namoudjoga ni itsinda ry'ibishushanyo byo ku rutare biri ku misozi ya Namoudjoga, mu Ntara ya Savanes, mu majyaruguru ya Togo, hafi ya Dapaong. Ibyo bishushanyo biri ku rutare runini rwikinga kandi bigaragaza abantu, inyamaswa, abagendera ku mafarashi n'ibimenyetso bya jewometiri. Ni bimwe mu hantu henshi hari ubuhanzi bwo ku rutare mu karere ka Dapaong, harimo n'ibishushanyo byo muri Sogou na Maogdjoal.\nIbisobanuro.\nAho biherereye.\nAhantu ha Namoudjoga hari nko ku bilometero 25 kugeza kuri 30 mu burasirazuba bwa Dapaong, hafi y'umudugudu wa Namoudjoga, ku muhanda uva Dapaong ujya Namoudjoga unyuze i Korbongou. Hari nko ku bilometero 25 uvuye i Dapaong.\nIbishushanyo biri ku rutare runini rwakozwe n'ibidukikije, rufite isura isa n'iy'ikinyabihumyo kandi rukaba rumeze nk'ubwihisho bwo ku rutare. Ahandi hari ibishushanyo byo ku rutare muri ako karere harimo imisozi ya Sodjoual i Sogou na Maogdjoal, mu karere kagari ka Dapaong.\nIbyo bishushanyo bigaragaza abantu, inyamaswa, abagendera ku mafarashi n'ibimenyetso bya jewometiri. I Namoudjoga havugwa amatsinda ane y'ibishushanyo. Itsinda rya mbere ririmo umuntu ugendera ku ifarashi, inyamaswa ebyiri, umuntu n'ibimenyetso bibiri bya jewometiri bitaramenyekana neza. Itsinda rya kabiri rigaragaza umuntu ugendera ku ifarashi hamwe n'amafarashi abiri, naho itsinda rya kane ririmo abantu bagera kuri batanu bagendera ku mafarashi n'umuntu uhagaze.\nAhantu ha Sogou hegeranye na Namoudjoga hari ibice byinshi by'amabuye bishushanyijeho. Mu bimenyetso byanditswe ko bihari harimo imirongo ihagaze n'iryamye, imirongo y'utudomo, inziga, utudomo twihariye, abagendera ku mafarashi n'inyamaswa, hamwe n'ibimenyetso bya jewometiri n'ibishushanyo by'abantu n'inyamaswa.\nImiterere y'ubucukumbuzi.\nHafi y'ubwihisho bwo ku rutare bwa Namoudjoga habonetse ibikoresho by'ubucukumbuzi, birimo ibisigazwa by'ibikoresho by'amabuye bikozwe muri silex, ibice by'ibikoresho by'ibumba n'ibisigazwa bifitanye isano n'ikorwa rya kera ry'icyuma. Mu karere kagari ka Dapaong kandi habonetse ibimenyetso by'ikorwa ry'ibikoresho by'amabuye byo mu bihe bya kera. Muri ako karere kandi habonetse ibimenyetso byerekana ko abantu bahatuye kuva kera.\nIvumburwa n'iyandikwa.\nIbishushanyo byo ku rutare bya Namoudjoga na Sogou byavumbuwe mu 1990 n'abamisiyoneri. Nyuma byashyizwe mu nyandiko zisobanura ahantu h'ubucukumbuzi n'umurage ndangamuco wo mu majyaruguru ya Togo.\nKubungabunga, ubukerarugendo n'umurage ndangamuco.\nIbishushanyo byugarijwe n'isuri, ihindagurika ry'ikirere n'ibikorwa by'abantu. Mu 2025, isuri, imiterere y'ikirere n'ikorwa ry'ubwangizi byari bibangamiye aho hantu, kandi hari ingamba nke zo kuhakingira. Gukorakora ku mabuye nta mbogamizi na byo bituma ibishushanyo bigenda bishira.\nIbishushanyo byo ku rutare bya Namoudjoga byamamazwa nk'ahantu ndangamuco kandi hakurura ba mukerarugendo mu majyaruguru ya Togo. Aho hantu hafatwa nk'hamwe mu hantu nyamukuru hakurura ba mukerarugendo mu karere ka Dapaong.\nInyandiko z'ubukerarugendo zivuga kuri Dapaong zikunze guhuza Namoudjoga n'ahandi hantu ndangamuco ho mu karere, harimo ubuvumo n'ibigega byo ku misozi bya Nok na Maproug, hamwe n'inzu ndangamurage y'akarere ya Dapaong."}
{"id": "23078", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23078", "title": "Inzu Ndangamurage y'Akarere ka Kara", "text": "Inzu Ndangamurage y'Akarere ka Kara () ni inzu ndangamurage iherereye i Kara, muri Togo.\nIherereye mu Ngoro y'Inama ya Kara, kandi ibika ikanerekana ibintu bijyanye n'imigenzo, imibereho n'amateka y'umuco y'abaturage bo muri ako karere.\nAmateka.\nInzu ndangamurage yafunguwe mu 1983.\nNi imwe mu nzu ndangamurage rusange zo ku rwego rw'uturere muri Togo. Izindi ni Inzu Ndangamurage y'Akarere ka Maritime iri i An\u00e9ho, Inzu Ndangamurage y'Akarere ka Centrale iri i Sokod\u00e9 n'Inzu Ndangamurage y'Akarere ka Savanes iri i Dapaong.\nIbisobanuro.\nAho iherereye.\nInzu Ndangamurage y'Akarere ka Kara iri mu Ngoro y'Inama ya Kara.\nIbyegeranyo.\nInzu ndangamurage yerekana ibintu bijyanye n'imibereho ya buri munsi n'umurage ndangamuco w'abaturage bo mu Karere ka Kara. Ibyegeranyo byayo birimo ibikoresho by'ubuhinzi n'iby'ubuhigi, ibikoresho byo mu rugo, ibikoresho bya muzika, imyambaro gakondo, ibikoresho bikoreshwa mu mihango n'amafoto.\nIbyegeranyo binagaragaza uburyo bwo guhinga, ubukorikori, ububoshyi, imihango gakondo, imihango yo gushyingura n'indi migenzo n'imibereho y'abaturage.\nInzu ndangamurage ibika kandi inyandiko n'amafoto bijyanye n'amateka ya vuba ya Togo. Muri byo harimo amakuru ajyanye n'uwahoze ari Perezida wa Togo Gnassingb\u00e9 Eyad\u00e9ma, wavukiye muri ako karere, hamwe n'impanuka y'indege yabereye i Sarakawa mu 1974.\nKubungabunga no gucunga ibyegeranyo.\nMuri Gicurasi 2024, itsinda ry'abahanga bo mu buyobozi bwa Togo bushinzwe umurage ndangamuco ryakoze isuzuma ry'uburyo ibyegeranyo byo mu nzu ndangamurage rusange zo mu gihugu bibungabungwa. Inzu Ndangamurage y'Akarere ka Kara yari mu bigo byasuwe muri iryo suzuma.\nIryo suzuma ryarebaga ibintu biri mu imurikagurisha rihoraho no mu bubiko bw'inzu ndangamurage, inyandiko zibisobanura, uko bibungabunzwe ndetse n'ingamba zikenewe kugira ngo birusheho kurindwa."}
{"id": "23099", "revid": "19167", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23099", "title": "Bikira Mariya wa Nili (filime)", "text": "Filime ya Our Lady of the Nile (Bikira Mariya wa Nile) yo mu mwaka w'2019 yayobowe kandi inandikirwa na Atiq Rahimi. Iyi filime ishingiye ku gitabo cyasohotse mu mwaka w'2012 cyitwa \"Our Lady of the Nile\" cyanditswe n'umwanditsi w'Umunyarwandakazi witwa Scholastique Mukasonga, ni igitabo kivuga ku mateka y'u Rwanda, mu ntangiriro z'amakimbirane hagati y'Abahutu n'Abatutsi yaje kurangira habayeho jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. \nInkuru ya filime.\nIyi filime ivuga ku Rwanda mu ntangiriro z'umwaka w' 1990 mu ishuri ry\u2019abakobwa b\u2019abagatolika ry\u2019abana bato, Our Lady of the Nile, riri hafi y\u2019isoko y\u2019uruzi rwa Nili. Iri shuri rihuza abanyeshuri bakomokaga mu miryango y\u2019Abahutu n\u2019Abatutsi, riyobowe n\u2019abapadiri n\u2019abarimu b\u2019i Burayi. Nubwo ikigo cyatezaga imbere umuco mwiza n'indangagaciro z'idini, amacakubiri ashingiye ku moko yari agihari. Abanyeshuri b'Abatutsi bahuraga n'ivangura ridasanzwe, mu gihe abanyeshuri b'Abahutu bashishikarizwa kugaragaza ubwoko bwabo. Uko ibibazo bya politiki byarushagaho kwiyongera mu gihugu hose, ni na ko urwango muri iryo shuri rwarushagaho kwiyongera. Babitewe n\u2019ibitekerezo bya poropaganda n\u2019igitutu cyo mu miryango, bamwe mu banyeshuri bakoraga ibikorwa byo kwirukana no guhohotera bagenzi babo b\u2019Abatutsi. Gusenyuka kw'amategeko muri iryo ishuri bigaragaza isenyuka rikomeye ry'imibereho ryabaye mu muryango nyarwanda, bikaba byaraganishije u Rwanda kuri jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. \nIbihembo.\nIserukiramuco Mpuzamahanga rya Filime rya Berlin rya 2020, ryatsindiye: Crystal Bear (Generation 14plus) Filime nziza. "}
{"id": "23100", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23100", "title": "We for Them", "text": "Amateka.\nMu Murenge wa Musha mu karere ka Rwamagana.Hagara gaye abanyeshuri b'urubyiruko b'akoze itsinda ryitwa\"We For Them &amp; Music\".Bakomeje gukangurirra Urubyiruko muri rusange uko rwakwitwara kandi bagakoresha imbaraga zabo zose.\nIbikorwa.\nUrubyiruko n\u2019abayobozi ba \u2018We for Them &amp; Music\u2019 ibi nibyo bagarutseho ubwo basuraga abarwayi bo ku bitaro bya Masaka mu Karere ka Kicukiro."}
{"id": "23101", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23101", "title": "Uruganda C", "text": "Uruganda C&amp;D Pink Mango rwshinzwe n'umushoramari muri uru ruganda witwa Mukangabo Maryse Mbonyumutwa, rukora imyenda irimo n\u2019iyoherezwa mu mahanga rwatangaje ko rufite gahunda yo kubaka irerero rizajya ryita ku bana b\u2019abagore barukoramo ndetse rukazajya rubagenera impapuro z\u2019isuku bazajya bakoresha buri kwezi igihe bari mu mihango.\nIrerero.\nUru ruganda rwa C&amp;D Pink Mango ltd rukora imyenda igiye itandukanye rwizihije Umunsi Mukuru w'Abari n'Abategarugori, aha hari aba bakozi 1600 bafite 80 % bose ni abagore. Uru ruganda kandi rwemereye buri mukobwa ukoramo kuzajya ahabwa cotex imwe buri kwezi. Uru ruganda ruzatangiza umushinga witwa Pink Ubuntu, uzaba urimo irerero rizafasha abana b'abagore bakoramo, Tuzatangirana n\u2019abana bari hagati ya 70 na 100."}
{"id": "23102", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23102", "title": "Irimbi ry'Abadage rya Lom\u00e9", "text": "Irimbi ry'Abadage rya Lom\u00e9 ni irimbi rya kera riri i Lom\u00e9 muri Togo. Ni kimwe mu bisigazwa by'amateka y'ubukoloni bw'Abadage muri Togo. Ririmo imva z'abamisiyoneri, abacuruzi, abayobozi b'ubutegetsi bw'Abadage ndetse n'Abanyatogo.\nAmateka.\nIrimbi ryashinzwe mu 1893. Imva ya kera cyane ihari ni iy'umuntu wapfuye mu 1889, umurambo we ukaza kwimurirwa muri iri rimbi nyuma.\nMu 1902, guverineri w'Abadage August K\u00f6hler yategetse ko abakozi b'ubutegetsi bw'Abadage bapfiraga muri Togo bashyingurwa muri icyo gihugu aho koherezwa mu Budage. K\u00f6hler na we yapfuye nyuma y'amezi make maze ashyingurwa muri iri rimbi.\nIrimbi ririmo imva zirenga mirongo ine zo mu gihe cy'ubukoloni bw'Abadage. Mu bantu bahashyinguwe harimo abamisiyoneri, abacuruzi n'abakozi b'ubutegetsi. Nyuma y'ubutegetsi bw'Abadage, Abanyatogo barimo abapasiteri Andreas Aku na Robert Baeta na bo bahashyinguwe.\nAho riherereye.\nIrimbi riherereye hafi y'inyanja i Lom\u00e9, ku muhanda wa Tokmake wahoze witwa \"Bremer Stra\u00dfe\" mu gihe cy'ubukoloni bw'Abadage. Rikikijwe n'urukuta kandi irembo rikuru rireba mu cyerekezo cy'inyanja.\nIrimbi riri mu bisigazwa by'amateka y'ubukoloni bw'Abadage muri Togo byashyizwe mu bikorwa byo kumenyekanisha umurage w'amateka na Goethe-Institut."}
{"id": "23103", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23103", "title": "Irimbi ry'Abadage rya Mango", "text": "Irimbi ry'Abadage rya Mango ni irimbi n'ahantu ndangamateka biherereye i Mango, mu karere ka Savanes mu majyaruguru ya Togo. Harimo imva z'abasirikare batatu b'Abadage bapfuye mu mpera z'ikinyejana cya 19.\nIri rimbi riri mu hantu ndangamateka hagize umurage ndangamuco wa Togo.\nAmateka.\nIrimbi rifitanye isano n'igihe Togo yari ubukoloni bw'Ubudage. Abasirikare batatu b'Abadage, Wilhelm Bierwerth, Henrich Werner na Theodor Heitman, ni bo bahashyinguye. Bari bakorera i Sansaann\u00e9, ubu hitwa Mango, kandi bapfuye mu 1896 no mu 1899.\nIri rimbi ryavuguruwe mu 1990.\nKwibuka.\nKu wa 18 Ugushyingo 2012, Joseph Weiss, wari ambasaderi w'Ubudage muri Togo, yasuye irimbi ry'Abadage rya Mango kugira ngo yunamire abasirikare bahashyinguye. Yashyize indabo ku mva zabo ari kumwe n'abahagarariye ubuyobozi bwa Togo n'Ubudage ndetse n'abasirikare bakuru ba Togo.\nUyu muhango wanagaragajwe nk'igikorwa cyo kwibuka no gushimangira amahoro n'ubwiyunge hagati ya Togo n'Ubudage.\nUmurage ndangamuco.\nIrimbi ry'Abadage rya Mango ryashyizwe ku rutonde rw'ahantu ndangamateka n'umutungo ndangamuco wa Togo rwasohotse mu Igazeti ya Leta mu 2017. Ruri kumwe n'ibindi bimenyetso by'igihe cy'Abadage i Mango, birimo iriba ry'Abadage, inyubako ya gasutamo, ikiraro cyo ku ruzi rwa Oti n'inyubako yahoze ari iposita y'Abadage.\nKomini ya Oti 1 na yo igaragaza iri rimbi nk'ahantu ndangamateka hashobora gusurwa i Mango."}
{"id": "23106", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23106", "title": "Centre hospitalier universitaire Sylvanus Olympio", "text": "Centre hospitalier universitaire Sylvanus Olympio (CHU Sylvanus-Olympio cyangwa CHU-SO) ni ibitaro bya Leta biri i Lom\u00e9 muri Togo. Ni kimwe mu bigo bikomeye by'ubuvuzi byifashishwa mu koherezamo abarwayi muri Togo. Bitanga serivisi z'ubuvuzi, bikigishirizwamo abaganga kandi bigakorerwamo ubushakashatsi ku bufatanye n'Ishami ry'Ubumenyi bw'Ubuzima rya Kaminuza ya Lom\u00e9.\nAmateka.\nKubaka ibi bitaro byatangiye mu mpera z'imyaka ya 1940. Ibuye ry'ifatizo ryashyizweho ku wa 19 Ugushyingo 1949, maze ibitaro bifungurwa mu 1954, icyo gihe byitwaga \"Centre national hospitalier\" (CNH).\nMu 1971, ubwo hashyirwagaho ishuri ry'ubuvuzi muri Kaminuza ya B\u00e9nin yaje guhinduka Kaminuza ya Lom\u00e9, ikigo cyahawe urwego rw'ibitaro bya kaminuza, cyitwa \"Centre hospitalier universitaire de Lom\u00e9-Tokoin\". Icyo cyemezo cyemejwe n'iteka nimero 71-184 ryo ku wa 12 Ukwakira 1971.\nKu wa 26 Mata 2012, ibitaro byiswe \"Centre hospitalier universitaire Sylvanus Olympio\", mu rwego rwo guha icyubahiro Sylvanus Olympio, wabaye perezida wa mbere wa Togo. Iryo zina ryemejwe n'iteka nimero 2012-020/PR.\nInshingano.\nCHU Sylvanus Olympio ifite inshingano eshatu z'ibanze: gutanga ubuvuzi, kwigisha no gukora ubushakashatsi.\nUbuvuzi.\nIbitaro byakira abarwayi baza kwisuzumisha n'abakeneye kuryamishwa, kandi bikita ku ndwara n'impanuka byihutirwa, harimo n'ibisaba kubagwa. Bitanga ubuvuzi rusange n'ubw'inzobere.\nMu mashami y'ubuvuzi harimo ay'indwara z'umutima, ubuvuzi bw'indwara zo mu mubiri, endocrinologie, indwara z'impyiko, iz'imyakura, iz'ubuhumekero, rubagimpande n'indwara zandura. Hari kandi anesth\u00e9sie-r\u00e9animation, kubaga rusange, kubaga abana, neurochirurgie, ubuvuzi bw'amaso, oto-rhino-laryngologie, urologie-andrologie n'ubuvuzi bw'imvune n'amagufwa.\nCHU-SO ifite kandi serivisi z'ubuvuzi bw'abagore n'ibyerekeye kubyara, iz'abana n'abana bavutse imburagihe, laboratwari n'imaging y'ubuvuzi.\nInyigisho.\nIbitaro bigira uruhare mu guhugura abanyeshuri n'abaganga bari mu myitozo mu byiciro bitandukanye by'ubuvuzi, ku bufatanye n'Ishami ry'Ubumenyi bw'Ubuzima rya Kaminuza ya Lom\u00e9. Abanyeshuri bahakorera imyitozo yo kwa muganga n'amahugurwa yihariye mu mashami atandukanye.\nUbushakashatsi.\nCHU Sylvanus Olympio ikorerwamo kandi ubushakashatsi bw'ubuvuzi n'ubwa siyansi. Mu mashami yayo hakorerwa inyigo za kaminuza n'ubushakashatsi bukorerwa ku barwayi.\nSerivisi n'ibikoresho.\nCHU Sylvanus Olympio igizwe n'amashami y'ubuvuzi, kubaga, kuvura abana n'ubuvuzi bw'abagore n'ibyerekeye kubyara, hamwe na serivisi zo gusuzuma indwara na farumasi.\nSerivisi zifasha mu gusuzuma zirimo anatomie na cytologie pathologiques, biochimie, h\u00e9matologie na immunologie, histologie-embryologie, bact\u00e9riologie, virologie na parasitologie. Ikigo gifite kandi radiologie, imaging y'ubuvuzi na farumasi y'ibitaro.\nKuvugurura ibitaro.\nCHU Sylvanus Olympio yagiye ivugururwa mu rwego rwo kunoza inyubako n'ibikoresho byayo. Mu 2022, Ishami ry'Umuryango w'Abibumbye ryita ku Iterambere (PNUD) ryagize uruhare mu gusana no guha ibikoresho ishami rishinzwe kwakira indembe zikeneye kubagwa.\nImirimo yamaze amezi cumi n'abiri, irimo gusana inyubako, gutunganya icyumba cyo kubagiramo no gushyiramo ibikoresho bishya by'ubuvuzi. Yatwaye amafaranga arenga miliyoni 200 z'amafaranga CFA, kandi ubushobozi bw'ishami ry'indembe zikeneye kubagwa bwavuye ku bitanda 12 bugera kuri 30. Ibitaro byanashyizwemo scanner mu rwego rwo kongera ubushobozi bw'imaging y'ubuvuzi.\nImiyoborere n'ubushobozi.\nCHU Sylvanus Olympio iri ku butaka bwa hegitari zigera ku 10 mu gace ka Tokoin i Lom\u00e9. Ifite ubushobozi bw'ibitaro bwagenwe ku bitanda 1,138, kandi ikoresha abakozi barenga 1,000.\nMu 2017, mu ivugurura ry'imicungire y'ibitaro rishingiye ku masezerano, CHU-SO yasobanuwe nk'ikigo cya Leta gifite ubuzima gatozi n'ubwigenge mu micungire y'imari. Icyo gihe ubushobozi bwari ibitanda 1,138, muri byo 830 bikaba ari byo byakoraga, naho abakozi bari 1,271."}
{"id": "23107", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23107", "title": "Rudy Ursula Hombenet Anvingui", "text": "Rudy Ursula Hombenet Anvingui (9 Kanama 1988 \u2013 27 Kanama 2026) yari umunyamakuru wo muri Gabon. Yakoreye cyane ikinyamakuru \"L'Union\", aho yabaye umunyamakuru, umwanditsi w'inkuru zihoraho ndetse akanagira uruhare mu guteza imbere itangazamakuru ryacyo ryo kuri interineti.\nUbuzima.\nAmashuri n'intangiriro z'umwuga.\nHombenet Anvingui yize muri Universit\u00e9 Omar-Bongo i Libreville, ahakura impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu bijyanye n'itumanaho n'itangazamakuru.\nMu rwego rwo kongera ubumenyi bw'umwuga, yanitabiriye amahugurwa yo hanze y'igihugu, harimo ayo yakoreye muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika.\nUmwuga.\nHombenet Anvingui wakomokaga i Moanda, yatangiye gukora mu bitangazamakuru mbere yo kujya muri \"L'Union\". Mu 2016 yatangiye kuhakorera nk'umunyamakuru wigenga, aza guhabwa akazi gahoraho muri Nyakanga 2019.\nYibandaga cyane ku ngingo z'imibereho y'abaturage, zirimo uburezi, uburenganzira bw'abagore, ikoranabuhanga n'ubuzima rusange. Muri \"L'Union\" yakoze nk'umunyamakuru n'umwanditsi w'inkuru z'ubuzima, ndetse agira uruhare mu guteza imbere urubuga rw'ikinyamakuru n'ibindi bikorwa byacyo byo kuri interineti.\nYanagize uruhare mu gutegura uburyo bushya bwo gutangaza amakuru, burimo ibiganiro \"Face \u00e0 L'Union\" na \"L'U Express\".\nIbihembo.\nMuri Kamena 2026, Hombenet Anvingui yahawe igihembo cy'umunyamakuru mwiza w'itangazamakuru ryanditse mu bihembo bya Makongonio, bigenewe abanyamakuru bo muri Gabon.\nUrupfu.\nRudy Ursula Hombenet Anvingui yapfiriye i Libreville mu ijoro ryo ku wa 26 rishyira ku wa 27 Kanama 2026, afite imyaka 38."}
{"id": "23108", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23108", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kamembe", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kamembe ni urwibutso ruherereye i Kamembe, mu Akarere ka Rusizi, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba y'u Rwanda. Rushyinguyemo kandi rwibukirwamo Abatutsi bishwe muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, by'umwihariko abiciwe mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Cyangugu. Kuri uru rwibutso hanabera ibikorwa ngarukamwaka byo Kwibuka.\nAho ruherereye.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Kamembe ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kamembe ni rumwe mu nzibutso n'imva rusange nyinshi ziri mu Rwanda no hanze yarwo, zibumbatiye amateka ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994.\nZimwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside, nk'Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Murambi, Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kigali n'Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Bisesero, zashyizwe mu Murage w'Isi wa UNESCO.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kamembe ruherereye iruhande rwa Sitade Kamarampaka, mu Murenge wa Kamembe, Akarere ka Rusizi, mu Ntara y'Iburengerazuba, hafi y'Ikiyaga cya Kivu.\nAmateka.\nKamembe iherereye mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Cyangugu, aho itotezwa ry'Abatutsi (kumeneshwa, gufungwa n'ubundi bugizi bwa nabi) ryatangiye kuva mu 1959, rikongera gukaza umurego mu 1963\u20131964 no mu 1973. Hagati ya 1990 na 1994, gutegura no gushyira mu bikorwa Jenoside byitabiriwe n'abayobozi ba Leta, ab'inzego z'ubutegetsi n'iz'umutekano kugeza ku rwego rw'ibanze; abasivili baratojwe bahabwa intwaro, kandi bariyeri zishyirwa mu mujyi wa Kamembe no mu nkengero zawo. Nyuma y'ihanurwa ry'indege ku wa 6 Mata 1994, ubwicanyi bwakajije umurego muri perefegitura; i Cyangugu bwakomeje kugeza mu mpera za Kanama 1994, nyuma y'ahandi henshi mu gihugu. Kuba ingabo za Op\u00e9ration Turquoise zari i Kamembe (muri \u00abZone humanitaire s\u00fbre\u00bb) ntibyabujije ibyaha gukomeza; hari ibikorwa by'ubugizi bwa nabi byavuzwe kandi abenshi mu bakoze Jenoside bahungiye mu yahoze ari Zayire, ubu ni Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nUrwibutso rwa Kamembe rwubatswe kugira ngo rushyingure mu cyubahiro imibiri y'abazize Jenoside, rubungabunge amazina y'abamenyekanye kandi rube ahantu ho kwibukira no kwigisha amateka, cyane cyane mu bikorwa ngarukamwaka byo \"Kwibuka\".\nAmateka rusange (1959\u20131993).\nAmateka y'itotezwa ry'Abatutsi mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Cyangugu ni maremare, kandi yatangiye kuva mu 1959.\nUbwicanyi bwabaye mbere ya Jenoside yo mu 1994.\nMu mvururu zo hagati ya 1959 na 1961, Abatutsi barishwe, amazu yabo aratwikwa, imitungo yabo irasahurwa, birukanwa mu kazi no mu mashuri, bituma abarokotse bahungira mu Burundi no mu yahoze ari Zayire. Guhera mu mpera za 1960, abanyapolitiki, cyane cyane abarwanashyaka ba PARMEHUTU, babibye urwango, bituma guhera mu Ugushyingo 1960 haba ubukangurambaga bukomeye bwo guhohotera no kumenesha Abatutsi.\nMu mvururu za 1963\u20131964, ubwicanyi bwageze ku rwego rukabije mu 1963: Abatutsi benshi bishwe ku itegeko rya perefe Pascal Ngirabatware, wiswe \u00abGahini\u00bb. Imyaka ya 1964 na 1973 yibukwa nk'\u00abitazibagirana\u00bb kubera ubwicanyi, kwirukanwa mu mashuri no mu kazi ndetse no kwamburwa imitungo. Muri Gashyantare 1964, ikinyamakuru \"La Tribune de Lausanne\" cyise ibyo bikorwa \u00abjenoside nyayo mu Rwanda\u00bb, naho ikinyamakuru \"France Soir\" kivuga iyicwa ry'\u00abAbatutsi 12.000\u00bb.\nMu 1973, mbere y'uko Perezida Gr\u00e9goire Kayibanda ahirikwa ku butegetsi na Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana, Perefegitura ya Cyangugu yibasiwe n'imvururu zikomeye. Abatutsi birukanwe mu mashuri no mu kazi, imidugudu yabo iratwikwa kandi imitungo yabo irasahurwa. Ubwo bwicanyi bwo mu 1973 bwiswe \u00abKajwangara\u00bb, kubera ko ababukoraga biyoberanyaga bitera umucanga (\"jwangara\") bahiga Abatutsi.\nImyiteguro ya Jenoside yatangiye mu 1990. Guhera mu Ukwakira 1990, Abatutsi bo muri ako gace baratotejwe bikomeye, barahohoterwa kandi barafungwa bashinjwa gukorana n'Inkotanyi. Ibinyamakuru nka \"Kangura\" na \"Imvaho\" byakwirakwijwe cyane muri perefegitura bibiba urwango.\nIshyirwa mu bikorwa rya Jenoside i Kamembe mu 1994.\nKomini Kamembe yari icyicaro cya Perefegitura ya Cyangugu, irimo inzego z'ubuyobozi bwa gisivili n'iza gisirikare, harimo n'inkambi ya gisirikare ya Karambo yayoborwaga na Liyetona Samuel Imanishimwe mu 1994.\nJenoside yatangiye mu cyahoze ari Komini Kamembe ku wa 7 Mata 1994, mu mujyi wa Kamembe. Mu ba mbere bishwe harimo Dogiteri Ignace Nagapfizi, wari umuyobozi w'ubuvuzi mu Karere k'Ubuzima ka Cyangugu akaba n'umurwanashyaka w'ishyaka PL; yishwe maze atwikirwa imbere y'urugo rwe ahitwa i Mucyo, ahagana saa yine za mu gitondo. Abandi Batutsi bari bazwi mu mujyi na bo barishwe, barimo Karangwa (umucuruzi ukomeye akaba n'umurwanashyaka wa PSD), Anicet Niyonzima (umurwanashyaka wa PL), Ndayisaba n'umuryango we, na Kongo (umucuruzi).\nUbwicanyi bwahise bukwira muri komini yose, bworoherejwe n'imyiteguro n'ibikoresho Interahamwe zari zarahawe.\nAhabereye ubwicanyi n'abagizemo uruhare.\nMu cyahoze ari Segiteri Kamembe, Abatutsi biciwe i Kadasomwa, kuri Sitade Kamarampaka n'inkengero zayo, mu cyahoze ari Selire ya Gatovu no mu nkengero z'umujyi. Ku wa 14 Mata 1994, Abatutsi bari bahunze ubwicanyi bava muri Komini Gisuma biciwe i Kadasomwa.\nMu mujyi wa Kamembe hari bariyeri zikomeye, harimo iy'i Cyapa ku muhanda wa kaburimbo, yashyizweho nyuma y'igitero cya FPR-Inkotanyi cyo mu Ukwakira 1990. Yabanje gucungwa n'abajandarume, nyuma icungwa n'Interahamwe, ikurwaho muri Nyakanga 1994 ubwo Guverinoma y'abatabazi yahungiraga muri Kongo.\nMu bashinjwa cyane ubwicanyi bwabereye kuri Sitade Kamarampaka no mu nkengero zayo harimo perefe wa Cyangugu, Liyetona Samuel Imanishimwe wayoboraga inkambi ya gisirikare ya Karambo, umushinjacyaha w'i Cyangugu, umuyobozi wa jandarumeri y'i Cyangugu na burugumesitiri wa Kamembe.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kamembe rushyinguyemo imibiri y'Abatutsi biciwe ahantu hatandukanye mu cyahoze ari Komini Kamembe no muri Cyangugu: kuri Sitade Kamarampaka n'inkengero zayo, i Kadasomwa, kuri Paruwasi ya Katedarali ya Cyangugu n'inkengero zayo, mu mujyi wa Kamembe no mu karere k'amashuri ka Gihundwe.\nUmwihariko wa Jenoside mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Cyangugu.\nJenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri Perefegitura ya Cyangugu ifite umwihariko ugaragara:\nUbugome bukabije no kurya abantu.\nPerefegitura izwiho ubugome bukabije bw'ubwicanyi bwahabereye. Hakorewe iyicarubozo rikomeye, harimo gutemagura abishwe no kotsa inyama zabo ku mishito ngo ziribwe.\nIgihe yamaze n'uruhare rw'abaturage.\nIshyirwa mu bikorwa rya Jenoside i Cyangugu ryaranzwe n'igihe kirekire ryamaze ndetse n'uruhare runini rw'ingeri zinyuranye z'abaturage.\nUruhare rwa Op\u00e9ration Turquoise.\nJenoside yabereye no muri \u00abZone humanitaire s\u00fbre\u00bb (ZHS) yagenzurwaga n'ingabo z'Abafaransa za Op\u00e9ration Turquoise, yarimo Cyangugu, Gikongoro na Kibuye. Ingabo z'Abafaransa, inyinshi zari zifite ibirindiro ku kibuga cy'indege cya Kamembe, zishinjwa gukorana n'Interahamwe n'abajandarume kuri bariyeri zo mu mujyi wa Cyangugu. Abatutsi biciwe ku kibuga cy'indege izo ngabo zihari, kandi abakoze Jenoside bahungiye muri ZHS.\nUruhare rw'abayobozi.\nAbayobozi benshi b'icyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Cyangugu baburanishijwe ku ruhare bagize mu gutegura no gushyira mu bikorwa Jenoside. Muri bo harimo Liyetona Samuel Imanishimwe, waburanishijwe n'Urukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (TPIR), wahoze ari perefe Emmanuel Bagambiki (wagizwe umwere na TPIR), ndetse na ba burugumesitiri b'amakomini nka Jean-Napol\u00e9on Mubiligi wa Kamembe, bahamijwe ibyaha n'inkiko Gacaca.\nKubera ko ruri hafi ya Sitade Kamarampaka n'umujyi wa Cyangugu (Kamembe), Urwibutso rwa Kamembe ni ahantu h'ingenzi ho kwibuka amateka mabi n'umwihariko w'ubugome bwa Jenoside muri iyi yahoze ari perefegitura. Rufite ibyumba by'imurikabikorwa n'imva rusange zibungabungiwemo imibiri y'abishwe, ndetse n'ahantu ho kwibukira hifashishwa mu bikorwa bya \"Kwibuka\"."}
{"id": "23109", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23109", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Gashirabwoba", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Gashirabwoba ni urwibutso ruherereye mu Murenge wa Bushenge, mu Akarere ka Nyamasheke, Intara y'Iburengerazuba, mu Rwanda. Rwibuka Abatutsi biciwe i Gashirabwoba no mu bindi bice bya Nyamasheke mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994.\nAho ruherereye.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Gashirabwoba ruherereye mu Murenge wa Bushenge, Akarere ka Nyamasheke, mu Ntara y'Iburengerazuba, hafi y'Ikiyaga cya Kivu.\nUrwibutso rwa Gashirabwoba ni rumwe mu nzibutso n'ahantu hashyinguwe abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda. Mu nzibutso zo mu Rwanda, iza Nyamata, Murambi, Gisozi na Bisesero zanditswe ku rutonde rw'Umurage w'Isi rwa UNESCO.\nUrwibutso rwa Gashirabwoba ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAmateka.\nUrwibutso rwa Gashirabwoba rwashyizweho kugira ngo rubungabunge amateka kandi rwibuke Abatutsi biciwe i Gashirabwoba no mu tundi duce tw'Akarere ka Nyamasheke mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nMu 2017, hatangijwe imirimo yo kubaka urwibutso rushya rwa Gashirabwoba, umushinga wari uteganyijwe gutwara amafaranga y'u Rwanda arenga miliyoni 400.\nKu wa 26 Gicurasi 2019, imibiri 15 629 y'abazize Jenoside yashyinguwe mu cyubahiro kuri uru rwibutso. Muri yo harimo imibiri 13 577 yari isanzwe ishyinguye i Gashirabwoba, 1 039 yakuwe ku rwibutso rwa Giheke, 675 yakuwe ku rwa Muyange, 268 yakuwe i Kidashira n'imibiri 70 yari yarashyinguwe mu ngo zo mu Murenge wa Bushenge.\nIyo mihango yahuje abarokotse Jenoside, abayobozi n'abaturage, kandi yari igamije guha icyubahiro imibiri yari yarabonetse cyangwa yari yarashyinguwe ahandi mbere yo kwimurirwa i Gashirabwoba.\nMu 2025, indi mibiri 30 y'abazize Jenoside yashyinguwe mu cyubahiro muri Nyamasheke mu muhango wabereye ku rwibutso rwa Gashirabwoba.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rufite ahashyinguwe imibiri y'abazize Jenoside, inyubako zagenewe ibikorwa byo kwibuka n'ahantu ho kwigishiriza amateka ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Raporo ya CNLG ivuga kandi ko urwibutso rufite isomero ryagenewe kubikwamo ibitabo n'inyandiko zivuga ku mateka ya Jenoside.\nUrwibutso runakoreshwa mu bikorwa byo kwigisha no kurwanya ihakanwa rya Jenoside. Mu mihango yo kwibuka, rwakira abarokotse Jenoside, abanyeshuri, abayobozi b'amadini n'abahagarariye inzego za Leta."}
{"id": "23110", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23110", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Remera", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Remera ni urwibutso rwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 ruherereye mu Murenge wa Remera, mu Akarere ka Ngoma, Intara y'Iburasirazuba, mu Rwanda. Rushyinguyemo imibiri y'Abatutsi biciwe mu cyahoze ari Komini Kigarama, by'umwihariko abiciwe ku biro by'iyo komini no mu nkengero zabyo.\nAho ruherereye.\nUrwibutso ruherereye hafi y'ibiro by'Umurenge wa Remera, mu gice cy'icyaro cy'Akarere ka Ngoma. Ruri hafi y'umuhanda, ibintu byateje ikibazo mu 2014 ubwo imbago z'umuhanda zageraga ku butaka bw'urwibutso.\nMu mitegekere yahozeho mbere ya 1994, Remera yari umwe mu mirenge 11 ya Komini Kigarama yo muri Perefegitura ya Kibungo. Indi mirenge yari Kabare I, Kabare II, Rurenge, Gasetsa, Kaberangwe, Vumwe, Gashanda, Fukwe, Rubona na Kansana.\nBamwe mu bayobozi bo muri Perefegitura ya Kibungo bagize uruhare mu gutegura no gushyira mu bikorwa Jenoside bakomokaga muri Komini Kigarama. Muri ako gace, Interahamwe n'indi mitwe yitwaraga gisirikare yagize uruhare mu kwibasira Abatutsi mbere no mu gihe cya Jenoside.\nNyuma ya Jenoside, mu Rwanda hashyizweho inzibutso zitandukanye zo gushyinguramo imibiri y'abazize Jenoside, kubungabunga amateka no gutanga ahantu ho kwibuka no kwigisha.\nUrwibutso rwa Remera ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAmateka.\nJenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994.\nNyuma y'ihanurwa ry'indege yari itwaye Perezida Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana ku wa 6 Mata 1994, Abatutsi benshi bo mu mirenge ya Komini Kigarama bahungiye ku biro bya komini byari i Remera bashaka ubuhungiro.\nMu gitondo cyo ku wa 7 Mata, Interahamwe zari zashyize bariyeri ku mihanda ijya ku biro bya komini zatangiye guhagarika no kwibasira Abatutsi bashakaga kuhagera. Raporo ya CNLG ivuga ko abantu bari hagati ya 1 500 na 2 000 bari bamaze guteranira ku biro bya komini, mu gihe abandi, harimo abakomeretse, bakomezaga kuhagera.\nKu wa 8 Mata 1994, burugumesitiri Emmanuel Mugiraneza, Colonel Pierre C\u00e9lestin Rwagafilita na Minisitiri Prosper Mugiraneza bagiye ku biro bya komini aho Abatutsi bari bahungiye babasabye kubarinda. Nyuma gato y'uko bahavuye, Interahamwe witwaga Emmanuel Muhinda yateye gerenade mu bantu bari bateraniye aho, yica bamwe abandi barakomereka; ubwicanyi bwakomeje nyuma y'icyo gitero.\nKu wa 11 Mata, Interahamwe zongeye gutera abari bahungiye ku biro bya komini. Brigadier Pierre Musonera wagerageje kubarinda yambuwe intwaro ku mabwiriza y'abayobozi, nyuma aricwa.\nKu wa 12 Mata, Lieutenant-colonel Anselme Nkuriyekubona yajyanye n'abasirikare, Interahamwe n'abari mu mutwe wa Simba Bataliani kongera gutera Abatutsi bari ku biro bya komini. Igitero kinini cyakurikiyeho ku wa 15 Mata 1994 cyibasiye benshi mu bari bakiri aho.\nNyuma y'uko Ingabo za FPR zifashe Komini Kigarama ahagana ku wa 20 Mata, bamwe mu barokotse bavanywe aho bajyanwa kuvurwa. Raporo ya CNLG ishyira Remera mu hantu h'ingenzi habereye ubwicanyi muri Komini Kigarama hagati ya 7 na 15 Mata 1994, kandi ivuga ko hari abantu batwitswe ari bazima abandi bagashyingurwa mu cyobo cyari hafi y'ibiro bya komini.\nIshyirwaho n'iterambere ry'urwibutso.\nNyuma ya Jenoside, imibiri y'abiciwe mu cyahoze ari Komini Kigarama yaravanywe ahantu hatandukanye, ishyirwa mu rwibutso rwubatswe i Remera ku butaka bwariho ibiro bya komini.\nMu 2014, ubuyobozi bw'Akarere ka Ngoma bwavuze ko urwibutso rwari ruri hafi cyane y'umuhanda kandi ko rwagombaga kwimurwa kubera imiterere y'ahantu. Hari gahunda yo kwimurira imibiri y'abantu bagera ku 2 900 ku Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kibungo-Ngoma, rumwe mu nzibutso zari zaratoranyijwe ku rwego rw'akarere.\nMu gihe cyo gusoza icyumweru cyo kwibuka muri Mata 2014, abarokotse bo mu Murenge wa Remera basabye ko imibiri y'ababo yaguma i Remera kugira ngo amateka y'ubwicanyi bwabereye mu cyahoze ari Komini Kigarama akomeze kubungabungwa aho yabereye. Imiryango y'abazize Jenoside n'abayobozi b'amadini banasabye kugira uruhare mu kubaka urwibutso rwujuje ibisabwa aho kwimurira imibiri i Kibungo.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rwa Remera rufite ahashyinguwe hamwe imibiri y'abazize Jenoside n'ahantu ho gukorera imihango ngarukamwaka yo Kwibuka.\nRukoreshwa kandi nk'ahantu hahurira abarokotse, imiryango y'abazize Jenoside n'abaturage bo mu cyahoze ari Komini Kigarama. Mu bikorwa byo kwibuka habamo ubuhamya, ibiganiro ku mateka no kwigisha kurwanya guhakana no gupfobya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi."}
{"id": "23111", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23111", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Rukara", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Rukara ni urwibutso rwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 ruherereye mu Murenge wa Rukara, mu Akarere ka Kayonza, Intara y'Iburasirazuba, mu Rwanda. Rushyinguyemo kandi rwibukirwamo Abatutsi biciwe i Rukara no mu duce tuyikikije.\nAho ruherereye.\nUrwibutso ruherereye mu Murenge wa Rukara, mu Karere ka Kayonza, Intara y'Iburasirazuba. Ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri muri ako karere.\nUrwibutso rwa Rukara ni rumwe mu nzibutso zibungabunga imibiri y'abazize Jenoside, zikakira ibikorwa byo Kwibuka kandi zigafasha mu kubungabunga no kwigisha amateka ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nUrwibutso rwa Rukara ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAmateka.\nMu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, ubwicanyi bwabereye i Rukara no mu nkengero zaho, by'umwihariko hafi ya misiyoni gatolika ya Rukara. Amafoto yafashwe muri Gicurasi 1994 agaragaza imibiri n'ibisigazwa by'abantu ku butaka bwa misiyoni, aho Abatutsi babarirwa mu magana bishwe muri Mata 1994.\nMuri Gicurasi 2014, imibiri y'abazize Jenoside barenga 8 000 yashyinguwe mu cyubahiro ku rwibutso rwa Rukara mu Karere ka Kayonza.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rwa Rukara rufitanye isano n'ubwicanyi bwakorewe Abatutsi muri Rukara no mu nkengero zaho. Rukoreshwa nk'ahantu ho kunamira abazize Jenoside no kwibukira abashyinguwe kuri urwo rwibutso.\nMu bihe byo Kwibuka, urwibutso rusurwa n'abarokotse Jenoside, imiryango y'abazize Jenoside, abaturage n'abandi basura aho hantu kugira ngo bibuke kandi bunamire abazize Jenoside."}
{"id": "23112", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23112", "title": "Institut facultaire des sciences agronomiques de Yangambi", "text": "Institut facultaire des sciences agronomiques de Yangambi (IFA-Yangambi) ni ikigo cya Leta cy'amashuri makuru cyo muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, cyibanda ku bumenyi bw'ubuhinzi, amashyamba n'ubuvuzi bw'amatungo. Gifitanye amateka n'ikigo cy'ubushakashatsi cya Yangambi mu ntara ya Tshopo, naho ibikorwa byacyo by'amasomo bikorerwa i Kisangani.\nAmateka.\nInkomoko ya IFA-Yangambi ishyirwa mu 1971, ubwo amashami yigishaga ubuhinzi ya Universit\u00e9 Lovanium i Kinshasa, Universit\u00e9 officielle du Congo i Lubumbashi na Universit\u00e9 libre du Congo i Kisangani yahurizwaga hamwe.\nHari amasoko atanga amatariki atandukanye yerekeye ishingwa ry'ikigo. \"World Higher Education Database\" na Infocongo bivuga 1971, mu gihe Agence universitaire de la Francophonie (AUF) ivuga ko IFA-Yangambi yashinzwe mu 1976.\nIFA-Yangambi iri mu murage w'ubushakashatsi bwa Yangambi, ahahoze icyicaro cya \"Institut national pour l'\u00e9tude agronomique du Congo belge\" (INEAC), nyuma yabaye \"Institut national pour l'\u00e9tude et la recherche agronomiques\" (INERA). Ibikorwa by'amasomo byaje kwimurirwa i Kisangani, mu gihe Yangambi yakomeje kuba ahantu hakorerwa ubushakashatsi n'igerageza mu buhinzi.\nImiterere n'ubuyobozi.\nIFA-Yangambi ni ikigo cya Leta kiri mu rwego rw'amashuri makuru ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. PRISM-RDC ya Minisiteri y'Amashuri Makuru igishyira mu bigo bya Leta byo mu ntara ya Tshopo, mu mujyi wa Kisangani.\nMichel Baudouin ni umuyobozi mukuru w'ikigo.\nAmasomo.\nIFA-Yangambi itanga amasomo mu mashami atandukanye y'ubumenyi bw'ubuhinzi. Arimo:\nIkigo gitanga impamyabumenyi kuva ku cyiciro cya mbere kugeza kuri doktora, harimo \"graduat\", \"licence\", \"Dipl\u00f4me d'\u00e9tudes sup\u00e9rieures\" (DES) na doktora. Mu mwaka w'amashuri wa 2022\u20132023, cyari gifite abanyeshuri bagera ku 5.300.\nUbushakashatsi n'ubufatanye.\nUbushakashatsi bwa IFA-Yangambi bwibanda ku buhinzi, amashyamba, urusobe rw'ibinyabuzima no gucunga umutungo kamere. Ikigo gifatanya n'imishinga mpuzamahanga y'ubushakashatsi n'amahugurwa.\nMu 2024, IFA-Yangambi yabaye kimwe mu bigo bifatanya mu mushinga \"INTERACT-Africa\", ugamije guteza imbere ikoranabuhanga ritangiza ibidukikije, kugabanya ingaruka z'imihindagurikire y'ikirere no guteza imbere ikoreshwa rirambye ry'umutungo kamere."}
{"id": "23117", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23117", "title": "Salma Maoulidi", "text": "Salma Maoulidi ni umunyamategeko, umuharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu akaba n'umuharanira uburenganzira bw'abagore ukomoka muri Tanzaniya. Ni umuyobozi mukuru w'umuryango SahibaSisters Foundation, ihuriro ry'abagore b'Abayisilamu muri Tanzaniya.\nIbikorwa.\nMaoulidi yabaye umwe mu bagize Komisiyo ishinzwe kuvugurura Itegeko Nshinga rya Tanzaniya, yashyizweho mu mwaka wa 2011, ahagarariye ikirwa cya Zanzibar.\nNi umwe mu bashinze SahibaSisters Foundation, urubuga n'ihuriro ry'abagore rigamije kubafasha mu myigishirize, mu kubatoza no mu kubaka umuryango uharanira uburenganzira bwabo. Yakoze kandi nk'umujyanama mu muryango wahoze witwa East Africa Support Unit for NGOs (EASUN), ndetse akora muri Oxfam Tanzania nk'umuhuzabikorwa wa gahunda zijyanye n'uburinganire.\nMaoulidi yanditse inyandiko nyinshi mu kinyamakuru \"Pambazuka News\" ku burenganzira bw'abagore, ku ihohoterwa rikorerwa abagore, ku burezi bw'abakuze no ku Itegeko Nshinga rya Tanzaniya."}
{"id": "23118", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23118", "title": "Lar\u00e9 Batouth Penn", "text": "Lar\u00e9 Batouth Penn ni umuhanga mu bumenyi bw'imibanire y'abantu (sosiyolojiya), umwarimu-mushakashatsi akaba n'uwahoze ari umudepite wo muri Togo.\nUbuzima n'ibikorwa.\nLar\u00e9 Batouth Penn yize muri Kaminuza Jean-Moulin Lyon 3 mu Ubufaransa, aho yakuye impamyabumenyi mu bumenyi bwa politiki n'imibanire mpuzamahanga. Ni umwarimu mukuru (\"ma\u00eetre de conf\u00e9rences\") mu bumenyi bw'imibanire y'abantu mu bigo n'ibikorwa bya Leta muri Kaminuza ya Lom\u00e9.\nUbushakashatsi bwe bwibanda ku ruhare rw'itumanaho mu iterambere ry'ibigo, ku mikoranire hagati y'ibibazo bya politiki n'imiterere y'ibigo, ndetse no ku gukusanya no gukoresha amakuru y'ubukungu (\"intelligence \u00e9conomique\") mu miyoborere y'ibigo.\nUbushakashatsi bwe bunareba kandi politiki zijyanye n'inyanja, umutekano wo mu nyanja n'inzibacyuho igana ku bukungu bushingiye ku nyanja (\"\u00e9conomie bleue\") muri Togo.\nIbikorwa bya politiki.\nLar\u00e9 Batouth Penn yabaye umudepite mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko ya Togo. Yinjiye mu Nteko mu Ukuboza 2007, asimbuye Noupokou Dammipi wari weguye, ahagarariye ifasi y'amatora ya Oti, ku rutonde rw'ishyaka Rassemblement du peuple togolais (RPT).\nNk'umunyamuryango w'ishyaka Union pour la R\u00e9publique (UNIR), yongeye gutorerwa kuba umudepite mu matora y'abadepite yo ku wa 25 Nyakanga 2013.\nMu mwaka wa 2019, yagizwe umuyobozi w'ibiro (\"chef de cabinet\") by'Inama Nkuru ishinzwe iby'Inyanja (\"Haut Conseil pour la mer\"), urwego rwa Leta ya Togo rushinzwe gufasha mu guhuza ibikorwa bya Leta mu bijyanye n'inyanja.\nMuri iki gihe, Lar\u00e9 Batouth Penn ni perezida w'umuryango Ti-Mondo."}
{"id": "23119", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23119", "title": "Nomonde Mihlali Meji", "text": "Nomonde Mihlali \"Mickey\" Meji (yavutse ku wa 9 Nzeri 1980 \u2013 apfa ku wa 13 Kanama 2026) yari umuharanira uburenganzira bw'abagore n'abakobwa wo muri Afurika y'Epfo, akaba yararwanyaga ikoreshwa ry'abantu mu mibonano mpuzabitsina ku gahato n'uburaya. Yakomokaga i Mthatha (Umtata) mu Ntara ya Eastern Cape. Nk'umuntu warokotse uburaya, yagize uruhare mu bikorwa byinshi by'imbere mu gihugu no ku rwego mpuzamahanga bijyanye n'uburenganzira bwa muntu, kurwanya virusi itera SIDA, ndetse na politiki za Leta ku bijyanye n'uburaya.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nMeji yavutse ku wa 9 Nzeri 1980. Yari afite impamyabumenyi mu itumanaho n'itangazamakuru.\nUmwuga.\nUbuhamya bwe bwite nk'uwarokotse uburaya bwari ishingiro ry'ibikorwa bye. Mu mbwirwaruhame ze, yahuzaga ubusumbane mu by'ubukungu n'imibereho muri Afurika y'Epfo, ingaruka za apartheid, n'uburyo bunyuranye abagore bamwe bakoreshwa mu mibonano mpuzabitsina ku gahato.\nYakoranye n'umuryango wo muri Afurika y'Epfo witwa Embrace Dignity, uharanira ko uburaya buvanwaho kandi ufasha abagore bahuye n'icuruzwa ry'abantu n'uburaya. Meji yafashije kandi mu gushinga imiryango n'amahuriro y'abarokotse, ahagararira sosiyete sivile mu nama nyinshi z'imbere mu gihugu n'izo ku rwego mpuzamahanga.\nMu mwaka wa 2016, Meji yinjiye muri Embrace Dignity nk'ushinzwe gahunda yo gufasha abarokotse. Akazi ke kibandaga ku burenganzira bw'abagore, ikoreshwa ry'abantu mu mibonano mpuzabitsina ku gahato, icuruzwa ry'abantu, n'ingaruka uburaya bugira ku mibereho no ku buzima.\nYafashije kandi mu kubaka amahuriro y'abarokotse. Afatanyije n'abandi barokotse uburaya, yagize uruhare mu ivuka ry'urugaga rw'abarokotse muri Afurika, ashinga gahunda yitwa Survivors Support and Empowerment Programme, igamije gufasha no guha ubushobozi abantu banyuze mu buraya.\nUbuvugizi.\nMeji yatangaga ibiganiro mu nama no mu mpaka zijyanye n'uburenganzira bwa muntu, uburaya n'ubuzima rusange. Yitabiriye by'umwihariko Inama ya 5 ya Afurika y'Epfo kuri SIDA n'Inama Mpuzamahanga kuri SIDA n'Indwara Zandurira mu Mibonano Mpuzabitsina muri Afurika (ICASA), aho yanamurikiye ubushakashatsi bwe.\nMuri Werurwe 2018, yayoboye itsinda ry'abarokotse mu iburanisha ryateguwe n'Ihuriro ry'Abagore b'Amashyaka Menshi (Multi-Party Women's Caucus) mu Inteko Ishinga Amategeko ya Afurika y'Epfo, ku mushinga wo kuvugurura amategeko agenga uburaya bw'abantu bakuru. Icyo gihe yashyigikiye ko uburaya buvanwaho burundu, anenga guhana abantu bagurisha imibonano mpuzabitsina.\nMeji yashyigikiye icyitegererezo cy'itegeko Embrace Dignity yise \"Sankara Equality Act\". Uwo mushinga ugamije gukura mu byaha kugurisha imibonano mpuzabitsina, ariko ugahana kuyigura n'uburyo bumwe bwo koroshya uburaya, bijyanye na gahunda zo gufasha abantu kuva mu buraya no kubaherekeza. Ubu buryo bumeze nk'ubwitwa \"icyitegererezo cy'ibihugu bya Nordic\" (\"Nordic model\").\nYanengaga kandi uburyo bwo kwemera no kugenga uburaya bwakoreshejwe mu bihugu bimwe, avuga ko butavanaho uburyo abantu bakoreshwa mu mibonano mpuzabitsina ku gahato.\nImyanya yo mu gihugu no ku rwego mpuzamahanga.\nMeji yabaye mu nzego nyinshi zishinzwe ubuzima rusange, uburenganzira bwa muntu na politiki zireba abagore.\nYahagarariye imiryango itari iya Leta ku mugabane wa Afurika mu Nama Ihuza Gahunda (Programme Coordinating Board) ya UNAIDS, gahunda y'Umuryango w'Abibumbye yo kurwanya virusi itera SIDA. Yari kandi umunyamuryango w'Inama y'Igihugu ya Afurika y'Epfo ishinzwe kurwanya SIDA (SANAC), aho yahagarariraga urwego rumwe.\nYitabiriye inama n'ibiganiro byinshi byo mu gihugu, mu karere no ku rwego mpuzamahanga ku burenganzira bw'abagore, virusi itera SIDA n'ikoreshwa ry'abantu mu mibonano mpuzabitsina ku gahato.\nUbuzima bwite n'urupfu.\nMeji yari umubyeyi w'abana batatu. Yapfuye ku wa 13 Kanama 2026, afite imyaka 45, habura ibyumweru bike ngo yuzuze imyaka 46.\nIbihembo.\nMeji yahawe igihembo cyitwa \"Advancing Freedom Award\" mu nama ya Coalition to End Sexual Exploitation (CESE), kubera uruhare rwe mu kurwanya ikoreshwa ry'abantu mu mibonano mpuzabitsina ku gahato no gufasha abarokotse."}
{"id": "23120", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23120", "title": "Faille d'Aledjo", "text": "Faille d'Aledjo (\"Umuhora wa Aledjo\") ni ahantu nyaburanga n'inzira y'umuhanda yaciwe mu musozi, iherereye muri Perefegitura ya Assoli, mu Ntara ya Kara, mu majyaruguru ya Togo. Iri ku birometero bigera kuri 36 mu majyaruguru y'umujyi wa Sokod\u00e9, kandi kuva kera ni inzira ihuza amajyepfo n'amajyaruguru y'igihugu. Izwi cyane kubera umuhora munini waciwe mu Misozi ya Togo, kugira ngo unyuzwemo umuhanda w'igihugu nimero 1.\nImiterere n'aho iherereye.\nFaille d'Aledjo iherereye mu Misozi ya Togo, ari yo gice cy'amajyepfo cy'Imisozi ya Atakora. Iri ku butumburuke buringaniye bwa metero zigera kuri 650, hafi y'umudugudu wa Aledjo Kadara. Ntigomba kwitiranywa n'agace kitwa Al\u00e9djo kari muri B\u00e9nin. Iri ku birometero bigera kuri 378 mu majyaruguru y'umujyi wa Lom\u00e9, kandi igaragaza aho Intara yo Hagati (Centrale) ihurira n'Intara ya Kara.\nAmateka.\nImirimo ya mbere yo gutunganya iyi nzira yatangiye mu gihe cy'ubukoloni bw'Abadage, mu ntangiriro z'ikinyejana cya 20, hagamijwe koroshya ubuhahirane hagati y'amajyepfo n'amajyaruguru y'igihugu. Umuhora uriho ubu waciwe mu musozi mu myaka ya 1950. Watumye habaho umuhanda munini uhuza Lom\u00e9 na Cinkass\u00e9, ku mupaka na Burkina Faso. Mu myaka myinshi, Faille d'Aledjo yabaye inzira y'ingenzi yo gutwara ibicuruzwa no kunyuzamo amakamyo manini yerekeza mu bihugu byo mu karere ka Sahel.\nIbikorwaremezo by'umuhanda.\nUmuhanda unyura muri uyu muhora ni wo wahoze ari inzira y'umuhanda w'igihugu nimero 1. Kubera ubuhaname, ubugufi bw'inzira n'imbogamizi za tekiniki, iki gice cy'umuhanda cyafatwaga igihe kirekire nk'igikomeye kunyuramo, cyane cyane ku binyabiziga biremereye. Mu myaka ya 2010, hubatswe umuhanda mushya wo kuzenguruka (d\u00e9viation) hagamijwe kongera umutekano no koroshya urujya n'uruza hagati ya Sokod\u00e9 na Kara. Kuva uwo muhanda mushya watangira gukoreshwa, amakamyo ntiyemerewe kunyura muri uyu muhora, ubu ukaba ukoreshwa cyane cyane n'imodoka nto.\nIbibazo n'impaka.\nIyubakwa n'isanwa ry'uwo muhanda wo kuzenguruka byanenzwe n'itangazamakuru ryo muri Togo, kubera gutinda kw'imirimo, kwangirika kw'umuhanda imburagihe, no gukekwa ko imirimo itakozwe neza. Inshuro nyinshi, gufunga by'agateganyo uwo muhanda mushya byatumye imodoka zongera kunyura mu muhanda wa kera unyura muri uyu muhora. Ibyo bibazo byateje impaka mu ruhame ku micungire y'imirimo minini yo kubaka imihanda muri Togo.\nUbukerarugendo n'umurage.\nMuri iki gihe, Faille d'Aledjo ifatwa nk'ahantu nyaburanga hasurwa na ba mukerarugendo, hafite ubwiza bw'imiterere y'igihugu. Uhereye aho, ubona neza imisozi n'imibande bihakikije, kandi umuhanda unyura mu midugudu myinshi ya gakondo. Ikunze kuvugwa nk'imwe mu hantu h'ikirango mu majyaruguru ya Togo, kandi ikurura abashyitsi bashishikajwe n'imiterere y'isi, amateka y'ibikorwaremezo n'ingendo n'amaguru. Ifatwa kandi nk'ahantu hafite agaciro mu bumenyi n'umurage kamere."}
{"id": "23124", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23124", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Bigogwe", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Bigogwe ni urwibutso rwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Ruri i Bigogwe, mu Umurenge wa Kanzenze, mu Akarere ka Rubavu, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba.\nUrwibutso rushyinguyemo imibiri 9\u00a0042 y'abazize Jenoside. Abo bantu biciwe mu yahoze ari komini Mutura na Rwerere. Urwibutso rwavuguruwe kandi rwagurwa hagati ya 2023 na 2025.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Bigogwe ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAmateka.\nMu gihe cya Jenoside yo mu 1994, Abatutsi benshi biciwe i Bigogwe no mu nkengero zaho. Ubwicanyi bwakorewe ahantu henshi. Bimwe muri ibyo bice biri mu Akarere ka Nyabihu: Bigogwe, Jenda na Kabatwa. Ibindi biri mu Akarere ka Rubavu: Kanzenze na Mudende. Ibyo bice byari mu yahoze ari komini Mutura na Rwerere.\nUmuryango Ibuka wo mu Karere ka Rubavu uvuga ko ubwicanyi bwakozwe cyane n'abasirikare b'abakomando. Abo basirikare bari mu kigo cya gisirikare cya Bigogwe.\nIvugururwa.\nMbere y'ivugururwa, aha hari imva rusange gusa. Iyo mva ntiyari yujuje ibisabwa ku rwibutso rwa Jenoside. Imirimo yo kuvugurura no kwagura urwibutso yatangiye ku wa 18 Werurwe 2023. Mu gihe cy'imirimo, imibiri yimuriwe by'agateganyo mu Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyundo.\nKu wa 10 Mata 2023, abakozi babonye gerenade mu gihe bacukuraga. Nta muntu wakomeretse. RIB yatwaye iyo gerenade. Imirimo yakomeje uwo munsi.\nImirimo yarangiye mu 2025. Yatwaye amafaranga y'u Rwanda arenga miliyari imwe. Imibiri yari iteganyijwe kugarurwa mu rwibutso ku wa 16 Gicurasi 2025.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rushya rufite imva rusange iri munsi y'ubutaka. Rufite kandi urumuri rw'icyizere. Hari igice cy'amateka, aho kwakirira abashyitsi, inzu mberabyombi n'ibiro. Hari n'ubusitani bw'urwibutso. Urwibutso rufite uburyo bwo kuzimya inkongi na kamera z'umutekano.\nUrwibutso ruri hafi y'urutare rwitwa Ibere rya Bigogwe.\nKwibuka.\nUrwibutso rwakira ibikorwa byo Kwibuka abazize Jenoside. Ku wa 15 Gicurasi 2026, abantu bafashe umunota wo guceceka ku rwibutso. Uwarokotse Jenoside i Bigogwe yatanze ubuhamya. Ku wa 29 Gicurasi 2026, Komisiyo y'Igihugu y'Uburenganzira bwa Muntu yibukiye kuri uru rwibutso."}
{"id": "23125", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23125", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Rubengera", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Rubengera ni ahantu ho kwibukira Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda haherereye i Rubengera, mu Akarere ka Karongi, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba, mu Rwanda.\nRuruhukiyemo imibiri 3\u00a0439 y'abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, biciwe mu cyahoze ari Komini Mabanza, igice kimwe cyayo kikaba ari cyo Murenge wa Rubengera w'ubu.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso rwubatswe mu Murenge wa Rubengera, mu Akarere ka Karongi, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba. Ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri mu Karere ka Karongi, hamwe n'iza Bisesero, Gatwaro, Mubuga, Nyamishaba n'ahandi hantu ho kwibukira ho mu nzego z'ibanze.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Rubengera ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAhari urwibutso rwa Rubengera ni mu gice cy'icyahoze ari Komini Mabanza, mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Kibuye. Mu gihe cyo Kwibuka ku nshuro ya 31 Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, cyabaye ku wa 24 Mata 2025, Akarere ka Karongi kagaragaje ko uru rwibutso rwibukirwamo Abatutsi biciwe mu cyahoze ari Komini Mabanza, ubu ni Umurenge wa Rubengera.\nAmateka.\nImiterere n'ubwicanyi.\nUrwibutso rubungabunga urwibutso rw'abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu cyahoze ari Komini Mabanza no mu Murenge wa Rubengera w'ubu. Akarere ka Karongi kavuga ko hashyinguwe imibiri 3\u00a0439 y'abazize Jenoside.\nKugira aha hantu ahantu ho kwibukira.\nNyuma ya Jenoside, Rubengera yabaye ahantu ho gushyingura no kwibukira abiciwe mu cyahoze ari Komini Mabanza. Mu rwego rwa \"Kwibuka\", hategurwa ibikorwa byo kwibuka birimo urugendo rwo kwibuka, kunamira imibiri ishyinguye no gushyira indabo ku mva.\nMu gihe cyo kwibuka cyo mu 2025, abahagarariye Akarere na Ibuka bibukije ko ari ngombwa gufasha abarokotse, kurwanya ingengabitekerezo ya Jenoside no kumenya ahantu hakiri imibiri y'abazize Jenoside itarashyingurwa mu cyubahiro.\nIvugururwa ry'urwibutso.\nMu ntangiriro z'imyaka ya 2010, i Rubengera hubatswe urwibutso rushya. Mu 2012, umuryango World Vision watanze amafaranga y'u Rwanda miliyoni 30 yo kubaka imva rusange nshya igenewe abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Uwo mushinga watangijwe nyuma y'uko urwibutso rwa kera rwangiritse, rwangijwe n'amazi y'imvura no gusaza kw'inyubako. Ibuye ry'ifatizo ryashyizweho ku wa 14 Kamena 2012, hafi y'imva rusange ya kera.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rwa Rubengera rubungabunga urwibutso rw'Abatutsi biciwe mu cyahoze ari Komini Mabanza, igice kimwe cyayo kikaba ari Umurenge wa Rubengera w'ubu. Akarere ka Karongi kavuga ko hashyinguwe imibiri 3\u00a0439 y'abazize Jenoside.\nUko Jenoside yagenze mu cyahoze ari Komini Mabanza byanditswe mu bushakashatsi bwa Philip Verwimp ku Perefegitura ya Kibuye. Ubwo bushakashatsi, bushingiye ku gitabo cya Ibuka kibaruramo abazize Jenoside bagera ku 59\u00a0050 muri perefegitura, bugaragaza ko Abatutsi 9\u00a0257 bo muri Komini Mabanza bishwe, ni ukuvuga hafi 86% by'Abatutsi bo muri iyo komini; abarokotse babaruwe ni 1\u00a0477.\nUbushakashatsi bwa Verwimp bugaragaza kandi ko amahirwe yo kurokoka yatandukanaga bitewe n'amasegiteri ya Mabanza. Abatutsi batagiye kuri sitade y'umupira w'amaguru ya Kibuye n'abahungiye mu misozi aho bagerageje kwirwanaho bagize amahirwe menshi yo kurokoka kurusha abakusanyirijwe ahantu hanini hahurizwaga abantu benshi. Segiteri ya Rubengera iri mu masegiteri yakorewe isesengura ry'imibare ku irokoka mu cyahoze ari Komini Mabanza.\nInyandiko z'ubucamanza zerekeye Ignace Bagilishema, wahoze ari burugumesitiri wa Mabanza, na zo zigaragaza ko amatsinda y'Interahamwe yanyuraga muri Segiteri ya Rubengera. Mu ibaruwa yo ku wa 24 Kamena 1994, Bagilishema avuga ko Interahamwe zaturutse i Gisenyi kuza kongera ingufu mu bitero byagabwe ku Batutsi bo mu Bisesero hagati ya 19 na 22 Kamena 1994 zagombaga guhagarara mu isantere ya Rubengera, i Mabanza, kugira ngo zihagabe igitero. Iyo nyandiko ivuga kandi bariyeri yari yashyizwe imbere y'ibiro bya komini n'amasasu yatumye abaturage bo muri Segiteri ya Rubengera bahunga.\nUbu urwibutso ni ahantu ho gushyingura no kwibukira. Mu gihe cyo Kwibuka ku nshuro ya 31 cyabereye i Rubengera ku wa 24 Mata 2025, umuhango warimo urugendo rugana ku rwibutso, kunamira imibiri ishyinguye no gushyira indabo ku mva. Abayobozi b'inzego z'ibanze n'abahagarariye Ibuka basabye ko hakomeza gushakishwa ahantu hashobora kuba hakiri imibiri y'abazize Jenoside itarashyingurwa mu cyubahiro."}
{"id": "23126", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23126", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Mugonero", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Mugonero rwibuka ubwicanyi bwakorewe Abatutsi muri Mata 1994 i Mugonero, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba y'u Rwanda, mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda mu 1994.\nUrwibutso ruri ahahoze ibitaro by'Abadiventisiti aho ibihumbi by'Abatutsi byiciwe ku wa 16 Mata 1994, kandi ruruhukiyemo imibiri y'abazize Jenoside isaga 17\u00a0000. Rurangwa n'inzu ibitsemo amagufwa, ibyapa by'urwibutso, ibishushanyo bibajwe bigaragaza ubugizi bwa nabi n'ivangura Abatutsi bakorewe, ndetse n'amagambo yanditse mu Ikinyarwanda agaragaza ku mugaragaro ubwoko bwabo, ibyatumye kugeza mu 2009 ruba urwibutso rwihariye mu Rwanda. Rufatwa nka kimwe mu bimenyetso by'ingenzi bya Jenoside, rukaberamo kenshi imihango yo kwibuka ya Leta kandi rugasurwa n'abantu baturutse mu gihugu no mu mahanga.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Mugonero ruherereye mu Akarere ka Karongi, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba, ku kigo cy'ibitaro by'Abadiventisiti bya Mugonero, hafi y'Ikiyaga cya Kivu. Ikibanza cyarwo cyegeranye n'icya Kaminuza y'Abadiventisiti yo muri Afurika yo Hagati.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Mugonero ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Mugonero ni rumwe mu nzibutso n'imva rusange nyinshi ziri ku butaka bw'u Rwanda no mu mahanga, zifitanye isano na Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Enye muri zo \u2014 Nyamata, Murambi, Gisozi na Bisesero \u2014 zashyizwe mu Murage w'Isi wa UNESCO.\nAmateka.\nUrwibutso rwa Mugonero rwubatswe ahari ibitaro by'Abadiventisiti aho, ku wa 16 Mata 1994, ibihumbi by'Abatutsi, barimo abarwayi, abakozi b'ibitaro, abapasitori n'imiryango yabo, bishwe nyuma yo guhungira muri icyo kigo cy'ibitaro.\nAha hantu ni kimwe mu bimenyetso bikomeye by'ubwicanyi bwa Jenoside yo mu 1994, kandi ubu haruhukiye imibiri y'abazize Jenoside isaga 17\u00a0000.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Mugonero rurangwa n'ibintu byinshi byihariye mu rwego rwo kwibuka no mu bimenyetso. Rurimo inzu ibitsemo amagufwa, ibyapa by'urwibutso n'ahantu ho kunamira, ndetse n'ibishushanyo bibajwe byihariye byubatswe ku bwinjiriro bw'urwibutso.\nIbyo bishushanyo bigizwe n'igice cya sima giteretseho umuhoro n'ubuhiri buteyeho imisumari, bikikijwe n'ibipfunsi bibiri bica iminyururu. Ibyo bikoresho bigereranya ubugizi bwa nabi bwa Jenoside, naho amaboko aboshye n'iminyururu agereranya ivangura rihoraho Abatutsi bakorewe. Inyubako iri iruhande, ibitsemo amagufwa y'abishwe, yanditseho mu Kinyarwanda amagambo agaragaza ku mugaragaro ko abishwe bari Abatutsi: \u00ab\"Urwibutso rw\u2019inzirakarengane z\u2019Abatutsi bazize itsembabwoko ryo muri mata 1994, bishwe bunyamaswa Leta y\u2019abagome irebera tuzahora tubibuka\"\u00bb.\nKugeza mu 2009, uru rwibutso ni rwo rwonyine mu Rwanda rwagaragazaga ku mugaragaro ubwoko bw'abishwe, bituma ruba urwibutso rwihariye mu nzibutso z'igihugu. Ibyo bishushanyo n'ayo magambo byateje impaka: bamwe babibonagamo inzitizi ku bwiyunge, abandi bashima uruhare rwabyo mu kubungabunga urwibutso rwihariye rw'Abatutsi bishwe.\nBuri mwaka hano habera imihango ya Leta, cyane cyane ku wa 7 cyangwa ku wa 16 Mata, mu gihe cyagenwe cyo kwibuka Jenoside buri mwaka (\"Kwibuka\"), kandi urwibutso rusurwa n'abantu baturutse mu Rwanda no mu mahanga."}
{"id": "23127", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23127", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyamasheke", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyamasheke rwibuka ubwicanyi bwakorewe Abatutsi muri Mata 1994 i Nyamasheke, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba y'u Rwanda, mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda mu 1994.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyamasheke ruherereye mu mujyi wa Nyamasheke, icyicaro cy'Akarere ka Nyamasheke, ku nkombe z'Ikiyaga cya Kivu, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba y'u Rwanda.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Nyamasheke ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyamasheke ni rumwe mu nzibutso n'imva rusange nyinshi ziri ku butaka bw'u Rwanda no hanze yabwo, zifitanye isano na Jenoside yo mu 1994.\nInzibutso enye zashyizwe mu Murage w'Isi wa UNESCO: Nyamata, Murambi, Gisozi na Bisesero.\nAmateka.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyamasheke rwashyizweho kugira ngo habe ahantu ho kwibukira no gushyingura mu cyubahiro abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri aka karere. Haruhukiye abazize Jenoside basaga 15\u00a0000, benshi muri bo bakaba barashyinguwe mu mihango yo gushyingura mu cyubahiro itegurwa buri mwaka.\nUrwibutso rwakorewe amavugurura n'isanwa rikomeye, cyane cyane guhera mu 2012, kugira ngo hasubizwe ibyifuzo by'abarokotse kandi urwibutso rurusheho kubungabungwa.\nUruhare rw'abarokotse n'abaturage bo muri ako gace mu kubaka no kwita ku rwibutso rukunze kugarukwaho.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rwa Nyamasheke ruzwiho kuba hafi y'Ikiyaga cya Kivu n'imyubakire yarwo yoroheje. Buri mwaka rwakira imihango yo kwibuka no gushyingura imibiri mu cyubahiro mu mva rusange. Imiryango n'abarokotse bahaza kunamira ababo.\nKuri uru rwibutso hari imurikabikorwa ry'amafoto n'ibyapa by'urwibutso, kandi ni ahantu ho kwigishiriza amahoro no gukumira Jenoside."}
{"id": "23129", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23129", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyundo", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyundo ni ahantu ho kwibukira haherereye i Nyundo, mu Akarere ka Rubavu, mu Rwanda. Rwibuka Abatutsi biciwe muri paruwasi ya Nyundo no mu masegiteri ayikikije hagati y'itariki ya 7 Mata n'iya 2 Gicurasi 1994, mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda.\nAho ruherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri mu Murenge wa Nyundo, mu Akarere ka Rubavu, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba, hafi ya Katedrali ya Nyundo n'umugezi wa Sebeya.\nNi rumwe mu nzibutso, amarimbi n'imva rusange za kera bifitanye isano na Jenoside yo mu 1994. Enye muri izo nzibutso \u2014 Nyamata, Murambi, Gisozi na Bisesero \u2014 zashyizwe ku rutonde rw'Umurage w'Isi wa UNESCO kuva mu 2023.\nUrwibutso rwa Nyundo ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAmateka.\nUbwicanyi bwo muri Mata na Gicurasi 1994.\nIbitero ku Batutsi b'i Nyundo byatangiye ku wa 7 Mata 1994, bukeye bw'ihanurwa ry'indege ya Perezida Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana, bikomeza kugeza ku wa 2 Gicurasi 1994. Abarwanashyaka b'Interahamwe n'aba CDR bateye imiryango y'Abatutsi yari ituye muri ako gace. Bamwe mu bagabye ibitero bari bambaye imyambaro imwe cyangwa bitwikiriye amakoma kugira ngo bamenyane.\nAbatutsi benshi bahungiye mu kigo cya paruwasi gatolika ya Nyundo, bibwira ko bahakingirwa. Abari bakusanyirijwe mu nyubako za Kiliziya baragoswe, barabica. Muri bo harimo abagore n'abana bari bahungiye muri shapeli.\nUbubiko bw'amateka ya Jenoside (Genocide Archive of Rwanda) bubarura abazize Jenoside bagera kuri 851 bashyinguye muri uru rwibutso. Uwo mubare urimo abiciwe mu kigo cya paruwasi ya Nyundo n'abaturutse mu masegiteri ya Nyundo, Kanama na Rugerero. Inyandiko ya kera y'ikarita y'Ikigo gishinzwe isesengura ry'imiterere y'ahantu (Center for Geographic Analysis) cya Kaminuza ya Harvard yo ivuga imibiri igera ku 2\u00a0100, itavuga niba uwo mubare ureba agace kamwe cyangwa igihe kimwe cyo gushyingura.\nIshyirwaho n'iyimurwa ry'urwibutso.\nNyuma ya Jenoside hubatswe urwibutso rwa mbere kugira ngo abazize Jenoside bashyingurwe kandi imiryango ibone aho kunamira ababo. Icyo gihe rwari mu kigo cya Kiliziya cya Nyundo, hagati y'ishuri n'iseminari.\nMu 2012, imyuzure y'umugezi wa Sebeya yangije urwibutso n'imva. Kubera ko ubutaka bwaho bwari bworoshye kwangirika, abayobozi bafashe icyemezo cyo kwimurira urwibutso ahantu hatibasirwa cyane n'imyuzure.\nUrwibutso rushya rugamije kubungabunga imibiri, amazina n'amateka y'abiciwe muri paruwasi no mu masegiteri ayikikije. Rwifashishwa kandi mu gutegura imihango yo kwibuka no kugeza amateka ya Jenoside ku bandi.\nAbazize Jenoside n'urwibutso rwa Diyosezi.\nUrwibutso rurimo aho babika amagufwa, imva rusange, ibyapa byanditseho amazina y'abazize Jenoside bamenyekanye n'amafoto y'abihayimana bishwe mu 1994.\nUmwepiskopi wa Nyundo, Anaclet Mwumvaneza, avuga ko uru rwibutso ari ho hashyinguwe abapadiri benshi ba Diyosezi bishwe muri Jenoside. Umushakashatsi Tom Ndahiro ahuza kandi aha hantu n'amateka y'abihayimana barwanyije ingengabitekerezo y'amoko n'ivangura, barimo uwahoze ari Umwepiskopi Aloys Bigirumwami.\nDonatha Mukeshimana, warokotse Jenoside wo mu Murenge wa Nyundo, avuga ko imibiri y'abamwe mu bishwe yatemaguwe mbere yo gutwarwa mu ngorofani ikajugunywa mu byobo rusange. Avuga ko imibiri myinshi itaraboneka cyangwa ngo imenyekane.\nKwibuka no kubungabunga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rwakira imigoroba yo kwibuka, misa n'imihango yo kwibuka itegurwa mu gihe cya \"Kwibuka\" buri mwaka. Imiryango y'abazize Jenoside, abarokotse, abahagarariye Diyosezi n'abayobozi b'inzego z'ibanze bahaza kunamira abishwe.\nAbarokotse basaba ko amateka y'ubwicanyi bwakorewe muri Diyosezi ya Nyundo yandikwa neza kandi akagezwa ku barusura. Basaba kandi ko amafoto, ubuhamya n'ibintu bifitanye isano n'abishwe bibikwa neza.\nAmashyirahamwe y'abarokotse, arimo Ibuka, agira uruhare mu bikorwa byo kwibuka no kugeza amateka ya Nyundo ku rubyiruko."}
