{"id": "23133", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23133", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kibeho", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kibeho rwibuka ubwicanyi bwakorewe Abatutsi muri Mata 1994 i Kibeho, mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo y'u Rwanda, mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda mu 1994.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kibeho ruherereye i Kibeho, mu Akarere ka Nyaruguru, mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo y'u Rwanda, hafi y'ahantu h'amabonekerwa ya Bikira Mariya.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Kibeho ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAmateka.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kibeho rwubatswe aho, muri Mata 1994, ibihumbi by'Abatutsi byiciwe nyuma yo guhungira muri Kiliziya Gatolika no mu nkengero zayo. Aha hantu habereye ubwicanyi bw'ubugome bukabije, bwagizemo uruhare abasivili n'abarwanashyaka b'umutwe w'Interahamwe. Nyuma ya Jenoside, hubatswe urwibutso rwo guha icyubahiro abazize Jenoside basaga 28\u00a0000, imibiri yabo ikaba iruhukiye mu mva rusange.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rwa Kibeho rurangwa na Kiliziya ya Bikira Mariya w'Ababara, yangiritse cyane muri Jenoside, n'imurikwa ry'imyenda, amafoto n'ibintu bwite by'abazize Jenoside. Buri mwaka rwakira imihango yo kwibuka kandi rusurwa n'Abanyarwanda benshi n'abanyamahanga, cyane cyane kubera isano rufitanye n'amabonekerwa ya Bikira Mariya i Kibeho."}
{"id": "23135", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23135", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Gisenyi", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Gisenyi ruherereye mu gice cyo hejuru cy'umujyi wa Gisenyi, hafi y'aho usohokera werekeza mu majyaruguru. Rwibuka Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda yo mu 1994. Harashyinguye abantu bagera ku 12\u00a0000.\nAho ruherereye.\nUru rwibutso ni rumwe mu zitubatswe ahahoze kiliziya. Ni rumwe mu nzibutso z'igihugu zo mu Rwanda zibuka Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nIzindi ni Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Murambi, Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Bisesero, Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Ntarama, Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kigali n'Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyarubuye.\nMu Rwanda hari inzibutso zisaga 250 zanditse zibuka Jenoside.\nUrwibutso rwa Gisenyi ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAmateka.\nUrwibutso ni ho hashyinguye abantu bagera ku 12\u00a0000. Ni rwo rwa mbere rwubatswe na Ibuka. Harimo imva y'Umunyamerikakazi washinze ikigo cyita ku mfubyi.\nKu wa 22 Ugushyingo 1992, L\u00e9on Mugesera, icyo gihe wari mu biro bya politiki bya MRND, yavugiye i Gisenyi ati:"}
{"id": "23136", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23136", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Ngororero", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Ngororero rwibuka ubwicanyi bwakorewe Abatutsi muri Mata 1994 i Ngororero, umujyi wo mu Akarere ka Ngororero mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba y'u Rwanda, mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda mu 1994.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Ngororero ruherereye i Ngororero, icyicaro cy'akarere kitwa izina rimwe, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba y'u Rwanda.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Ngororero ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Ngororero ni rumwe mu nzibutso n'imva rusange nyinshi ziri ku butaka bw'u Rwanda no hanze yabwo, zifitanye isano na Jenoside yo mu 1994.\nZimwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri mu Murage w'Isi wa UNESCO.\nAmateka.\nUrwibutso rwa Ngororero rwashyizweho kugira ngo hubahwe ibihumbi by'Abatutsi biciwe muri ako karere mu 1994.\nKuri uru rwibutso hari imva rusange nyinshi, n'inyubako zakira abarokotse n'imiryango mu gihe cyo kwibuka buri mwaka.\nMu 2009, hatangajwe ko urwibutso ruzavugururwa kugira ngo rurusheho kubungabunga urwibutso rw'abazize Jenoside no kwakira imihango ya Leta. Urwibutso ni kandi ahantu h'ingenzi mu bikorwa byo kwibuka Jenoside biba buri mwaka mu Rwanda.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rwa Ngororero ruruhukiyemo imibiri y'ibihumbi by'abazize Jenoside, kandi ni ahantu ho kunamira, kwigisha amateka no guhurira mu minsi ikomeye yo kwibuka.\nRurimo ibimenyetso by'urwibutso, ibyapa by'urwibutso n'ahantu ho kwakirira imiryango y'abazize Jenoside n'abarokotse."}
{"id": "23137", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23137", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Cyanika", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Cyanika rwibuka ubwicanyi bwakorewe Abatutsi muri Mata 1994 i Cyanika, mu majyepfo y'u Rwanda, mu Akarere ka Nyamagabe, mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Cyanika ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAmateka n'aho ruherereye.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Cyanika ni rumwe mu hantu henshi mu Rwanda hagenewe kwibuka abazize Jenoside yo mu 1994.\nRuherereye mu Akarere ka Nyamagabe, hafi ya Murambi, mu Rwanda. Uru rwibutso rwibuka abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Rwatashywe mu 2012 na Jeannette Kagame, kandi ni ahantu ho kunamira no kwibuka ibihumbi by'Abatutsi biciwe muri aka karere.\nUrwibutso ruruhukiyemo imibiri y'abazize Jenoside isaga 35\u00a0000, kandi ni ahantu abarokotse n'imiryango yabuze ababo bibukira kandi bagatekereza ku bugome bwakozwe.\nDamascene, ukora ku rwibutso rwa Cyanika, yabwiye umushakashatsi Julia Viebach mu 2014 ati:\nMu Ukwakira 2019, mu muhango wabereye ku rwibutso rwa Cyanika, Minisitiri w'Ubutabera, Johnston Busingye, yongeye gushimangira ko Leta itazihanganira abahisha amakuru y'aho imibiri y'abazize Jenoside iri, ashimangira akamaro ko gukorera mu mucyo n'ubutabera ku miryango y'abazize Jenoside.\nAmateka y'ubwicanyi.\nMuri Jenoside, Kiliziya Gatolika ya Cyanika yabaye ahantu h'ubwicanyi aho Abatutsi benshi bari bahahungiye biciwe. Padiri mukuru wa paruwasi, Joseph Niyomugabo, yanze gutererana impunzi, nawe aricwa muri Mata 1994."}
{"id": "23138", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23138", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kaduha", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kaduha rwibuka abazize ubwicanyi bwakorewe Abatutsi muri Mata 1994 muri paruwasi ya Kaduha, mu Akarere ka Nyamagabe, mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo, mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kaduha rwubatse mu Mudugudu wa Bamba, Akagari ka Kavumu, Umurenge wa Kaduha, Akarere ka Nyamagabe, mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo, mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Gikongoro.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Kaduha ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kaduha ni rumwe mu nzibutso n'imva rusange nyinshi ziri ku butaka bw'u Rwanda no hanze yabwo, zifitanye isano na Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Ubwo yarutahaga, Paul Kagame yashimangiye ko ari ngombwa kwibuka ibyabaye kugira ngo Jenoside itazongera kubaho ukundi. Yashishikarije Abanyarwanda guhangana n'ibibazo bateza imbere ubumwe, ubutabera, ubwiyunge, no kurwanya ubukene n'imiyoborere mibi.\nAmateka.\nUbwicanyi bukomeye bwabereye i Kaduha ku wa 21 Mata 1994. Kaduha ni hamwe mu hantu h'ingenzi habereye ubwicanyi muri Perefegitura ya Gikongoro, nyuma ya Mushubi (7 Mata), Kibeho (14 Mata) na Muganza (16 Mata). Ibihumbi by'Abatutsi bari barigeze guhungira muri paruwasi za Kaduha, Cyanika na Kibeho mu bwicanyi bwo muri Noheli ya 1963\u20131964.\nIgitero cyo ku wa 21 Mata 1994 cyibasiye kiliziya n'inyubako za paruwasi, ndetse n'ibigo nderabuzima n'amashuri byari hafi aho. Abatangabuhamya basobanura uko impunzi zakusanyirijwe i Kaduha babwirwa ko ari ukugira ngo zirindwe, hanyuma zikicwa. Claude Ndorimana warokotse, wigaga mu ishuri ry'ubuhinzi n'ubworozi rya Kaduha, yavuze ko yahungiye muri paruwasi ari kumwe n'umuryango we, amaze kumva ko bene wabo bishwe. Yatanze ubuhamya ku bwicanyi bwabereye mu ishuri no mu bitaro, no ku ishyingurwa ry'abishwe, barimo na murumuna we w'imyaka itandatu wari ukiri muzima. Fran\u00e7ois Shikama, umuhinzi, na we yatanze ubuhamya ko yabonye abantu bicirwa kuri bariyeri yari hafi y'\u00abUmuzungukazi\u00bb (Umubikira Milgitha) no kuri kiliziya.\nImva rusange z'i Kaduha zabanje kuba imyobo impunzi zacukuye zibitegetswe n'abayobozi, bavuga ko ari imisarane, nyuma iza kujugunywamo imirambo y'abishwe. Hari ibihembo, nk'umuceri cyangwa amafaranga byatangwaga n'Umubikira Milgitha, byahabwaga abatwaraga imirambo.\nKu rwibutso rwa Kaduha hakunze kubera imihango yo kwibuka. Itariki yo kwibuka ihindagurika buri mwaka bitewe na gahunda y'inzego z'ubuyobozi, ariko nk'uko abatangabuhamya babyemeza, yakabaye iya 21 Mata, umunsi Abatutsi bari bahungiye muri kiliziya bishwe.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rwa Kaduha rwubatswe ku bufatanye bw'abaturage. Ni ahantu ho kwibukira no gusura, kandi ni ingenzi mu bushakashatsi ku mateka ya Jenoside, cyane cyane kubera inyandiko n'amafoto byabitswe n'umubikira w'Umudage Milgitha K\u00f6sser (1936\u20132016). Yari umuyobozi w'ikigo nderabuzima cya Kaduha kuva mu 1973, akaba yarabaye umuhamya utagira icyo ashobora gukora ku wa 21 Mata 1994. Yakoze alubumu y'amafoto 193, yo hagati ya 1992 na 1995, agaragaza uburemere bw'ubwicanyi n'isenywa ry'ibintu, ndetse no gutesha agaciro imirambo, ahantu n'ibintu by'idini. Iyo alubumu ni inyandiko y'ingenzi yo gusobanukirwa n'ibyabereye i Kaduha.\nUbushakashatsi ku byabereye i Kaduha bugaragaza kandi uburyo abakoze Jenoside bagoretse ururimi: amagambo nka \"gutabara\" yakoreshwaga mu kuvuga kongera ingufu z'udutsiko tw'abicanyi. Imvugo zijyanye n'\u00abakazi\u00bb cyangwa \u00abinshingano z'ubuyobozi\u00bb zasobanuraga uburinzi bwo kuri bariyeri zicirwagaho abantu. N'amagambo yo mu birori yakoreshejwe mu kuvuga ibirori by'abicanyi.\nImiterere y'i Kaduha, ifite imisozi ihanamye n'imikoki miremire, yahinduye paruwasi umutego mu gihe cy'ubwicanyi, bituma guhunga bitashobokera abishwe batari bafite uko birwanaho."}
{"id": "23139", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23139", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyanza-Kicukiro", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyanza-Kicukiro ni urwibutso ruri i Kigali, mu Akarere ka Kicukiro, aho haruhukiye abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 basaga 100\u00a0000. Aha hantu hafitanye isano rya hafi n'igenda ry'ingabo za MINUAR zari mu Ishuri ry'Imyuga (\u00c9cole technique officielle, ETO) rya Kicukiro ku wa 11 Mata 1994, n'ubwicanyi bwakurikiyeho ku musozi wa Nyanza.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri i Nyanza, mu Murenge wa Kagarama, mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba bw'umujyi rwagati wa Kigali, hafi y'ishuri \"Integrated Polytechnic Regional College\" (IPRC), ryahoze ari \u00c9cole technique officielle ya Kicukiro (ETO).\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Nyanza-Kicukiro ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nUrwibutso rwa Nyanza-Kicukiro ni ahantu ho kwibukira abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Ruri mu nzibutso z'igihugu zahariwe kwibuka ibyo byabaye. Ruri iruhande rw'Ubusitani bw'urwibutso bwa Nyanza, ubusitani bwo kwigisha amateka bwatashywe mu 2022.\nUru rwibutso ni rumwe mu nzibutso, imva rusange n'ahantu ho kwibukira biri hirya no hino mu Rwanda no mu mahanga, bifitanye isano na Jenoside yo mu 1994. Enye muri zo \u2014 Nyamata, Murambi, Gisozi na Bisesero \u2014 zashyizwe mu Murage w'Isi wa UNESCO.\nAmateka.\nKu wa 11 Mata 1994, nyuma y'igenda ry'ingabo z'Ababiligi za MINUAR zari zirinze \u00c9cole technique officielle ya Kicukiro, ibihumbi by'impunzi z'Abatutsi byategetswe kuva mu kigo cy'ishuri bijyanwa ku musozi wa Nyanza, aho byiciwe ku gicamunsi. Bivugwa ko hishwe abantu nibura 2\u00a0000, barimo abana benshi.\nMu myaka yakurikiyeho, imibiri y'abazize Jenoside yataburuwe mu bice bitandukanye by'umujyi yagiye ikusanyirizwa i Nyanza igashyingurwa mu cyubahiro. Muri Gicurasi 2022, imibiri mishya 9\u00a0181 yashyinguwe mu cyubahiro kuri uru rwibutso. Muri Mata 2021, ubuyobozi bw'Umujyi wa Kigali bwavugaga ko i Nyanza hashyinguye abantu basaga 96\u00a0000, umubare wageze ku basaga 105\u00a0000 nk'uko byatangajwe ku mugaragaro mu gihe cya \"Kwibuka31\" mu 2025. Ubusitani bw'urwibutso buri iruhande rwarwo, bwatekerejwe n'umuryango Ibuka ufatanyije n'umunyabugeni Bruce Clarke, bwatashywe ku mugaragaro ku wa 11 Nzeri 2022 na Jeannette Kagame.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rurimo imva rusange nyinshi zisizweho amakaro n'ibyapa byanditseho amazina y'abazize Jenoside. Buri mwaka rwakira imihango yo Kwibuka n'urugendo rwo kwibuka (\"Walk to Remember\") ruhera kuri IPRC (yahoze ari ETO).\nUrwibutso ruri ku rutonde rwa Ibuka, rugaragaza ko ruri i Kicukiro kandi rufite imva rusange enye z'ingenzi."}
{"id": "23140", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23140", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Rusiga", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Rusiga ni ahantu ho kwibukira no gushyingura abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, mu Murenge wa Rusiga, mu Akarere ka Rulindo, mu Ntara y'Amajyaruguru y'u Rwanda.\nAho ruherereye.\nItorero ry'Abapantekoti rya Rusiga na Kiliziya Gatolika ya Rulindo ni ho hantu h'ingenzi habereye ubwicanyi.\nUrwibutso rwa Rusiga ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAmateka.\nHashyinguwe abazize Jenoside basaga 6\u00a0400.\nMu Karere ka Rulindo hari ahandi hantu umunani ho kwibukira no gushyingura; muri aho hantu hose, harimo n'urwibutso rwa Rusiga, hashyinguwe abazize Jenoside 18\u00a0600 (imibare yo muri Werurwe 2014).\nUbwicanyi bw'Abatutsi bwabereye mu karere, cyane cyane mu Itorero ry'Abapantekoti rya Rusiga no muri Kiliziya Gatolika ya Rulindo."}
{"id": "23141", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23141", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Bazize", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Bazize ni ahantu ho kwibukira no gushyingura abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, haherereye mu Murenge wa Macuba, mu Akarere ka Nyamasheke, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba, mu Rwanda.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri mu Murenge wa Macuba, mu Akarere ka Nyamasheke, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba. Ruri mu gice cy'iburengerazuba bw'u Rwanda kirimo inzibutso nyinshi zagenewe abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Bazize ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu. Izo nzibutso zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro abazize Jenoside, kubunamira, kubika amateka no kwibuka.\nInzibutso enye za Jenoside zo mu Rwanda ziri ku rutonde rw'Umurage w'Isi wa UNESCO: Nyamata, Murambi, Gisozi na Bisesero.\nAmateka.\nUrwibutso rwa Bazize ruri mu hantu ho kwibukira hashyizweho nyuma ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, kugira ngo habungabungwe urwibutso rw'abayizize bo mu Akarere ka Nyamasheke.\nInyandiko z'ingengo y'imari y'Akarere ka Nyamasheke zigaragaza amafaranga yagenewe kubungabunga inzibutso za Jenoside no gukora imirimo ijyanye n'inzibutso zo muri ako karere.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nKimwe n'izindi nzibutso zo mu Rwanda, urwibutso rwa Bazize ni ahantu ho gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kunamira abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Ruri mu rusobe rw'inzibutso z'igihugu zakira imihango yo Kwibuka n'ibikorwa byo kurwanya ihakana n'ingengabitekerezo ya Jenoside."}
{"id": "23142", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23142", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Birogo", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Birogo ni ahantu ho kwibukira no gushyingura abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, haherereye mu Murenge wa Gihombo, mu Akarere ka Nyamasheke, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba, mu Rwanda.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri mu Murenge wa Gihombo, mu Akarere ka Nyamasheke, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba. Ruri mu burengerazuba bw'u Rwanda, hafi y'Ikiyaga cya Kivu, mu gice kirimo ahantu henshi ho kwibukira abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Birogo ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu. Inzibutso zo mu Rwanda ni ahantu ho gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kunamira, kubika amateka no kwibuka.\nInzibutso enye za Jenoside zo mu Rwanda ziri ku rutonde rw'Umurage w'Isi wa UNESCO: Nyamata, Murambi, Gisozi na Bisesero.\nAmateka.\nUrwibutso rwa Birogo ruri mu hantu ho kwibukira hashyizweho nyuma ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, kugira ngo habungabungwe urwibutso rw'abayizize bo mu Akarere ka Nyamasheke.\nInyandiko z'ingengo y'imari y'Akarere ka Nyamasheke zigaragaza amafaranga yagenewe kubungabunga inzibutso za Jenoside no gukora imirimo ijyanye n'inzibutso zo muri ako karere.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nBariyeri ya Birogo.\nKu wa 13 Mata 1994, imodoka y'imbangukiragutabara yari itwaye abagore babiri b'Abatutsi, Dativa na Brigitte, abana babo n'umukobwa umwe ukiri muto, yahagarikiwe i Birogo na Joseph Mpambara n'abandi bagabo. Abari mu modoka bahatiwe gukomeza urugendo berekeza i Mugonero, imodoka ikikijwe n'abagabye igitero. Bageze i Mugonero, Dativa, Brigitte n'abana babo bakubiswe imihoro n'amahiri, baricwa.\nMu gitabo cye \"Briseurs de destins\", Fran\u00e7ois-Xavier Nsanzuwera avuga urubanza rwa Joseph Mpambara mu isesengura rye ku mabariyeri yakoreshejwe mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Asobanura ko amabariyeri yashyizweho muri Jenoside yakoreshwaga mu kumenya no gufata Abatutsi n'Abahutu bazwi ko batavuga rumwe n'ubutegetsi, kandi ko yari ahantu hakorerwaga ihohoterwa, harimo n'ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina ryakorerwaga abagore b'Abatutsi."}
{"id": "23143", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23143", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Musanze", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Musanze (rwahoze rwitwa urwa Ruhengeri) ni ahantu ho kwibukira no gushyingura abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, haherereye mu mujyi wa Musanze, mu Akarere ka Musanze, mu Intara y'Amajyaruguru y'u Rwanda. Rwakira buri mwaka imihango yo \"Kwibuka\".\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso rwashyizwe mu nyubako yahoze ari iy'Urukiko rw'Ubujurire rwa Ruhengeri, ku muhanda munini w'umujyi wa Musanze. Rwafunguwe nyuma yo gutunganya iyo nyubako no kwimura imibiri yari ishyinguye mu rwibutso rwa kera rwa Muhoza.\nUbwicanyi bwabereye mu rukiko.\nHagati ya tariki ya 12 na 14 Mata 1994, Abatutsi babarirwa mu magana bo mu makomini ya Nyarutovu, Gatonde na Ndusu (mu cyahoze ari Superefegitura ya Busengo, ubu ni mu Akarere ka Gakenke) bajyanywe ku Rukiko rw'Ubujurire rwa Ruhengeri, bicirwa mu cyumba cy'iburanisha: baterewe ibyuka biryana mu maso, ibisasu, banakubitwa intwaro za gakondo. Benshi mu bishwe bari abakozi ba Leta n'abandi banyamwuga (abarimu, abaganga n'abaforomo, abakozi ba banki, abashoferi, abahinzi-borozi b'abahanga), ndetse n'abakozi b'urukiko ubwarwo.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Musanze ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAmateka.\nMbere y'uko uru rwibutso rwubakwa, abazize Jenoside bo muri ako karere bari bashyinguye cyane cyane mu rwibutso rwa Muhoza, mu mujyi wa Musanze. Mu 2019, abarokotse Jenoside basabye ko hashyirwaho ahantu ho gushyingura heza kandi harinzwe neza.\nMu 2021, inzego z'ubuyobozi zatangaje ko inyubako yahoze ari iy'Urukiko rw'Ubujurire igiye guhindurwa urwibutso. Ku wa 15 Mata 2022, imibiri irenga 800 yimuwe i Muhoza yashyinguwe mu cyubahiro mu rwibutso rushya.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso ruri ku muhanda munini wo mu mujyi wa Musanze (Ruhengeri), umurwa mukuru w'Intara y'Amajyaruguru. Ni rwo rwibutso rw'Akarere, kandi rusurwa kenshi n'amashuri yo muri ako gace.\nMu muhango wo gushyingura wo ku wa 15 Mata 2022, Perezida w'Urukiko rw'Ikirenga, Faustin Nteziryayo, yavuze ko kwicira abantu b'inzirakarengane mu cyumba cy'iburanisha ari ibintu bitari byarigeze bibaho mu Rwanda, kandi ko n'ubushakashatsi bugaragaza ko bitigeze bibaho ahandi hose. Minisitiri Jean-Damasc\u00e8ne Bizimana we yibukije ko Jenoside yageragerejwe mu bice bitandukanye bya Perefegitura ya Ruhengeri mbere ya 1994.\nImibare.\nKugeza ku wa 15 Mata 2022, abazize Jenoside barenga 1\u00a0500 bari bashyinguye mu nzibutso eshatu zo mu Karere ka Musanze; hari n'indi mibiri itaraboneka, kandi abaturage basabwa gutanga amakuru ku hantu hakiri imibiri itarashyingurwa.\nUrwibutso rwakira buri mwaka imihango ya \"Kwibuka\", irimo urugendo rwo kwibuka, ijoro ryo kwibuka no gushyira indabo ku mva, ndetse n'ibikorwa by'uburezi bikorwa ku bufatanye n'amashuri na za kaminuza zo muri ako karere."}
{"id": "23144", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23144", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Gahanga", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Gahanga ni ahantu ho kwibukira no gushyingura abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, haherereye mu Murenge wa Gahanga, mu Akarere ka Kicukiro, mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba bw'Umujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri i Gahanga, mu gice cy'amajyepfo y'uburasirazuba bw'Umujyi wa Kigali, mu Akarere ka Kicukiro. Ruri hafi ya Kiliziya Gatolika ya Gahanga, rwegeranye n'ahandi hantu ho kwibukira ho muri uwo murenge, nka Karembure.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Gahanga ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAmateka.\nUbwicanyi bwo muri Kiliziya ya Gahanga.\nGuhera ku wa 8 Mata 1994, Abatutsi bahungiye muri Kiliziya ya Gahanga. Ku wa 9 Mata, abayobozi b'inzego z'ibanze bategetse Abahutu kuvamo, Abatutsi basigara bonyine. Ku wa 10 Mata 1994 ubwicanyi bwaratangiye, ariko Abatutsi barirwanaho basubiza inyuma Interahamwe. Konseye Buregeya yahise yitabaza abasirikare, baza barasa abari muri kiliziya, maze Interahamwe zisonga inkomere. Hafi y'Abatutsi bose bari muri kiliziya barishwe, na bake barokotse bakomereka bikabije.\nIshyingurwa ry'imibiri.\nMu 1996, imibiri yari imaze kuboneka yarakusanyijwe ishyingurwa mu cyubahiro muri uru rwibutso. Mu 2020, KT Press yavugaga ko urwibutso rurimo imibiri irenga 7\u00a0000.\nKu wa 1 Nyakanga 2023, imibiri 10\u00a0224 yashyinguwe mu cyubahiro mu rwibutso rwa Gahanga. Imwe muri yo yari yarabonetse kuri Kiliziya ya Gahanga, indi ivanwa mu mva rusange za Nunga na Karembure. Minisitiri w'Abakozi ba Leta n'Umurimo, Fanfan Kayirangwa Rwanyindo, yavuze ko iyo mibiri yari itatanyije mu hantu hatandukanye itari ishyinguwe mu buryo bukwiye.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nBuri mwaka, urwibutso rwa Gahanga rwakira imihango yo \"Kwibuka\" yitabirwa n'imiryango y'abazize Jenoside, abarokotse n'abayobozi; mu gihe cyo kwibuka hakomeza gushyingurwa mu cyubahiro imibiri igenda iboneka."}
{"id": "23145", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23145", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Jabana", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Jabana ni ahantu ho kwibukira no gushyingura abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 mu gace k'Umurenge wa Jabana w'ubu, mu Akarere ka Gasabo, mu Mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri mu majyaruguru y'Umujyi wa Kigali, mu Akarere ka Gasabo, hafi y'uruganda rw'isukari rwa Kabuye (Kabuye Sugar Factory).\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Jabana ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, harimo n'izo mu Mujyi wa Kigali nk'Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kigali ku Gisozi.\nAmateka.\nMu 1994, ubwicanyi bwo muri ako gace bwakozwe n'abarwanyi b'umutwe wa Nyaconga bahungaga ingabo za RPA, hamwe n'amatsinda y'Interahamwe yayoborwaga n'abayobozi b'inzego z'ibanze. Mu bagize uruhare harimo burugumesitiri ndetse n'abayobozi b'inganda n'insyo bo muri ako gace, batanze intwaro kandi bategura ubwicanyi.\nNyuma ya Jenoside, imibiri y'abazize Jenoside yo muri Jabana no mu mirenge ihakikije yakusanyirijwe muri uru rwibutso ishyingurwa mu cyubahiro.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nMu 2025, urwibutso rwari ruruhukiyemo imibiri y'abazize Jenoside 333, ikomoka mu mirenge itanu: Jabana, Nduba, Jali, Gatsata na Ndera.\nUrwibutso rwakira ibikorwa byo \"Kwibuka\" bitegurwa n'abarokotse, inzego n'ibigo byo muri ako gace. Nko ku wa 16 Gicurasi 2025, abakozi b'uruganda rwa Kabuye Sugar Factory bakoze urugendo rwo kwibuka (\"walk to remember\") kuva ku ruganda kugera ku rwibutso, bafata umunota wo kwibuka, bumva ubuhamya bw'abarokotse, banasobanurirwa amateka ya Jenoside mu cyahoze ari Segiteri ya Kabuye, i Jabana, igice cya Segiteri ya Muhororo n'i Masoro."}
{"id": "23146", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23146", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kibagabaga", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kibagabaga ni ahantu ho kwibukira no gushyingura abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, haherereye i Kibagabaga, mu Murenge wa Kimironko, mu Akarere ka Gasabo, mu Mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri i Kibagabaga, mu Murenge wa Kimironko, mu gice cy'amajyaruguru y'uburasirazuba bw'Umujyi wa Kigali, mu Akarere ka Gasabo. Ruri hafi y'umuhanda munini; mu 2024, abayobozi bagaragaje ko uko kwegerana n'umuhanda guteza impungenge ku mutekano w'urwibutso, bavuga ko hateganywa uburyo bwo gukemura icyo kibazo.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Kibagabaga ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka. Mu Mujyi wa Kigali harimo n'Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kigali ku Gisozi, ruri ku rutonde rw'Umurage w'Isi wa UNESCO hamwe n'inzibutso za Nyamata, Murambi na Bisesero.\nAmateka.\nMu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, Abatutsi benshi bahungiye mu rusengero rwari hafi y'ahari urwibutso ubu, maze bahicirwa. Indi mibiri yagiye iboneka ahandi hantu hatandukanye mu Murenge wa Kimironko.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nMu 2024, urwibutso rwa Kibagabaga rwibukirwagamo Abatutsi bagera ku 23\u00a0141. Buri mwaka rwakira imihango yo \"Kwibuka\" y'Umurenge wa Kimironko; nko ku wa 11 Mata 2024, witabiriwe n'abayobozi barimo Umuyobozi w'Akarere ka Gasabo, Pauline Umwali, na Minisitiri w'Ubuhinzi n'Ubworozi, Dr. Ildephonse Musafiri.\nKimwe n'izindi nzibutso zo mu Rwanda, ruri mu rusobe rw'inzibutso z'igihugu zakira imihango yo kwibuka n'ibikorwa byo kurwanya ihakana n'ingengabitekerezo ya Jenoside."}
{"id": "23147", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23147", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kinyinya", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kinyinya ni ahantu ho kwibukira no gushyingura abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, haherereye i Murama, mu Murenge wa Kinyinya, mu Akarere ka Gasabo, mu Mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri i Murama, mu Murenge wa Kinyinya, mu Akarere ka Gasabo, mu Mujyi wa Kigali.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Kinyinya ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka. Mu Mujyi wa Kigali harimo n'Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kigali ku Gisozi, ruri ku rutonde rw'Umurage w'Isi wa UNESCO hamwe n'inzibutso za Nyamata, Murambi na Bisesero.\nAmateka.\nNk'uko byavuzwe mu buhamya bwatanzwe mu gihe cyo kwibuka ku nshuro ya 32 i Kinyinya, Abatutsi bari batuye ku musozi wa Kinyinya bishwe n'abasirikare b'ubutegetsi bwa Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana n'Interahamwe. Ubwicanyi bwatangiye nyuma y'ihanurwa ry'indege ya Perezida Habyarimana ku wa 6 Mata 1994, abicanyi bagenda basoma amazina y'abo bagombaga kwica, ibigaragaza ko bari barabateguye mbere.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nMu 2025, urwibutso rwa Kinyinya rwari ruruhukiyemo imibiri y'abazize Jenoside 441. Ku rwibutso hari urutonde rw'amazina 411 y'Abatutsi biciwe ku musozi wa Kinyinya, rugenda rwuzuzwa uko abandi bazize Jenoside bamenyekana.\nUrwibutso kandi rufitanye isano n'amateka y'amashuri yo muri ako gace. Ku wa 16 Gicurasi 2025, umuhango wo kwibuka wateguwe na Groupe Scolaire Kinyinya watangiriye ku rwibutso rwa Kinyinya i Murama, ukomereza ku ishuri; hibukwa abarimu 12 n'abanyeshuri 6 b'icyahoze ari ishuri ribanza rya Kinyinya bishwe muri Jenoside.\nRwakira imihango yo \"Kwibuka\" iteganywa n'amategeko y'u Rwanda agenga kwibuka Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi."}
{"id": "23148", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23148", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Cyabakamyi", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Cyabakamyi (ruzwi kandi nk'urwibutso rw'i Nyabinyenga) ni ahantu ho kwibukira no gushyingura abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, haherereye i Nyabinyenga, mu Murenge wa Cyabakamyi, mu Akarere ka Nyanza, mu Intara y'Amajyepfo, mu Rwanda.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri ku musozi wa Nyabinyenga, hafi ya Paruwasi ya Nyabinyenga n'ibiro by'Akagari ka Nyabinyenga, mu Murenge wa Cyabakamyi, mu Akarere ka Nyanza.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Cyabakamyi ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zibaruwe mu bushakashatsi bwa Komisiyo y'Igihugu yo Kurwanya Jenoside (CNLG) ku hantu habereye Jenoside.\nAmateka.\nNk'uko Minisiteri y'Ubumwe bw'Abanyarwanda n'Inshingano Mboneragihugu (MINUBUMWE) ibivuga, guhera ku wa 22 Mata 1994 Abatutsi batangiye kurimburwa ahantu hatandukanye muri Perefegitura ya Butare, harimo n'i Nyabinyenga.\nNyuma ya Jenoside, imibiri y'abazize Jenoside yabonetse muri ako gace yashyinguwe muri uru rwibutso.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nKimwe n'izindi nzibutso zo mu Rwanda, rwakira imihango yo \"Kwibuka\" iteganywa n'amategeko agenga kwibuka Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi."}
{"id": "23149", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23149", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Cyahinda", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Cyahinda ni ahantu ho kwibukira no gushyingura abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, haherereye mu Murenge wa Cyahinda, mu Akarere ka Nyaruguru, mu Intara y'Amajyepfo, mu Rwanda.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri mu Murenge wa Cyahinda, mu Akarere ka Nyaruguru. Rufitanye isano na Paruwasi Gatolika ya Cyahinda, yiciwemo Abatutsi benshi muri Jenoside, mu cyahoze ari Komini Nyakizu, Perefegitura ya Butare.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Cyahinda ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAmateka.\nUbwicanyi bwo kuri Paruwasi ya Cyahinda.\nNk'uko raporo ya Human Rights Watch ibivuga, Abatutsi benshi bo muri Komini Nyakizu n'abaturutse mu makomini ahakikije, cyane cyane mu Gikongoro, bahungiye kuri Kiliziya ya Cyahinda. Burugumesitiri wa Nyakizu, Ladislas Ntaganzwa, yabizezaga umutekano (\"Nimuze muri komini yanjye, muzaba mutekanye\"), mu gihe yateguraga ubwicanyi mu ibanga.\nHagati ya tariki ya 15 na 19 Mata 1994, impunzi zari kuri Kiliziya ya Cyahinda zagabweho ibitero byayobowe na Ntaganzwa. Ibyo bitero byagizwemo uruhare n'abapolisi b'igihugu (Gendarmerie), abasirikare, abapolisi ba komini, impunzi z'Abarundi zitwaje intwaro, abarwanashyaka ba MDR-Power, Interahamwe zaturutse mu Gikongoro, ndetse n'abaturage ba Nyakizu n'ab'amakomini ahakikije. Human Rights Watch igereranya ko abishwe bari hagati ya 5\u00a0500 na 15\u00a0000, abenshi muri bo bakaba bari abagore, abana n'abasaza.\nUrwibutso.\nKu wa 18 Mata 2010, imibiri 142 y'abazize Jenoside yashyinguwe mu cyubahiro mu rwibutso rwa Cyahinda. Muri uwo muhango, Padiri mukuru wa Paruwasi ya Cyahinda, Innocent Gakwaya, yasabye abihaye Imana bagize uruhare muri Jenoside kwigaragaza no gusaba imbabazi.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso ni ahantu ho gushyingura, kunamira no kwibuka abiciwe i Cyahinda. Kimwe n'izindi nzibutso zo mu Rwanda, rwakira imihango yo \"Kwibuka\" iteganywa n'amategeko agenga kwibuka Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi."}
{"id": "23150", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23150", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Cyarwa", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Cyarwa ni ahantu ho kwibukira no gushyingura abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, haherereye mu Murenge wa Tumba, mu Akarere ka Huye, mu Intara y'Amajyepfo, mu Rwanda. Ruruhukiyemo imibiri irenga 11\u00a0000 y'abazize Jenoside.\nAho ruherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri mu Murenge wa Tumba, mu Akarere ka Huye, hafi y'umujyi wa Butare.\nUrwibutso rwa Cyarwa ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAmateka.\nUrwibutso rwa Cyarwa ruri mu hantu ho kwibukira hafitanye isano na Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Butare, ahabereye ubwicanyi bwinshi mu 1994.\nMu muhango wo kwibuka ku nshuro ya 28 wabereye i Cyarwa ku wa 21 Mata 2022, abatanze ubuhamya bagaragaje ko Jenoside muri ako gace yatangiye nyuma y'ijambo Perezida w'agateganyo, Th\u00e9odore Sindikubwabo, yavugiye i Butare ku wa 19 Mata 1994, akangurira abantu kwica. Minisitiri w'Ubuzima, Dr. Daniel Ngamije, yavuze ko Sindikubwabo \"yari umuganga ariko ahitamo kuba umwicanyi\".\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rwa Cyarwa ruruhukiyemo imibiri y'abazize Jenoside irenga 11\u00a0000.\nKu wa 15 Gicurasi 2021, imibiri 48 yashyinguwe mu cyubahiro muri uru rwibutso: 47 yari yabonetse mu Mudugudu w'Akamuhoza hagati ya tariki ya 26 na 28 Mata 2021, n'umwe wavanywe mu Murenge wa Ngoma. Umuhango witabiriwe na Visi Perezida wa Sena, Esp\u00e9rance Nyirasafari, na Perezida wa Ibuka mu Karere ka Huye, Th\u00e9odate Siboyintore."}
{"id": "23151", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23151", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Giheke", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Giheke ni ahantu ho kwibukira no gushyingura abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, haherereye mu Murenge wa Giheke, mu Akarere ka Rusizi, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba, mu Rwanda.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri mu Murenge wa Giheke, mu Akarere ka Rusizi, mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bw'u Rwanda.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Giheke ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka. Inzibutso enye za Jenoside zo mu Rwanda ziri ku rutonde rw'Umurage w'Isi wa UNESCO: Nyamata, Murambi, Gisozi na Bisesero.\nAmateka.\nUrwibutso rwa Giheke ruri mu hantu ho kwibukira hashyizweho nyuma ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, kugira ngo habungabungwe urwibutso rw'abayizize bo mu Akarere ka Rusizi.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nKimwe n'izindi nzibutso zo mu Rwanda, urwibutso rwa Giheke ni ahantu ho gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kunamira abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, kandi rwakira imihango yo \"Kwibuka\" iteganywa n'amategeko."}
{"id": "23152", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23152", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kabgayi", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kabgayi ni ahantu ho kwibukira no gushyingura abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, haherereye i Kabgayi, mu Akarere ka Muhanga, mu Intara y'Amajyepfo, mu Rwanda. Rwibutsa Abatutsi benshi bahungiye i Kabgayi muri Jenoside, bakahicirwa cyangwa bagakurwayo bakajya kwicirwa ahandi.\nAho ruherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri ku musozi wa Kabgayi, mu majyepfo y'umujyi wa Muhanga (wahoze witwa Gitarama), hafi ya Katederali ya Kabgayi, ibitaro bya Kabgayi n'ibigo by'amashuri bya Kiliziya Gatolika.\nUrwibutso rwa Kabgayi ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAmateka.\nUbuhungiro bw'i Kabgayi.\nMuri Jenoside, Kabgayi yabaye ubuhungiro bw'Abatutsi ibihumbi n'ibihumbi baturutse mu makomini ya Perefegitura ya Gitarama, cyane cyane Mushubati, Tambwe, Ntongwe, Mugina, Taba na Buringa, ndetse n'abari bahunze ubwicanyi bw'i Kigali. Bahungiye mu ishuri ribanza, muri Petit S\u00e9minaire ya Kabgayi, mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Saint-Joseph no mu kigo cy'ababikira cyitwaga CND, bizeye ko nk'uko byagenze mu 1959, kugera ku butaka bwa Kiliziya byari kubarinda.\nGuhera ku wa 15 Mata 1994, Padiri Vjeko \u0106uri\u0107, umupadiri w'Umufaransisikani, yatangiye gutwara impunzi zari i Kivumu azijyana i Kabgayi, akajya aha ruswa Interahamwe zabaga ziri kuri bariyeri. Muri Gicurasi 1994, Human Rights Watch yagereranyaga ko i Kabgayi hari abantu bagera ku 50\u00a0000 bavanywe mu byabo, abenshi muri bo bakaba Abatutsi, kandi ko Leta y'icyo gihe yanze kwemera ko ibitaro bya Kabgayi bitagira aho bibogamiye.\nUbwicanyi.\nUbuzima bw'impunzi i Kabgayi bwari bugoye cyane: abicanyi bahoraga bagaba ibitero, bagatoranya abo bica, kandi uwageragezaga gusohoka yashoboraga gufatwa akicwa n'Interahamwe. Abatutsi benshi, cyane cyane abagabo n'abahungu, barakusanywaga bagashyirwa mu mabisi ya ONATRACOM, bakajyanwa i Ngororero bakahicirwa. Human Rights Watch na yo yavuze ko amatsinda y'abantu yakurwaga mu nkambi y'impunzi z'Abatutsi yari mu kigo cya Kiliziya i Kabgayi, akajyanwa kwicwa. Abarokotse bavuga kandi ko abagore n'abakobwa bafatwaga ku ngufu, abagabo bakajyanwa ahantu hatazwi bakicwa.\nKu wa 2 Kamena 1994, ahagana saa tatu za mu gitondo, ingabo za FPR-Inkotanyi zafashe Kabgayi, zirokora impunzi zari zikiri yo.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso ruri munsi y'umusozi wa Katederali ya Kabgayi, hafi y'ibitaro. Kimwe n'izindi nzibutso zo mu Rwanda, rwakira imihango yo \"Kwibuka\" iteganywa n'amategeko."}
{"id": "23153", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23153", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Karama", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Karama ni ahantu ho kwibukira Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, haherereye mu Murenge wa Karama, mu Akarere ka Huye, mu Intara y'Amajyepfo, mu Rwanda.\nRuhurije hamwe imibiri y'Abatutsi ibihumbi mirongo biciwe i Karama no mu makomini ahakikije, bari bakusanyirijwe kuri Paruwasi Gatolika ya Karama, nyuma ya Jenoside bagashyingurwa mu mva n'ibyumba by'imibiri byubatswe aho.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri mu Murenge wa Karama, umwe mu mirenge cumi n'ine igize Akarere ka Huye mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo, mu burasirazuba bw'umujyi wa Butare (Huye). Ruri hafi ya Kiliziya Gatolika ya Karama, ahantu hirengeye hagerwa unyuze mu muhanda w'itaka uturuka ku muhanda uhuza Huye na Nyaruguru.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Karama ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nMu 1994, Karama yari mu cyahoze ari Komini Runyinya, muri Perefegitura ya Butare, agace abayobozi ba gisivili, aba gisirikare n'ab'amadini bagizemo uruhare rukomeye mu gushyira mu bikorwa Jenoside. Abatutsi bahungaga ibitero mu makomini aturanye ya Runyinya, Rwamiko, Mubuga, Maraba cyangwa Nyakizu boherezwaga kuri Paruwasi Gatolika ya Karama, bizezwa ko ari ubuhungiro.\nKuva Jenoside irangiye, buri murenge wo mu Karere ka Huye ufite ahantu ho kwibukira abazize Jenoside, kandi urwibutso rwa Karama rwagiye ruba rumwe mu nzibutso z'ingenzi z'akarere.\nAmateka.\nUbwicanyi bwo mu 1994.\nNyuma y'igitero cyagabwe ku kigo cy'amashuri cya Murambi ku wa 20 na 21 Mata 1994, Abatutsi ibihumbi bakusanyirijwe n'abayobozi ba komini kuri Paruwasi ya Karama, mu cyahoze ari Komini Runyinya. Impunzi zaturutse mu makomini atandukanye ya Perefegitura ya Butare, zikusanyirizwa muri kiliziya, mu mashuri no ku isoko ryari hafi aho, zibarurwa kandi zigabanywa hakurikijwe segiteri zaturutsemo.\nAbayobozi b'inzego z'ibanze n'abajandarume bafunze amazi, banashyira uburozi mu mugezi wari hafi kugira ngo impunzi zibure amazi meza, hanyuma bagaba ibitero bihuriweho bakoresheje za gerenade, imbunda n'intwaro gakondo. Ku wa 21 Mata 1994, nyuma y'umunsi wose w'ubwicanyi, abenshi mu bari bahungiye i Karama barishwe. Abarokotse bavuga kandi ko igikoma cyahawe abagore n'abana bari basigaye aho cyari kirimo uburozi, gihitana amagana muri bo.\nImibiri y'abishwe yajugunywe mu byobo byinshi byacukuwe hirya no hino ya paruwasi no ku misozi ihakikije. Ibigereranyo bihari bivuga ko i Karama hiciwe Abatutsi ibihumbi mirongo, abagera ku 70\u00a0000 muri bo bakaba bashyinguye mu rwibutso ubu.\nIshyirwaho n'iterambere ry'urwibutso.\nNyuma ya 1994, imva rusange zari hirya no hino i Karama zagiye zifukurwa buhoro buhoro, imibiri ikusanyirizwa mu nzu y'agateganyo yari ku kibanza cya paruwasi. Mu ntangiriro z'imyaka ya 2010, Leta y'u Rwanda yashyize Karama ku rutonde rw'ahantu ho kwibukira hagomba kubungabungwa, igenera ingengo y'imari yo kubaka urwibutso rufatika muri uwo murenge.\nImirimo yo gutunganya aho hantu yatumye imibiri ibihumbi yavanywe mu byobo 1\u00a0335 byabaruwe mu cyahoze ari Komini Runyinya ihurizwa hamwe ikongera gushyingurwa. Ubu urwibutso ruruhukiyemo imibiri y'Abatutsi igereranywa hagati ya 68\u00a0000 na 75\u00a0000, bigatuma ruba rumwe mu nzibutso nini z'Akarere ka Huye.\nHagati ya 2020 na 2024, inzego za Leta n'imiryango y'abarokotse bateguye imihango yo \"Kwibuka\" i Karama, bashimangira ko ari ngombwa kurushaho kunoza ibikorwaremezo by'aho hantu no kuhashyira ku rwego rw'urwibutso rw'akarere. Abarokotse n'abayobozi b'inzego z'ibanze basaba ko hubakwa inyubako nshya zo kumurikiramo amateka no gutunganya umuhanda ugerayo.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rwa Karama rugizwe n'inzu nini ibitswemo imibiri, imva zipfundikiye, ikibuga cyo gukoreramo imihango n'umusaraba munini ugaragara uri ku muhanda Huye\u2013Nyaruguru. Ni ahantu imiryango ikomoka mu cyahoze ari Komini Runyinya no mu makomini aturanye iza kunamira ababo, igategura buri mwaka imihango yo kwibuka, ubuhamya n'ibikorwa byo kurwanya ihakana n'ipfobya rya Jenoside.\nKubera umubare munini w'abahashyinguye n'amateka yihariye ya Paruwasi ya Karama muri Jenoside, abarokotse bafata aha hantu nk'ahantu h'ingenzi ho kwibukira Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu karere ka Huye."}
{"id": "23154", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23154", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Mayunzwe", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Mayunzwe ni ahantu ho kwibukira haherereye i Mayunzwe, mu Akarere ka Ruhango (Intara y'Amajyepfo, Rwanda). Rwunamira abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, kandi rwakira buri mwaka imihango yo \"Kwibuka\".\nUrwibutso rufitanye isano n'ahantu hitwa \u00abKaruvariyo\u00bb (\"Kaluvariyo\"), ku musozi uri hafi aho, ahiciwe Abatutsi b'i Mayunzwe muri Mata 1994.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri i Mayunzwe, mu Murenge wa Mbuye (Akarere ka Ruhango, Intara y'Amajyepfo). Aka gace kari mu burengerazuba bwa Kigali, hafi ya Muhanga (yahoze yitwa Gitarama).\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Mayunzwe ni rumwe mu nzibutso, imva rusange n'ahantu ho kwibukira biri hirya no hino mu Rwanda no mu mahanga, bifitanye isano na Jenoside yo mu 1994. Muri izo nzibutso, enye \u2014 Nyamata, Murambi, Gisozi na Bisesero \u2014 ziri ku rutonde rw'Umurage w'Isi wa UNESCO.\nAmateka.\nKu wa 24 Mata 1994, Abatutsi biciwe i Mayunzwe, cyane cyane ahitwa \u00abKaruvariyo\u00bb. Amakuru yo muri ako gace agereranya ko uwo munsi hishwe abantu amagana. Umwanditsi Charles Habonimana, wavukiye i Mayunzwe, yarokotse ubwo bwicanyi maze abwandikaho igitabo \"Moi, le dernier Tutsi\" (2019).\nNyuma ya Jenoside, i Mayunzwe hubatswe urwibutso. Inyandiko z'ingengo y'imari zigaragaza imirimo yo kubaka no gusana urwibutso yatewe inkunga n'Akarere ka Ruhango.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rufitanye isano ya bugufi n'ahitwa \u00abKaruvariyo\u00bb, ku musozi uri hafi aho, ahiciwe abenshi mu bazize Jenoside b'i Mayunzwe ku wa 24 Mata 1994; ibigereranyo byo muri ako gace bivuga ko muri segiteri ya Mayunzwe honyine hishwe abarenga 850. Mu bavugwa ko bayoboye cyangwa bashishikarije ubwicanyi harimo Fran\u00e7ois Murekambanze, wari konseye wa segiteri, hamwe n'abicanyi baturutse ahandi.\nAha hantu hakoreshwa buri gihe mu bikorwa byo kwibuka (\"Kwibuka\"), kandi hari umushinga wo kubaka \u00abinzira y'amateka\u00bb igana kuri Karuvariyo.\nUrwibutso rwakira buri mwaka imihango yo \"Kwibuka\" (ijoro ryo kwibuka, gushyira indabo ku mva, urugendo rwo kwibuka) n'ibikorwa byo kwigisha amateka ya Jenoside bitegurwa n'inzego z'ibanze n'imiryango y'abarokotse.\nCharles Habonimana, mu gitabo cye \"Moi, le dernier Tutsi\", avuga uko abo mu muryango we bishwe n'uko we yarokotse muri Mata 1994 aha hantu."}
{"id": "23155", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23155", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Mugombwa", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Mugombwa ni ahantu ho kwibukira no gushyingura abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, haherereye i Mugombwa, mu Akarere ka Gisagara, mu Intara y'Amajyepfo, mu Rwanda.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri mu Murenge wa Mugombwa, mu Akarere ka Gisagara, mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo. Rufitanye isano na Paruwasi Gatolika ya Mugombwa, ivugwa mu hantu hiciwe Abatutsi muri Jenoside mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Butare.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Mugombwa ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kunamira, kubika amateka no kwibuka. Inzibutso enye za Jenoside zo mu Rwanda ziri ku rutonde rw'Umurage w'Isi wa UNESCO: Nyamata, Murambi, Gisozi na Bisesero.\nAmateka.\nUrwibutso rwa Mugombwa rufitanye isano n'ubwicanyi bwakorewe mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Butare muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Paruwasi Gatolika ya Mugombwa ivugwa nk'ahantu hiciwe Abatutsi muri Mata 1994, cyane cyane mu bitero byagizwemo uruhare n'impunzi z'Abarundi zari zituye muri ako gace.\nMuri Mata 2010, imibiri 40 y'abazize Jenoside yashyinguwe mu cyubahiro mu rwibutso rwa Mugombwa. Muri uwo muhango, Umuvunyi Mukuru Tito Rutaremara yasabye abakoze Jenoside kwemera uruhare rwabo no gusaba imbabazi.\nMu 2016, mu Akarere ka Gisagara havumbuwe imva rusange, mu bikorwa byo gushakisha imibiri y'abazize Jenoside. Ibyo byibukije akamaro ko kumenya, gutaburura no gushyingura mu cyubahiro imibiri y'abazize Jenoside muri ako karere.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUbwicanyi bwo kuri Paruwasi ya Mugombwa.\nUrwibutso rufitanye isano n'ubwicanyi bwakorewe kuri Paruwasi Gatolika ya Mugombwa, yari mu cyahoze ari Komini Muganza, Perefegitura ya Butare. Ku wa 20 na 21 Mata 1994, Abatutsi baturutse i Muganza, Kibayi, Nyaruhengeri no mu nkengero z'umusozi wa Nyange bahungiye muri Kiliziya ya Mugombwa. Nk'uko Komisiyo y'Igihugu yo Kurwanya Jenoside (CNLG) ibivuga, Abatutsi bagera ku 26\u00a0700 biciwe kuri Paruwasi ya Mugombwa.\nUbwicanyi bwateguwe hafi ya kiliziya, aho impunzi zari zafungiwe mbere y'igitero. Raporo ya CNLG ivuga ko inzugi zakingishijwe, hanyuma abagabye igitero bakazisenya bakoresheje imbunda na za gerenade, mbere yo gutwika inyubako bakoresheje lisansi. Iyo raporo ivuga kandi ko mu babigizemo uruhare harimo \u00c9lie Ndayambaje, wahoze ari burugumesitiri wa Muganza, abayobozi ba komini, Interahamwe n'impunzi z'Abahutu b'Abarundi zari zituye muri ako gace.\nIbyabereye i Mugombwa byanditswe kandi n'Urukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (TPIR/ICTR) mu rubanza ruzwi nka \u00abButare\u00bb. Urubanza rwo ku rwego rwa mbere rwagaragaje ko ibitero byagabwe kuri Kiliziya ya Mugombwa ku wa 20 na 21 Mata 1994, kandi ko icyo gihe hari hahungiye impunzi ibihumbi, abenshi muri bo bakaba Abatutsi. Mu bujurire, igihano \u00c9lie Ndayambaje yahawe cyo gufasha no gushishikariza ubwicanyi bw'Abatutsi kuri Kiliziya ya Mugombwa ku wa 20 na 21 Mata 1994 cyaremejwe.\nUruhare rw'impunzi z'Abarundi.\nKuba impunzi z'Abarundi zaragize uruhare muri ibyo bitero ni ikintu gikunze kuvugwa mu nkuru zo muri ako gace. Nk'uko \"KT Press\" ibivuga, impunzi z'Abahutu b'Abarundi zari zituye mu nkambi zegereye umupaka, cyane cyane hafi ya Nyange, zagize uruhare runini mu bitero byagabwe kuri paruwasi no mu midugudu iyikikije. Iyo nkuru ivuga kandi ko abishwe bashyinguwe mu rwibutso ruri mu kigo cya paruwasi, aho haba haruhukiye abantu 43\u00a0471, hiyongereyeho abagera ku 6\u00a0000 bashyinguye ahandi hantu hatatu haturanye.\nUrwibutso ubu ni ahantu ho gushyingura, kunamira no kwibuka abiciwe i Mugombwa. Ruri mu rusobe rw'inzibutso za Jenoside z'igihugu, zakira imihango yo \"Kwibuka\" n'ibikorwa byo kurwanya ihakana n'ingengabitekerezo ya Jenoside."}
{"id": "23156", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23156", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyanza", "text": " \"Ntibyitiranywe n'Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyanza-Kicukiro.\"\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyanza rwibutsa Abatutsi bazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, i Nyanza, mu Intara y'Amajyepfo y'u Rwanda. Rwafunguwe ku mugaragaro ku wa 21 Mata 2014, kandi rubitse imibiri y'abazize Jenoside igera ku 20\u00a0000.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri mu Mudugudu wa Murambi, Akagari ka Rwesero, Umurenge wa Busasamana, mu Akarere ka Nyanza, mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo. Rwubatswe ku kibanza cya Leta cyari kiriho inzu y'Umwami Mutara III Rudahigwa yitwaga \u00abCercle\u00bb, aho Umwami yakoreraga inama n'abatware be.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Nyanza ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nUrwibutso rwa Nyanza ni rumwe mu nzibutso nyinshi zagenewe abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Umujyi wa Nyanza uzwi kandi kubera Ingoro Ndangamurage y'Umwami i Rukari, ndetse n'amateka yawo nk'icyahoze ari umurwa w'ubwami. Mu 1994, aho urwibutso ruri hari muri Selire Murambi, Segiteri Rwesero, Komini Nyabisindu, Perefegitura ya Butare.\nAmateka.\nJenoside i Nyanza.\nUbwicanyi bwatangiye muri ako gace ahagana ku wa 15 Mata 1994, ubwo umuntu wa mbere yicirwaga i Rwabicuma. Burugumesitiri wa Komini Nyabisindu, Jean-Marie Vianney Gisagara, wakanguriraga abaturage kutijandika mu bwicanyi, yarafashwe arabohwa, azengurutswa umujyi wa Nyanza aziritse ku modoka, aricwa. Nyuma y'urupfu rwe, ubwicanyi busesuye bwatangiye ku wa 20 Mata 1994.\nUbwicanyi bwabereye mu mujyi wa Nyanza no mu nkengero zawo, i Busasamana, i Rwabicuma, i Mukingo, i Mpanga n'ahandi. Ku gasozi ka Nyamiyaga, Abatutsi bagerageje kwirwanaho bakoresheje amabuye, ariko bicwa n'amasasu y'abajandarume. Kubera ko hari bariyeri hose, abenshi biciwe mu ngo zabo. Imibiri y'abishwe yajugunywe kuri sitade ya Nyanza no mu cyuzi cya Nyamagana. Jenoside yahagaritswe i Nyanza ku wa 28\u201329 Gicurasi 1994.\nIshyirwaho ry'urwibutso.\nKubera ko aho imibiri yari ishyinguye kuri sitade nta bwinyagamburiro hari hafite, Akarere ka Nyanza kafashe icyemezo cyo kubaka urwibutso rushya no kwimurirayo imibiri. Rwatashywe ku wa 21 Mata 2014. Rushyinguyemo imibiri yavanywe kuri sitade n'indi yari ishyinguye hirya no hino mu masambu no mu ngo; hateganyijwe kandi kwimurirwamo imibiri iri mu nzibutso za Kavumu na Mwima.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nAbashyinguye mu rwibutso rwa Nyanza bagereranywa ku 20\u00a0011, kandi umubare uziyongera uko imibiri mishya izagenda iboneka. Umunsi wo kwibuka ni ku wa 21 Mata buri mwaka, kuko ari bwo ubwicanyi bweruye bwatangiye i Nyanza. Hari ubusitani bwagutse, kandi inzu ya \u00abCercle\u00bb y'Umwami Rudahigwa iteganyirizwa kuba inzu y'amateka."}
{"id": "23157", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23157", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Rubona", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Rubona ni ahantu ho kwibukira Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, haherereye ku butaka bw'icyahoze ari ikigo cy'ubushakashatsi mu buhinzi cya ISAR Rubona, mu Murenge wa Rusatira, mu Akarere ka Huye, mu majyepfo y'u Rwanda.\nRushyinguyemo imibiri y'Abatutsi bazize Jenoside, barimo abakozi b'icyo kigo n'imiryango yabo, ndetse n'impunzi zari zaturutse mu makomini aturanye.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri mu kigo cy'ubushakashatsi cya Rubona cy'Ikigo cy'Igihugu Gishinzwe Guteza Imbere Ubuhinzi n'Ubworozi (Rwanda Agriculture Board, RAB), mu Mudugudu wa Rubona, Akagari ka Kiruhura, Umurenge wa Rusatira, mu Akarere ka Huye, mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo. Ruri mu nzibutso za Jenoside zabaruwe ku mugaragaro n'inzego z'ubuyobozi bw'u Rwanda.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Rubona ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nMbere ya 1994, ISAR Rubona yari ikigo cy'ubushakashatsi mu buhinzi cy'Ikigo cy'Ubushakashatsi mu by'Ubuhinzi mu Rwanda (ISAR), gikikijwe n'imisozi y'icyaro yo mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Butare. Jenoside igitangira, Abatutsi benshi bo muri icyo kigo no mu makomini aturanye ya Ruhashya, Rusatira, Mbazi, Mugusa, Maraba n'agace ka Gikongoro bahungiye ku musozi wa Rubona, bizeye ko bazarindwa n'uko hari ikigo cy'igihugu n'inzego z'umutekano.\nAmateka.\nKu wa 26 Mata 1994, ibitero byaturutse mu makomini atandukanye aturanye byagabwe ku mpunzi z'Abatutsi zari zikusanyirijwe mu kigo cya ISAR Rubona no ku musozi wa Rubona. Interahamwe, abajandarume, abasirikare n'abapolisi bagize uruhare mu bwicanyi bwamaze umunsi wose n'ijoro ryose, bwibasiye abakozi b'ikigo n'imiryango yabo, ndetse n'abari basubijwe inyuma bagerageza guhungira i Burundi. Raporo ya CNLG ivuga ko mu bayobozi bo muri ako gace bagize uruhare muri ubwo bwicanyi harimo Umuyobozi Mukuru wa ISAR, Charles Ndereyehe, umuyobozi w'ikigo cya Rubona Joseph Mulindangabo, ushinzwe abakozi Didace Mugemana n'abandi bayobozi n'Interahamwe bateguye ibarura ry'Abatutsi kandi bahuza ibitero.\nNyuma y'ubwicanyi bwa mbere, bamwe mu barokotse bakusanyirijwe ahitwa i Gakera, munsi y'umusozi wa Rubona, bizezwa ko ubwicanyi buzahagarara, nyuma bongera kugabwaho ibitero baricwa mu ntangiriro za Gicurasi 1994. Ibigereranyo bivuga ko abakozi ba ISAR Rubona n'ababo bagera kuri mirongo irindwi biciwe aha hantu, mu gihe umubare wose w'abishwe, harimo n'impunzi zaturutse mu makomini aturanye, ari munini kandi bigoye kuwumenya.\nNyuma ya Jenoside, imibiri y'abazize Jenoside yatabururwe aha hantu no mu nkengero zaho yagiye ihurizwa hamwe mu mva rusange y'urwibutso rwa Rubona. Iyo raporo ivuga ko hashyinguwe abantu bagera ku 120 bamenyekanye, mu gihe indi mibiri itaraboneka ikiri mu mva rusange cyangwa mu bishanga.\nBuri mwaka, Ikigo RAB n'abarokotse bategura imihango yo kwibuka muri icyo gihe cya \"Kwibuka\". Iyo mihango kandi iba umwanya wo kwibutsa imanza zaciriwe bamwe mu bahoze ari abayobozi ba ISAR Rubona, nka Venant Rutunga, woherejwe n'u Buholandi akaburanishirizwa mu Rwanda kubera uruhare rwe mu bwicanyi bwabereye aha hantu.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rwa Rubona ruri ku buso bungana na hegitari 0,1 mu kigo cy'ubushakashatsi, rukagira imva rusange n'ikimenyetso cy'urwibutso byerekana aho abazize Jenoside baruhukiye. Ni ahantu imiryango y'abazize Jenoside, abarokotse bo mu karere ka Huye n'abakozi b'urwego rw'ubuhinzi mu Rwanda bazira kunamira bagenzi babo biciwe mu 1994."}
{"id": "23158", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23158", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Ruhashya", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Ruhashya ni ahantu ho kwibukira no gushyingura abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, haherereye i Ruhashya, mu Akarere ka Huye, mu Intara y'Amajyepfo, mu Rwanda.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri mu Murenge wa Ruhashya, mu Akarere ka Huye, mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo. Ruri ku rutonde rw'inzibutso za Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Ruhashya ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kunamira, kubika amateka no kwibuka. Inzibutso enye za Jenoside zo mu Rwanda ziri ku rutonde rw'Umurage w'Isi wa UNESCO: Nyamata, Murambi, Gisozi na Bisesero.\nAmateka.\nUrwibutso rwa Ruhashya ruri mu hantu ho kwibukira hashyizweho nyuma ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, kugira ngo habungabungwe urwibutso rw'abayizize bo mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Butare, ubu iri mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo.\nMu 2006, itangazamakuru ryo mu Rwanda ryavuze ku muhango wo kwibuka wabereye ku rwibutso rwa Ruhashya, aho abarokotse batanze ubuhamya ku bugome bakorewe muri Jenoside.\nMuri Mata 2011, imibiri 122 y'abazize Jenoside yashyinguwe mu cyubahiro mu rwibutso rwa Ruhashya, mu mihango yateguwe mu Akarere ka Huye.\nAha hantu hari imishinga yo kuhasana no kuhagura. Mu 2023, Akarere ka Huye kasohoye isoko ryo gusana no kwagura urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Ruhashya.\nJenoside i Ruhashya.\nJenoside i Ruhashya yaranzwe no kuva ku kwirwanaho kwa mbere ikagera ku bwicanyi buteguwe. Mu cyahoze ari Komini Ruhashya, ubu iri mu Akarere ka Huye, ubwicanyi bwatangiye ahagana ku wa 22 Mata 1994. Burugumesitiri Martin Rudakubana ngo yabanje kugerageza kurwanya ibitero byibasiraga Abatutsi, nyuma ahindura imyitwarire nyuma y'inama yabereye i Butare ku wa 19 Mata 1994, ayigarukamo yambaye imyenda ya gisirikare. Abatutsi bahungiye ahantu hatandukanye, harimo ku biro bya Komini Ruhashya, muri ISAR Songa, muri ISAR Rubona, ku musozi wa Rubaba, i Mwendo n'i Rugogwe. I Rubaba, amatsinda amwe yagerageje kwirwanaho mbere y'uko abajandarume baza kurasa ku mpunzi.\nUbwicanyi bwakozwe mu byiciro bitandukanye hagati ya tariki ya 21 Mata 1994 n'impera z'ukwezi kwa Mata. Abatutsi bari bahungiye i Rubaba bishwe ku wa 21 Mata 1994, abari ku biro bya komini ya Ruhashya bicwa ku wa 24 na 25 Mata 1994, naho abari bahungiye muri ISAR Songa bicwa ku wa 28 Mata 1994. Ibitero byagabwe n'Interahamwe n'amatsinda yaturutse mu turere dutandukanye duturanye, harimo icyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Gikongoro, Maraba, Rusatira na Kinyamakara. Raporo yerekeye Huye ivuga kandi uruhare rwa Aloys Simba mu bitero byagabwe ku Batutsi bari bahungiye muri Komini Ruhashya, cyane cyane i Rugogwe n'i Gashoba.\nIkindi cyihariye kuri Ruhashya ni uko ahantu hiciwe abantu hari hatatanye. Abatutsi ntibiciwe gusa aho bari bahungiye ari benshi, ahubwo bicirwaga no kuri bariyeri zashyizwe mu masantere no ku mihanda, nka bariyeri za Rwaniro, Mwogo, kwa Godefroid Ngenzi no kwa Rukundo. Ibyo bisobanura impamvu mu Murenge wa Ruhashya w'ubu hari ahantu henshi ho kwibukira, harimo inzibutso za Ruhashya, Mwendo na ISAR Songa.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso ni ahantu ho gushyingura, kunamira no kwibuka abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Ruri mu rusobe rw'inzibutso z'igihugu zakira imihango yo \"Kwibuka\" n'ibikorwa byo kurwanya ihakana n'ingengabitekerezo ya Jenoside."}
{"id": "23159", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23159", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Songa", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Songa ni urwibutso rwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Ruri i Songa, mu Akarere ka Huye, mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo y'u Rwanda.\nUrwibutso ruri hafi y'ikigo cya ISAR Songa. Muri Mata 1994, Abatutsi benshi bahahungiye. Ku wa 28 Mata 1994, abajandarume n'Interahamwe babagabyeho igitero gikomeye. Abantu bake gusa ni bo barokotse.\nAho ruherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri ku muhanda ugana i Butare. Ruri mu majyepfo y'igihugu, mu Akarere ka Huye.\nIkigo cy'Ubushakashatsi mu by'Ubuhinzi mu Rwanda (ISAR) cyari gifite ishami i Songa. Mu 1994, Songa yari muri Superefegitura ya Nyabisindu. Ubu ni mu Karere ka Huye.\nUrwibutso rwa Songa ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAmateka.\nUbuhungiro.\nMu ntangiriro za Mata 1994, Abatutsi benshi bahungiye muri ISAR Songa. Bizeraga ko ikigo cya Leta kizabarinda. Umubare wabo wageze ku bantu bagera ku 3\u00a0400.\nTharcisse Sinzi yari umwarimu wa karate. Yakoraga muri Kaminuza Nkuru y'u Rwanda i Butare. Na we yahungiye muri ISAR Songa. Guhera ku wa 13 Mata, yayoboye impunzi mu kwirwanaho.\nUbwicanyi bwo ku wa 28 Mata 1994.\nKu wa 27 Mata 1994, kajugujugu ya gisirikare yaje kugenzura aho hantu. Bukeye bwaho, ku wa 28 Mata, impunzi zagabweho igitero gikomeye. Abagabye igitero bari abajandarume, abasirikare n'Interahamwe. Bamwe mu bajandarume baturutse i Nyanza.\nAbagabye igitero bakoresheje intwaro ziremereye na gerenade. Abagabo benshi barishwe. Abagore benshi bafashwe ku ngufu. Mu mpunzi zisaga 3\u00a0000, abantu 118 gusa ni bo bageze i Burundi ari bazima.\nUruhare n'ubutabera.\nPhilippe Hategekimana yari umwofisiye muto wa Jandarumeri y'i Nyanza. Yari afite ipeti rya Adjudant-chef. Yitwaga \u00abBiguma\u00bb. Mu Bufaransa, yaje kwitwa Philippe Manier. Ubushinjacyaha bwamushinje kuyobora no kugira uruhare mu bwicanyi bwo muri ISAR Songa.\nKu wa 28 Kamena 2023, Urukiko rwa Rubanda (Cour d'assises) rw'i Paris rwamuhamije icyaha cya Jenoside n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu. Rwamukatiye igifungo cya burundu. Yajuririye icyo cyemezo. Mu rubanza rw'ubujurire, abarokotse ISAR Songa batanze ubuhamya. Ku wa 17 Ukuboza 2024, urukiko rw'ubujurire rwemeje igifungo cya burundu.\nCharles Ndereyehe yari umuyobozi wa ISAR. Ashinjwa gutegura ubwicanyi bw'abakozi b'Abatutsi n'impunzi. Ashinjwa kandi gukoresha imodoka z'ikigo mu gutwara abicanyi.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso ni ahantu ho kunamira no kwibuka abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Rukoreshwa mu bikorwa byo kwibuka no kwigisha amateka, harimo gusura aho hantu n'imihango yo \"Kwibuka\"."}
{"id": "23160", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23160", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa UNR Butare", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa UNR Butare ni urwibutso rwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Ruri mu kigo cya Huye cya Kaminuza y'u Rwanda, mu Akarere ka Huye, mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo y'u Rwanda.\nUrwibutso rwibuka abanyeshuri, abarimu n'abakozi ba Kaminuza Nkuru y'u Rwanda (UNR) bishwe mu 1994. Ubwicanyi muri kaminuza bwatangiye ku wa 20 n'uwa 21 Mata 1994.\nAho ruherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri mu kigo cya Huye cya Kaminuza y'u Rwanda. Ruri hafi y'irembo ry'ikigo. Ruri mu Murenge wa Ngoma. Mu 1994, aho hantu hari muri Komini Ngoma, muri Perefegitura ya Butare.\nUrwibutso rwa UNR Butare ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAmateka.\nKaminuza Nkuru y'u Rwanda.\nKaminuza Nkuru y'u Rwanda (UNR) yashinzwe i Butare mu 1963. Muri Gashyantare 1973, abanyeshuri n'abakozi b'Abatutsi birukanwe muri kaminuza. Mu 1994, kaminuza yarasahuwe.\nUbwicanyi bwo mu 1994.\nKu wa 19 Mata 1994, Perezida w'inzibacyuho Th\u00e9odore Sindikubwabo yavugiye ijambo i Butare. Muri iryo jambo, yashishikarije Abahutu kwica Abatutsi.\nUbwicanyi muri kaminuza bwatangiye ku wa 20 n'uwa 21 Mata 1994. Abanyeshuri, abarimu n'abakozi b'Abatutsi barishwe. Bamwe mu banyeshuri n'abarimu b'Abahutu b'intagondwa bagize uruhare mu bwicanyi. Bafashije gukora urutonde rw'Abatutsi bagenzi babo. Mu buhamya, havugwamo abantu icyenda, barimo Sosth\u00e8ne Munyemana. Muri kaminuza, abanyeshuri bishe abanyeshuri bagenzi babo. Abarimu na bo bishe abarimu bagenzi babo.\nIshingwa ry'urwibutso.\nMu 1995, abarokotse bagarutse muri kaminuza. Bashyinguye mu cyubahiro abari bari mu mva rusange. Babifashijwemo n'ubuyobozi bwa kaminuza, AERG na AGEUNR.\nGuhera mu mpera z'imyaka ya 1990, Leta y'u Rwanda yashyizeho politiki yo kwibuka. Iyo politiki igamije kumenya ahabereye ubwicanyi no gushyingura abazize Jenoside mu cyubahiro. Ikigo cya kaminuza cya Butare kiri ku rutonde rw'ahantu habereye Jenoside.\nKu wa 21 Mata 2012, imibiri y'abantu 15 yashyinguwe mu rwibutso. Yari yakuwe mu mva rusange iri hafi y'icumbi ry'abanyeshuri b'abahungu.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nImibiri ishyinguwe hakurikijwe amashami ya kaminuza na serivisi abazize bakoragamo. Umubare w'abashyinguwe aho ntuvugwaho rumwe. Rapha\u00ebl Nkaka avuga imibiri 422. KT Press ivuga imibiri 565. Kaminuza y'u Rwanda ivuga abantu barenga 450 bo mu muryango wayo.\nBuri mwaka, mu gihe cyo \"Kwibuka\", kaminuza itegura imihango yo kwibuka kuri urwo rwibutso."}
{"id": "23161", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23161", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kayonza-Mukarange", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kayonza-Mukarange ni ahantu ho kwibukira Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, haherereye mu Murenge wa Mukarange, mu Akarere ka Kayonza, mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba.\nRuhurije hamwe imibiri y'Abatutsi ibihumbi byinshi biciwe mu nsengero no mu duce two mu karere ka Kayonza muri Mata 1994.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri ku musozi wa Mukarange, hafi y'umujyi wa Kayonza, ku muhanda Kigali\u2013Kayonza\u2013Kagitumba, mu burasirazuba bw'u Rwanda. Ruri mu nzibutso za Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi zabaruwe ku mugaragaro n'inzego z'ubuyobozi bw'u Rwanda.\nImibiri ishyinguye i Kayonza-Mukarange yavanywe mu Murenge wa Mukarange no mu nkengero zawo mu Karere ka Kayonza, aho Abatutsi benshi bari bahungiye mu nsengero zitandukanye no ku nyubako za Leta muri Mata 1994.\nImiterere rusange.\nMuri Mata 1994, Abatutsi benshi bo mu karere ka Kayonza bahungiye mu nsengero za Paruwasi Gatolika ya Mukarange no mu zindi nsengero zari hafi aho, nyuma y'uko ubwicanyi butangira mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Kibungo. Ku wa 12 Mata 1994, mu gitondo, Interahamwe zateye Abatutsi bari bahungiye kuri Paruwasi ya Mukarange. Abatutsi barenga 5\u00a0000 bahiciwe uwo munsi. Inyandiko z'ubucamanza n'iz'amateka zivuga uruhare rwa burugumesitiri Jean-Baptiste Gatete mu gukangurira Interahamwe n'abasirikare kugaba ibitero ku mpunzi i Kiziguro n'i Mukarange.\nKu wa 11 Mata 1994, Abatutsi bari bahungiye mu rusengero rw'Abangilikani rwa Midiho, mu Kagari ka Nyagatovu (Umurenge wa Mukarange), bishwe nyuma y'igitero cy'Interahamwe zo muri ako gace; imibiri yabo ntiyose yabonetse. Mu minsi yakurikiyeho, Paruwasi Gatolika ya Mukarange yabereyemo ubwicanyi bukomeye, aho impunzi ibihumbi zishwe n'Interahamwe n'abasirikare bari bagose aho hantu.\nAmateka.\nNyuma y'uko Jenoside ihagarara muri Nyakanga 1994, inzego z'ibanze n'imiryango y'abarokotse, cyane cyane Ibuka yo muri ako karere, bateguye igikorwa cyo gutaburura buhoro buhoro imva rusange no gushyingura abazize Jenoside ahantu hamwe i Mukarange. Mu 2011, habaye umuhango wo gushyingura mu cyubahiro abazize Jenoside bagera kuri 850, imibiri yabo ikaba yarabonetse mu mirenge itandukanye ya Kayonza ikimurirwa i Mukarange.\nMu myaka ya 2010, ibikorwa nk'ibyo byo gushakisha no kongera gushyingura imibiri y'abazize Jenoside byakozwe i Mukarange no mu yandi makomini y'akarere, bituma umubare w'abashyinguye mu rwibutso ugenda wiyongera. Inkuru z'itangazamakuru zivuga abazize Jenoside ibihumbi, bamwe bakagereranya ko abashyinguye aha hantu barenga 9\u00a0000. Mu 2023, urwibutso rwari rushyinguyemo imibiri irenga 8\u00a0700. Ni rwo runini mu nzibutso zirindwi z'Akarere ka Kayonza.\nGuhera mu mpera z'imyaka ya 2010, imishinga yo kwagura no kuvugurura urwibutso yatewe inkunga muri gahunda z'ishoramari rya Leta. Inyandiko z'ingengo y'imari za Minisiteri y'Imari n'Igenamigambi zivuga ibyiciro bitandukanye byo kubaka \u00abinzu y'amateka\u00bb n'ibindi bikorwa ku rwibutso rwa Mukarange. Mu 2020, itangazamakuru ryavuze imirimo yo kunoza urwibutso nyamukuru rw'Akarere ka Kayonza, ruri i Mukarange. Mu 2022, Akarere ka Kayonza katangiye kuvugurura urwibutso. Imirimo yagenewe miliyoni 700 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda. Inyubako nshya igeretse ifite ishusho y'icumu. Icumu ni imwe mu ntwaro zakoreshejwe mu bwicanyi. Iyo nyubako irimo ibiro n'imurikabikorwa ku mateka ya Jenoside mu yahoze ari amakomini ya Kabarondo, Muhazi, Rukara na Kayonza.\nBuri mwaka urwibutso rwakira imihango yo \"Kwibuka\" ku rwego rw'Akarere ka Kayonza, yitabirwa n'abarokotse, imiryango itari iya Leta, amashuri n'inzego za Leta. Ku wa 12 Mata 2026, mu muhango wo Kwibuka ku nshuro ya 32, hashyinguwe mu cyubahiro imibiri 27.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rugizwe n'imva rusange zipfundikishijwe amabuye, ahantu ho kunamira, amabuye y'urwibutso n'inyubako igenewe imurikabikorwa rihoraho ku mateka ya Jenoside mu Karere ka Kayonza. Urutonde rw'amazina y'abazize Jenoside rugenda rwuzuzwa hifashishijwe ubuhamya bw'abarokotse n'ubushakashatsi bwa Ibuka n'inzego z'ibanze.\nHategurwa ingendo-shuri z'abanyeshuri n'intumwa z'inzego za Leta, baza kumva ubuhamya bw'abarokotse no gutekereza ku bijyanye no kwibuka, ubutabera n'ubwiyunge mu Rwanda.\nInzibutso z'Akarere ka Kayonza.\nMu ntangiriro za 2023, Akarere ka Kayonza kari gafite inzibutso za Jenoside zirindwi. Zari zishyinguyemo imibiri irenga 25\u00a0000. Muri uwo mwaka, akarere kemerewe gusigarana inzibutso eshanu."}
{"id": "23162", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23162", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyamirama", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyamirama ni ahantu ho kwibukira Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda, haherereye i Nyamirama, mu Akarere ka Kayonza, mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba, mu Rwanda.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyamirama ruri mu Murenge wa Nyamirama, mu Akarere ka Kayonza, mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba. Umurenge wa Nyamirama ni umwe mu mirenge igize Akarere ka Kayonza.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Nyamirama ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nUrwibutso rwa Nyamirama ni rumwe mu nzibutso, imva rusange n'ahantu ho kwibukira bifitanye isano na Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Inzibutso enye za Jenoside \u2014 Nyamata, Murambi, Gisozi na Bisesero \u2014 ziri ku rutonde rw'Umurage w'Isi wa UNESCO.\nAmateka.\nUrwibutso rwahariwe kwibuka Abatutsi biciwe mu gace ka Nyamirama muri Jenoside yo mu 1994. Nk'uko raporo ya Komisiyo y'Igihugu yo Kurwanya Jenoside (CNLG) ibivuga, ubwicanyi bwabereye mu Murenge wa Nyamirama no mu duce duturanye twa Ruramira na Nyarusange hagati ya tariki ya 9 na 17 Mata 1994. Iyo raporo ivuga ko Abatutsi ibihumbi bajugunywe mu rugomero ruri hagati ya Nyamirama na Ruramira.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rwa Nyamirama rufitanye isano n'ubwicanyi bwakorewe mu Murenge wa Nyamirama no ku nkengero z'urugomero ruri hagati ya Nyamirama na Ruramira. Rwibutsa ubugome bwakorewe Abatutsi muri iki gice cy'icyahoze ari Kibungo mu byumweru bya mbere bya Jenoside yo mu 1994.\nJenoside mu Murenge wa Nyamirama yaranzwe n'ubwicanyi bwatangiye kare n'umugambi wo gusibanganya ibimenyetso by'ibyaha. Guhera ku wa 9 Mata 1994, Abatutsi bari bahungiye ku misozi ya Nyamirama baribasiwe baricwa. Ahantu h'ingenzi hiciwe abantu habonetse mu Kagari ka Kabuye, inyuma y'Urukiko rwa Kanto. Ku bijyanye no guhisha ibimenyetso, byanditswe ko \u00abmuri Segiteri Nyamirama, Selire Kabuye, inyuma y'Urukiko rwa Kanto, imibiri yahambwe mu cyobo, maze abantu benshi bishwe baratwikwa kugira ngo hasibangane ibimenyetso byose\u00bb.\nAbakoze Jenoside, bayobowe na konseye Paul Gakwavu n'uwitwa Murego, batwitse imibiri kugira ngo \u00abbasibanganye ibimenyetso byose\u00bb. Ingengabitekerezo ya Jenoside yakomeje kugaragara muri uwo murenge igihe kirekire nyuma y'ibyo byaha: mu 2014, mu ishuri ryo muri ako gace havuzwe ibikorwa byo gutoteza abarokotse n'amagambo abakomeretsa, bigaragaza ko bamwe mu barimu bagize uruhare mu gukwirakwiza urwo rwango."}
{"id": "23163", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23163", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Rukira", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Rukira ni ahantu ho kwibukira no gushyingura abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, haherereye i Rukira, mu Akarere ka Ngoma, mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba, mu Rwanda.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri mu Murenge wa Rukira, mu Akarere ka Ngoma, mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Rukira ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kunamira, kubika amateka no kwibuka. Inzibutso enye za Jenoside zo mu Rwanda ziri ku rutonde rw'Umurage w'Isi wa UNESCO: Nyamata, Murambi, Gisozi na Bisesero.\nAmateka.\nUrwibutso rwa Rukira rufitanye isano n'ubwicanyi bwakorewe mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Kibungo muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Umurenge wa Rukira uri hafi ya Nyarubuye, ahandi hantu h'ingenzi habereye ubwicanyi mu burasirazuba bw'u Rwanda.\nNk'uko ubuhamya bwakusanyirijwe ku rwibutso rwa Nyarubuye bubivuga, abaturage b'i Nyarubuye bari bamenye ko ubwicanyi bwari bwatangiye i Rukira mbere y'uko bugera iwabo.\nMu 2003, urukiko rwo mu Rwanda rwaburanishirije i Rukira rwakatiye abantu cumi n'umunani kubera ibyaha bya Jenoside byakorewe mu gace ka Nyarubuye na Rukira. Ibihano byatanzwe byari hagati y'imyaka myinshi y'igifungo n'igifungo cya burundu.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso ni ahantu ho gushyingura, kunamira no kwibuka abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Rufitanye isano n'urwibutso rw'ubwicanyi bwakorewe mu Murenge wa Rukira no mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Kibungo.\nRuri mu rusobe rw'inzibutso z'igihugu zakira imihango yo \"Kwibuka\" n'ibikorwa byo kurwanya ihakana n'ingengabitekerezo ya Jenoside."}
{"id": "23164", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23164", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Rukumberi", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Rukumberi ni ahantu ho kwibukira Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, haherereye mu Murenge wa Rukumberi, mu Akarere ka Ngoma, mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba, mu Rwanda.\nRushyinguyemo imibiri y'abazize Jenoside irenga 40\u00a0000, iruhukiye mu mva rusange.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri rwagati mu Murenge wa Rukumberi, mu cyaro cy'Akarere ka Ngoma, mu burasirazuba bw'u Rwanda. Ruri mu gace k'imisozi n'ibishanga ku nkombe z'ikiyaga cya Mugesera n'ibibaya bikunze kurengerwa n'amazi, aho imibiri y'abazize Jenoside yagiye iboneka uko imyaka yagiye ihita.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Rukumberi ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nUmurenge wa Rukumberi ni umwe mu mirenge cumi n'ine igize Akarere ka Ngoma, hamwe na Gashanda, Jarama, Karembo, Kazo, Kibungo, Mugesera, Murama, Mutenderi, Remera, Rukira, Rurenge, Sake na Zaza. Guhera mu mpera z'imyaka ya 1950 no mu ntangiriro z'imyaka ya 1960, imiryango y'Abatutsi yaturutse mu tundi duce tw'igihugu yimuriwe ku gahato ituzwa muri aka gace kari kitaruye, karangwaga n'ibishanga byuzuyemo isazi ya tsetse n'ibyago byo kurwara indwara y'ibitotsi. Iyo politiki yagize uruhare mu guheza Abatutsi bari batujwe i Rukumberi no guhungabanya imibereho yabo igihe kirekire.\nNyuma ya 1994, Leta y'u Rwanda yagiye ishyiraho urusobe rw'inzibutso zigenewe guhuriza hamwe imibiri y'abazize Jenoside no kuba ahantu ho kwigira no kunamira. Urwibutso rwa Rukumberi ruri muri izo nzibutso ziri mu ntara zitandukanye z'u Rwanda.\nAmateka.\nMuri Jenoside yo mu 1994, Abatutsi b'i Rukumberi bibasiwe n'Interahamwe n'amatsinda yitwaje intwaro yashyigikiwe n'abayobozi b'inzego z'ibanze. Ubwicanyi bwageze ku ndunduro ahagana ku wa 16 Mata 1994; itangazamakuru ryo mu Rwanda rivuga ko hafi ya bose mu Batutsi bo muri ako gace bishwe.\nMu myaka yakurikiye Jenoside, i Rukumberi hashyizwe ahantu ho gushyingura abantu benshi hamwe, hagenewe imibiri y'abazize Jenoside yabonekaga mu bishanga no mu mazu yatawe. Guhera mu myaka ya 2010, hakozwe ibikorwa byo gutaburura imibiri mu nkengero, cyane cyane ku nkombe z'ikiyaga cya Mugesera, bituma havumburwa izindi mva rusange, imibiri ikongera gushyingurwa mu rwibutso.\nKu wa 26 Werurwe 2019, inzego z'ubuyobozi zatangaje ko imibiri y'abazize Jenoside irenga 40\u00a0000 igiye kwimurirwa no gushyingurwa mu rwibutso rushya rw'i Rukumberi, rwubatswe kugira ngo babone aho gushyingurwa mu cyubahiro kurushaho, n'ibikorwaremezo bikwiye imihango yo kwibuka. Ku wa 20 Gicurasi 2019, umuhango wateguwe ku rwego rw'Akarere ka Ngoma waranze ishyingurwa ry'iyo mibiri mu mva zateguwe ku rwibutso rwa Rukumberi, witabirwa n'abarokotse, abayobozi b'inzego z'ibanze n'intumwa zaturutse mu tundi duce tw'u Rwanda.\nKuva icyo gihe, ibigo bya Leta n'iby'abikorera bigira uruhare mu kubungabunga no kuvugurura urwibutso. Mu 2022, isosiyete AOS Limited yatanze ibikoresho by'ubwubatsi kandi yifatanya n'abakozi bayo mu mihango yo kwibuka yabereye aho hantu. Ibikorwa byo gutaburura imibiri bikomeje mu Murenge wa Rukumberi, cyane cyane nyuma yo kubona amagufwa ku nkombe z'ikiyaga cya Mugesera cyangwa hafi y'amasambu y'abakoze Jenoside, kugira ngo imibiri yimurirwe mu rwibutso.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rwa Rukumberi rugizwe n'imva rusange zubakishijwe amatafari, ikibuga cyo gukoreramo imihango yo kunamira n'amabuye y'urwibutso menshi yibutsa amateka y'Abatutsi bimuriwe muri aka gace nyuma bakicwa mu 1994. Rwakira buri mwaka imihango yo \"Kwibuka\", ingendo-shuri z'abanyeshuri n'ibikorwa by'umuganda bitegurwa n'inzego z'ibanze, imiryango y'abarokotse n'ibigo bitandukanye byo mu Rwanda.\nInkuru z'itangazamakuru zigaragaza Rukumberi nk'ahantu habera ibikorwa by'ubwiyunge hagati y'abarokotse n'abakoze ibyaha, binyuze mu nama rusange n'imihango aho abarokotse bababarira abakoze Jenoside bicuza."}
{"id": "23165", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23165", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Zaza", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Zaza ni urwibutso rwa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Ruri i Zaza, mu Akarere ka Ngoma, mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba y'u Rwanda.\nUrwibutso rushyinguyemo imibiri y'abazize Jenoside bo mu mirenge myinshi. Muri Mata 1994, Abatutsi barenga 1\u00a0000 biciwe kuri paruwasi ya Zaza.\nAho ruherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri mu Murenge wa Zaza, mu Karere ka Ngoma. Ako karere kari mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba. Mu Karere ka Ngoma hari izindi nzibutso za Jenoside. Muri zo harimo Kibungo-Ngoma, Rukira na Rukumberi.\nUrwibutso rwa Zaza ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nAmateka.\nZaza yari mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Kibungo.\nUbwicanyi bwo kuri paruwasi ya Zaza.\nPerezida Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana amaze gupfa, ubwicanyi bwatangiye muri ako gace. Ku wa 8 Mata 1994, abarokotse ubwicanyi bw'i Sake bageze kuri paruwasi ya Zaza. Abatutsi benshi bahungiye muri kiliziya. Bizeraga ko bazahabona umutekano.\nAbicanyi bari Interahamwe za MRND n'Impuzamugambi za CDR. Bari bagera kuri 400. Bari barateguwe n'umudepite wa MRND Sylvain Mutaruka. Ingabo za Leta zarabashyigikiye. Abicanyi bari bafite urutonde rw'abagombaga kwicwa.\nAbicanyi binjiye muri kiliziya. Bahiciye nibura abantu 600. Abarokotse bahungiye mu Iseminari Nto ya Zaza. Abicanyi bongeye kubatera. Abantu batandatu gusa ni bo barokotse: abapadiri bane n'abahungu babiri.\nInkomoko ntizivuga amatariki amwe. L'Humanit\u00e9 ivuga ko ubwicanyi bwatangiye ku cyumweru tariki ya 9 Mata. AllAfrica ivuga ko bwabaye hagati ya tariki ya 10 n'iya 11 Mata 1994. Ivuga ko Abatutsi barenga 1\u00a0000 bahiciwe. Ubwo bwicanyi bwagizwemo uruhare n'abayobozi b'inzego z'ibanze.\nUrwibutso.\nNyuma ya 1994, imibiri y'abazize Jenoside yataburuwe mu mirenge myinshi. Iyo mibiri yashyinguwe i Zaza. Imibiri myinshi yavuye mu mirenge ya Mugesera, Gashanda, Karembo na Zaza. Imihango yo kwibuka ihabera nibura kuva mu myaka ya 2000.\nMu mpera z'imyaka ya 2010, Akarere ka Ngoma kateganyije imirimo yo kurangiza no kuvugurura urwibutso.\nKwibuka.\nUrwibutso rwa Zaza ni ahantu ho kunamira abazize Jenoside. Ni n'ahantu ho kubashyingura mu cyubahiro no kwigisha amateka ya Jenoside. Buri mwaka, imihango yo \"Kwibuka\" ihabera."}
{"id": "23166", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23166", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyamishaba", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyamishaba ni ahantu ho kwibukira no gushyingura abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, haherereye mu Murenge wa Mubuga, mu Akarere ka Karongi, mu Rwanda.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri mu Murenge wa Mubuga, mu Akarere ka Karongi, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba. Ruri ku nkombe z'Ikiyaga cya Kivu, mu gace k'icyahoze ari Ishuri ry'Ubuhinzi n'Amashyamba rya Nyamishaba, rikunze kwitwa EAFO Nyamishaba.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Nyamishaba ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kunamira, kubika amateka no kwibuka. Inzibutso enye za Jenoside zo mu Rwanda ziri ku rutonde rw'Umurage w'Isi wa UNESCO: Nyamata, Murambi, Gisozi na Bisesero.\nAmateka.\nUrwibutso rwa Nyamishaba rufitanye isano n'ubwicanyi bwakorewe mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Kibuye muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Icyahoze ari ishuri rya EAFO Nyamishaba kivugwa mu hantu hiciwe Abatutsi, barimo abakozi, abanyeshuri n'abaturage bari bahahungiye. Bamwe mu bishwe bajugunywe mu Ikiyaga cya Kivu.\nMu Karere ka Karongi hategurwa imihango yo kwibuka abiciwe mu cyahoze ari ETO Kibuye no muri EAFO Nyamishaba.\nUbwicanyi bwa Nyamishaba buvugwa kandi mu manza zijyanye na Jenoside. Mu 2026, mu rubanza rw'ubujurire rwa Claude Muhayimana mu Bufaransa, abatangabuhamya bavuze ku bwicanyi bwabereye i Nyamishaba ku wa 15 Mata 1994, ku nkombe z'ikiyaga cya Kivu. Itangazamakuru ryavuze kandi ko Claude Muhayimana yakatiwe mu bujurire igifungo cy'imyaka cumi n'ine kubera ubufatanyacyaha muri Jenoside n'ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu, mu rubanza rujyanye no gutwara Interahamwe azijyana ahantu hatandukanye habereye ubwicanyi mu gace ka Kibuye.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rwa Nyamishaba rufitanye isano n'ubwicanyi bwakorewe hafi y'icyahoze ari Ishuri ry'Ubuhinzi n'Amashyamba EAFO Nyamishaba, ubu riri muri IPRC Karongi. Nk'uko IPRC Karongi ibivuga, abakozi, abanyeshuri b'icyahoze ari EAFO Nyamishaba n'Abatutsi bari bahahungiye bishwe muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994; benshi mu bishwe nyuma bajugunywe mu kiyaga cya Kivu.\nUbuhamya bwatanzwe mu mihango yo kwibuka bwerekana ko ibitero byatangiye i Nyamishaba ku wa 15 Mata 1994. Abari bahungiye mu nyubako za EAFO bakuwe aho bari bihishe, bajyanwa ku kiyaga baricwa; bamwe bakurikiranywe n'ubwato igihe bageragezaga kurokoka boga. Abarokotse bashinja kandi bamwe mu banyeshuri n'abakozi b'icyo kigo kuba baragize uruhare mu kwerekana abari bihishe no kubajyana aho biciwe.\nAha hantu hafite umwihariko wo gushyingura kubera ikiyaga cya Kivu. IPRC Karongi ivuga ko mu rwibutso rwa Nyamishaba haruhukiye Abatutsi barenga 3\u00a0000, mu gihe umubare w'abajugunywe mu kiyaga utazwi. Muri Kanama 2024, imibiri 18 y'abazize Jenoside yabonetse ku nkombe z'ikiyaga cya Kivu, hafi y'icyahoze ari EAFO Nyamishaba; yajyanywe mu rwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Gatwaro kugira ngo ishyingurwe mu cyubahiro.\nUrwibutso rwatoranyijwe mu nzibutso zizagumaho muri gahunda yo guhuriza hamwe inzibutso zo mu Akarere ka Karongi. Mu 2026, itangazamakuru ryo mu Rwanda ryavuze ko Nyamishaba igomba kugumaho kubera agaciro kayo muri ako gace n'umubare w'imibiri y'abazize Jenoside yabonetse mu kiyaga cya Kivu. Ibyo bijyanye na politiki y'igihugu yo kubungabunga ahantu ho kwibukira Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, iteganywa n'amategeko y'u Rwanda agenga imihango yo kwibuka."}
{"id": "23167", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23167", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyarushishi", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyarushishi ni ahantu ho kwibukira Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, haherereye ku misozi ya Nyarushishi, hafi ya Cyangugu, mu Akarere ka Rusizi, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba.\nRuhurije hamwe imibiri y'abazize Jenoside ibihumbi yataburuwe mu mirenge itandukanye y'akarere, ishyingurwa mu rwibutso no mu mva rusange.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso ruri ku misozi ya Nyarushishi, hafi y'umujyi wa Cyangugu n'Ikiyaga cya Kivu, mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bw'u Rwanda. Aha hantu hari mu Akarere ka Rusizi, mu Ntara y'Iburengerazuba.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Nyarushishi ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nUrwibutso rwa Nyarushishi ruri mu rusobe rw'inzibutso zashyizweho mu Rwanda nyuma ya 1994, rwahuzwaga na Komisiyo y'Igihugu yo Kurwanya Jenoside (CNLG, ubu ni MINUBUMWE). Zimwe muri izo nzibutso zashyizwe ku rutonde rw'Umurage w'Isi wa UNESCO, nka Nyamata, Murambi, Gisozi na Bisesero.\nAmateka.\nInkambi y'impunzi yo mu 1994.\nMuri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, abayobozi n'Umuryango Mpuzamahanga wa Croix-Rouge bakusanyirije i Nyarushishi Abatutsi ibihumbi bo muri Perefegitura ya Cyangugu, bavanywe ahantu nka sitade Kamarampaka. Ibigereranyo bivuga ko abantu bari hagati ya 8\u00a0000 na hafi 12\u00a0000 bakusanyirijwe muri iyo nkambi hagati ya Mata na Nzeri 1994.\nInkambi yabaye imwe mu ntego z'ingenzi z'Op\u00e9ration Turquoise, igikorwa cya gisirikare cy'Ubufaransa cyemejwe n'icyemezo nimero 929 cy'Akanama k'Umutekano k'Umuryango w'Abibumbye. Imitwe ya L\u00e9gion \u00e9trang\u00e8re yafashe inkambi mu mpera za Kamena 1994 kugira ngo irinde impunzi, nyuma y'aho imva rusange zivumbuwe mu gace ka Nyarushishi. Itangazamakuru n'ubushakashatsi bumwe bigaragaza ko kuba ingabo z'Ubufaransa zari muri iyo nkambi bitavugwaho rumwe, bijyanye n'impaka ku ruhare rwa Op\u00e9ration Turquoise n'ibirego by'ihohoterwa, harimo no gufata ku ngufu, bamwe mu basirikare bakoreye abagore b'impunzi.\nIshyirwaho ry'urwibutso.\nNyuma ya Jenoside, ahantu ha Nyarushishi hatoranyijwe kugira ngo hashyirwe urwibutso n'imva rusange zigenewe abazize Jenoside bo mu Karere ka Rusizi. Imihango yo gushyingura abantu benshi icyarimwe yatangiye kuhabera guhera mu myaka ya 2000, imibiri yabonetse mu makomini atandukanye igenda yimurirwayo.\nMu 2014, Akarere ka Rusizi kongeye gutangiza imirimo yo kubaka urwibutso runini, gatangaza ingengo y'imari igera kuri miliyoni 50 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda yo kubaka \u00abinzu ndangamurage-rwibutso\u00bb igezweho no kuvugurura igishushanyo cya mbere cy'aho hantu.\nMuri Kamena 2018, mu muhango wo gushyingura wabereye i Nyarushishi, abazize Jenoside barenga 3\u00a0500 bataburuwe mu mva zari zitatanye muri ako gace bashyinguwe mu cyubahiro.\nKwibuka n'imikoreshereze y'ubu.\nUrwibutso rwakira imihango yo \"Kwibuka\" mu Karere ka Rusizi, irimo amajoro yo kwibuka, gushyira indabo ku mva n'ubuhamya bw'abarokotse. Aha hantu hakoreshwa kandi nk'ahantu ho kwigira ku mashuri yo muri ako gace no ku bashyitsi baturutse mu Rwanda no mu mahanga, mu ngendo zo kwibuka zitegurwa ku bufatanye n'imiryango y'abarokotse n'inzego z'ibanze.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUrwibutso rwa Nyarushishi rufitanye isano ya hafi n'amateka y'inkambi y'impunzi yo mu 1994, yabaye ku isonga mu mpaka ku bikorwa by'Ubufaransa n'umuryango mpuzamahanga muri Jenoside. Imihango ibera aha hantu ihuza kwibuka abahashyinguye no gutekereza kuri icyo gice cya Op\u00e9ration Turquoise."}
{"id": "23168", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23168", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Shangi", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Shangi rwibutsa ubwicanyi bwakorewe Abatutsi i Shangi, mu Akarere ka Nyamasheke k'ubu, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba y'u Rwanda, muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nAho ruherereye.\nAho biherereye.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Shangi rwubatswe iruhande rwa Paruwasi ya Shangi, mu Akarere ka Nyamasheke, mu Ntara y'Iburengerazuba, hafi y'Ikiyaga cya Kivu. Rubitse imibiri y'abiciwe kuri paruwasi no mu nkengero zayo.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Shangi ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Shangi ni rumwe mu nzibutso, imva rusange n'ahantu ho kwibukira biri mu Rwanda no mu mahanga, bifitanye isano na Jenoside yo mu 1994. Enye muri zo \u2014 Nyamata, Murambi, Gisozi na Bisesero \u2014 ziri ku rutonde rw'Umurage w'Isi wa UNESCO.\nAmateka.\nMbere ya Jenoside.\nMbere ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, Paruwasi Gatolika ya Shangi yari mu cyahoze ari Komini Gafunzo, muri Segiteri ya Shangi; ubu iri mu Akarere ka Nyamasheke. Itotezwa ry'Abatutsi ryaho ryatangiye kera, kuko ubugizi bwa nabi bwagaragaye kuva mu myaka ya 1960, harimo gutwika amazu no gufata abakirisitu bavaga mu misa ya Noheli kuri paruwasi. Guhera mu ntangiriro z'imyaka ya 1990, mu gihe cy'intambara yatangijwe na FPR, iryo totezwa ryariyongereye. Nk'uko Komisiyo y'Igihugu yo Kurwanya Jenoside (CNLG) ibivuga, abayobozi b'inzego z'ibanze ba MRND na MDR bagize uruhare mu guheza Abatutsi: abize cyangwa abakoraga mu nzego za Leta birukanwe ku mirimo yabo, kandi Abahutu bashakanye n'Abatutsikazi bashyirwaho igitutu ngo babirukane. Mu 1993, Interahamwe za Gafunzo zatorejwe ku ruganda rw'icyayi rwa Shagasha, zifashijwe n'abayobozi b'ubutegetsi n'abasirikare bo muri Perefegitura ya Cyangugu.\nIbitero byo muri Mata 1994.\nGuhera ku wa 8 Mata 1994, Abatutsi benshi b'i Shangi no mu nkengero zaho bahungiye kuri paruwasi, bizeye kuharindirwa. Abantu ibihumbi, baturutse cyane cyane mu makomini ya Gafunzo na Gisuma, bahakusanyirijwe; bamwe ngo bahajyanywe cyangwa bategetswe kujyayo n'abayobozi b'inzego z'ibanze. Icyo gihe kandi hashyizweho bariyeri muri ako gace, Interahamwe ziririmba indirimbo zikangurira gutsemba Abatutsi. Ibitero bya mbere ku mpunzi byabaye ku wa 12 na 13 Mata. Impunzi zari muri paruwasi zagerageje kwirwanaho zisubiza inyuma ibitero byinshi. Abagabye ibitero bakoresheje kandi amayeri yo kuzinaniza: bafunze amatiyo y'amazi ya paruwasi kugira ngo impunzi zicwe n'inyota, kandi abageragezaga kumanuka ku kiyaga cya Kivu kuvoma baricwaga.\nKu wa 14 Mata 1994, Interahamwe, cyane cyane iziturutse i Nyamirundi ziyobowe n'uwitwa Pima, zagabye igitero gikomeye. Mbere y'igitero, Interahamwe zanyuze kuri Komini Gafunzo gufata intwaro na za gerenade, zihabwa ku mabwiriza ya burugumesitiri Charles Karorero. Indi nkomoko yerekeye Jenoside mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Cyangugu ivuga kandi igitero cyo ku wa 15 Mata cyayobowe na Epimaque Uburiyemuye, alias Pima, n'Interahamwe z'i Nyabitekeri, cyahitanye abantu barenga ijana bari bahungiye i Shangi.\nKu wa 18 Mata 1994, intumwa za perefegitura ziyobowe na superefe Th\u00e9odore Munyangabe zakoranyije abakonseye bo muri ako gace, zibasaba gukora urutonde rw'Abatutsi bahunze ingo zabo n'aho bahungiye. Mu minsi yakurikiyeho, Padiri Aim\u00e9 Mategeko, superefe Munyangabe n'abakozi ba komini bajyaga kenshi kuri paruwasi gukuramo abagabo bakuru, abahungu n'abize. Abo bantu batoranywaga bitwajwe ko bagombaga kubazwa i Kamembe ku bijyanye n'intwaro bivugwa ko bari bafite zo gutera Abahutu. Nta n'umwe mu bajyanywe wagarutse. Izindi nkuru zivuga ko hatoranyijwe abagabo mirongo ine na babiri b'abakomeye cyangwa abize, bajyanwa kuri sitade Kamarampaka nyuma baricwa, cyane cyane i Bushenge.\nNyuma y'igitero cyasubijwe inyuma ku wa 27 Mata, igitero gikomeye cyagabwe kuri paruwasi ku wa 29 Mata 1994. Cyayobowe n'Interahamwe za Yusufu Munyakazi, zaturutse i Bugarama mu makamyo menshi, zitwaje imihoro, amahiri, imbunda na za gerenade. Abagabye igitero bibasiye impunzi zari zikusanyirijwe muri kiliziya no mu nyubako za paruwasi. Nk'uko abarokotse babivuga, ubwicanyi bwakomeje kugeza ku mugoroba; abakobwa bari barokotse bahise bajyanwa gufatwa ku ngufu. Bukeye bwaho, Interahamwe zagarutse gusonga inkomere n'abari bakiri bazima. Imibiri yajugunywe mu cyobo kinini cyiswe \u00abCroix-Rouge\u00bb, cyari imisarane ya kera y'ishuri ribanza rya Shangi. Icyo cyobo kimaze kuzura, hacukuwe ibindi kugira ngo imibiri ihishwe kandi inyubako za paruwasi zisukurwe.\nAbagize uruhare.\nAbayobozi benshi bo muri ako gace bavugwa mu nkomoko zerekeye ubwicanyi bw'i Shangi. Th\u00e9odore Munyangabe, ukomoka muri ako gace, avugwa nk'umwe mu bateguye ubwicanyi n'abatoranyije abicwa. Padiri Aim\u00e9 Mategeko avugwa nk'uwagize uruhare mu kugambanira impunzi no mu bikorwa byatumye zicwa; nyuma yakatiwe igifungo cya burundu kubera icyaha cya Jenoside. Andi mazina avugwa mu nkomoko arimo burugumesitiri Charles Karorero, burigadiye wa komini Philippe Sekanyambo, \u00c9tienne Gatamobwa wari ukuriye CDR muri ako gace, na Sim\u00e9on Nchamihigo, wari umushinjacyaha wungirije, uvugwa ko yagenzuraga ako gace kandi agatanga intwaro ku Nterahamwe.\nUrwibutso.\nUrwibutso rwa Shangi rwubatswe kugira ngo hunamirwe Abatutsi biciwe kuri paruwasi no mu nkengero zayo, cyane cyane mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Cyangugu. Ruhurije hamwe imibiri y'abazize ubwicanyi bwakorewe aha hantu no muri ako gace barenga 4\u00a0000. Havugwa kandi ibikorwa byo kwirwanaho mu Murenge wa Shangi, cyane cyane i Mugera, aho umuryango w'Abatamu ngo wirwanyeho bikomeye mbere yo gutsembwa, hapfa abantu barenga 350 nk'uko inkomoko zerekeye ahantu habereye ubwicanyi mu cyahoze ari Perefegitura ya Cyangugu zibivuga.\nIbiranga urwibutso.\nUbu urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Shangi ni ahantu ho gushyingura, kunamira no kwigisha amateka, hagenewe abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri uyu murenge. Kuba ruri hafi ya kiliziya aho impunzi nyinshi zari zahungiye muri Mata 1994 byibutsa uruhare paruwasi yagize nk'ubuhungiro, ibitero byagiye bihagabwa, n'uburyo bwakoreshejwe mu gutoranya, gutandukanya no gutsemba abazize Jenoside. Ruri mu rusobe rw'inzibutso zo mu Rwanda zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura, kwibuka no kwigisha."}
{"id": "23169", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23169", "title": "Urwibutso rw'Abasirikare b'Ababiligi", "text": "Urwibutso rw'Abasirikare b'Ababiligi (mu Gifaransa: \"M\u00e9morial des gardiens de la paix Belges\") ni urwibutso ruri mu kigo cyahoze ari icya gisirikare cya \"Camp Kigali\" i Kigali, mu Rwanda. Inkingi icumi zubatswe aho hantu zibutsa abasirikare icumi b'Ababiligi b'ingabo za MINUAR bishwe ku wa 7 Mata 1994, igihe ubwicanyi bwatangiraga mu ntangiriro za Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi.\nAho ruherereye.\nUru rwibutso ni rumwe mu nzibutso zitubatswe ku kibanza rusange. Ni kimwe mu bibanza byinshi byo kwibuka biri mu Rwanda, byibutsa Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994.\nMu nzibutso z'igihugu harimo Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Murambi, Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Bisesero, Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Ntarama, Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Kigali n'Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Nyarubuye.\nMu Rwanda habarurwa ibibanza by'urwibutso birenga 250 byanditswe, byibutsa Jenoside.\nAmateka n'imiterere y'ibihe.\nMu mpera z'imyaka ya 1950, mu gihe cy'ubwigenge bw'ibihugu byinshi by'Afurika, u Rwanda rwaranzwe n'ubwiyongere bw'amakimbirane mu muryango n'urugomo rushingiye ku moko. Ibyo byakomeje na nyuma y'uko igihugu kibona ubwigenge ku Ububiligi mu 1962.\nMuri Kanama 1993, kubera imbaraga z'Umuryango w'Ubumwe bw'Afurika (OUA) n'iza guverinoma zo mu karere mu gushaka amahoro, isinywa ry'Amasezerano y'amahoro ya Arusha ryasaga n'irirangije intambara (yatangiye mu 1990) hagati ya guverinoma y'u Rwanda y'icyo gihe na FPR. Mu Ukwakira 1993, Akanama k'Umutekano ka Loni kashyizeho Ubutumwa bw'Umuryango w'Abibumbye bwo gufasha u Rwanda (MINUAR), bwari bufite inshingano zo kubungabunga amahoro, gutanga ubufasha bw'ubutabazi no gushyigikira muri rusange inzira y'amahoro.\nKu wa 6 Mata 1994, urupfu rw'Abaperezida b'u Burundi n'u Rwanda, mu ndege yahanuwe na misile, rwabaye imbarutso ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi yari imaze amezi menshi itegurwa. Abishwe bagereranywa na miliyoni imwe. Mu gihe kitageze ku isaha igice nyuma y'uko indege ihanuka, bariyeri zagenzurwaga n'abarwanyi b'Abahutu, akenshi bafashijwe na jandarumori cyangwa abasirikare, zarashyizweho kugira ngo zitahure Abatutsi zibice.\nKu wa 7 Mata, Radio T\u00e9l\u00e9vision Libre des Mille Collines (RTLM) yatangaje ikiganiro gishinja FPR n'abasirikare b'Ababiligi ba MINUAR kuba ari bo bahanuye indege, itangira gushishikariza Abahutu kurimbura \u00abinyenzi z'Abatutsi\u00bb. Nyuma y'aho kuri uwo munsi, Minisitiri w'Intebe Agathe Uwilingiyimana n'abasirikare 10 b'Ababiligi b'ingabo za Loni zishinzwe kubungabunga amahoro bari bashinzwe kumurinda bishwe bunyamaswa n'abasirikare ba guverinoma y'u Rwanda. Nyuma y'iyicwa ry'abasirikare bayo, Ububiligi bwafashe icyemezo cyo gucyura ingabo zabwo za Loni.\nUko byagenze ku wa 6 n'uwa 7 Mata 1994 ku ruhande rw'abasirikare ba 2e Commando.\nUko byagenze ku wa 6 n'uwa 7 Mata 1994 ku ruhande rw'abasirikare ba 2e Commando\n6 Mata, saa 20:30: Indege yari igeze ku kibuga cy'indege cya Kigali, itwaye Perezida w'u Rwanda Juv\u00e9nal Habyarimana na Perezida w'u Burundi Cyprien Ntaryamira, yahanuwe na misile zirasirwa ku butaka, hapfa kandi abaminisitiri babiri b'u Burundi, umugaba mukuru w'ingabo z'u Rwanda, abandi bayobozi n'abakozi b'indege b'Abafaransa.\nAgahenge karahagaze mu buryo butunguranye. Ibihuha bikwirakwira ko Ababiligi ari bo bahanuye indege ya Perezida.\nSaa 22:00: Hashyizweho komite ishinzwe ibibazo byihutirwa. Jenerali Rom\u00e9o Dallaire, umuyobozi w'ingabo za MINUAR, ajya mu nama asangamo Koloneli Th\u00e9oneste Bagosora, umuyobozi w'ibiro bya Minisitiri w'Ingabo. Icyifuzo cy'uko Minisitiri w'Intebe Agathe Uwilingiyimana, ubundi wari ku isonga mu murongo w'abasimbura, yageza ijambo ku gihugu, cyaranzwe.\n7 Mata, saa 01:18: Nyamara, ku itegeko rya Jenerali Dallaire, umuyobozi wa MINUAR ushinzwe agace ka Kigali, Koloneli Luc Marchal, ashinga batayo ya 2 ya Commando y'Ababiligi guherekeza Minisitiri w'Intebe kuri Radiyo Rwanda no kurinda aho hantu. Yagombaga kugeza ijambo ku gihugu saa 05:30.\nLiyetona-Koloneli Joseph Dewez, umuyobozi wa batayo, agaragaza gushidikanya kuri ubwo butumwa mu bihe byari bikomeye cyane.\nSaa 02:16: Liyetona Thierry Lotin, wari ufite itsinda ry'abasirikare ba Mortiers ba batayo ya 2 ya Commando ku kibuga cy'indege n'amajipe yabo abiri bagiye gushyiramo lisansi, ahabwa ubwo butumwa. Agomba gufata amajipe ane (inshuro ebyiri z'iherekeza risanzwe).\nSaa 03:19: Mu nzira ajya gusohoza ubwo butumwa, Liyetona Lotin ahagarikwa kuri bariyeri, kuri kilometero imwe gusa uvuye mu rugo rwa Minisitiri w'Intebe. Atakaza igihe kinini aganira kandi ategereje umusirikare w'u Rwanda ushinzwe guhuza ibikorwa utigeze uza.\nSaa 05:12: Liyetona Lotin amaherezo ayoborwa mu wundi muhanda. Mu mujyi hose humvikana amasasu ahandi n'ahandi.\nSaa 05:42: Amajipe y'itsinda rya Mortiers agera aho yagombaga kujya. Abasirikare bahura n'abasirikare batanu ba MINUAR bo muri Ghana n'abajandarume batanu b'Abanyarwanda bari bashinzwe umutekano wa Minisitiri w'Intebe. Ako kanya, abasirikare b'u Rwanda bafite imodoka z'intambara n'abarinzi ba Perezida bagota aho bari, barasa ku rugo.\nSaa 05:47: Liyetona Lotin asuzuma uko ibintu bimeze. Ubutumwa bwo guherekeza Minisitiri w'Intebe kuri radiyo buhagarikwa. Itsinda rya Liyetona Lotin ntiryirwanaho, kuko abasirikare b'u Rwanda batari babarasaho. Liyetona-Koloneli Dewez na we ababwira kutarasa.\nSaa 06:03: Itsinda rimenyesha ko amajipe yaryo yangijwe.\nSaa 06:55: Abasirikare b'u Rwanda bategeka itsinda gushyira hasi intwaro no kwitanga. Liyetona-Koloneli Dewez agira inama Liyetona Lotin yo kutabikora, ahubwo agashaka ibiganiro.\nSaa 07:00: Umuyobozi wa kompanyi ya 2e Commando, wari nko ku birometero bibiri uvuye mu rugo rwa Minisitiri w'Intebe, asaba gutabara n'itsinda ryongerewe imbaraga. Ubuyobozi bwa batayo bwanga icyo cyifuzo.\nSaa 07:40: Minisitiri w'Intebe ahungira mu nzu yari hafi aho, aherekejwe n'abajandarume. Nyuma (saa 11:45), we n'umugabo we bavumbuwe n'itsinda ry'Abarinzi ba Perezida, baricwa.\nSaa 08:44: Liyetona Lotin amenyesha ubugome bw'abasirikare b'u Rwanda bamukikije. Batayo ya 2 isaba amabwiriza Koloneli Marchal, wumvaga ibiganiro kuri radiyo ya batayo.\nSaa 08:49: Liyetona-Koloneli Dewez asubiramo ko itsinda ridakwiye gushyira hasi intwaro, ariko bikaba byatinze: abasirikare bane bari bamaze kwamburwa intwaro no kuryamishwa hasi. Liyetona Lotin yitanga abyemerewe n'ubuyobozi bwa batayo n'ubw'agace.\nItsinda ry'Ababiligi n'abasirikare bo muri Ghana bafatwa mpiri na Majoro Bernard Ntuyahaga wo mu biro bikuru by'ingabo z'u Rwanda. Batwarwa muri minibisi.\nAhagana saa 09:00: Bagera i \"Camp Kigali\", ikigo cya gisirikare cy'u Rwanda kitari kure y'aho.\nAkigerayo, Liyetona Lotin ahura na Kapiteni Kodjo Apedo, ku biro bya Loni byari hafi aho. Uwo kapiteni yari umusirikare wa MINUAR ukomoka muri Togo, ushinzwe guhuza ibikorwa muri icyo kigo.\nMuri ako kanya, Majoro Ntuyahaga akwirakwiza ibihuha ko izo mfungwa z'Ababiligi ari zo zahanuye indege ya Perezida, akabyutsa uburakari bw'abasirikare b'u Rwanda bari aho. Imbaga yitwaje imigongo y'imbunda, amabuye n'imbunda, itangira gukubita no kwica izo mfungwa zitari zitwaje intwaro.\nSaa 09:06: Liyetona abasha kuvugana bwa nyuma n'abamukuriye kugira ngo abamenyeshe ibibazo arimo, akoresheje radiyo ya kapiteni wo muri Togo.\nSaa 09:08: Liyetona-Koloneli Dewez asaba ubuyobozi bw'agace ubufasha bwo gutabara. Koloneli Marchal amenyesha umwe mu bagize ibiro bya Jenerali Dallaire, asaba ko icyo kibazo kizaganirwaho n'abayobozi b'u Rwanda mu nama yari iteganyijwe saa 10:00.\nHagati aho, abasirikare bane ba Liyetona Lotin bapfa bazize inkoni n'ibyuma by'imbunda (\"ba\u00efonnettes\"). Abandi, bakomeretse bikabije, bacika iyo mbaga bagera kuri Liyetona Lotin mu biro bya Loni. Bafungirana imbere batangira kwirwanaho ngo barokore ubuzima bwabo.\nImyigaragambyo y'abasirikare (\"mutinerie\") i \"Camp Kigali\" iba yose igihe abasirikare b'u Rwanda bamena ububiko bw'intwaro bw'ikigo kugira ngo bitwaze intwaro. Ibiro birasirwaho cyane, maze undi musirikare wa Para-Commando w'Umubiligi arapfa.\nMu gihe igitero cyari gihagaze gato, Kapiteni Apedo n'abasirikare batanu bo muri Ghana bakurwa muri ibyo biro.\nMbere gato ya saa 10:00: Jenerali Dallaire ava ku cyicaro cye ajya mu nama. Amara isaha mu nzira. Amenyeshwa ikibazo kirebana n'abasirikare b'Ababiligi ba MINUAR.\nSaa 10:40: Umusirikare w'u Rwanda ushaka kwinjira mu biro yamburwa intwaro akicwa na Liyetona Lotin wari wasigaranye pisitori ye. Habaho kurasana. Abasirikare b'u Rwanda barakomereka abandi barapfa.\nSaa 10:50: Ajya mu nama, Jenerali Dallaire anyura imbere y'irembo rya \"Camp Kigali\", kuri metero 30 gusa uvuye aho ibyo byaberaga. Abona imirambo y'abasirikare ba MINUAR iri hasi. Ategeka ko imodoka ihagarara, ariko umushoferi we w'Umunyarwanda aranga, amubwira ko bari mu kaga kuko hari imyigaragambyo y'abasirikare.\nSaa 10:55: Jenerali Dallaire agera aho inama yabereye, kuri metero 200 gusa uvuye aho ibyo byaberaga, ahahurira na Kapiteni Apedo n'abasirikare bo muri Ghana bari bemerewe kuva mu kigo. Bamumenyesha ibibera i \"Camp Kigali\". Igitangaje ni uko Jenerali Dallaire nta gikorwa na kimwe yakoze ngo akemure icyo kibazo. Ntiyanakivuzeho mu nama yamaze kugeza saa 12:15. Nk'uko yabyanditse mu gitabo cye \"J'ai serr\u00e9 la main du diable\", yageragezaga gusobanukirwa n'uko ibintu byari bimeze.\nAhagana saa 13:00: Ibyuka biryana mu maso n'ibisasu bya gerenade bijugunywa binyuze mu mwobo wo ku gisenge. Ibyo bishyira iherezo ku kwirwanaho gutangaje kw'aba Para-Commandos b'Ababiligi.\nNyuma ya saa sita, imirambo yabo yasahuwe kandi igacibwa ibice ijyanwa mu buruhukiro bw'ibitaro bya Kigali, igerekeranywa. Nimugoroba, Jenerali Dallaire ajya ku bitaro. Ntiyabasha kumenya umubare w'abasirikare be bapfuye.\nKwibuka Ababiligi bishwe.\nNk'uko bivugwa mu mwanzuro wa 2150 w'Akanama k'Umutekano k'Umuryango w'Abibumbye (wemejwe n'abagize akanama bose mu 2014), werekeye gukumira no kurwanya jenoside, Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda yahitanye abantu bagera kuri miliyoni mu minsi 100. Muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, n'Abahutu n'abandi bantu barwanyaga jenoside barishwe.\nUbubiligi bwo bubabazwa n'abantu 22 bwabuze: abasirikare 10 b'ingabo za Loni bari bashinzwe kurinda Minisitiri w'Intebe Agathe Uwilingiyimana (na we wishwe), n'abasivili 12 bishwe ahanini kubera ko bari Ababiligi.\nUrutonde rw'Ababiligi 22 bishwe mu 1994.\nChristine Andr\u00e9 | Bruno Bassinne | Claire Beckers-Bucyana | Katia Bucyana | Albert Craemers | Alain Debatty | Olivier Dulieu | Christophe Dupont | Michel Gigi | Antoine Godfriaux | Paul Kesenne | Yannick Leroy | H\u00e9l\u00e8ne Laveque | St\u00e9phane Lhoir | Thierry Lotin | Bruno Meaux | Louis Plescia | Christophe Renwa | Annie Roland-Mugwaneza | Etienne Staelgraeve | Marc Uyttebroeck | Paul Van Vynckt\nIcyapa cyo kwibuka cya guverinoma y'Ububiligi n'amabuye 10 yo kwibuka byashyizweho ku wa 7 Mata 2000 mu rwego rwo kwibuka abasirikare 10 b'Ababiligi bishwe i Kigali ku wa 7 Mata 1994, bari mu butumwa bw'amahoro mu Rwanda.\nIcyubahiro cyahawe na guverinoma y'Ububiligi, ku wa 7 Mata 2000.\nUruhare rw'itangazamakuru ry'urwango.\nBagaragazwa nk'ibyitso bya FPR cyangwa nk'abagize uruhare mu iyicwa rya Perezida Habyarimana, Ababiligi bari mu banyamahanga bibasiwe cyane n'icengezamatwara ry'\u00abitangazamakuru ry'urwango\u00bb, cyane cyane Radio T\u00e9l\u00e9vision Libre des Mille Collines (RTLM) n'ikinyamakuru Kangura.\nItegurwa ry'itsembatsemba ry'Abatutsi ndetse n'umugambi wo kwibasira Ababiligi, cyane cyane abasirikare, byari byaramenyeshejwe muri \u00ab\"Genocide Fax\"\u00bb. Iyo fagisi yoherejwe na Rom\u00e9o Dallaire ku cyicaro cya Loni i New York ku wa 11 Mutarama 1994, hafi amezi atatu mbere y'uko Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi itangira. Ivuga ku kiganiro umwanditsi wayo yagiranye n'umuyobozi mu barwanyi b'Interahamwe wari uzi imigambi ya jenoside, kandi ni ikimenyetso cy'uko umuryango mpuzamahanga wananiwe gukumira Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda.\nIbice by'iyo \u00ab\"Genocide Fax\"\u00bb (mu Cyongereza):\nUruhare rw'Ububiligi n'ingaruka.\nMuri Mata 1997, Sena y'Ububiligi yafashe icyemezo cyo gushyiraho komisiyo y'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko yo gukora iperereza kuri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda.\nImyanzuro y'iyo raporo igaragaza cyane cyane uruhare rusange:\nMu ijambo ry'amateka ryo ku wa 7 Mata 2000, mu gihe cyo kwibuka ku nshuro ya 6 Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi i Kigali, Guy Verhofstadt (wari Minisitiri w'Intebe icyo gihe) yemereye imbere y'Abanyarwanda uruhare rw'Ububiligi muri Jenoside yo mu 1994:\nUbutabera nyuma ya Jenoside.\nNyuma ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, urwego rw'ubutabera rw'u Rwanda, rwari rwarazahajwe cyane n'intambara, ntirwashoboraga kuburanisha mu buryo bwuzuye abakekwagaho jenoside (hafashwe abakekwa barenga 120\u00a0000, mu gihe urwego rw'ubutabera rwashoboraga kuburanisha nka 1\u00a0000 gusa ku mwaka).\nUbubiligi bwatanze umusanzu mu Urukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga rwashyiriweho u Rwanda (TPIR/ICTR), rwashyizweho na Loni (Ugushyingo 1994 \u2013 Ukuboza 2015) rukagira icyicaro i Arusha (Tanzaniya). Umusaruro warwo w'abantu 61 bahamijwe ibyaha wagiye unengwa.\nMu rwego rwo kwihutisha imanza no gushyira mu bikorwa inzira y'ubwiyunge bw'igihugu, guverinoma y'u Rwanda yashyizeho Inkiko Gacaca, uburyo bw'ubutabera ku rwego rw'ibanze bushingiye ku mico gakondo.\nNyuma yo kuburanisha imanza 1\u00a0958\u00a0634, Inkiko Gacaca zasojwe ku mugaragaro ku wa 18 Kamena 2012.\nUbubiligi ni cyo gihugu cya mbere cy'amahanga cyaburanishije kandi kigahamya ibyaha abakoze jenoside b'Abanyarwanda ku butaka bwacyo; imanza zaciwe n'inkiko z'igihugu z'Ububiligi zishingiye ku ihame ry'ububasha bw'inkiko ku isi yose (\"comp\u00e9tence universelle\").\nUrubanza rwa Butare Bane.\nAlphonse Higaniro, Vincent Ntezimana, Consolata Mukangango na Julienne Mukabutera bafatiwe ku butaka bw'Ububiligi bakurikiranyweho uruhare mu bwicanyi bwabereye muri Perefegitura ya Butare hagati ya Mata na Nyakanga 1994.\nBahamijwe ibyaha n'Urukiko rwa Rubanda (\"Cour d'assises\") rw'i Buruseli ku wa 8 Kamena 2001 (Ikigeragezo cya Butare Bane), bakatirwa igifungo kiri hagati y'imyaka 12 na 20.\nUrubanza rwa Bernard Ntuyahaga.\nBernard Ntuyahaga, wahoze ari Majoro mu Ngabo z'u Rwanda (FAR), yakatiwe ku wa 5 Nyakanga 2007 n'Urukiko rwa Rubanda rw'i Buruseli igifungo cy'imyaka 20 kubera iyicwa ry'abasirikare 10 b'Ababiligi ba Loni, irya Minisitiri w'Intebe w'u Rwanda Agathe Uwilingiyimana n'iry'Abanyarwanda benshi, cyane cyane muri Perefegitura za Kigali na Butare. Amaze imyaka 20 muri gereza mu Bubiligi, Bernard Ntuyahaga yirukanywe asubizwa mu Rwanda mu Ukuboza 2018.\nIbikorwa byo gukurikirana abandi bakekwaho jenoside byarakomeje."}
